eit und Gemeinschaft erscheinen nicht als einfache Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Phasen einer geistigen Ökonomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME5","text":"Untergang wird als Übergangsoperation zwischen Übermenschlichkeit, Menschwerdung und Mitteilung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra verlässt seine Höhle und wendet sich den Menschen zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT2","text":"Structural — Angesammelte Weisheit erzeugt durch Überfluss den Zwang zur Verteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Wirkung des Weisen wird nicht durch Bewahrung der Distanz, sondern durch deren strategische Aufhebung eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zarathustras Identität wird als zeitliche Sequenz von Einsamkeit, Überfülle, Untergang und Wiederwerdung zum Menschen konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von Einsamkeit zu Austeilung und Abstieg zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT2","text":"Die Sonnenmetapher ist als Vermittlungsmodell erforderlich, nicht als bloße Ausschmückung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die Menschen auf die ausgeteilte Weisheit reagieren und ob die Verteilung gelingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT4","text":"Intern bleibt gespannt, ob der Untergang Verlust, Erfüllung oder beides zugleich bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT5","text":"Ebenfalls ungelöst bleibt das Verhältnis zwischen notwendiger Selbstentleerung und fortbestehendem Anspruch auf geistigen Überfluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Abstieg als generative Selbstaufhebung und nicht als bloße Ortsveränderung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184450298739Z_c7652d95","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"cf883b5755bbf0bb1cd1c1bf31fff351fcfdbe731a296609f271f424f9ee8a55","sha256":"742cdb5c98ac774cfab91b65ef3276a4303b288e3d2349c0ba89029483fb7d89","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:44:50.302012+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AS1","text":"A wisdom accumulated over ten years becomes problematic as superabundance and no longer as fulfilling possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AS2","text":"Wisdom attains its efficacy only through recipients, outstretched hands, and distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AS3","text":"The sun serves as the model of a happiness that passes from its abundance over to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AS4","text":"Zarathustra determines his necessary movement as a descent from solitude into the human world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AS5","text":"The descent is at once self-emptying, becoming human again, and the beginning of a going under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A1","text":"Happiness is not independent of those whom it benefits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A2","text":"Prolonged solitude makes possible the accumulation of spiritual superabundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A3","text":"Accumulated wisdom can turn into surfeit and a need to give it away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A4","text":"Abundance requires recipients among whom it distributes itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A5","text":"Distribution transforms possession into an effect that extends beyond the possessor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A6","text":"The setting of the sun models the transition from shining above others to shining for others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A7","text":"Access to human beings requires descent from isolated height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:A8","text":"Zarathustra's descent signifies at once the loss of a special status and a return to human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX1","text":"Wisdom is not sufficient as a completed possession of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX2","text":"Happiness is not complete as unenvied self-sufficiency without recipients.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX3","text":"The wise person may not permanently withhold his superabundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's movement leads not further into solitude, but out of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX5","text":"The descent is not merely a spatial change, but the abolition of a superhuman distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:NX6","text":"The end of separation appears not as mere defeat, but as the necessary fulfillment of superabundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:D1","text":"Because accumulated wisdom turns into surfeit and requires recipients, Zarathustra must give away his wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_1100:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:D2","text":"Because distribution exceeds the possessor, the return to human beings becomes the condition of the efficacy of Zarathustra's wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A5","CH_97E9_1100:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:D3","text":"Because the sun mediates its abundance through daily rising and setting, its course becomes the formal model for Zarathustra's movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A6","CH_97E9_1100:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:D4","text":"Zarathustra's going under denotes the transition from stored wisdom to communicated knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_1100:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:D5","text":"Becoming human again is the social form of self-emptying.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A7","CH_97E9_1100:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SD1","text":"The system replaces the ideal of intensified self-preservation with an ideal of efficacious expenditure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SD2","text":"The highest spiritual position is determined not by distance, but by controlled descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SD3","text":"Superabundance is positively determined only when it translates itself into the enrichment of others and one's own emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SD4","text":"Going under functions as a productive transformation: the dissolution of special status generates the possibility of human efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:DNX1","text":"A wisdom that remains with its possessor is structurally regarded as incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:DNX2","text":"A happiness without the needy, recipients, or participants is excluded as insufficient happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:DNX3","text":"Spiritual height without a subsequent return into the human sphere cannot fulfill a generative function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:DNX4","text":"The logic of possession and the logic of communication are not treated as equivalent forms of spiritual existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:DNX5","text":"The identity of the wise person as one permanently separated from human beings is presupposed to be unsustainable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an autonomous completion of spirit outside every relation to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a form of happiness that stabilizes itself through preservation rather than through transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility is a pure, consequence-free transcendence without return, recipients, and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:SNX4","text":"The entire movement depends on the impossibility of maintaining superabundance permanently outside human mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:FGS1","text":"Solitude → spiritual accumulation → surfeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:FGS2","text":"Surfeit → need for recipients → decision to distribute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:FGS3","text":"Sun model → going under as transition → descent to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:FGS4","text":"Descent → self-emptying → becoming human again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:FGS5","text":"Intention of emptying → transmission of superabundance → beginning of Zarathustra's going under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AF1","text":"Spiritual superabundance → surfeit with isolated possession → need for hands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AF2","text":"Need for recipients → solar analogy → legitimation of descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AF3","text":"Descent → access to the human world → self-emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:AF4","text":"Self-emptying → becoming human again → Zarathustra's going under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME1","text":"Wisdom is remapped from an inner possession to a relational form of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME2","text":"Descent is reclassified from mere abasement to a condition of productive efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME3","text":"Happiness becomes visible no longer primarily as a state of the subject, but as circulating surplus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME4","text":"Solitude and community appear not as simple opposites, but as successive phases of a spiritual economy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ME5","text":"Going under becomes legible as a transitional operation between superhumanity, becoming human, and communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra leaves his cave and turns toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT2","text":"Structural — Accumulated wisdom generates, through abundance, the compulsion to distribute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The efficacy of the wise person is opened not by preserving distance, but by its strategic abolition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zarathustra's identity is constructed as a temporal sequence of solitude, superabundance, going under, and becoming human again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from solitude to distribution and descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT2","text":"The sun metaphor is required as a model of mediation, not as mere embellishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how human beings respond to the distributed wisdom and whether the distribution succeeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT4","text":"It remains internally unresolved whether going under denotes loss, fulfillment, or both at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT5","text":"Likewise unresolved remains the relation between necessary self-emptying and the continuing claim to spiritual superabundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1100:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text insofar as descent is understood as generative self-abolition and not as mere change of location.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1100@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1100:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 01","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 1","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 2","order":2,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2200"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2200@R001","sha256":"b2985853cba0d568d6d9a9f0350ce3f933bd184a517ba5d8137baa4749c1ad33","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS1","text":"Die Begegnung stellt Zarathustras Verwandlung als Übergang von abgeschiedener Selbsttragung zu einer Bewegung auf die Menschen hin aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS2","text":"Der Greis deutet diesen Übergang als Wechsel vom Hinauftragen der Asche zum Hinabtragen des Feuers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS3","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt sich als Erwachter und als Überbringer eines Geschenks für die Schlafenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS4","text":"Der Heilige setzt dieser Bewegung die Abkehr von den Menschen, die Gottesliebe und die Einsamkeit entgegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS5","text":"Der Dialog verschiebt die Frage vom guten Willen des Gebenden auf die Form und Möglichkeit der Annahme durch die Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS6","text":"Die diagnostisch-kontrastive Bewegung führt von erkannter Verwandlung über unvereinbare Liebes- und Gabenschemata zur zeitlichen Diagnose einer religiösen Unwissenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A1","text":"Der Greis erkennt Zarathustra als den früheren Wanderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A2","text":"Der Greis nimmt an Zarathustra eine gegenwärtige Verwandlung wahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A3","text":"Diese Verwandlung wird als Wechsel vom Tragen der Asche zum Tragen des Feuers beschrieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A4","text":"Zarathustra wird als Kind und Erwachter bestimmt, der zu den Schlafenden geht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A5","text":"Zarathustra erklärt, dass er die Menschen liebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A6","text":"Der Heilige erklärt die Menschen für unvollkommen und setzt seine Gottesliebe gegen die Menschenliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A7","text":"Zarathustra bringt den Menschen ein Geschenk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A8","text":"Zarathustra weist das Almosen als Form seines Gebens zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A9","text":"Zarathustra begründet diese Zurückweisung mit seinem eigenen Reichtum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A10","text":"Der Heilige empfiehlt den Rückzug in Wald und Tierwelt sowie höchstens das Geben eines Almosens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A11","text":"Die Menschen misstrauen Einsiedlern und deuten deren einsame Schritte als mögliches Zeichen des Diebstahls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A12","text":"Der Heilige erzeugt in der Einsamkeit Lieder, durch die er seinen Gott lobt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX1","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht mehr auf die frühere Gestalt des aschetragenden Einsiedlers festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX2","text":"Erwachen bedeutet nicht, bei den Schlafenden oder im abgeschlossenen Wald zu verbleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX3","text":"Menschenliebe ist nicht mit der Gottesliebe des Heiligen identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Geschenk ist kein Almosen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX5","text":"Die einsame Herkunft des Gebenden garantiert nicht die Anerkennung seines Geschenks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX6","text":"Die Lobpreisung Gottes im Wald ist keine Bewegung auf die Menschen zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX7","text":"Zarathustras Weg schließt die vom Heiligen vorgeschlagene Gleichwerdung mit Tieren aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D1","text":"Zarathustras Verwandlung erhält eine gerichtete Bedeutung: Sie führt aus der privaten Askese in eine Bewegung der Übermittlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A1","CH_97E9_2200:A2","CH_97E9_2200:A3","CH_97E9_2200:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D2","text":"Die beiden Liebesformen erzeugen gegensätzliche Beziehungsorientierungen: menschliche Zuwendung bei Zarathustra und göttlich begründeten Rückzug beim Heiligen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A5","CH_97E9_2200:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D3","text":"Zarathustras Geschenk wird als Gabe aus Überschuss und nicht als Hilfe aus Mangel bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A7","CH_97E9_2200:A8","CH_97E9_2200:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D4","text":"Der Heilige reduziert die mögliche Beziehung zu den Menschen auf Lastabnahme, Almosen und erzwungene Bedürftigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A6","CH_97E9_2200:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D5","text":"Vor jeder Annahme wird Zarathustras Gabe durch die soziale Lesbarkeit des Einsiedlers als möglicher Dieb blockiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A7","CH_97E9_2200:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D6","text":"Die Einsamkeit des Heiligen bildet eine geschlossene religiöse Praxis aus, deren Produktivität auf das Lob des eigenen Gottes zurückgeführt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A10","CH_97E9_2200:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D7","text":"Zarathustra diagnostiziert den Heiligen als jemand, dessen religiöser Horizont die Rede vom Tod Gottes noch nicht erreicht hat.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A4","CH_97E9_2200:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD1","text":"Die Verwandlung wird von einer inneren Läuterung zu einer riskanten öffentlichen Übertragung von Feuer und Reichtum umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D1","CH_97E9_2200:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD2","text":"Der Konflikt betrifft nicht bloß zwei Meinungen über Wohltätigkeit, sondern zwei inkompatible Ökonomien der Beziehung: Entlastung und Almosen gegen Überschuss und Geschenk.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D2","CH_97E9_2200:D3","CH_97E9_2200:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD3","text":"Die Einsamkeit erzeugt zugleich geistliche Produktivität und epistemische Isolation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D6","CH_97E9_2200:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD4","text":"Zarathustras missionarische Bewegung bleibt von einer Rezeptionsstörung abhängig, weil das Geschenk des Einsiedlers vor seinem Inhalt als Diebstahl gelesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D1","CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Einsamkeit als solche die höhere oder abschließende Form der Verwandlung garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass menschliche Unvollkommenheit den Rückzug von den Menschen endgültig rechtfertigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Absicht des Gebenden die soziale Bedeutung der Gabe bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass religiöse Produktivität mit zeitlicher oder erkenntnismäßiger Aktualität gleichzusetzen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Geschenk und Almosen auf einer gemeinsamen, nur graduell verschiedenen Skala liegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein gemeinsamer religiöser Zeithorizont, in dem der Heilige und Zarathustra dasselbe Gottesverhältnis teilen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein unmittelbarer Übergang von Einsamkeit zu Gemeinschaft, weil die Gabe an der vorgängigen Verdächtigung des Gebenden scheitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine versöhnte Synthese von Menschenliebe und heiliger Absonderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein transparenter Empfänger, der das Geschenk weder als Almosen noch als Diebstahl missdeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS1","text":"Frühere Identität + gegenwärtige Differenz → Feststellung der Verwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS2","text":"Asche nach oben / Feuer nach unten → Umkehrung der Bewegungsrichtung von Selbsttragung zu Übermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS3","text":"Erwachen + Schlafende → Begründung einer Bewegung aus der Einsamkeit zu den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS4","text":"Menschenliebe und Geschenk ↔ Gottesliebe und Rückzug → Konfrontation zweier Beziehungsregime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS5","text":"Geschenk ≠ Almosen + Reichtum des Gebenden → Zurückweisung der Bedürftigkeitsökonomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS6","text":"Einsame Herkunft → Verdacht des Diebstahls → Unsicherheit der Annahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS7","text":"Gotteslob in der Abgeschiedenheit + fehlendes Wissen vom Tod Gottes → Diagnose eines religiösen Zeitversatzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AF1","text":"Früheres Aschetragen → erkannte Verwandlung → Feuerbewegung zu den Tälern → Erwachter unter den Schlafenden → Geschenk statt Almosen → Misstrauen gegen den einsamen Gebenden → Trennung → Diagnose des nicht erkannten Todes Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME1","text":"Vertikale Askese wird als gerichtete Übermittlung neu kartiert: Das Entscheidende ist nicht mehr das Hinauftragen, sondern das Hinabtragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME2","text":"Der einheitliche Begriff der Liebe zerfällt in Menschenliebe als Zuwendung und Gottesliebe als Absonderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME3","text":"Geben wird in drei konkurrierende Kategorien aufgeteilt: Geschenk aus Überschuss, Almosen aus Bedürftigkeit und Diebstahl als fremde Deutung der Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME4","text":"Einsamkeit wird zugleich als Quelle von Gesang und als Ursache eines Erkenntnisrückstands sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME5","text":"Die Menschen erscheinen nicht als passive Empfänger, sondern als misstrauische Instanz, die den Sinn der Gabe vor ihrer Annahme bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die sichtbare Ebene ist ein Gespräch zwischen Zarathustra und dem aus dem Wald kommenden Heiligen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Szene organisiert zwei soziale und religiöse Mechanismen: öffentliche Gabe an Menschen und abgeschlossene Gottesverehrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustras Weg wird als Aufgabe der Übertragung gegen die Strategie des Rückzugs und der Selbstbewahrung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Bezeichnungen Kind, Erwachter und Schlafende sowie die Rede vom Tod Gottes ordnen die Figuren verschiedenen Zuständen und Zeiten des Bewusstseins zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der erkannten Verwandlung über den Gabenkonflikt bis zur Schlussdiagnose zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben der genaue Inhalt von Zarathustras Geschenk, die Bedeutung seiner Kindwerdung und die Begründung des Satzes vom Tod Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Aussagen des Heiligen als Gegenmodell und Zarathustras Schluss als eigene Diagnose behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Achse liegt in den Gegensätzen Asche/Feuer, Aufstieg/Abstieg, Wald/Täler, Almosen/Geschenk und Gotteslob/Tod Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von metaphorischen Richtungswerten und von der nicht unabhängig bestätigten Verallgemeinerung des Heiligen über das Misstrauen der Menschen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie bleibt ungelöst: Zarathustras Menschenliebe wird behauptet, aber weder ihre Annahme noch ihre praktische Wirksamkeit wird vorgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190100222077Z_c6641a08","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"b2985853cba0d568d6d9a9f0350ce3f933bd184a517ba5d8137baa4749c1ad33","sha256":"517694d9a02bd1bc89db57467e0ccee72a813e88f7e80b6749eb6f8ea4c320f0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:01:00.223303+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS1","text":"The encounter presents Zarathustra's transformation as a transition from secluded self-sustenance to a movement toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS2","text":"The old man interprets this transition as a change from carrying ashes upward to carrying fire downward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS3","text":"Zarathustra defines himself as one awakened and as the bearer of a gift for those who sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS4","text":"The saint opposes this movement with a turning away from human beings, love of God, and solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS5","text":"The dialogue shifts the question from the good will of the giver to the form and possibility of acceptance by human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AS6","text":"The diagnostic-contrastive movement leads from a recognized transformation through incompatible schemas of love and gift to the temporal diagnosis of a religious ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A1","text":"The old man recognizes Zarathustra as the former wanderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A2","text":"The old man perceives in Zarathustra a present transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A3","text":"This transformation is described as a change from carrying ashes to carrying fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A4","text":"Zarathustra is defined as a child and one awakened, who goes to those who sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A5","text":"Zarathustra declares that he loves human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A6","text":"The saint declares human beings imperfect and sets his love of God against love of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A7","text":"Zarathustra brings human beings a gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A8","text":"Zarathustra rejects alms as the form of his giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A9","text":"Zarathustra grounds this rejection in his own wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A10","text":"The saint recommends withdrawal into the forest and the animal world, as well as, at most, the giving of alms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A11","text":"Human beings distrust hermits and interpret their solitary steps as a possible sign of theft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:A12","text":"In solitude, the saint produces songs through which he praises his God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX1","text":"Zarathustra is no longer fixed upon the former figure of the ash-bearing hermit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX2","text":"Awakening does not mean remaining among those who sleep or in the enclosed forest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX3","text":"Love of human beings is not identical with the saint's love of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's gift is not alms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX5","text":"The solitary origin of the giver does not guarantee recognition of his gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX6","text":"The praise of God in the forest is not a movement toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:NX7","text":"Zarathustra's path excludes the becoming-equal to animals proposed by the saint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D1","text":"Zarathustra's transformation acquires a directed significance: it leads out of private asceticism into a movement of transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A1","CH_97E9_2200:A2","CH_97E9_2200:A3","CH_97E9_2200:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D2","text":"The two forms of love produce opposed relational orientations: human solicitude in Zarathustra and divinely grounded withdrawal in the saint.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A5","CH_97E9_2200:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D3","text":"Zarathustra's gift is defined as a gift from abundance and not as assistance from lack.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A7","CH_97E9_2200:A8","CH_97E9_2200:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D4","text":"The saint reduces the possible relation to human beings to the removal of burdens, alms, and enforced neediness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A6","CH_97E9_2200:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D5","text":"Prior to any acceptance, Zarathustra's gift is blocked by the social legibility of the hermit as a possible thief.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A7","CH_97E9_2200:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D6","text":"The saint's solitude forms a closed religious practice whose productivity is referred back to the praise of his own God.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A10","CH_97E9_2200:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:D7","text":"Zarathustra diagnoses the saint as someone whose religious horizon has not yet reached the discourse on the death of God.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A4","CH_97E9_2200:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD1","text":"Transformation is recoded from an inner purification into a risky public transmission of fire and wealth.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D1","CH_97E9_2200:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD2","text":"The conflict concerns not merely two opinions about charity, but two incompatible economies of relation: relief and alms versus abundance and gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D2","CH_97E9_2200:D3","CH_97E9_2200:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD3","text":"Solitude produces both spiritual productivity and epistemic isolation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D6","CH_97E9_2200:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SD4","text":"Zarathustra's missionary movement remains dependent on a disruption of reception, because the hermit's gift is read as theft before its content.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D1","CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX1","text":"The system excludes that solitude as such guarantees the higher or final form of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX2","text":"It excludes that human imperfection conclusively justifies withdrawal from human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX3","text":"It excludes that the intention of the giver determines the social meaning of the gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX4","text":"It excludes that religious productivity is to be equated with temporal or epistemic actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:DNX5","text":"It excludes that gift and alms lie on a common scale differing only by degree.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains a shared religious temporal horizon in which the saint and Zarathustra could share the same relation to God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX2","text":"Excluded remains an immediate transition from solitude to community, because the gift fails due to the prior suspicion of the giver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains a reconciled synthesis of love of human beings and holy separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a transparent recipient who misinterprets the gift neither as alms nor as theft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS1","text":"Former identity + present difference → determination of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS2","text":"Ashes upward / fire downward → reversal of the direction of movement from self-sustenance to transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS3","text":"Awakening + those who sleep → grounding of a movement from solitude to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS4","text":"Love of human beings and gift ↔ love of God and withdrawal → confrontation of two relational regimes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS5","text":"Gift ≠ alms + wealth of the giver → rejection of the economy of neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS6","text":"Solitary origin → suspicion of theft → uncertainty of acceptance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:FGS7","text":"Praise of God in seclusion + absent knowledge of the death of God → diagnosis of a religious temporal displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:AF1","text":"Former carrying of ashes → recognized transformation → movement of fire toward the valleys → one awakened among those who sleep → gift instead of alms → distrust of the solitary giver → separation → diagnosis of the unrecognized death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME1","text":"Vertical asceticism is remapped as directed transmission: what is decisive is no longer carrying upward, but carrying downward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME2","text":"The unified concept of love disintegrates into love of human beings as solicitude and love of God as separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME3","text":"Giving is divided into three competing categories: gift from abundance, alms from neediness, and theft as an external interpretation of the gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME4","text":"Solitude becomes visible both as a source of song and as the cause of an epistemic lag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ME5","text":"Human beings appear not as passive recipients, but as a distrustful instance that determines the meaning of the gift before its acceptance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT1","text":"Surface — The visible level is a conversation between Zarathustra and the saint coming from the forest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT2","text":"Structural — The scene organizes two social and religious mechanisms: public gift to human beings and closed worship of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustra's path is set as the task of transmission against the strategy of withdrawal and self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The designations child, one awakened, and those who sleep, as well as the discourse on the death of God, assign the figures to different states and times of consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from recognized transformation through the conflict of gifts to the concluding diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise content of Zarathustra's gift, the significance of his becoming a child, and the grounding of the proposition concerning the death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the saint's statements are treated as a countermodel and Zarathustra's conclusion as his own diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT4","text":"Its strongest axis lies in the oppositions ashes/fire, ascent/descent, forest/valleys, alms/gift, and praise of God/death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on metaphorical directional values and on the saint's independently unconfirmed generalization concerning human beings' distrust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2200:MRT6","text":"The central fault line remains unresolved: Zarathustra's love of human beings is asserted, but neither its acceptance nor its practical efficacy is demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2200:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2200@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2200:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 02","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 2","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 3","order":3,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3300"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3300@R001","sha256":"08c3f7060fd758757abe55e96a07baf0cb05c36a82c3d8930e30e9d66692c0a4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS1","text":"Die Rede bearbeitet die Frage, warum der Mensch sich mit seiner gegenwärtigen Gestalt begnügt, obwohl er als Übergang bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS2","text":"Sie bestimmt den Menschen als nicht abgeschlossenen Durchgangspunkt zwischen tierischer Herkunft und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS3","text":"Sie verlagert den Sinn von einer überirdischen Instanz auf die Erde und auf den Übermenschen als deren zukünftigen Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS4","text":"Sie diagnostiziert Leibverachtung, überirdische Hoffnung und moralische Genügsamkeit als Formen derselben Lebens- und Erdverneinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS5","text":"Sie steigert die Kritik zur großen Verachtung, in der Glück, Vernunft, Tugend, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid ihre gegenwärtige Genügsamkeit offenbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS6","text":"Sie fordert einen Bruch mit dieser Genügsamkeit durch Blitz und Wahnsinn und verdichtet diesen Bruch im Bild des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS7","text":"Die Schlussrahmung zeigt, dass der kollektive Adressat die Verkündigung nicht als Selbstüberwindung, sondern als Spektakel auffasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A1","text":"Alles Lebendige erzeugt etwas über sich hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A2","text":"Der Mensch ist ein Übergang und kein Endpunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A3","text":"Der Übermensch ist der Sinn der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A4","text":"Die Erde verlangt Treue; überirdische Hoffnungen entwerten das Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A5","text":"Der Tod Gottes beendet die frühere Vorrangordnung des Frevels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A6","text":"Die Verachtung des Leibes dient dem Versuch, der Erde und dem Leben zu entkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A7","text":"Die Seele, die den Leib verachtet, ist selbst verarmt, entstellt und ausgehungert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A8","text":"Der gegenwärtige Mensch ist ein unreiner Strom, der einer größeren Aufnahmefähigkeit bedarf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A9","text":"Die große Verachtung entsteht, wenn die gegenwärtigen Formen von Glück, Vernunft, Tugend, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid als unzureichend erfahren werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A10","text":"Genügsamkeit und Geiz in den eigenen Werten sind problematischer als die bloße Sünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A11","text":"Selbstüberwindung erfordert einen gewaltsamen Einbruch von Blitz und Wahnsinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A12","text":"Der Übermensch wird als Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn der gegenwärtigen Verachtung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX1","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht das höchste oder abschließende Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX2","text":"Selbstüberwindung bedeutet nicht die Rückkehr zum Tier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX3","text":"Der Sinn des Daseins liegt nicht in einer überirdischen Hoffnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX4","text":"Die Seele ist kein höherer Bereich, der den Leib und die Erde legitim überschreiten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX5","text":"Leibverachtung ist keine Erhebung, sondern eine Form der Lebensverneinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX6","text":"Gegenwärtiges Glück, gegenwärtige Vernunft, Tugend, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid sind keine hinreichende Rechtfertigung des Daseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX7","text":"Die Sünde allein ist nicht das zentrale Hindernis der Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX8","text":"Beharrende Vernünftigkeit und moralische Ausgeglichenheit erzeugen keine Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D1","text":"Der Mensch muss sich überschreiten, weil seine eigene Bestimmung in einer allgemeinen Logik des Über-sich-hinaus-Schaffens liegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D2","text":"Die Verlagerung des Sinns auf die Erde macht den Übermenschen zu einer immanenten, zukünftigen Zielbestimmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D3","text":"Die Behauptung einer höheren Seele wird als Symptom einer verarmten leiblichen und irdischen Existenz lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A6","CH_97E9_3300:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D4","text":"Die große Verachtung bildet die Schwelle, an der bestehende Werte ihre Selbstverständlichkeit verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D5","text":"Der Übermensch bezeichnet keine bloße bessere Version des gegenwärtigen Menschen, sondern die Fähigkeit, dessen Verachtung aufzunehmen und umzuwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D6","text":"Die Verkündigung wird vom Volk in die Erwartung einer äußeren Vorführung des Seiltänzers umgedeutet.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D7","text":"Die kollektive Reaktion reproduziert genau jene Unfähigkeit zur Überwindung, die die Rede diagnostiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A10","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine transzendente Teleologie durch eine irdische Teleologie der Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD2","text":"Die Kritik bestehender Werte zielt nicht auf wertfreie Auflösung, sondern auf ihre Umwandlung in eine höhere irdische Möglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD3","text":"Der Übermensch bündelt ontologische Zukunft, normative Forderung, affektive Krise und transformative Gewalt in einer einzigen Figur.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD4","text":"Die Rede macht die Unfähigkeit zur Aufnahme ihrer Botschaft selbst zum Beweis für die Fortdauer des zu überwindenden Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Lehre und Spektakel wird zu einer Prüfung der kollektiven Empfangsfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A12","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein in sich fertiger, stabiler und selbstgenügsamer Mensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein äußerer Garant des Sinns jenseits der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine eigenständige höhere Sphäre der Seele gegenüber Leib und Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass schrittweise moralische Verbesserung die entscheidende Transformation leisten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gegenwart, deren Glück, Vernunft und Tugend bereits hinreichend wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine gesicherte kollektive Rezeption der Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX1","text":"Die positive Gestalt des Übermenschen bleibt als Abwesenheit bestehen; verfügbar sind vor allem seine Funktionen als Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX2","text":"Ein unabhängiges Kriterium dafür, welcher Wahnsinn zur Selbstüberwindung und welcher zur Zerstörung führt, wird nicht bereitgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX3","text":"Eine gemeinschaftliche Sprache, in der die Verkündigung ohne Verwechslung mit Spektakel aufgenommen werden könnte, fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX4","text":"Die Versöhnung zwischen Erdtreue und der Verachtung gegenwärtiger menschlicher Güter bleibt unaufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer nicht-gewaltsamen oder nicht-verachtenden Transformation wird strukturell nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS1","text":"Setze die allgemeine Selbstüberschreitung des Lebendigen und den Menschen als Übergang; daraus folgt die Negation des Menschen als Endpunkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS2","text":"Bestimme die gegenwärtige menschliche Gestalt durch tierische Überreste, verarmte Seele und unreinen Strom; daraus folgt die Diagnose gegenwärtiger Unzulänglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A6","CH_97E9_3300:A7","CH_97E9_3300:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS3","text":"Entferne Transzendenz und Leibdualismus; verlege den Sinn auf Erde und Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5","CH_97E9_3300:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS4","text":"Entwerte die bestehenden Formen von Glück, Vernunft, Tugend, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid als Genügsamkeit; erzeuge die Schwelle der großen Verachtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS5","text":"Übersetze die große Verachtung in einen eruptiven Transformationsbedarf; bestimme Blitz und Wahnsinn als operative Mittel des Bruchs.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS6","text":"Verdichte Ziel, Aufnahmefähigkeit und Bruch in der Figur des Übermenschen als Sinn der Erde, Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS7","text":"Konfrontiere die Lehre mit dem kollektiven Adressaten; lasse deren Umdeutung zum Spektakel die gegenwärtige Nichtüberwindung sichtbar machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AF1","text":"Selbstüberschreitung des Lebendigen → Mensch als Übergang → Diagnose animalischer und geistiger Unvollständigkeit → Ausschluss von Transzendenz und Leibverachtung → Erdtreue → große Verachtung → Blitz und Wahnsinn → Übermensch als irdischer Sinn und transformierende Aufnahmefähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AF2","text":"Verkündigung des Übermenschen → kollektive Fehllektüre → Ersetzung der begrifflichen Lehre durch das erwartete Spektakel → Bestätigung der diagnostizierten Genügsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME1","text":"Der Mensch wird von einem Endpunkt der Entwicklung zu einer Übergangsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME2","text":"Sinn wird vom Überirdischen auf Erde, Zukunft und Selbstüberwindung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME3","text":"Seele und moralische Werte werden von autonomen Höhen zu Symptomen leiblicher und irdischer Zustände umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME4","text":"Verachtung wird von einer bloß negativen Haltung zu einer produktiven Schwellenkraft umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME5","text":"Der Übermensch wird zugleich als Ziel, Medium, Maßstab und Ereignis der Transformation kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME6","text":"Öffentliche Rezeption wird als struktureller Umschlag von Verkündigung in Spektakel sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine prophetische Rede fordert die Überwindung des Menschen und die Treue zur Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Überirdische Hoffnung, Leibverachtung und Genügsamkeit werden als miteinander verbundene Formen derselben Lebensverneinung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Veränderung wird nicht durch Korrektur bestehender Werte, sondern durch ihre affektive Entwertung und einen eruptiven Bruch vorbereitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Der Mensch erscheint als zeitliche Übergangsform; der Sinn liegt in einer zukünftigen, aber vollständig irdischen Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von menschlicher Unabgeschlossenheit über Erdtreue und große Verachtung zum Übermenschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche argumentative Bewegung und integriert die Schlusswendung als Test der kollektiven Rezeption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Gestalt des Übermenschen jenseits der Bilder von Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste innere Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Transzendenzkritik, Erdtreue und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass gegenwärtige Vernunft, Tugend, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid verworfen werden, ohne ein alternatives normatives Kriterium auszuarbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie entsteht zwischen der universalen Anrufung des Volkes und der im Text selbst dargestellten Unfähigkeit des Volkes, die Anrufung begrifflich aufzunehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt auf die rhetorische Gleichsetzung von Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn angewiesen, weil deren funktionale Differenz nicht vollständig formalisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191235860460Z_e0c75299","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"08c3f7060fd758757abe55e96a07baf0cb05c36a82c3d8930e30e9d66692c0a4","sha256":"69df7bdc54d2331cba7d351ab9cccdbb2daf36eec0518215f1faac34b9a0fdfd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:12:35.862687+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS1","text":"The discourse addresses the question of why the human being is content with its present form, although it is determined as a transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS2","text":"It determines the human being as an unfinished passage-point between animal origin and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS3","text":"It shifts meaning from a supra-terrestrial instance to the earth and to the Übermensch as its future meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS4","text":"It diagnoses contempt for the body, supra-terrestrial hope, and moral self-sufficiency as forms of the same negation of life and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS5","text":"It intensifies the critique into the great contempt, in which happiness, reason, virtue, justice, and pity reveal their present self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS6","text":"It demands a break with this self-sufficiency through lightning and madness and condenses this break in the image of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AS7","text":"The concluding framing shows that the collective addressee understands the proclamation not as self-overcoming but as spectacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A1","text":"Everything living creates something beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A2","text":"The human being is a transition and not an endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A3","text":"The Übermensch is the meaning of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A4","text":"The earth demands fidelity; supra-terrestrial hopes devalue life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A5","text":"The death of God ends the former order of precedence of sacrilege.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A6","text":"Contempt for the body serves the attempt to escape the earth and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A7","text":"The soul that despises the body is itself impoverished, deformed, and famished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A8","text":"The present human being is an impure stream that requires a greater capacity for reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A9","text":"The great contempt arises when the present forms of happiness, reason, virtue, justice, and pity are experienced as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A10","text":"Self-sufficiency and stinginess in one's own values are more problematic than mere sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A11","text":"Self-overcoming requires a violent irruption of lightning and madness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:A12","text":"The Übermensch is determined as the sea, lightning, and madness of present contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX1","text":"The human being is not the highest or final being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX2","text":"Self-overcoming does not mean the return to the animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX3","text":"The meaning of existence does not lie in a supra-terrestrial hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX4","text":"The soul is not a higher realm that could legitimately transcend the body and the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX5","text":"Contempt for the body is not an elevation, but a form of negation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX6","text":"Present happiness, present reason, virtue, justice, and pity are not a sufficient justification of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX7","text":"Sin alone is not the central obstacle to overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:NX8","text":"Persistent rationality and moral equilibrium do not produce self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D1","text":"The human being must transcend itself because its own determination lies in a general logic of creating beyond itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D2","text":"The shift of meaning onto the earth makes the Übermensch an immanent, future determination of the goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D3","text":"The assertion of a higher soul becomes legible as a symptom of an impoverished bodily and earthly existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A6","CH_97E9_3300:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D4","text":"The great contempt forms the threshold at which existing values lose their self-evidence.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D5","text":"The Übermensch denotes not merely a better version of the present human being, but the capacity to receive and transform its contempt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D6","text":"The proclamation is reinterpreted by the people as the expectation of an external performance by the tightrope walker.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:D7","text":"The collective reaction reproduces precisely that incapacity for overcoming which the discourse diagnoses.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A10","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD1","text":"The system replaces a transcendent teleology with an earthly teleology of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD2","text":"The critique of existing values aims not at value-free dissolution, but at their transformation into a higher earthly possibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD3","text":"The Übermensch combines ontological futurity, normative demand, affective crisis, and transformative violence in a single figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD4","text":"The discourse makes the incapacity to receive its message itself into proof of the persistence of the human being to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SD5","text":"The opposition between doctrine and spectacle becomes a test of collective receptivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A12","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a human being complete, stable, and self-sufficient in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an external guarantor of meaning beyond the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an independent higher sphere of the soul in relation to body and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that gradual moral improvement can accomplish the decisive transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a present whose happiness, reason, and virtue would already be sufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a secured collective reception of the doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX1","text":"The positive figure of the Übermensch remains as absence; chiefly available are its functions as sea, lightning, and madness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX2","text":"An independent criterion for which madness leads to self-overcoming and which to destruction is not provided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX3","text":"A communal language in which the proclamation could be received without confusion with spectacle is lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX4","text":"The reconciliation between fidelity to the earth and contempt for present human goods remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:SNX5","text":"The possibility of a non-violent or non-contemptuous transformation is structurally not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS1","text":"Posit the general self-transcendence of the living and the human being as transition; from this follows the negation of the human being as endpoint.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A1","CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS2","text":"Determine the present human form through animal remnants, impoverished soul, and impure stream; from this follows the diagnosis of present inadequacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A6","CH_97E9_3300:A7","CH_97E9_3300:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS3","text":"Remove transcendence and body dualism; relocate meaning to earth and Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:A5","CH_97E9_3300:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS4","text":"Devalue the existing forms of happiness, reason, virtue, justice, and pity as self-sufficiency; generate the threshold of the great contempt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS5","text":"Translate the great contempt into an eruptive need for transformation; determine lightning and madness as operative means of the break.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS6","text":"Condense goal, receptivity, and break in the figure of the Übermensch as meaning of the earth, sea, lightning, and madness.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A8","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:FGS7","text":"Confront the doctrine with the collective addressee; let its reinterpretation as spectacle make present non-overcoming visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AF1","text":"Self-transcendence of the living → human being as transition → diagnosis of animal and spiritual incompleteness → exclusion of transcendence and contempt for the body → fidelity to the earth → great contempt → lightning and madness → Übermensch as earthly meaning and transformative receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:AF2","text":"Proclamation of the Übermensch → collective misreading → replacement of conceptual doctrine by the expected spectacle → confirmation of the diagnosed self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME1","text":"The human being is remapped from an endpoint of development to a transitional form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME2","text":"Meaning is remapped from the supra-terrestrial to earth, future, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME3","text":"Soul and moral values are reclassified from autonomous heights to symptoms of bodily and earthly conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME4","text":"Contempt is reclassified from a merely negative attitude to a productive threshold force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME5","text":"The Übermensch is mapped simultaneously as goal, medium, standard, and event of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ME6","text":"Public reception becomes visible as a structural reversal from proclamation into spectacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A prophetic discourse demands the overcoming of the human being and fidelity to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Supra-terrestrial hope, contempt for the body, and self-sufficiency are organized as interconnected forms of the same negation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Change is prepared not through the correction of existing values, but through their affective devaluation and an eruptive break.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The human being appears as a temporal transitional form; meaning lies in a future, yet wholly earthly possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from human incompleteness through fidelity to the earth and great contempt to the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement and integrates the concluding turn as a test of collective reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT3","text":"The positive figure of the Übermensch remains underdetermined beyond the images of sea, lightning, and madness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT4","text":"The strongest internal connection lies in the coupling of critique of transcendence, fidelity to the earth, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that present reason, virtue, justice, and pity are rejected without elaborating an alternative normative criterion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT6","text":"A second line of rupture arises between the universal address to the people and the incapacity of the people, represented in the text itself, to receive the address conceptually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3300:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction remains dependent on the rhetorical equation of sea, lightning, and madness, because their functional difference is not fully formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3300:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3300@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3300:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 03","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 3","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 4","order":4,"parents":["RAW_97E9_4400"],"revision":"CH_97E9_4400@R001","sha256":"31257d612d5f5dac6cb4c6cc6b224e633d53d638ea2739685214a0b223d186fc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, den Menschen ohne Setzung als endgültigen Zweck zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS2","text":"Der Mensch wird als Seil zwischen Tier und Übermensch und damit als gefährlicher Übergang über einem Abgrund neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS3","text":"Menschliche Größe entsteht nicht durch Selbsterhaltung, sondern durch die Bereitschaft zum Übergang, zur Selbstüberschreitung und zum Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS4","text":"Erkenntnis, Arbeit, Erfindung, Tugend, Freiheit, Verletzbarkeit und Verschwendung erhalten ihren Wert durch ihre Ausrichtung auf die künftige Hervorbringung des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS5","text":"Das Argument operiert diagnostisch, teleologisch und prophetisch: Es ersetzt menschliche Selbstzweckhaftigkeit durch eine auf den Übermenschen gerichtete Übergangslogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Selbstpositionierung Zarathustras als Verkündiger des Blitzes, dessen Name Übermensch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A1","text":"Der Mensch ist ein Übergang zwischen Tier und Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A2","text":"Der Mensch ist eine Brücke und kein Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A3","text":"Der Übergang des Menschen ist notwendig gefährlich und mit einem Abgrund verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A4","text":"Menschliche Größe besteht in der Bereitschaft zum Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A5","text":"Der Übermensch ist die zukünftige Zielgestalt menschlicher Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A6","text":"Die Erde soll durch gegenwärtige Opfer für die Entstehung des Übermenschen vorbereitet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A7","text":"Erkenntnis ist nur dann positiv bestimmt, wenn sie dem künftigen Leben des Übermenschen dient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A8","text":"Arbeit und Erfindung sind Mittel zur Vorbereitung einer Welt des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A9","text":"Tugend ist Wille zum Untergang und Pfeil der Sehnsucht nach dem anderen Ufer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A10","text":"Eine Tugend gewinnt durch Konzentration stärkere Schicksalsbindung als eine Vielheit von Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A11","text":"Der wertvolle Mensch bewahrt keinen Teil seines Geistes für sich und macht sich nicht zum Zweck seiner eigenen Erhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A12","text":"Selbstverschwendung, Selbstvergessenheit, Verwundbarkeit und Freiheit intensivieren den Übergang über die Brücke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A13","text":"Gegenwärtiger Untergang kann die Zukunft rechtfertigen und die Vergangenheit erlösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A14","text":"Zarathustra erscheint als Verkündiger des Blitzes, der Übermensch heißt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX1","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht der endgültige Zweck seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX2","text":"Menschliche Existenz ist keine abgeschlossene oder stabile Seinsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX3","text":"Der Sinn des Untergangs wird nicht durch einen jenseitigen Grund garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX4","text":"Selbsterhaltung ist kein oberstes Kriterium menschlichen Wertes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX5","text":"Die bloße Ansammlung vieler Tugenden gilt nicht als Steigerung der Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX6","text":"Gabe wird nicht durch Dank, Rückgabe oder Gegenleistung legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX7","text":"Glück und günstiger Zufall begründen keinen unbedingten Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX8","text":"Versprechen begrenzen nicht die Verpflichtung, mehr zu verwirklichen als angekündigt wurde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX9","text":"Der gegenwärtige Mensch ist nicht der letzte Richter über Zukunft und Vergangenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX10","text":"Gott bleibt nicht außerhalb von Züchtigung, Zorn und Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D1","text":"Der Wert des Menschen liegt in seiner Funktion als Mittel einer noch nicht verwirklichten Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_4400:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D2","text":"Der Untergang bezeichnet nicht bloße Vernichtung, sondern die Bedingung des Übergangs zum Übermenschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A3","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D3","text":"Erkenntnis, Arbeit und Erfindung werden aus autonomen Tätigkeiten in vorbereitende Funktionen einer zukünftigen Welt umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A7","CH_97E9_4400:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D4","text":"Tugend wird nicht als Besitz, sondern als gerichtete Bewegung auf Selbstüberschreitung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D5","text":"Die Konzentration auf eine einzige Tugend bindet das Individuum enger an sein Schicksal und verstärkt seine Übergangsfunktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D6","text":"Selbstverschwendung hebt die Grenze zwischen individueller Erhaltung und zukünftiger Hervorbringung auf.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D7","text":"Verwundbarkeit wird vom Zeichen des Scheiterns zum Medium des Übergangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A3","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D8","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als opfernde Schwelle zwischen einer zu erlösenden Vergangenheit und einer zu rechtfertigenden Zukunft bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D9","text":"Die Rede über den wertvollen Menschen erzeugt zugleich ein Auswahlkriterium für Formen des Lebens, die ihren eigenen Untergang wollen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD1","text":"Das gesamte Wertesystem wird von der Erhaltung des Bestehenden auf die Erzeugung eines zukünftigen Typs umgestellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD2","text":"Der Untergang wird zur produktiven Schaltstelle, an der individuelle Selbstaufgabe in geschichtliche Hervorbringung übergeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_4400:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD3","text":"Der Übermensch fungiert nicht nur als zukünftiges Wesen, sondern als regulatives Zentrum, das gegenwärtige Erkenntnis, Arbeit, Tugend und Opfer rückwirkend ordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A7","CH_97E9_4400:A8","CH_97E9_4400:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD4","text":"Die Rede von Liebe übernimmt die Funktion einer normativen Selektion: Geliebt wird, was sich als Übergangsmittel für den Übermenschen exponiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD5","text":"Die individuelle Existenz wird vollständig in eine kosmisch-geschichtliche Übergangsarchitektur eingetragen, in der ihre höchste Erfüllung mit ihrem Verschwinden zusammenfällt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass der Mensch keinen aus sich selbst gültigen Wesenskern besitzt, der unabhängig von seiner Überschreitung bewahrt werden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Überleben, Kontinuität, Dankbarkeit und Rückkehr keine letzten Kriterien von Wert sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Entwicklung aus, in der der Mensch den Übermenschen erreicht, ohne seine gegenwärtige Form preiszugeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX4","text":"Es schließt einen jenseitigen Garanten aus, der Opfer, Untergang oder Zukunft nachträglich legitimieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine neutrale oder selbstgenügsame Tugend aus, die nicht als gerichtete Bewegung auf ein anderes Ufer funktioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit eines Menschen, der zugleich endgültiger Zweck und Übergang sein könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gegenwart, die sich selbst rechtfertigt und nicht als Material ihres eigenen Untergangs behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine versöhnte Kontinuität zwischen Mensch und Übermensch; die Zukunft kann nur durch Bruch, Opfer und Selbstaufgabe eröffnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine positive Bestimmung des Übermenschen unabhängig von der Abwesenheit, Unzulänglichkeit und Preisgabe des gegenwärtigen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS1","text":"Zwischenwesenheit des Menschen + Abgrund → Brückenstruktur ohne Selbstzweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS2","text":"Brückenstruktur ohne Selbstzweck + gefährlicher Übergang → Notwendigkeit von Risiko, Verwundbarkeit und Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS3","text":"Künftiger Übermensch + irdische Zielrichtung → Umwandlung von Erkenntnis, Arbeit und Erfindung in vorbereitende Funktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS4","text":"Wille zum Untergang + konzentrierte Tugend → Individuum als Träger und Knoten eines zukünftigen Schicksals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS5","text":"Selbstverschwendung + Selbstvergessenheit + Gegenwartsverlust → Auflösung individueller Selbsterhaltung zugunsten geschichtlicher Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS6","text":"Gegenwärtiger Untergang + Zukunftsrechtfertigung + Vergangenenerlösung → zeitliche Umkehrung der Wertbegründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS7","text":"Verkündigerrolle + Blitzmetapher → abschließende Identifikation des Übermenschen als angekündigte Zielgestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AF1","text":"Mensch als problematisches Zwischenwesen → Brücke statt Zweck → gefährlicher Übergang über den Abgrund → Untergang als Wertkriterium → irdische Vorbereitung des Übermenschen → Selbstaufgabe als geschichtliche Funktion → Zarathustra als Verkündiger des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME1","text":"Der Mensch wird von einer selbständigen Wesensbestimmung zu einer topologischen Übergangsfunktion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME2","text":"Untergang wird von einem negativen Resultat zu einem positiven Medium von Übergang und Hervorbringung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Diesseits und Jenseits wird zugunsten einer irdischen Vorbereitung des Zukünftigen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME4","text":"Erkenntnis, Arbeit, Erfindung, Tugend, Freiheit, Großzügigkeit und Verwundbarkeit werden als Varianten derselben gerichteten Übergangsbewegung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME5","text":"Die Zeitordnung wird neu gezeichnet: Die Gegenwart verliert ihre Selbständigkeit und wird zur opfernden Vermittlung von Vergangenheit und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME6","text":"Individuelle Selbstverwirklichung und Selbstvernichtung werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als zusammenfallende Formen des Übergangs behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME7","text":"Die Sprecherposition wird von der Beschreibung eines Menschenbildes zur performativen Verkündigung seiner zukünftigen Zielgestalt verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die wertende Aufzählung von Menschen, die ihren Untergang, ihre Verschwendung und ihre Selbstüberschreitung wollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT2","text":"Structural — Darunter liegt ein Bewertungsmechanismus, der jede Fähigkeit nach ihrer Funktion für die Hervorbringung des Übermenschen klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument ersetzt die Frage nach der Bewahrung des Menschen durch die Frage, welche Lebensformen als Pfeile, Brücken und Opfer für eine kommende Gestalt dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Mensch wird als vorläufiges Zwischenwesen, die Gegenwart als Übergang und der Übermensch als zukünftige ontologische Zielgestalt gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundbewegung von Zwischenwesenheit über Untergang zur Hervorbringung des Übermenschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der Übermensch positiv ist; seine Funktion wird stärker bestimmt als seine Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT3","text":"Der Begriff des Untergangs bleibt zwischen Selbstvernichtung, Selbstüberschreitung, Opfer und Übergang semantisch unaufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT4","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung besteht zwischen der Behauptung, der Mensch sei kein Zweck, und der starken teleologischen Ausrichtung sämtlicher Werte auf den Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen freiem Geist und Herz einerseits und der vollständigen Instrumentalisierung des Individuums für eine zukünftige Gestalt andererseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT6","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht darauf, dass Untergang nicht als bloßes Ende, sondern als Bedingung der Zukunft gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, verliert jedoch die singuläre Bildlogik, durch die Brücke, Abgrund, Blitz, Pfeil und Wolke dieselbe Übergangsmaschine mehrfach verkörpern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191716577981Z_8a4de6af","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4.","source_sha256":"31257d612d5f5dac6cb4c6cc6b224e633d53d638ea2739685214a0b223d186fc","sha256":"bd97c71b0485cb614b7d1194e4f03ee2cb60d4307bbf516e25e131e2c3dce275","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:17:16.580098+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in determining the human being without positing it as the ultimate end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS2","text":"The human being is redefined as a rope between animal and Übermensch, and thus as a dangerous passage over an abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS3","text":"Human greatness arises not through self-preservation, but through readiness for passage, self-overcoming, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS4","text":"Knowledge, work, invention, virtue, freedom, vulnerability, and wastefulness receive their value through their orientation toward the future production of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS5","text":"The argument operates diagnostically, teleologically, and prophetically: it replaces human self-finality with a logic of passage directed toward the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AS6","text":"The movement ends in Zarathustra's self-positioning as the proclaimer of the lightning whose name is Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A1","text":"The human being is a passage between animal and Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A2","text":"The human being is a bridge and not an end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A3","text":"The human being's passage is necessarily dangerous and bound up with an abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A4","text":"Human greatness consists in readiness for downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A5","text":"The Übermensch is the future goal-form of human self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A6","text":"The earth is to be prepared through present sacrifices for the emergence of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A7","text":"Knowledge is positively determined only when it serves the future life of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A8","text":"Work and invention are means of preparing a world of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A9","text":"Virtue is the will to downfall and the arrow of longing for the other shore.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A10","text":"Through concentration, one virtue gains a stronger binding to fate than a multiplicity of virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A11","text":"The valuable human being reserves no part of his spirit for himself and does not make himself the end of his own preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A12","text":"Self-wastefulness, self-forgetfulness, vulnerability, and freedom intensify the passage across the bridge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A13","text":"Present downfall can justify the future and redeem the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:A14","text":"Zarathustra appears as the proclaimer of the lightning called Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX1","text":"The human being is not its own ultimate end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX2","text":"Human existence is not a completed or stable form of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX3","text":"The meaning of downfall is not guaranteed by a transcendent ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX4","text":"Self-preservation is not a supreme criterion of human value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX5","text":"The mere accumulation of many virtues does not count as an intensification of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX6","text":"A gift is not legitimized by thanks, return, or recompense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX7","text":"Happiness and favorable chance do not ground unconditional value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX8","text":"Promises do not limit the obligation to realize more than has been announced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX9","text":"The present human being is not the final judge over future and past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:NX10","text":"God does not remain outside chastisement, wrath, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D1","text":"The value of the human being lies in its function as a means of a future not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_4400:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D2","text":"Downfall does not designate mere destruction, but the condition of passage to the Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A3","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D3","text":"Knowledge, work, and invention are reclassified from autonomous activities into preparatory functions of a future world.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A7","CH_97E9_4400:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D4","text":"Virtue is determined not as possession, but as a directed movement toward self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D5","text":"Concentration upon a single virtue binds the individual more closely to its fate and intensifies its function of passage.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D6","text":"Self-wastefulness abolishes the boundary between individual preservation and future production.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D7","text":"Vulnerability is transformed from a sign of failure into the medium of passage.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A3","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D8","text":"The present is determined as a sacrificing threshold between a past to be redeemed and a future to be justified.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:D9","text":"The discourse on the valuable human being simultaneously generates a criterion of selection for forms of life that will their own downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD1","text":"The entire value system is shifted from the preservation of what exists to the production of a future type.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD2","text":"Downfall becomes a productive switching point at which individual self-abandonment passes into historical production.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A6","CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_4400:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD3","text":"The Übermensch functions not only as a future being, but as a regulative center that retrospectively orders present knowledge, work, virtue, and sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A7","CH_97E9_4400:A8","CH_97E9_4400:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD4","text":"The discourse of love assumes the function of normative selection: loved is what exposes itself as a means of passage for the Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A5","CH_97E9_4400:A9","CH_97E9_4400:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SD5","text":"Individual existence is fully inscribed into a cosmic-historical architecture of passage, in which its highest fulfillment coincides with its disappearance.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_4400:A4","CH_97E9_4400:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that the human being possesses no essential core valid in itself that would have to be preserved independently of its overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that survival, continuity, gratitude, and return are not ultimate criteria of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX3","text":"It excludes a development in which the human being reaches the Übermensch without surrendering its present form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX4","text":"It excludes a transcendent guarantor that could retroactively legitimize sacrifice, downfall, or the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:DNX5","text":"It excludes a neutral or self-sufficient virtue that does not function as a directed movement toward another shore.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a human being that could simultaneously be ultimate end and passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a present that justifies itself and is not treated as material for its own downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a reconciled continuity between human being and Übermensch; the future can be opened only through rupture, sacrifice, and self-abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a positive determination of the Übermensch independently of the absence, insufficiency, and relinquishment of the present human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS1","text":"Intermediate-being of the human being + abyss → bridge structure without self-finality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS2","text":"Bridge structure without self-finality + dangerous passage → necessity of risk, vulnerability, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS3","text":"Future Übermensch + earthly orientation toward the goal → transformation of knowledge, work, and invention into preparatory functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS4","text":"Will to downfall + concentrated virtue → individual as bearer and node of a future fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS5","text":"Self-wastefulness + self-forgetfulness + loss of the present → dissolution of individual self-preservation in favor of historical production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS6","text":"Present downfall + justification of the future + redemption of the past → temporal reversal of the grounding of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:FGS7","text":"Role of proclaimer + lightning metaphor → concluding identification of the Übermensch as the announced goal-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:AF1","text":"Human being as problematic intermediate being → bridge instead of end → dangerous passage over the abyss → downfall as criterion of value → earthly preparation of the Übermensch → self-abandonment as historical function → Zarathustra as proclaimer of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME1","text":"The human being is remapped from an independent essential determination into a topological function of passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME2","text":"Downfall is reclassified from a negative result into a positive medium of passage and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME3","text":"The opposition between this world and the beyond is displaced in favor of an earthly preparation of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME4","text":"Knowledge, work, invention, virtue, freedom, generosity, and vulnerability become legible as variants of the same directed movement of passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME5","text":"The temporal order is redrawn: the present loses its independence and becomes the sacrificing mediation of past and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME6","text":"Individual self-realization and self-destruction are no longer treated as opposites, but as coinciding forms of passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ME7","text":"The speaker position is shifted from the description of an image of humanity to the performative proclamation of its future goal-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the evaluative enumeration of human beings who will their downfall, their wastefulness, and their self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT2","text":"Structural — Beneath this lies a mechanism of evaluation that classifies every capacity according to its function for the production of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces the question of preserving the human being with the question of which forms of life serve as arrows, bridges, and sacrifices for a coming form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The human being is posited as a provisional intermediate being, the present as passage, and the Übermensch as a future ontological goal-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic movement from intermediate-being through downfall to the production of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the Übermensch positively is; its function is more strongly determined than its form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT3","text":"The concept of downfall remains semantically unresolved between self-destruction, self-overcoming, sacrifice, and passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT4","text":"A structural tension exists between the claim that the human being is not an end and the strong teleological orientation of all values toward the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT5","text":"A further tension exists between free spirit and heart on the one hand, and the complete instrumentalization of the individual for a future form on the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT6","text":"The internal coherence rests on reading downfall not as a mere end, but as the condition of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4400:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but loses the singular logic of images through which bridge, abyss, lightning, arrow, and cloud repeatedly embody the same machine of passage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4400:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_4400@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_4400:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 4","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","4."],"original_title":"4."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 4","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","4."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 04","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 4","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 4"},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 5","order":5,"parents":["RAW_97E9_5500"],"revision":"CH_97E9_5500@R001","sha256":"72204f305abe693cb73f2e16a1d7de92b261ebbbb3ff135cce234c010d0fbb0c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS1","text":"Die Rede setzt beim Problem ein, dass eine gebildete Menge den Sprecher hört, ohne ihn zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS2","text":"Zarathustra richtet seine Ansprache über den Stolz der Bildung auf das Verächtlichste und diagnostiziert daran den letzten Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS3","text":"Der Mensch muss sich ein Ziel über sich hinaus setzen und den Keim höchster Hoffnung in seine noch fruchtbare Gegenwart pflanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS4","text":"Die Möglichkeit höherer Hervorbringung hängt vom Erhalt inneren Chaos und überschießender Sehnsucht ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS5","text":"Der letzte Mensch bezeichnet die zukünftige Stillstellung dieser Bewegung durch Wärme, Sicherheit, Gleichheit, Gesundheit und verkleinernde Bedürfnisverwaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS6","text":"Die Menge verwechselt die Warnung mit einem Angebot, begehrt den letzten Menschen und bestätigt dadurch die diagnostizierte Unfähigkeit des Hörens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A1","text":"Der Mensch muss sich ein Ziel über sich hinaus setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A2","text":"Höchste Hoffnung entsteht nur, wenn ihr Keim in die gegenwärtige menschliche Erde gepflanzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A3","text":"Die gegenwärtige menschliche Erde kann in Zukunft arm und zahm werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A4","text":"Über den Menschen hinaus gerichtete Sehnsucht benötigt innere Spannung und Chaos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A5","text":"Schöpferische Hervorbringung wird durch die Geburt eines höheren Sterns bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A6","text":"Der letzte Mensch kann sich selbst nicht mehr verachten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A7","text":"Der letzte Mensch organisiert sein Glück durch Wärme, Sicherheit, Gesundheit und angenehme Bedürfnisbefriedigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A8","text":"Arbeit bleibt bestehen, wird aber auf ungefährliche Unterhaltung begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A9","text":"Herrschaft, Gehorsam und soziale Rangordnung gelten als zu beschwerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A10","text":"Abweichung wird als Krankheit behandelt, während Gleichheit zur verpflichtenden Gemeinsamkeit wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A11","text":"Dauernder Streit wird durch schnelle Versöhnung zugunsten körperlicher und sozialer Unversehrtheit neutralisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A12","text":"Bildung fungiert für die Menge als Distinktionsstolz, nicht notwendig als Fähigkeit zum Verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A13","text":"Die Menge kann eine Warnung vor dem letzten Menschen als Verheißung desselben aufnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX1","text":"Bildung garantiert kein Hören und kein Verständnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX2","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht als endgültiger Zustand bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX3","text":"Die menschliche Sehnsucht darf nicht an der Selbsterhaltung enden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX4","text":"Der letzte Mensch besitzt keine gerichtete Sehnsucht über den Menschen hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX5","text":"Liebe, Schöpfung und Stern sind für den letzten Menschen keine offenen Fragen einer höheren Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX6","text":"Härte, Krankheit, Misstrauen und Risiko werden aus der zulässigen Lebensform ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX7","text":"Armut, Reichtum, Herrschaft und Gehorsam werden als untragbare Gegensätze beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX8","text":"Dauernder Konflikt und bleibende Differenz dürfen nicht fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX9","text":"Selbstverachtung als Maßstab des Niedrigen wird dem letzten Menschen entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX10","text":"Der Übermensch darf nicht mit dem letzten Menschen identisch werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D1","text":"Wenn der Mensch sein Ziel über sich hinaus setzen muss und seine gegenwärtige Erde verarmen kann, ist seine Zukunft nicht als linearer Aufstieg gesichert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A1","CH_97E9_5500:A2","CH_97E9_5500:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D2","text":"Wenn Chaos die Bedingung schöpferischer Hervorbringung ist, bedeutet seine Beseitigung den Verlust der Möglichkeit eines höheren Ziels.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A4","CH_97E9_5500:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D3","text":"Das Glück des letzten Menschen besteht nicht in gesteigerter Erfüllung, sondern in der Vermeidung aller verletzenden oder überfordernden Bedingungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D4","text":"Wärme, ungefährliche Arbeit, Gesundheitsverehrung und angenehmes Sterben bilden zusammen ein System kontrollierter Bedürfnisbefriedigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D5","text":"Die Zurückweisung von Herrschaft und Gehorsam erzeugt keine offene Vielheit, sondern eine normierte Gleichheit, in der Andersfühlen pathologisiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A9","CH_97E9_5500:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D6","text":"Die schnelle Versöhnung verwandelt Konflikt aus einer möglichen Quelle von Veränderung in eine gesundheitlich zu vermeidende Störung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D7","text":"Die behauptete Allwissenheit der letzten Menschen verbindet retrospektives Wissen mit dem Verlust einer offenen Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A3","CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D8","text":"Die Menge vertauscht das verworfene Endstadium mit dem angekündigten Ziel und macht den Übermenschen zum Tauschpreis für die Verwandlung in letzte Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A1","CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD1","text":"Der letzte Mensch ist kein bloßer Charakter, sondern ein sich selbst erhaltendes soziales System aus Komfort, Gleichmachung, Gesundheitsnorm und Konfliktneutralisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:D4","CH_97E9_5500:D5","CH_97E9_5500:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD2","text":"Die Formel vom erfundenen Glück bezeichnet die systemische Umbenennung von Selbstbegrenzung in Erfüllung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD3","text":"Die lange Dauer und die allgemeine Begehrbarkeit des letzten Menschen machen seine Ordnung reproduktionsfähig, ohne dass sie eine äußere Herrschaft benötigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A9","CH_97E9_5500:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD4","text":"Die Bedingungen, die das Leben schützen, beseitigen zugleich jene Spannung, aus der Schöpfung und Selbstüberschreitung hervorgehen könnten.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D2","CH_97E9_5500:D4","CH_97E9_5500:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD5","text":"Das Scheitern der Rede ist kein äußerer Zufall, sondern die praktische Demonstration eines sozialen Typs, dessen Bildung seine Rezeptivität verschließt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A12","CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass menschliche Vervollkommnung durch dauerhafte Selbstberuhigung erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Bildung als Besitz von Wissen bereits eine höhere Form des Hörens bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Abschaffung von Verletzlichkeit einen neutralen oder eindeutigen Fortschritt darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Gleichheit ohne Normierung und Ausschluss der Abweichung bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Verlängerung des Lebens seinen Wert oder seine Höhe beweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Versöhnung notwendig eine Auflösung des Konflikts in höherer Gestalt bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX7","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass der Mensch ein bereits verfügbares Endprodukt seiner eigenen Geschichte ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der der Mensch sich selbst als ausreichenden Endzweck anerkennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass zukünftige Menschen noch ein Maß über der gegenwärtigen Selbsterhaltung hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein gemeinsames Ohr, in dem prophetische Rede und soziale Bereitschaft zur Überschreitung zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine nicht pathologisierte Differenz, die weder Herrschaft noch Herdengleichheit voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine offene Zeitlichkeit; an ihre Stelle tritt endlose Dauer ohne Aufstieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein innerer Maßstab, durch den eine saturierte Ordnung sich selbst noch als niedrig erkennen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS1","text":"Übergangsthese: Der Mensch muss ein Ziel über sich hinaus setzen und seine höchste Hoffnung gegenwärtig anlegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS2","text":"Zeitliche Gefährdung: Die gegenwärtige Fruchtbarkeit kann in Armut, Zahmheit und fehlende Höhe umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS3","text":"Produktionsbedingung: Inneres Chaos erzeugt die Spannung, aus der ein höherer Stern hervorgehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS4","text":"Negationskonstruktion: Die Beseitigung von Härte, Risiko, Konflikt, Hierarchie und Differenz erzeugt den Typus des letzten Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS5","text":"Selbststabilisierung: Der Typus benennt seine Einschränkung als Glück, reproduziert sie durch Gleichheit und verlängert sie durch Sicherheits- und Gesundheitsnormen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS6","text":"Rezeptionsumkehr: Die Menge liest die Warnung als Wunschformel, macht den letzten Menschen zum Ziel und bestätigt dadurch die Unmöglichkeit ihrer eigenen Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AF1","text":"Gebildeter Stolz und fehlendes Verständnis → Ansprache über Verachtung → Setzung menschlicher Selbstüberschreitung → Verlust von Chaos und Sehnsucht → Konstruktion des letzten Menschen → Verwechslung von Warnung und Verheißung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AF2","text":"Vorführung des letzten Menschen → Jubel der Menge → Forderung nach seiner eigenen Verwandlung → Austausch des Übermenschen gegen die Endgestalt → Trauer des Sprechers über ein Publikum ohne hörfähiges Ohr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME1","text":"Der Mensch wird von einer festen Identität zu einer gefährdeten Übergangsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME2","text":"Bildung wird von sozialer Auszeichnung in ein mögliches Hindernis des Verstehens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME3","text":"Glück wird von Erfüllung in die Verwaltung von Wärme, Gesundheit, Sicherheit und angenehmer Begrenzung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME4","text":"Gleichheit wird nicht als bloße Aufhebung von Herrschaft, sondern als Mechanismus der Abweichungsunterdrückung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME5","text":"Krankheit, Risiko, Streit und Härte werden von bloßen Übeln zu ausgeschlossenen Bedingungen schöpferischer Steigerung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME6","text":"Das Missverständnis der Menge wird vom individuellen Hörfehler zur strukturellen Funktion der dargestellten Ordnung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine Rede über Bildung, Stolz, Verachtung, Glück und den letzten Menschen wird von einer Menge unterbrochen und umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Wärme, Gesundheitsnorm, ungefährliche Arbeit, Gleichheit und schnelle Versöhnung bilden einen Mechanismus sozialer Selbstberuhigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Sprecher verschiebt die Ansprache vom erklärenden Argument zur provozierenden Grenzfigur, um eine verschlossene Hörfähigkeit sichtbar zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Der Mensch erscheint als Übergangswesen zwischen schöpferischer Selbstüberschreitung und einer dauerhaft reproduzierbaren Endform ohne höhere Zeitlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von menschlicher Selbstüberschreitung über die Bedingung des Chaos zur Konstruktion des letzten Menschen zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT2","text":"Die Ableitungen rekonstruieren die Umwandlung von Glück, Bildung, Gleichheit und Gesundheit in Instrumente der Stillstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der genaue historische oder kausale Übergang von der gegenwärtigen Fruchtbarkeit zur zukünftigen Zahmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT4","text":"Eine interne Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass die Rede ein Publikum zur Überschreitung ansprechen muss, dessen Hörfähigkeit sie zugleich als blockiert darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass die Ablehnung von Herrschaft in eine normierte Herdenordnung übergeht, ohne ihren Zwang vollständig zu erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Kopplung von innerer Produktionsbedingung und sozialer Negationsform: Chaos erzeugt Höhe, seine Beseitigung erzeugt Verkleinerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an bildhaften Grenzbegriffen wie Stern, Pfeil, Boden, Wärme und Ohr, deren funktionale Beziehungen präziser sind als ihre begriffliche Ausarbeitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: fehlendes Verständnis → strategische Provokation → anthropologische Alternative → soziale Endform → performative Bestätigung des Missverständnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191858189761Z_0858f1e6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5.","source_sha256":"72204f305abe693cb73f2e16a1d7de92b261ebbbb3ff135cce234c010d0fbb0c","sha256":"1b420bbfa312d32e0d6668d369b0938643e2a98129124be4b160ba0e200d725c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:18:58.192065+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS1","text":"The discourse begins from the problem that an educated crowd hears the speaker without understanding him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS2","text":"Zarathustra directs his address concerning the pride of education toward the most contemptible thing and diagnoses in it the last man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS3","text":"The human being must set a goal beyond himself and plant the seed of highest hope in his still fertile present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS4","text":"The possibility of higher creation depends on the preservation of inner chaos and excessive longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS5","text":"The last man denotes the future immobilization of this movement through warmth, security, equality, health, and diminutive management of needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AS6","text":"The crowd mistakes the warning for an offer, desires the last man, and thereby confirms the diagnosed incapacity for hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A1","text":"The human being must set a goal beyond himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A2","text":"Highest hope arises only when its seed is planted in the present human earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A3","text":"The present human earth can become poor and tame in the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A4","text":"Longing directed beyond the human being requires inner tension and chaos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A5","text":"Creative production is designated by the birth of a higher star.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A6","text":"The last man can no longer despise himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A7","text":"The last man organizes his happiness through warmth, security, health, and pleasant satisfaction of needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A8","text":"Work remains, but is limited to harmless entertainment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A9","text":"Rule, obedience, and social rank are regarded as too burdensome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A10","text":"Deviation is treated as illness, while equality becomes obligatory commonality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A11","text":"Lasting dispute is neutralized through swift reconciliation in favor of physical and social intactness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A12","text":"For the crowd, education functions as pride of distinction, not necessarily as a capacity for understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:A13","text":"The crowd can receive a warning against the last man as a promise of the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX1","text":"Education guarantees neither hearing nor understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX2","text":"The human being is not destined as a final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX3","text":"Human longing must not end in self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX4","text":"The last man possesses no directed longing beyond the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX5","text":"For the last man, love, creation, and star are not open questions of a higher movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX6","text":"Hardness, illness, mistrust, and risk are excluded from the permissible form of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX7","text":"Poverty, wealth, rule, and obedience are eliminated as unbearable opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX8","text":"Lasting conflict and enduring difference must not persist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX9","text":"Self-contempt as a measure of the lowly is withdrawn from the last man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:NX10","text":"The Übermensch must not become identical with the last man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D1","text":"If the human being must set his goal beyond himself and his present earth can become impoverished, then his future is not secured as a linear ascent.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A1","CH_97E9_5500:A2","CH_97E9_5500:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D2","text":"If chaos is the condition of creative production, its elimination means the loss of the possibility of a higher goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A4","CH_97E9_5500:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D3","text":"The happiness of the last man consists not in heightened fulfillment, but in the avoidance of all injurious or overwhelming conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D4","text":"Warmth, harmless work, veneration of health, and pleasant dying together form a system of controlled satisfaction of needs.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D5","text":"The rejection of rule and obedience produces not an open multiplicity, but a normalized equality in which feeling differently is pathologized.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A9","CH_97E9_5500:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D6","text":"Swift reconciliation transforms conflict from a possible source of change into a disturbance to be avoided for reasons of health.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D7","text":"The alleged omniscience of the last men combines retrospective knowledge with the loss of an open future.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A3","CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:D8","text":"The crowd exchanges the rejected final stage for the announced goal and makes the Übermensch the price of exchange for transformation into last men.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A1","CH_97E9_5500:A6","CH_97E9_5500:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD1","text":"The last man is not a mere character, but a self-preserving social system of comfort, equalization, health norm, and conflict neutralization.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:D4","CH_97E9_5500:D5","CH_97E9_5500:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD2","text":"The formula of invented happiness designates the systemic renaming of self-limitation as fulfillment.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD3","text":"The long duration and general desirability of the last man render his order capable of reproduction without requiring external rule.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:A9","CH_97E9_5500:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD4","text":"The conditions that protect life simultaneously eliminate that tension from which creation and self-overcoming could emerge.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D2","CH_97E9_5500:D4","CH_97E9_5500:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SD5","text":"The failure of the discourse is no external accident, but the practical demonstration of a social type whose education closes off its receptivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A12","CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX1","text":"The system excludes that human perfection can be attained through lasting self-calming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX2","text":"The system excludes that education as possession of knowledge already constitutes a higher form of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX3","text":"The system excludes that the abolition of vulnerability constitutes neutral or unambiguous progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX4","text":"The system excludes that equality can exist without normalization and exclusion of deviation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX5","text":"The system excludes that the prolongation of life proves its value or its height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX6","text":"The system excludes that reconciliation necessarily means a resolution of conflict in higher form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:DNX7","text":"The system excludes that the human being is an already available final product of his own history.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which the human being acknowledges himself as an adequate final end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that future human beings may still produce a measure beyond present self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a common ear in which prophetic discourse and social readiness for self-overcoming coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a non-pathologized difference that presupposes neither rule nor herd equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX5","text":"Excluded is an open temporality; in its place comes endless duration without ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:SNX6","text":"Excluded is an inner measure through which a satiated order could still recognize itself as lowly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS1","text":"Transition thesis: The human being must set a goal beyond himself and presently cultivate his highest hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS2","text":"Temporal endangerment: Present fertility can turn into poverty, tameness, and lack of height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS3","text":"Condition of production: Inner chaos generates the tension from which a higher star can emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS4","text":"Construction of negation: The elimination of hardness, risk, conflict, hierarchy, and difference produces the type of the last man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS5","text":"Self-stabilization: The type names its limitation happiness, reproduces it through equality, and prolongs it through norms of security and health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:FGS6","text":"Reversal of reception: The crowd reads the warning as a wish-formula, makes the last man its goal, and thereby confirms the impossibility of its own self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AF1","text":"Educated pride and lack of understanding → address concerning contempt → positing of human self-overcoming → loss of chaos and longing → construction of the last man → confusion of warning and promise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:AF2","text":"Presentation of the last man → jubilation of the crowd → demand for its own transformation → exchange of the Übermensch for the final form → the speaker's grief over an audience without an ear capable of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME1","text":"The human being is remapped from a fixed identity into an endangered transitional form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME2","text":"Education is reclassified from social distinction into a possible obstacle to understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME3","text":"Happiness is remapped from fulfillment into the management of warmth, health, security, and pleasant limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME4","text":"Equality becomes visible not as the mere abolition of rule, but as a mechanism for suppressing deviation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME5","text":"Illness, risk, dispute, and hardness are reclassified from mere evils into excluded conditions of creative enhancement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ME6","text":"The crowd's misunderstanding is remapped from an individual error of hearing into a structural function of the order portrayed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A discourse about education, pride, contempt, happiness, and the last man is interrupted and reinterpreted by a crowd.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Warmth, the health norm, harmless work, equality, and swift reconciliation form a mechanism of social self-calming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The speaker shifts the address from explanatory argument to a provocative limit-figure in order to make a closed capacity for hearing visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The human being appears as a transitional being between creative self-overcoming and a durably reproducible final form without higher temporality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to generate the movement from human self-overcoming, through the condition of chaos, to the construction of the last man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT2","text":"The derivations reconstruct the transformation of happiness, education, equality, and health into instruments of immobilization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is the precise historical or causal transition from present fertility to future tameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT4","text":"One internal fault line lies in the fact that the discourse must address an audience toward self-overcoming whose capacity for hearing it simultaneously presents as blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT5","text":"A second fault line lies in the fact that the rejection of rule passes into a normalized herd order without fully explaining its coercion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT6","text":"The strongest point of the system is the coupling of inner condition of production and social form of negation: chaos produces height; its elimination produces diminishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on figurative limit-concepts such as star, arrow, ground, warmth, and ear, whose functional relations are more precise than their conceptual elaboration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5500:MRT8","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved: lack of understanding → strategic provocation → anthropological alternative → social final form → performative confirmation of misunderstanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5500:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_5500@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_5500:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 5","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","5."],"original_title":"5."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 5","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","5."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 05","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 5","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 5"},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 6","order":6,"parents":["RAW_97E9_6600"],"revision":"CH_97E9_6600@R001","sha256":"1f7d6e020c823a78fbf6ea26fc541a5eb78e7e1eab9a15d75cab239a27cff6f6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS1","text":"Eine öffentliche Darbietung wird durch die Verfolgung und den Sprung eines Konkurrenten in eine tödliche Katastrophe überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS2","text":"Die Katastrophe entlarvt die vermeintliche Konkurrenz als existenzielle Gefährdung des Ausführenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS3","text":"Der Sterbende deutet seinen Untergang zunächst als Wirkung von Teufel und Hölle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS4","text":"Zarathustra ersetzt diese transzendente Deutung durch die Leugnung von Teufel und Hölle und verschiebt den Tod auf eine leiblich-seelische Ebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS5","text":"Der Beruf des Seiltänzers wird trotz seiner gewaltsamen Bedingungen als nicht verachtenswerte Selbstbestimmung anerkannt, während sein Vollzug tödlich endet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS6","text":"Die abschließende Handbewegung verwandelt die asymmetrische Begegnung in eine minimale Form von Dank und menschlicher Anerkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A1","text":"Die öffentliche Darbietung beruht auf riskanter körperlicher Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A2","text":"Konkurrenz kann die Darbietung in eine unmittelbare tödliche Bedrohung verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A3","text":"Der Konkurrent behandelt den Seiltänzer als Hindernis, minderwertige Gestalt und unrechtmäßigen Nutzer des freien Weges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A4","text":"Der Sprung über den Seiltänzer zerstört dessen Gleichgewicht und führt zu seinem Absturz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A5","text":"Das Publikum reagiert auf die Katastrophe mit kollektiver Auflösung und Flucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A6","text":"Der Sterbende erklärt sein Unglück zunächst durch eine dämonisch-eschatologische Kausalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A7","text":"Zarathustra weist die Existenz von Teufel und Hölle zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A8","text":"Der Tod des Seiltänzers betrifft nach Zarathustra zuerst die Seele und danach den Leib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A9","text":"Der Seiltänzer versteht sich als durch Schläge und knappe Nahrung dressiertes, beinahe tierisches Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A10","text":"Der Seiltänzer hat die Gefahr zu seinem Beruf gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A11","text":"Die Wahl eines gefährlichen Berufs besitzt einen nicht verachtenswerten Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A12","text":"Der Beruf kann zugleich identitätsstiftend und tödlich sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A13","text":"Zarathustra übernimmt gegenüber dem Sterbenden eine begrenzte fürsorgliche Verpflichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A14","text":"Der Sterbende kann seine Anerkennung nur noch durch eine minimale körperliche Geste ausdrücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX1","text":"Der Absturz wird nicht durch einen Teufel verursacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX2","text":"Eine Hölle als nachträglicher Aufenthaltsort des Sterbenden existiert nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX3","text":"Die Katastrophe wird nicht durch eine transzendente Bestrafungsordnung erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX4","text":"Der Seiltänzer ist nicht bloß eine verachtenswerte oder lächerliche Figur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX5","text":"Der gefährliche Beruf ist nicht als wertlos zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX6","text":"Der Sterbende ist nicht durch die Rettung aus der Gefahr zu bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX7","text":"Die öffentliche Menge bildet in der Katastrophe keine schützende Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX8","text":"Zarathustra ersetzt Trost nicht durch die Zusicherung eines jenseitigen Weiterlebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D1","text":"Die unmittelbare Ursache des Absturzes liegt in der aggressiven Konkurrenz und nicht in einer metaphysischen Macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A2","CH_97E9_6600:A3","CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D2","text":"Die öffentliche Ordnung erweist sich im Moment der Gefahr als nicht tragfähig.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D3","text":"Der Seiltänzer deutet seine Lage zunächst innerhalb eines religiösen Schuld- und Strafschemas.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D4","text":"Zarathustra verschiebt die Erklärung des Untergangs von transzendenter Verursachung zu endlicher körperlicher und seelischer Sterblichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_6600:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D5","text":"Die Beschreibung des Seiltänzers als dressiertes Tier macht sichtbar, dass seine Berufswahl unter Bedingungen von Zwang, Disziplinierung und Bedürftigkeit steht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A9","CH_97E9_6600:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D6","text":"Die Anerkennung des Berufs verhindert, dass sein tödlicher Ausgang als bloße persönliche Nichtigkeit gelesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D7","text":"Fürsorge erscheint nicht als Rettung, sondern als Begleitung, Bestattung und Anerkennung des bereits eingetretenen Untergangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D8","text":"Die letzte Handbewegung stellt eine minimale soziale Beziehung dort her, wo Sprache und öffentliche Ordnung versagen.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD1","text":"Die Gefährdung entsteht aus dem Zusammenwirken von Selbstüberschreitung, öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit und konkurrierender Ausschließung.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A1","CH_97E9_6600:A2","CH_97E9_6600:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD2","text":"Die Entmythologisierung der Katastrophe beseitigt nicht den Schrecken, sondern legt seine soziale und körperliche Kausalität frei.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A6","CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_6600:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD3","text":"Der Wert einer Existenz wird vom Erfolg ihrer Leistung getrennt: Der Beruf bleibt anerkennbar, obwohl sein Vollzug scheitert.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A10","CH_97E9_6600:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD4","text":"Menschliche Anerkennung wird auf eine postkatastrophische Minimalform reduziert, die weder Rettung noch Versöhnung voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A8","CH_97E9_6600:A13","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD5","text":"Die öffentliche Menge fungiert als flüchtige Zuschauerordnung, während die eigentliche Beziehung erst zwischen dem Sterbenden und dem bei ihm verbleibenden Zarathustra entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A13","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX1","text":"Der Tod darf nicht als abschließende Bestätigung einer transzendenten moralischen Ordnung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX2","text":"Die Katastrophe darf nicht als individuelles Versagen isoliert werden; sie ist in eine aggressive Konkurrenzordnung eingebettet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX3","text":"Anerkennung darf nicht an Rettung, Erfolg oder gesellschaftliche Nützlichkeit gebunden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX4","text":"Der Beruf darf nicht vollständig auf Dressur, Zwang und Lächerlichkeit reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX5","text":"Die Abschaffung metaphysischer Tröstungen beseitigt weder Sterblichkeit noch Bedürfnis nach Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX6","text":"Fürsorge darf nicht mit der Wiederherstellung des zerstörten Subjekts verwechselt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX1","text":"Eine gerechte oder schützende Weltordnung bleibt als verfügbare Erklärung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX2","text":"Eine Rettung, die den Beruf, den Körper oder die soziale Stellung des Seiltänzers nachträglich wiederherstellt, bleibt unmöglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX3","text":"Der Tod lässt sich nicht in eine abgeschlossene Sinnordnung überführen; er bleibt als körperlicher Zusammenbruch und relationale Resthandlung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer solidarischen Gemeinschaft der Zuschauer bleibt im entscheidenden Moment unzugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS1","text":"Riskante Selbstüberschreitung + öffentliche Konkurrenz → Ausschließungsaggression → Gleichgewichtsverlust → körperlicher Absturz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS2","text":"Körperliche Katastrophe → religiöse Fehlkausalität des Sterbenden → metaphysische Negation durch Zarathustra → endliche Sterblichkeitsdiagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS3","text":"Dressur- und Bedürftigkeitsgeschichte + selbstgewählter Gefahrenberuf → Spannung zwischen Zwangsformung und Berufswert → Zurückweisung der Verachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS4","text":"Scheitern des Berufs → Verlust von Sprache und sozialer Ordnung → fürsorgliche Präsenz → Bestattung statt Rettung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS5","text":"Fortbestehendes Bewusstsein + minimale Handbewegung → Anerkennung ohne Versprechen, Heilung oder Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF1","text":"Öffentliche Hochrisikoleistung → aggressive Konkurrenz → Absturz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF2","text":"Absturz → Zerfall der Menge → isolierter Sterbender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF3","text":"Isolierter Sterbender → dämonische Deutung → Zurückweisung von Teufel und Hölle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF4","text":"Metaphysische Zurückweisung → Diagnose von seelischer und körperlicher Endlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF5","text":"Diagnose der Endlichkeit → Anerkennung des gefährlichen Berufs trotz tödlichen Ausgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF6","text":"Anerkennung → Bestattung und minimale Dankesgeste ohne transzendente Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME1","text":"Die Ursache der Katastrophe wird von der religiösen Deutung auf Konkurrenz, Körper und Situation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Berufswert und tödlichem Scheitern wird aufgehoben; beides kann gleichzeitig gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME3","text":"Der Seiltänzer wird von einer verachteten Randfigur zu einem anerkennbaren, jedoch verletzlichen Berufssubjekt neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME4","text":"Das Publikum wird von einer scheinbaren Gemeinschaft zu einer flüchtigen Masse ohne tragende Solidarität umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME5","text":"Fürsorge wird von Rettung auf Beistand, Bestattung und Anerkennung des Unwiderruflichen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME6","text":"Der letzte körperliche Impuls erhält gegenüber dem gescheiterten öffentlichen Spektakel die Funktion der kleinsten sozialen Verbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Seiltänzer stürzt nach dem Sprung eines konkurrierenden Possenreißers ab und stirbt neben Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT2","text":"Structural — Konkurrenz, öffentliche Sichtbarkeit und körperliche Disziplinierung erzeugen eine Ordnung, in der Leistung durch Ausschließung in Zerstörung umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Deutung des Ereignisses wird von religiöser Schuld- und Höllenlogik auf endliche Kausalität, Berufsanerkennung und nachträgliche Fürsorge umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Tod wird als Vorrang des seelischen vor dem leiblichen Erlöschen bestimmt, ohne jenseitige Fortexistenz; Anerkennung bleibt nur noch als gegenwärtige Restbeziehung möglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von öffentlicher Darbietung zu Konkurrenz, Absturz und Sterbebegleitung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT2","text":"Die metaphysikkritische Wendung ist durch die Leugnung von Teufel und Hölle sowie die Bestimmung der Sterblichkeit hinreichend erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Aussage über das frühere Erlöschen der Seele ontologisch oder als rhetorische Entleerung des Jenseits gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT4","text":"Die Spannung zwischen Dressur durch Gewalt und Anerkennung des gewählten Berufs bleibt ungelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT5","text":"Ebenso ungelöst bleibt, ob die Fürsorge eine neue Gemeinschaft eröffnet oder nur die Isolation des Sterbenden verwaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von Spektakel über Katastrophe und Entmythologisierung zu Anerkennung ohne Rettung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192040249844Z_3c8a5592","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"6.","source_sha256":"1f7d6e020c823a78fbf6ea26fc541a5eb78e7e1eab9a15d75cab239a27cff6f6","sha256":"33532e5fee4f37b4cbc1c68eeb2ead715a2f5a0aa582b4a5970f65e0a49eba32","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:20:40.253712+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS1","text":"A public performance is transformed into a fatal catastrophe by the pursuit and leap of a competitor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS2","text":"The catastrophe exposes the supposed competition as an existential threat to the performer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS3","text":"The dying man initially interprets his downfall as the work of the devil and hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS4","text":"Zarathustra replaces this transcendent interpretation with the denial of devil and hell and shifts death to a bodily-soulful level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS5","text":"The rope-dancer's profession is acknowledged as self-determination not worthy of contempt despite its violent conditions, while its practice ends fatally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AS6","text":"The concluding hand movement transforms the asymmetrical encounter into a minimal form of gratitude and human recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A1","text":"The public performance rests upon risky bodily self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A2","text":"Competition can transform the performance into an immediate mortal threat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A3","text":"The competitor treats the rope-dancer as an obstacle, an inferior figure, and an illegitimate user of the free path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A4","text":"The leap over the rope-dancer destroys his balance and leads to his fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A5","text":"The audience reacts to the catastrophe with collective dispersal and flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A6","text":"The dying man initially explains his misfortune through a demonic-eschatological causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A7","text":"Zarathustra rejects the existence of devil and hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A8","text":"According to Zarathustra, the death of the rope-dancer affects the soul first and then the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A9","text":"The rope-dancer understands himself as an almost animal-like being trained by blows and scant food.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A10","text":"The rope-dancer has made danger his profession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A11","text":"The choice of a dangerous profession possesses a value not worthy of contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A12","text":"The profession can be both identity-forming and fatal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A13","text":"Zarathustra assumes a limited obligation of care toward the dying man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:A14","text":"The dying man can express his recognition only through a minimal bodily gesture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX1","text":"The fall is not caused by a devil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX2","text":"A hell as the dying man's subsequent place of abode does not exist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX3","text":"The catastrophe is not explained by a transcendent order of punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX4","text":"The rope-dancer is not merely a contemptible or ridiculous figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX5","text":"The dangerous profession is not to be treated as worthless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX6","text":"The dying man is not to be preserved through rescue from danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX7","text":"In the catastrophe, the public crowd does not constitute a protective community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:NX8","text":"Zarathustra does not replace consolation with the assurance of an otherworldly continued existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D1","text":"The immediate cause of the fall lies in aggressive competition and not in a metaphysical power.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A2","CH_97E9_6600:A3","CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D2","text":"At the moment of danger, the public order proves unsustainable.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D3","text":"The rope-dancer initially interprets his situation within a religious schema of guilt and punishment.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D4","text":"Zarathustra shifts the explanation of downfall from transcendent causation to finite bodily and soulful mortality.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_6600:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D5","text":"The description of the rope-dancer as a trained animal makes visible that his professional choice stands under conditions of coercion, disciplining, and need.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A9","CH_97E9_6600:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D6","text":"Recognition of the profession prevents its fatal outcome from being read as mere personal nullity.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D7","text":"Care appears not as rescue, but as accompaniment, burial, and recognition of the downfall that has already occurred.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:D8","text":"The final hand movement establishes a minimal social relation where language and public order fail.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD1","text":"Endangerment arises from the interaction of self-transcendence, public visibility, and competitive exclusion.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A1","CH_97E9_6600:A2","CH_97E9_6600:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD2","text":"The demythologization of the catastrophe does not eliminate horror, but discloses its social and bodily causality.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:A6","CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_6600:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD3","text":"The value of an existence is separated from the success of its performance: the profession remains worthy of recognition although its practice fails.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A10","CH_97E9_6600:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD4","text":"Human recognition is reduced to a post-catastrophic minimal form that presupposes neither rescue nor reconciliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A8","CH_97E9_6600:A13","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SD5","text":"The public crowd functions as a fleeting spectator order, while the actual relation arises only between the dying man and Zarathustra, who remains with him.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A5","CH_97E9_6600:A13","CH_97E9_6600:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX1","text":"Death must not count as the final confirmation of a transcendent moral order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX2","text":"The catastrophe must not be isolated as individual failure; it is embedded in an aggressive order of competition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX3","text":"Recognition must not be bound to rescue, success, or social usefulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX4","text":"The profession must not be reduced entirely to training, coercion, and ridiculousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX5","text":"The abolition of metaphysical consolations eliminates neither mortality nor the need for relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:DNX6","text":"Care must not be confused with the restoration of the destroyed subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX1","text":"A just or protective world order remains excluded as an available explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX2","text":"A rescue that subsequently restores the rope-dancer's profession, body, or social position remains impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX3","text":"Death cannot be translated into a closed order of meaning; it remains as bodily collapse and residual relational action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a solidaristic community of spectators remains inaccessible at the decisive moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS1","text":"Risky self-transcendence + public competition → exclusionary aggression → loss of balance → bodily fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS2","text":"Bodily catastrophe → the dying man's religious false causality → metaphysical negation by Zarathustra → diagnosis of finite mortality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS3","text":"History of training and need + self-chosen dangerous profession → tension between coercive formation and professional value → rejection of contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS4","text":"Failure of the profession → loss of language and social order → caring presence → burial instead of rescue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:FGS5","text":"Persisting consciousness + minimal hand movement → recognition without promise, healing, or afterlife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF1","text":"Public high-risk performance → aggressive competition → fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF2","text":"Fall → disintegration of the crowd → isolated dying man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF3","text":"Isolated dying man → demonic interpretation → rejection of devil and hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF4","text":"Metaphysical rejection → diagnosis of soulful and bodily finitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF5","text":"Diagnosis of finitude → recognition of the dangerous profession despite fatal outcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:AF6","text":"Recognition → burial and minimal gesture of thanks without transcendent closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME1","text":"The cause of the catastrophe is remapped from religious interpretation onto competition, body, and situation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME2","text":"The opposition between professional value and fatal failure is aufgehoben; both can apply simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME3","text":"The rope-dancer is reclassified from a despised marginal figure into a recognizable yet vulnerable professional subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME4","text":"The audience is remapped from an apparent community into a fleeting mass without sustaining solidarity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME5","text":"Care is shifted from rescue to assistance, burial, and recognition of the irrevocable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ME6","text":"In contrast to the failed public spectacle, the final bodily impulse assumes the function of the smallest social connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT1","text":"Surface — A rope-dancer falls after the leap of a competing jester and dies beside Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT2","text":"Structural — Competition, public visibility, and bodily disciplining generate an order in which performance can turn into destruction through exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The interpretation of the event is shifted from religious logic of guilt and hell to finite causality, recognition of profession, and subsequent care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Death is determined as the priority of the soulful over the bodily extinction, without otherworldly continued existence; recognition remains possible only as a present residual relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from public performance to competition, fall, and accompaniment in dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT2","text":"The metaphysics-critical turn is sufficiently captured through the denial of devil and hell and the determination of mortality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the statement concerning the soul's earlier extinction is meant ontologically or as a rhetorical emptying of the afterlife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT4","text":"The tension between training through violence and recognition of the chosen profession remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT5","text":"Likewise unresolved is whether care opens a new community or merely administers the dying man's isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6600:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from spectacle through catastrophe and demythologization to recognition without rescue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6600:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_6600@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_6600:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 6","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","6."],"original_title":"6."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 6","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","6."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 06","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 6","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 6"},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 7","order":7,"parents":["RAW_97E9_7700"],"revision":"CH_97E9_7700@R001","sha256":"e16574937e685dc9e2fa2d0fe02e6098ac1225790ede4ed0fc73166da6fd0425","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS1","text":"Das gescheiterte öffentliche Ereignis wird als Übergang von menschlicher Neugier und Schrecken in Ermüdung und Dunkelheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS2","text":"Der vermeintliche Fang erweist sich als kein gewonnener Mensch, sondern als geborgener Leichnam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS3","text":"Aus dieser Konstellation wird die Unheimlichkeit und Sinnlosigkeit des menschlichen Daseins diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS4","text":"Die Sinnlosigkeit erscheint als strukturell prekär, weil ein Possenreißer für das menschliche Dasein verhängnisvoll werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS5","text":"Zarathustra setzt dem die Lehre vom Übermenschen als zukünftigem Sinn des menschlichen Seins entgegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS6","text":"Die Lehre bleibt kommunikativ und anthropologisch vermittelt, weil Zarathustra den Menschen noch fern und selbst nur eine Mitte zwischen Narr und Leichnam ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS7","text":"Die unaufgelöste Vermittlung endet in der Übernahme des Leichnams und seiner Überführung zur Bestattung durch dunkle Nacht und Wege.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A1","text":"Menschliche Neugier und menschlicher Schrecken sind zeitlich erschöpfbare Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A2","text":"Die Auflösung des Publikums hebt die öffentliche Szene und ihre unmittelbare Wirkung auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A3","text":"Der vermeintliche Erfolg Zarathustras besteht nicht im Gewinn eines Menschen, sondern im Auffinden eines Leichnams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A4","text":"Das menschliche Dasein ist unheimlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A5","text":"Das menschliche Dasein ist weiterhin ohne Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A6","text":"Ein Possenreißer kann für das menschliche Dasein verhängnisvoll werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A7","text":"Der Übermensch ist als Sinn des menschlichen Seins gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A8","text":"Zarathustra kann den Menschen diesen Sinn lehren wollen, erreicht aber ihre Sinne noch nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A9","text":"Zarathustra befindet sich gegenüber den Menschen in einer Zwischenstellung zwischen Narr und Leichnam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A10","text":"Zarathustras Weg und die Überführung des Leichnams liegen unter dem Zeichen von Dunkelheit, Kälte und Ungewissheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A11","text":"Der Leichnam wird nicht liegen gelassen, sondern von Zarathustra getragen und begraben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX1","text":"Der Fang ist kein Fang eines Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX2","text":"Das menschliche Dasein besitzt noch keinen gegebenen oder erreichten Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX3","text":"Die öffentliche Aufmerksamkeit bildet keine dauerhafte Grundlage der Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX4","text":"Zarathustras gegenwärtige Position ist weder die des Narren noch die des Leichnams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX5","text":"Zarathustras Sinn ist den menschlichen Sinnen noch nicht unmittelbar zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX6","text":"Die Übermensch-Lehre ist noch nicht als verwirklichte Gegenwart ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX7","text":"Der Leichnam wird nicht als lebendiger Gesprächspartner eingesetzt, sondern als toter Gefährte überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D1","text":"Der öffentliche Auftritt erzeugt keine stabile menschliche Gefolgschaft, sondern endet in Vereinzelung und Tod.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A1","CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_7700:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D2","text":"Der Leichnam fungiert als sichtbarer Beleg dafür, dass die gegenwärtige menschliche Situation den angekündigten Sinn noch nicht besitzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D3","text":"Die Gefahr des Possenreißers zeigt, dass Sinnlosigkeit nicht bloß Leere, sondern eine verhängnisfähige soziale Konstellation ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D4","text":"Die Lehre vom Übermenschen ist als Antwort auf eine diagnostizierte Sinnlosigkeit formuliert, nicht als Beschreibung einer bereits bestehenden Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D5","text":"Die Distanz zwischen Zarathustras Sinn und den menschlichen Sinnen verhindert die unmittelbare Übertragung des angekündigten Sinns.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A7","CH_97E9_7700:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D6","text":"Zarathustras Zwischenstellung macht ihn zugleich zum Träger einer kommenden Lehre und zum Zeugen des gegenwärtigen Verfalls.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D7","text":"Die Bestattung wird zur vorläufigen praktischen Form des Umgangs mit einer noch nicht sinnhaft gewordenen Menschheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A10","CH_97E9_7700:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD1","text":"Der Text verschiebt die Möglichkeit von Lehre aus dem Raum öffentlicher Überzeugung in den Raum einsamer Begleitung und Bestattung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A1","CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD2","text":"Der Übermensch erscheint nicht als unmittelbare Lösung, sondern als transitorischer Sinnhorizont, der aus dem Scheitern der gegenwärtigen Menschheit hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7","CH_97E9_7700:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD3","text":"Zarathustras Autorität gründet auf einer unaufgelösten Doppelposition: Er verkündet eine kommende Sinnordnung und bleibt zugleich in der Dunkelheit der sinnlosen Gegenwart gebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A9","CH_97E9_7700:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD4","text":"Der Tod des Einzelnen wird zur Totalfigur für eine Menschheit, deren gegenwärtige Form ihren eigenen Sinn noch nicht hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A4","CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX1","text":"Sinn kann nicht als bereits vorhandene Eigenschaft der menschlichen Existenz vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX2","text":"Öffentliche Sichtbarkeit, Neugier und Schrecken können keine dauerhafte Vermittlung zwischen Zarathustra und den Menschen leisten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX3","text":"Der Mensch kann nicht zugleich als gegenwärtig erfülltes Ziel und als Übergang zum Übermenschen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX4","text":"Verkündete Bedeutung und tatsächliche Verständlichkeit fallen nicht automatisch zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX5","text":"Der Tod kann nicht durch bloße Anwesenheit in Sinn verwandelt werden; er muss zunächst getragen und begraben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX6","text":"Die Lehre verfügt noch nicht über eine gesicherte soziale Trägerschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gegenwart, in der die Menschen den Sinn ihres Seins bereits verstehen und verkörpern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine unmittelbare Gemeinschaft zwischen dem Verkünder und den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Übergang zum Übermenschen ohne Durchgang durch Zerfall, Tod und Bestattung der gegenwärtigen menschlichen Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine helle, abgeschlossene Zukunftsordnung; die Zukunft bleibt als dunkler Weg der Überführung strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS1","text":"Erschöpfung des Publikums → Aufhebung der öffentlichen Szene → Vereinzelung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS2","text":"Vermeintlicher Fang → Leichnam statt Mensch → sichtbare Negativgestalt der gegenwärtigen Menschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS3","text":"Leichnam → Diagnose von Unheimlichkeit und Sinnlosigkeit → Notwendigkeit eines noch nicht verwirklichten Sinns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS4","text":"Sinnlosigkeit plus verhängnisfähiger Possenreißer → prekäre und gefährliche Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS5","text":"Prekäre Gegenwart → Setzung des Übermenschen als Sinnhorizont → Anspruch auf Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS6","text":"Anspruch auf Lehre plus fehlende Verständlichkeit → Vermittlungsdistanz → Zarathustras Zwischenstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS7","text":"Zwischenstellung plus Dunkelheit → Übernahme und Bestattung des Leichnams → vorläufige praktische Schließung ohne Sinnverwirklichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF1","text":"Erschöpfte Öffentlichkeit → gescheiterter Menschenfang → Leichnam als Rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF2","text":"Leichnam → Diagnose des unheimlichen und sinnlosen Menschseins → Gefährlichkeit der gegenwärtigen Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF3","text":"Sinnlose Gegenwart → Setzung des Übermenschen → misslingende Mitteilung an die Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF4","text":"Misslingende Mitteilung → Zwischenstellung Zarathustras → dunkle Überführung und Bestattung des Leichnams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME1","text":"„Fischfang“ wird von einer Erfolgsmetapher der Gewinnung in eine Negativkartierung des nicht gewonnenen Menschen umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME2","text":"Der Leichnam wird vom individuellen Todesfall zur strukturellen Chiffre einer noch sinnlosen Menschheit erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME3","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Lehre und Scheitern wird durch eine Zwischenfigur ersetzt, in der Verkündigung und Verfall gleichzeitig bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME4","text":"Öffentlichkeit wird als flüchtige Vorstufe, Einsamkeit dagegen als Ort der eigentlichen Konsequenzbildung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME5","text":"Der Übermensch wird nicht als gegenwärtiges Subjekt, sondern als noch nicht zugänglicher Sinnhorizont klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME6","text":"Bestattung wird als minimale Handlung zwischen gegenwärtiger Sinnlosigkeit und zukünftiger Sinnsetzung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein nächtlicher Markt zerfällt; Zarathustra bleibt bei einem Leichnam und beschließt dessen Bestattung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die öffentliche Vermittlung scheitert an der Erschöpfbarkeit der Aufmerksamkeit und an der fehlenden Anschlussfähigkeit von Zarathustras Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Übergang zum Übermenschen wird nicht durch unmittelbare Bekehrung, sondern durch Diagnose, Distanz und vorläufige Begleitung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Der Mensch erscheint als unvollendete, sinnlose Übergangsform; der Übermensch bezeichnet eine zukünftige Sinnrichtung, deren Ankunft zeitlich offen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von öffentlichem Scheitern über Sinnlosigkeitsdiagnose und Übermensch-Setzung bis zur Bestattung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch der Übermensch positiv bestimmt wird; gegeben ist nur seine Funktion als Sinn des menschlichen Seins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, warum der Possenreißer verhängnisvoll wird; festgehalten ist nur seine strukturelle Gefährlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange der Übermensch als zukünftiger Horizont und nicht als gegenwärtig verwirklichte Gestalt verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Leichnam, Sinnlosigkeitsdiagnose und Zarathustras Zwischenstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT6","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt zwischen dem Anspruch, Sinn zu lehren, und der Feststellung, dass Zarathustras Sinn die menschlichen Sinne noch nicht erreicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Bestattung als vorläufige Handlung und nicht als Auflösung der Sinnproblematik gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192315627218Z_3b425699","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"7.","source_sha256":"e16574937e685dc9e2fa2d0fe02e6098ac1225790ede4ed0fc73166da6fd0425","sha256":"ee729754ba6047f1a4c343e49c39313c7d4db0cba4bc58f60a6edaa6a1a3498b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:23:15.630300+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS1","text":"The failed public event is determined as a transition from human curiosity and terror into fatigue and darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS2","text":"The supposed catch proves to be not a gained human being, but a recovered corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS3","text":"From this constellation, the uncanniness and meaninglessness of human existence are diagnosed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS4","text":"Meaninglessness appears as structurally precarious because a buffoon can become fatal for human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS5","text":"Zarathustra counters this with the teaching of the Overman as the future meaning of human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS6","text":"The teaching remains communicatively and anthropologically mediated because Zarathustra is still distant from human beings and himself only a middle position between fool and corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AS7","text":"The unresolved mediation ends in the taking up of the corpse and its conveyance for burial through dark night and paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A1","text":"Human curiosity and human terror are forces that can be exhausted over time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A2","text":"The dissolution of the audience abolishes the public scene and its immediate effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A3","text":"Zarathustra's supposed success does not consist in gaining a human being, but in finding a corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A4","text":"Human existence is uncanny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A5","text":"Human existence remains without meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A6","text":"A buffoon can become fatal for human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A7","text":"The Overman is posited as the meaning of human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A8","text":"Zarathustra may wish to teach human beings this meaning, but he does not yet reach their senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A9","text":"With respect to human beings, Zarathustra occupies an intermediate position between fool and corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A10","text":"Zarathustra's path and the conveyance of the corpse stand under the sign of darkness, cold, and uncertainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:A11","text":"The corpse is not left lying, but carried and buried by Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX1","text":"The catch is not the catch of a human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX2","text":"Human existence does not yet possess a given or attained meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX3","text":"Public attention does not form a lasting foundation for the teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's present position is neither that of the fool nor that of the corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX5","text":"Zarathustra's meaning is not yet immediately accessible to human senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX6","text":"The teaching of the Overman is not yet established as a realized present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:NX7","text":"The corpse is not employed as a living interlocutor, but conveyed as a dead companion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D1","text":"The public appearance produces no stable human following, but ends in isolation and death.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A1","CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_7700:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D2","text":"The corpse functions as visible evidence that the present human situation does not yet possess the proclaimed meaning.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D3","text":"The danger of the buffoon shows that meaninglessness is not merely emptiness, but a social constellation capable of becoming fatal.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D4","text":"The teaching of the Overman is formulated as a response to a diagnosed meaninglessness, not as a description of an already existing order.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D5","text":"The distance between Zarathustra's meaning and human senses prevents the immediate transmission of the proclaimed meaning.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A7","CH_97E9_7700:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D6","text":"Zarathustra's intermediate position makes him at once the bearer of a coming teaching and the witness of present decline.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:D7","text":"Burial becomes the provisional practical form of dealing with a humanity that has not yet become meaningful.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A10","CH_97E9_7700:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD1","text":"The text shifts the possibility of teaching from the space of public persuasion into the space of solitary accompaniment and burial.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A1","CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD2","text":"The Overman appears not as an immediate solution, but as a transitory horizon of meaning emerging from the failure of present humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7","CH_97E9_7700:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD3","text":"Zarathustra's authority is grounded in an unresolved double position: he proclaims a coming order of meaning and remains at the same time bound within the darkness of the meaningless present.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A8","CH_97E9_7700:A9","CH_97E9_7700:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SD4","text":"The death of the individual becomes a total figure for a humanity whose present form does not yet bring forth its own meaning.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A3","CH_97E9_7700:A4","CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX1","text":"Meaning cannot be presupposed as an already existing property of human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX2","text":"Public visibility, curiosity, and terror cannot provide lasting mediation between Zarathustra and human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX3","text":"The human being cannot be treated simultaneously as a presently fulfilled end and as a transition to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX4","text":"Proclaimed meaning and actual intelligibility do not automatically coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX5","text":"Death cannot be transformed into meaning through mere presence; it must first be carried and buried.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:DNX6","text":"The teaching does not yet possess a secured social support.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a present in which human beings already understand and embody the meaning of their being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an immediate community between the proclaimer and human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a transition to the Overman without passing through the decay, death, and burial of the present human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a bright, completed future order; the future remains structured as a dark path of conveyance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS1","text":"Exhaustion of the audience → abolition of the public scene → Zarathustra's isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS2","text":"Supposed catch → corpse instead of human being → visible negative figure of present humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS3","text":"Corpse → diagnosis of uncanniness and meaninglessness → necessity of a meaning not yet realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS4","text":"Meaninglessness plus a buffoon capable of becoming fatal → precarious and dangerous present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS5","text":"Precarious present → positing of the Overman as horizon of meaning → claim to teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS6","text":"Claim to teaching plus lack of intelligibility → mediating distance → Zarathustra's intermediate position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:FGS7","text":"Intermediate position plus darkness → taking up and burial of the corpse → provisional practical closure without realization of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF1","text":"Exhausted public sphere → failed catch of human beings → corpse as remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF2","text":"Corpse → diagnosis of uncanny and meaningless human existence → dangerousness of the present form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF3","text":"Meaningless present → positing of the Overman → unsuccessful communication to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:AF4","text":"Unsuccessful communication → Zarathustra's intermediate position → dark conveyance and burial of the corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME1","text":"“Fishing” is recoded from a success metaphor of acquisition into a negative mapping of the human being not gained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME2","text":"The corpse is expanded from an individual case of death into the structural cipher of a humanity still without meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME3","text":"The opposition between teaching and failure is replaced by an intermediate figure in which proclamation and decline coexist simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME4","text":"The public sphere is mapped as a fleeting preliminary stage, whereas solitude is mapped as the site of the actual formation of consequences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME5","text":"The Overman is classified not as a present subject, but as a horizon of meaning not yet accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ME6","text":"Burial is newly determined as a minimal action between present meaninglessness and future positing of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A nocturnal marketplace disintegrates; Zarathustra remains with a corpse and decides upon its burial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Public mediation fails because attention is exhaustible and because Zarathustra's meaning lacks capacity for connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The transition to the Overman is organized not through immediate conversion, but through diagnosis, distance, and provisional accompaniment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The human being appears as an unfinished, meaningless transitional form; the Overman designates a future direction of meaning whose arrival remains temporally open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from public failure through the diagnosis of meaninglessness and the positing of the Overman to burial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is that by which the Overman is positively determined; given is only its function as the meaning of human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is why the buffoon becomes fatal; retained is only his structural dangerousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as the Overman is understood as a future horizon and not as a presently realized figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection exists between the corpse, the diagnosis of meaninglessness, and Zarathustra's intermediate position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT6","text":"The greatest tension lies between the claim to teach meaning and the determination that Zarathustra's meaning does not yet reach human senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7700:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement provided that burial is read as a provisional action and not as a resolution of the problem of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7700:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_7700@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_7700:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 7","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","7."],"original_title":"7."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 7","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","7."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 07","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 7","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 7"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 8","order":8,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8800"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8800@R001","sha256":"4803f4e434cfcdc4c7468690b27d8d2cc7febfb29595cbe995731fd6090e9d89","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert die Fortbewegung eines Lebenden, der einen Toten durch einen feindlich codierten Stadtraum trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS2","text":"Die Fortsetzung des Weges entsteht weder durch soziale Anerkennung noch durch gesicherte Orientierung, sondern durch Tragen, Schweigen, Nahrung und vorläufigen Schutz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS3","text":"Die Argumentation ist diagnostisch und schwellenförmig: öffentliche Benennung wird zu Ausschluss, Hunger zu autonomem Zwang und Orientierung zu zeitweiligem Vertrauen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS4","text":"Der tote Gefährte fungiert zugleich als Last, Stigma, Beziehungspartner und Schutzobjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von städtischer Ausstoßung über schweigendes Weitergehen und Hunger zu erzwungener Gastaufnahme, Wegverlust, Totenschutz und Schlaf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS6","text":"Der Endzustand ist keine Ankunft oder Versöhnung, sondern körperliche Erschöpfung bei unbewegter Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A1","text":"Zarathustra trägt einen toten Hund als Gefährten auf seinem Rücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A2","text":"Die Stimmen des Stadtraums behandeln Zarathustra als Feind, Verächter und Gefahr der Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A3","text":"Der Possenreißer behauptet, Lachen und Erniedrigung hätten Zarathustra vorläufig gerettet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A4","text":"Die Totengräber behandeln das Tragen des toten Hundes als entwürdigende Totengräberarbeit und verweigern die Berührung mit dem Toten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A5","text":"Zarathustra beantwortet die öffentliche Zurückweisung nicht und setzt seinen Weg fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A6","text":"Zarathustras Hunger folgt keiner stabilen zeitlichen Ordnung und tritt unabhängig von der letzten Mahlzeit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A7","text":"Der Einsiedler bietet dem anklopfenden Besucher Brot und Wein an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A8","text":"Der Einsiedler verlangt, dass jeder Anklopfende annimmt, was ihm angeboten wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A9","text":"Zarathustra behandelt den toten Gefährten als unfähig, auf die Aufforderung zum Essen und Trinken zu reagieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A10","text":"Zarathustra vertraut während seines nächtlichen Weitergehens dem Weg und dem Licht der Sterne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A11","text":"Im tiefen Wald verschwindet bei Tagesanbruch der erkennbare Weg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A12","text":"Zarathustra legt den Toten in einen hohlen Baum, um ihn vor den Wölfen zu schützen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A13","text":"Zarathustra schläft nach dem Schutz des Toten auf dem Boden und Moos ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A14","text":"Zarathustras Körper ist müde, während seine Seele unbewegt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX1","text":"Der Stadtraum bietet Zarathustra und seinem toten Gefährten keine aufnahmefähige Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX2","text":"Die öffentliche Feindmarkierung wird nicht durch Argumentation oder Selbstverteidigung aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX3","text":"Der tote Gefährte ist kein gewöhnlicher Teilnehmer an gemeinsamer Nahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX4","text":"Hunger ist kein verlässlich berechenbarer Effekt regelmäßiger Mahlzeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX5","text":"Die Gastgabe ist kein frei verhandelbares Angebot, das der Besucher folgenlos ablehnen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX6","text":"Vertrauen in Weg und Sterne garantiert keinen bleibenden Weg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX7","text":"Der Schutz des Toten stellt dessen Lebendigkeit nicht wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX8","text":"Der Schlaf führt nicht zu einer Auflösung der Differenz zwischen körperlicher Müdigkeit und seelischer Unbewegtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D1","text":"Die städtische Feindmarkierung macht den Abzug zur praktischen Bedingung des Weiterlebens, ohne dass Zarathustra sie öffentlich widerlegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D2","text":"Die Verbindung mit dem Toten erzeugt zugleich soziale Erniedrigung und eine vorläufige Form des Überlebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D3","text":"Das Schweigen verwandelt die öffentliche Verspottung nicht in Widerlegung, sondern in ununterbrochene Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D4","text":"Nach dem sozialen Ausschluss übernimmt der Hunger die Funktion des nächsten bestimmenden Zwangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A5","CH_97E9_8800:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D5","text":"Die Gastaufnahme macht den Lebenden und den Toten zu Adressaten derselben Gabe, ohne den Toten zu gegenseitiger Teilnahme zu befähigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D6","text":"Nahrung wird nicht durch Anerkennung oder Verhandlung, sondern durch die Regel des Hauses verfügbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D7","text":"Die Orientierung im Sternenlicht bleibt vorläufig, weil das Vertrauen in den Weg dessen Fortbestand nicht sichert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D8","text":"Der Verlust des Weges verschiebt die Aufgabe vom Weitergehen auf die Bewahrung des Toten.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D9","text":"Der abschließende Schlaf erzeugt eine räumliche und körperliche Unterbrechung, aber keinen inneren Abschluss.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD1","text":"Das Überleben ist an eine Folge räumlicher Schwellen gebunden: städtischer Ausschluss, häusliche Aufnahme und waldliche Einschließung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD2","text":"Der tote Gefährte bildet eine operative Einheit mit Zarathustra, obwohl er sozial stigmatisiert, materiell schutzbedürftig und nicht zur Gegenseitigkeit fähig ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD3","text":"Die Bewegung wird wiederholt durch Krisen erzeugt: Ausstoßung beginnt sie, Hunger unterbricht sie, Gastaufnahme setzt sie fort, Wegverlust arretiert sie und Schlaf suspendiert sie.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A5","CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD4","text":"Stadt und Wildnis gefährden dieselbe Lebend-Tot-Konstellation durch unterschiedliche Mechanismen: soziale Feindmarkierung dort, Hunger und Wölfe hier.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD5","text":"Die äußere Beweglichkeit des Körpers endet in einer inneren Unbewegtheit, ohne dass eine höhere Einheit zwischen beiden hergestellt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX1","text":"Eine zivile Reintegration Zarathustras mitsamt dem Toten ist strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX2","text":"Eine reziproke Gemeinschaft zwischen Lebendem und Toten ist ausgeschlossen, obwohl beide als Gefährten gekoppelt bleiben.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX3","text":"Ein stabiler teleologischer Weg ist ausgeschlossen, weil Bewegung ohne gesicherte Richtung fortgesetzt wird und Orientierung in Weglosigkeit umschlägt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX4","text":"Der Hunger ist der souveränen zeitlichen Selbstordnung des Subjekts entzogen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX5","text":"Eine neutrale öffentliche Klassifikation des Toten ist ausgeschlossen; er erscheint ausschließlich als Stigma, Arbeit, Diebesgut, Mahlzeit oder Schutzobjekt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer Rückkehr in die Stadt unter Bedingungen sozialer Anerkennung bleibt verschlossen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX2","text":"Eine endgültige Trennung vom Toten ist nicht verfügbar: Weder kann er in der Stadt aufgenommen noch der Wildnis überlassen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX3","text":"Ankunft ist kein verfügbares Kriterium des Gelingens, weil der Weg verschwindet und der Schlaf an die Stelle des Ziels tritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX4","text":"Eine Synthese von Leben und Tod wird nicht erreicht; die Kopplung bleibt bestehen, ohne in gemeinsame Teilnahme überzugehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS1","text":"Lebender Träger plus toter Gefährte erzeugen öffentliche Sichtbarkeit und eine konflikthafte soziale Codierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS2","text":"Feindmarkierung plus Lächerlichmachung erzeugen Ausschluss, während die Erniedrigung zugleich als vorläufige Rettung behauptet wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS3","text":"Ausschluss plus Schweigen erzeugen den Übergang vom sozialen Raum in die nächtliche Wanderung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS4","text":"Wildnis plus Wölfe plus zeitlich ungebundener Hunger erzeugen den Zwang zur Unterbrechung am erleuchteten Haus.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS5","text":"Anklopfen plus Hausregel erzeugen Nahrungsaufnahme ohne entsprechende Gegenseitigkeit des toten Gefährten.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS6","text":"Nahrung erzeugt erneutes Weitergehen unter dem Sternenlicht, aber nicht die Dauer des Weges.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","text":"Wegverlust erzeugt Schutzhandlung, räumliche Einschließung und Schlaf; daraus entsteht körperliche Erschöpfung bei seelischer Unbewegtheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AF1","text":"Lebender Träger mit totem Gefährten → städtische Feindmarkierung → Erniedrigung als vorläufige Rettung → schweigender Abzug → Hunger als autonomer Zwang → verbindliche Gastaufnahme → Weitergehen im Sternenlicht → Wegverlust im Wald → Schutz des Toten → Schlaf bei unbewegter Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME1","text":"Öffentliche Gegnerschaft wird von einer möglichen Auseinandersetzung in eine räumliche Ausschlussoperation umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME2","text":"Der Leichnam wird vom bloßen toten Gegenstand zu einem sozialen Zeichen, einem Gefährten und einem Schutzobjekt umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME3","text":"Hunger wird von einem bloßen Mangelzustand zu einer eigenständigen zeitlichen Organisationsmacht umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME4","text":"Gastfreundschaft wird von freiwilliger Wohltätigkeit zu einer verbindlichen Regel der Gabeannahme umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME5","text":"Der Weg wird von einer dauerhaften Orientierung zu einem nur vorläufig verfügbaren Medium der Bewegung umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME6","text":"Leben und Tod erscheinen nicht mehr als getrennte Zustände, sondern als asymmetrisch gekoppelte Handlungseinheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT1","text":"Surface: Auf der Oberflächenebene wird die Strecke eines Lebenden mit einem Toten durch Stadt, Wildnis, Haus und Wald organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT2","text":"Structural: Auf der strukturellen Ebene erzeugen soziale Markierung, Hausregel, Hunger, Wegverlust und Wolfsgefahr die Bedingungen des Weitergehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird Schweigen als Fortsetzung der Bewegung und nicht als Niederlage im öffentlichen Streit funktionalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Auf der ontologischen und zeitlichen Ebene werden Lebendigkeit, Tod, Hunger, Nacht, Morgen, Schlaf, Körper und Seele nicht synchronisiert, sondern nebeneinander gehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die vollständige Bewegungslogik von städtischer Zurückweisung bis zum Schlaf im Wald zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die Vorgeschichte von Zarathustras Rede, die genaue Beziehung zum Toten und die ontologische Bedeutung der unbewegten Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, aber spannungsbehaftet: Der Wirt verlangt Teilnahme vom Toten, obwohl dessen Nichtteilnahme vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umwandlung desselben Toten vom öffentlichen Stigma zum privaten Schutzobjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an komprimierten Bildlogiken, insbesondere an der Kopplung von Hund, Leichnam, Teufelsbissen, Wölfen und Gefährtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT6","text":"Die extrahierte Maschine bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Endzustand als Unterbrechung ohne Versöhnung und nicht als abgeschlossene Lösung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192504971134Z_ee3a178c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"4803f4e434cfcdc4c7468690b27d8d2cc7febfb29595cbe995731fd6090e9d89","sha256":"b1806e7a09200561c564dbeac405b9205c4523e6ec6cb64faf8cd7cb182697bd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:25:04.977061+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the movement of a living being carrying a dead person through an urban space coded as hostile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS2","text":"The continuation of the journey arises neither through social recognition nor through secure orientation, but through carrying, silence, food, and provisional protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS3","text":"The argumentation is diagnostic and threshold-like: public naming becomes exclusion, hunger becomes autonomous compulsion, and orientation becomes temporary trust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS4","text":"The dead companion functions at once as burden, stigma, relational partner, and object of protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from urban expulsion through silent onward movement and hunger to compelled hospitality, loss of the way, protection of the dead, and sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AS6","text":"The final state is not arrival or reconciliation, but bodily exhaustion with an unmoved soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A1","text":"Zarathustra carries a dead dog as a companion on his back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A2","text":"The voices of the urban space treat Zarathustra as an enemy, despiser, and danger to the crowd.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A3","text":"The buffoon claims that laughter and humiliation have provisionally saved Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A4","text":"The gravediggers treat carrying the dead dog as degrading gravediggers' work and refuse contact with the dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A5","text":"Zarathustra does not answer the public rejection and continues on his way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A6","text":"Zarathustra's hunger follows no stable temporal order and occurs independently of the last meal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A7","text":"The hermit offers bread and wine to the visitor who knocks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A8","text":"The hermit demands that everyone who knocks accept what is offered to him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A9","text":"Zarathustra treats the dead companion as incapable of responding to the invitation to eat and drink.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A10","text":"During his nocturnal onward movement, Zarathustra trusts the way and the light of the stars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A11","text":"In the deep forest, the recognizable way disappears at daybreak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A12","text":"Zarathustra places the dead man in a hollow tree in order to protect him from the wolves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A13","text":"After protecting the dead man, Zarathustra falls asleep on the ground and moss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:A14","text":"Zarathustra's body is tired while his soul remains unmoved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX1","text":"The urban space offers neither Zarathustra nor his dead companion a community capable of receiving them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX2","text":"The public marking as enemy is not annulled through argumentation or self-defense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX3","text":"The dead companion is not an ordinary participant in shared food.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX4","text":"Hunger is not a reliably calculable effect of regular meals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX5","text":"The gift of hospitality is not a freely negotiable offer that the visitor can reject without consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX6","text":"Trust in the way and the stars guarantees no enduring way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX7","text":"Protecting the dead does not restore his vitality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:NX8","text":"Sleep does not lead to a dissolution of the difference between bodily fatigue and spiritual immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D1","text":"Urban marking as enemy makes departure the practical condition of continued survival, without Zarathustra publicly refuting it.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D2","text":"The connection with the dead produces both social humiliation and a provisional form of survival.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D3","text":"Silence does not transform public mockery into refutation, but into uninterrupted movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D4","text":"After social exclusion, hunger assumes the function of the next determining compulsion.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A5","CH_97E9_8800:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D5","text":"Hospitality makes the living and the dead addressees of the same gift, without enabling the dead to participate reciprocally.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D6","text":"Food becomes available not through recognition or negotiation, but through the rule of the house.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D7","text":"Orientation in starlight remains provisional because trust in the way does not secure its continuance.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D8","text":"The loss of the way shifts the task from onward movement to the preservation of the dead.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:D9","text":"The concluding sleep produces a spatial and bodily interruption, but no inner closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD1","text":"Survival is bound to a sequence of spatial thresholds: urban exclusion, domestic reception, and forest enclosure.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD2","text":"The dead companion forms an operative unity with Zarathustra, although he is socially stigmatized, materially in need of protection, and incapable of reciprocity.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD3","text":"Movement is repeatedly produced by crises: expulsion begins it, hunger interrupts it, hospitality continues it, loss of the way arrests it, and sleep suspends it.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A5","CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD4","text":"City and wilderness endanger the same living-dead constellation through different mechanisms: social marking as enemy there, hunger and wolves here.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SD5","text":"The body's external mobility ends in an inner immobility, without a higher unity between the two being established.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX1","text":"A civic reintegration of Zarathustra together with the dead is structurally excluded.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX2","text":"A reciprocal community between the living and the dead is excluded, although both remain coupled as companions.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX3","text":"A stable teleological way is excluded because movement continues without a secure direction and orientation turns into pathlessness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX4","text":"Hunger is withdrawn from the subject's sovereign temporal self-ordering.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:DNX5","text":"A neutral public classification of the dead is excluded; he appears exclusively as stigma, labor, stolen goods, meal, or object of protection.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a return to the city under conditions of social recognition remains closed.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX2","text":"A definitive separation from the dead is unavailable: he can neither be received into the city nor abandoned to the wilderness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX3","text":"Arrival is not an available criterion of success, because the way disappears and sleep takes the place of the goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:SNX4","text":"A synthesis of life and death is not achieved; the coupling persists without passing into shared participation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS1","text":"Living bearer plus dead companion produce public visibility and a conflictual social coding.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS2","text":"Marking as enemy plus ridicule produce exclusion, while humiliation is simultaneously asserted as provisional salvation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS3","text":"Exclusion plus silence produce the transition from social space into nocturnal wandering.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS4","text":"Wilderness plus wolves plus temporally unbound hunger produce the compulsion to interrupt at the illuminated house.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS5","text":"Knocking plus house rule produce food intake without corresponding reciprocity on the part of the dead companion.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8","CH_97E9_8800:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS6","text":"Food produces renewed onward movement under starlight, but not the duration of the way.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","text":"Loss of the way produces an act of protection, spatial enclosure, and sleep; from this arises bodily exhaustion with spiritual immobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:A13","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:AF1","text":"Living bearer with dead companion → urban marking as enemy → humiliation as provisional salvation → silent departure → hunger as autonomous compulsion → binding hospitality → onward movement in starlight → loss of the way in the forest → protection of the dead → sleep with an unmoved soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME1","text":"Public enmity is remapped from a possible confrontation into a spatial operation of exclusion.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME2","text":"The corpse is reclassified from a merely dead object into a social sign, a companion, and an object of protection.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A3","CH_97E9_8800:A4","CH_97E9_8800:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME3","text":"Hunger is remapped from a mere state of deficiency into an autonomous temporal organizing power.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME4","text":"Hospitality is reclassified from voluntary beneficence into a binding rule of gift acceptance.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A7","CH_97E9_8800:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME5","text":"The way is remapped from a lasting orientation into a medium of movement available only provisionally.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A10","CH_97E9_8800:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ME6","text":"Life and death no longer appear as separate states, but as an asymmetrically coupled unit of action.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A1","CH_97E9_8800:A9","CH_97E9_8800:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT1","text":"Surface: At the surface level, the course of a living being with a dead person is organized through city, wilderness, house, and forest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT2","text":"Structural: At the structural level, social marking, house rule, hunger, loss of the way, and the danger of wolves produce the conditions of onward movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: At the metastrategic level, silence is functionalized as continuation of movement and not as defeat in public dispute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: At the ontological and temporal level, vitality, death, hunger, night, morning, sleep, body, and soul are not synchronized, but held alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the complete logic of movement from urban rejection to sleep in the forest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the prehistory of Zarathustra's speech, the precise relation to the dead, and the ontological significance of the unmoved soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent but tension-laden: the host demands participation from the dead, although his non-participation is presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the transformation of the same dead person from public stigma into a private object of protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on compressed image-logics, especially on the coupling of dog, corpse, devil's bites, wolves, and companionship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8800:MRT6","text":"The extracted machine preserves the text's actual movement, provided that the final state is read as interruption without reconciliation and not as a completed solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8800:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8800@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8800:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Prologue.","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 8","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede.","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 8","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","Zarathustra’s Prologue.","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 08","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 8","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2","layer":"CH","title":"Zarathustra’s Prologue · 8","order":9,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_2@R001","sha256":"ddecbc3c80a9c499ac420effbe72a56d73bec0d7166ce41bfeadea120df132f9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS1","text":"Eine neue Wahrheit entsteht aus dem Erwachen zur Unvereinbarkeit zwischen eigener Bewegung und mitgetragenen Toten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS2","text":"Gefolgschaft wird als gültig bestimmt, wenn die Gefährten sich selbst folgen wollen und dadurch freiwillig dieselbe Richtung teilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS3","text":"Volk, Herde, Hirten, Gute, Gerechte und Gläubige werden als Ordnungen identifiziert, die bestehende Wertetafeln gegen den Schaffenden verteidigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS4","text":"Der Schaffende benötigt keine Bekehrten, sondern Mitschaffende, Miterntende und Mitfeiernde, die neue Werte hervorbringen und vollenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS5","text":"Die neue Wahrheit erzwingt den Abschied vom ersten Gefährten, vom Volk und von der Hirtenfunktion zugunsten eines eigenen Gangs über die Zögernden hinweg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von isolierter Selbstprüfung über die negative Bestimmung falscher Gemeinschaft zur selektiven Bildung schöpferischer Gefährtenschaft und zur selbstgesetzten Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A1","text":"Lebendige Gefährten sind solchen Gefährten vorzuziehen, die als Tote oder Leichname mitgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A2","text":"Gültige Gefährtenschaft beruht darauf, dass jeder Gefährte sich selbst folgen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","text":"Gemeinsame Richtung setzt keine Unterordnung unter einen Hirten voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","text":"Das Volk und die Herde reproduzieren kollektive Gefolgschaft anstelle selbstbestimmter Gefährtenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A5","text":"Die Guten, Gerechten und Gläubigen verteidigen bestehende Tafeln der Werte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","text":"Der Schaffende zerbricht bestehende Wertetafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A7","text":"Neue Werte entstehen durch Mitschaffen und das Schreiben neuer Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A8","text":"Schöpferische Arbeit erfordert zugleich Ernte, gemeinsames Vollenden und die Fähigkeit, die Sicheln zu wetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A9","text":"Der Schaffende wird von den Verteidigern des Bestehenden als Vernichter und Verächter des Guten und Bösen bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A10","text":"Zarathustras Ziel verlangt den Abschied von der Hirten- und Totengräberrolle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A11","text":"Der eigene Gang hat Vorrang vor dem Zögern und der Saumseligkeit anderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:A12","text":"Die Gefährtenschaft des Schaffenden umfasst gemeinsames Schaffen, Ernten und Feiern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1","text":"Gefährtenschaft ist nicht das Mitführen von Leichnamen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX2","text":"Gefährtenschaft ist nicht Herdenzugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX3","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht Hirte von Volk oder Herde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX4","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht Totengräber der Vergangenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX5","text":"Der Schaffende ist nicht Verteidiger bestehender Wertetafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX6","text":"Die Guten, Gerechten und Gläubigen sind keine neutralen Träger von Werten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX7","text":"Schöpferische Gefährtenschaft ist nicht bloßer Glaube oder bloße Gefolgschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX8","text":"Die Erntenden sind nicht notwendig Vernichter oder Verächter, obwohl sie so genannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX9","text":"Die neue Wahrheit richtet sich nicht mehr an das Volk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:NX10","text":"Zögern und Saumseligkeit bilden keinen legitimen Maßstab für den eigenen Gang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D1","text":"Die Ablehnung toter Gefährten erzeugt eine Unterscheidung zwischen passivem Mittragen und lebendiger Selbstbewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A1","CH_97E9_8C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D2","text":"Wenn gültige Gefährten sich selbst folgen, kann gemeinsame Richtung ohne Hirtenhierarchie bestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A2","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D3","text":"Wer bestehende Wertetafeln zerbricht, wird aus der Perspektive ihrer Verteidiger notwendig als Verbrecher oder Vernichter klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A5","CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D4","text":"Die Abkehr von der Herde richtet die Suche des Schaffenden auf Mitschaffende, die neue Wertetafeln hervorbringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D5","text":"Schöpferische Gemeinschaft umfasst nicht nur Hervorbringung, sondern auch gemeinsames Ernten und Feiern.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A8","CH_97E9_8C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D6","text":"Die Entscheidung gegen die Hirtenrolle macht den Abschied vom Volk zur Voraussetzung der neuen Gefährtenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:D7","text":"Der eigene Gang wird durch die Zurückweisung des Zögerns als selektive und ausschließende Bewegung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A10","CH_97E9_8C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt das Modell vertikaler Führung durch eine horizontale Allianz selbstgerichteter Werteschöpfer.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A2","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2","text":"Werteschöpfung erscheint als doppelte Operation: Zerstörung überkommener Tafeln und kollektive Einsetzung neuer Tafeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A5","CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3","text":"Gemeinschaft wird nicht durch gemeinsame Überzeugung, sondern durch gemeinsame Teilnahme an Schöpfung, Ernte und Feier konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A8","CH_97E9_8C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SD4","text":"Der Bruch mit der Herde erzeugt eine neue politische und zeitliche Ordnung, in der das kommende Ziel die gegenwärtige Gefährtenschaft selektiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10","CH_97E9_8C_2:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass bestehende Werte keine letzte oder unverfügbare Geltung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Gemeinschaft primär durch gemeinsame Orthodoxie oder gemeinsame Unterordnung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX3","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, dass Führung notwendig Vermittlung zwischen Volk und Wahrheit leisten muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Bewahrung des Überlieferten als ausreichenden Zweck des gemeinschaftlichen Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine dauerhafte Koexistenz zwischen Werteschöpfung und der Verteidigung festgelegter Wertetafeln aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX6","text":"Es behandelt das Volk nicht als noch unentschlossene Ressource, die durch bloße Ansprache gewonnen werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gemeinschaft, deren Einheit nicht aus eigener Bewegung, sondern aus Identität, Gehorsam oder Glaubensgleichheit stammt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Wertordnung, die sich gegen ihre eigene Überschreitung immunisieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX3","text":"Abwesend ist ein gemeinsamer Raum, in dem Schaffende und Verteidiger bestehender Werte dauerhaft dieselbe politische Funktion erfüllen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Rückkehr zur Hirtenrolle, sobald der Schaffende seine Gefährtenschaft als gemeinsame Wertproduktion bestimmt hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine universale Ansprache; die neue Wahrheit kann nur durch Auswahl, Trennung und Ausschluss wirksam werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:FGS1","text":"Erwachen → innere Prüfung → Erkennen des mitgetragenen Toten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:FGS2","text":"Mitgetragener Toter → Ausschluss von Leichnam, Herde und Volk → Definition lebendiger Gefährtenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_2:FGS3","text":"Bestehende Wertetafeln → Verteidigung durch Gute, Gerechte und Gläubige → Identifikation des Schaffenden als Brecher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"h