r Leser wird vom neutralen Rezipienten zum potenziellen Müssiggänger und Verfallsagenten reklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME3","text":"Höhe wird nicht länger als Ziel des Aufblickens, sondern als Position des Hinabblickens organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME4","text":"Trauer, Ernst, Tiefe und Schwere werden als zusammengehörige Varianten eines einzigen Gegensystems sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME5","text":"Lachen wird von einer Reaktion zu einer ontologischen und strategischen Gegenkraft aufgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME6","text":"Bewegung wird von äußerer Verursachung auf erlernte Selbsttätigkeit umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME7","text":"Der Gottbegriff wird anhand der Fähigkeit zu tanzen und nicht anhand von Ernst oder Tiefe kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Lesen, Schreiben, Sprüche, Leser, Leben, Liebe, Lachen, Gehen, Fliegen und Tanzen erscheinen als unmittelbare Operationsfelder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine hierarchische Kommunikationsordnung verbindet körperliche Beglaubigung, selektive Adressierung, Erhebung und Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verwandelt Form, Publikum und Affekt in Instrumente einer Abwehr gegen Müssiggang, Passivität und Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Geist bewegt sich in einer Abstiegsgeschichte von Gott über Mensch zu Pöbel, während die Gegenbewegung als Aufstieg, Fallüberwindung und Tanz erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Blutinschrift über Gipfelstruktur und Erhebung bis zur Überwindung der Schwere zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch „Große“ und „Hochwüchsige“ außer durch die Bildlogik der Höhe bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, wie Auswendiglernen ohne ein vorgängiges Lesen und Verstehen funktionieren soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern dort kohärent, wo Blut, Höhe, Lachen, Leichtigkeit und Selbstbewegung gegen gemeinsame Formen der Passivität gerichtet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Bruchlinie besteht zwischen der Verwerfung des Lesers und der direkten Anrede eines „ihr“, die weiterhin eine Hör- und Rezeptionsinstanz voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Verwerfung allgemeiner Lesbarkeit und dem Fehlen einer positiven Ordnung der Überlieferung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT7","text":"Die Verbindung von Gewalt, Hierarchie, Liebe, Wahnsinn und Glück wird behauptet, aber nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern der Schluss nicht als bloße Leichtigkeit, sondern als selbst erzeugte Gegenbewegung zum Geist der Schwere verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195200102818Z_f2f43d6a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Reading and Writing","source_sha256":"f935ed000c2087f073bc212378eb44b636742ce32b155bae23c564a9c1b94f83","sha256":"a657674635fe4f5c5e60bf1516db5a2f6f0761492d0642a65af5c56cc7eec4be","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:52:00.103862+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS1","text":"The problem is the emptying of writing and thinking through general readability and passive reading.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS2","text":"Writing is redefined as a bodily risky inscription in blood that does not serve the reader but compels remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS3","text":"The aphorism is organized as a summit, whose understanding presupposes distance, height, and a privileged addressee.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS4","text":"Elevation produces a downward-looking perspective from which grief, heaviness, and seriousness are devalued through laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS5","text":"Affirmation of life is bound to the connection of capacity to bear burdens, love, madness, reason, and lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AS6","text":"The movement ends in self-generated walking, flying, and dancing as the killing of the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A1","text":"Writing with blood lets blood be experienced as spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A2","text":"Foreign blood is not easy to understand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","text":"General literacy corrupts writing and thinking in the long run.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A4","text":"Aphorisms written in blood aim at memorization, not at mere reading.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","text":"Aphorisms are to be summits and are addressed to the great and the tall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","text":"Elevation produces a perspective of looking down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A7","text":"Wisdom demands courage, unconcern, mockery, and violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A8","text":"The heaviness of life is borne through pride and surrender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A9","text":"Love contains madness and reason at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A10","text":"Lightness, agility, and foolish daintiness stand closest to happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","text":"The serious, thorough, and solemn devil is the spirit of gravity, through which all things fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","text":"Laughter kills the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:A13","text":"Learned walking and flying enable movement without an external impulse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX1","text":"The system does not presuppose understanding as immediate transferability between foreign bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX2","text":"Writing is not service to the reader.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX3","text":"General readability is not a neutral or progressive condition of thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX4","text":"Spirit does not remain in the form of God, but can become human and then further become rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX5","text":"The aphorism is not an ordinary explanatory text, but a summit-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX6","text":"Elevation does not consist in mere looking up, but in looking down from an elevated position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX7","text":"The heaviness of life does not justify treating life tenderly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX8","text":"Love is neither mere attachment nor pure reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX9","text":"A valid God is not determined by seriousness, depth, and solemnity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX10","text":"The spirit of gravity is not overcome by anger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:NX11","text":"Self-movement is not the result of waiting for an external impulse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D1","text":"Blood as spirit produces a fundamental difficulty of understanding between writer and reader.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A1","CH_97E9_VLUS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D2","text":"Orientation toward the general reader intensifies precisely that emptying of writing and thinking which the inscription in blood wards off.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D3","text":"The inaccessibility of the aphorism is not a weakness but the condition of its summit structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A2","CH_97E9_VLUS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D4","text":"Elevation transforms grief and seriousness into objects of laughter and assigns wisdom to a combative attitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VLUS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D5","text":"The capacity to bear life requires both self-assertion and devotion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A8","CH_97E9_VLUS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D6","text":"The connection of madness and reason enables a non-heavy form of happiness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A9","CH_97E9_VLUS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D7","text":"Seriousness, depth, and solemnity are classified as manifestations of fall-producing heaviness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:D8","text":"Laughter and self-generated movement form two complementary procedures for overcoming heaviness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD1","text":"The system replaces universal communication with bodily authenticated, selective, and remembrance-oriented transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A1","CH_97E9_VLUS:A2","CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD2","text":"Height, spiritual quality, and social addressability are fused into a hierarchical unity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VLUS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD3","text":"Affirmation of life does not mean relief from burdens, but the transformation of burden into pride, love, and agility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A8","CH_97E9_VLUS:A9","CH_97E9_VLUS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD4","text":"Laughter functions not as a mood, but as an operative counterforce against falling, seriousness, passivity, and heaviness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD5","text":"The truth of the text depends on a non-universal order of communication in which understanding is produced through distance and selection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A2","CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SD6","text":"The highest form of spirit is determined as self-moving, dancing existence and not as contemplative depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A10","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that truth can be communicated independently of bodily risk and embodiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX2","text":"It excludes the equal rank of writer and reader as a communicative point of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX3","text":"It excludes an indiscriminate publicness of understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX4","text":"It excludes seriousness and depth as sufficient criteria of spiritual truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX5","text":"It excludes external causation as an adequate explanation of self-determined movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX6","text":"It excludes a stable separation of reason and madness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX7","text":"It excludes an affirmation of life that rests on sparingness, compassion, or sensitivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX1","text":"A shared community of understanding that is immediately accessible remains structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX2","text":"A non-hierarchical order of general education is treated as unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX3","text":"The possibility that elevation and equal rank coincide is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX4","text":"A reconciliation between the elevated speaker and the others seen beneath him is not established.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX5","text":"A collective form of overcoming heaviness is not formalized; only individual self-movement remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX6","text":"A serious, non-falling, and non-heavy spirit is treated as an impossible form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS1","text":"Bodily inscription → spirit is determined as blood → foreign blood remains difficult to understand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS2","text":"General readability → orientation toward the reader and idleness → decay of writing and thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS3","text":"Inscription in blood → rejection of the reader → aphorism as a memorable summit → selective tallness as a condition of address.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS4","text":"Elevation → looking down → recoding of grief, seriousness, and heaviness into ridiculousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS5","text":"Capacity to bear burdens + pride + surrender → love as madness/reason → light form of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:FGS6","text":"Spirit of gravity → falling → laughter and courage → walking without impulse → flying → dancing God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:AF1","text":"Decay through general readability → blood as a countermodel of inscription → aphorism as selective summit → elevation as looking down → laughter against grief and heaviness → love, lightness, and self-movement → dance as the final form of spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME1","text":"Writing is remapped from a communicative service to the reader into a bodily guaranteed test of understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME2","text":"The reader is reclassified from a neutral recipient into a potential idler and agent of decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME3","text":"Height is no longer organized as the goal of looking up, but as the position of looking down.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME4","text":"Grief, seriousness, depth, and heaviness become visible as interrelated variants of a single counter-system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME5","text":"Laughter is elevated from a reaction to an ontological and strategic counterforce.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME6","text":"Movement is shifted from external causation to learned self-activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ME7","text":"The concept of God is mapped according to the capacity to dance and not according to seriousness or depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Reading, writing, aphorisms, readers, life, love, laughter, walking, flying, and dancing appear as immediate fields of operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT2","text":"Structural — A hierarchical order of communication connects bodily authentication, selective address, elevation, and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text transforms form, audience, and affect into instruments of a defense against idleness, passivity, and heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Spirit moves in a history of descent from God through human to rabble, while the counter-movement appears as ascent, overcoming falling, and dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from inscription in blood through summit structure and elevation to the overcoming of heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what “the great” and “the tall” are determined apart from the image-logic of height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT3","text":"It further remains underdetermined how memorization is supposed to function without prior reading and understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where blood, height, laughter, lightness, and self-movement are directed against common forms of passivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT5","text":"An unresolved fault line exists between the rejection of the reader and the direct address of a “you,” which continues to presuppose an instance of hearing and reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the rejection of general readability and the absence of a positive order of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT7","text":"The connection of violence, hierarchy, love, madness, and happiness is asserted, but not fully mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the conclusion is understood not as mere lightness but as a self-generated counter-movement to the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLUS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VLUS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VLUS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 17","title":"On Reading and Writing","context":"Chapter 17","original_title":"Vom Lesen und Schreiben","original_context":"Chapter 17"},"original_title":"Vom Lesen und Schreiben","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB","layer":"CH","title":"On the Tree on the Mountainside","order":18,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VBAB"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VBAB@R001","sha256":"93eb9856a282e4ae4d8ef74e15a304d90f33128c04f263599beac1d36ea90bd9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist ein Aufstieg zur Höhe, der den Jüngling von sich selbst, von anderen und von seinem Ziel entfremdet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS2","text":"Das Baumgleichnis bestimmt diesen Aufstieg als gleichzeitige Wirkung unsichtbarer Kräfte und erdwärts strebender Wurzeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS3","text":"Der Jüngling bestätigt die Diagnose durch beschleunigte Selbstverwandlung, übersprungene Stufen, Einsamkeit, Verachtung und Erschöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS4","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt den Freiheitsdrang als noch gefangene und ungeklärte Befreiung, in der auch wilde Triebe freigesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung des Edlen vom Guten verschiebt den Konflikt von Bewahrung zu Schöpfung und legt die Gefahr selbstzerstörerischer Reaktion frei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS6","text":"Der Argumentweg endet nicht in der Verwerfung der Höhe, sondern in der Forderung, Liebe, Hoffnung und den Helden der Seele gegen ihre Entleerung zu bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","text":"Unsichtbare Kräfte biegen und quälen den Menschen stärker als unmittelbar sichtbare Einwirkungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","text":"Je stärker der Mensch nach Höhe und Helle strebt, desto tiefer wurzelt er in Erde, Dunkel und Bösem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","text":"Der Jüngling erfährt sein Werden als schnelle Selbstwiderlegung zwischen Heute und Gestern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A4","text":"Übersprungene Stufen verweigern dem Aufstieg eine versöhnte Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","text":"Die erreichte Höhe erzeugt Einsamkeit, Frost, Misstrauen und Müdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A6","text":"Verachtung und Sehnsucht nach der Höhe wachsen gemeinsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","text":"Der Freiheitsdrang umfasst auch wilde und schlimme Triebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","text":"Wer Freiheit nur ersinnt, bleibt solange Gefangener, wie sie nicht verwirklicht und gereinigt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","text":"Die vorgestellte Freiheit macht den Gefangenen klug, arglistig und schlecht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","text":"Der Befreite muss verbliebenes Gefängnis und verbliebenen Moder reinigen, damit sein Auge klar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A11","text":"Der Edle schafft Neues und eine neue Tugend, während der Gute das Alte erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A12","text":"Die Gefahr des Edlen liegt in Frechheit, Hohn und Vernichtung, nicht in seiner Verwandlung zum Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A13","text":"Der Verlust der höchsten Hoffnung verwandelt heroische Ausrichtung in kurze Lust, Ziellosigkeit und entstellten Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A14","text":"Liebe, Hoffnung und der Held der Seele müssen gegen diese Entleerung bewahrt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX1","text":"Der menschliche Zwang wird nicht als Wirkung unmittelbar sichtbarer Hände erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX2","text":"Der Aufstieg wird nicht als reine Bewegung nach oben behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX3","text":"Höhe wird nicht mit Freiheit gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX4","text":"Das sich verwandelnde Subjekt besitzt keine ungebrochene Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX5","text":"Der Edle ist nicht mit dem Guten und dessen Bewahrung des Alten identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX6","text":"Der Freiheitsdrang ist nicht schon Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX7","text":"Die Befreiung des Geistes ist nicht mit der bloßen Freisetzung seiner Triebe vollendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX8","text":"Der Verlust der höchsten Hoffnung erzeugt keinen neutralen Zustand, sondern einen Verfall in Lust, Ziellosigkeit und Entstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX9","text":"Die heroische Möglichkeit der Seele darf nicht als überholter Rest beseitigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D1","text":"Die Höhe ist kein stabiler Zielpunkt, sondern ein Kraftfeld, in dem der Aufstieg zugleich eine Gegenbewegung in die Tiefe erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D2","text":"Die beschleunigte Selbstverwandlung verbindet den übersprungenen Entwicklungsweg mit Selbstmisstrauen und sozialer Isolation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A4","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D3","text":"Die Höhe wird zur affektiven Doppelbindung, weil ihr Begehren durch wachsende Verachtung des Aufsteigenden unterlaufen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D4","text":"Die Freisetzung der wilden Triebe reproduziert Gefangenschaft, wenn sie nicht durch Reinigung vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D5","text":"Freiheit bezeichnet einen Reinigungsprozess innerhalb des Subjekts und keinen bereits erreichten Zustand außerhalb aller Gefängnisse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D6","text":"Der Konflikt zwischen Edlem und Gutem ist ein Konflikt zwischen schöpferischer Setzung und erhaltender Norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","text":"Der Zusammenbruch der höchsten Hoffnung verwandelt die schöpferische Spannung des Edlen in selbstentwürdigende Bedürfnisbefriedigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D8","text":"Die Rettung des Edlen besteht nicht in der Rückkehr zum Guten, sondern in der Reinigung und Bewahrung seiner höchsten Ausrichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1","text":"Aufstieg und Befreiung erzeugen ihre Gefahren nicht nur unter äußeren Bedingungen, sondern aus der inneren Organisation des Aufstiegs selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD2","text":"Beschleunigte Selbstüberschreitung verwandelt das eigene Gestern in einen Gegner und macht Identität zur fortgesetzten Widerlegung ihrer früheren Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD3","text":"Das System verlagert die entscheidende ethische Grenze von Gut und Böse auf die Differenz zwischen schöpferischer Erneuerung und konservierender Bewahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD4","text":"Die eigentliche Gefahr des Edlen ist eine sekundäre Degeneration: Der Verlust der höchsten Hoffnung lässt den Schöpfer zum Lüstling und den Helden zum Gegenstand des Grauens werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD5","text":"Zarathustra ist zugleich der erwartete Blitz, der den Untergang auslöst, und die Instanz, die Liebe, Hoffnung und Heldentum gegen diesen Untergang bewahren will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Krise des Jünglings primär durch äußere Unterdrückung verursacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine lineare Teleologie aus, in der jeder Aufstieg eine eindeutige Entfernung vom Dunklen und Bösen bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein autonomes, sich selbst vollständig durchsichtiges Subjekt aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX4","text":"Es schließt einen stabilen moralischen Maßstab aus, nach dem das Gute ohne Weiteres als höhere Form des Edlen gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Befreiung aus, die keine Überreste von Gefängnis, Moder und ungeklärten Trieben mitführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Selbstbefreiung aus, die ohne Deutung, Erfindung und intervenierende Begegnung auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX7","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass die Aufgabe des höchsten Ziels folgenlos bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX1","text":"Eine reine Höhe jenseits von Erde, Dunkel und Bösem ist im System nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX2","text":"Eine vollständig selbstbegründete Freiheit ohne Rest, Gegenkraft oder fremde Vermittlung ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX3","text":"Zwischen höchster Hoffnung und Verfall gibt es keinen neutralen Zwischenraum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX4","text":"Ein reines Heldentum ohne die Möglichkeit von Hohn, Vernichtung und Selbstentstellung ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5","text":"Die Befreiung kann ihre eigene Gefangenschaft nicht einfach hinter sich lassen; sie bleibt auf Reinigung und fortgesetzte Ausrichtung angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS1","text":"Ausweichen des Jünglings → Baumkontakt → Unterscheidung sichtbarer Hände und unsichtbaren Windes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS2","text":"Unsichtbare Einwirkung → Baum als Menschenmodell → Aufstieg in die Höhe erzeugt erdwärts gerichtete Wurzeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS3","text":"Aufstiegsmodell → Selbstzeugnis des Jünglings → schnelle Selbstwiderlegung, übersprungene Stufen, Einsamkeit, Verachtung und Müdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS4","text":"Freiheitsbegehren plus wilde Triebe → vorgestellte statt verwirklichte Freiheit → Gefangenschaft, Arglist und Unreinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS5","text":"Gefangenschaft → notwendige Reinigung → Unterscheidung zwischen dem schöpferischen Edlen und dem erhaltenden Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS6","text":"Verlust der höchsten Hoffnung → Aufgabe von Ziel und Heldentum → kurze Lust, entstellter Geist und Abscheu vor dem Helden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS7","text":"Diagnose der Gefahr → Verweigerung des Verzichts auf Liebe und Hoffnung → Bewahrung des Helden als Bedingung weiterer Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AF1","text":"Ausweichen und Einsamkeit → Baumgleichnis der unsichtbaren Biegung → Aufstieg als gleichzeitige Verwurzelung im Dunklen → Selbstenthüllung des Jünglings → Freiheit als fortbestehende Gefangenschaft → Reinigung des Befreiten → Edler gegen Guten → Verlust der höchsten Hoffnung → Bewahrung von Liebe, Hoffnung und Held.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME1","text":"Die psychische Krise wird von einem inneren Zustand in eine Topologie gegenläufiger Kräfte umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME2","text":"Höhe und Tiefe werden nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als gekoppelte Richtungen desselben Aufstiegs sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3","text":"Freiheit wird von einem Zielzustand in eine unvollendete Reinigung innerhalb fortbestehender Gefangenschaft umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME4","text":"Die Kategorie des Edlen wird aus der moralischen Nähe zum Guten gelöst und an Schöpfung, Risiko und Selbstüberwindung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME5","text":"Der Niedergang wird als Verlust einer höchsten Orientierung und nicht als bloße Rückkehr zu einem niedrigeren Ausgangszustand kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME6","text":"Zarathustra wird von einem bloßen Beobachter zu einer intervenierenden Kraft, die Diagnose und Gefährdung zugleich verkörpert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Jüngling sucht die Höhe, erlebt Einsamkeit und erkennt in Zarathustra den erwarteten Blitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Aufstieg, unsichtbare Kräfte, innere Triebe, Gefangenschaft und Reinigung bilden einen zusammenhängenden Mechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Krise soll nicht durch Rückkehr zum Guten gelöst werden, sondern durch Bewahrung der schöpferischen Hoffnung vor ihrer destruktiven Entleerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt ist ein werdender Zusammenhang, in dem das Heute das Gestern widerlegt und jede Höhe ihre eigene Tiefe mitführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Weg vom Baumgleichnis über die Freiheitsdiagnose bis zur Bewahrung der höchsten Hoffnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die geforderte Reinigung praktisch vollzogen wird und woran ein gereinigtes Auge endgültig zu erkennen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist auf der Ebene ihrer Bild- und Diagnoselogik intern kohärent: Die Baumwurzel, die Gefangenschaft und der ungeklärte Trieb bilden dieselbe Gegenbewegung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist das System dort, wo es Aufstieg, Selbstwiderlegung, Einsamkeit und Verfall als verschiedene Erscheinungen eines einzigen Mechanismus verbindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen unsichtbarer Biegung und geforderter Selbstreinigung: Das Subjekt ist bestimmt und zugleich zur aktiven Befreiung verpflichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass Zarathustra den Untergang des Jünglings als Blitz auslöst und zugleich dessen Rettung durch Liebe und Hoffnung beansprucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegungsrichtung, komprimiert jedoch die Mehrdeutigkeit von Bösem, Edlem, Gutem und Heldentum in eine einheitliche Generierungslogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193820581939Z_cfa08738","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Tree on the Mountain","source_sha256":"93eb9856a282e4ae4d8ef74e15a304d90f33128c04f263599beac1d36ea90bd9","sha256":"1c0d72affc724d38178329dd329fdda3c56cd7073c0a81c91b68233bc5d7330e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:38:20.583608+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS1","text":"The central problem is an ascent to the heights that alienates the young man from himself, from others, and from his goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS2","text":"The tree analogy determines this ascent as the simultaneous effect of invisible forces and roots striving earthward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS3","text":"The young man confirms the diagnosis through accelerated self-transformation, skipped stages, solitude, contempt, and exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS4","text":"Zarathustra determines the drive for freedom as liberation that is still captive and unresolved, in which wild drives too are released.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS5","text":"The distinction between the noble and the good shifts the conflict from preservation to creation and exposes the danger of self-destructive reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AS6","text":"The course of the argument ends not in the rejection of the heights, but in the demand to preserve love, hope, and the hero of the soul against their emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","text":"Invisible forces bend and torment the human being more strongly than immediately visible influences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","text":"The more strongly the human being strives for height and brightness, the more deeply he takes root in earth, darkness, and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","text":"The young man experiences his becoming as rapid self-refutation between today and yesterday.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A4","text":"Skipped stages deny ascent a reconciled development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","text":"The attained height produces solitude, frost, mistrust, and weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A6","text":"Contempt and longing for the heights grow together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","text":"The drive for freedom also encompasses wild and terrible drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","text":"Whoever merely conceives freedom remains a prisoner so long as it is not realized and purified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","text":"Imagined freedom makes the prisoner clever, cunning, and bad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","text":"The liberated person must cleanse the remaining prison and the remaining rot, so that his eye becomes clear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A11","text":"The noble person creates the new and a new virtue, whereas the good person preserves the old.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A12","text":"The danger of the noble person lies in insolence, mockery, and destruction, not in his transformation into the good person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A13","text":"The loss of the highest hope transforms heroic orientation into brief pleasure, aimlessness, and a disfigured spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:A14","text":"Love, hope, and the hero of the soul must be preserved against this emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX1","text":"Human compulsion is not explained as the effect of immediately visible hands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX2","text":"Ascent is not treated as a pure movement upward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX3","text":"Height is not equated with freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX4","text":"The transforming subject possesses no unbroken identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX5","text":"The noble person is not identical with the good person and the latter's preservation of the old.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX6","text":"The drive for freedom is not yet liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX7","text":"The liberation of the spirit is not completed by the mere release of its drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX8","text":"The loss of the highest hope produces no neutral state, but rather a decline into pleasure, aimlessness, and disfigurement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:NX9","text":"The heroic possibility of the soul must not be eliminated as an obsolete remnant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D1","text":"Height is not a stable endpoint, but a field of forces in which ascent simultaneously produces a countermovement into the depths.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D2","text":"Accelerated self-transformation links the skipped path of development with self-mistrust and social isolation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A4","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D3","text":"Height becomes an affective double bind because desire for it is undermined by the growing contempt of the one ascending.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D4","text":"The release of wild drives reproduces captivity if it is not mediated through purification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D5","text":"Freedom denotes a process of purification within the subject and not an already attained state outside all prisons.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D6","text":"The conflict between the noble and the good is a conflict between creative positing and preserving norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","text":"The collapse of the highest hope transforms the noble person's creative tension into self-degrading gratification of needs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:D8","text":"The salvation of the noble person consists not in a return to the good, but in the purification and preservation of his highest orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1","text":"Ascent and liberation generate their dangers not only under external conditions, but from the inner organization of ascent itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD2","text":"Accelerated self-transcendence transforms one's own yesterday into an adversary and makes identity the continuing refutation of its earlier form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD3","text":"The system shifts the decisive ethical boundary from good and evil to the difference between creative renewal and conserving preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD4","text":"The proper danger of the noble person is a secondary degeneration: the loss of the highest hope makes the creator into a voluptuary and the hero into an object of horror.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SD5","text":"Zarathustra is at once the awaited lightning bolt that triggers downfall and the instance that seeks to preserve love, hope, and heroism against this downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that the young man's crisis is caused primarily by external oppression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX2","text":"It excludes a linear teleology in which every ascent signifies an unambiguous removal from the dark and the evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX3","text":"It excludes an autonomous subject fully transparent to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX4","text":"It excludes a stable moral standard according to which the good could straightforwardly count as a higher form of the noble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX5","text":"It excludes a liberation that carries with it no remnants of prison, rot, and unresolved drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX6","text":"It excludes a self-liberation that can do without interpretation, invention, and intervening encounter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX7","text":"It excludes the possibility that the abandonment of the highest goal remains without consequences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX1","text":"A pure height beyond earth, darkness, and evil is not available within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX2","text":"A fully self-grounded freedom without remainder, counterforce, or external mediation is not available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX3","text":"There is no neutral intermediate space between the highest hope and decline.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX4","text":"A pure heroism without the possibility of mockery, destruction, and self-disfigurement is not available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5","text":"Liberation cannot simply leave its own captivity behind; it remains dependent on purification and continuing orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS1","text":"Avoidance by the young man → contact with the tree → distinction between visible hands and invisible wind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS2","text":"Invisible influence → tree as model of the human being → ascent into the heights produces earthward-directed roots.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS3","text":"Model of ascent → the young man's self-testimony → rapid self-refutation, skipped stages, solitude, contempt, and weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS4","text":"Desire for freedom plus wild drives → imagined rather than realized freedom → captivity, cunning, and impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS5","text":"Captivity → necessary purification → distinction between the creative noble person and the preserving good person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS6","text":"Loss of the highest hope → abandonment of goal and heroism → brief pleasure, disfigured spirit, and disgust before the hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:FGS7","text":"Diagnosis of danger → refusal to renounce love and hope → preservation of the hero as the condition of further liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:AF1","text":"Avoidance and solitude → tree analogy of invisible bending → ascent as simultaneous rooting in the dark → the young man's self-revelation → freedom as continuing captivity → purification of the liberated person → noble person against good person → loss of the highest hope → preservation of love, hope, and hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME1","text":"The psychic crisis is remapped from an inner state into a topology of opposing forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME2","text":"Height and depth are no longer visible as opposites, but as coupled directions of the same ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3","text":"Freedom is reclassified from a goal-state into an unfinished purification within continuing captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME4","text":"The category of the noble is detached from moral proximity to the good and bound to creation, risk, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME5","text":"Decline is mapped as the loss of a highest orientation and not as a mere return to a lower initial state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ME6","text":"Zarathustra is transformed from a mere observer into an intervening force that embodies diagnosis and endangerment at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT1","text":"Surface — A young man seeks the heights, experiences solitude, and recognizes in Zarathustra the awaited lightning bolt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ascent, invisible forces, inner drives, captivity, and purification form a coherent mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The crisis is not to be resolved through a return to the good, but through the preservation of creative hope against its destructive emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject is a becoming nexus in which today refutes yesterday and every height carries its own depth with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the path from the tree analogy through the diagnosis of freedom to the preservation of the highest hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the demanded purification is practically carried out and by what a purified eye could definitively be recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent at the level of its logic of image and diagnosis: the tree root, captivity, and the unresolved drive represent the same countermovement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT4","text":"The system is strongest where it connects ascent, self-refutation, solitude, and decline as different manifestations of a single mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension exists between invisible bending and demanded self-purification: the subject is determined and at the same time obligated to active liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT6","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that Zarathustra triggers the young man's downfall as lightning and at the same time claims his salvation through love and hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBAB:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of movement, but compresses the ambiguity of evil, the noble, the good, and heroism into a unified generative logic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VBAB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VBAB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 18","title":"On the Tree on the Mountainside","context":"Chapter 18","original_title":"Vom Baum am Berge","original_context":"Chapter 18"},"original_title":"Vom Baum am Berge","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD","layer":"CH","title":"On the Preachers of Death","order":19,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDPD"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDPD@R001","sha256":"81540d24d28ce419b28266ed62afbe0affeb44f1c415734023951e88a8ff5251","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS1","text":"Die Rede diagnostiziert eine Erde, auf der Lebensverneinung als Lehre, Moral und Lebensform verbreitet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS2","text":"Sie bestimmt die Prediger des Todes nicht über eine einheitliche Doktrin, sondern über die gemeinsame Funktion ihrer heterogenen Haltungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS3","text":"Sie kehrt das Urteil um, dass Krankheit, Leiden, Alter oder Tod das Leben widerlegen: Widerlegt werden vielmehr der einseitige Blick und sein Träger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS4","text":"Sie zeigt, wie Selbstzerfleischung, Askese, Antiprozreation, Mitleid und rastlose Arbeit den Wunsch nach Entbindung vom Leben verkleiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS5","text":"Sie unterstellt auch der hektischen Bejahung des Augenblicks eine negative Funktion: Flucht vor sich selbst und Unfähigkeit zum Warten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS6","text":"Die diagnostisch-polemische Bewegung führt von der Typologie einzelner Todespredigten zur funktionalen Gleichsetzung von wörtlichem und „ewigem“ Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A1","text":"Die Erde ist von Predigern des Todes und von als überflüssig bestimmten Existenzen erfüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","text":"Predigen des Todes bedeutet, Abkehr vom Leben zu verlangen oder den schnellen Abschied aus ihm zu befördern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","text":"Die Predigt des Todes erscheint in mehreren sozialen, moralischen, psychischen und zeitlichen Gestalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","text":"Krankheit, Leiden, Alter und Tod bilden für sich genommen kein hinreichendes Urteil über das Leben als Ganzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A5","text":"Derjenige, der aus einzelnen negativen Erscheinungen die Widerlegung des Lebens folgert, macht seinen eigenen Blick zum eigentlichen Problem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A6","text":"Lehren vom Selbsttod und von der Selbstentfernung verwandeln Lebensmüdigkeit in eine Tugend- oder Wahrheitsforderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A7","text":"Die Verurteilung von Lust, Zeugung und Geburt kann als Strategie der Lebensverneinung auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A8","text":"Mitleid und Schenken können dem Geber zur Lösung vom Leben dienen und zugleich den Empfänger stärker binden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A9","text":"Wilde Arbeit, Unruhe, Schnelligkeit, Neuheit und Fremdheit können als Flucht vor sich selbst funktionieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","text":"Die Fähigkeit zum Warten setzt inneren Inhalt voraus; ihr Fehlen bezeichnet eine Form der Lebensmüdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A11","text":"Innerhalb der Rede gilt stärkerer Glaube an das Leben als geringere Bereitschaft, sich dem einzelnen Augenblick auszuliefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A12","text":"„Ewiges Leben“ und Tod sind funktional gleichgestellt, sobald beide den schnellen Abschied aus diesem Leben bezwecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX1","text":"Die Prediger des Todes sind nicht auf die ausdrücklich „Gelben“ oder „Schwarzen“ beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX2","text":"Krankheit, Alter, Leichnam und Leiden widerlegen das Leben nicht automatisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX3","text":"Nicht das Leben, sondern der Blick, der nur ein Gesicht des Daseins sieht, ist widerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX4","text":"Die Wahrheit des Leidens legitimiert nicht die Forderung, das Leben zu beenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX5","text":"Lustverzicht, Kinderlosigkeit und Geburtsverweigerung werden nicht als neutrale Vernunftentscheidungen anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX6","text":"Mitleid wird nicht durch seine Selbstbezeichnung als uneigennützige Befreiung beglaubigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX7","text":"Schenken löst nicht notwendig Bindungen, sondern kann sie verdichten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX8","text":"Arbeit, Geschwindigkeit und Neuheit gelten nicht notwendig als Zeichen von Lebensbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX9","text":"Die Berufung auf das „ewige Leben“ hebt die Funktion des Todespredigens nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D1","text":"Die verschiedenen Todespredigten bilden trotz ihrer widersprüchlichen Oberflächen eine funktionale Einheit: Sie organisieren Abstand vom Leben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D2","text":"Der einseitige Blick verwandelt partikulare Lebensmängel in ein totalisierendes Urteil über das Dasein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D3","text":"Eine persönliche Erschöpfung wird in eine allgemeine Lehre übersetzt, die auch für andere den Rückzug aus dem Leben fordert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A5","CH_97E9_VDPD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D4","text":"Die Lehre vom Selbsttod macht aus innerer Lebensmüdigkeit eine normative Tugend.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D5","text":"Anti-sexuelle und anti-prokreative Argumente erscheinen als Varianten desselben Verzichts auf zukünftige Lebensbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D6","text":"Mitleid und Geschenke können die behauptete Befreiung unterlaufen, indem sie andere an den Geber oder an dessen Entsagung ketten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D7","text":"Das moralische Vorzeichen wird umgekehrt: „Böse sein“ kann innerhalb der Rede als die wirksamere Form erscheinen, anderen das Leben nicht zu verleiden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","text":"Rastlose Aktivität wird als negative Bewegung lesbar, wenn sie nicht aus innerem Inhalt, sondern aus Selbstvergessenheit entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A9","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D9","text":"Die Unfähigkeit zum Warten verbindet Lebensmüdigkeit mit dem Zwang zur permanenten Gegenwartsflucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","text":"Wörtlicher Tod und „ewiges Leben“ werden unter dem Kriterium der Beschleunigung zu austauschbaren Formen desselben Abschieds.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","text":"Private Erschöpfung wird durch Predigt in eine soziale Struktur der Lebensverneinung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A1","CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","text":"Moralisch gegensätzliche Haltungen wie Askese, Mitleid, Geburtsverweigerung und hektischer Fleiß werden als verschiedene Oberflächen derselben Fluchtbewegung sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","CH_97E9_VDPD:A7","CH_97E9_VDPD:A8","CH_97E9_VDPD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","text":"Die zentrale Unterscheidung verschiebt sich von Leben gegen Tod zu Verweilen gegen beschleunigte Entbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4","text":"Der Versuch, sich vom Leben zu lösen, erzeugt soziale Bindungen, sobald er als Geschenk, Mitleid oder Lehre auf andere übergreift.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A6","CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD5","text":"Die Kritik entzieht dem Leiden seine Funktion als metaphysischer Beweis und macht die Reaktion auf das Leiden zum eigentlichen Diagnosegegenstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","text":"Lebensbejahung wird nicht über Intensität, Aktivität oder Lust bestimmt, sondern über die Fähigkeit, Dauer, Vielheit und inneres Warten auszuhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX1","text":"Aus der Endlichkeit, dem Leiden oder dem Tod lässt sich kein objektives Gesamturteil ableiten, dass das Leben widerlegt sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX2","text":"Die Selbstauskunft des Leidenden oder Entsagenden gilt nicht als ausreichender Beweis für die Wahrheit seiner Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX3","text":"Ein Gegensatz zwischen selbstlosem Mitleid und eigennütziger Flucht wird strukturell zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX4","text":"Eine Steigerung von Arbeit, Bewegung und Neuheit wird nicht als Gegenmodell zur Lebensverneinung zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX5","text":"Eine transzendente Verlängerung des Lebens bildet kein Gegenprinzip zum Tod, wenn sie den Abschied vom gegenwärtigen Leben beschleunigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX6","text":"Die Lebensverneinung kann nicht durch ihre Einordnung unter verschiedene moralische Begriffe neutralisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX7","text":"Es gibt innerhalb des Systems keinen voraussetzungslosen Außenstandpunkt, von dem aus das Leben als Ganzes verurteilt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, sich aus dem Leben zurückzuziehen, ohne weiterhin auf andere Leben einzuwirken und sie zu binden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist ein reiner Übergang vom Leiden zum Tod, der nicht bereits durch eine selektive Deutung des Lebens vermittelt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird die Annahme eines einzigen Gesichts des Daseins; die Totalisierung des Negativen ist die verborgene Gegenfigur des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX4","text":"Der Text kreist um die nicht vollständig ausgearbeitete Möglichkeit eines in sich gehaltvollen Verweilens, das weder Entsagung noch Zerstreuung benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX5","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine positive Ontologie des bejahten Lebens; erhalten bleibt vor allem die Ausschließung seiner Verneinungsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Lebensform, die zugleich frei von Lebensflucht, Fremdbindung und hektischer Selbstvergessenheit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","text":"Einzelnes Leiden, einzelne Schwäche oder einzelne Last wird als privilegierter Zugang zum Ganzen des Lebens isoliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS2","text":"Die partikulare Negativität wird in den Satz überführt, das Leben selbst sei widerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","text":"Aus dem Gesamturteil werden Vorschriften für Selbsttod, Entsagung, Kinderlosigkeit, Mitleid oder rastlose Tätigkeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","text":"Die Vorschriften werden nicht nach ihrem Selbstverständnis, sondern nach ihrer Funktion als Entbindung vom Leben klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS5","text":"Die behauptete Kritik des Lebens wird auf den einseitigen Blick und die Lebensmüdigkeit ihres Trägers zurückprojiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS6","text":"Gegenläufig erscheinende Aktivität wird demselben Funktionsschema untergeordnet, sobald sie als Flucht vor sich selbst lesbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS7","text":"Das Schema schließt mit der funktionalen Gleichsetzung jedes beschleunigten Abschieds, gleichgültig ob er als Tod oder als „ewiges Leben“ bezeichnet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AF1","text":"Erde der Überflüssigen → heterogene Farben des Todespredigens → Isolierung von Leiden und Tod → falsches Gesamturteil über das Leben → Rückwendung des Urteils auf Blick und Träger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AF2","text":"Selbsttod, Lustverzicht, Geburtsverweigerung, Mitleid und rastlose Arbeit → gemeinsame Funktion der Lebensflucht → Bindung anderer durch den eigenen Rückzug → Gleichsetzung von Tod und „ewigem Leben“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME1","text":"Eine moralische Typologie wird in eine funktionale Karte überführt: Verschiedene Farben bezeichnen verschiedene Wege derselben Lebensentbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME2","text":"Krankheit, Alter, Leichnam und Leiden verlieren ihre Stellung als Beweise gegen das Leben und werden zu Prüfsteinen der Wahrnehmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","text":"Askese, Antiprozreation, Mitleid, Schenken und Fleiß werden von positiven Motiven zu möglichen Techniken des Verschwindens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Leben und Tod wird durch die zeitliche Achse des Verweilens und der Beschleunigung neu gezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME5","text":"Rückzug erscheint nicht mehr als rein private Handlung, sondern als mögliche Erzeugung neuer Bindungen und Belastungen für andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME6","text":"Intensive Gegenwartsorientierung wird von Lebensfülle getrennt und als Symptom innerer Leere kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT1","text":"Surface: Sichtbar sind Prediger des Todes, ihre Lehren vom Leiden, der Entsagung, der Kinderlosigkeit, des Mitleids und der rastlosen Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die verschiedenen Haltungen werden durch die gemeinsame Operation verbunden, das Leben zu verkürzen, zu verleiden oder zu verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Rede ersetzt moralische Selbstbeschreibungen durch eine Diagnose ihrer Funktion und kehrt die behauptete Widerlegung des Lebens gegen ihre Urheber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Das Leben wird als vielgesichtig und zeitlich ausgedehnt vorausgesetzt; seine Bejahung zeigt sich in der Fähigkeit zu warten, statt sich dem Augenblick oder einem Jenseits auszuliefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Typologie, die Umkehrung des Lebensurteils und die abschließende Gleichsetzung der Todesformen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin der positive Inhalt eines bejahten Lebens außer Warten, Vielheit und innerem Gehalt besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo sie alle Formen nach ihrer Funktion statt nach ihrer Selbstauslegung beurteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion bei der Umkehrung „Nicht das Leben, sondern der Blick ist widerlegt“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von starker Kompression heterogener Lebensformen unter dem gemeinsamen Begriff der Flucht ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die Rede totalisierende Urteile über das Leben kritisiert, aber selbst ein umfassendes Urteil über die Prediger des Todes fällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Anerkennung, dass „das Leben nur Leiden“ nicht notwendig eine Lüge ist, und der Zurückweisung der daraus gezogenen Konsequenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: heterogene Symptome werden funktional vereinheitlicht, auf ihre Träger zurückgewendet und temporal als Flucht vor dem Verweilen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194630697880Z_75306005","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Preachers of Death","source_sha256":"81540d24d28ce419b28266ed62afbe0affeb44f1c415734023951e88a8ff5251","sha256":"430f76690f54412eae9fee430151e420eae7f7a9e9bf1ff88776ee1df9534ba6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:46:30.698780+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS1","text":"The discourse diagnoses an earth on which life-negation is widespread as doctrine, morality, and way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS2","text":"It defines the preachers of death not by a uniform doctrine, but by the shared function of their heterogeneous attitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS3","text":"It reverses the judgment that sickness, suffering, old age, or death refute life: rather, the one-sided gaze and its bearer are refuted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS4","text":"It shows how self-laceration, asceticism, anti-procreation, pity, and restless work disguise the desire for release from life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS5","text":"It attributes a negative function even to the hectic affirmation of the moment: flight from oneself and inability to wait.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AS6","text":"The diagnostic-polemical movement leads from a typology of individual preachings of death to the functional equivalence of literal and “eternal” death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A1","text":"The earth is filled with preachers of death and with existences deemed superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","text":"Preaching death means demanding a turning away from life or promoting a swift departure from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","text":"The preaching of death appears in several social, moral, psychic, and temporal forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","text":"Sickness, suffering, old age, and death, taken by themselves, constitute no sufficient judgment upon life as a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A5","text":"Whoever infers the refutation of life from individual negative phenomena makes his own gaze the actual problem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A6","text":"Doctrines of self-death and self-removal transform weariness of life into a demand of virtue or truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A7","text":"The condemnation of pleasure, procreation, and birth can appear as a strategy of life-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A8","text":"Pity and giving can serve the giver's release from life while at the same time binding the recipient more strongly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A9","text":"Wild work, unrest, speed, novelty, and strangeness can function as flight from oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","text":"The capacity to wait presupposes inner content; its absence denotes a form of weariness of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A11","text":"Within the discourse, stronger belief in life counts as lesser readiness to abandon oneself to the individual moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:A12","text":"“Eternal life” and death are functionally equated as soon as both aim at a swift departure from this life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX1","text":"The preachers of death are not confined to the expressly “Yellow” or “Black” ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX2","text":"Sickness, old age, corpse, and suffering do not automatically refute life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX3","text":"Not life, but the gaze that sees only one face of existence, is refuted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX4","text":"The truth of suffering does not legitimize the demand to end life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX5","text":"Renunciation of pleasure, childlessness, and refusal of birth are not acknowledged as neutral decisions of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX6","text":"Pity is not authenticated by its self-designation as selfless liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX7","text":"Giving does not necessarily dissolve bonds, but can intensify them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX8","text":"Work, speed, and novelty do not necessarily count as signs of life-affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:NX9","text":"Appeal to “eternal life” does not suspend the function of preaching death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D1","text":"Despite their contradictory surfaces, the various preachings of death form a functional unity: they organize distance from life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D2","text":"The one-sided gaze transforms particular deficiencies of life into a totalizing judgment upon existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D3","text":"A personal exhaustion is translated into a general doctrine that demands withdrawal from life also for others.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A5","CH_97E9_VDPD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D4","text":"The doctrine of self-death turns inner weariness of life into a normative virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D5","text":"Anti-sexual and anti-procreative arguments appear as variants of the same renunciation of future attachment to life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D6","text":"Pity and gifts can undermine the claimed liberation by chaining others to the giver or to the latter's renunciation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D7","text":"The moral sign is reversed: “being evil” can appear within the discourse as the more effective form of not making life distasteful to others.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","text":"Restless activity becomes legible as a negative movement when it arises not from inner content but from self-forgetfulness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A9","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D9","text":"The inability to wait joins weariness of life to the compulsion toward permanent flight from the present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","text":"Literal death and “eternal life” become interchangeable forms of the same departure under the criterion of acceleration.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","text":"Private exhaustion is transferred through preaching into a social structure of life-negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A1","CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","text":"Morally opposed attitudes such as asceticism, pity, refusal of birth, and hectic diligence become visible as different surfaces of the same movement of flight.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","CH_97E9_VDPD:A7","CH_97E9_VDPD:A8","CH_97E9_VDPD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","text":"The central distinction shifts from life against death to abiding against accelerated release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A2","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4","text":"The attempt to detach oneself from life generates social bonds as soon as it extends to others as gift, pity, or doctrine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A6","CH_97E9_VDPD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD5","text":"The critique deprives suffering of its function as metaphysical proof and makes the reaction to suffering the actual object of diagnosis.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A4","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","text":"Life-affirmation is determined not by intensity, activity, or pleasure, but by the capacity to endure duration, multiplicity, and inward waiting.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:A3","CH_97E9_VDPD:A10","CH_97E9_VDPD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX1","text":"No objective overall judgment that life has been refuted can be derived from finitude, suffering, or death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX2","text":"The self-account of the sufferer or renunciant does not count as sufficient proof of the truth of his doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX3","text":"An opposition between selfless pity and self-interested flight is structurally rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX4","text":"An intensification of work, movement, and novelty is not admitted as a countermodel to life-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX5","text":"A transcendent prolongation of life forms no counterprinciple to death if it accelerates departure from present life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX6","text":"Life-negation cannot be neutralized by classifying it under different moral concepts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX7","text":"Within the system, there is no presuppositionless external standpoint from which life as a whole could be condemned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of withdrawing from life without continuing to affect and bind other lives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX2","text":"Blocked is a pure transition from suffering to death that would not already be mediated by a selective interpretation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX3","text":"The assumption of a single face of existence becomes inadmissible; the totalization of the negative is the system's hidden counterfigure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX4","text":"The text revolves around the not fully elaborated possibility of an abiding rich in inner content, requiring neither renunciation nor distraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX5","text":"Absent remains a positive ontology of affirmed life; what remains above all is the exclusion of its forms of negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6","text":"Unavailable is a way of life that would be free at once from flight from life, heteronomous attachment, and hectic self-forgetfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","text":"Individual suffering, individual weakness, or individual burden is isolated as a privileged access to the whole of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS2","text":"Particular negativity is transferred into the proposition that life itself has been refuted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","text":"From the overall judgment, prescriptions for self-death, renunciation, childlessness, pity, or restless activity are generated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","text":"The prescriptions are classified not according to their self-understanding, but according to their function as release from life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS5","text":"The asserted critique of life is projected back onto the one-sided gaze and the weariness of life of its bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS6","text":"Activity appearing to run counter to this is subsumed under the same functional schema as soon as it becomes legible as flight from oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS7","text":"The schema concludes with the functional equivalence of every accelerated departure, regardless of whether it is called death or “eternal life.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AF1","text":"Earth of the superfluous → heterogeneous colors of preaching death → isolation of suffering and death → false overall judgment upon life → turning the judgment back upon gaze and bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:AF2","text":"Self-death, renunciation of pleasure, refusal of birth, pity, and restless work → shared function of flight from life → binding of others through one's own withdrawal → equivalence of death and “eternal life.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME1","text":"A moral typology is transferred into a functional map: different colors denote different paths of the same release from life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME2","text":"Sickness, old age, corpse, and suffering lose their status as proofs against life and become touchstones of perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","text":"Asceticism, anti-procreation, pity, giving, and diligence are reclassified from positive motives into possible techniques of disappearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME4","text":"The opposition between life and death is redrawn through the temporal axis of abiding and acceleration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME5","text":"Withdrawal no longer appears as a purely private act, but as a possible generation of new bonds and burdens for others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ME6","text":"Intense orientation toward the present is separated from fullness of life and mapped as a symptom of inner emptiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT1","text":"Surface: Visible are preachers of death, their doctrines of suffering, renunciation, childlessness, pity, and restless work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","text":"Structural: The various attitudes are joined by the common operation of shortening, making distasteful, or leaving life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The discourse replaces moral self-descriptions with a diagnosis of their function and turns the asserted refutation of life against its authors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Life is presupposed as multifaceted and temporally extended; its affirmation manifests itself in the capacity to wait rather than abandon oneself to the moment or to an afterworld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the typology, the reversal of the judgment upon life, and the concluding equivalence of the forms of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the positive content of an affirmed life consists in beyond waiting, multiplicity, and inner content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent where it judges all forms according to their function rather than according to their self-interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the reversal “Not life, but the gaze is refuted.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on a strong compression of heterogeneous ways of life under the common concept of flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the discourse criticizes totalizing judgments about life, but itself passes a comprehensive judgment upon the preachers of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT7","text":"A further fault line lies between the acknowledgment that “life is only suffering” is not necessarily a lie and the rejection of the consequence drawn from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement: heterogeneous symptoms are functionally unified, turned back upon their bearers, and determined temporally as flight from abiding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDPD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDPD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDPD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 19","title":"On the Preachers of Death","context":"Chapter 19","original_title":"Von den Predigern des Todes","original_context":"Chapter 19"},"original_title":"Von den Predigern des Todes","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK","layer":"CH","title":"On War and Warriors","order":20,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VKUK"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VKUK@R001","sha256":"f80a007feba15c54e66a3afb5913ad5d4e6779a69541ebe2745335a493d6470d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt eine unschonende Wahrheit zwischen brüderlicher Liebe und feindlicher Prüfung an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt den Soldaten neu als Kriegsmann, dessen Identität durch die Suche nach einem würdigen Feind und den Kampf für einen Gedanken entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS3","text":"Er ordnet Frieden, Arbeit, Moral und Rettung dem Primat von Krieg, Sieg und Tapferkeit unter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS4","text":"Er verwandelt Hass, Neid, Bosheit und Übermut aus zu verbergenden Affekten in anzunehmende Kräfte der Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS5","text":"Er ersetzt autonome Selbstbestimmung durch befohlenen Gehorsam, der sich als eigentliche Vornehmheit ausgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Setzung des Menschen als eines Wesens, das überwunden werden soll, und des Lebens als Gehorsam und Krieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A1","text":"Wahrheit verlangt, dass weder Feindschaft noch Liebe schonend von der Prüfung ausgenommen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A2","text":"Brüderliche Liebe und feindliche Gegnerschaft können in derselben Beziehung zusammenbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A3","text":"Hass und Neid gehören zur unvollkommenen Größe und dürfen nicht durch Scham verdrängt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","text":"Kriegsmänner sind Gefährten und Vorläufer einer möglichen Heiligkeit der Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A5","text":"Ein äußerer Soldatenhabitus genügt nicht, um einen Kriegsmann zu konstituieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","text":"Der Kriegsmann sucht einen Feind und führt den Kampf für seinen Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A7","text":"Die Niederlage eines Gedankens kann durch Redlichkeit in einen Triumph verwandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","text":"Frieden besitzt seinen Wert als Mittel zu neuen Kriegen, wobei der kurze Frieden dem langen vorzuziehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","text":"Arbeit soll als Kampf und Frieden als Sieg bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","text":"Der gute Krieg heiligt die Sache, nicht die vorausgesetzte Güte einer Sache den Krieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","text":"Tapferkeit besitzt gegenüber Mitleid und Nächstenliebe die höhere rettende Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A12","text":"Das Gute wird durch Tapferkeit und nicht durch Schönheit, Rührung oder Sanftheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A13","text":"Ein würdiger Feind ist zu hassen, nicht zu verachten, und sein Erfolg kann dem eigenen Erfolg zugerechnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","text":"Vornehmheit besteht in Gehorsam, wobei eigenes Befehlen selbst als Gehorchen organisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A15","text":"Der höchste Gedanke des Lebens lautet, dass der Mensch überwunden werden soll, und dieser Gedanke wird befohlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A16","text":"Das Leben des Kriegers ist als Leben des Gehorsams und des Krieges höher zu bewerten als seine bloße Verlängerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX1","text":"Das System definiert Wahrheit nicht als Schonung durch Liebe oder Feindschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX2","text":"Größe ist nicht die Abwesenheit von Hass und Neid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX3","text":"Erkenntnisheiligkeit ist nicht der unmittelbare Ausgangspunkt; ihr geht die Gestalt des Kriegsmannes voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX4","text":"Der Soldat ist nicht schon aufgrund seiner einförmigen äußeren Form ein Kriegsmann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX5","text":"Arbeit ist nicht als friedliche Tätigkeit vom Kampf getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX6","text":"Frieden ist nicht der endgültige Zweck des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX7","text":"Nächstenliebe und Mitleid sind nicht die primären Kräfte der Rettung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX8","text":"Das Gute ist nicht durch das Hübsche, Rührende oder Sanfte definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX9","text":"Der Feind darf nicht zum bloßen Gegenstand der Verachtung werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX10","text":"Auflehnung ist nicht die höchste Form von Vornehmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX11","text":"Der eigene Wille ist nicht der höchste Maßstab des Kriegsmannes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX12","text":"Lang-Leben und Schonung sind nicht die obersten Güter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D1","text":"Hass und Neid werden aus beschämenden Defekten in anzunehmende Bestandteile der Selbstüberwindung umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D2","text":"Der Kriegsmann wird durch eine gerichtete Feindsuche und nicht durch militärische Zugehörigkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A5","CH_97E9_VKUK:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D3","text":"Der Kampf erhält Vorrang vor der bloßen Arbeit, weil beide als Formen derselben kriegerischen Tätigkeit klassifiziert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","text":"Frieden wird zu einer taktischen Unterbrechung und nicht zu einer Aufhebung des Konflikts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D5","text":"Der Wert einer Sache wird nach der Qualität des Krieges bestimmt, durch den sie getragen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D6","text":"Tapferkeit ersetzt Mitleid als bevorzugtes Kriterium wirksamer Rettung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D7","text":"Die Anerkennung eines starken Feindes verwandelt dessen Erfolg in eine Steigerung des eigenen Erfolgs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","text":"Gehorsam wird nicht als Gegensatz zum Befehlen, sondern als dessen innere Form konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D9","text":"Der höchste Lebensgedanke erscheint nicht als selbstgewählte Einsicht, sondern als auferlegte Aufgabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D10","text":"Die Niederlage eines Gedankens entwertet den Kämpfer nicht, sofern die Redlichkeit den Ausgang überdauert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D11","text":"Das menschliche Leben wird als Übergang zur Überwindung des Menschen und nicht als Erhaltung einer gegebenen Form bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A15","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1","text":"Der Text ordnet sämtliche zentralen Werte — Arbeit, Frieden, Güte, Rettung und Lebensdauer — einer kriegerischen Wertungslogik unter.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","text":"Das Subjekt entsteht nicht aus autonomem Selbstbesitz, sondern aus Feindsuche, Befehl, Gehorsam und der Verpflichtung zur Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","text":"Der äußere Krieg wird in eine innere und zeitliche Struktur verlängert, in der Gedankenniederlage, Selbstüberwindung und zukünftige Größe zusammengehören.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","CH_97E9_VKUK:A7","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD4","text":"Liebe und Feindschaft bilden keine Gegensätze, sondern zwei Funktionen derselben unschonenden Erziehungsbeziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A1","CH_97E9_VKUK:A2","CH_97E9_VKUK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD5","text":"Heiligkeit der Erkenntnis wird als zukünftige Möglichkeit erzeugt, deren Vorbedingung eine kriegerische Disziplinierung des Menschen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","text":"Krieg wird von einer einzelnen Tätigkeit zu einer Totalform umgebaut, die Denken, Arbeiten, Frieden, Moral und Lebensführung organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine moralische Ordnung aus, deren Geltung unabhängig von Krieg, Sieg und Tapferkeit besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine konfliktfreie Form von Erkenntnis und Größe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX3","text":"Es schließt Mitleid als hinreichenden Grund moralischer Rettung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4","text":"Es schließt den autonomen Willen als letzte Quelle von Wert und Handlung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX5","text":"Es schließt einen Feindbegriff aus, der auf bloßer Verachtung oder Ausschaltung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX6","text":"Es schließt Frieden als selbstgenügsame politische oder existenzielle Ordnung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX7","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, der Mensch besitze bereits eine zu bewahrende endgültige Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX8","text":"Es schließt eine Gleichsetzung von Selbstbestimmung und eigenem Wollen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines nichtkriegerischen Maßstabs, an dem Krieg selbst beurteilt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX2","text":"Er behandelt eine endgültige Versöhnung von Feind, Frieden und Selbst als nicht verfügbare Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX3","text":"Er hält ein sich selbst gründendes Subjekt ohne Befehl, Gegner und Überwindungsaufgabe für unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX4","text":"Er setzt die Abwesenheit einer abgeschlossenen menschlichen Form voraus, damit Überwindung als höchster Gedanke fungieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX5","text":"Er entzieht dem langen Frieden und dem langen Leben jede eigenständige normative Endgültigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS1","text":"Brüderliche Liebe plus feindliche Schonungslosigkeit → Wahrheit als Prüfung innerhalb einer asymmetrischen Erziehungsbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS2","text":"Hass, Neid, Scham und äußerer Soldatenhabitus → Diagnose eines unzureichend geformten Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","text":"Diagnose → Umwandlung des Soldaten in den feindsuchenden Kriegsmann und des Gedankens in einen Kampfgegenstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS4","text":"Kriegsmann plus Kampf → Neurahmung von Arbeit als Kampf, Frieden als Sieg und Krieg als Wertquelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS5","text":"Neurahmung der Werte → Vorrang von Tapferkeit vor Mitleid und des guten Krieges vor der vorausgesetzten Güte einer Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS6","text":"Vorrang des Krieges → Disziplinierung durch Gehorsam, Befehl und Annahme des höchsten Gedankens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7","text":"Gehorsam plus höchster Gedanke → Leben als Krieg und als fortgesetzte Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AF1","text":"Schonungsbedürftige Soldatenidentität → unschonende Wahrheit zwischen Liebe und Feindschaft → Umwandlung des Soldaten in den Kriegsmann → Instrumentalisierung des Friedens und Militarisierung der Arbeit → Vorrang von Krieg und Tapferkeit → Feind als konstitutiver Gegner → Gehorsam als Vornehmheit → Mensch als zu überwindendes Übergangswesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME1","text":"Die Karte verschiebt die Unterscheidung Soldat/Kriegsmann von äußerer Zugehörigkeit zu innerer Feindsuche und gedanklicher Kampfbereitschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME2","text":"Frieden und Arbeit werden aus autonomen Lebensbereichen in taktische Formen des Krieges umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME3","text":"Der Feind wird vom zu beseitigenden Hindernis zum konstitutiven Maßstab eigener Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Gehorsam und Selbstbestimmung wird durch die Identifikation von Befehlen und innerem Befehlen destabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Krieg und Moral bricht zusammen, weil der Krieg selbst zur Quelle der Heiligung und Wertsetzung wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6","text":"Der Mensch wird von einer zu erhaltenden Identität zu einer vorläufigen Position in einem Prozess der Überwindung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text fordert vom Kriegsmann Feindsuche, Kampf, Tapferkeit, Frieden als Sieg und Gehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","text":"Structural — Er organisiert Affekte, Gegner, Arbeit, Frieden und Moral durch eine hierarchische Kriegsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Er ersetzt passive Schonung, bloße Arbeit, autonome Willkür und moralische Selbstberuhigung durch Kampf, Befehl und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Er setzt den Menschen als nicht abgeschlossene Übergangsform und das Leben als gerichteten Prozess über die gegenwärtige Gestalt hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der unschonenden Brüderlichkeit über den Kriegsmann zum überwindbaren Menschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche konkrete Gestalt der höchste Gedanke nach der Überwindung des Menschen annehmen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist lokal kohärent, weil alle Werte konsequent in eine kriegerische und hierarchische Ordnung überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die systemische Umklassifizierung von Frieden, Arbeit, Feind und Moral als Funktionen des Krieges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT5","text":"Eine zentrale Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Liebe zum Bruder und der prinzipiellen Verweigerung von Schonung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass Gehorsam als Vornehmheit gilt, während der höchste Gedanke zugleich als fremder Befehl gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","text":"Die Gleichsetzung von gutem Krieg und heiliger Sache droht die Wertordnung zirkulär zu schließen: Der Krieg heiligt die Sache, deren Wert durch den Krieg bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern Krieg nicht als Einzelereignis, sondern als generatives Prinzip der gesamten Lebensordnung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195109762535Z_a180a7c6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On War and Warrior Peoples","source_sha256":"f80a007feba15c54e66a3afb5913ad5d4e6779a69541ebe2745335a493d6470d","sha256":"b77c66cda068f58f0c758daeee807fe0c0b0c8701a68914e78149023f51e6e63","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:51:09.764958+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS1","text":"The text posits an unsparing truth between brotherly love and hostile testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS2","text":"It redefines the soldier as a warrior whose identity arises through the search for a worthy enemy and the struggle for an idea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS3","text":"It subordinates peace, work, morality, and salvation to the primacy of war, victory, and courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS4","text":"It transforms hatred, envy, malice, and arrogance from affects to be concealed into forces of greatness to be embraced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS5","text":"It replaces autonomous self-determination with commanded obedience, which presents itself as genuine nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AS6","text":"The movement culminates in positing the human being as a being that is to be overcome, and life as obedience and war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A1","text":"Truth demands that neither enmity nor love be sparingly exempted from testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A2","text":"Brotherly love and hostile antagonism can coexist within the same relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A3","text":"Hatred and envy belong to imperfect greatness and must not be repressed through shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","text":"Warriors are companions and forerunners of a possible sanctity of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A5","text":"An outward soldierly habitus is insufficient to constitute a warrior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","text":"The warrior seeks an enemy and wages the struggle for his idea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A7","text":"The defeat of an idea can be transformed into a triumph through integrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","text":"Peace has its value as a means to new wars, whereby short peace is preferable to long peace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","text":"Work is to be determined as struggle and peace as victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","text":"Good war sanctifies the cause, not the presupposed goodness of a cause the war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","text":"Courage possesses a higher salvific efficacy than pity and neighborly love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A12","text":"The good is determined by courage and not by beauty, sentiment, or gentleness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A13","text":"A worthy enemy is to be hated, not despised, and his success can be counted as one's own success.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","text":"Nobility consists in obedience, whereby commanding oneself is itself organized as obeying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A15","text":"The highest thought of life is that the human being is to be overcome, and this thought is commanded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:A16","text":"The life of the warrior, as a life of obedience and war, is to be valued more highly than its mere prolongation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX1","text":"The system does not define truth as sparingness through love or enmity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX2","text":"Greatness is not the absence of hatred and envy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX3","text":"Sanctity of knowledge is not the immediate point of departure; it is preceded by the figure of the warrior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX4","text":"The soldier is not already a warrior on account of his uniform external form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX5","text":"Work is not separated from struggle as a peaceful activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX6","text":"Peace is not the ultimate purpose of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX7","text":"Neighborly love and pity are not the primary forces of salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX8","text":"The good is not defined by the pretty, the moving, or the gentle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX9","text":"The enemy must not become a mere object of contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX10","text":"Rebellion is not the highest form of nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX11","text":"One's own will is not the warrior's highest standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:NX12","text":"Long life and sparingness are not the highest goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D1","text":"Hatred and envy are recoded from shameful defects into components of self-overcoming to be embraced.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D2","text":"The warrior is determined by a directed search for enemies and not by military affiliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A5","CH_97E9_VKUK:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D3","text":"Struggle takes precedence over mere work because both are classified as forms of the same warlike activity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","text":"Peace becomes a tactical interruption rather than an abolition of conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D5","text":"The value of a cause is determined by the quality of the war through which it is sustained.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D6","text":"Courage replaces pity as the preferred criterion of effective salvation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D7","text":"Recognition of a strong enemy transforms his success into an increase in one's own success.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","text":"Obedience is constructed not as the opposite of commanding, but as its inner form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D9","text":"The highest thought of life appears not as a self-chosen insight, but as an imposed task.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D10","text":"The defeat of an idea does not devalue the fighter, provided that integrity outlasts the outcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:D11","text":"Human life is determined as a transition toward overcoming the human being, and not as the preservation of a given form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A15","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1","text":"The text subordinates all central values — work, peace, goodness, salvation, and duration of life — to a warlike logic of valuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:A12","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","text":"The subject arises not from autonomous self-possession, but from the search for enemies, command, obedience, and the obligation to self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A14","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","text":"External war is extended into an inner and temporal structure in which the defeat of ideas, self-overcoming, and future greatness belong together.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","CH_97E9_VKUK:A7","CH_97E9_VKUK:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD4","text":"Love and enmity form not opposites, but two functions of the same unsparing pedagogical relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A1","CH_97E9_VKUK:A2","CH_97E9_VKUK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD5","text":"Sanctity of knowledge is generated as a future possibility whose precondition is a warlike disciplining of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A4","CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","text":"War is reconfigured from an individual activity into a total form that organizes thinking, working, peace, morality, and conduct of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:A6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:A9","CH_97E9_VKUK:A10","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a moral order whose validity exists independently of war, victory, and courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX2","text":"It excludes a conflict-free form of knowledge and greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX3","text":"It excludes pity as a sufficient ground of moral salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4","text":"It excludes the autonomous will as the ultimate source of value and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX5","text":"It excludes a concept of the enemy that rests on mere contempt or elimination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX6","text":"It excludes peace as a self-sufficient political or existential order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX7","text":"It excludes the assumption that the human being already possesses a final form to be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX8","text":"It excludes an equation of self-determination with one's own willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a non-warlike standard by which war itself could be judged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX2","text":"It treats a final reconciliation of enemy, peace, and self as an unavailable possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX3","text":"It considers a self-grounding subject without command, opponent, and task of overcoming to be insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX4","text":"It presupposes the absence of a completed human form so that overcoming can function as the highest thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX5","text":"It deprives long peace and long life of any independent normative finality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS1","text":"Brotherly love plus hostile unsparingness → truth as testing within an asymmetrical pedagogical relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS2","text":"Hatred, envy, shame, and outward soldierly habitus → diagnosis of an insufficiently formed subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","text":"Diagnosis → transformation of the soldier into the enemy-seeking warrior and of the idea into an object of struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS4","text":"Warrior plus struggle → reframing of work as struggle, peace as victory, and war as a source of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS5","text":"Reframing of values → primacy of courage over pity and of good war over the presupposed goodness of a cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS6","text":"Primacy of war → disciplining through obedience, command, and acceptance of the highest thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7","text":"Obedience plus highest thought → life as war and as the continued overcoming of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:AF1","text":"Soldierly identity in need of sparingness → unsparing truth between love and enmity → transformation of the soldier into the warrior → instrumentalization of peace and militarization of work → primacy of war and courage → enemy as constitutive opponent → obedience as nobility → human being as a transitional being to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME1","text":"The map shifts the distinction between soldier and warrior from external affiliation to an inner search for enemies and intellectual readiness for struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME2","text":"Peace and work are reclassified from autonomous domains of life into tactical forms of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME3","text":"The enemy is remapped from an obstacle to be eliminated into a constitutive measure of one's own greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME4","text":"The opposition between obedience and self-determination is destabilized through the identification of commanding and inner commanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME5","text":"The opposition between war and morality collapses because war itself becomes the source of sanctification and value-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6","text":"The human being is remapped from an identity to be preserved into a provisional position in a process of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text demands of the warrior the search for enemies, struggle, courage, peace as victory, and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","text":"Structural — It organizes affects, opponents, work, peace, and morality through a hierarchical form of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — It replaces passive sparingness, mere work, autonomous arbitrariness, and moral self-reassurance with struggle, command, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — It posits the human being as an unfinished transitional form and life as a directed process beyond its present form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from unsparing brotherliness through the warrior to the human being capable of being overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what concrete form the highest thought is to assume after the overcoming of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT3","text":"The structure is locally coherent because all values are consistently transferred into a warlike and hierarchical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the systemic reclassification of peace, work, enemy, and morality as functions of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT5","text":"A central tension remains between the asserted love for the brother and the principled refusal of sparingness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that obedience counts as nobility, while the highest thought is at the same time posited as an alien command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","text":"The equation of good war and holy cause threatens to close the order of value circularly: war sanctifies the cause whose value is determined by war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement provided that war is read not as an individual event, but as the generative principle of the entire order of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUK:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VKUK@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VKUK:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 20","title":"On War and Warriors","context":"Chapter 20","original_title":"Vom Krieg und Kriegsvolke","original_context":"Chapter 20"},"original_title":"Vom Krieg und Kriegsvolke","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT","layer":"CH","title":"On the New Idol","order":21,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VNGT"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VNGT@R001","sha256":"acdfa72523baed2014b1cba5a6dda454621ee475dcfafe5e9a551da03a13784e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS1","text":"Die Rede setzt Volk und Staat als gegensätzliche Formen kollektiver Existenz an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS2","text":"Sie bestimmt das Volk als schöpferische, lebensdienliche und sprachlich-eigenständige Bildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS3","text":"Sie entlarvt den Staat als falsche Identifikation mit dem Volk, als Diebstahl und als organisierte Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS4","text":"Die polemisch-diagnostische Bewegung führt von der staatlichen Selbstbeschreibung zu ihrer Funktion für die Überflüssigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS5","text":"Die staatliche Funktion besteht darin, Masse, Tugend, Müdigkeit, Besitz- und Machtbegehren in kollektive Selbstauflösung umzuwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS6","text":"Die strategische Folgerung führt aus der Götzendienerei heraus in ein freies, armes und nichtüberflüssiges Menschsein jenseits des Staates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A1","text":"Volk und Staat sind gegensätzliche Formen kollektiver Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","text":"Völker werden durch schöpferische Kräfte hervorgebracht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A3","text":"Gemeinsamer Glaube und gemeinsame Liebe ordnen das Volk auf das Leben hin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","text":"Jedes Volk bildet seine eigene Sprache des Guten und Bösen in Sitten und Rechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A5","text":"Der Staat behauptet fälschlich, selbst das Volk zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A6","text":"Der Staat wird von Vernichtern als Falle für Viele errichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","text":"Der Staat lügt in den Sprachen des Guten und Bösen und eignet sich das, was er besitzt, durch Diebstahl an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A8","text":"Die staatliche Sprachverwirrung bezeichnet einen Willen zum Tode.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","text":"Der Staat wird für die Überflüssigen erfunden, sobald die Vielen als Übermaß erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","text":"Der Staat lockt, verschlingt und verarbeitet die Überflüssigen als Masse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","text":"Der Staat legitimiert sich durch den Anspruch, die höchste ordnende und göttliche Instanz zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","text":"Der Staat gewinnt große Seelen durch Müdigkeit, Ehren, gute Gewissen und die Käuflichkeit ihrer Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A13","text":"Der Staat stellt ein Sterben für Viele als Leben dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","text":"Die Überflüssigen verwandeln Aneignung in Bildung, Krankheit in öffentliche Rede und Besitz in Verarmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A15","text":"Die Überflüssigen verwechseln Macht, Aufstieg und Thron mit Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","text":"Jenseits des Staates beginnen freies Leben, geringe Armut, Einsamkeit, der nichtüberflüssige Mensch und die einmalige Weise des Notwendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX1","text":"Der Staat ist nicht das Volk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX2","text":"Der Staat ist keine schöpferische und lebensdienliche Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX3","text":"Die staatliche Sprache ist keine eigene Sprache eines Volkes, sondern Sprachverwirrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX4","text":"Die staatliche Selbstbezeichnung als Volk ist keine Wahrheit, sondern Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX5","text":"Staatlicher Besitz ist kein legitimer Besitz, sondern angeeignetes Gut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX6","text":"Staatliche Ordnung ist keine göttliche Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX7","text":"Staatlich anerkannte Tugend und Ehre bewahren keine autonome Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX8","text":"Kollektives Sterben ist kein Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX9","text":"Bildung, Zeitung, Reichtum und Macht bezeichnen bei den Überflüssigen nicht ihre behauptete Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX10","text":"Der Thron ist kein Sitz des Glücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX11","text":"Der Staat ist nicht der Anfang oder die Vollendung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX12","text":"Befreiung besteht nicht in der Anbetung oder Besteigung des staatlichen Zentrums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","text":"Der Staat kann das Volk nur dadurch repräsentieren, dass er dessen schöpferischen Ursprung durch eine falsche Identität ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D2","text":"Die staatliche Universalität entsteht als Überlagerung der unterschiedlichen Sprachen, Sitten und Rechte der Völker.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D3","text":"Der Staat fungiert als Fang- und Verarbeitungsapparat für die Überflüssigen, nicht als deren gemeinsames Lebensmedium.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D4","text":"Der Staat verwandelt die Selbstauflösung der Vielen durch religiöse, moralische und politische Sprache in den Schein des Lebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A8","CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D5","text":"Die Eroberung des alten Gottes schützt die großen Seelen nicht vor neuer Unterwerfung, weil ihre Müdigkeit staatlich verwertbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D6","text":"Tugend wird im Staat von einer schöpferischen Kraft zu einem Lockmittel für die Masse umfunktioniert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D7","text":"Die Praktiken der Überflüssigen bilden ein einheitliches Muster aus Aneignung, Krankheit, Selbstverarmung und hierarchischem Aufstieg.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","CH_97E9_VNGT:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D8","text":"Der Austritt aus dem Staat wird als positive Bedingung eines nichtüberflüssigen Menschseins bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1","text":"Der Staat erscheint als totalisierende Anti-Lebensform, weil er Sprache, Besitz, Moral, Tugend und Masse in eine Ordnung der Selbstvernichtung integriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2","text":"Die Kategorie des Überflüssigen bezeichnet nicht bloß zahlenmäßigen Überschuss, sondern eine staatlich verwertbare Form des massenhaften Selbstverlusts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13","CH_97E9_VNGT:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD3","text":"Die Überwindung eines alten Gottes bleibt unzureichend, wenn die freigewordene Müdigkeit in den Dienst eines neuen Götzen tritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","text":"Die strategische Alternative zum Staat ist nicht seine Eroberung, sondern die räumliche und soziale Entfernung von seiner Götzendienerei.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A15","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5","text":"Der Mensch und der Übermensch werden als Möglichkeiten an der Grenze des Staates bestimmt, nicht als dessen institutionelle Produkte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A1","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Staat, der das Volk wahrhaft repräsentiert, ohne dessen schöpferische Eigenständigkeit zu zerstören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine universale politische Sprache, die die unterschiedlichen Sprachen der Völker unverändert bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein neutraler Staat, der Zwang, Ordnung und Macht dauerhaft mit dem Leben vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine staatliche Einbindung der Tugend, die deren schöpferischen Ursprung unangetastet lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Massenordnung, in der Vielheit nicht in Überflüssigkeit und Selbstverlust umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Bildung, Besitz oder Macht innerhalb der staatlichen Ordnung ihren eigenen Namen erfüllen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die politische Befreiung durch Aufstieg zum Thron oder durch Übernahme des staatlichen Zentrums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines mit dem Leben versöhnten und zugleich legitimen Staates bleibt unzugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer gemeinsamen politischen Welt jenseits von Masse und Einsamkeit wird nicht bereitgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3","text":"Eine positive institutionelle Form des Lebens nach dem Staat bleibt unformuliert; verfügbar ist zunächst nur der Austritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX4","text":"Der Übermensch kann nicht als staatliches Ziel, Produkt oder Erziehungsresultat erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX5","text":"Die Rede schließt eine Versöhnung von staatlicher Totalität und einmaliger, unersetzlicher Existenz aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS1","text":"Schöpferische Hervorbringung plus gemeinsamer Glaube und Liebe plus eigene Sprache erzeugen das lebensdienliche Volk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS2","text":"Falsche Identifikation mit dem Volk plus universale Sprachverwirrung plus Diebstahl erzeugen den Staat als kaltes Ungeheuer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS3","text":"Übermaß der Vielen plus staatliche Lockung plus Verschlingung erzeugen die verwaltete Masse der Überflüssigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS4","text":"Staatliche Autorität plus vereinnahmte Tugend plus gute Gewissen verwandeln Müdigkeit und Exzellenz in Köder für die Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS5","text":"Aneignung plus Krankheit plus Selbstverarmung plus Thronbegehren erzeugen die soziale Gestalt des Überflüssigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021",