che Identifikation → staatliche Sprachverwirrung und Diebstahl → Staat als Falle für die Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF2","text":"Übermaß der Vielen → Erfindung des Staates für die Überflüssigen → Verschlingung und Selbstverlust → Sterben wird als Leben ausgegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF3","text":"Müdigkeit großer Seelen → staatliche Vereinnahmung von Tugend und Ehre → neue Götzendienerei → Entfernung vom Staat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-gr