tructural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME2","text":"Einheit wird nicht länger als sprachliche oder moralische Gemeinsamkeit, sondern als staatlich erzeugte Verwirrung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME3","text":"Die Überflüssigen werden von einer bloßen Masse zu einer durch staatliche Anziehung, Verarbeitung und Selbstauflösung bestimmten politischen Kategorie umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME4","text":"Tugend, Ehre und gutes Gewissen werden von autonomen Werten zu verwertbaren Ressourcen staatlicher Massenbindung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME5","text":"Die Gegensätze Leben und Tod, Bildung und Diebstahl, Reichtum und Verarmung, Macht und Unvermögen werden als staatliche Verkehrungen derselben Ordnung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME6","text":"Der politische Horizont verschiebt sich vom Thron zur Schwelle des Austritts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME7","text":"Das Menschliche wird nicht als staatlich erreichter Zustand, sondern als nachstaatlicher Möglichkeitsraum klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Staat wird als kaltes Ungeheuer, Lügner, Dieb und neuer Götze angeredet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2","text":"Structural: Der Staat organisiert Sprache, Recht, Besitz, Moral, Masse, Tugend und Macht als zusammenhängenden Mechanismus der Selbstauflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Kampf wird von der Besteigung des Thrones auf Distanzierung, Fensterbruch, Weggang und Freihaltung großer Seelen umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Der Mensch beginnt erst dort, wo der Staat endet; der Übermensch erscheint als Übergangs- und Brückenmöglichkeit jenseits dieser Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundopposition von lebensdienlichem Volk und lebensverneinendem Staat zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die staatliche Erfassung der Überflüssigen und die Umbenennung des Sterbens in Leben abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die historische Referenz des Staates, die genaue Verfassung des Volkes und die institutionelle Form des Lebens nach dem Staat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist innerhalb ihrer polemisch-symbolischen Totalisierung kohärent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle liegt in der Verbindung von Sprachlüge, Aneignung, Tugendvereinnahmung und kollektiver Selbstvernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT6","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle liegt in der Gleichsetzung staatlicher Ordnung mit einer einzigen, durchgehend lebensfeindlichen Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT7","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass das Volk durch eigene Sitten und Rechte bestimmt wird, während die nachstaatliche Ordnung keine entsprechende kollektive Vermittlung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT8","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass große Seelen zugleich als autonome Kräfte und als durch Müdigkeit staatlich verfügbare Ressourcen erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Entlarvung über Funktionsdiagnose und Vereinnahmung bis zum strategischen Austritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195227551131Z_623f417c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the New Idol","source_sha256":"acdfa72523baed2014b1cba5a6dda454621ee475dcfafe5e9a551da03a13784e","sha256":"d815f16fe035952b285c1bd0e9f4fcef4955daac110c588a3bf1f9ee26364b99","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:52:27.552158+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS1","text":"The discourse posits people and state as opposing forms of collective existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS2","text":"It determines the people as a creative, life-serving, and linguistically autonomous formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS3","text":"It exposes the state as a false identification with the people, as theft, and as organized destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS4","text":"The polemical-diagnostic movement leads from the state's self-description to its function for the superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS5","text":"The state's function consists in transforming mass, virtue, weariness, and the desire for possession and power into collective self-dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AS6","text":"The strategic consequence leads out of idolatry into a free, poor, and non-superfluous humanity beyond the state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A1","text":"People and state are opposing forms of collective existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","text":"Peoples are brought forth by creative forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A3","text":"Common faith and common love orient the people toward life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","text":"Each people forms its own language of good and evil in customs and laws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A5","text":"The state falsely claims to be the people itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A6","text":"The state is erected by destroyers as a trap for the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","text":"The state lies in the languages of good and evil and appropriates what it possesses through theft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A8","text":"The state's confusion of languages designates a will to death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","text":"The state is invented for the superfluous as soon as the many appear as an excess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","text":"The state entices, devours, and processes the superfluous as a mass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","text":"The state legitimates itself through the claim to be the highest ordering and divine authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","text":"The state wins over great souls through weariness, honors, good consciences, and the purchasability of their virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A13","text":"The state presents a dying for the many as life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","text":"The superfluous transform appropriation into education, sickness into public discourse, and possession into impoverishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A15","text":"The superfluous mistake power, ascent, and the throne for happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","text":"Beyond the state begin free life, modest poverty, solitude, the non-superfluous human being, and the singular way of what is necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX1","text":"The state is not the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX2","text":"The state is not a creative and life-serving production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX3","text":"The language of the state is not a people's own language, but confusion of languages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX4","text":"The state's self-designation as people is not truth, but a lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX5","text":"State possession is not legitimate possession, but appropriated goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX6","text":"State order is not divine order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX7","text":"State-recognized virtue and honor preserve no autonomous purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX8","text":"Collective dying is not life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX9","text":"Among the superfluous, education, newspaper, wealth, and power do not designate their asserted function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX10","text":"The throne is not a seat of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX11","text":"The state is not the beginning or the completion of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:NX12","text":"Liberation does not consist in the worship or ascent of the state center.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","text":"The state can represent the people only by replacing its creative origin with a false identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D2","text":"State universality arises as an overlaying of the differing languages, customs, and laws of peoples.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D3","text":"The state functions as an apparatus for capturing and processing the superfluous, not as their common medium of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D4","text":"Through religious, moral, and political language, the state transforms the self-dissolution of the many into the semblance of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A8","CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D5","text":"The conquest of the old god does not protect great souls from new subjugation, because their weariness becomes usable by the state.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D6","text":"In the state, virtue is repurposed from a creative force into a lure for the mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D7","text":"The practices of the superfluous form a unified pattern of appropriation, sickness, self-impoverishment, and hierarchical ascent.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","CH_97E9_VNGT:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:D8","text":"Withdrawal from the state is determined as a positive condition of non-superfluous humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1","text":"The state appears as a totalizing anti-form of life because it integrates language, possession, morality, virtue, and mass into an order of self-destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A4","CH_97E9_VNGT:A7","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2","text":"The category of the superfluous designates not merely numerical excess, but a form of mass self-loss usable by the state.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A9","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13","CH_97E9_VNGT:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD3","text":"The overcoming of an old god remains insufficient if the liberated weariness enters into the service of a new idol.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A11","CH_97E9_VNGT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","text":"The strategic alternative to the state is not its conquest, but spatial and social removal from its idolatry.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A15","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5","text":"The human being and the overhuman are determined as possibilities at the boundary of the state, not as its institutional products.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A1","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a state that truly represents the people without destroying its creative autonomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a universal political language that preserves the differing languages of peoples unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a neutral state that durably mediates coercion, order, and power with life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a state incorporation of virtue that leaves its creative origin untouched.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX5","text":"Excluded is an order of mass in which multiplicity does not turn into superfluity and self-loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the assumption that education, possession, or power within the state order fulfill their own name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX7","text":"Excluded is political liberation through ascent to the throne or through taking over the state center.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a legitimate state reconciled with life remains inaccessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2","text":"The possibility of a shared political world beyond mass and solitude is not provided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3","text":"A positive institutional form of life after the state remains unformulated; initially, only withdrawal is available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX4","text":"The overhuman cannot appear as a state goal, product, or result of education.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX5","text":"The discourse excludes a reconciliation of state totality and singular, irreplaceable existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS1","text":"Creative production plus common faith and love plus an own language generate the life-serving people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS2","text":"False identification with the people plus universal confusion of languages plus theft generate the state as a cold monster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS3","text":"Excess of the many plus state enticement plus devouring generate the administered mass of the superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS4","text":"State authority plus appropriated virtue plus good consciences transform weariness and excellence into bait for the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS5","text":"Appropriation plus sickness plus self-impoverishment plus desire for the throne generate the social figure of the superfluous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS6","text":"Naming dying as life plus collective self-loss generate the state's will to death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS7","text":"Distance from the state plus modest poverty plus free solitude open the space for the non-superfluous human being and the bridges of the overhuman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF1","text":"People as creative multiplicity → state as false identification → state confusion of languages and theft → state as trap for the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF2","text":"Excess of the many → invention of the state for the superfluous → devouring and self-loss → dying is passed off as life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF3","text":"Weariness of great souls → state appropriation of virtue and honor → new idolatry → distance from the state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:AF4","text":"Withdrawal from the state order → free earth and modest poverty → song of the necessary → beginning of the human being and transition to the overhuman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME1","text":"The state is remapped from a political community into an anti-people apparatus of capture and appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME2","text":"Unity is no longer visible as linguistic or moral commonality, but as confusion produced by the state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME3","text":"The superfluous are reclassified from a mere mass into a political category determined by state attraction, processing, and self-dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME4","text":"Virtue, honor, and good conscience are remapped from autonomous values into usable resources of state mass-binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME5","text":"The oppositions life and death, education and theft, wealth and impoverishment, power and incapacity become legible as state inversions of the same order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME6","text":"The political horizon shifts from the throne to the threshold of withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ME7","text":"The human is classified not as a condition attained by the state, but as a post-state space of possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT1","text":"Surface: The state is addressed as a cold monster, liar, thief, and new idol.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2","text":"Structural: The state organizes language, law, possession, morality, mass, virtue, and power as a coherent mechanism of self-dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The struggle is shifted from ascending the throne to distancing, window-breaking, departure, and keeping great souls free.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The human being begins only where the state ends; the overhuman appears as a possibility of transition and bridge beyond this boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the fundamental opposition between the life-serving people and the life-negating state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to derive the state's capture of the superfluous and the renaming of dying as life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT3","text":"The historical referent of the state, the precise constitution of the people, and the institutional form of life after the state remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent within its polemical-symbolic totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT5","text":"Its strongest point lies in the connection of linguistic lie, appropriation, appropriation of virtue, and collective self-destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT6","text":"Its weakest point lies in the equation of state order with a single, consistently life-hostile function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT7","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the people is determined through its own customs and laws, while the post-state order receives no corresponding collective mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT8","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that great souls appear both as autonomous forces and as resources made available to the state through weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from exposure through functional diagnosis and appropriation to strategic withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VNGT:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VNGT@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VNGT:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 21","title":"On the New Idol","context":"Chapter 21","original_title":"Vom neuen Götzen","original_context":"Chapter 21"},"original_title":"Vom neuen Götzen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD","layer":"CH","title":"On the Flies of the Marketplace","order":22,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDFD"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDFD@R001","sha256":"b4b4327971f41315c12fe5ee4505f792e949f38c21583af2a65a7c2d1171838e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS1","text":"Der Text stellt den Markt als Lärm- und Schauspielordnung dar, in der öffentliche Wirkung an die Stelle schöpferischer Größe tritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt die „grossen Männer“ des Volkes als Aufführer, deren Macht aus erzeugtem Glauben und nicht aus Wahrheit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS3","text":"Er erklärt die Unsichtbarkeit der Schöpfer neuer Werte und die Sichtbarkeit der Schauspieler durch die Wahrnehmungslogik des Marktes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS4","text":"Er verschiebt die Diagnose von öffentlicher Täuschung zu persönlicher Verwundbarkeit durch Nähe, Lob, Stiche und verdeckte Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS5","text":"Er kontrastiert die schnelle, wechselnde Marktzeit mit der langsamen Tiefe des Erlebens und Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS6","text":"Die diagnostisch-strategische Bewegung führt von Marktanalyse über Verletzungsdiagnose zur Flucht in die Einsamkeit als Schutz des Schöpferischen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","text":"Einsamkeit ermöglicht Schweigen, starke Luft, langsames Erleben und schöpferische Sammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","text":"Der Markt beginnt mit dem Ende der Einsamkeit und organisiert sich durch Lärm, Schauspiel und erzwungene Entscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","text":"Das Volk erkennt vor allem Aufführer großer Dinge und begreift das Schaffende nur unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","text":"Die Erfinder neuer Werte wirken abseits von Markt und Ruhm, während sich die Welt unsichtbar um ihre Schöpfungen dreht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","text":"Der Schauspieler bemisst Beweis an der Fähigkeit, Glauben zu erzeugen, nicht an der Geltung des Geglaubten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A6","text":"Der Markt verwirft Wahrheiten, die keinen Lärm erzeugen, und behandelt Umwerfen, Tollmachen und Blut als überzeugende Gründe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","text":"Die Kleinen erfahren großes Dasein als Anklage ihrer eigenen Niedrigkeit und Schuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","text":"Nähe, Lob und scheinbare Liebenswürdigkeit der Kleinen können als Zugriffe, Schmeichelei und verdeckte Wehtaten gegen den Großen funktionieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","text":"Viele kleine Verletzungen können einen großen Bau aushöhlen und schließlich zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","text":"Der Tiefe leidet besonders stark an kleinen Wunden, während Stolz und Milde seine gewaltsame Gegenwehr hemmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","text":"Die Kleinen sind unzählbar, sodass unmittelbare Gegenwehr weder wirksam noch die Aufgabe des Großen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","text":"Der Rückzug in Einsamkeit und raue, starke Luft schützt vor Marktzwang, Nähe und kumulativer Verletzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX1","text":"Größe ist nicht identisch mit öffentlichem Ruhm, zeitweiliger Herrschaft oder sichtbarer Aufführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX2","text":"Schöpfer neuer Werte sind nicht mit Schauspielern großer Sachen gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3","text":"Überzeugungskraft ist kein Beweis für Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX4","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht an das erzwungene „Ja“ oder „Nein“ des Marktes gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX5","text":"Lob, Schmeichelei und Liebenswürdigkeit sind nicht ohne Weiteres Ausdruck von Liebe oder Achtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX6","text":"Die scheinbare Unschuld der Kleinen hebt die Wirkung ihrer Rache und Wehtaten nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX7","text":"Milde gegenüber den Kleinen begründet keine wechselseitige Anerkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX8","text":"Der Wahrheitsliebende ist nicht zur unmittelbaren Bekämpfung jeder einzelnen Fliege bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","text":"Die Marktordnung löst öffentliche Anerkennung von schöpferischer Wertschöpfung und bindet sie an Aufführung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","text":"Der Markt erzeugt eine Erkenntnisordnung, in der die Wirkung auf den Glauben den Wahrheitsgehalt ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","text":"Die schnelle und wechselhafte Marktzeit kann die langsame Entstehungszeit tiefer Erfahrung nicht angemessen aufnehmen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D4","text":"Die öffentliche Sichtbarkeit des Großen verwandelt seine Tugenden und seine bloße Anwesenheit in Anlässe für Ressentiment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D5","text":"Kleine, nicht notwendig bewusst bösartige Schädigungen können durch Wiederholung eine strukturelle Zerstörung bewirken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDFD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D6","text":"Die ethische Milde des Großen beseitigt den Gegensatz nicht, sondern lässt ihn unter Umständen ungehindert fortwirken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","text":"Der Rückzug erscheint als Schutzmaßnahme gegen eine asymmetrische Konfliktordnung, in der der Einzelne einer unzählbaren Menge gegenübersteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","text":"Der Markt ist zugleich Bewertungsapparat, Erkenntnisapparat und Affektapparat: Er verteilt Ruhm, bestimmt Wahrheit nach Wirkung und erzeugt Ressentiment gegen das nicht auf Wirkung reduzierte Große.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","text":"Öffentliche Sichtbarkeit macht die Größe, die sie darstellen soll, zur Quelle ihrer eigenen Verfolgung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD3","text":"Die Welt zerfällt in zwei inkompatible Umläufe: in den unsichtbaren Umlauf der Wertschöpfung und den sichtbaren Umlauf von Volk, Ruhm und Schauspiel.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht bloß individuelle Absonderung, sondern die zeitliche und affektive Gegenordnung zum Markt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD5","text":"Die Verbindung von Tiefe, Milde und Stolz erzeugt eine besondere Verwundbarkeit: Der Große kann weder die kleinen Wunden ignorieren noch die Angreifer wirksam beseitigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","text":"Die Strategie der Erhaltung besteht nicht in der Umformung des Marktes, sondern in der Entziehung aus seinem Wahrnehmungs- und Verletzungszusammenhang.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass öffentliche Anerkennung kein verlässliches Maß schöpferischer Größe ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX2","text":"Es schließt einen gemeinsamen öffentlichen Zeit- und Wahrnehmungsraum aus, in dem langsame Wertschöpfung ohne Verfälschung erscheinen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass kleine Beschädigungen wegen ihrer Geringfügigkeit oder Unbewusstheit folgenlos bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine unschuldige, wechselseitige Nähe zwischen großem Dasein und kleiner Seele aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","text":"Es behandelt direkte Gegenwehr nicht als Lösung des Konflikts, sondern als unendliche und unpassende Bindung an den Markt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer öffentlichen Anerkennung des Schöpferischen ohne Schauspiel, Lärm und Ruhm bleibt versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX2","text":"Ein gemeinsamer Raum, in dem Wahrheit zwischen erzwungenem Ja und Nein bestehen könnte, wird nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","text":"Eine positive kollektive Strategie gegen Markt, Ruhm und Ressentiment fehlt; verfügbar bleibt nur die Flucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX4","text":"Die Koexistenz von Größe und Öffentlichkeit wird als strukturell unhaltbar behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS1","text":"Einsamkeit → Schweigen und starke Luft → langsames Erleben → Hervorgehen neuer Werte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS2","text":"Ende der Einsamkeit → Eintritt in den Markt → Lärm, Schauspiel und zeitlicher Druck → erzwungenes Ja oder Nein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS3","text":"Vorrang der Wirkung → Erzeugung von Glauben → öffentliche Anerkennung des Schauspielers → Unsichtbarkeit des Schöpfers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS4","text":"Sichtbare Größe → Empfinden der eigenen Niedrigkeit → verdeckte Rache, Lob und Schmeichelei → fortgesetzte Stiche.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS5","text":"Wiederholte kleine Wunden → kumulative Aushöhlung → Erschöpfung und Zerbrechen des Großen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS6","text":"Unzählbarkeit der Angreifer + Unmöglichkeit wirksamer Einzelabwehr → Aufgabe der Gegenwehr → Rückzug in Einsamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","text":"Rückzug → Entzug aus Marktlogik und Verletzungszirkulation → Erhaltung der Bedingungen des Schöpferischen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AF1","text":"Betäubung durch Lärm und Stiche → Neubestimmung des Marktes als Schauspiel- und Glaubensmaschine → Trennung von Schöpfer und Aufführer → Ersetzung der Wahrheit durch Wirkung → Umwandlung von Nähe in Ressentiment und Verletzung → Akkumulation kleiner Wunden → Rückzug in Einsamkeit als Schutz des Großen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME1","text":"Öffentliche Größe wird von schöpferischer Größe getrennt und als Effekt der Aufführung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","text":"Der Markt wird nicht mehr als neutraler Ort der Anerkennung, sondern als Maschine der Wertverwechslung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME3","text":"Kleine Menschen werden nicht nur als Individuen, sondern als verteilte und kumulative Verletzungsmacht kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME4","text":"Lob, Nähe und Liebenswürdigkeit werden von positiven Affekten in mögliche Formen des Zugriffs umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME5","text":"Einsamkeit wird von sozialer Absonderung zu einer Schutz- und Produktionszone des Schöpferischen umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME6","text":"Zeit wird als Gegensatz von sofortiger Marktreaktion und verzögerter Tiefe organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein einzelner Großer soll den Markt, die Fliegen und die Nähe der Kleinen verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT2","text":"Structural: Markt, Ruhm und Schauspiel erzeugen eine institutionalisierte Verwechslung von Wirkung, Anerkennung und Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Kampf wird nicht durch Gegendarstellung oder Gegenangriff, sondern durch Entzug aus der erzwungenen öffentlichen Entscheidung neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Schöpferische Wertsetzung ist unsichtbar, langsam und weltbildend, während öffentliche Macht sichtbar, wechselhaft und augenblicksgebunden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT1","text":"Die zwölf Axiome reichen aus, um Markt, Schauspiel, Schöpfung, Ressentiment, Verwundbarkeit und Rückzug als zusammenhängende Erzeugungsordnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Einsamkeit notwendige Bedingung des Schaffens oder vor allem eine Schutzstrategie gegen den Markt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Markt und Einsamkeit als gegensätzliche Zeit-, Wahrnehmungs- und Affektordnungen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Rekonstruktion in der Kette von Wirkungsglauben über öffentliche Fehlbewertung zu Ressentiment und kumulativer Verletzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass der Text öffentliche Anerkennung verwirft, seine Diagnose jedoch selbst als öffentliche Anrede vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der behaupteten Unschuld der Kleinen und ihrer systematischen Funktion als rächende und zerstörerische Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT7","text":"Der Rückzug schützt den Schöpfer, überlässt den Markt jedoch den Schauspielern und enthält keine positive kollektive Gegenstrategie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegungsrichtung des Textes bleibt erhalten: Markt → Fehlbewertung → Ressentiment → Verletzung → Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194140729337Z_a4439289","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Flies of the Market","source_sha256":"b4b4327971f41315c12fe5ee4505f792e949f38c21583af2a65a7c2d1171838e","sha256":"a8a3091f1f5f81e99768f7f0d0328e11cfa46dbe041a17f5f5218544988ce57c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:41:40.732306+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS1","text":"The text presents the market as an order of noise and spectacle in which public effect takes the place of creative greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS2","text":"It defines the people's “great men” as performers whose power proceeds from generated belief rather than from truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS3","text":"It explains the invisibility of creators of new values and the visibility of actors through the perceptual logic of the market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS4","text":"It shifts the diagnosis from public deception to personal vulnerability through proximity, praise, stings, and concealed revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS5","text":"It contrasts rapid, changing market time with the slow depth of experiencing and creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AS6","text":"The diagnostic-strategic movement leads from market analysis through the diagnosis of injury to flight into solitude as protection of the creative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","text":"Solitude enables silence, strong air, slow experiencing, and creative concentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","text":"The market begins with the end of solitude and organizes itself through noise, spectacle, and compelled decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","text":"The people recognize above all performers of great things and grasp the creative only inadequately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","text":"The inventors of new values work apart from market and fame, while the world turns invisibly around their creations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","text":"The actor measures proof by the capacity to generate belief, not by the validity of what is believed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A6","text":"The market rejects truths that produce no noise and treats overthrowing, making mad, and blood as convincing reasons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","text":"The small experience great existence as an accusation of their own baseness and guilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","text":"The proximity, praise, and apparent amiability of the small can function as encroachments, flattery, and concealed harms against the great.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","text":"Many small injuries can hollow out and ultimately break a great structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","text":"The deep suffer especially intensely from small wounds, while pride and gentleness inhibit their violent retaliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","text":"The small are innumerable, so that immediate retaliation is neither effective nor the task of the great.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","text":"Retreat into solitude and harsh, strong air protects against market compulsion, proximity, and cumulative injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX1","text":"Greatness is not identical with public fame, temporary domination, or visible performance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX2","text":"Creators of new values are not to be equated with actors of great things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3","text":"Persuasive power is no proof of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX4","text":"Truth is not bound to the compelled “Yes” or “No” of the market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX5","text":"Praise, flattery, and amiability are not straightforwardly expressions of love or respect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX6","text":"The apparent innocence of the small does not nullify the effect of their revenge and harms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX7","text":"Gentleness toward the small does not ground reciprocal recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:NX8","text":"The lover of truth is not destined to fight every individual fly directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","text":"The market order detaches public recognition from creative value-creation and binds it to performance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","text":"The market produces an order of knowledge in which effect on belief replaces truth-content.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","text":"Rapid and changeable market time cannot adequately accommodate the slow time of emergence of deep experience.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D4","text":"The public visibility of the great transforms their virtues and their mere presence into occasions for ressentiment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D5","text":"Small harms, not necessarily consciously malicious, can through repetition bring about structural destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDFD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D6","text":"The ethical gentleness of the great does not eliminate the opposition but may allow it to continue unchecked.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","text":"Retreat appears as a protective measure against an asymmetrical order of conflict in which the individual stands opposed to an innumerable multitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","text":"The market is at once an apparatus of valuation, an apparatus of knowledge, and an apparatus of affect: it distributes fame, determines truth according to effect, and generates ressentiment against greatness not reduced to effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","text":"Public visibility makes the greatness it is meant to represent into the source of its own persecution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD3","text":"The world disintegrates into two incompatible circuits: the invisible circuit of value-creation and the visible circuit of people, fame, and spectacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","text":"Solitude is not merely individual separation, but the temporal and affective counter-order to the market.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD5","text":"The conjunction of depth, gentleness, and pride produces a particular vulnerability: the great can neither ignore the small wounds nor effectively eliminate the attackers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","text":"The strategy of preservation consists not in transforming the market but in withdrawing from its nexus of perception and injury.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that public recognition is not a reliable measure of creative greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX2","text":"It excludes a shared public space of time and perception in which slow value-creation could appear without distortion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that small damages remain without consequences by virtue of their slightness or unconsciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX4","text":"It excludes an innocent, reciprocal proximity between great existence and the small soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","text":"It treats direct retaliation not as a solution to the conflict but as an endless and inappropriate attachment to the market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX1","text":"The possibility of public recognition of the creative without spectacle, noise, and fame remains barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX2","text":"A shared space in which truth could subsist between compelled Yes and No is not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","text":"A positive collective strategy against market, fame, and ressentiment is absent; only flight remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX4","text":"The coexistence of greatness and publicity is treated as structurally untenable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS1","text":"Solitude → silence and strong air → slow experiencing → emergence of new values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS2","text":"End of solitude → entry into the market → noise, spectacle, and temporal pressure → compelled Yes or No.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS3","text":"Primacy of effect → generation of belief → public recognition of the actor → invisibility of the creator.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A3","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDFD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS4","text":"Visible greatness → feeling of one's own baseness → concealed revenge, praise, and flattery → continued stings.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A7","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS5","text":"Repeated small wounds → cumulative hollowing-out → exhaustion and breaking of the great.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDFD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS6","text":"Innumerability of attackers + impossibility of effective individual defense → abandonment of retaliation → retreat into solitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","text":"Retreat → withdrawal from market logic and the circulation of injury → preservation of the conditions of the creative.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A1","CH_97E9_VDFD:A4","CH_97E9_VDFD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:AF1","text":"Numbing through noise and stings → redefinition of the market as a machine of spectacle and belief → separation of creator and performer → replacement of truth by effect → transformation of proximity into ressentiment and injury → accumulation of small wounds → retreat into solitude as protection of the great.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME1","text":"Public greatness is separated from creative greatness and reclassified as an effect of performance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","text":"The market becomes visible no longer as a neutral site of recognition but as a machine of value-confusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME3","text":"Small people are mapped not only as individuals but as a distributed and cumulative power of injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME4","text":"Praise, proximity, and amiability are recoded from positive affects into possible forms of encroachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME5","text":"Solitude is reordered from social separation into a zone of protection and production for the creative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ME6","text":"Time is organized as the opposition between immediate market reaction and delayed depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT1","text":"Surface: A single great person is to leave the market, the flies, and the proximity of the small.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT2","text":"Structural: Market, fame, and spectacle produce an institutionalized confusion of effect, recognition, and greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The struggle is reframed not through counter-representation or counterattack but through withdrawal from compelled public decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Creative value-positing is invisible, slow, and world-forming, whereas public power is visible, changeable, and bound to the moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT1","text":"The twelve axioms suffice to reconstruct market, spectacle, creation, ressentiment, vulnerability, and retreat as a coherent generative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether solitude is a necessary condition of creation or primarily a protective strategy against the market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as market and solitude are treated as opposing orders of time, perception, and affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT4","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the chain from belief in effect through public misvaluation to ressentiment and cumulative injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the text rejects public recognition, yet conveys its diagnosis itself as a public address.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT6","text":"A second fault line lies between the asserted innocence of the small and their systematic function as a vengeful and destructive multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT7","text":"Retreat protects the creator but leaves the market to the actors and contains no positive collective counter-strategy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT8","text":"The text's actual direction of movement is preserved: market → misvaluation → ressentiment → injury → solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDFD:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDFD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDFD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 22","title":"On the Flies of the Marketplace","context":"Chapter 22","original_title":"Von den Fliegen des Marktes","original_context":"Chapter 22"},"original_title":"Von den Fliegen des Marktes","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0","layer":"CH","title":"On Chastity","order":23,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDK0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDK0@R001","sha256":"652ff0f8b41b5218868db5faaa4cc7ebbe521ba96903a72b84b5961ac3d6e7e0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist eine von Brunst bestimmte Lebensform, die in Stadt, Sexualität, Tugend, Geist und Mitleid wiederkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS2","text":"Das Argument bestimmt sexuelle Unordnung nicht primär als körperliches, sondern als seelisch-geistiges Problem neu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS3","text":"Keuschheit wird von einer allgemeinen Norm in eine bedingte, individuelle Möglichkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS4","text":"Abstinenz beweist keine Reinheit, weil Sinnlichkeit sich in Tugend, Geist und Mitleid verkleiden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS5","text":"Die positive Alternative ist nicht die Tötung der Sinne, sondern ihre Unschuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS6","text":"Das Argument endet bei einer seltenen, nicht erzwungenen Keuschheit, die sich selbst nicht absolut setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A1","text":"Die Stadt ist ein Lebensraum verdichteter Brunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A2","text":"Ungeordnete sexuelle Begierde verengt das menschliche Leben auf die Befriedigung am Weib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A3","text":"Vollkommenheit des Tieres setzt Unschuld voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","text":"Die Sinne sollen nicht getötet, sondern unschuldig gemacht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","text":"Keuschheit ist für einige eine Tugend und für viele beinahe ein Laster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","text":"Äußerliche Enthaltsamkeit kann von neidischer Sinnlichkeit begleitet sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","text":"Verdrängte Sinnlichkeit verfolgt den Menschen bis in Tugend und Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A8","text":"Versagte körperliche Befriedigung kann sich als geistiges Begehren artikulieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A9","text":"Mitleid mit Leidenden kann verkleidete Wollust sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A10","text":"Der Versuch, den eigenen Teufel auszutreiben, kann in eine andere Form der Preisgabe führen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A11","text":"Eine Keuschheit, die schwerfällt, kann zum Weg der seelischen Brunst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","text":"Die Tiefe einer Wahrheit ist entscheidender als ihre moralische Sauberkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A13","text":"Ursprünglich Keusche sind milder, freudiger und weniger dogmatisch gegenüber der Keuschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A14","text":"Eine tragfähige Keuschheit wird aufgenommen, nicht als allgemeines Gesetz auferlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX1","text":"Das Problem ist nicht durch den bloßen Aufenthalt außerhalb der Stadt gelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","text":"Die Lösung besteht nicht in der Tötung der Sinne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","text":"Keuschheit ist keine allgemeine Tugendpflicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX4","text":"Enthaltsamkeit ist kein hinreichender Beweis für Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX5","text":"Geistige Tätigkeit ist nicht automatisch von Sinnlichkeit frei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX6","text":"Mitleid ist nicht notwendig uneigennütziger als Wollust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX7","text":"Das Austreiben des Teufels garantiert keine Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX8","text":"Schmutzigkeit ist nicht das äußerste epistemische Übel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX9","text":"Eine schwer ertragene Keuschheit darf nicht als Weg zur Tugend empfohlen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D1","text":"Weil die Sinne nicht getötet werden sollen und Keuschheit nicht allgemein gilt, wird Unschuld der Sinne zur eigentlichen Zielbestimmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D2","text":"Weil Enthaltsamkeit von neidischer Sinnlichkeit begleitet sein kann, trennt körperliche Unterlassung nicht zuverlässig von innerer Brunst.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","text":"Weil Sinnlichkeit bis in Tugend und Geist folgt, kann moralische und geistige Erhöhung die Begierde lediglich umlagern.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D4","text":"Weil versagte Fleischlichkeit um Geist betteln lässt, kann Geist als Ersatzobjekt der Sinnlichkeit funktionieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D5","text":"Weil Mitleid verkleidete Wollust sein kann, ist die moralische Bezeichnung eines Affekts kein Beweis seiner Reinheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D6","text":"Weil erzwungene Keuschheit zur Brunst führen kann, ist ihre Empfehlung von der individuellen Fähigkeit zu ihr abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D7","text":"Weil ursprünglich Keusche über die Keuschheit lachen, gehört Selbstentkrampfung zu ihrer positiven Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D8","text":"Weil die Tiefe und nicht die Sauberkeit der Wahrheit maßgeblich ist, wird moralische Reinlichkeit als Erkenntniskriterium entwertet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Opposition zwischen Sexualität und Keuschheit durch die Unterscheidung zwischen unschuldiger und verkleideter Sinnlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2","text":"Moralische, geistige und mitfühlende Formen des Handelns werden als mögliche Transformationsformen desselben Triebes lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A8","CH_97E9_VDK0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD3","text":"Die Gültigkeit einer Tugend wird nicht durch ihre allgemeine Form, sondern durch ihre innere Herkunft und ihre affektive Wirkung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A10","CH_97E9_VDK0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","text":"Befreiung erscheint nicht als Entfernung vom Trieb, sondern als Entlarvung seiner Verkleidungen und als Wiedergewinnung einer nicht-neidischen Sinnlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass körperliche Unterdrückung den Trieb ontologisch aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass der Geist gegenüber der Sinnlichkeit eine unabhängige, reine Sphäre bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass moralische Benennungen wie Tugend, Mitleid oder Keuschheit den Ursprung eines Affekts offenlegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Beseitigung eines sichtbaren Begehrens dessen strukturelle Wiederkehr verhindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass eine allgemein gültige Norm die Verschiedenheit individueller Triebverfassungen aufheben kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass moralische Sauberkeit mit erkenntnistheoretischer Tiefe identisch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer vollständig triebfreien Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine stabile Grenze zwischen Körper, Geist und moralischem Affekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine allgemeine Norm, die ohne seelische Verwandlung zur Erlösung führt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Verfügbarkeit unschuldiger Sinnlichkeit als gewöhnlicher oder institutionell herstellbarer Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Erkenntnis, die sich durch Reinheit statt durch Tiefe legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS1","text":"Verdichtete Brunst → Verengung des Lebens auf Befriedigung → Diagnose einer seelischen Verschlammung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_pr