"alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Sinnlichkeit und Geist bricht zusammen; Geist kann als sublimierte Sinnlichkeit erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME4","text":"Mitleid wird aus der Sphäre selbstverständlicher moralischer Reinheit in die Sphäre möglicher Verkleidung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME5","text":"Die relevante Unterscheidung lautet nicht schmutzig versus keusch, sondern tief versus seicht und unschuldig versus neidisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME6","text":"Die strategische Landschaft verschiebt sich von Verbot und Selbstunterdrückung zu Diagnose, Entkleidung und individueller Prüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text behandelt Stadt, Sexualität, Keuschheit, Mitleid und das Verhältnis zu den Sinnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Er beschreibt die Wiederkehr und Umlagerung der Sinnlichkeit in Körper, Tugend, Geist und moralischen Affekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Er ersetzt das Gebot allgemeiner Enthaltsamkeit durch eine Prüfung der Herkunft, Wirkung und Verkleidung von Trieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Er setzt voraus, dass derselbe Trieb seine Erscheinungsform wechseln kann und dass Reinheit nicht durch Negation, sondern durch Verwandlung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Brunstdiagnose zur bedingten Verteidigung der Keuschheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Unterscheidung zwischen erzwungener Enthaltsamkeit und ursprünglicher Keuschheit bleibt auf eine Typologie innerer Zustände angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Keuschheit nicht als Gegensatz zur Sinnlichkeit, sondern als deren unschuldige Gestalt verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Operation ist die Entlarvung moralischer und geistiger Formen als mögliche Umlagerungen des Triebs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der scharfen Kritik an der Keuschheit und ihrer positiven Bestimmung als seltene Tugend bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht durch die pauschale Stadtkritik neben der späteren Individualisierung des Problems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die positive Zielgröße nicht Keuschheit, sondern Unschuld der Sinne ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194352547802Z_de7ee725","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Chastity","source_sha256":"652ff0f8b41b5218868db5faaa4cc7ebbe521ba96903a72b84b5961ac3d6e7e0","sha256":"713a87909e6effe4518074b1c3b88da242f97008ea29742980ce249e13f7b2f0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:43:52.552213+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS1","text":"The problem is a form of life determined by ardor that recurs in city, sexuality, virtue, spirit, and pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS2","text":"The argument redefines sexual disorder not primarily as a bodily problem, but as a psychic-spiritual one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS3","text":"Chastity is remapped from a general norm into a conditional, individual possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS4","text":"Abstinence proves no purity, because sensuality can disguise itself as virtue, spirit, and pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS5","text":"The positive alternative is not the killing of the senses, but their innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AS6","text":"The argument ends with a rare, unforced chastity that does not posit itself as absolute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A1","text":"The city is a life-space of concentrated ardor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A2","text":"Disordered sexual desire narrows human life to satisfaction in woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A3","text":"The perfection of the animal presupposes innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","text":"The senses should not be killed, but made innocent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","text":"For some, chastity is a virtue, and for many almost a vice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","text":"Outward abstinence can be accompanied by envious sensuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","text":"Repressed sensuality pursues the human being even into virtue and spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A8","text":"Denied bodily satisfaction can articulate itself as spiritual desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A9","text":"Pity for sufferers can be disguised voluptuousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A10","text":"The attempt to cast out one's own devil can lead into another form of surrender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A11","text":"A chastity that comes with difficulty can become the path of psychic ardor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","text":"The depth of a truth is more decisive than its moral cleanliness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A13","text":"Those originally chaste are milder, more joyful, and less dogmatic toward chastity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:A14","text":"A sustainable chastity is embraced, not imposed as a general law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX1","text":"The problem is not solved by merely residing outside the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","text":"The solution does not consist in killing the senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","text":"Chastity is not a general duty of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX4","text":"Abstinence is not sufficient proof of purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX5","text":"Spiritual activity is not automatically free of sensuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX6","text":"Pity is not necessarily more selfless than voluptuousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX7","text":"Casting out the devil guarantees no liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX8","text":"Dirtiness is not the ultimate epistemic evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:NX9","text":"A chastity endured with difficulty must not be recommended as the path to virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D1","text":"Because the senses are not to be killed and chastity does not apply generally, the innocence of the senses becomes the proper determination of the goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D2","text":"Because abstinence can be accompanied by envious sensuality, bodily abstention does not reliably separate one from inner ardor.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","text":"Because sensuality follows even into virtue and spirit, moral and spiritual elevation can merely displace desire.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D4","text":"Because denied carnality makes one beg for spirit, spirit can function as a substitute object of sensuality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D5","text":"Because pity can be disguised voluptuousness, the moral designation of an affect is no proof of its purity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D6","text":"Because forced chastity can lead to ardor, its recommendation depends on the individual's capacity for it.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D7","text":"Because those originally chaste laugh about chastity, release from self-constriction belongs to its positive form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:D8","text":"Because the depth, and not the cleanliness, of truth is decisive, moral cleanliness is devalued as a criterion of knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD1","text":"The system replaces the opposition between sexuality and chastity with the distinction between innocent and disguised sensuality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2","text":"Moral, spiritual, and compassionate forms of action become legible as possible transformational forms of the same drive.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A8","CH_97E9_VDK0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD3","text":"The validity of a virtue is determined not by its general form, but by its inner origin and its affective effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A10","CH_97E9_VDK0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","text":"Liberation appears not as removal from the drive, but as the unmasking of its disguises and as the recovery of a non-envious sensuality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VDK0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that bodily repression ontologically abolishes the drive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that spirit constitutes an independent, pure sphere in relation to sensuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that moral designations such as virtue, pity, or chastity disclose the origin of an affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the elimination of a visible desire prevents its structural recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that a universally valid norm can abolish the diversity of individual drive-constitutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that moral cleanliness is identical with epistemological depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a virtue wholly free of drives is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX2","text":"A stable boundary between body, spirit, and moral affect is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX3","text":"A general norm that leads to redemption without psychic transformation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX4","text":"The availability of innocent sensuality as an ordinary or institutionally producible condition is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX5","text":"A knowledge that legitimates itself through purity rather than depth is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS1","text":"Concentrated ardor → narrowing of life to satisfaction → diagnosis of a psychic miredness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS2","text":"Abstinence → persistence of sensuality → displacement into virtue, spirit, or pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS3","text":"Disguised drive → unmasking of moral self-interpretations → abolition of the equation of virtue and purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS4","text":"Rejection of the killing of the senses + rejection of general chastity → innocence of the senses as positive target value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS5","text":"Individual incapacity for chastity → counsel against chastity → avoidance of intensified ardor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS6","text":"Original chastity → mildness and laughter → non-dogmatic embrace of chastity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS7","text":"Testing truth by depth rather than cleanliness → epistemic devaluation of moral surface cleanliness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:AF1","text":"City as concentration of ardor → sexual narrowing → psychic miredness → unmasking of disguised sensuality → rejection of general chastity → innocence of the senses → conditional acceptance of original chastity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME1","text":"Chastity is reclassified from a uniform norm into a differentiated function of individual drive-constitutions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME2","text":"The boundary between sexual, moral, spiritual, and compassionate motivation is made permeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME3","text":"The opposition between sensuality and spirit collapses; spirit can appear as sublimated sensuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME4","text":"Pity is shifted from the sphere of self-evident moral purity into the sphere of possible disguise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME5","text":"The relevant distinction is not dirty versus chaste, but deep versus shallow and innocent versus envious.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ME6","text":"The strategic landscape shifts from prohibition and self-repression to diagnosis, stripping away, and individual examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text treats the city, sexuality, chastity, pity, and the relation to the senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT2","text":"Structural — It describes the recurrence and displacement of sensuality in body, virtue, spirit, and moral affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — It replaces the commandment of general abstinence with an examination of the origin, effect, and disguise of drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — It presupposes that the same drive can change its mode of appearance and that purity arises not through negation, but through transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the diagnosis of ardor to the conditional defense of chastity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT2","text":"The central distinction between forced abstinence and original chastity remains dependent on a typology of inner states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as chastity is understood not as the opposite of sensuality, but as its innocent form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation is the unmasking of moral and spiritual forms as possible displacements of the drive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the sharp critique of chastity and its positive determination as a rare virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises through the blanket critique of the city alongside the later individualization of the problem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the positive target value is not chastity, but the innocence of the senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDK0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDK0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDK0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 23","title":"On Chastity","context":"Chapter 23","original_title":"Von der Keuschheit","original_context":"Chapter 23"},"original_title":"Von der Keuschheit","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF","layer":"CH","title":"On the Friend","order":24,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VOMF"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VOMF@R001","sha256":"b353a6327e8d4071f4af151d1e94b78f758fd2f6684506c8f13e610d7f6701fd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","text":"Einsamkeit erzeugt keine Einheit, sondern die Verdopplung des Selbst in „Ich“ und „Mich“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS2","text":"Die Zweierbeziehung droht in die Tiefe zu sinken und benötigt deshalb den Freund als vermittelnden Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS3","text":"Die Sehnsucht nach dem Freund wird als Verrat eines gewünschten Selbstbildes und als Verdeckung von Neid und Verwundbarkeit diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS4","text":"Freundschaft wird von bloßer Liebe, Transparenz und Harmonie auf antagonistische Nähe, begrenztes Wissen und harte Anteilnahme umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS5","text":"Der Freund soll Spiegel, Feind und Pfeil zur Überwindung des Menschen zugleich sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung ist diagnostisch und normativ: Von der inneren Verdopplung über die antagonistische Vermittlung zur noch ausstehenden Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","text":"Das einsame Selbst ist in „Ich“ und „Mich“ geteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A2","text":"Das Gespräch zweier Beteiligter droht ohne Vermittlung in die Tiefe zu sinken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","text":"Der Freund nimmt die Position eines Dritten ein und hält die Zweierbeziehung in einer vermittelten Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A4","text":"Der Glaube an Andere verrät ein gewünschtes Bild des eigenen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A5","text":"Die Sehnsucht nach einem Freund verrät eine eigene, nicht eingestandene Bedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A6","text":"Liebe kann dazu dienen, Neid zu überspringen oder zu verdecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A7","text":"Angriff kann dazu dienen, die eigene Verwundbarkeit zu verbergen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","text":"Ehrfurcht vor dem Freund verlangt die Fähigkeit, ihm als Feind entgegenzutreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","text":"Der Freund soll innerhalb der Nähe ein bester Feind bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","text":"Freundschaft verlangt Erraten, Stillschweigen und begrenzte Einsicht statt vollständiger Transparenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","text":"Der Freund spiegelt das eigene raue und unvollkommene Gesicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","text":"Der Mensch ist eine zu überwindende Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A13","text":"Der Freund soll Pfeil und Sehnsucht nach dem Übermenschen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A14","text":"Mitleid mit dem Freund soll unter einer harten Schale verborgen bleiben und Widerstand erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A15","text":"Eine feste Position als Sklave oder Tyrann schließt Freundschaft aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","text":"Der Text stellt die weibliche Liebe als von Freundschaft unterschiedene, durch Sklave und Tyrann bestimmte Form dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A17","text":"Der Text stellt auch die Männer als gegenwärtig nicht hinreichend freundschaftsfähig dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A18","text":"Kameradschaft ist vorhanden, während Freundschaft erst entstehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX1","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht die ungeteilte Einheit des einsamen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX2","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht die unmittelbare Zweierbeziehung ohne vermittelnden Dritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX3","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht bloße Liebe oder affektive Zuneigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX4","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht die Abwesenheit von Widerstreit, Feindschaft oder Krieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht totale Nähe, vollständige Erkenntnis oder nackte Selbstenthüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX6","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht weiches, voraussetzungsloses Mitleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX7","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht die Beziehung zwischen festgesetzter Herrschaft und Unterwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX8","text":"Der Freund ist nicht bloß ein identisches Gegenüber, obwohl er das eigene Gesicht spiegelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX9","text":"Freundschaft ist nicht mit Kameradschaft gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX10","text":"Freundschaft ist im Text keine bereits verwirklichte soziale Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX11","text":"Die Liebe des Weibes wird im Text nicht als hinreichende Grundlage der Freundschaft anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D1","text":"Der Freund stabilisiert die gespaltene Selbstbeziehung, indem er als dritter Vermittlungspunkt zwischen „Ich“ und „Mich“ eintritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A2","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D2","text":"Die Freundessehnsucht ist kein transparenter Ausdruck von Bedürfnis, sondern ein diagnostisches Zeichen für ein gewünschtes Selbstbild.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D3","text":"Liebe und Angriff können als Verschiebungsformen verdeckter Affekte gelesen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D4","text":"Freundschaft wird durch die Fähigkeit zum Widerstreit konstituiert und nicht durch die Beseitigung des Konflikts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D5","text":"Intimität besteht in einer begrenzten, erratenden Erkenntnis, die die Fremdheit des Freundes erhält.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D6","text":"Der Freund ermöglicht Selbsterkenntnis, ohne auf ein bloßes Abbild des Selbst reduziert zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D7","text":"Freundschaft erhält eine teleologische Richtung, weil sie den Menschen über seine gegenwärtige Gestalt hinausweisen soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D8","text":"Mitleid wird in eine fordernde Form der Hilfe überführt, die den Freund nicht durch Schonung entmündigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D9","text":"Weder Unterwerfung noch Herrschaft können die für Freundschaft erforderliche relationale Freiheit erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D10","text":"Die geschlechtliche Ausschließung der weiblichen Liebe führt nicht zu einem gesicherten männlichen Gegenmodell, weil auch die Männer als seelenarm und geizig dargestellt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","CH_97E9_VOMF:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D11","text":"Die gegenwärtige soziale Beziehung bleibt unterhalb der normativen Freundschaft und wird als Kameradschaft klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1","text":"Freundschaft ist eine Struktur produktiver Distanz, in der Vermittlung, Widerstreit und Nähe gemeinsam die Selbstüberwindung erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD2","text":"Der Freund fungiert gleichzeitig als dritter Vermittler, antagonistische Grenze, unvollkommener Spiegel und Vektor über den gegenwärtigen Menschen hinaus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD3","text":"Das ethische Maß der Freundschaft ist nicht maximale Offenheit, sondern eine kontrollierte Erkenntnis, die Alterität und Widerstand bewahrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4","text":"Die Freundschaftsnorm schließt sowohl Unterwerfung als auch Herrschaft aus, ohne eine symmetrische oder konfliktfreie Beziehung zu fordern.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD5","text":"Die Behauptung weiblicher Unfähigkeit zur Freundschaft wird durch die anschließende männliche Unfähigkeit in eine allgemeine Diagnose gegenwärtiger menschlicher Unzulänglichkeit überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","CH_97E9_VOMF:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6","text":"Freundschaft ist keine vorhandene soziale Institution, sondern eine zukünftige Transformationsform des Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX1","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme, dass das Selbst in sich geschlossen und ohne äußere Vermittlung eins sein kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX2","text":"Falsch sein muss die Gleichsetzung von Intimität mit vollständiger Selbstenthüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX3","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme, dass Konflikt eine Beziehung notwendig zerstört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX4","text":"Falsch sein muss die Gleichsetzung von Liebe, Mitleid, Kameradschaft und Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX5","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme, dass ein dauerhaftes Herrschafts- oder Unterwerfungsverhältnis Freundschaft tragen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX6","text":"Falsch sein muss die Vorstellung, der Mensch sei eine abgeschlossene und nicht zu überwindende Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX7","text":"Falsch sein muss die Annahme, der Freund könne entweder vollständig angeeignet oder vollständig als äußerer Fremder behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer bereits verwirklichten Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Nähe, die weder in Verschmelzung noch in Herrschaft übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX3","text":"Es fehlt ein Subjekt, das zugleich autonom, widerspruchsfähig, nicht-dominierend und zur Selbstüberwindung fähig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX4","text":"Die soziale Gegenwart verfügt nur über Kameradschaft; die Höhe der Freundschaft und der Übermensch bleiben als nicht eingelöste Zielpunkte bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS1","text":"Innere Spaltung des Selbst → Verdopplung des Gesprächs → Gefahr des Absinkens in die Tiefe → Bedarf eines dritten Vermittlungspunktes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS2","text":"Freund als Dritter → Stabilisierung der Zweierbeziehung → Aufrechterhaltung von Höhe und Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS3","text":"Sehnsucht nach dem Freund → Aufdeckung von Selbstprojektion, Neid und Verwundbarkeit → Umstellung von Affekt auf Diagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS4","text":"Diagnose verdeckter Affekte → Forderung nach Feindfähigkeit → Freundschaft als antagonistische Nähe ohne Übertritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS5","text":"Begrenzte Erkenntnis, Erraten und Stillschweigen → Erhaltung der Alterität → Freund als Spiegel und Widerstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6","text":"Spiegelung der Unvollkommenheit → Ausrichtung auf Überwindung → Freundschaft als Zukunfts- und Transformationsform statt als Kameradschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF1","text":"Einsamkeit → Ich/Mich-Verdopplung → absinkendes Zweiergespräch → Freund als Dritter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF2","text":"Freundessehnsucht → Selbstverrat → verdeckter Neid und verdeckte Verwundbarkeit → diagnostische Neubestimmung der Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF3","text":"Ehrfurcht → Feindfähigkeit → Nähe ohne Übertritt → erratende, schweigende und harte Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF4","text":"Schlafender Freund → rauer Spiegel des eigenen Gesichts → Einsicht in menschliche Unvollkommenheit → Pfeil zum Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF5","text":"Ausschluss von Sklave und Tyrann → Demontage des geschlechtlichen Gegenmodells → männliche Seelenarmut → Kameradschaft als unzureichende Gegenwart → ausstehende Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME1","text":"Der Freund wird vom emotionalen Gegenstand zum strukturellen Dritten reklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME2","text":"Freund und Feind werden nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als koexistierende Funktionen derselben Beziehung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME3","text":"Intimität wird von Transparenz auf selektive Erkenntnis, Schweigen und Erraten umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME4","text":"Mitleid wird von passiver Schonung in eine harte, widerständige Form der Anteilnahme umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME5","text":"Der Freund wird vom bestätigenden Spiegel zum unvollkommenen Spiegel und transformativen Pfeil umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6","text":"Die soziale Landschaft wird in gegenwärtige Kameradschaft und zukünftige Freundschaft geteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME7","text":"Die geschlechtliche Gegenüberstellung wird durch die männliche Unfähigkeit zurück auf eine allgemeine menschliche Diagnose gebogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text ordnet Einsamkeit, Freundschaft, Feindschaft, Mitleid und Kameradschaft in eine normative Beziehungslehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Beziehung wird als ternäre, antagonistische und nicht-dominierende Vermittlungsstruktur organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Sehnsucht, Liebe und Mitleid werden in diagnostische Prüfungen und Formen relationaler Disziplin umgewandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Mensch erscheint als unvollkommene Übergangsform, während Freundschaft als noch nicht verwirklichte Zukunftsgestalt fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Weg von der inneren Verdopplung zum Freund als vermittelndem Dritten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT2","text":"Sie reichen aus, um Freundschaft als antagonistische, selektive und transformative Beziehung abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Freund eine reale Beziehung, ein Idealtyp oder eine pädagogische Konstruktion bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist am stärksten in der Neubestimmung von Intimität durch Distanz, Widerstand und begrenzte Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT5","text":"Die geschlechtliche Argumentation bleibt intern instabil, weil die Ausschließung der Frauen in eine allgemeine männliche Unfähigkeit übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen dem Freund als Spiegel des Selbst und dem Freund als irreduziblem Feind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT7","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt ebenfalls die Spannung zwischen helfender Erlösung und der Forderung, dass Selbstbefreiung nicht stellvertretend geleistet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn der Schluss nicht als Lösung, sondern als Ausweisung der noch fehlenden Freundschaft gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195252502307Z_9428f0f1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Friend","source_sha256":"b353a6327e8d4071f4af151d1e94b78f758fd2f6684506c8f13e610d7f6701fd","sha256":"e67986ac544637b04927d57f40544a5f00339874422f6f6fff35e5a92eca929c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:52:52.504004+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","text":"Solitude produces not unity, but the doubling of the self into “I” and “Me”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS2","text":"The dyadic relationship threatens to sink into the depths and therefore requires the friend as a mediating third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS3","text":"Longing for the friend is diagnosed as the betrayal of a desired self-image and as the concealment of envy and vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS4","text":"Friendship is shifted from mere love, transparency, and harmony toward antagonistic closeness, limited knowledge, and hard participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS5","text":"The friend is to be mirror, enemy, and arrow toward the overcoming of the human being at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AS6","text":"The movement is diagnostic and normative: from inner doubling through antagonistic mediation to friendship still outstanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","text":"The solitary self is divided into “I” and “Me”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A2","text":"The conversation of two participants threatens to sink into the depths without mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","text":"The friend occupies the position of a third and holds the dyadic relationship at a mediated height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A4","text":"Belief in others betrays a desired image of one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A5","text":"Longing for a friend betrays one's own unacknowledged neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A6","text":"Love can serve to bypass or conceal envy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A7","text":"Attack can serve to conceal one's own vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","text":"Reverence for the friend requires the capacity to confront him as an enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","text":"Within closeness, the friend is to remain a best enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","text":"Friendship requires guessing, silence, and limited insight rather than complete transparency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","text":"The friend mirrors one's own rough and imperfect face.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","text":"The human being is a figure to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A13","text":"The friend is to be arrow and longing for the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A14","text":"Compassion for the friend is to remain concealed beneath a hard shell and generate resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A15","text":"A fixed position as slave or tyrant excludes friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","text":"The text presents feminine love as a form distinct from friendship, determined by slave and tyrant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A17","text":"The text also presents men as presently not sufficiently capable of friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:A18","text":"Comradeship is present, whereas friendship is still to arise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX1","text":"Friendship is not the undivided unity of the solitary self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX2","text":"Friendship is not the immediate dyadic relationship without a mediating third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX3","text":"Friendship is not mere love or affective affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX4","text":"Friendship is not the absence of conflict, enmity, or war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5","text":"Friendship is not total closeness, complete knowledge, or naked self-disclosure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX6","text":"Friendship is not soft, unconditional compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX7","text":"Friendship is not the relationship between fixed domination and subjection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX8","text":"The friend is not merely an identical counterpart, although he mirrors one's own face.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX9","text":"Friendship is not to be equated with comradeship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX10","text":"In the text, friendship is not an already realized social form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:NX11","text":"The love of woman is not acknowledged in the text as a sufficient foundation of friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D1","text":"The friend stabilizes the divided self-relation by entering as a third point of mediation between “I” and “Me”.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A2","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D2","text":"Longing for the friend is not a transparent expression of need, but a diagnostic sign of a desired self-image.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D3","text":"Love and attack can be read as forms of displacement of concealed affects.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D4","text":"Friendship is constituted by the capacity for conflict and not by the elimination of conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D5","text":"Intimacy consists in a limited, conjectural knowledge that preserves the friend's otherness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D6","text":"The friend enables self-knowledge without being reduced to a mere image of the self.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D7","text":"Friendship acquires a teleological direction because it is to point the human being beyond his present figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D8","text":"Compassion is transformed into a demanding form of help that does not incapacitate the friend through indulgence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D9","text":"Neither subjection nor domination can produce the relational freedom required for friendship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D10","text":"The gendered exclusion of feminine love does not lead to a secure masculine countermodel, because men too are depicted as poor in soul and miserly.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","CH_97E9_VOMF:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:D11","text":"The present social relationship remains beneath normative friendship and is classified as comradeship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1","text":"Friendship is a structure of productive distance in which mediation, conflict, and closeness jointly produce self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD2","text":"The friend functions simultaneously as third mediator, antagonistic boundary, imperfect mirror, and vector beyond the present human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD3","text":"The ethical measure of friendship is not maximal openness, but a controlled knowledge that preserves alterity and resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4","text":"The norm of friendship excludes both subjection and domination without demanding a symmetrical or conflict-free relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A8","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD5","text":"The assertion of feminine incapacity for friendship is transformed by the subsequent masculine incapacity into a general diagnosis of present human inadequacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A16","CH_97E9_VOMF:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6","text":"Friendship is not an existing social institution, but a future form of human transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX1","text":"The assumption that the self can be one, self-enclosed and without external mediation, must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX2","text":"The equation of intimacy with complete self-disclosure must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX3","text":"The assumption that conflict necessarily destroys a relationship must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX4","text":"The equation of love, compassion, comradeship, and friendship must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX5","text":"The assumption that a permanent relationship of domination or subjection can sustain friendship must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX6","text":"The notion that the human being is a completed and not-to-be-overcome figure must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX7","text":"The assumption that the friend can either be fully appropriated or treated entirely as an external stranger must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX1","text":"The text is organized around the absence of an already realized friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX2","text":"The barred possibility is a closeness that passes over neither into fusion nor into domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX3","text":"What is missing is a subject that is at once autonomous, capable of conflict, non-dominating, and capable of self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX4","text":"The social present possesses only comradeship; the height of friendship and the Übermensch remain as unrealized points of orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS1","text":"Inner division of the self → doubling of conversation → danger of sinking into the depths → need for a third point of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS2","text":"Friend as third → stabilization of the dyadic relationship → maintenance of height and distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS3","text":"Longing for the friend → exposure of self-projection, envy, and vulnerability → shift from affect to diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS4","text":"Diagnosis of concealed affects → demand for the capacity for enmity → friendship as antagonistic closeness without crossing over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS5","text":"Limited knowledge, guessing, and silence → preservation of alterity → friend as mirror and resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6","text":"Mirroring of imperfection → orientation toward overcoming → friendship as future and transformative form rather than comradeship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF1","text":"Solitude → I/Me doubling → sinking dyadic conversation → friend as third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF2","text":"Longing for the friend → self-betrayal → concealed envy and concealed vulnerability → diagnostic redefinition of the relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF3","text":"Reverence → capacity for enmity → closeness without crossing over → conjectural, silent, and hard friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF4","text":"Sleeping friend → rough mirror of one's own face → insight into human imperfection → arrow toward the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:AF5","text":"Exclusion of slave and tyrant → dismantling of the gendered countermodel → masculine poverty of soul → comradeship as inadequate present → friendship outstanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME1","text":"The friend is reclassified from an emotional object into a structural third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME2","text":"Friend and enemy are no longer mapped as opposites, but as coexisting functions of the same relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME3","text":"Intimacy is shifted from transparency to selective knowledge, silence, and guessing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME4","text":"Compassion is reclassified from passive indulgence into a hard, resistant form of participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME5","text":"The friend is redrawn from an affirming mirror into an imperfect mirror and transformative arrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6","text":"The social landscape is divided into present comradeship and future friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ME7","text":"The gendered opposition is bent back, through masculine incapacity, toward a general human diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text arranges solitude, friendship, enmity, compassion, and comradeship into a normative doctrine of relations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relationship is organized as a ternary, antagonistic, and non-dominating structure of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Longing, love, and compassion are transformed into diagnostic tests and forms of relational discipline.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The human being appears as an imperfect transitional form, while friendship functions as a future figure not yet realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the path from inner doubling to the friend as mediating third.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT2","text":"They suffice to derive friendship as an antagonistic, selective, and transformative relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the friend denotes a real relationship, an ideal type, or a pedagogical construction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT4","text":"The structure is strongest in the redefinition of intimacy through distance, resistance, and limited knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT5","text":"The gendered argumentation remains internally unstable because the exclusion of women passes over into a general masculine incapacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6","text":"The tension between the friend as mirror of the self and the friend as irreducible enemy remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT7","text":"Likewise unresolved remains the tension between helpful redemption and the demand that self-liberation cannot be performed by proxy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if the conclusion is read not as a solution, but as the indication of friendship still lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMF:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VOMF@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VOMF:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 24","title":"On the Friend","context":"Chapter 24","original_title":"Vom Freunde","original_context":"Chapter 24"},"original_title":"Vom Freunde","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE","layer":"CH","title":"On the Thousand and One Goals","order":25,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VTUE"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VTUE@R001","sha256":"629984a09b64f22c5aa87fe3b6bc148067d20aaaac79c8a4f6032c1a06d2ad26","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","text":"Die Verschiedenheit der Völker erzeugt Verschiedenheit ihrer Güter- und Bösetafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","text":"Kein Volk kann ohne Wertung leben, und sein Selbsterhalt verlangt eine eigene, vom Nachbarn unterschiedene Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","text":"Gut und Böse sind menschliche Schöpfungen, durch die Völker ihre Überwindungen, ihre Macht und ihre Hoffnung organisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS4","text":"Wertschöpfung ist zugleich Zerstörung früherer Werte und bewegt sich von kollektiven Schöpfern zu später entstehenden Einzelnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","text":"Tausend Völker erzeugen tausend Ziele; weil ein gemeinsames Ziel fehlt, ist die Menschheit noch nicht als erfüllte Einheit konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich genealogisch von der Wertpluralität über die menschliche Wertschöpfung zur Diagnose einer unvollendeten Menschheit und der offenen Forderung nach dem Einen Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","text":"Kein Volk kann ohne Wertung leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","text":"Der Selbsterhalt eines Volkes verlangt, dass es nicht nach den Werten seines Nachbarn wertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","text":"Was einem Volk gut gilt, kann einem anderen als Hohn, Schmach oder Böse gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","text":"Die Wertordnungen verschiedener Völker bleiben einander grundsätzlich unverständlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","text":"Die Gütertafel eines Volkes ist die Tafel seiner Überwindungen und die Stimme seines Willens zur Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A6","text":"Als gut gilt einem Volk, was ihm schwer, unerlässlich, rettend oder herrschaftsbegründend erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","text":"Menschen empfangen Gut und Böse nicht aus dem Himmel und finden sie nicht als fertige Gegebenheiten vor, sondern schaffen sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","text":"Schätzen erzeugt den Sinn und den Wert der Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","text":"Der Wandel der Werte ist ein Wandel der Schaffenden, und jedes Schaffen schließt Vernichtung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","text":"Völker waren die ersten Schöpfer von Werttafeln; der Einzelne entstand erst später als Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","text":"Liebe zur Herrschaft und Liebe zum Gehorsam können gemeinsam Werttafeln hervorbringen, während die Lust an der Herde älter ist als die Lust am Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A12","text":"Das eigennützige, lieblose Ich, das seinen Nutzen im Nutzen vieler sucht, ist nicht der Ursprung der Herde, sondern ihr Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A13","text":"Liebende und Schaffende erzeugen Gut und Böse, und Lob und Tadel besitzen dadurch eine umfassende Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","text":"Die tausend Völker haben tausend Ziele hervorgebracht, während der Menschheit das Eine Ziel fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","text":"Wo der Menschheit das Ziel fehlt, fehlt ihr auch ihre vollendete eigene Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX1","text":"Das System lässt kein wertfreies Leben zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX2","text":"Gut und Böse sind keine für alle Völker identischen Maßstäbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX3","text":"Der Wert des Nachbarn ist kein normativer Maßstab für den Selbsterhalt eines Volkes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX4","text":"Werte sind keine vom Himmel herabfallenden Stimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX5","text":"Werte sind keine unabhängig vom Menschen vorgefundenen Gegenstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX6","text":"Die Dinge besitzen keinen vorausliegenden Sinn, der erst nachträglich erkannt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX7","text":"Wertordnungen sind weder unveränderlich noch von ihrer eigenen Zerstörung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX8","text":"Der isolierte Einzelne ist nicht der ursprüngliche Ursprung von Wert und Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX9","text":"Allgemeiner Nutzen ist nicht der Ursprung der Herde, sondern kann als Zeichen ihres Untergangs erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX10","text":"Die Menschheit verfügt gegenwärtig über kein einheitliches Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D1","text":"Die Notwendigkeit eigener Wertung macht moralische Verschiedenheit zu einer Bedingung kollektiven Selbsterhalts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D2","text":"Moralische Gegensätze erscheinen als Differenzen kollektiver Überwindungsordnungen und nicht als bloße Irrtümer einzelner Urteile.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D3","text":"Gut und Böse bezeichnen den menschlich erzeugten Sinn, durch den Dinge in eine Wertordnung eintreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D4","text":"Jede neue Wertordnung verändert nicht nur Werte, sondern auch die Instanz, die als Schöpfer dieser Werte hervortritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D5","text":"Der Einzelne ist ein spätes Produkt kollektiver Wertschöpfung und keine vorsoziale Grundlage derselben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D6","text":"Lob und Tadel wirken als Machtmittel, weil sie die von Schaffenden erzeugten Werttafeln über viele Menschen hinweg befestigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D7","text":"Die Vielheit der Völker wird als Vielheit ihrer Ziele und nicht nur als Vielheit ihrer Lebensformen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D8","text":"Ein gemeinsames menschliches Ziel könnte innerhalb dieses Systems nicht entdeckt, sondern nur durch neue Wertschöpfung hervorgebracht werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD1","text":"Moralische Pluralität ist keine zufällige Störung einer ursprünglich gemeinsamen Ordnung, sondern entsteht aus den unterschiedlichen Bedingungen und Überwindungen kollektiver Selbsterhaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD2","text":"Die Menschheit erscheint nicht als bereits vorhandene Gattungseinheit, sondern als unvollendete Hervorbringung ihrer eigenen Wertschöpfungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD3","text":"Ein gemeinsames Ziel wäre keine Rückkehr zu einer transzendenten Wahrheit, sondern eine neue, machtvolle Setzung innerhalb des Prozesses von Schöpfung, Überwindung und Zerstörung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD4","text":"Die Entstehung des Individuums setzt kollektive Wertordnungen voraus, während die spätere Individualisierung zugleich als mögliche Auflösung der Herdenordnung erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VTUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD5","text":"Die Macht der Werte liegt nicht nur in ihrer normativen Geltung, sondern in ihrer Fähigkeit, Völker zu formen, zu beherrschen und auf Ziele auszurichten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine externe Instanz, die Gut und Böse unabhängig von menschlicher Wertschöpfung festlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine objektive Wertwelt, deren Bedeutungen von Menschen lediglich erkannt oder übernommen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine harmonische Koexistenz der Werttafeln, sofern diese ihre eigene Verschiedenheit nicht als Bedingung des Selbsterhalts aufgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Vorstellung, dass das Individuum der ursprüngliche Träger von Sinn, Wert und Gemeinschaft sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Schaffen, das ohne Vernichtung früherer Werte auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein gemeinsames Ziel, das als fertige Wahrheit vor jeder neuen Wertsetzung bereitliegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX1","text":"Es fehlt eine außerhalb der Wertschöpfung liegende Einheit, die der Menschheit bereits im Voraus ihre Identität verleiht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist die Möglichkeit, die Menschheit als bereits vollendete Einheit mit einem selbstverständlichen Ziel zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine wertende Ordnung, die zugleich allgemein gilt und von Macht, Überwindung, Lob und Tadel unabhängig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4","text":"Ungeklärt bleibt, wie aus tausend notwendigen Wertsetzungen ein Ziel hervorgehen könnte, das nicht erneut eine partikular hervorgebrachte Machtordnung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS1","text":"Verschiedene Völker + unterschiedliche Notlagen und Umwelten → verschiedene Werttafeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS2","text":"Werttafel → Kodierung dessen, was schwer, notwendig, rettend und herrschaftsbegründend ist → Gesetz der Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS3","text":"Menschliches Schätzen → Sinngebung der Dinge → Erzeugung von Gut und Böse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS4","text":"Wertschöpfung → Vernichtung früherer Werte → Wandel der Schaffenden → Übergang vom Volk zum späteren Einzelnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS5","text":"Liebe, Herrschaft, Gehorsam und Herde → kollektive Wertordnung → Lob und Tadel als Macht über Viele.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS6","text":"Tausend Völker → tausend Ziele → kein Eine Ziel → unvollendete Menschheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF1","text":"Völkervielfalt → divergierende Werttafeln → wechselseitiges Unverständnis → notwendige Eigenwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF2","text":"Eigenwertung → Schöpfung von Sinn und Gutem/Bösem → Werttafeln als Überwindungs- und Machtordnungen → Bildung von Volk, Herde und Einzelnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF3","text":"Kollektive Wertschöpfung → tausend Ziele → Abwesenheit des Einen Ziels → Menschheit als noch nicht vollendete Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF4","text":"Fehlendes Ziel → offene Frage nach einer neuen gemeinsamen Setzung, deren Entstehungsweise der Text nicht abschließend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME1","text":"Gut und Böse werden von transzendenten Kategorien in geschichtlich erzeugte Wertsetzungen kollektiver Lebensformen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME2","text":"Werttafeln werden nicht mehr primär als Moralregeln, sondern als Archive von Überwindung, Notlage, Macht und Hoffnung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME3","text":"Die Dinge erscheinen nicht als Träger eines vorausliegenden Sinns, sondern als durch menschliches Schätzen bedeutungserzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME4","text":"Der Einzelne wird von der Grundfigur des Menschen zu einer späten Hervorbringung kollektiver Wertschöpfung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME5","text":"Moralischer Konflikt wird von individueller Verfehlung auf inkompatible kollektive Wertordnungen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME6","text":"Die Menschheit wird von einer fertigen Gattung zu einem noch nicht abgeschlossenen Ziel- und Schöpfungsprozess umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT1","text":"Surface: Völker besitzen unterschiedliche Tafeln des Guten und Bösen und verfolgen unterschiedliche Ziele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT2","text":"Structural: Werttafeln organisieren Selbsterhalt, Überwindung, Herrschaft, Gehorsam und kollektive Hoffnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Analyse verschiebt die Frage von der richtigen Moral zur Erzeugung, Veränderung und möglichen Vereinheitlichung von Wertordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Sinn und Wert werden durch menschliches Schaffen hervorgebracht; Völker gehen den Einzelnen voraus, und die Menschheit bleibt ohne gemeinsames Ziel unvollendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Wertpluralität über menschliche Wertschöpfung bis zur Diagnose der unvollendeten Menschheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob und wie das Eine Ziel entstehen soll und welcher Träger es hervorbringen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Wertpluralität als Bedingung kollektiven Selbsterhalts und nicht als bloßer Irrtum verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Schätzen, Schaffen, Wert und Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Verbindung liegt im Übergang vom Fehlen eines gemeinsamen Ziels zum Fehlen der Menschheit selbst; dieser Übergang wird gesetzt, nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Notwendigkeit vieler eigener Werttafeln und der offenen Forderung nach dem Einen Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen dem Einzelnen als jüngster Schöpfung und der Menschheit als möglichem einheitlichem Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern das Ende als offene teleologische Leerstelle und nicht als bereits formulierte Lösung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195408459070Z_df5a3c35","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of a Thousand and One Goal","source_sha256":"629984a09b64f22c5aa87fe3b6bc148067d20aaaac79c8a4f6032c1a06d2ad26","sha256":"a6f9693bb70d6dba1b27acc457bb86d0677bec750cf0d71b26be2212e56fbaa6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:54:08.460720+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","text":"The diversity of peoples produces a diversity of their tables of goods and evils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","text":"No people can live without valuation, and its self-preservation requires an order of values of its own, distinct from that of its neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","text":"Good and evil are human creations through which peoples organize their overcomings, their power, and their hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS4","text":"Value-creation is at once the destruction of earlier values and moves from collective creators to individuals emerging later.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","text":"A thousand peoples produce a thousand goals; because a common goal is lacking, humanity is not yet constituted as a fulfilled unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AS6","text":"The argument moves genealogically from the plurality of values through human value-creation to the diagnosis of an unfinished humanity and the open demand for the One Goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","text":"No people can live without valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","text":"The self-preservation of a people requires that it not value according to the values of its neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","text":"What counts as good for one people can count as mockery, disgrace, or evil for another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","text":"The orders of values of different peoples remain fundamentally unintelligible to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","text":"The table of goods of a people is the table of its overcomings and the voice of its will to power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A6","text":"A people counts as good whatever appears to it difficult, indispensable, saving, or founding of dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","text":"Human beings do not receive good and evil from heaven and do not find them as ready-made givens, but create them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","text":"Valuing produces the meaning and the value of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","text":"The change of values is a change of creators, and every creation includes destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","text":"Peoples were the first creators of tables of values; the individual arose only later as a creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","text":"Love of dominion and love of obedience can jointly bring forth tables of values, while the pleasure in the herd is older than the pleasure in the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A12","text":"The self-interested, loveless I, which seeks its benefit in the benefit of many, is not the origin of the herd, but its downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A13","text":"Loving ones and creators produce good and evil, and praise and blame thereby possess a comprehensive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","text":"The thousand peoples have brought forth a thousand goals, while humanity lacks the One Goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","text":"Where humanity lacks the goal, it also lacks its completed unity of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX1","text":"The system permits no value-free life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX2","text":"Good and evil are not standards identical for all peoples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX3","text":"The neighbor's value is not a normative standard for the self-preservation of a people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX4","text":"Values are not voices falling down from heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX5","text":"Values are not objects found independently of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX6","text":"Things possess no antecedent meaning that would only subsequently be recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX7","text":"Orders of values are neither unchangeable nor separate from their own destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX8","text":"The isolated individual is not the original origin of value and community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX9","text":"General benefit is not the origin of the herd, but can appear as a sign of its downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:NX10","text":"Humanity presently possesses no unified goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D1","text":"The necessity of valuation of one's own makes moral difference a condition of collective self-preservation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D2","text":"Moral oppositions appear as differences of collective orders of overcoming and not as mere errors of individual judgments.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D3","text":"Good and evil designate the humanly produced meaning through which things enter into an order of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D4","text":"Every new order of values changes not only values, but also the instance that emerges as the creator of these values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D5","text":"The individual is a late product of collective value-creation and not its pre-social foundation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D6","text":"Praise and blame act as means of power because they consolidate across many human beings the tables of values produced by creators.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D7","text":"The plurality of peoples is determined as a plurality of their goals and not merely as a plurality of their forms of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:D8","text":"Within this system, a common human goal could not be discovered, but only brought forth through new value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD1","text":"Moral plurality is not an accidental disturbance of an originally common order, but arises from the differing conditions and overcomings of collective self-preservation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD2","text":"Humanity appears not as an already existing unity of species, but as an unfinished product of its own value-creations.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD3","text":"A common goal would not be a return to a transcendent truth, but a new, powerful positing within the process of creation, overcoming, and destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD4","text":"The emergence of the individual presupposes collective orders of values, while subsequent individualization appears at the same time as a possible dissolution of the herd order.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VTUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SD5","text":"The power of values lies not only in their normative validity, but in their capacity to form peoples, to dominate them, and to orient them toward goals.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an external instance that determines good and evil independently of human value-creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an objective world of values whose meanings are merely recognized or adopted by human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a harmonious coexistence of tables of values, insofar as these do not relinquish their own difference as a condition of self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the notion that the individual is the original bearer of meaning, value, and community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a creation that manages without the destruction of earlier values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a common goal that lies ready as a finished truth prior to every new positing of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX1","text":"Lacking is a unity lying outside value-creation that already grants humanity its identity in advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is the possibility of treating humanity as an already completed unity with a self-evident goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX3","text":"Not available is an order of valuation that is at once generally valid and remains independent of power, overcoming, praise, and blame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4","text":"It remains unresolved how, from a thousand necessary positings of value, there could arise a goal that would not once again be a particularly produced order of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS1","text":"Different peoples + different states of need and environments → different tables of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS2","text":"Table of values → codification of what is difficult, necessary, saving, and founding of dominion → law of overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS3","text":"Human valuing → conferral of meaning upon things → production of good and evil.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS4","text":"Value-creation → destruction of earlier values → change of creators → transition from the people to the later individual.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS5","text":"Love, dominion, obedience, and herd → collective order of values → praise and blame as power over many.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VTUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:FGS6","text":"A thousand peoples → a thousand goals → no One Goal → unfinished humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF1","text":"Diversity of peoples → divergent tables of values → mutual incomprehension → necessary valuation of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF2","text":"Valuation of one's own → creation of meaning and good/evil → tables of values as orders of overcoming and power → formation of people, herd, and individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF3","text":"Collective value-creation → a thousand goals → absence of the One Goal → humanity as a unity not yet completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:AF4","text":"Missing goal → open question of a new common positing, whose mode of emergence the text does not conclusively determine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME1","text":"Good and evil are remapped from transcendent categories into historically produced positings of value by collective forms of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME2","text":"Tables of values become legible no longer primarily as moral rules, but as archives of overcoming, states of need, power, and hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME3","text":"Things appear not as bearers of an antecedent meaning, but as rendered meaning-producing through human valuing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME4","text":"The individual is reclassified from the basic figure of the human being into a late product of collective value-creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME5","text":"Moral conflict is shifted from individual failure to incompatible collective orders of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ME6","text":"Humanity is redrawn from a finished species into a process of goal and creation not yet concluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT1","text":"Surface: Peoples possess different tables of good and evil and pursue different goals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT2","text":"Structural: Tables of values organize self-preservation, overcoming, dominion, obedience, and collective hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The analysis shifts the question from the right morality to the production, transformation, and possible unification of orders of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Meaning and value are brought forth through human creation; peoples precede individuals, and humanity remains unfinished without a common goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the plurality of values through human value-creation to the diagnosis of unfinished humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether and how the One Goal is to arise and which bearer could bring it forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as the plurality of values is understood as a condition of collective self-preservation and not as a mere error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection consists between valuing, creating, value, and power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT5","text":"The weakest connection lies in the transition from the absence of a common goal to the absence of humanity itself; this transition is posited, not fully mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the necessity of many tables of values of one's own and the open demand for the One Goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT7","text":"A further tension exists between the individual as the youngest creation and humanity as a possible unified subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VTUE:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the end is read as an open teleological lacuna and not as an already formulated solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VTUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VTUE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VTUE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 25","title":"On the Thousand and One Goals","context":"Chapter 25","original_title":"Von tausend und Einem Ziele","original_context":"Chapter 25"},"original_title":"Von tausend und Einem Ziele","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC","layer":"CH","title":"On Love of One’s Neighbour","order":26,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDNC"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDNC@R001","sha256":"b9bfe5710eae1e02e65b516960a164dd49e94bd35db4db30c17bfc35cbd2ea07","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","text":"Die Nächstenliebe wird als Problem einer verkleideten Selbstflucht bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS2","text":"Der Vorrang des Du vor dem Ich erzeugt eine moralisch geheiligte, aber ungeprüfte Form der Selbstvermeidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","text":"Die soziale Beziehung fungiert als Bühne für Selbsttäuschung, Fremdbestätigung und gegenseitige Verfälschung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","text":"Die Kritik der Nächstenliebe wird in eine Rangordnung von Nächsten-, Fernsten-, Zukunfts-, Ding-, Gespenster- und Freundesliebe überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS5","text":"Der Freund ersetzt den Nächsten als schöpferische Beziehung und wird zum Medium des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS6","text":"Das gegenwärtige Handeln soll durch Zukunft und Fernstes kausal bestimmt werden; das Gute entsteht als Werden aus Bösem und Zufall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","text":"Die gewöhnliche Nächstenliebe kann eine schlechte Liebe zu sich selbst sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","text":"Der Mensch kann vor sich selbst zum Nächsten fliehen und diese Flucht als Selbstlosigkeit ausgeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","text":"Das Du ist in der geltenden moralischen Ordnung älter und geheiligter als das Ich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A4","text":"Der Umgang mit anderen kann den Charakter verderben oder einen fehlenden Charakter verdecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","text":"Selbsturteile können durch die Zustimmung eines verführten Zeugen künstlich beglaubigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A6","text":"Über sich selbst kann man nicht nur gegen besseres Wissen, sondern auch gegen eigenes Nichtwissen lügen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A7","text":"Die Nächstenliebe wird teilweise von den Fernen bezahlt, die in der sozialen Nahordnung unsichtbare Kosten tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","text":"Gruppenbeziehungen können Schauspiel, Zuschauertum und gegenseitige Rollenübernahme hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A9","text":"Einsamkeit kann durch schlechte Selbstliebe zum Gefängnis werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","text":"Die Liebe zum Fernsten und Künftigen steht höher als die Liebe zum Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A11","text":"Die Liebe zu Sachen und Gespenstern kann höher stehen als die Liebe zu Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","text":"Der Freund ist nicht bloß Gegenstand der Zuneigung, sondern eine schöpferische Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A13","text":"Ein übervolles Herz setzt die Fähigkeit voraus, aufnehmend und formbar wie ein Schwamm zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","text":"Der schöpferische Freund verschenkt eine bereits geformte Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","text":"Das Werden des Guten kann durch das Böse hindurch erfolgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","text":"Zwecke können aus dem Zufall hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","text":"Zukunft und Fernstes sollen als Ursache des gegenwärtigen Handelns fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","text":"Im Freund soll der Übermensch als Ursache geliebt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","text":"Nächstenliebe ist nicht notwendig Selbstlosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX2","text":"Nächstenliebe ist nicht notwendig echte Liebe zum Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX3","text":"Der Nächste ist nicht das höchste Objekt der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX4","text":"Das Du darf nicht unbefragt als heiliger Vorrang vor dem Ich gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX5","text":"Selbstlob durch den verführten Zeugen ist keine gesicherte Selbsterkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX6","text":"Soziale Rede über sich selbst ist nicht automatisch wahrheitsfähig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX7","text":"Gemeinschaft ist nicht notwendig Charakterbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX8","text":"Festlichkeit ist nicht notwendig gemeinsames Feiern; sie kann kollektives Schauspiel sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX9","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht notwendig Freiheit oder Selbstgenügsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX10","text":"Der Nächste ist nicht mit dem Freund gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX11","text":"Gegenwart ist nicht der höchste zeitliche Bezugspunkt des Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX12","text":"Ordnung, Zweck und Güte sind nicht auf unmittelbare moralische Reinheit angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D1","text":"Die Nächstenliebe kann der Selbstvermeidung dienen, weil der Mensch sich im Nächsten vor sich selbst verbirgt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D2","text":"Die moralische Erhöhung des Nächsten stabilisiert die Verdrängung des eigenen Selbst.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D3","text":"Soziale Anerkennung erzeugt ein zirkuläres Selbstverhältnis: Der Mensch lässt sich bestätigen, um sich anschließend selbst zu bestätigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D4","text":"Der Nächste wird zum Medium gegenseitiger Selbsttäuschung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D5","text":"Die Nächstenordnung erzeugt externe Kosten, weil die Fernen für die unmittelbare Gemeinschaft einstehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D6","text":"Die soziale Gruppe kann Individualität durch Rollen, Zuschauerpositionen und Schauspiel verdecken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A4","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D7","text":"Die Alternative zur Nächstenbeziehung ist nicht bloße Isolation, sondern die schöpferische Hervorbringung eines Freundes aus dem eigenen Selbst.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D8","text":"Die höhere Liebe richtet sich auf das Fernste und Künftige, weil sie das Gegenwärtige transzendiert und formt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D9","text":"Der Freund wird zur Schale, in der eine fertige Welt empfangen, verkörpert und verschenkt werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A13","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D10","text":"Der Übermensch erscheint nicht primär als erreichter Zustand, sondern als kausale Zukunftsfigur der Freundschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D11","text":"Das Gute wird als Prozess einer Umformung verstanden, nicht als vorausliegende moralische Substanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD1","text":"Das Argument ersetzt eine horizontal-gegenwärtige Ethik der Nähe durch eine vertikal-zeitliche Ethik der Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD2","text":"Die soziale Nähe wird als Erhaltungsmechanismus des gegenwärtigen Selbst entlarvt, während die Fernstenliebe als Produktionsmechanismus eines anderen Selbst fungiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD3","text":"Wahrheit wird nicht als private Übereinstimmung, sondern als Widerstand gegen die sozialen Verfahren der Selbstbeglaubigung behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD4","text":"Der Freund verbindet Selbsterschaffung, Weltentwurf und Zukunftsorientierung in einer einzigen Beziehungsfigur.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD5","text":"Das System macht aus Zufall und Bösem keine Gegenprinzipien des Guten, sondern Durchgangsbedingungen seiner Entstehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD6","text":"Die behauptete Rangordnung der Liebe totalisiert die Zukunft als normativen Ursprung der Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass unmittelbare soziale Nähe keine verlässliche Quelle von Wahrheit, Charakter oder Güte ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass moralische Selbstlosigkeit häufig eine Form verdeckter Selbstbeziehung bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Selbst aus, das sich durch Anerkennung, Gemeinschaft und Nächstenliebe bereits erfüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass das Gute als fertige Norm vor seinem Werden existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX5","text":"Es verweigert der Gegenwart die Befugnis, den Sinn des Handelns abschließend zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX6","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Individualität nicht durch soziale Spiegelung, sondern durch schöpferische Selbstbildung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Ethik, in der Nähe bereits moralische Wahrheit garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein autonomes Ich, das ohne Spannung zwischen Selbstliebe, Selbstflucht und Selbsterschaffung auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Gegenwart, die weder von einem Fernsten noch von einer kommenden Gestalt des Menschen überboten werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der soziale Anerkennung, Charakter und Wahrheit ohne theatrale Vermittlung zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","text":"Die strukturelle Abwesenheit ist eine nicht-entfremdete Gemeinschaft, in der der Nächste weder Gefängnis noch Verführer noch Kostenverursacher wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX6","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine unmittelbar gegebene Güte; an ihre Stelle tritt ein noch zu erzeugendes Werden des Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS1","text":"Moralischer Vorrang des Du → Verdrängung des Ich → Nächstenliebe als Selbstflucht → Selbsttäuschung durch soziale Bestätigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS2","text":"Soziale Nähe → Rollen- und Zeugenstruktur → verfälschtes Selbsturteil → Charakterverlust oder Charaktermaskierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS3","text":"Nächstenbeziehung → Kosten für die Fernen → Umkehrung der Wertordnung → Vorrang des Fernsten und Künftigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS4","text":"Ablehnung der Nächstenliebe → Abgrenzung der Freundschaft → Freund als schöpferische Weltinstanz → Übermensch als Zukunftsursache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS5","text":"Zufall und Böse → Umformung im Werden → Entstehung von Zweck und Gutem → rückwirkende Bestimmung der Gegenwart durch die Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS6","text":"Gegenwärtige soziale Moral → Diagnose der Selbstvermeidung → zeitliche und ontologische Umkehrung → schöpferische Fernstenliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AF1","text":"Geheiligte Nächstenliebe → Diagnose der Selbstflucht → Aufdeckung sozialer Selbsttäuschung → Sichtbarmachung externer Kosten → Vorrang des Fernsten und Künftigen → Freund als schöpferische Vorform des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME1","text":"Nächstenliebe wird von einer moralischen Tugend zu einem möglichen Mechanismus der Selbstvermeidung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME2","text":"Nähe und moralischer Wert werden voneinander getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME3","text":"Der Nächste wird vom Zielpunkt der Ethik zum Prüfstein ihrer Selbsttäuschungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME4","text":"Die Fernen werden als verborgene Träger der Kosten sozialer Nähe sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME5","text":"Freundschaft wird von Gegenseitigkeit und Gesellschaft unterschieden und als schöpferische Weltgabe klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME6","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als Folge der Gegenwart, sondern als Ursache gegenwärtiger Orientierung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME7","text":"Böse und Zufall werden aus der Position absoluter Gegenprinzipien entfernt und in die Genese des Guten integriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME8","text":"Der Übermensch wird als relationale und zeitliche Funktion innerhalb der Freundschaft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Sprecherstimme weist die Nächstenliebe zurück und empfiehlt Fernstenliebe, Freundschaft und Zukunftsorientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT2","text":"Structural — Nächstenliebe stabilisiert Selbstflucht, soziale Spiegelung, Rollenspiel und die Externalisierung von Kosten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die moralische Rangordnung wird umgekehrt: Nicht Nähe, sondern Distanz, Zukunft und schöpferische Überschreitung bestimmen den höheren Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Gute entsteht im Werden aus Bösem und Zufall; das Künftige wirkt als Ursache des Gegenwärtigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Kritik der Nächstenliebe zur Konstruktion der Freundschaft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT2","text":"Die Ableitungen bewahren die operative Unterscheidung zwischen Nächsten, Fernsten und Freund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die schöpferische Hervorbringung des Freundes praktisch oder institutionell erfolgen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, wie die behauptete Rangordnung von Menschen, Sachen und Gespenstern begründet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Zukunft, Freundschaft und Übermensch als normative Kausalordnung akzeptiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Kritik sozialer Beziehungen und der positiven Abhängigkeit vom Freund als relationaler Figur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass Selbsterschaffung zugleich Selbstüberwindung und Empfang einer vom Freund geschenkten fertigen Welt sein soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, verliert jedoch die aphoristische Mehrdeutigkeit der Rangordnung, sofern deren poetische Bilder nicht als eigenständige Operatoren erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194535703975Z_143f13b7","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Love of the Neighbor","source_sha256":"b9bfe5710eae1e02e65b516960a164dd49e94bd35db4db30c17bfc35cbd2ea07","sha256":"48bdc60c5ac95f44c4447ff9d63543f462bc5c0c86f5fbf7f4af4b8751c16c4b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:45:35.706301+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","text":"Love of the neighbor is determined as the problem of a disguised flight from oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS2","text":"The priority of the Thou over the I produces a morally sanctified yet unexamined form of self-avoidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","text":"The social relationship functions as a stage for self-deception, validation by others, and mutual falsification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","text":"The critique of love of the neighbor is transformed into a hierarchy of love of the neighbor, love of the farthest, love of the future, love of things, love of spectres, and love of the friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS5","text":"The friend replaces the neighbor as a creative relationship and becomes the medium of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AS6","text":"Present action is to be causally determined by the future and the farthest; the good arises as becoming out of evil and chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","text":"Ordinary love of the neighbor can be a bad love of oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","text":"The human being can flee from himself to the neighbor and pass off this flight as selflessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","text":"In the prevailing moral order, the Thou is older and more sanctified than the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A4","text":"Dealings with others can corrupt character or conceal a lacking character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","text":"Self-judgments can be artificially authenticated through the assent of a seduced witness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A6","text":"One can lie about oneself not only against better knowledge, but also against one's own non-knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A7","text":"Love of the neighbor is partly paid for by the distant, who bear invisible costs within the social order of proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","text":"Group relations can bring forth acting, spectatorship, and mutual assumption of roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A9","text":"Solitude can become a prison through bad self-love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","text":"Love of the farthest and the future ranks higher than love of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A11","text":"Love of things and spectres can rank higher than love of human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","text":"The friend is not merely an object of affection, but a creative instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A13","text":"An overflowing heart presupposes the capacity to be receptive and malleable like a sponge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","text":"The creative friend gives away an already formed world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","text":"The becoming of the good can take place through evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","text":"Ends can arise from chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","text":"The future and the farthest are to function as the cause of present action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","text":"In the friend, the Overman is to be loved as cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","text":"Love of the neighbor is not necessarily selflessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX2","text":"Love of the neighbor is not necessarily genuine love of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX3","text":"The neighbor is not the highest object of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX4","text":"The Thou must not count unquestioned as a sacred priority over the I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX5","text":"Self-praise through the seduced witness is not secured self-knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX6","text":"Social speech about oneself is not automatically capable of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX7","text":"Community is not necessarily character formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX8","text":"Festivity is not necessarily collective celebration; it can be collective spectacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX9","text":"Solitude is not necessarily freedom or self-sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX10","text":"The neighbor is not to be equated with the friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX11","text":"The present is not the highest temporal point of reference for action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:NX12","text":"Order, purpose, and goodness do not depend on immediate moral purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D1","text":"Love of the neighbor can serve self-avoidance because the human being hides from himself in the neighbor.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D2","text":"The moral elevation of the neighbor stabilizes the repression of one's own self.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D3","text":"Social recognition produces a circular relation to oneself: the human being has himself validated in order subsequently to validate himself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D4","text":"The neighbor becomes the medium of mutual self-deception.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D5","text":"The order of the neighbor produces external costs because the distant answer for the immediate community.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D6","text":"The social group can conceal individuality through roles, spectator positions, and acting.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A4","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D7","text":"The alternative to the relationship with the neighbor is not mere isolation, but the creative bringing forth of a friend out of one's own self.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D8","text":"The higher love is directed toward the farthest and the future because it transcends and forms the present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D9","text":"The friend becomes the vessel in which a finished world can be received, embodied, and given away.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A13","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D10","text":"The Overman appears not primarily as an attained state, but as a causal future figure of friendship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:D11","text":"The good is understood as a process of transformation, not as a pre-existing moral substance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD1","text":"The argument replaces a horizontal-present ethics of proximity with a vertical-temporal ethics of overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD2","text":"Social proximity is unmasked as a mechanism for preserving the present self, while love of the farthest functions as a mechanism for producing another self.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD3","text":"Truth is treated not as private correspondence, but as resistance to the social procedures of self-authentication.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A6","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD4","text":"The friend unites self-creation, world-projection, and orientation toward the future in a single relational figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD5","text":"The system makes neither chance nor evil counter-principles of the good, but transitional conditions of its emergence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SD6","text":"The asserted hierarchy of love totalizes the future as the normative origin of the present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX1","text":"The system depends on immediate social proximity not being a reliable source of truth, character, or goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that moral selflessness frequently remains a form of concealed self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX3","text":"It excludes a self that already fulfills itself through recognition, community, and love of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that the good exists as a finished norm prior to its becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX5","text":"It denies the present the authority conclusively to determine the meaning of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:DNX6","text":"It presupposes that individuality arises not through social mirroring, but through creative self-formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ethics in which proximity already guarantees moral truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an autonomous I that can do without tension between self-love, flight from oneself, and self-creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a present that need not be surpassed either by a farthest or by a coming figure of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a world in which social recognition, character, and truth coincide without theatrical mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","text":"The structural absence is a non-alienated community in which the neighbor would be neither prison nor seducer nor producer of costs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX6","text":"The blocked possibility is an immediately given goodness; in its place stands a becoming of the good yet to be produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS1","text":"Moral priority of the Thou → repression of the I → love of the neighbor as flight from oneself → self-deception through social validation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS2","text":"Social proximity → role and witness structure → falsified self-judgment → loss of character or masking of character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS3","text":"Relationship with the neighbor → costs for the distant → reversal of the order of value → priority of the farthest and the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS4","text":"Rejection of love of the neighbor → differentiation of friendship → friend as creative world-instance → Overman as future cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS5","text":"Chance and evil → transformation in becoming → emergence of purpose and the good → retroactive determination of the present by the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:FGS6","text":"Present social morality → diagnosis of self-avoidance → temporal and ontological reversal → creative love of the farthest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:AF1","text":"Sanctified love of the neighbor → diagnosis of flight from oneself → disclosure of social self-deception → rendering external costs visible → priority of the farthest and the future → friend as creative prefiguration of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME1","text":"Love of the neighbor is remapped from a moral virtue into a possible mechanism of self-avoidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME2","text":"Proximity and moral value are separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME3","text":"The neighbor is shifted from the endpoint of ethics to the touchstone of its self-deceptions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME4","text":"The distant become visible as hidden bearers of the costs of social proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME5","text":"Friendship is distinguished from reciprocity and society and classified as a creative gift of world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME6","text":"The future is mapped not as a consequence of the present, but as a cause of present orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME7","text":"Evil and chance are removed from the position of absolute counter-principles and integrated into the genesis of the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ME8","text":"The Overman becomes visible as a relational and temporal function within friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker's voice rejects love of the neighbor and recommends love of the farthest, friendship, and orientation toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT2","text":"Structural — Love of the neighbor stabilizes flight from oneself, social mirroring, role-playing, and the externalization of costs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The moral hierarchy is reversed: not proximity, but distance, future, and creative transcendence determine the higher value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The good arises in becoming out of evil and chance; the future acts as cause of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the critique of love of the neighbor to the construction of friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT2","text":"The derivations preserve the operative distinction between neighbor, farthest, and friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the creative bringing forth of the friend is to occur practically or institutionally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT4","text":"It further remains underdetermined how the asserted hierarchy of human beings, things, and spectres is grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as future, friendship, and Overman are accepted as a normative causal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the critique of social relationships and the positive dependence on the friend as a relational figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT7","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that self-creation is at once to be self-overcoming and the reception of a finished world given as a gift by the friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDNC:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, yet loses the aphoristic ambiguity of the hierarchy insofar as its poetic images are not retained as autonomous operators.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDNC@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDNC:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 26","title":"On Love of One’s Neighbour","context":"Chapter 26","original_title":"Von der Nächstenliebe","original_context":"Chapter 26"},"original_title":"Von der Nächstenliebe","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS","layer":"CH","title":"On the Way of the Creator","order":27,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VWDS"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VWDS@R001","sha256":"74a9ea452d5c13bb1908076271ea45784bd9adeaf1b7316c4c8df1a7f3b0a3f6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert den Übergang aus der Heerde in eine Vereinsamung, die nicht bloß räumliche Trennung, sondern Selbstsuche bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS2","text":"Die Loslösung von der Heerde beseitigt deren Stimme nicht, sondern verwandelt sie in Schuld, Schmerz und innere Anklage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS3","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst wird als prüfbedürftige Erzeugung neuer Kraft, neuen Rechts und einer positiven Freiheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4","text":"Diese Freiheit muss sich als Selbstgesetzgebung, eigenes Richten und eigene Vergeltung gegen das eigene Gesetz bewähren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS5","text":"Die daraus entstehende Einsamkeit führt durch gesellschaftliche Feindschaft, innere Gegner, Verachtung und Selbstverbrennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS6","text":"Aus der Verbindung von Selbstliebe, Selbstverachtung und Schaffen entsteht eine neue Gestalt, deren Gerechtigkeit erst nachträglich und deren Erfolg als mögliches Zugrundegehen erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A1","text":"Die Heerde erklärt Selbstsuche und Vereinsamung für Schuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","text":"Die Stimme der Heerde bleibt im Einzelnen als inneres Gewissen wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst verlangt den Nachweis einer neuen Kraft und eines neuen Rechts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","text":"Freiheit wird durch ihr Wozu und nicht durch die bloße Befreiung von einem Joch bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","text":"Der Einzelne muss sich selbst sein Gutes und Böses geben und seinen Willen als Gesetz aufhängen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","text":"Selbstgesetzgebung schließt ein, sich selbst Richter und Rächer des eigenen Gesetzes zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","text":"Vereinsamung ist eine furchtbare Prüfung, in der Gefühle den Einsamen vernichten wollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A8","text":"Der Einsame muss die gegen ihn gerichteten zerstörerischen Gefühle überwinden und gegebenenfalls selbst töten können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","text":"Höhere Selbstsetzung erzeugt Neid, Hass, Ungerechtigkeit und die Verkleinerung des Einzelnen im Blick der Vielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A10","text":"Die hergebrachten Guten und Gerechten bekämpfen denjenigen, der sich seine eigene Tugend erfindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A11","text":"Liebe kann den Einsamen durch vorschnelle Nähe und unterschiedslose Handreichung schwächen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","text":"Der schlimmste Feind des Einsamen ist der Einsame selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst führt durch sieben innere Teufel und durch Selbstverwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","text":"Neues Werden verlangt, sich in der eigenen Flamme zu verbrennen und zu Asche zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","text":"Der Schaffende erzeugt aus seinen sieben Teufeln einen Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","text":"Selbstliebe verbindet sich mit Selbstverachtung, weil der Liebende schaffen will, was er zugleich verachten musste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","text":"Liebe und Schaffen gehen der Gerechtigkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A18","text":"Das Über-sich-hinaus-Schaffen schließt das mögliche Zugrundegehen ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX1","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst ist nicht die Fortsetzung der Zugehörigkeit zur Heerde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX2","text":"Vereinsamung ist nicht die schmerzlose Aufhebung des herdengemäßen Gewissens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3","text":"Freiheit ist nicht bloße Befreiung von einem Joch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX4","text":"Selbstbefreiung ist nicht schon Selbstwert oder Selbstherrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX5","text":"Der Weg des Einzelnen ist nicht durch Ehrgeiz, Höhenlust oder aufgeblähte große Gedanken begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX6","text":"Selbstgesetzgebung ist nicht die Übernahme eines bereits geltenden moralischen Gesetzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX7","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht Unverwundbarkeit und nicht die Abwesenheit innerer Anfechtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX8","text":"Eigene Tugend ist nicht mit der Tugend der Guten und Gerechten identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX9","text":"Heilige Einfalt ist nicht das neutrale Maß für das Heilige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX10","text":"Liebe ist nicht unterschiedslose Nähe oder allgemeine Handreichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX11","text":"Der tiefste Feind liegt nicht ausschließlich außerhalb des Einzelnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX12","text":"Neues Werden ist nicht kontinuierliche Selbstbewahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX13","text":"Schaffen ist nicht von Verachtung und Selbstzerstörung ablösbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX14","text":"Gerechtigkeit ist nicht der anfängliche Maßstab des Weges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D1","text":"Die Loslösung von der Heerde verlagert den sozialen Konflikt in das Innere des Einzelnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D2","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst kann nur durch eine positive Selbstbegründung und nicht durch bloße Abwendung von der Heerde vollzogen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D3","text":"Freiheit wird zur Fähigkeit, eine selbstgesetzte Ordnung zu erzeugen, zu richten und gegen sich selbst durchzusetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D4","text":"Die Einsamkeit ist zugleich Bedingung und Bewährungsprobe der Selbstgesetzgebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D5","text":"Der Aufstieg des Einzelnen vergrößert seine soziale Angreifbarkeit und vermindert seine Sichtbarkeit im Blick des Neides.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D6","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Feindschaft gegen den Einzelnen bestätigt nicht dessen moralische Unschuld, sondern zwingt ihn zur Auswahl seiner eigenen Gerechtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D7","text":"Selbstbehauptung verlangt eine kontrollierte Grenze der Liebe und eine nicht unterschiedslose Beziehung zu anderen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D8","text":"Selbstüberwindung setzt voraus, dass der Einzelne seine eigenen inneren Gegenmächte als Material des Weges anerkennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D9","text":"Schöpferische Erneuerung setzt eine vorgängige Selbstauflösung voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D10","text":"Liebe wird schöpferisch, indem sie Selbstbejahung und Selbstverachtung in eine einzige Bewegung bringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D11","text":"Gerechtigkeit kann erst nach der schöpferischen Selbstverwandlung auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D12","text":"Der Erfolg des Weges wird nicht durch Bestand, sondern durch die Fähigkeit zum Über-sich-hinaus-Schaffen bestimmt, selbst wenn dieses zum Untergang führt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD1","text":"Der Weg zu sich selbst ist keine Entdeckung eines bereits fertigen Selbst, sondern die Produktion eines Selbst durch Gesetzgebung, Prüfung und Zerstörung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD2","text":"Äußere Feindschaft und innere Dämonie bilden zwei Ebenen derselben Bewährungsstruktur: Der Einzelne muss Widerstand nicht nur ertragen, sondern in Schaffenskraft umwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD3","text":"Freiheit, Liebe und Schaffen bilden eine Sequenz aus Selbstgesetzgebung, selektiver Trennung, Verachtung, Selbstverbrennung und neuer Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A11","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD4","text":"Die normative Ordnung wird zeitlich nachgeordnet: Gerechtigkeit erscheint erst, nachdem der Einzelne sich durch Schaffen verändert hat.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD5","text":"Das Selbst entsteht als gespaltener Vollzug, weil es zugleich Gesetzgeber, Richter, Rächer, Feind, Liebender und Verachtender sein muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD6","text":"Die Forderung nach autonomer Selbstbegründung bleibt auf eine fremde Aufforderung zur Rechtfertigung angewiesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD7","text":"Selbstliebe und Selbstverachtung sind keine aufgelösten Gegensätze, sondern die produktive Spannung, aus der das Schaffen hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein vorgegebenes, stabiles und lediglich auffindbares Selbst aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX2","text":"Es schließt Freiheit als bloße Abwesenheit äußerer Einschränkung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine neutrale oder versöhnliche soziale Anerkennungsordnung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX4","text":"Es schließt ein für den Einzelnen verbindliches, bereits fertiges Gut-Böse-Schema aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX5","text":"Es schließt Schaffen als reine Steigerung, Anhäufung oder ungebrochene Affirmation aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX6","text":"Es schließt Liebe als Versöhnung ohne Verachtung und Trennung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX7","text":"Es schließt Gerechtigkeit als vorgängige Legitimation des Einzelnen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX8","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Trennung zwischen äußerer Verfolgung und innerer Selbstfeindschaft aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer von äußerer Anerkennung und überlieferter Moral unabhängigen, zugleich aber vollständig gesicherten Identität bleibt versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX2","text":"Eine friedliche Kontinuität zwischen Einzelnen und Heerde wird als nicht verfügbare Möglichkeit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX3","text":"Ein ungespaltenes Selbst ist unzulässig, weil Selbstgesetzgebung die Verdoppelung in Gesetzgeber, Richter und Rächer voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4","text":"Eine Schöpfung ohne Selbstvernichtung wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX5","text":"Eine endgültige Versöhnung von Selbstliebe, Selbstverachtung, Liebe und Gerechtigkeit wird nicht bereitgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX6","text":"Die vollständige Auflösung der sieben inneren Gegenmächte bleibt als nicht abgeschlossene Möglichkeit außerhalb des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS1","text":"Herdzugehörigkeit → internalisierte Stimme → Schuld und Schmerz der Absonderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS2","text":"Schmerz der Absonderung → Forderung nach neuer Kraft und neuem Recht → Unterscheidung von Freiheit-von und Freiheit-wozu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS3","text":"Freiheit-wozu → Selbstgesetzgebung → eigener Richter und eigener Rächer → furchtbare Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS4","text":"Einsamkeit → innere und äußere Feindschaft → Verachtung, Abwehr und Konfrontation mit den sieben Teufeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS5","text":"Konfrontation mit den Gegenmächten → Selbstverbrennung → Asche → Möglichkeit des neuen Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS6","text":"Selbstverbrennung → Schaffen eines Gottes aus den Teufeln → Selbstliebe durch Selbstverachtung → verspätete Gerechtigkeit und mögliches Zugrundegehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AF1","text":"Herdgewissen → schmerzhafte Absonderung → Forderung nach neuer Kraft und neuem Recht → Freiheit als Selbstgesetzgebung → Einsamkeit als Gericht → soziale und innere Feindschaft → Verachtung und Selbstverbrennung → Schaffen aus den eigenen Teufeln → verspätete Gerechtigkeit und mögliches Zugrundegehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME1","text":"Freiheit wird von der Karte der Befreiung auf die Karte der Selbstgesetzgebung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME2","text":"Vereinsamung wird vom negativen Zustand der Trennung zur produktiven Passage der Selbstwerdung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME3","text":"Gesellschaftliche Verachtung wird nicht nur als Gegenwehr, sondern als Prüf- und Transformationsmedium sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME4","text":"Die moralische Opposition zwischen Gut und Böse wird durch die Aufgabe ersetzt, eigenes Gut und eigenes Böse zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME5","text":"Innere Teufel werden von Hindernissen zu schöpferischem Rohmaterial umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME6","text":"Liebe wird aus der Sphäre unmittelbarer Versöhnung in die Spannung von Nähe, Grenze, Verachtung und Schaffen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME7","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird aus der Anfangsbedingung des Handelns an das Ende einer noch nicht abgeschlossenen Verwandlung verlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT1","text":"Surface: Die Rede fordert den Bruder auf, die Heerde zu verlassen, den Weg zu sich selbst zu gehen und zu schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT2","text":"Structural: Der Text organisiert Selbstwerdung als Konflikt zwischen Herdengewissen, moralischer Konvention, sozialem Neid und innerer Selbstfeindschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Freiheit wird als positive Selbstsetzung neu gerahmt; Widerstand, Verachtung und Einsamkeit werden zu notwendigen Bedingungen der Strategie des Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Das Selbst ist ein werdendes, gespaltenes und sich selbst überschreitendes Verhältnis; seine Verwandlung geht der Gerechtigkeit voraus und kann im Zugrundegehen enden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Herdzugehörigkeit über Selbstgesetzgebung und Einsamkeit zum Schaffen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Gott und die sieben Teufel eigenständige Mächte, Selbstzustände oder Funktionen des Schaffens sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, nach welchem Kriterium das selbstgegebene Gute und Böse verbindlich werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Selbstliebe, Selbstverachtung, Zerstörung und Schaffen als aufeinander angewiesene Vollzüge gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umstellung von Freiheit-von auf Freiheit-wozu und in der Rückführung äußerer Feindschaft auf Selbstprüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT6","text":"Die unaufgelösten Bruchlinien liegen zwischen autonomer Selbstbegründung und fremder Aufforderung zur Rechtfertigung, zwischen Einsamkeit und notwendiger Anrede sowie zwischen Selbstliebe und Selbstverachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange das mögliche Zugrundegehen nicht als Scheitern außerhalb, sondern als im Schaffen angelegte Konsequenz behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195524760997Z_bd6dd671","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Way of the Creator","source_sha256":"74a9ea452d5c13bb1908076271ea45784bd9adeaf1b7316c4c8df1a7f3b0a3f6","sha256":"e4e2334c5c89e225e2b298cabe9fae41aae54b173376b3502661970d748a3c09","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:55:24.762927+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the transition from the herd into a solitude that signifies not merely spatial separation but the search for oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS2","text":"Detachment from the herd does not eliminate its voice, but transforms it into guilt, pain, and inner accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS3","text":"The way to oneself is determined as a test-requiring production of new strength, new right, and a positive freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4","text":"This freedom must prove itself as self-legislation, one's own judging, and one's own retribution against one's own law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS5","text":"The solitude arising from this leads through social hostility, inner enemies, contempt, and self-incineration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AS6","text":"From the conjunction of self-love, self-contempt, and creation arises a new figure, whose justice appears only afterward and whose success appears as possible perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A1","text":"The herd declares self-search and solitude to be guilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","text":"The voice of the herd remains effective within the individual as inner conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","text":"The way to oneself demands proof of a new strength and a new right.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","text":"Freedom is determined by its what-for and not by mere liberation from a yoke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","text":"The individual must be able to give himself his own good and evil and to hang up his will as law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","text":"Self-legislation includes being oneself the judge and avenger of one's own law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","text":"Solitude is a terrible trial in which feelings seek to destroy the solitary one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A8","text":"The solitary one must overcome the destructive feelings directed against him and, if necessary, be able to kill them himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","text":"Higher self-positing generates envy, hatred, injustice, and the diminution of the individual in the gaze of the many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A10","text":"The inherited good and just ones fight against the one who invents his own virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A11","text":"Love can weaken the solitary one through premature proximity and indiscriminate assistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","text":"The solitary one's worst enemy is the solitary one himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","text":"The way to oneself leads through seven inner devils and through self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","text":"New becoming demands burning oneself in one's own flame and becoming ashes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","text":"The creator produces a god from his seven devils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","text":"Self-love combines with self-contempt because the one who loves wishes to create what he had at the same time to despise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","text":"Love and creation precede justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:A18","text":"Creating beyond oneself includes possible perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX1","text":"The way to oneself is not the continuation of belonging to the herd.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX2","text":"Solitude is not the painless abolition of herd-conforming conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3","text":"Freedom is not mere liberation from a yoke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX4","text":"Self-liberation is not already self-worth or self-mastery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX5","text":"The way of the individual is not founded on ambition, pleasure in heights, or inflated great thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX6","text":"Self-legislation is not the adoption of an already valid moral law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX7","text":"Solitude is not invulnerability and not the absence of inner trial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX8","text":"One's own virtue is not identical with the virtue of the good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX9","text":"Holy simplicity is not the neutral measure of the holy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX10","text":"Love is not indiscriminate proximity or general assistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX11","text":"The deepest enemy does not lie exclusively outside the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX12","text":"New becoming is not continuous self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX13","text":"Creation cannot be separated from contempt and self-destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:NX14","text":"Justice is not the initial standard of the way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D1","text":"Detachment from the herd shifts the social conflict into the interior of the individual.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D2","text":"The way to oneself can be accomplished only through a positive self-grounding and not through mere turning away from the herd.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D3","text":"Freedom becomes the capacity to produce a self-legislated order, to judge it, and to enforce it against oneself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D4","text":"Solitude is at once the condition and the test of self-legislation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D5","text":"The ascent of the individual increases his social vulnerability and diminishes his visibility in the gaze of envy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D6","text":"Social hostility toward the individual does not confirm his moral innocence, but compels him to choose his own justice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D7","text":"Self-assertion requires a controlled limit to love and a non-indiscriminate relation to others.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D8","text":"Self-overcoming presupposes that the individual recognizes his own inner counterforces as material for the way.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D9","text":"Creative renewal presupposes a prior self-dissolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D10","text":"Love becomes creative by bringing self-affirmation and self-contempt into a single movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D11","text":"Justice can appear only after creative self-transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:D12","text":"The success of the way is determined not by persistence, but by the capacity to create beyond oneself, even if this leads to downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD1","text":"The way to oneself is not the discovery of an already finished self, but the production of a self through legislation, trial, and destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD2","text":"External hostility and inner demonicity form two levels of the same structure of testing: the individual must not merely endure resistance, but transform it into creative force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD3","text":"Freedom, love, and creation form a sequence of self-legislation, selective separation, contempt, self-incineration, and new production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A11","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD4","text":"The normative order is temporally subordinated: justice appears only after the individual has changed himself through creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD5","text":"The self arises as a divided enactment, because it must at once be legislator, judge, avenger, enemy, lover, and despiser.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD6","text":"The demand for autonomous self-grounding remains dependent on an alien demand for justification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SD7","text":"Self-love and self-contempt are not resolved opposites, but the productive tension from which creation proceeds.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a predetermined, stable self that is merely to be found.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX2","text":"It excludes freedom as the mere absence of external restriction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX3","text":"It excludes a neutral or conciliatory order of social recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX4","text":"It excludes an already finished schema of good and evil binding upon the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX5","text":"It excludes creation as pure intensification, accumulation, or unbroken affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX6","text":"It excludes love as reconciliation without contempt and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX7","text":"It excludes justice as prior legitimation of the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX8","text":"It excludes a final separation between external persecution and inner self-hostility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX1","text":"The possibility of an identity independent of external recognition and inherited morality, yet at the same time completely secured, remains barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX2","text":"A peaceful continuity between individual and herd is treated as an unavailable possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX3","text":"An undivided self is inadmissible because self-legislation presupposes duplication into legislator, judge, and avenger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4","text":"A creation without self-destruction is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX5","text":"A final reconciliation of self-love, self-contempt, love, and justice is not provided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX6","text":"The complete dissolution of the seven inner counterforces remains outside the system as an uncompleted possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS1","text":"Belonging to the herd → internalized voice → guilt and pain of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS2","text":"Pain of separation → demand for new strength and new right → distinction between freedom-from and freedom-for.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS3","text":"Freedom-for → self-legislation → one's own judge and one's own avenger → terrible solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS4","text":"Solitude → inner and outer hostility → contempt, defense, and confrontation with the seven devils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS5","text":"Confrontation with the counterforces → self-incineration → ashes → possibility of new becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:FGS6","text":"Self-incineration → creation of a god from the devils → self-love through self-contempt → belated justice and possible perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:AF1","text":"Herd conscience → painful separation → demand for new strength and new right → freedom as self-legislation → solitude as judgment → social and inner hostility → contempt and self-incineration → creation from one's own devils → belated justice and possible perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME1","text":"Freedom is shifted from the map of liberation to the map of self-legislation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME2","text":"Solitude is reclassified from the negative state of separation into the productive passage of self-becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME3","text":"Social contempt becomes visible not only as resistance, but as a medium of testing and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME4","text":"The moral opposition between good and evil is replaced by the task of producing one's own good and one's own evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME5","text":"Inner devils are remapped from obstacles into creative raw material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME6","text":"Love is shifted from the sphere of immediate reconciliation into the tension of proximity, limit, contempt, and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ME7","text":"Justice is moved from the initial condition of action to the end of a transformation not yet completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speech calls upon the brother to leave the herd, to go the way to himself, and to create.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT2","text":"Structural: The text organizes self-becoming as a conflict between herd conscience, moral convention, social envy, and inner self-hostility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Freedom is reframed as positive self-positing; resistance, contempt, and solitude become necessary conditions of the creator's strategy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The self is a becoming, divided, and self-surpassing relation; its transformation precedes justice and can end in perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from belonging to the herd through self-legislation and solitude to creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether God and the seven devils are independent powers, states of the self, or functions of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined according to which criterion the self-given good and evil become binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as self-love, self-contempt, destruction, and creation count as enactments dependent upon one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the shift from freedom-from to freedom-for and in the reduction of external hostility to self-testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT6","text":"The unresolved fault lines lie between autonomous self-grounding and an alien demand for justification, between solitude and necessary address, and between self-love and self-contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as possible perishing is treated not as failure external to creation, but as a consequence inherent in creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VWDS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VWDS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VWDS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 27","title":"On the Way of the Creator","context":"Chapter 27","original_title":"Vom Wege des Schaffenden","original_context":"Chapter 27"},"original_title":"Vom Wege des Schaffenden","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ","layer":"CH","title":"On Little Old and Young Women","order":28,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VAUJ"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VAUJ@R001","sha256":"091a572353e01b558abd4f271e7f55b4a26a7c1848ca62429539707247d1ae0a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS1","text":"Das Argument eröffnet die Lehre als kleine, verborgene und schwer zu bändigende Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS2","text":"Die zunächst ausgeschlossene Rede über das Weib wird durch die Intervention des alten Weibleins erzwungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS3","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt Schwangerschaft als universale Lösung des weiblichen Rätsels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS4","text":"Die Frage nach dem Zweck des Weibes für den Mann verschiebt die Ordnung von weiblicher Reproduktion zu männlichem Spiel, Krieg und Erholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS5","text":"Liebe, Hass, Gehorsam, Ehre und Tiefe werden als asymmetrische Geschlechterfunktionen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS6","text":"Die weibliche Existenz wird zugleich als gefährliche Macht und als zu unterordnendes Spielzeug konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","text":"Die alte Frau führt eine abschließende Gegenwahrheit ein, die das System nicht aufhebt, sondern als Peitsche von außen markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","text":"Zarathustra behandelt die Wahrheit als kleinen, kindlich-ungebärdigen Inhalt, der verborgen und zum Schweigen gebracht werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","text":"Zarathustra setzt Schwangerschaft als einzige Lösung des weiblichen Rätsels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt den Mann für das Weib als Mittel und das Kind als dessen Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","text":"Der echte Mann will Gefahr und Spiel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt das Weib als gefährlichstes Spielzeug des Mannes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","text":"Der Mann soll zum Krieg und das Weib zur Erholung des Kriegers erzogen werden; andere Ordnungen gelten als Torheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A7","text":"Im echten Manne ist ein verborgenes Kind wirksam, dessen Bedürfnis das Spielen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","text":"Das Weib soll als reines, feines Spielzeug die noch nicht verwirklichte Tugendwelt verkörpern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","text":"Die Hoffnung der weiblichen Liebe soll in der Geburt des Übermenschen liegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","text":"Weibliche Liebe soll Tapferkeit, Angriff auf das Furchteinflößende und eine Ehre des Mehrliebens hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","text":"Weibliche Liebe und weiblicher Hass werden als totale, opferbereite und entwertende Affekte dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","text":"Das Glück des Mannes wird als eigener Wille, das Glück des Weibes als der Wille des Mannes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","text":"Weibliches Gemüt gilt als Oberfläche, männliches Gemüt als Tiefe, deren Kraft das Weib nur ahnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14","text":"Die alte Frau setzt als kleine Wahrheit die Anweisung: „Du gehst zu Frauen? Vergiss die Peitsche nicht!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX1","text":"Frauen werden zunächst als unzulässige Adressatinnen der Rede über das Weib ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX2","text":"Das Weib wird nicht als eigener Zweck, sondern als Mittel zur Schwangerschaft und zum Kind definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3","text":"Eine symmetrische Bestimmung von Mann und Weib wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX4","text":"Eine Erziehung des Mannes außerhalb des Krieges und des Weibes außerhalb der Erholung wird als Torheit verworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX5","text":"Eine Liebe ohne Gefahr, Bitterkeit, Opfer und Unterordnung wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX6","text":"Gegenseitigkeit als Maß der Liebe wird durch das Gebot des Mehrliebens zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX7","text":"Weiblicher Wille als eigenständiger Zweck wird zugunsten des männlichen Willens ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX8","text":"Eine dem Mann gleichkommende weibliche Tiefe und begriffliche Erfassung seiner Kraft werden verneint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX9","text":"Die ungebändigte Wahrheit wird nicht als öffentlich sprechfähig zugelassen, sondern muss eingewickelt und zum Schweigen gebracht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D1","text":"Schwangerschaft wird zur Totalformel, durch die jede weibliche Rätselhaftigkeit auf einen reproduktiven Zweck zurückgeführt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D2","text":"Die Beziehung zwischen Mann und Weib wird als funktionale Asymmetrie organisiert: Das Weib dient dem Kind, der Mann nutzt das Weib für Spiel und Erholung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D3","text":"Das Bild des Weibes als Spielzeug bezeichnet zugleich eine männliche Infantilisierung und eine weibliche Instrumentalisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A7","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D4","text":"Liebe wird aus einer Beziehung in ein Erzeugungsverfahren für eine zukünftige Gestalt des Menschen überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D5","text":"Weibliche Affektmacht wird anerkannt, aber nur in Formen zugelassen, die männliche Furcht, Opferbereitschaft oder Gehorsam erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D6","text":"Die behauptete weibliche Oberflächenhaftigkeit liefert eine epistemische Rechtfertigung männlicher Deutungshoheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D7","text":"Die Rede über das Weib erzeugt eine doppelte Wahrheitsordnung, in der Zarathustra die große Lehre formuliert und die alte Frau die kleine Gegenwahrheit zurückgibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D8","text":"Die Reproduktion verbindet die weibliche Bestimmung mit dem zukünftigen Übermenschen und macht das Weib zum Träger einer Zukunft, die es selbst nicht begrifflich beherrscht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD1","text":"Das System totalisiert die weibliche Bedeutung, indem es Gegenwart, Sexualität und Zukunft über Schwangerschaft auf einen einzigen Zweck hin ordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD2","text":"Krieg, Spiel, Erholung und Gehorsam bilden keine Einzelmetaphern, sondern eine geschlossene Arbeitsteilung zwischen männlicher Aktivität und weiblicher Funktionalisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD3","text":"Weibliche Macht kann innerhalb des Systems nur als Gefahr, Opferfähigkeit, Anziehung oder Hass erscheinen, nicht als autonome Zwecksetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD4","text":"Die behauptete weibliche Schwäche wird durch die Notwendigkeit ergänzt, das Weib stark genug zur Bedrohung und schwach genug zur Unterordnung zu machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD5","text":"Die Szene stellt männliche Deutungshoheit her, lässt diese aber durch die weibliche Gegenrede zugleich als unvollständig und von außen korrigierbar erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD6","text":"Der zukünftige Übermensch wird nicht jenseits der Geschlechterordnung, sondern durch ihre reproduktive Organisation erreichbar gemacht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit des Weibes als Zweck seiner selbst wird strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX2","text":"Eine erotische Beziehung, deren Sinn nicht in Kind, Spiel, Krieg oder Gehorsam liegt, bleibt unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX3","text":"Weibliche Rede als gleichrangige Quelle öffentlicher Wahrheit wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX4","text":"Eine nichtreproduktive Form weiblicher Zukunft wird nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX5","text":"Eine Verteilung von Wille, Tiefe und Autorität jenseits der Geschlechterpolarität wird nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX6","text":"Männliche Abhängigkeit vom Weib als eigenständigem Subjekt wird verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX7","text":"Liebe ohne hierarchische Differenz zwischen Führendem und Gehorchendem wird aus dem Begriff der Liebe entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX1","text":"Das System kann das Weib nur als Objekt der Lehre, geheime Trägerin einer kleinen Wahrheit oder Quelle einer abschließenden Drohung auftreten lassen, nicht als gleichrangige Theoretikerin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX2","text":"Eine nicht-hierarchische Geschlechterbeziehung bleibt undarstellbar, weil sie die Unterscheidung von Zweck, Mittel, Wille und Gehorsam aufheben würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX3","text":"Die Möglichkeit weiblicher Autonomie wird nicht widerlegt, sondern durch die reproduktive Totalisierung gar nicht erst als Kategorie gebildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX4","text":"Die Wahrheit muss zugleich verborgen und ausgesprochen werden: Ihre Unterdrückung erzeugt die Notwendigkeit ihrer Rückkehr durch die alte Frau.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX5","text":"Die behauptete Überwindung des Menschen bleibt an eine Geschlechterordnung gebunden, die selbst nicht überwunden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS1","text":"Verborgener Schatz oder ungebärdiges Kind → Wahrheit wird als gefährlicher, zu versiegelnder Inhalt codiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS2","text":"Ausgeschlossene weibliche Adressatin → erzwungene Rede über das Weib → Schwangerschaft als universale Lösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS3","text":"Frage nach dem weiblichen Zweck für den Mann → Umkehr der Mittel-Zweck-Relation → Weib als gefährliches Spielzeug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS4","text":"Spielzeugfunktion → Zuordnung von Krieg, Erholung, männlicher Tiefe und weiblicher Oberfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS5","text":"Geschlechterordnung → affektive Normierung von Liebe, Hass, Opfer, Ehre und Gehorsam → reproduktive Zukunft des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS6","text":"Anerkannte weibliche Gefährlichkeit → Notwendigkeit der Kontrolle → Rückkehr der kontrollierten Wahrheit als Peitschenformel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF1","text":"Verborgene kleine Wahrheit → weiblicher Einspruch gegen den Redeausschluss → Schwangerschaft als weiblicher Grundcode → männliche Nutzung des Weibes → Kriegsspielordnung → weibliche Gegenwahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF2","text":"Weibliches Rätsel → reproduktive Lösung → weiblicher Zweck für das Kind → weiblicher Zweck für den Mann als Gefahr und Spielzeug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF3","text":"Männlicher Wille und Tiefe → weibliche Oberfläche und Gehorsam → affektive Gefährlichkeit → disziplinierende Peitsche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF4","text":"Behauptete männliche Erkenntnisautorität → Eingeständnis begrenzten weiblichen Verständnisses → alte Frau als Korrektiv → unaufgelöste Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME1","text":"„Das Weib“ wird vom ausgeschlossenen Gesprächsthema zum universalen Reproduktionsprinzip und männlichen Funktionsobjekt umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME2","text":"Die Geschlechterbeziehung wird nicht mehr primär als Gegenseitigkeit, sondern als asymmetrische Zweck- und Gebrauchsanordnung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME3","text":"Liebe wird aus dem privaten Affektbereich in eine politische und zeitliche Ordnung von Krieg, Mut, Gehorsam und Zukunft verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME4","text":"Weibliche Macht wird neu als zugleich subordiniert und gefährlich klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME5","text":"Die Unterscheidungen Oberfläche/Tiefe, Wille/Gehorsam und Gegenwart/Zukunft werden zu einer einzigen Geschlechterkarte gekoppelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME6","text":"Die Position der Sprecherin wird von der ausgeschlossenen Adressatin zur Trägerin der terminalen Korrektur verschoben, ohne dass daraus Gleichrangigkeit folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Die Szene formuliert aphoristische Anweisungen über Mann, Weib, Liebe, Krieg, Gehorsam und Peitsche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Anweisungen erzeugen eine institutionelle Arbeitsteilung zwischen männlichem Krieg und weiblicher Reproduktion beziehungsweise Erholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text rahmt seine eigene Autorität durch eine kontrollierte Redeordnung, in der männliche Lehre und weibliche Gegenrede asymmetrisch aufeinander folgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Weiblichkeit wird als reproduktive Zukunft, Männlichkeit als Wille, Tiefe, Krieg und verborgenes Kind organisiert; der Übermensch fungiert als zukünftiger Zweck dieser Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der verborgenen Wahrheit über die Geschlechterordnung bis zur abschließenden Gegenformel zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die zentrale Generierung: Schwangerschaft totalisiert das Weib, während Gefahr und Spiel seine männliche Funktion bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT3","text":"Die interne Kohärenz besteht nur als hierarchische Konstruktion; die widersprüchlichen Eigenschaften werden funktional nebeneinander gehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Schwangerschaft ausschließlich biologisch, metaphorisch oder zugleich biologisch und metaphysisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT5","text":"Nicht aufgelöst wird der Widerspruch zwischen dem Weib als gefährlichster Macht und dem Weib als oberflächlichem Spielzeug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT6","text":"Nicht aufgelöst wird die Spannung zwischen dem Ausschluss weiblicher Rede und der Notwendigkeit, die abschließende Wahrheit durch eine alte Frau sprechen zu lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT7","text":"Die Konstruktion bleibt davon abhängig, dass männliche Tiefe mit kindlichem Spielbedürfnis und weibliche Oberfläche mit totaler Affektmacht zugleich behauptet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT8","text":"Die Peitschenformel ist aus der vorherigen Lehre nicht vollständig ableitbar; sie tritt als externe Gegenaxiomatik in das System ein und verhindert eine widerspruchsfreie Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193753914863Z_0394adae","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of Old and Young Women","source_sha256":"091a572353e01b558abd4f271e7f55b4a26a7c1848ca62429539707247d1ae0a","sha256":"b4920860f8ee5f30c1fe917e30b01fe2e155f413ab5aa895501fa4b8d77aae87","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:37:53.917218+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS1","text":"The argument opens the teaching as a small, hidden, and difficult-to-tame truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS2","text":"The initially excluded discourse about woman is compelled by the intervention of the old woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS3","text":"Zarathustra determines pregnancy as the universal solution to the feminine riddle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS4","text":"The question of woman's purpose for man shifts the order from female reproduction to male play, war, and recreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS5","text":"Love, hatred, obedience, honor, and depth are organized as asymmetrical gender functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS6","text":"Female existence is constructed simultaneously as dangerous power and as a toy to be subordinated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","text":"The old woman introduces a concluding counter-truth that does not annul the system but marks it from outside as a whip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","text":"Zarathustra treats truth as a small, childishly unruly content that must be hidden and silenced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","text":"Zarathustra posits pregnancy as the sole solution to the feminine riddle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","text":"Zarathustra determines man as the means for woman and the child as her purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","text":"The genuine man wants danger and play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","text":"Zarathustra determines woman as man's most dangerous toy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","text":"Man is to be educated for war and woman for the warrior's recreation; other orders count as folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A7","text":"In the genuine man, a hidden child is active, whose need is play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","text":"Woman, as a pure, fine toy, is to embody the world of virtue not yet realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","text":"The hope of female love is to lie in the birth of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","text":"Female love is to bring forth courage, an attack upon what inspires fear, and an honor of loving more.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","text":"Female love and female hatred are depicted as total, self-sacrificing, and devaluing affects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","text":"Man's happiness is determined as his own will, woman's happiness as the man's will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","text":"Female disposition counts as surface, male disposition as depth, the force of which woman only surmises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14","text":"The old woman posits as a small truth the instruction: „Du gehst zu Frauen? Vergiss die Peitsche nicht!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX1","text":"Women are initially excluded as impermissible addressees of the discourse about woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX2","text":"Woman is defined not as an end in herself but as a means to pregnancy and to the child.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3","text":"A symmetrical determination of man and woman is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX4","text":"An education of man outside war and of woman outside recreation is rejected as folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX5","text":"A love without danger, bitterness, sacrifice, and subordination is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX6","text":"Reciprocity as the measure of love is rejected through the commandment to love more.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX7","text":"Female will as an independent end is excluded in favor of male will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX8","text":"A female depth equal to man's and a conceptual grasp of his force are denied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX9","text":"The untamed truth is not admitted as capable of public speech but must be wrapped up and silenced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D1","text":"Pregnancy becomes a total formula through which every feminine enigmaticness is reduced to a reproductive purpose.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D2","text":"The relation between man and woman is organized as functional asymmetry: woman serves the child; man uses woman for play and recreation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D3","text":"The image of woman as toy denotes at once a male infantilization and a female instrumentalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A7","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D4","text":"Love is transferred from a relation into a procedure of generation for a future form of the human.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D5","text":"Female affective power is acknowledged, but admitted only in forms that produce male fear, willingness to sacrifice, or obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D6","text":"The asserted superficiality of women provides an epistemic justification for male interpretive sovereignty.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D7","text":"The discourse about woman produces a double order of truth, in which Zarathustra formulates the great teaching and the old woman returns the small counter-truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:D8","text":"Reproduction links the determination of woman with the future Übermensch and makes woman the bearer of a future that she herself does not conceptually command.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD1","text":"The system totalizes female meaning by ordering the present, sexuality, and the future toward a single purpose through pregnancy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD2","text":"War, play, recreation, and obedience are not individual metaphors but a closed division of labor between male activity and female functionalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD3","text":"Within the system, female power can appear only as danger, capacity for sacrifice, attraction, or hatred, not as autonomous purposiveness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD4","text":"The asserted female weakness is supplemented by the necessity of making woman strong enough to be a threat and weak enough to be subordinated.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A5","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD5","text":"The scene establishes male interpretive sovereignty, but simultaneously allows it to appear, through the female counter-speech, as incomplete and corrigible from outside.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD6","text":"The future Übermensch is made attainable not beyond the gender order but through its reproductive organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX1","text":"The possibility of woman as an end in herself is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX2","text":"An erotic relation whose meaning does not lie in child, play, war, or obedience remains impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX3","text":"Female speech as an equal source of public truth is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX4","text":"A nonreproductive form of female future is not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX5","text":"A distribution of will, depth, and authority beyond gender polarity is not admitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX6","text":"Male dependence on woman as an independent subject is concealed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:DNX7","text":"Love without hierarchical difference between leader and obedient party is removed from the concept of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX1","text":"The system can allow woman to appear only as an object of the teaching, a secret bearer of a small truth, or the source of a concluding threat, not as an equal theorist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX2","text":"A non-hierarchical gender relation remains unrepresentable because it would annul the distinction between end, means, will, and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX3","text":"The possibility of female autonomy is not refuted but is not even formed as a category through reproductive totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX4","text":"Truth must be hidden and spoken at once: its suppression produces the necessity of its return through the old woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX5","text":"The asserted overcoming of the human remains bound to a gender order that is itself not overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS1","text":"Hidden treasure or unruly child → truth is coded as dangerous content that must be sealed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS2","text":"Excluded female addressee → compelled discourse about woman → pregnancy as universal solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS3","text":"Question of woman's purpose for man → reversal of the means-end relation → woman as dangerous toy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS4","text":"Toy function → allocation of war, recreation, male depth, and female surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS5","text":"Gender order → affective norming of love, hatred, sacrifice, honor, and obedience → reproductive future of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:FGS6","text":"Acknowledged female dangerousness → necessity of control → return of controlled truth as whip formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF1","text":"Hidden small truth → female objection to exclusion from discourse → pregnancy as female ground code → male use of woman → war-play order → female counter-truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF2","text":"Feminine riddle → reproductive solution → female purpose for the child → female purpose for man as danger and toy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF3","text":"Male will and depth → female surface and obedience → affective dangerousness → disciplining whip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:AF4","text":"Asserted male epistemic authority → admission of limited female understanding → old woman as corrective → unresolved closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME1","text":"„Das Weib“ is remapped from the excluded topic of conversation into a universal principle of reproduction and male functional object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME2","text":"The gender relation becomes visible no longer primarily as reciprocity but as an asymmetrical arrangement of purpose and use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME3","text":"Love is shifted from the private affective sphere into a political and temporal order of war, courage, obedience, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME4","text":"Female power is newly classified as both subordinated and dangerous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME5","text":"The distinctions surface/depth, will/obedience, and present/future are coupled into a single gender map.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME6","text":"The position of the female speaker is shifted from excluded addressee to bearer of the terminal correction, without equality following from this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The scene formulates aphoristic instructions concerning man, woman, love, war, obedience, and the whip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The instructions produce an institutional division of labor between male war and female reproduction or recreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text frames its own authority through a controlled order of discourse, in which male teaching and female counter-speech follow one another asymmetrically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Femininity is organized as reproductive future, masculinity as will, depth, war, and hidden child; the Übermensch functions as this order's future purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from hidden truth through the gender order to the concluding counter-formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the central generation: pregnancy totalizes woman, while danger and play determine her male function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT3","text":"Internal coherence exists only as a hierarchical construction; the contradictory properties are held together functionally alongside one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether pregnancy is meant exclusively biologically, metaphorically, or at once biologically and metaphysically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT5","text":"The contradiction between woman as the most dangerous power and woman as superficial toy is not resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT6","text":"The tension between the exclusion of female speech and the necessity of letting a final truth be spoken by an old woman is not resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT7","text":"The construction remains dependent on asserting simultaneously male depth with a childish need for play and female surface with total affective power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VAUJ:MRT8","text":"The whip formula is not fully derivable from the preceding teaching; it enters the system as an external counter-axiomatics and prevents a contradiction-free closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VAUJ:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VAUJ@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VAUJ:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 28","title":"On Little Old and Young Women","context":"Chapter 28","original_title":"Von alten und jungen Weiblein","original_context":"Chapter 28"},"original_title":"Von alten und jungen Weiblein","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN","layer":"CH","title":"On the Bite of the Adder","order":29,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VBDN"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VBDN@R001","sha256":"2f12663854ed15d0d628e00b16f94e65b8c4d5e908b8de6ec7af2441ca645a15","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1","text":"Eine tödliche Verletzung wird nicht als bloßes Unrecht, sondern als Weckung innerhalb eines noch nicht beendeten Weges bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS2","text":"Die moralische Frage nach der Geschichte wird durch eine Umkehrung der gewöhnlichen Vergeltungs- und Gerechtigkeitsbegriffe beantwortet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS3","text":"Feindschaft soll weder durch gutes Vergelten noch durch reine Segnung neutralisiert, sondern als asymmetrische Beziehung anerkannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS4","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird von kalter Urteilspraxis auf Liebe, Tragfähigkeit, Selbstbegrenzung und die Aufhebung des Richtenden verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS5","text":"Die Möglichkeit dieser Gerechtigkeit hängt von einem Überschuss an Kraft, Reichtum und Erinnerungsfähigkeit ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in einer paradoxen Norm: Der Gerechte gibt nicht jedem das Seine, sondern jedem das Eigene, während der Einsiedler als unauflöslicher Träger von Erinnerung und Vergeltung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A1","text":"Eine tödliche Bedrohung kann für den Stärkeren eine Weckung und keine endgültige Niederlage sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","text":"Ein Feind wird durch gutes Vergelten nicht versöhnt, sondern beschämt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","text":"Unrecht darf nicht nur passiv getragen, sondern muss in eine verteilte und tragbare Form überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","text":"Eine begrenzte Rache ist menschlicher als der vollständige Verzicht auf Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","text":"Strafe ist nur legitim, wenn sie für den Übertretenden zugleich Recht und Ehre sein kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","text":"Wer freiwillig Unrecht auf sich nimmt, muss über genügend Reichtum oder Kraft verfügen, um diesen Verlust zu tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","text":"Kälte im Namen der Gerechtigkeit verbirgt die Figur des Henkers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","text":"Eine höhere Gerechtigkeit muss Liebe mit sehender Erkenntnis verbinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A9","text":"Eine radikale Gerechtigkeit muss Schuld und Strafe tragen oder aufheben können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A10","text":"Der Anspruch, von Grund aus jedem das Seine zu geben, überschreitet die menschliche Fähigkeit zur Gerechtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A11","text":"Die angemessene Alternative zur universalen Zuteilung besteht darin, jedem das Eigene zu geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","text":"Der Einsiedler vergisst erlittenes Unrecht nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","text":"Im Einsiedler sinkt jede Beleidigung in eine tiefe, schwer zugängliche Erinnerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A14","text":"Eine nicht aufgelöste Beleidigung kann in Vergeltung umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX1","text":"Das Töten durch Gift wird als ausreichende Erklärung des Todes zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX2","text":"Gutes Vergelten gegenüber dem Feind wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX3","text":"Reines Segnen als Antwort auf Fluch wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX4","text":"Vollständiger Verzicht auf Rache wird als unmenschlich zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX5","text":"Eine Strafe ohne Recht und Ehre für den Bestraften wird abgelehnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX6","text":"Kalte, richterliche Gerechtigkeit wird als eigentliche Henkerlogik entlarvt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7","text":"Eine Gerechtigkeit, die jedem abstrakt das Seine zuteilen will, wird als unerfüllbar zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX8","text":"Das Vergessen erlittener Beleidigung wird dem Einsiedler abgesprochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D1","text":"Die Stärke Zarathustras verwandelt das Gift der Natter von einer tödlichen Gabe in eine zurückzugebende Last.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D2","text":"Das gute Vergelten stabilisiert die Überlegenheit des Feindes, weil es ihn beschämt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D3","text":"Gerechte Feindschaft verlangt eine Maßnahme, die weder vollständige Versöhnung noch schrankenlose Vergeltung ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D4","text":"Die Teilung des Unrechts macht es tragbar, ohne seine Existenz zu leugnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D5","text":"Selbst auferlegtes Unrecht kann vornehmer sein als das Beharren auf eigenem Recht, sofern der Betroffene den Verlust tragen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D6","text":"Die sichtbare Liebe der Gerechtigkeit verlangt Erkenntnis des Betroffenen statt bloßer Anwendung eines Urteils.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D7","text":"Der Anspruch auf universale Gerechtigkeit erzeugt eine Lüge, sobald die menschliche Fähigkeit zur vollständigen Zuteilung fehlt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A10","CH_97E9_VBDN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D8","text":"Die Tiefe des Einsiedlers macht eine Beleidigung zeitlich wirksam, auch wenn sie äußerlich beendet scheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D9","text":"Eine Beleidigung, die nicht gelöst oder getilgt wird, bleibt als Möglichkeit der Vergeltung bestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die symmetrische Moral von Schuld und Vergeltung durch eine Rangordnung der Tragfähigkeit: Entscheidend ist nicht, wer formal im Recht ist, sondern wer Last, Verlust und Unrecht tragen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VBDN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD2","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird von einer Institution des Urteilens in eine Praxis der Umverteilung, Selbstbegrenzung und Aufhebung des Richters transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","CH_97E9_VBDN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD3","text":"Die moralische Norm wird nicht abgeschafft, sondern durch eine höhere, apophatisch bestimmte Norm ersetzt, die sich gegen Güte, Segnung, Kälte und abstrakte Gleichverteilung richtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","CH_97E9_VBDN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4","text":"Der Einsiedler verkörpert die zeitliche Reststruktur des Unrechts: Was nicht äußerlich verfolgt wird, bleibt innerlich gespeichert und kann später als Vergeltung zurückkehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit ab, dass moralische Güte durch Umkehrung des erlittenen Bösen hergestellt werden könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein universales, für alle Fälle gleich anwendbares Gerechtigkeitsmaß aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass Vergebung das Gedächtnis des Unrechts aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX4","text":"Es verwirft die Vorstellung, Strafe könne neutral, kalt und unabhängig von Ehre sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX5","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass der Richter nicht außerhalb des moralischen Geschehens steht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Gerechtigkeit aus, die ohne Überschuss an Kraft, Reichtum oder Tragfähigkeit auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Moral, in der jede Feindschaft durch gute Gegengabe, Segnung oder vollständige Vergebung endgültig verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Gerechtigkeit ohne Rest, in der kein Unrecht, keine Schuld und keine Erinnerung außerhalb des Urteils verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine versöhnte Welt, in der Vergeltung weder menschliche Grenze noch zeitliche Nachwirkung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit ist ein nicht-richtender Maßstab, der Gerechtigkeit vollzieht, ohne selbst Schuld, Entscheidung und Gewalt zu reproduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS1","text":"Verletzung → Weckung des Stärkeren → Rückgabe des Giftes → Umkehrung von Opfer und Täter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS2","text":"Feindschaft → Ausschluss von Gutvergeltung und Segnung → begrenzte Gegengabe → Wiederherstellung menschlicher Asymmetrie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS3","text":"Unrecht → Verteilung und Übernahme → Erfordernis von Kraft und Reichtum → vornehme Selbstbelastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS4","text":"Strafe → Prüfung auf Recht und Ehre des Übertretenden → Ausschluss kalter Sanktion → nicht-richterliche Gerechtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS5","text":"Abstrakter Anspruch auf das Seine → Eingeständnis menschlicher Unfähigkeit → Ersetzung durch das Eigene → partikulare Gerechtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS6","text":"Beleidigung des Einsiedlers → Speicherung in der Tiefe → zeitliche Verzögerung → mögliche Vergeltung oder Vernichtung des Trägers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AF1","text":"Giftangriff → Relativierung des Todes → moralische Selbstbezeichnung als Vernichter → Umkehrung der Feindesbehandlung → Neubestimmung der Gerechtigkeit → Begrenzung durch Tragfähigkeit → Einsiedler als ungelöster Rest der Vergeltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Recht und Unrecht wird durch den Gegensatz von Tragfähigkeit und Unfähigkeit überlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Rache und Vergebung wird in eine Skala begrenzter, menschlicher und ehrenfähiger Gegengaben überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME3","text":"Der Richter wird vom Garanten der Gerechtigkeit zum möglichen Träger der Schuld und zum verborgenen Henker umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME4","text":"Der Einsiedler wird nicht als friedlicher Rückzug, sondern als Speicher verzögerter Vergeltung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME5","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird nicht mehr durch Gleichverteilung, sondern durch relationale Selbstzuteilung und Übernahme des Eigenen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Natter beißt Zarathustra; aus der Erzählung werden Regeln für Feindschaft, Rache, Strafe und Gerechtigkeit gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das System ordnet Beziehungen nach Tragfähigkeit, Erinnerung, asymmetrischer Vergeltung und der institutionellen Gewalt des Richters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Moralische Überlegenheit wird nicht durch Güte oder Segnung, sondern durch die Fähigkeit erzeugt, Unrecht zu tragen, zurückzugeben oder neu zu verteilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Unrecht bleibt als gespeicherte Kraft bestehen; Zeit beendet die Verletzung nicht notwendig, sondern kann ihre Vergeltung nur aufschieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Natterepisode zur Kritik der Gerechtigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wann begrenzte Rache in zulässige oder unzulässige Gewalt übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT3","text":"Die Beziehung zwischen Liebe, Schuldtragung und Freispruch des Richtenden bleibt programmatisch und nicht vollständig formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Priorität der Tragfähigkeit gegenüber abstrakter Gleichheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht zwischen der Ablehnung des Richtenden und der fortbestehenden Normierung von Rache, Strafe und Ehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen der Aufhebung der Schuld und der Behauptung, dass Beleidigung als vergeltbare Erinnerung fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die scheinbaren Widersprüche als gestufte Umwertung und nicht als Auflösung verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193843562002Z_169a3668","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Bite of the Adder","source_sha256":"2f12663854ed15d0d628e00b16f94e65b8c4d5e908b8de6ec7af2441ca645a15","sha256":"cb88f6ef7d73bc639f9706d8fa708bd4f023eb602eded9383debe17602cb8743","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:38:43.565205+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1","text":"A mortal injury is determined not as mere wrong, but as an awakening within a path not yet ended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS2","text":"The moral question concerning history is answered through a reversal of the customary concepts of retribution and justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS3","text":"Enmity is to be neither neutralized by repaying good nor by pure blessing, but recognized as an asymmetrical relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS4","text":"Justice is shifted from cold judicial practice to love, capacity to bear, self-limitation, and the abolition of the judge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS5","text":"The possibility of this justice depends on a surplus of strength, wealth, and capacity for memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AS6","text":"The movement ends in a paradoxical norm: the just person gives not to each what is due to him, but to each what is his own, while the hermit appears as an irresolvable bearer of memory and retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A1","text":"For the stronger person, a mortal threat can be an awakening and not a final defeat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","text":"An enemy is not reconciled by repaying good, but shamed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","text":"Wrong must not merely be borne passively, but must be transferred into a distributed and bearable form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","text":"A limited revenge is more human than the complete renunciation of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","text":"Punishment is legitimate only if it can at the same time be right and honor for the transgressor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","text":"Whoever voluntarily takes wrong upon himself must possess sufficient wealth or strength to bear this loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","text":"Coldness in the name of justice conceals the figure of the executioner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","text":"A higher justice must unite love with seeing knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A9","text":"A radical justice must be able to bear or abolish guilt and punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A10","text":"The claim to give each person what is due to him from the ground up exceeds the human capacity for justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A11","text":"The appropriate alternative to universal allocation consists in giving each person what is his own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","text":"The hermit does not forget suffered wrong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","text":"In the hermit, every insult sinks into a deep, difficult-to-access memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:A14","text":"An unresolved insult can turn into retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX1","text":"Killing by poison is rejected as a sufficient explanation of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX2","text":"Repaying good toward the enemy is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX3","text":"Pure blessing as an answer to a curse is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX4","text":"Complete renunciation of revenge is rejected as inhuman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX5","text":"A punishment without right and honor for the punished person is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX6","text":"Cold, judicial justice is exposed as the proper logic of the executioner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7","text":"A justice that seeks to allocate abstractly to each person what is due to him is rejected as unfulfillable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:NX8","text":"The forgetting of suffered insults is denied to the hermit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D1","text":"Zarathustra's strength transforms the adder's poison from a mortal gift into a burden to be given back.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D2","text":"Repaying good stabilizes the enemy's superiority because it shames him.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D3","text":"Just enmity demands a measure that is neither complete reconciliation nor unbounded retribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D4","text":"The division of wrong makes it bearable without denying its existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D5","text":"Self-imposed wrong can be nobler than insisting on one's own right, provided that the affected person can bear the loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D6","text":"The visible love of justice demands knowledge of the affected person instead of the mere application of a judgment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D7","text":"The claim to universal justice produces a lie as soon as the human capacity for complete allocation is lacking.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A10","CH_97E9_VBDN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D8","text":"The hermit's depth makes an insult temporally effective even when it seems outwardly ended.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:D9","text":"An insult that is not resolved or expunged remains as a possibility of retribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1","text":"The system replaces the symmetrical morality of guilt and retribution with a hierarchy of capacity to bear: decisive is not who is formally in the right, but who can bear burden, loss, and wrong.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VBDN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD2","text":"Justice is transformed from an institution of judging into a practice of redistribution, self-limitation, and abolition of the judge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","CH_97E9_VBDN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD3","text":"The moral norm is not abolished, but replaced by a higher, apophatically determined norm directed against goodness, blessing, coldness, and abstract equal distribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A8","CH_97E9_VBDN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4","text":"The hermit embodies the temporal residual structure of wrong: what is not outwardly pursued remains inwardly stored and can later return as retribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth that moral goodness could be produced through reversal of the evil suffered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX2","text":"It excludes a universal measure of justice equally applicable to all cases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that forgiveness abolishes the memory of wrong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX4","text":"It rejects the notion that punishment could be neutral, cold, and independent of honor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX5","text":"It presupposes that the judge does not stand outside moral events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX6","text":"It excludes a justice that can do without a surplus of strength, wealth, or capacity to bear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a morality in which every enmity finally disappears through good counter-gift, blessing, or complete forgiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a justice without remainder, in which no wrong, no guilt, and no memory remains outside judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX3","text":"The barred possibility is a reconciled world in which retribution possesses neither a human limit nor a temporal aftereffect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX4","text":"The deepest absence is a non-judging standard that enacts justice without itself reproducing guilt, decision, and violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS1","text":"Injury → awakening of the stronger person → return of the poison → reversal of victim and perpetrator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS2","text":"Enmity → exclusion of good repayment and blessing → limited counter-gift → restoration of human asymmetry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS3","text":"Wrong → distribution and assumption → requirement of strength and wealth → noble self-burdening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS4","text":"Punishment → examination of the transgressor's right and honor → exclusion of cold sanction → non-judicial justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS5","text":"Abstract claim to what is due to one → admission of human incapacity → replacement by what is one's own → particular justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:FGS6","text":"Insult to the hermit → storage in the depths → temporal delay → possible retribution or destruction of the bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:AF1","text":"Poison attack → relativization of death → moral self-designation as destroyer → reversal of the treatment of the enemy → redefinition of justice → limitation by capacity to bear → hermit as unresolved remainder of retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME1","text":"The opposition between right and wrong is overlaid by the opposition between capacity and incapacity to bear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME2","text":"The opposition between revenge and forgiveness is transferred into a scale of limited, human, and honor-capable counter-gifts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME3","text":"The judge is reclassified from guarantor of justice into a possible bearer of guilt and a hidden executioner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME4","text":"The hermit is mapped not as peaceful withdrawal, but as a storehouse of delayed retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ME5","text":"Justice is determined no longer through equal distribution, but through relational self-allocation and assumption of what is one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT1","text":"Surface — An adder bites Zarathustra; rules for enmity, revenge, punishment, and justice are derived from the narrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT2","text":"Structural — The system orders relations according to capacity to bear, memory, asymmetrical retribution, and the institutional violence of the judge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Moral superiority is produced not through goodness or blessing, but through the capacity to bear, return, or redistribute wrong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wrong persists as stored force; time does not necessarily end the injury, but can only defer its retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the adder episode to the critique of justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined when limited revenge passes into permissible or impermissible violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT3","text":"The relation between love, bearing guilt, and acquittal of the judge remains programmatic and not fully formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT4","text":"Internally coherent is the priority of capacity to bear over abstract equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT5","text":"A tension arises between the rejection of the judge and the continuing normation of revenge, punishment, and honor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises between the abolition of guilt and the assertion that insult persists as a retributable memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, provided that the apparent contradictions are understood as graduated revaluation and not as dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VBDN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VBDN@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VBDN:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 29","title":"On the Bite of the Adder","context":"Chapter 29","original_title":"Vom Biss der Natter","original_context":"Chapter 29"},"original_title":"Vom Biss der Natter","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE","layer":"CH","title":"On Child and Marriage","order":30,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VKUE"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VKUE@R001","sha256":"1067c0b45b57fe12772fc149d124e429e15b9f795454d274fd9d0f40b5fcfe69","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS1","text":"Der Wunsch nach Kind und Ehe wird einer Prüfung seines Ursprungs und der Beschaffenheit des Wünschenden unterworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS2","text":"Berechtigt ist der Wunsch nur, wenn er aus Selbstbezwingung, Freiheit und beherrschter Tugend hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS3","text":"Fortpflanzung wird als Überschreitung des eigenen Selbst bestimmt, die eine vorherige Formung von Leib und Seele voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS4","text":"Ehe wird als gemeinsamer Wille zweier zur Hervorbringung eines Größeren als ihrer selbst neu definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS5","text":"Die gewöhnliche Ehe wird als Bedürfnisgemeinschaft, seelische Verarmung und falsche Sakralisierung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS6","text":"Liebe erhält ihren Wert erst als schmerzhafte Übergangsbewegung zum Schaffen, zum Übermenschen und zur heiligen Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","text":"Der Wunsch nach Kind und Ehe muss durch die Beschaffenheit des Wünschenden legitimiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","text":"Der berechtigte Wünschende ist siegreich, selbstbezwingend, sinnesbeherrschend und Herr seiner Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A3","text":"Der Wunsch nach Kind und Ehe kann aus Tierheit, Nothdurft, Vereinsamung oder Selbstunfrieden hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","text":"Gültige Fortpflanzung richtet sich nicht bloß auf Fortsetzung, sondern auf Aufstieg über das eigene Selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","text":"Das Überschreiten des eigenen Selbst setzt voraus, dass Leib und Seele zuvor vom Subjekt selbst aufgebaut wurden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","text":"Ein Kind soll als lebendiges Denkmal des Sieges und der Befreiung hervorgebracht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","text":"Ehe ist der Wille zweier, ein Eines zu schaffen, das mehr ist als die es Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","text":"Ehe verlangt Ehrfurcht vor den beiden Wollenden eines solchen gemeinsamen Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","text":"Die Ehe der Viel-zu-Vielen bezeichnet seelische Armut, seelischen Schmutz und gemeinsames Behagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A10","text":"Liebe ist auch in ihrer besten Gestalt ein Gleichnis und eine schmerzhafte Gluth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","text":"Liebe soll über die Liebenden hinaus auf höhere Wege und den Übermenschen verweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A12","text":"Die Bitternis der Liebe erzeugt Sehnsucht und Durst nach dem Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A13","text":"Heilig ist nur der Wille zur Ehe, der diese schöpferische und übersteigende Richtung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX1","text":"Nicht jeder Mensch darf sich aufgrund seines bloßen Wunsches ein Kind wünschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX2","text":"Fortpflanzung ist nicht bloße biologische oder soziale Fortsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX3","text":"Ehe ist nicht die Lösung von Vereinsamung, Nothdurft oder Selbstunfrieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","text":"Ehe ist nicht gegenseitiges Behagen zweier seelisch Bedürftiger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","text":"Göttliche oder himmlische Segnung verleiht einer nicht schöpferischen Verbindung keine Gültigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX6","text":"Ehe ist nicht die Verbindung qualitativ unverbundener oder widersprüchlicher Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX7","text":"Liebe ist nicht die Ansammlung kurzer Thorheiten, die in einer langen Dummheit endet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX8","text":"Gegenseitige Liebe ist nicht bloß das gegenseitige Erraten zweier Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX9","text":"Liebe ist nicht das letzte Ziel der Liebenden, sondern ein Übergang zu höheren Wegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D1","text":"Die Legitimität des Wunsches wird vor jeder Bewertung von Kind und Ehe genealogisch aus seiner Quelle bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D2","text":"Fortpflanzung wird von der bloßen Weitergabe des Lebens in eine Praxis des Selbstüberstiegs umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D3","text":"Ehe bezeichnet nicht primär ein Verhältnis zwischen zwei Personen, sondern die Produktion einer dritten, höheren Einheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D4","text":"Die gewöhnliche Ehe fällt nicht nur unter ein niedrigeres Werturteil, sondern aus dem eigentlichen Begriff der Ehe heraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D5","text":"Der Schmerz der Liebe erhält eine positive Funktion, indem er den Übergang zum Schaffen antreibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A10","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D6","text":"Die Heiligkeit der Ehe hängt nicht an ihrer Institution, sondern an ihrer Fähigkeit, über das Paar hinauszuführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","text":"Ehe fungiert als Selektionsmechanismus, der zwischen bloßer Bedürfnisgemeinschaft und schöpferischer Lebensform unterscheidet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2","text":"Das Kind wird zum zeitlichen Medium, in dem ein errungener Zustand des Selbst über die gegenwärtige Person hinaus fortwirkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD3","text":"Die positive Bestimmung der Ehe entsteht durch die systematische Ausschließung fast aller gewöhnlichen Formen von Paarbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD4","text":"Das Paar ist keine letzte Einheit, sondern ein Übergangsinstrument für die Hervorbringung eines höheren Schaffenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD5","text":"Die Sakralisierung der Ehe wird aus einer transformativen Funktion und nicht aus religiöser Sanktion erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX1","text":"Aus dem natürlichen, sozialen oder emotionalen Auftreten eines Wunsches folgt keine Berechtigung dieses Wunsches.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX2","text":"Kein biologisches Ergebnis gilt als Beweis für geistigen oder schöpferischen Aufstieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX3","text":"Keine Institution kann den Wert einer Verbindung unabhängig von der Qualität ihres Willens garantieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX4","text":"Kein Paar besitzt aus seiner bloßen Zweiheit heraus einen eigenen höheren Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX5","text":"Kein gegenwärtiges Liebesgefühl verbürgt die Fähigkeit zu Selbstüberwindung und Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX6","text":"Keine religiöse Jenseitsordnung darf als letzte Instanz über die Gültigkeit der irdischen Verbindung eingesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX7","text":"Keine Liebe darf als abgeschlossene Erfüllung bestehen bleiben, wenn sie nicht in eine höhere Bewegung übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die autonome Legitimität der Ehe als gewöhnliches menschliches Gut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist das Kind als unabhängiger Endzweck jenseits des Sieges, der Freiheit und des Schaffens seiner Erzeuger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Versöhnung von Tierheit und schöpferischer Berufung innerhalb desselben Ehebegriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine nicht-teleologische Gegenseitigkeit, in der das Paar sich selbst genügen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Sakralität, die nicht aus Überwindung, Schöpfung und Zukunft, sondern aus bloßer Anerkennung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS1","text":"Wunsch nach Kind und Ehe → Prüfung der Quelle des Wunsches → Ausschluss von Tierheit, Nothdurft, Vereinsamung und Selbstunfrieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS2","text":"Ausschluss niedriger Wunschquellen → Prüfung des Subjekts → Selbstbezwingung, Sinnesbeherrschung und Tugendherrschaft als Qualifikationsbedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS3","text":"Qualifiziertes Subjekt → vorheriger Aufbau von Leib und Seele → Möglichkeit des Übersichhinausbauens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS4","text":"Übersichhinausbauen → gemeinsamer Wille zweier → Hervorbringung eines Eines, das größer ist als seine Erzeuger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS5","text":"Gemeinsame Schöpfung → Ehrfurcht vor den Wollenden → positive Bestimmung der Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS6","text":"Vergleich mit der gewöhnlichen Ehe → Bedürfnisgemeinschaft, Schmutz, Behagen und religiöse Scheinlegitimation → begrifflicher Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS7","text":"Liebe → schmerzhafte Bitternis → Fackel für höhere Wege → Sehnsucht nach dem Übermenschen → Heiligkeit der schöpferischen Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AF1","text":"Wunsch nach Kind und Ehe → Prüfung des Wünschenden → Unterscheidung zwischen Selbstbezwingung und Bedürfnis → Selbstaufbau von Leib und Seele → Ehe als gemeinsamer Schöpfungswille → Ausschluss der Viel-zu-Vielen-Ehe → Liebe als schmerzhafte Übergangskraft → Durst nach Schaffen und Übermensch → heilige Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME1","text":"Ehe wird von einer sozialen Institution zu einer selektierten schöpferischen Willensform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME2","text":"Das Kind wird vom Nachkommen zum lebendigen Denkmal eines errungenen und über sich hinausweisenden Zustands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME3","text":"Liebe wird vom Beziehungsziel zur Fackel und Übergangstechnologie höherer Wege umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME4","text":"Religiöse Legitimation und soziale Benennung werden von der schöpferischen Gültigkeit der Verbindung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Liebe und Schmerz bricht zusammen, weil Schmerz als notwendiger Antrieb der höheren Liebe erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME6","text":"Die Zweiheit des Paares wird als unvollständige Zwischenform einer zukünftigen höheren Einheit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der explizite Gegenstand ist die Berechtigung des Wunsches nach Kind und Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text verschiebt die Gültigkeit von Ehe und Fortpflanzung auf Selbstformung, Willensqualität und gemeinsame Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verwandelt die Bewertung von Ehe in eine Prüfung der Herkunft von Wünschen und nutzt die Zurückweisung gewöhnlicher Formen als begriffliche Konstruktion des Ideals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das gültige Sein der Ehe liegt in einer zukünftigen Hervorbringung, die das gegenwärtige Paar und seine bloße biologische Fortsetzung überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Prüfung des Wunsches über die Selbstformung zur schöpferischen Ehe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran die behauptete Rechtwinkligkeit von Leib und Seele praktisch erkannt oder gemessen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Ehe ausschließlich als schöpferische und übersteigende Willensform gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die funktionale Umwandlung von Liebe, Schmerz und Fortpflanzung in eine gemeinsame Bewegung des Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der geforderten Ehrfurcht vor zwei Wollenden und der instrumentellen Unterordnung des Paares unter das Hervorzubringende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Bejahung leiblicher Liebe und der Disqualifizierung ihrer tierischen, bedürftigen oder triebhaften Ursprünge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT7","text":"Der positive Ehebegriff wird fast vollständig apophatisch gewonnen, weil die gewöhnlichen Formen der Ehe systematisch aus ihm ausgeschlossen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, bleibt jedoch auf die metaphorische Gleichsetzung von Schmerz, Schöpfung und Übermensch angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195043503098Z_5fce04ff","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Child and Marriage","source_sha256":"1067c0b45b57fe12772fc149d124e429e15b9f795454d274fd9d0f40b5fcfe69","sha256":"e120b028bcb51d169ca2b75546be18387ba8ef00252005b4809d70478aa06059","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:50:43.507793+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS1","text":"The desire for child and marriage is subjected to an examination of its origin and of the constitution of the desiring person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS2","text":"The desire is justified only if it proceeds from self-mastery, freedom, and mastered virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS3","text":"Procreation is determined as a surpassing of one's own self, which presupposes a prior formation of body and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS4","text":"Marriage is redefined as the common will of two to bring forth something greater than themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS5","text":"Ordinary marriage is excluded as a community of need, spiritual impoverishment, and false sacralization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AS6","text":"Love receives its value only as a painful movement of transition toward creation, the Overman, and holy marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","text":"The desire for child and marriage must be legitimated by the constitution of the desiring person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","text":"The justified desiring person is victorious, self-mastering, master of the senses, and master of his virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A3","text":"The desire for child and marriage can proceed from animality, necessity, loneliness, or discord with oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","text":"Valid procreation is directed not merely toward continuation, but toward ascent beyond one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","text":"The surpassing of one's own self presupposes that body and soul were previously built up by the subject itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","text":"A child is to be brought forth as a living monument to victory and liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","text":"Marriage is the will of two to create a One that is more than those who create it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","text":"Marriage demands reverence for the two who will such common creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","text":"The marriage of the far-too-many denotes spiritual poverty, spiritual filth, and mutual comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A10","text":"Even in its best form, love is a parable and a painful glow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","text":"Love is to point beyond the lovers toward higher paths and the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A12","text":"The bitterness of love generates longing and thirst for creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:A13","text":"Only the will to marriage that possesses this creative and surpassing orientation is holy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX1","text":"Not every human being may desire a child merely on account of his desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX2","text":"Procreation is not mere biological or social continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX3","text":"Marriage is not the solution to loneliness, necessity, or discord with oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","text":"Marriage is not the mutual comfort of two spiritually needy persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","text":"Divine or heavenly blessing confers no validity upon a non-creative union.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX6","text":"Marriage is not the union of qualitatively unconnected or contradictory beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX7","text":"Love is not the accumulation of brief follies that ends in one long stupidity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX8","text":"Mutual love is not merely the mutual divining of two animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:NX9","text":"Love is not the final goal of the lovers, but a transition to higher paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D1","text":"The legitimacy of the desire is determined genealogically from its source before any evaluation of child and marriage.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D2","text":"Procreation is recoded from the mere transmission of life into a practice of self-surpassing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D3","text":"Marriage denotes not primarily a relation between two persons, but the production of a third, higher unity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D4","text":"Ordinary marriage does not merely fall under a lower value judgment, but falls outside the proper concept of marriage.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D5","text":"The pain of love receives a positive function by driving the transition toward creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A10","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:D6","text":"The holiness of marriage does not rest upon its institution, but upon its capacity to lead beyond the couple.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","text":"Marriage functions as a mechanism of selection that distinguishes between a mere community of need and a creative form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2","text":"The child becomes the temporal medium in which an achieved state of the self continues to operate beyond the present person.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A4","CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD3","text":"The positive determination of marriage arises through the systematic exclusion of almost all ordinary forms of pair-bonding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD4","text":"The couple is not a final unity, but an instrument of transition for the bringing forth of a higher creator.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SD5","text":"The sacralization of marriage is generated from a transformative function and not from religious sanction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX1","text":"No justification of a desire follows from its natural, social, or emotional occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX2","text":"No biological result counts as proof of spiritual or creative ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX3","text":"No institution can guarantee the value of a union independently of the quality of its will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX4","text":"No couple possesses a higher meaning of its own merely by virtue of its duality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX5","text":"No present feeling of love guarantees the capacity for self-overcoming and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX6","text":"No religious order of the beyond may be installed as the final authority over the validity of the earthly union.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX7","text":"No love may remain as completed fulfillment if it does not pass over into a higher movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the autonomous legitimacy of marriage as an ordinary human good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the child as an independent final end beyond the victory, freedom, and creation of its begetters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a reconciliation of animality and creative vocation within the same concept of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a non-teleological reciprocity in which the couple could suffice unto itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a sacrality that arises not from overcoming, creation, and the future, but from mere recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS1","text":"Desire for child and marriage → examination of the source of the desire → exclusion of animality, necessity, loneliness, and discord with oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS2","text":"Exclusion of lower sources of desire → examination of the subject → self-mastery, mastery of the senses, and mastery of virtue as conditions of qualification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS3","text":"Qualified subject → prior construction of body and soul → possibility of building beyond oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS4","text":"Building beyond oneself → common will of two → bringing forth of a One that is greater than its begetters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS5","text":"Common creation → reverence for those who will → positive determination of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS6","text":"Comparison with ordinary marriage → community of need, filth, comfort, and religious pseudo-legitimation → conceptual exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS7","text":"Love → painful bitterness → torch for higher paths → longing for the Overman → holiness of creative marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:AF1","text":"Desire for child and marriage → examination of the desiring person → distinction between self-mastery and need → self-construction of body and soul → marriage as common creative will → exclusion of the marriage of the far-too-many → love as painful transitional force → thirst for creation and the Overman → holy marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME1","text":"Marriage is remapped from a social institution into a selected creative form of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME2","text":"The child is transformed from descendant into a living monument to an achieved state that points beyond itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME3","text":"Love is reclassified from the goal of a relationship into the torch and transitional technology of higher paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME4","text":"Religious legitimation and social designation are separated from the creative validity of the union.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME5","text":"The opposition between love and pain collapses because pain appears as the necessary impetus of higher love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ME6","text":"The duality of the couple becomes visible as an incomplete intermediate form of a future higher unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT1","text":"Surface — The explicit subject is the legitimacy of the desire for child and marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text shifts the validity of marriage and procreation onto self-formation, the quality of will, and common bringing-forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text transforms the evaluation of marriage into an examination of the origin of desires and uses the rejection of ordinary forms as a conceptual construction of the ideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The valid being of marriage lies in a future bringing-forth that surpasses the present couple and its mere biological continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the examination of desire through self-formation to creative marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the asserted right-angledness (Rechtwinkligkeit) of body and soul is to be practically recognized or measured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as marriage counts exclusively as a creative and surpassing form of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the functional transformation of love, pain, and procreation into a common movement of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the demanded reverence for two who will and the instrumental subordination of the couple to that which is to be brought forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT6","text":"A further fault line lies between the affirmation of bodily love and the disqualification of its animal, needy, or instinctual origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT7","text":"The positive concept of marriage is gained almost entirely apophatically, because the ordinary forms of marriage are systematically excluded from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, yet remains dependent upon the metaphorical equation of pain, creation, and the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VKUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VKUE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VKUE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 30","title":"On Child and Marriage","context":"Chapter 30","original_title":"Von Kind und Ehe","original_context":"Chapter 30"},"original_title":"Von Kind und Ehe","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0","layer":"CH","title":"On Voluntary Death","order":31,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VFT0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VFT0@R001","sha256":"271365357f6678a18d66907130a898a7dfb0c1fb00164489c0ba504ad72c3447","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt das Sterben als Problem des richtigen oder falschen Zeitpunkts, nicht als bloßes Eintreten des Todes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS2","text":"Der richtige Tod setzt ein richtig gelebtes, auf Vollendung gerichtetes Leben voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS3","text":"Die freie Todesform entsteht aus dem eigenen Wollen, wird aber durch Ziel, Erbe und erreichte Reife zeitlich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS4","text":"Gegen das freie und vollbringende Sterben werden schleichender Tod, Lebensverlängerung, Feigheit und unreife Todesdeutung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS5","text":"Der vollbrachte Tod wirkt auf die Lebenden zurück, indem er ihnen Hoffnung, Gelöbnis und eine neue Bindung an die Erde überträgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS6","text":"Die Polemik gegen den zu frühen Tod Jesu fungiert als Beleg dafür, dass unreifes Sterben eine lebens- und erdfeindliche Lehre erzeugen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS7","text":"Zarathustras eigenes Aufschieben des Todes wird als legitime Verzögerung zugunsten der Erben und der Weitergabe seines Ziels neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A1","text":"Ein Tod kann zu früh oder zu spät eintreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A2","text":"Zur rechten Zeit sterben setzt voraus, zur rechten Zeit zu leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","text":"Der rechte Zeitpunkt des Todes wird durch Vollendung, Ziel und Erbe bestimmt, nicht durch das bloße biologische Alter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A4","text":"Ein freier Tod kommt, weil der Sterbende ihn will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","text":"Ziel und Erbe geben dem Willen zum Tod seine zeitliche und normative Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","text":"Der vollbringende Tod wird für die Lebenden zum Stachel und zum Gelöbnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A7","text":"Der Tod im Kampf ist eine nachgeordnete Form, weil er die große Seele im Kampf verausgabt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","text":"Das Festhalten am Leben nach erreichter Reife verwandelt Fortdauer in Rückwärtsbewegung, Verbrauch oder Verfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A9","text":"Wahrheit, Ruhm und geliebte Wirkung müssen aufgegeben werden können, bevor sie in Selbstverbrauch umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","text":"Reifung und Alter verlaufen bei verschiedenen Menschen zeitlich ungleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A11","text":"Feigheit bindet ein missratenes oder verdorbenes Leben an seine Fortdauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A12","text":"Die Predigt des langsamen Todes verlangt Geduld mit dem Irdischen und steht der geforderten Todesform entgegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A13","text":"Ein unreifer Tod kann eine unreife, menschen- und erdfeindliche Lehre hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","text":"Reife ermöglicht ein freies Nein, sobald die Zeit für ein Ja vorüber ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A15","text":"Ein gelungener Tod muss Geist und Tugend sichtbar bewahren und die Liebe zur Erde vermehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX1","text":"Der Tod ist nicht schon deshalb ein Fest, weil er Tod ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX2","text":"Geduldige Verlängerung des Lebens ist keine hinreichende Todesweisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX3","text":"Ein schleichender, diebischer Tod ist kein freier Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX4","text":"Fortdauer nach erreichter Reife ist keine neutrale Bewahrung, sondern kann Verfall bedeuten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX5","text":"Ruhm, Wahrheit und geliebte Wirkung dürfen nicht ohne zeitliche Grenze verlängert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX6","text":"Ein Tod, der Mensch und Erde lästert, ist missraten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX7","text":"Ein zu früher Tod besitzt keine selbstverständliche Autorität als Vorbild oder Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX8","text":"Das Lebensalter allein liefert kein Kriterium für den richtigen Todeszeitpunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX9","text":"Eine religiöse oder moralische Verehrung des Todes kann seine Unreife nicht aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX10","text":"Der Tod ist nicht als isoliertes Privatereignis gültig, wenn ihm Ziel, Erbe und Wirkung auf die Lebenden fehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D1","text":"Der richtige Tod ist eine Folgerung aus der Qualität des gelebten Lebens und nicht unabhängig von ihr.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A1","CH_97E9_VFT0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D2","text":"Der Wille zum Tod wird erst dann zum freien Todeswillen, wenn er durch Ziel, Erbe und Vollendung zeitlich bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D3","text":"Der vollbringende Tod erhält seinen Wert durch die von ihm erzeugte Weiterwirkung in den Lebenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D4","text":"Der Text ordnet die Todesformen hierarchisch: vollbringender Tod, Tod im Kampf, schleichender oder verfehlter Tod.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A7","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D5","text":"Langes Leben wird dann zum negativen Wert, wenn es lediglich die Bindung an Unreife, Ruhm, Wahrheit oder Genuss verlängert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:A9","CH_97E9_VFT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D6","text":"Ein Todesfest entsteht nicht aus der Feier des Todes selbst, sondern aus der Weihe künftiger Gelöbnisse der Lebenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D7","text":"Die Figur Jesu wird als Fall eines zu frühen Todes gelesen, dessen Unreife eine lebens- und erdfeindliche Lehre stabilisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D8","text":"Reife besteht nicht in fortgesetzter Zustimmung, sondern in der Fähigkeit, den Übergang vom Ja zum Nein rechtzeitig zu vollziehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","text":"Zarathustras Verzögerung des eigenen Todes erscheint als freies Aufschieben, weil sie der Übergabe des Ziels an die Erben dient.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","CH_97E9_VFT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1","text":"Der Tod wird von einem biologischen Ende zu einer pädagogischen und sozialen Übertragung zwischen Sterbendem und Lebenden umgebildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","text":"Zeit wird nicht chronologisch, sondern qualitativ und teleologisch organisiert: Entscheidend ist die erreichte Reife im Verhältnis zu Ziel und Erbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3","text":"Lebensbejahung bedeutet nicht maximale Fortdauer, sondern die Bereitschaft, sich im richtigen Augenblick zugunsten einer größeren Weiterwirkung aufzugeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD4","text":"Die Jesus-Polemik ersetzt religiöse Autorität durch ein Reifekriterium: Eine Lehre gilt nur dann als tragfähig, wenn ihr Ursprung Mensch und Erde bejahen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","text":"Das Subjekt wird durch die Fähigkeit konstituiert, sein Leben in ein Ziel, einen Erben und eine Zukunft zu überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD6","text":"Zarathustras eigenes Aufschieben erzeugt eine Schleife: Die Lehre vom rechten Tod benötigt ein Weiterleben, damit sie Erben hervorbringen kann, die ihren Tod vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass biologische Fortdauer an sich einen positiven oder verbindlichen Wert besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zeitordnung, in der bloße Dauer an die Stelle von Reife, Vollendung und Ziel tritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die normative Gleichgültigkeit gegenüber verschiedenen Todesformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Subjekt, das sich ausschließlich durch Festhalten, Erhalten oder Weitergenießen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Todeslegitimation, die allein aus religiöser Verehrung, moralischem Ruhm oder überlieferter Lehre stammt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX1","text":"Der Text lässt keinen neutralen Tod außerhalb einer Hierarchie von Reife, Unreife, Vollendung und Verfehlung zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines unbegrenzten Weiterlebens als Ausdruck von Treue oder Verantwortung wird blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Lebensbejahung, die ohne terminale Selbstbegrenzung und ohne Übergabe an andere auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX4","text":"Die Erde kann nicht als selbstgenügsamer Lebensgrund gelten; ihre Bejahung wird durch die richtige Form des Sterbens vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS1","text":"Unterscheidung der Zeitformen: zu früh / zur rechten Zeit / zu spät.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS2","text":"Diagnose des Lebens: Unreife, Feigheit, Verfall oder erreichte Vollendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS3","text":"Bestimmung der Todesform: schleichender Tod, Tod im Kampf oder freier vollbringender Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS4","text":"Zeitliche Entscheidung: Das erreichte Ziel und der vorhandene Erbe bestimmen, wann der Wille zum Tod legitim wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS5","text":"Soziale Transformation: Der gelungene Tod wird in Stachel, Gelöbnis, Hoffnung und Weitergabe überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS6","text":"Negative Grenzziehung: Verlängerung, Ruhmsucht, Feigheit, religiöse Sanktion und Erdverneinung werden als Fehlformen klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS7","text":"Selbstanwendung: Zarathustra verschiebt den eigenen Tod, bis sein Ziel an die Freunde als Erben übertragen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF1","text":"Zu frühes oder zu spätes Sterben → Diagnose eines unzeitigen Lebens → Prüfung von Reife, Ziel und Erbe → freier Tod zur rechten Zeit → Stachel und Gelöbnis für die Lebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF2","text":"Lebensverneinende Unreife → zu früher Tod → verhärtete Lehre gegen Mensch und Erde → Gegenbild des reifen, freien Neins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF3","text":"Eigene Todesabsicht → verbleibende Pflicht gegenüber Ziel und Erben → Aufschub → Weitergabe des goldenen Balls → Tod als spätere Vollendung statt als Flucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME1","text":"Der Tod wird von einem singulären Ereignis zu einer Relation zwischen Lebensführung, Zeitpunkt und Wirkung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME2","text":"Die Opposition Leben/Tod wird durch die Unterscheidung von Reife und Unreife ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME3","text":"Chronologisches Alter verliert seine Vorrangstellung zugunsten einer ungleich verteilten zeitlichen Reife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME4","text":"Fortdauer wird neu als mögliche Rückwärtsbewegung, Selbstverbrauch oder Fäulnis klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME5","text":"Der private Tod wird als öffentliches Erziehungs- und Übertragungsereignis sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME6","text":"Religiöse Todesverehrung wird in eine Prüfung der Erd- und Menschenbejahung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME7","text":"Aufschub und Festhalten werden unterschieden: Das eine kann Feigheit sein, das andere eine zielgerichtete Übergabe ermöglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Text unterscheidet frühes, spätes, kämpferisches, freies und vollbringendes Sterben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Todesformen werden durch Lebensreife, Zielbindung, Erbschaft und soziale Wirkung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Tod wird als Instrument der Lehrenbildung und der Formung zukünftiger Lebender neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Zeit erscheint als qualitative Ordnung der Vollendung; die Erde ist Ursprung und Ziel eines Lebens, dessen höchste Bejahung seine richtige Beendigung einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Unterscheidung zwischen zu frühem, zu spätem und freiem Tod zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran Ziel, Vollendung und ein legitimer Erbe außerhalb der poetischen Setzung konkret erkannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern bedingt kohärent, sofern der Wille zum Tod durch Ziel, Reife und Weiterwirkung begrenzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Lebensdiagnose, Todeszeitpunkt und Wirkung auf die Lebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von der nicht weiter abgesicherten Annahme ab, dass biologisches Weiterleben nach der Reife in Verfall umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem freien Tod als persönlichem Wollen und dem rechten Zeitpunkt als objektivem Verhältnis zu Ziel und Erbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen der Verurteilung des Aufschubs und Zarathustras eigenem Aufschieben; sie wird nur durch den Zweck der Weitergabe vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT8","text":"Die Erdbejahung bleibt mit der Vorrangstellung des Todes verschränkt, weil das Leben seine höchste Geltung erst in der Bereitschaft zur Beendigung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT9","text":"Die Jesus-Deutung beruht auf einer kontrafaktischen Behauptung über eine mögliche spätere Selbstwiderrufung und bleibt innerhalb des Systems polemisch zugespitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von der Unzeitigkeit des Sterbens über Reife und freie Vollendung zur Übertragung des Ziels an die Lebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194955894792Z_53520360","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Free Death","source_sha256":"271365357f6678a18d66907130a898a7dfb0c1fb00164489c0ba504ad72c3447","sha256":"e2bd944e1847c21b8cafb1d3afd18a9056f946370c138aac358356bcb4e5afbc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:49:55.896961+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS1","text":"The text defines dying as a problem of the right or wrong time, not as the mere occurrence of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS2","text":"The right death presupposes a rightly lived life directed toward completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS3","text":"The free form of death arises from one's own willing, but is temporally determined by goal, heir, and attained maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS4","text":"Against free and consummating dying, creeping death, prolongation of life, cowardice, and immature interpretation of death are excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS5","text":"The consummated death acts back upon the living by transmitting to them hope, vow, and a new bond to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS6","text":"The polemic against the too-early death of Jesus functions as evidence that immature dying can produce a teaching hostile to life and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AS7","text":"Zarathustra's own postponement of death is redefined as a legitimate delay for the sake of the heirs and the transmission of his goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A1","text":"A death can occur too early or too late.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A2","text":"Dying at the right time presupposes living at the right time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","text":"The right time of death is determined by completion, goal, and heir, not by mere biological age.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A4","text":"A free death comes because the dying person wills it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","text":"Goal and heir give the will to death its temporal and normative determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","text":"The consummating death becomes a spur and a vow for the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A7","text":"Death in battle is a subordinate form because it exhausts the great soul in battle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","text":"Clinging to life after maturity has been attained transforms continuance into backward movement, self-consumption, or decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A9","text":"Truth, fame, and beloved effect must be capable of being relinquished before they turn into self-consumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","text":"Maturation and aging proceed at unequal times in different human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A11","text":"Cowardice binds a failed or corrupted life to its continuance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A12","text":"The preaching of slow death demands patience with the earthly and stands opposed to the required form of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A13","text":"An immature death can bring forth an immature teaching hostile to human beings and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","text":"Maturity enables a free No as soon as the time for a Yes is past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:A15","text":"A successful death must visibly preserve spirit and virtue and increase love of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX1","text":"Death is not already a festival merely because it is death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX2","text":"Patient prolongation of life is not sufficient wisdom concerning death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX3","text":"A creeping, thieving death is not a free death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX4","text":"Continuance after maturity has been attained is not neutral preservation, but can mean decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX5","text":"Fame, truth, and beloved effect must not be prolonged without temporal limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX6","text":"A death that blasphemes human beings and earth is failed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX7","text":"A too-early death possesses no self-evident authority as an example or teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX8","text":"Age alone provides no criterion for the right time of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX9","text":"A religious or moral veneration of death cannot abolish its immaturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:NX10","text":"Death is not valid as an isolated private event when it lacks goal, heir, and effect upon the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D1","text":"The right death is a consequence of the quality of the life lived and not independent of it.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A1","CH_97E9_VFT0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D2","text":"The will to death becomes a free will to death only when it is temporally determined by goal, heir, and completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D3","text":"The consummating death receives its value through the continuing effect it produces in the living.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D4","text":"The text orders the forms of death hierarchically: consummating death, death in battle, creeping or failed death.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A7","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D5","text":"Long life becomes a negative value when it merely prolongs attachment to immaturity, fame, truth, or pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:A9","CH_97E9_VFT0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D6","text":"A festival of death arises not from the celebration of death itself, but from the consecration of future vows of the living.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D7","text":"The figure of Jesus is read as a case of too-early death, whose immaturity stabilizes a teaching hostile to life and earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D8","text":"Maturity consists not in continued assent, but in the capacity to accomplish the transition from Yes to No in good time.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","text":"Zarathustra's delay of his own death appears as free postponement because it serves the handing over of the goal to the heirs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","CH_97E9_VFT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1","text":"Death is transformed from a biological end into a pedagogical and social transmission between the dying person and the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","text":"Time is organized not chronologically but qualitatively and teleologically: decisive is the maturity attained in relation to goal and heir.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3","text":"Affirmation of life does not mean maximal continuance, but the readiness to relinquish oneself at the right moment for the sake of a greater continuing effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD4","text":"The Jesus polemic replaces religious authority with a criterion of maturity: a teaching is valid only if its origin can affirm human beings and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","text":"The subject is constituted through the capacity to carry its life over into a goal, an heir, and a future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SD6","text":"Zarathustra's own postponement produces a loop: the teaching of the right death requires continued life so that it can bring forth heirs who enact their death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that biological continuance as such possesses a positive or binding value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an order of time in which mere duration takes the place of maturity, completion, and goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is normative indifference toward different forms of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a subject that determines itself exclusively through clinging, preserving, or continued enjoyment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a legitimation of death deriving solely from religious veneration, moral fame, or inherited teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX1","text":"The text permits no neutral death outside a hierarchy of maturity, immaturity, completion, and failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX2","text":"The possibility of unlimited continued life as an expression of fidelity or responsibility is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is an affirmation of life that manages without terminal self-limitation and without handing over to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX4","text":"The earth cannot count as a self-sufficient ground of life; its affirmation is mediated by the right form of dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS1","text":"Distinction of temporal forms: too early / at the right time / too late.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS2","text":"Diagnosis of life: immaturity, cowardice, decay, or attained completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS3","text":"Determination of the form of death: creeping death, death in battle, or free consummating death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS4","text":"Temporal decision: the attained goal and the existing heir determine when the will to death becomes legitimate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS5","text":"Social transformation: the successful death is transformed into spur, vow, hope, and transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS6","text":"Negative demarcation: prolongation, lust for fame, cowardice, religious sanction, and denial of the earth are classified as erroneous forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:FGS7","text":"Self-application: Zarathustra postpones his own death until his goal can be transmitted to his friends as heirs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF1","text":"Dying too early or too late → diagnosis of an untimely life → examination of maturity, goal, and heir → free death at the right time → spur and vow for the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF2","text":"Life-denying immaturity → too-early death → hardened teaching against human beings and earth → counterimage of the mature, free No.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:AF3","text":"Own intention of death → remaining duty toward goal and heirs → postponement → handing over of the golden ball → death as later completion rather than as flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME1","text":"Death is remapped from a singular event into a relation among conduct of life, time, and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME2","text":"The opposition life/death is replaced by the distinction between maturity and immaturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME3","text":"Chronological age loses its primacy in favor of unequally distributed temporal maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME4","text":"Continuance is newly classified as possible backward movement, self-consumption, or putrefaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME5","text":"Private death becomes visible as a public event of education and transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME6","text":"Religious veneration of death is transferred into an examination of affirmation of earth and human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ME7","text":"Postponement and clinging are distinguished: one can be cowardice, the other can enable a goal-directed handing over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The text distinguishes early, late, combative, free, and consummating dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Forms of death are generated through maturity of life, attachment to a goal, inheritance, and social effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Death is reframed as an instrument of the formation of teachings and of the shaping of future living beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Time appears as a qualitative order of completion; the earth is origin and goal of a life whose highest affirmation includes its right ending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the distinction between too-early, too-late, and free death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how goal, completion, and a legitimate heir are concretely recognized outside the poetic positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally conditionally coherent insofar as the will to death is limited by goal, maturity, and continuing effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection consists between diagnosis of life, time of death, and effect upon the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on the not further secured assumption that biological continued life after maturity can turn into decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between free death as personal willing and the right time as an objective relation to goal and heir.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT7","text":"A further tension arises between the condemnation of postponement and Zarathustra's own postponing; it is mediated only by the purpose of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT8","text":"Affirmation of the earth remains interwoven with the primacy of death, because life receives its highest validity only in readiness for ending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT9","text":"The interpretation of Jesus rests on a counterfactual claim about a possible later self-revocation and remains polemically sharpened within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the untimeliness of dying through maturity and free completion to the transmission of the goal to the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VFT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VFT0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VFT0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 31","title":"On Voluntary Death","context":"Chapter 31","original_title":"Vom freien Tode","original_context":"Chapter 31"},"original_title":"Vom freien Tode","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 1","order":32,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_2@R001","sha256":"316618fab440bb2792970b4eab07a19de8027ca1de81d0e07c5308d9f83ec984","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS1","text":"Das Argument untersucht, wodurch Wert und Tugend ihren höchsten Rang erhalten und wie gesunde von kranker Selbstsucht zu unterscheiden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS2","text":"Es überführt die Eigenschaften des Goldes in das Abbild einer schenkenden Tugend und bestimmt Wert über Selbsthingabe statt über Nutzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS3","text":"Es unterscheidet die schenkende Selbstsucht, die Werte sammelt und zurückströmen lässt, von der hungernden Selbstsucht, die aus Mangel stiehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS4","text":"Es verlagert den Ursprung der Tugend vom Geist auf den erhöhten, werdenden und kämpfenden Leib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS5","text":"Es behandelt die Namen von Gut und Böse nicht als Wissen, sondern als Gleichnisse und Richtungszeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS6","text":"Es führt von der Diagnose der Entartung zu einer neuen, machtförmigen Ordnung von Tugend, Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A1","text":"Gold erhält seinen höchsten Wert durch Außergewöhnlichkeit, Unnützlichkeit, Leuchten, milden Glanz und Selbsthingabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A2","text":"Die höchste Tugend ist außergewöhnlich, unnützlich, leuchtend, mild im Glanz und schenkend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A3","text":"Gold ist nur als Abbild der höchsten Tugend von höchstem Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","text":"Die schenkende Tugend nimmt Reichtümer und Dinge in sich auf, damit sie als Gaben der Liebe zurückströmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","text":"Die gesunde Selbstsucht ist eine schenkende Liebe, die sich selbst bejaht, indem sie Werte weitergibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","text":"Die kranke Selbstsucht entspringt Armut und Hunger und richtet sich als Diebstahl auf den Reichtum anderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A7","text":"Entartung zeigt sich dort, wo die schenkende Seele fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A8","text":"Der Aufstieg führt von der Art zur Über-Art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","text":"Der Leib durchläuft die Geschichte als Werdender und Kämpfender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","text":"Der Geist ist Herold, Genoss und Wiederhall der Kämpfe und Siege des Leibes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A11","text":"Die Namen von Gut und Böse sind Gleichnisse, die anzeigen, ohne Wissen auszusprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","text":"Die Tugend beginnt, wenn der erhöhte Leib den Geist zum Schöpfer, Schätzer, Liebenden und Wohlthäter macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A13","text":"Ein überströmendes Herz, das Segen und Gefahr zugleich ist, bildet einen Ursprung der Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A14","text":"Ein über Lob und Tadel erhabener Wille, der als Liebender allen Dingen befehlen will, bildet einen Ursprung der Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A15","text":"Die Tugend entsteht in der Zurückweisung des Angenehmen, des weichen Bettes und der Weichlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A16","text":"Die Tugend entsteht, wenn ein einziger Wille die Wendung aller Not in Notwendigkeit vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A17","text":"Die neue Tugend ist Macht, herrschender Gedanke, goldene Sonne und von Erkenntnis umringte Schlange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX1","text":"Der höchste Wert gründet nicht in Nützlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX2","text":"Die höchste Tugend ist keine Bewahrung oder bloße Ansammlung von Besitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX3","text":"Schenkende Selbstsucht ist nicht identisch mit hungerndem Diebstahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX4","text":"Das „Alles für mich“ gilt nicht als Aufstieg, sondern als entartender Sinn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX5","text":"Die Tugend gründet nicht in der Abwesenheit von Selbstsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX6","text":"Geistige Begriffe erzeugen kein unmittelbares Wissen über Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX7","text":"Tugend entsteht nicht aus Lob, Tadel, Bequemlichkeit oder Weichlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX8","text":"Die neue Wertordnung übernimmt Gut und Böse nicht als unveränderte alte Kategorien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D1","text":"Der Wert des Goldes wird aus einer materiellen Eigenschaft in eine genealogische Beziehung zur Tugend überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A1","CH_97E9_1C_2:A2","CH_97E9_1C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D2","text":"Das Ansammeln von Reichtümern widerspricht der schenkenden Tugend nicht, sofern es der Rückgabe als Gabe dient.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","text":"Schenkende Liebe wird zum Räuber aller Werte, weil sie alles aneignet, um es in einen Strom von Gaben zu verwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D4","text":"Selbstsucht wird nicht nach ihrem Selbstbezug, sondern nach der Richtung ihres Wertflusses beurteilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D5","text":"Das Fehlen der Schenkungsfähigkeit fungiert als Diagnosekriterium der Entartung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_1C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","text":"Die Erhöhung des Leibes erzeugt einen schöpferischen und wertenden Geist, statt dass der Geist den Leib ursprünglich bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","CH_97E9_1C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D7","text":"Die Namen der Tugenden weisen auf Prozesse der Erhöhung, ohne deren Wesen als Wissen abzuschließen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A8","CH_97E9_1C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D8","text":"Überströmung, Herrschaft als Liebe, Härte gegen Bequemlichkeit und einheitlicher Wille werden zu verschiedenen Erscheinungsweisen desselben Tug  endursprungs.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A13","CH_97E9_1C_2:A14","CH_97E9_1C_2:A15","CH_97E9_1C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D9","text":"Die neue Tugend verbindet schöpferische Macht, wertende Herrschaft und Erkenntnis in einer einzigen symbolischen Konstellation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","text":"Wert entsteht als Transformation eines aufgenommenen Überschusses in schenkende Bewegung, nicht als statischer Besitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD2","text":"Die zentrale Grenze des Systems verläuft zwischen zirkulierender Aneignung und abschließender Aneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD3","text":"Die moralische Unterscheidung von gesund und krank wird physiologisch und funktional statt formal oder legal bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD4","text":"Der Leib wird zur generativen Instanz der Tugend, während der Geist auf die Vermittlung und Artikulation leiblicher Erhöhung beschränkt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD5","text":"Die Revaluation erzeugt keine bloße Umkehrung alter Werte, sondern eine neue Ordnung aus Macht, Schenkung, Notwendigkeit und Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6","text":"Die symbolische Form der goldenen Sonne mit der Erkenntnisschlange totalisiert Wert, Macht, Leib, Geist und Erkenntnis in einem einzigen Bildgefüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Nutzen, Bedürfnisbefriedigung oder Besitz den letzten Grund des Wertes bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Tugend aus, die im Verzicht auf Selbstbejahung oder in selbstloser Entleerung bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen autonomen Geist als Ursprung von Tugend und Wertung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige begriffliche Erkenntnis von Gut und Böse aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Beibehaltung einer unveränderten moralischen Ordnung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Deutung von Not als bloßem Mangel aus, sobald ein einheitlicher Wille sie in Notwendigkeit wendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ordnung, in der Selbstbewahrung und „Alles für mich“ den Endzweck des Wertens bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wertbegriff ohne Überschuss, Weitergabe und Erzeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Versöhnung von Leib und Geist, in der der Geist unabhängig vom Leib den Ursprung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Sprache, die durch Benennung anstelle von Gleichnis endgültiges Wissen liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Tugend, die ihre Geltung aus Komfort, Anerkennung oder sozialer Zustimmung bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS1","text":"Goldqualitäten → Abbildbeziehung → höchste Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS2","text":"Außergewöhnlichkeit + Unnützlichkeit + Leuchten + Milde + Selbsthingabe → schenkende Wertform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS3","text":"Aufnahme von Reichtümern → innere Anhäufung → Rückstrom als Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS4","text":"Selbstbezug + Rückgabe → heilige Selbstsucht; Selbstbezug + Mangel + Diebstahl → kranke Selbstsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS5","text":"Fehlen der Schenkungsseele → Entartungsdiagnose → Ausschluss des „Alles für mich“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS6","text":"Leibliches Werden und Kämpfen → Erhöhung → Geist als Schöpfer, Schätzer, Liebender und Wohlthäter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS7","text":"Gleichnishaftigkeit der Wertnamen → Aufhebung des Wissensanspruchs → Richtungsanzeige statt Definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS8","text":"Überströmung + liebende Herrschaft + Härte gegen Weichlichkeit + einheitlicher Wille → neue Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS9","text":"neue Tugend → Macht und herrschender Gedanke → goldene Sonne mit Erkenntnisschlange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AF1","text":"Gold als höchster Wert → Gold als Abbild der Tugend → schenkende Tugend als Wertquelle → gesunde gegen kranke Selbstsucht → Entartung als Fehlen der Schenkungsseele → Leib als Ursprung der Erhöhung → Gleichnisse statt Wissen → neue machtvolle Ordnung von Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME1","text":"Gold wird vom wertvollen Gegenstand zum Diagramm einer schenkenden Wertproduktion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME2","text":"Selbstsucht wird in zwei entgegengesetzte Wertflüsse aufgeteilt: Rückgabe des Überschusses und Diebstahl aus Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME3","text":"Der Leib wird vom Gegenstand geistiger Beherrschung zur Quelle von Erhöhung, Tugend und Wertung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME4","text":"Der Geist wird vom souveränen Ursprung zum Echo, Herold und schöpferischen Ausdruck leiblicher Prozesse umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME5","text":"Gut und Böse werden von Wissenskategorien zu Gleichnissen einer noch offenen Wertbewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME6","text":"Notwendigkeit wird von äußerem Zwang in die Form eines einheitlich gewollten Lebensvollzugs überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME7","text":"Tugend wird von moralischer Anerkennung und Bequemlichkeit auf Macht, Überschuss, Härte und Schenkung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gold, Tugend, Selbstsucht, Leib, Geist sowie Gut und Böse bilden die unmittelbare Begriffsebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wert wird durch die Richtung eines Überschusses, die Zirkulation von Gaben und die leibliche Erhöhung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Werten wird aus den Maßstäben von Lob, Tadel, Komfort und Besitz herausgelöst und auf eine neue Ordnung von Macht und Schenkung ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Leib erscheint als historisch werdende und kämpfende Realität; Tugend bezeichnet eine Bewegung von der Art zur Über-Art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom Goldsymbol zur schenkenden Tugend und zur neuen Wertordnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie genau Außergewöhnlichkeit, Unnützlichkeit, Leuchten und Milde als Wertqualitäten zusammenwirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT3","text":"Die Unterscheidung gesunder und kranker Selbstsucht ist intern kohärent, weil sie über die Richtung des Wertflusses erfolgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Schenkung, Überschuss, Aneignung und Rückgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen dem Räuber aller Werte und dem Gegner des Diebstahls wird nur durch die unterschiedliche Zielrichtung der Aneignung aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT6","text":"Die Vorrangstellung des Leibes vor dem Geist wird behauptet und funktional gestützt, aber nicht weiter begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Zurückweisung von Wissen über Gut und Böse steht in Spannung zur sicheren Diagnose von Gesundheit, Krankheit und Entartung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von symbolischer Wertgenealogie über leibliche Erzeugung bis zur machtförmigen Revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185243711313Z_2828085a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"316618fab440bb2792970b4eab07a19de8027ca1de81d0e07c5308d9f83ec984","sha256":"5946c60ae7bbdad4e55095234a3f6e2417a7c29958d612c6eb15604578515298","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:52:43.712334+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS1","text":"The argument examines what confers upon value and virtue their highest rank and how healthy selfishness is to be distinguished from sick selfishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS2","text":"It transforms the qualities of gold into the image of a gift-giving virtue and determines value through self-giving rather than through usefulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS3","text":"It distinguishes gift-giving selfishness, which gathers values and lets them flow back, from hungry selfishness, which steals out of deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS4","text":"It shifts the origin of virtue from the spirit to the elevated, becoming, and struggling body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS5","text":"It treats the names of good and evil not as knowledge, but as parables and signs of direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AS6","text":"It leads from the diagnosis of degeneration to a new, power-shaped order of virtue, good, and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A1","text":"Gold attains its highest value through extraordinariness, uselessness, radiance, mild lustre, and self-giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A2","text":"The highest virtue is extraordinary, useless, radiant, mild in lustre, and giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A3","text":"Gold is of the highest value only as an image of the highest virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","text":"The giving virtue takes riches and things into itself so that they flow back as gifts of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","text":"Healthy selfishness is a giving love that affirms itself by passing on values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","text":"Sick selfishness springs from poverty and hunger and directs itself, as theft, toward the wealth of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A7","text":"Degeneration shows itself where the giving soul is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A8","text":"The ascent leads from the species to the over-species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","text":"The body passes through history as one becoming and struggling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","text":"The spirit is herald, companion, and echo of the struggles and victories of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A11","text":"The names of good and evil are parables that indicate without pronouncing knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","text":"Virtue begins when the elevated body makes the spirit into a creator, evaluator, lover, and benefactor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A13","text":"An overflowing heart, which is blessing and danger at once, constitutes an origin of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A14","text":"A will elevated above praise and blame, which as a lover wishes to command all things, constitutes an origin of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A15","text":"Virtue arises in the rejection of what is pleasant, of the soft bed, and of softness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A16","text":"Virtue arises when a single will accomplishes the transformation of all distress into necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:A17","text":"The new virtue is power, ruling thought, golden sun, and serpent encircled by knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX1","text":"The highest value is not grounded in utility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX2","text":"The highest virtue is not preservation or the mere accumulation of possessions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX3","text":"Giving selfishness is not identical with hungry theft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX4","text":"“Everything for me” does not count as ascent, but as a degenerating disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX5","text":"Virtue is not grounded in the absence of selfishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX6","text":"Spiritual concepts produce no immediate knowledge of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX7","text":"Virtue does not arise from praise, blame, comfort, or softness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:NX8","text":"The new order of values does not adopt good and evil as unchanged old categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D1","text":"The value of gold is transferred from a material property into a genealogical relation to virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A1","CH_97E9_1C_2:A2","CH_97E9_1C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D2","text":"The accumulation of riches does not contradict giving virtue, insofar as it serves return as a gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","text":"Giving love becomes the robber of all values because it appropriates everything in order to transform it into a stream of gifts.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D4","text":"Selfishness is judged not according to its self-reference, but according to the direction of its flow of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D5","text":"The absence of the capacity for giving functions as a diagnostic criterion of degeneration.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_1C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","text":"The elevation of the body produces a creative and evaluating spirit, rather than the spirit originally determining the body.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","CH_97E9_1C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D7","text":"The names of the virtues point to processes of elevation without conclusively determining their essence as knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A8","CH_97E9_1C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D8","text":"Overflowing, dominion as love, hardness against comfort, and unified will become different manifestations of the same origin of virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A13","CH_97E9_1C_2:A14","CH_97E9_1C_2:A15","CH_97E9_1C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:D9","text":"The new virtue combines creative power, evaluating dominion, and knowledge in a single symbolic constellation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","text":"Value arises as the transformation of an assimilated surplus into giving movement, not as static possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD2","text":"The system's central boundary runs between circulating appropriation and conclusive appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD3","text":"The moral distinction between healthy and sick is determined physiologically and functionally rather than formally or legally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD4","text":"The body becomes the generative instance of virtue, while the spirit is restricted to the mediation and articulation of bodily elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD5","text":"The revaluation produces not a mere reversal of old values, but a new order of power, giving, necessity, and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6","text":"The symbolic form of the golden sun with the serpent of knowledge totalizes value, power, body, spirit, and knowledge in a single figurative configuration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes utility, satisfaction of needs, or possession from constituting the ultimate ground of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes a virtue that would consist in renouncing self-affirmation or in selfless emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX3","text":"It excludes an autonomous spirit as the origin of virtue and valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX4","text":"It excludes a final conceptual knowledge of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes the preservation of an unchanged moral order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX6","text":"It excludes interpreting distress as mere lack as soon as a unified will transforms it into necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an order in which self-preservation and “Everything for me” constitute the ultimate purpose of valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a concept of value without surplus, passing on, and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a reconciliation of body and spirit in which the spirit independently constitutes the origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a language that provides final knowledge through naming rather than parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a virtue that derives its validity from comfort, recognition, or social approval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS1","text":"Gold qualities → image-relation → highest virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS2","text":"Exceptionality + uselessness + shining + gentleness + self-giving → gift-giving form of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS3","text":"Reception of riches → inner accumulation → flowing back as a gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS4","text":"Self-reference + return → sacred selfishness; self-reference + deficiency + theft → sick selfishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS5","text":"Absence of the gift-giving soul → diagnosis of degeneration → exclusion of “Alles für mich”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS6","text":"Bodily becoming and struggling → elevation → spirit as creator, evaluator, lover, and benefactor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS7","text":"Parabolic character of the names of value → suspension of the claim to knowledge → indication of direction rather than definition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS8","text":"Overflowing + loving dominion + hardness against softness + unified will → new virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:FGS9","text":"new virtue → power and ruling thought → golden sun with serpent of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:AF1","text":"Gold as highest value → gold as image of virtue → giving virtue as source of value → healthy versus sick selfishness → degeneration as absence of the giving soul → body as origin of elevation → parables instead of knowledge → new powerful order of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME1","text":"Gold is remapped from the valuable object into a diagram of a giving production of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME2","text":"Selfishness is divided into two opposing flows of value: return of the surplus and theft from lack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME3","text":"The body is reclassified from the object of spiritual mastery into the source of elevation, virtue, and valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME4","text":"The spirit is reclassified from the sovereign origin into the echo, herald, and creative expression of bodily processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME5","text":"Good and evil are remapped from categories of knowledge into parables of a still-open movement of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME6","text":"Necessity is transferred from external compulsion into the form of a life-process willed in unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ME7","text":"Virtue is shifted from moral recognition and comfort toward power, surplus, hardness, and giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gold, virtue, selfishness, body, spirit, and good and evil constitute the immediate conceptual level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Value is organized through the direction of a surplus, the circulation of gifts, and bodily elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Valuation is detached from the standards of praise, blame, comfort, and possession and oriented toward a new order of power and giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The body appears as a historically becoming and struggling reality; virtue designates a movement from the species to the over-species.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the gold symbol to giving virtue and to the new order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is precisely how extraordinariness, uselessness, radiance, and mildness interact as qualities of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT3","text":"The distinction between healthy and sick selfishness is internally coherent because it proceeds through the direction of the flow of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between giving, surplus, appropriation, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT5","text":"The tension between the robber of all values and the opponent of theft is resolved only through the differing direction of appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT6","text":"The priority of the body over the spirit is asserted and functionally supported, but not further justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7","text":"The rejection of knowledge of good and evil stands in tension with the certain diagnosis of health, sickness, and degeneration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from symbolic genealogy of value through bodily production to power-formed revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Von der schenkenden Tugend","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 32","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 1","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der schenkenden Tugend · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 2","order":33,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_2@R001","sha256":"96f0dff9a8f9208d48ae73611403a9bd62a0d0332b80c803fc757a782b724eca","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS1","text":"Der Mensch ist ein Versuch, in dessen Leib sich vergangene Irrtümer, Wahnformen und fehlgeleitete Tugenden sedimentiert haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS2","text":"Die entscheidende Gegenbewegung besteht darin, Geist und Tugend aus ihrer Verflüchtigung in die Erde, den Leib und das Leben zurückzuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS3","text":"Der Sinn der Erde wird durch eine neue Setzung des Werts aller Dinge erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS4","text":"Erkenntnis wirkt als leibliche Reinigung, Erprobung und Erhöhung der Triebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS5","text":"Selbstheilung bildet die operative Form der Hilfe und der Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS6","text":"Aus einsamen, sich selbst auswählenden Menschen soll ein erwähltes Volk und aus diesem der Übermensch hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS7","text":"Die Erde wird als noch unerschöpfter Ort zukünftiger Gesundheit und Hoffnung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","text":"Der Sinn der Erde ist die maßgebliche Orientierung des menschlichen Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A2","text":"Geist und Tugend können sich vom Irdischen lösen und dadurch ihren Sinn verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","text":"Verflogene Tugend muss zu Leib und Leben zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","text":"Vergangene Irrtümer und Wahnformen sind im menschlichen Leib wirksam geworden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","text":"Der Mensch ist ein unvollendeter Versuch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","text":"Vernunft und Wahnsinn der vergangenen Jahrtausende wirken gemeinsam als menschliches Erbe fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A7","text":"Zufall und Unsinn bestimmen die bisherige menschliche Geschichte mit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","text":"Geist und Tugend sollen der Neubestimmung aller Werte dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","text":"Wertsetzung verlangt eine kämpfende und schaffende Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","text":"Wissen kann den Leib reinigen, erproben und erhöhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A11","text":"Erkenntnis kann die Triebe heiligen und die Seele fröhlich machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","text":"Hilfe für andere gewinnt ihre höchste Wirksamkeit aus der sichtbaren Selbstheilung des Helfenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A13","text":"Mensch und Menschen-Erde bleiben unerschöpft und unentdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","text":"Einsamkeit und Selbstauswahl können die Bildung eines neuen Volkes begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","text":"Aus diesem neuen Volk kann der Übermensch hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A16","text":"Die Erde kann zu einer Stätte der Genesung werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX1","text":"Der Sinn der Tugend liegt nicht in ihrer Entfernung vom Irdischen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX2","text":"Geist und Tugend dürfen nicht gegen ewige Wände verfliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX3","text":"Der Leib ist nicht bloß ein passiver Träger des Geistes, sondern der Ort seiner Verkörperung und Umwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX4","text":"Menschliche Vererbung ist nicht mit vernünftiger Überlieferung gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX5","text":"Die bisherige Menschheitsordnung ist nicht durch einen einheitlichen Sinn bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX6","text":"Erkenntnis ist nicht kontemplative Distanz vom Leib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX7","text":"Heilung erfolgt nicht primär durch fremde Behandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX8","text":"Die Zukunft des Menschen ist nicht ausgeschöpft oder abschließend entdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX9","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht endgültige soziale Absonderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX10","text":"Der Übermensch ist nicht als bereits vorhandene menschliche Eigenschaft vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D1","text":"Die Rückbindung von Geist und Tugend an Leib und Leben macht den Körper zum Austragungsort der Wertbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","text":"Weil vergangene Irrtümer leiblich fortwirken, verlangt menschliche Veränderung eine Reinigung und Umformung des verkörperten Erbes.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D3","text":"Weil der Mensch ein Versuch unter Bedingungen von Irrtum und Unsinn ist, bleibt seine Gestalt prinzipiell veränderbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A7","CH_97E9_2C_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D4","text":"Neue Werte entstehen nicht durch bloße Erkenntnis, sondern durch kämpfende und schaffende Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","CH_97E9_2C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D5","text":"Erkenntnis wird zu einer leiblichen Praxis, wenn sie Triebe verändert und den Körper erhöht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D6","text":"Derjenige, der sich selbst heilt, verkörpert die wirksamste Form der Hilfe für den Kranken.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","text":"Die zukünftige Gemeinschaft wird nicht aus der bestehenden Menschheit als Ganzem, sondern aus einer Auswahl einsamer Menschen gebildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","text":"Der Übermensch erscheint als Ergebnis einer gestuften Hervorbringung: Selbstauswahl → Volk → Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","text":"Die Rückkehr zur Erde ist keine Rücknahme von Geistigkeit, sondern eine Rekodierung von Geist, Tugend und Erkenntnis als leibliche Wertproduktionskräfte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","text":"Menschliche Zukunft wird als aktive Selbstüberwindung eines belasteten Erbes und nicht als Fortsetzung gegebener Vernunft organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3","text":"Heilung, Wertsetzung und Erhöhung bilden eine einzige Transformationslogik, in der individuelle Selbstformung gesellschaftliche und transhumane Folgen erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4","text":"Die zukünftige Gemeinschaft wird durch Selektion und Selbstwahl erzeugt, nicht durch die bloße Integration aller Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A13","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem höhere Werte durch Abwendung vom Leib oder durch Bezug auf ein Ewiges gewonnen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem der Körper nur die nachträgliche Hülle bereits fertiger geistiger Inhalte bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem die menschliche Geschichte als rationaler Fortschritt ohne wirksamen Wahnsinn, Irrtum und Zufall erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem Hilfe unabhängig von der Transformation des Helfenden wirksam wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem die Zukunft des Menschen durch die gegenwärtige Menschengestalt begrenzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX6","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem Gemeinschaft vor der Herausbildung selbstgewählter und selbstformender Individuen entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine transzendente Ordnung, die dem Irdischen seinen Sinn von außen vorgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine unschuldige oder neutrale Leiblichkeit, die nicht bereits von überliefertem Wahn und Irrtum geformt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine allgemeine Erlösung der Menschheit ohne Auswahl, Selbstprüfung und leibliche Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, den Übermenschen als gegenwärtige Tatsache statt als erzeugte Zukunftsfigur zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS1","text":"Verkörpertes Erbe aus Vernunft, Wahnsinn, Irrtum und Zufall → gegenwärtige menschliche Unabgeschlossenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS2","text":"Unabgeschlossenheit → Rückführung von Geist und Tugend auf Erde, Leib und Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS3","text":"Rückführung → leibliche Reinigung, Erprobung, Erhöhung und Heiligung der Triebe durch Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS4","text":"Leibliche Transformation → neue Wertsetzung durch Kampf und Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS5","text":"Selbstheilung → exemplarische Hilfe und Modell einer zukünftigen Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS6","text":"Selbstauswahl der Einsamen → auserwähltes Volk → Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS7","text":"Neue Wertsetzung plus zukünftige Hervorbringung → Erde als mögliche Stätte der Genesung und Hoffnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1","text":"Verkörperter Irrtum und Unsinn → Diagnose des Menschen als Versuch → Rückbindung an die Erde → leibliche Erkenntnispraxis → neue Wertsetzung → selbstheilende Individuen → erwähltes Volk → Übermensch → genesende Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME1","text":"Die Trennung von Geist und Leib wird in eine operative Einheit von Erkenntnis, Trieb und körperlicher Transformation überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Vernunft und Wahnsinn wird durch die gemeinsame Verkörperung beider als menschliches Erbe neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME3","text":"Heilung wird von einer fremden Intervention auf die Sichtbarkeit eigener Selbstheilung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME4","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als bloße Fortsetzung der Menschheit, sondern als selektive Hervorbringung eines neuen Kollektivs bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5","text":"Die Erde wird vom Schauplatz menschlicher Verirrung zum Material und möglichen Ort ihrer Genesung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME6","text":"Einsamkeit wird von sozialem Ausschluss in eine Vorbedingung kollektiver Neubildung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Die Jünger sollen der Erde treu bleiben, ihre Tugend und Erkenntnis auf sie beziehen und als Kämpfende und Schaffende handeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Leib, Erbe, Triebe, Wertsetzung und Gemeinschaft bilden eine Kette verkörperter Reproduktion und Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text ersetzt kontemplative, transzendente oder fremdheilende Modelle durch Selbstformung, Selbstheilung, Auswahl und Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Der Mensch ist ein noch nicht abgeschlossener Versuch; die Zukunft wirkt als noch unentdeckte Möglichkeit einer neuen menschlichen Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von verkörpertem Erbe zu zukünftiger Hervorbringung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Vermittlung besteht in der Rückführung von Geist und Tugend auf Erde, Leib und Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen Kriterien neue Werte, Gesundheit oder Selbstauswahl bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern tragfähig, solange Erde, Leib, Erkenntnis, Heilung und Wertsetzung als zusammengehörige Transformation behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Ablehnung transzendenter Maßstäbe und der normativen Forderung nach einem „Sinn der Erde“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Kritik am überlieferten Erbe und der Bildung eines „auserwählten Volkes“, die erneut eine vererbungs- und auswahlförmige Ordnung nahelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern der Übermensch als erzeugte Zukunftsfolge und nicht als vorausgesetzte Entität gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190410851845Z_68232277","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"96f0dff9a8f9208d48ae73611403a9bd62a0d0332b80c803fc757a782b724eca","sha256":"3174b708f5d87e6fa3323c6075f6b2e5575afff982876fac05b7184b71ccb26d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:04:10.853786+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS1","text":"The human being is an experiment, in whose body past errors, forms of delusion, and misguided virtues have sedimented.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS2","text":"The decisive counter-movement consists in returning spirit and virtue from their volatilization to the earth, the body, and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS3","text":"The meaning of the earth is produced through a new positing of the value of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS4","text":"Knowledge operates as bodily purification, testing, and elevation of the drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS5","text":"Self-healing constitutes the operative form of help and recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS6","text":"From solitary, self-selecting human beings, a chosen people is to emerge, and from this the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AS7","text":"The earth is newly determined as a still unexhausted site of future health and hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","text":"The meaning of the earth is the decisive orientation of human action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A2","text":"Spirit and virtue can detach themselves from the earthly and thereby lose their meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","text":"Fled virtue must be brought back to body and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","text":"Past errors and forms of delusion have become efficacious in the human body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","text":"The human being is an unfinished experiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","text":"Reason and madness from past millennia continue to operate together as human inheritance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A7","text":"Chance and nonsense also determine human history hitherto.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","text":"Spirit and virtue are to serve the revaluation of all values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","text":"Value-positing demands a struggling and creating activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","text":"Knowledge can purify, test, and elevate the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A11","text":"Cognition can sanctify the drives and make the soul joyful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","text":"Help for others gains its highest efficacy from the visible self-healing of the helper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A13","text":"The human being and the human-earth remain inexhausted and undiscovered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","text":"Solitude and self-selection can ground the formation of a new people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","text":"From this new people the Overman can emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:A16","text":"The earth can become a place of convalescence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX1","text":"The meaning of virtue does not lie in its distance from the earthly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX2","text":"Spirit and virtue must not fly away against eternal walls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX3","text":"The body is not merely a passive bearer of spirit, but the site of its embodiment and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX4","text":"Human inheritance is not to be equated with rational tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX5","text":"The human order hitherto is not determined by a unified meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX6","text":"Cognition is not contemplative distance from the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX7","text":"Healing does not occur primarily through treatment by another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX8","text":"The future of the human being is not exhausted or conclusively discovered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX9","text":"Solitude is not definitive social isolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:NX10","text":"The Overman is not presupposed as an already existing human attribute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D1","text":"The rebinding of spirit and virtue to body and life makes the body the site where values are formed.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","text":"Because past errors continue to operate corporeally, human transformation demands a purification and reshaping of embodied inheritance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D3","text":"Because the human being is an experiment under conditions of error and nonsense, its form remains in principle mutable.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A7","CH_97E9_2C_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D4","text":"New values arise not through mere cognition, but through struggling and creating value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","CH_97E9_2C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D5","text":"Cognition becomes a corporeal practice when it transforms drives and elevates the body.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D6","text":"The one who heals himself embodies the most efficacious form of help for the sick.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","text":"The future community will be formed not from existing humanity as a whole, but from a selection of solitary human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","text":"The Overman appears as the result of a graduated production: self-selection → people → Overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","text":"The return to the earth is not a retraction of spirituality, but a recoding of spirit, virtue, and cognition as corporeal forces of value-production.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","CH_97E9_2C_2:A8","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","text":"The human future is organized as active self-overcoming of a burdened inheritance and not as the continuation of given reason.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3","text":"Healing, value-positing, and elevation form a single logic of transformation in which individual self-formation produces social and transhuman consequences.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4","text":"The future community is produced through selection and self-choice, not through the mere integration of all human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A13","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX1","text":"False is a model in which higher values are gained through turning away from the body or through reference to an eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX2","text":"False is a model in which the body forms only the subsequent shell of already finished spiritual contents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX3","text":"False is a model in which human history appears as rational progress without efficacious madness, error, and chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX4","text":"False is a model in which help becomes efficacious independently of the transformation of the helper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX5","text":"False is a model in which the future of the human being is limited by the present human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX6","text":"False is a model in which community arises before the formation of self-chosen and self-forming individuals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a transcendent order that externally prescribes its meaning to the earthly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an innocent or neutral corporeality that would not already have been formed by inherited delusion and error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a general redemption of humanity without selection, self-examination, and corporeal transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating the Overman as a present fact rather than as a produced figure of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS1","text":"Embodied inheritance from reason, madness, error, and chance → present human incompleteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS2","text":"Incompleteness → return of spirit and virtue to earth, body, and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS3","text":"Return → bodily purification, testing, elevation, and sanctification of the drives through knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS4","text":"Bodily transformation → new value-positing through struggle and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS5","text":"Self-healing → exemplary help and model of a future recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS6","text":"Self-selection of the solitary → chosen people → Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:FGS7","text":"New value-positing plus future bringing-forth → earth as a possible site of recovery and hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1","text":"Embodied error and nonsense → diagnosis of the human being as experiment → rebinding to the earth → corporeal practice of cognition → new value-positing → self-healing individuals → chosen people → Overman → convalescing earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME1","text":"The separation of spirit and body is transformed into an operative unity of cognition, drive, and bodily transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME2","text":"The opposition between reason and madness is remapped through the shared embodiment of both as human inheritance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME3","text":"Healing is shifted from an intervention by another to the visibility of one's own self-healing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME4","text":"The future is determined not as the mere continuation of humanity, but as the selective production of a new collective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5","text":"The earth is reclassified from the scene of human aberration into the material and possible site of its convalescence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ME6","text":"Solitude is transformed from social exclusion into a precondition of collective reformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The disciples are to remain faithful to the earth, relate their virtue and cognition to it, and act as strugglers and creators.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Body, inheritance, drives, value-positing, and community form a chain of embodied reproduction and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text replaces contemplative, transcendent, or healing-by-another models with self-formation, self-healing, selection, and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The human being is an experiment not yet completed; the future operates as the still undiscovered possibility of a new human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from embodied inheritance to future production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT2","text":"The central mediation consists in leading spirit and virtue back to earth, body, and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined according to which criteria new values, health, or self-selection are determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally viable insofar as earth, body, cognition, healing, and value-positing are treated as a coherent transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the rejection of transcendent standards and the normative demand for a “meaning of the earth”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the critique of inherited legacy and the formation of a “chosen people,” which again suggests an order shaped by inheritance and selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement provided that the Overman is read as a produced future consequence and not as a presupposed entity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Von der schenkenden Tugend","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 33","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 2","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der schenkenden Tugend · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 3","order":34,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_2@R001","sha256":"55254c2975b7ba7e8e1aae116152d5a830e817a33440f370e1f7406866f4e9a0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS1","text":"Die fortbestehende Bindung an den Lehrer verhindert die Selbstfindung der Jünger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","text":"Der Lehrer hebt seine eigene Autorität auf, indem er Trennung, Widerstand und Verleugnung fordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS3","text":"Die Verehrung des Lehrers wird als neue Form des Glaubens und der Idolatrie bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS4","text":"Der Verlust Zarathustras soll die Jünger zur Findung ihrer selbst nötigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS5","text":"Nach vollzogener Selbstwerdung wird eine erneuerte Freundschaft auf gemeinsamer Hoffnung möglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS6","text":"Diese Hoffnung wird im Übergang des Menschen zum Übermenschen und im großen Mittag zeitlich und ontologisch geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","text":"Ein Schüler darf nicht dauerhaft Schüler bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","text":"Erkenntnis verlangt die Fähigkeit zum Widerstand gegen den eigenen Lehrer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","text":"Verehrung kann den Verehrten in eine erschlagende Bildsäule verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","text":"Glaube an den Lehrer ersetzt die vorgängige Suche nach dem eigenen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","text":"Selbstfindung verlangt den Verlust und die Verleugnung des Lehrers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A6","text":"Eine spätere Freundschaft setzt die überwundene Lehrer-Schüler-Beziehung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","text":"Der Mensch befindet sich zwischen Tier und Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","text":"Der Untergang des Menschen kann als Übergang zu einem neuen Morgen bejaht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A9","text":"Der große Mittag bezeichnet die Mitte des menschlichen Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A10","text":"Das Leben des Übermenschen tritt an die Stelle der toten Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX1","text":"Die Jünger sollen nicht im Zustand dauernder Schülerschaft verbleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX2","text":"Erkenntnis ist nicht mit bloßer Gefolgschaft identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX3","text":"Zarathustra darf nicht zum unangefochtenen Gegenstand des Glaubens werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX4","text":"Verehrung darf nicht in Idolatrie übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX5","text":"Die gefundene Autorität darf nicht an die Stelle der Selbstsuche treten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Beziehung darf nicht als endgültige Freundschaft gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX7","text":"Der Mensch darf nicht als vollendete oder letzte Gestalt behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX8","text":"Die alten Götter gelten nicht mehr als lebendige Träger des letzten Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D1","text":"Die Aufforderung zum Fortgehen macht die Trennung zum pädagogischen Mittel.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D2","text":"Widerstand gegen Zarathustra ist eine Bedingung echter Erkenntnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D3","text":"Die Verehrung des Lehrers kann die Selbstwerdung gerade dadurch verhindern, dass sie den Lehrer verabsolutiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","CH_97E9_3C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D4","text":"Das Verlieren Zarathustras erzeugt die Möglichkeit, die eigene Identität zu finden.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D5","text":"Die spätere Rückkehr des Lehrers ist nicht Fortsetzung, sondern Wiederaufnahme unter veränderten Augen und veränderter Liebe.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D6","text":"Der menschliche Untergang wird als Durchgang und nicht als bloße Vernichtung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_3C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D7","text":"Der große Mittag verbindet Selbstüberschreitung, Erkenntnis und Zukunftshoffnung in einem Übergangsmoment.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","text":"Die höchste Treue zum Lehrer besteht in der Aufhebung der Abhängigkeit von ihm.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2","text":"Autorität wird nicht durch Fortbestand, sondern durch ihre kontrollierte Selbstzerstörung legitimiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD3","text":"Die Gemeinschaft der Jünger entsteht erst nach der Auflösung ihrer ursprünglichen Glaubensgemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","text":"Die gesamte Bewegung organisiert Zeit als Übergang von einer überwundenen Gestalt zu einer noch ausstehenden Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A9","CH_97E9_3C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD5","text":"Die Befreiung von religiöser Autorität wird durch eine neue teleologische Figur, den Übermenschen, neu gebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A10","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","text":"Selbstwerdung ist unmöglich, solange das fremde Wort als eigener Grund übernommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX2","text":"Eine Lehre, die nur Anhänger erzeugt, hat ihr eigenes Ziel verfehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX3","text":"Keine gegenwärtige Gestalt darf den offenen Übergang des Menschen stillstellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX4","text":"Erkenntnis darf nicht in ein stabiles Besitzverhältnis zu einer Autorität überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX5","text":"Der Tod der alten Götter genügt nicht als Endpunkt; auch die bloße Negation des Alten ist unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gemeinschaft, deren Einheit auf unvermittelter Verehrung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine abgeschlossene Gegenwart, in der der Mensch bereits seine höchste Gestalt erreicht hätte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Autorität, die durch dauernde Anwesenheit und nicht durch ihre Überwindung wirkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter Sinn, der unabhängig vom Übergang, vom Untergang und von einer zukünftigen Gestalt verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS1","text":"Lehrerautorität → Schülerbindung → Verhinderung der Selbstsuche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS2","text":"Selbstaufhebung der Lehrerautorität → Fortgehen, Widerstand und Verleugnung → Auflösung der Glaubensabhängigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS3","text":"Auflösung der Glaubensabhängigkeit → Selbstfindung → Möglichkeit einer nicht-hierarchischen Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS4","text":"Selbstfindung → gemeinsame Hoffnung → Mensch als Übergang zwischen Tier und Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS5","text":"Übergang → großer Mittag → Bejahung des Untergangs als Hinübergehen → Leben des Übermenschen anstelle der toten Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1","text":"Lehrerverehrung → Abhängigkeit → geforderte Trennung → Widerstand und Verleugnung → Selbstfindung → erneuerte Freundschaft → gemeinsamer Übergang zum Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AF2","text":"Tote Götter → neuer letzter Wille → großer Mittag → Selbstsegnung des Untergehenden → neuer Morgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME1","text":"Lehrer und Schüler werden nicht mehr als dauerhafte Rollen, sondern als zu durchlaufende Übergangsstufen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME2","text":"Verehrung wird von einem Zeichen der Bindung zu einem Risiko der Vergegenständlichung und Selbstvernichtung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME3","text":"Verleugnung erscheint nicht als Gegensatz zur Lehre, sondern als deren notwendige Vollendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME4","text":"Untergang wird aus der Kategorie des Endes in die Kategorie des Übergangs verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen religiöser Negation und neuer Hoffnung wird durch die Figur des Übermenschen neu organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra fordert seine Jünger auf, ihn zu verlassen, sich gegen ihn zu wenden und ihn zu verleugnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Lehrer-Schüler-Beziehung erzeugt Abhängigkeit, wenn sie nicht in Selbstständigkeit überführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Autorität behauptet sich, indem sie ihre eigene Verehrung unterbindet und die Anhänger zur Opposition befähigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Mensch ist eine Zwischenform; sein Untergang eröffnet einen zukünftigen Übergang zum Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Lehrerbindung zur Selbstfindung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den großen Mittag als zeitliche und ontologische Übergangsfigur abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die erneuerte Freundschaft institutionell oder praktisch bestehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Aufhebung der Lehrerautorität als Bedingung ihrer Fortwirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Abschaffung des Glaubens und dem gemeinsamen letzten Willen zum Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der geforderten Verleugnung Zarathustras und seiner angekündigten Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern der Übermensch als offene Zielgestalt und nicht als bereits verfügbare Autorität behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191256904203Z_279bec2d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"55254c2975b7ba7e8e1aae116152d5a830e817a33440f370e1f7406866f4e9a0","sha256":"50c8c9e91c3d6ed51561424f7190dcf11f0979dc6358cacfdacf974d8c983c8e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:12:56.906323+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS1","text":"The continuing attachment to the teacher prevents the disciples' finding of themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","text":"The teacher abolishes his own authority by demanding separation, resistance, and denial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS3","text":"The veneration of the teacher is determined as a new form of faith and idolatry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS4","text":"The loss of Zarathustra is meant to compel the disciples to find themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS5","text":"After self-becoming has been accomplished, a renewed friendship based on shared hope becomes possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AS6","text":"This hope is temporally and ontologically closed in the transition of the human being to the Overman and in the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","text":"A pupil may not remain a pupil permanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","text":"Knowledge requires the capacity for resistance against one's own teacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","text":"Veneration can transform the venerated one into a crushing statue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","text":"Faith in the teacher replaces the prior search for one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","text":"Finding oneself requires the loss and denial of the teacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A6","text":"A later friendship presupposes the overcoming of the teacher-pupil relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","text":"The human being stands between animal and Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","text":"The going-under of the human being can be affirmed as a transition to a new morning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A9","text":"The great noon denotes the midpoint of the human transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:A10","text":"The life of the Overman takes the place of the dead gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX1","text":"The disciples are not to remain in a condition of permanent discipleship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX2","text":"Knowledge is not identical with mere following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX3","text":"Zarathustra may not become the uncontested object of faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX4","text":"Veneration may not pass over into idolatry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX5","text":"The authority that has been found may not take the place of the search for oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX6","text":"The present relationship may not count as final friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX7","text":"The human being may not be treated as a completed or final form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:NX8","text":"The old gods no longer count as living bearers of the ultimate will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D1","text":"The injunction to depart makes separation into a pedagogical means.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D2","text":"Resistance against Zarathustra is a condition of genuine knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D3","text":"Veneration of the teacher can prevent self-becoming precisely by absolutizing the teacher.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","CH_97E9_3C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D4","text":"Losing Zarathustra generates the possibility of finding one's own identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D5","text":"The teacher's later return is not continuation, but resumption under altered eyes and altered love.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D6","text":"Human going-under becomes legible as passage and not as mere annihilation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_3C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:D7","text":"The great noon joins self-overcoming, knowledge, and hope for the future in a moment of transition.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","text":"The highest fidelity to the teacher consists in abolishing dependence on him.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2","text":"Authority is legitimized not through continuance, but through its controlled self-destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A3","CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD3","text":"The community of disciples arises only after the dissolution of their original community of faith.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A4","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","text":"The entire movement organizes time as a transition from an overcome form to a form still outstanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A9","CH_97E9_3C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SD5","text":"Liberation from religious authority is newly bound through a new teleological figure, the Overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A8","CH_97E9_3C_2:A10","CH_97E9_3C_2:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","text":"Self-becoming is impossible so long as the alien word is adopted as one's own ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX2","text":"A teaching that produces only followers has failed in its own aim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX3","text":"No present form may arrest the open transition of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX4","text":"Knowledge may not be converted into a stable relation of possession toward an authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX5","text":"The death of the old gods does not suffice as an endpoint; mere negation of the old is also insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a community whose unity rests on unmediated veneration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a closed present in which the human being would already have attained his highest form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an authority that operates through permanent presence and not through its overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an ultimate meaning that would be available independently of transition, going-under, and a future form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS1","text":"Teacher authority → pupil attachment → prevention of the search for oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS2","text":"Self-abolition of teacher authority → departure, resistance, and denial → dissolution of dependence on faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS3","text":"Dissolution of dependence on faith → finding oneself → possibility of a non-hierarchical friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS4","text":"Finding oneself → shared hope → human being as transition between animal and Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS5","text":"Transition → great noon → affirmation of going-under as crossing-over → life of the Overman in place of the dead gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1","text":"Veneration of the teacher → dependence → demanded separation → resistance and denial → finding oneself → renewed friendship → shared transition to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:AF2","text":"Dead gods → new ultimate will → great noon → self-blessing of the one going under → new morning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME1","text":"Teacher and pupil are mapped no longer as permanent roles, but as transitional stages to be traversed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME2","text":"Veneration is reclassified from a sign of attachment into a risk of objectification and self-destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME3","text":"Denial appears not as the opposite of teaching, but as its necessary completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME4","text":"Going-under is shifted from the category of the end into the category of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ME5","text":"The opposition between religious negation and new hope is reorganized through the figure of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra calls upon his disciples to leave him, turn against him, and deny him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The teacher-pupil relationship produces dependence when it is not transformed into independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Authority asserts itself by preventing its own veneration and enabling its followers to oppose it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The human being is an intermediate form; his going-under opens a future transition to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from attachment to the teacher to finding oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to derive the great noon as a temporal and ontological figure of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the renewed friendship is to endure institutionally or practically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT4","text":"The abolition of teacher authority as a condition of its continued efficacy is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the abolition of faith and the shared ultimate will to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the demanded denial of Zarathustra and his announced return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the Overman is treated as an open goal-form and not as an authority already available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part One"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Von der schenkenden Tugend","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Erster Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part One","reading_heading_titles":["Part One","On the Gift-Giving Virtue","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 34","title":"On the Gift-Giving Virtue · 3","context":"Part One","original_context":"Erster Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der schenkenden Tugend · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET","layer":"CH","title":"Part Two","order":35,"parents":["RAW_97E9_ZWET"],"revision":"CH_97E9_ZWET@R001","sha256":"703e0f7151db6c91de53155a5af14cba7dd868a3b9169be0c981c9ddc26596ab","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS1","text":"Die angesprochene Gemeinschaft wird als eine Instanz gesetzt, deren vollständige Verleugnung des Sprechers den Umschlagpunkt der Beziehung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS2","text":"Die Rückkehr des Sprechers wird nicht als gegenwärtige, sondern als nachgeordnete Möglichkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS3","text":"Die Rückkehr erzeugt eine veränderte Wahrnehmungsweise und eine veränderte Form der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS4","text":"Erst nach dieser Veränderung werden die Verlorenen erneut gesucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS5","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von Verleugnung über zeitliche Unterbrechung und relationale Transformation zu einer erneuerten Suche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A1","text":"Der Sprecher richtet sich an eine kollektive Gemeinschaft von „Brüdern“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","text":"Die Gemeinschaft kann den Sprecher vollständig verleugnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","text":"Die vollständige Verleugnung bildet die Bedingung seiner späteren Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","text":"Die spätere Rückkehr erfolgt mit „andern Augen“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","text":"Die spätere Liebe zu den Angesprochenen nimmt eine andere Gestalt an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","text":"Die Angesprochenen erscheinen nach der Verleugnung als „Verlorene“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A7","text":"Die Verlorenen bleiben trotz ihres Verluststatus Gegenstand einer erneuten Suche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A8","text":"Die Beziehung wird durch eine Abfolge von Verleugnung, Rückkehr, Veränderung und Suche organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX1","text":"Die Rückkehr erfolgt nicht vor der vollständigen Verleugnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX2","text":"Die spätere Wahrnehmung ist nicht mit der früheren Wahrnehmung identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX3","text":"Die spätere Liebe ist nicht die Fortsetzung derselben Liebesform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX4","text":"Die Angesprochenen sind nicht unmittelbar verfügbar, sondern als Verlorene bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX5","text":"Die Beziehung wird nicht durch ungebrochene Anerkennung aufrechterhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX6","text":"Die Suche setzt nicht die gegenwärtige Anwesenheit der Gesuchten voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D1","text":"Die Verleugnung fungiert nicht als endgültiger Abbruch, sondern als notwendige Schwelle einer späteren Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","CH_97E9_ZWET:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D2","text":"Die Rückkehr bezeichnet eine relationale Neuaufnahme unter veränderten Wahrnehmungsbedingungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D3","text":"Der Verlust erzeugt die Kategorie, unter der die Gemeinschaft erneut gesucht werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D4","text":"Die zeitliche Distanz zwischen Verleugnung und Rückkehr ist konstitutiv für die Veränderung der Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D5","text":"„Wiederkehren“ bezeichnet keine einfache Wiederholung des Früheren, sondern eine Rückkehr unter qualitativ veränderten Bedingungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD1","text":"Die Beziehung wird durch ihre Unterbrechung hindurch erneuert; Verleugnung und spätere Suche bilden daher keine Gegensätze, sondern aufeinander bezogene Phasen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD2","text":"Die Identität des Sprechers bleibt über die Rückkehr hinweg erhalten, während Wahrnehmung und Liebe als veränderliche Beziehungsformen neu konfiguriert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3","text":"Die vollständige Verleugnung wird zugleich als äußerster Verlust und als Bedingung einer nicht-identischen Wiedergewinnung funktionalisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4","text":"Die erneuerte Beziehung gründet nicht auf der Wiederherstellung des früheren Zustands, sondern auf einer durch Verlust erzeugten Verschiebung des Sehens und Liebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX1","text":"Eine unmittelbare Kontinuität zwischen gegenwärtiger Anerkennung und späterer Rückkehr wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX2","text":"Eine unveränderte Identität der Beziehung wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX3","text":"Ein Verlust ohne verbleibende Möglichkeit der Suche wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX4","text":"Eine Liebe, deren Form bereits abschließend bestimmt ist, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX5","text":"Eine Rückkehr, die keine vorherige Desintegration der Gemeinschaft voraussetzt, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer tragfähigen Gegenwart gemeinsamer Anerkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, dass die Beziehung zugleich unverändert fortbesteht und sich dennoch erneuert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Rückkehr zur früheren Gemeinschaft; verfügbar bleibt nur eine Rückkehr zu den als verloren neu bestimmten Anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX4","text":"Die ursprüngliche Liebes- und Wahrnehmungsordnung wird als nicht wiederholbar behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX5","text":"Der Text setzt eine Gemeinschaft voraus, die erst durch ihre Abwesenheit als wieder suchbarer Gegenstand konstituiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS1","text":"Gemeinschaftliche Beziehung → vollständige Verleugnung des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS2","text":"Vollständige Verleugnung → zeitliche Unterbrechung und Status des Verlorenseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS3","text":"Unterbrechung → Rückkehr des Sprechers unter veränderten Wahrnehmungsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS4","text":"Veränderte Wahrnehmung → veränderte Liebesform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS5","text":"Veränderte Liebesform plus Verluststatus → erneute Suche der Verlorenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS6","text":"Erneute Suche → Beziehung als nicht-identische Wiederaufnahme statt als Wiederherstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AF1","text":"Gegenwärtige Gemeinschaft → vollständige Verleugnung → Verlust und Unterbrechung → Rückkehr → anderes Sehen und Lieben → erneute Suche der Verlorenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME1","text":"Verleugnung wird von einem Endpunkt zu einer relationalen Übergangsfunktion umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2","text":"Rückkehr wird von Wiederholung zu transformierter Wiederaufnahme umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME3","text":"Die Gemeinschaft wird von unmittelbar Anwesenden zu verlorenen, aber erneut suchbaren Gegenständen reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME4","text":"Wahrnehmung und Liebe werden als veränderbare Bedingungen der Beziehung sichtbar, nicht als stabile Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME5","text":"Verlust wird zugleich als Entzug und als Voraussetzung neuer Beziehung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine Sprecherinstanz kündigt nach vollständiger Verleugnung ihre Rückkehr und eine erneute Suche an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Beziehung wird als sequenzielle Formation aus Verleugnung, Unterbrechung, Transformation und Suche organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die spätere Beziehung wird der gegenwärtigen Anerkennung entzogen und an einen durch Verlust erzeugten Perspektivwechsel gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Identität bleibt über die Zeit hinweg bestehen, während relationale Formen und die Bestimmung der Anderen temporal mutieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Abfolge von Verleugnung, Rückkehr, Veränderung und Suche zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Verleugnung tatsächlich eintritt oder als zukünftige Bedingung angekündigt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls offen bleibt, ob die veränderte Liebe eine Intensivierung, eine Distanzierung oder eine qualitative Umformung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Rückkehr ausdrücklich nicht als Wiederholung, sondern als Transformation angelegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste operative Achse ist die Konversion von Verleugnung in die Bedingung späterer Suche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der rhetorischen Spannung zwischen bleibender Anrede und veränderter Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegungslogik bleibt erhalten, sofern „wiederkehren“ als nicht-identische Rückkehr gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195603043757Z_46d2f08b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Second Part","source_sha256":"703e0f7151db6c91de53155a5af14cba7dd868a3b9169be0c981c9ddc26596ab","sha256":"77e5fd0fe9d65e725967115bf3213ea6f01f4d2fbe99c43f0120902ae1cf81ad","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:56:03.045586+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS1","text":"The addressed community is posited as an instance whose complete denial of the speaker constitutes the turning point of the relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS2","text":"The speaker's return is determined not as present, but as a subsequent possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS3","text":"The return produces an altered mode of perception and an altered form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS4","text":"Only after this transformation are the lost ones sought again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AS5","text":"The argument moves from denial, through temporal interruption and relational transformation, to a renewed search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A1","text":"The speaker addresses a collective community of “brothers.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","text":"The community can completely deny the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","text":"Complete denial constitutes the condition of his later return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","text":"The later return takes place with “other eyes.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","text":"The later love for those addressed assumes another form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","text":"Those addressed appear after the denial as “lost ones.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A7","text":"Despite their status as lost, the lost ones remain the object of a renewed search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:A8","text":"The relationship is organized through a sequence of denial, return, transformation, and search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX1","text":"The return does not occur before the complete denial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX2","text":"The later perception is not identical with the earlier perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX3","text":"The later love is not the continuation of the same form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX4","text":"Those addressed are not immediately available, but are determined as lost ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX5","text":"The relationship is not sustained through uninterrupted recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:NX6","text":"The search does not presuppose the present presence of those sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D1","text":"Denial functions not as a final break, but as the necessary threshold of a later relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","CH_97E9_ZWET:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D2","text":"The return designates a relational resumption under altered conditions of perception.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D3","text":"Loss produces the category under which the community can be sought again.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D4","text":"The temporal distance between denial and return is constitutive of the transformation of the relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:D5","text":"“Returning” designates not a simple repetition of what was earlier, but a return under qualitatively altered conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD1","text":"The relationship is renewed through its interruption; denial and later search therefore constitute not opposites, but mutually related phases.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD2","text":"The identity of the speaker remains preserved across the return, while perception and love are reconfigured as mutable relational forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3","text":"Complete denial is functionalized simultaneously as the utmost loss and as the condition of a non-identical recovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A2","CH_97E9_ZWET:A3","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4","text":"The renewed relationship is grounded not in the restoration of the earlier state, but in a loss-produced displacement of seeing and loving.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX1","text":"An immediate continuity between present recognition and later return is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX2","text":"An unchanged identity of the relationship is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX3","text":"A loss without any remaining possibility of search is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX4","text":"A love whose form is already conclusively determined is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:DNX5","text":"A return that does not presuppose a prior disintegration of the community is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a viable present of shared recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility that the relationship both continues unchanged and nevertheless renews itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a return to the earlier community; available remains only a return to the Others newly determined as lost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX4","text":"The original order of love and perception is treated as non-repeatable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX5","text":"The text presupposes a community that is constituted as an object searchable again only through its absence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS1","text":"Communal relationship → complete denial of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS2","text":"Complete denial → temporal interruption and status of being lost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS3","text":"Interruption → return of the speaker under altered conditions of perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS4","text":"Altered perception → altered form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS5","text":"Altered form of love plus status of loss → renewed search for the lost ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS6","text":"Renewed search → relationship as non-identical resumption rather than restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:AF1","text":"Present community → complete denial → loss and interruption → return → different seeing and loving → renewed search for the lost ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME1","text":"Denial is reclassified from an endpoint into a relational transition function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2","text":"Return is remapped from repetition to transformed resumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME3","text":"The community is reorganized from immediately present persons into lost, yet again searchable, objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME4","text":"Perception and love become visible as alterable conditions of the relationship, not as stable properties.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ME5","text":"Loss becomes legible simultaneously as deprivation and as the precondition of a new relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT1","text":"Surface: A speaking instance announces, after complete denial, its return and a renewed search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT2","text":"Structural: The relationship is organized as a sequential formation of denial, interruption, transformation, and search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The later relationship is withdrawn from present recognition and bound to a shift in perspective produced by loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Identity persists across time, while relational forms and the determination of the Others mutate temporally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the sequence of denial, return, transformation, and search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the denial actually occurs or is announced as a future condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains open whether the altered love designates an intensification, a distancing, or a qualitative reshaping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where return is explicitly conceived not as repetition, but as transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT5","text":"The strongest operative axis is the conversion of denial into the condition of later search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction hinges on the rhetorical tension between continuing address and altered relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT7","text":"The actual logic of movement remains preserved provided that “returning” is read as a non-identical return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ZWET:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_ZWET@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_ZWET:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 35","title":"Part Two","context":"Chapter 35","original_title":"Zweiter Theil","original_context":"Chapter 35"},"original_title":"Zweiter Theil","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD","layer":"CH","title":"The Child with the Mirror","order":36,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DKMD"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DKMD@R001","sha256":"d0b35f2ec6dbbdc1e6b26a4e0c219bdf602cd9a6250885239c4a3360de4ae8b9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS1","text":"Nach der Aussaat verwandelt der Rückzug die verstreute Gabe in angesammelte Weisheit, deren Fülle schmerzhaft wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS2","text":"Der Spiegeltraum zeigt nicht Zarathustras eigenes Gesicht, sondern ein verzerrtes teuflisches Bild, wodurch die Krise als Gefahr für das öffentliche Bild der Lehre bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS3","text":"Die feindliche Entstellung beschämt die Geliebten über ihre empfangenen Gaben und erzeugt den Verlust der Freunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS4","text":"Die Diagnose verwandelt den Rückzug in die Aufgabe, die Verlorenen zu suchen und zu Freunden wie Feinden zurückzukehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS5","text":"Überströmende Liebe und erschöpfte Sprache erzwingen neue Rede, Abstieg und Zirkulation vom einsiedlerischen See zum Meer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS6","text":"Die Rückkehr bleibt antagonistisch: Feinde werden zugleich Adressaten und Ziele, während die wilde Weisheit nach empfänglichem Grund in der Liebe der Freunde sucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","text":"Der Rückzug folgt auf die Aussaat und dient der Reifung des Ausgesäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","text":"Die Einsamkeit lässt die Weisheit wachsen, verwandelt ihre Fülle jedoch in Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","text":"Das Spiegelbild kann vom eigenen Selbst abweichen und eine fremde Verzerrung sichtbar machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","text":"Eine Lehre besitzt ein öffentlich zirkulierendes Bild, das durch Feinde entstellt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A5","text":"Die Entstellung der Lehre beschämt ihre Empfänger und kann den Verlust der Freunde hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A6","text":"Die erkannte Gefährdung der Lehre erzeugt die Notwendigkeit, die verlorenen Freunde aufzusuchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","text":"Das Glück verwandelt die Rückkehr in seherische, singende und schenkende Bewegung statt in Flucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","text":"Die Liebe ist eine überströmende Kraft, die nach Rede, Gabe und Abstieg in die Täler verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A9","text":"Die alten Sprachformen und Wege reichen für die erneuerte Bewegung des Geistes nicht mehr aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","text":"Freunde und Feinde können zugleich zum gemeinsamen Kreis der Anrede und der Seligkeit gehören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","text":"Das gegen die Feinde gerichtete Werkzeug dient zugleich als Mittel des Aufstiegs und der Entladung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","text":"Aufgestaute Spannung verlangt eine gewaltsame Entladung, durch die Erleichterung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","text":"Die Weisheit bleibt wild und erzeugt aus ihrer Einsamkeit ein jüngstes, neues Hervorgebrachtes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A14","text":"Das Hervorgebrachte sucht einen sanften, empfänglichen Grund in der Liebe der Freunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1","text":"Das öffentliche Bild der Lehre ist nicht mit ihrem eigenen Wahrheitsgehalt identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX2","text":"Entstellung darf Unkraut nicht als Weizen legitimieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX3","text":"Die Lehre wird nicht durch bloße Bewahrung in der Einsamkeit gerettet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX4","text":"Die Rückkehr entspringt nicht der Angst, sondern einer verwandelten Glücksbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX5","text":"Die selbstgenügsame Einsamkeit bildet keinen endgültigen Zielzustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX6","text":"Die alten Zungen und abgelaufenen Sohlen können die neue Bewegung nicht tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX7","text":"Feindschaft schließt nicht aus dem Kreis der Anrede und der Seligkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX8","text":"Liebe ist keine konfliktfreie oder beruhigte Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX9","text":"Wilde Weisheit ist keine bereits domestizierte und gesicherte Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D1","text":"Die Einsamkeit erzeugt zugleich die notwendige Reifung der Weisheit und den Überschuss, der ihre Rückkehr erzwingt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D2","text":"Der Spiegeltraum diagnostiziert keine innere Selbstverwandlung, sondern eine Störung der öffentlichen Erscheinung der Lehre.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D3","text":"Die feindliche Bildentstellung wird zur sozialen Ursache der Scham der Geliebten und des Verlusts der Freunde.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D4","text":"Die Bedrohung der Lehre wird nur durch erneute soziale Zirkulation beantwortet, nicht durch verlängerten Rückzug.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A5","CH_97E9_DKMD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D5","text":"Das Glück wird als erneute Fähigkeit zu reden, zu schenken und zu lieben wirksam.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D6","text":"Der Überschuss der Liebe erzeugt eine neue Sprache, weil die alten sprachlichen Formen die Bewegung nicht mehr vermitteln.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D7","text":"Der Feind wird zugleich als Gegenstand der Abwehr und als Bedingung der eigenen Entladung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D8","text":"Die gewaltsame Entladung führt nicht zum Ende der Weisheit, sondern zu ihrer erneuten Zeugung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","CH_97E9_DKMD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D9","text":"Die neue Weisheit bleibt auf eine noch nicht gesicherte Aufnahme durch die Freunde angewiesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1","text":"Die Identität der Lehre wird nicht allein durch ihre Herkunft, sondern durch den Kampf um ihr öffentliches Bild und ihre soziale Aufnahme bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2","text":"Die Einsamkeit ist zugleich Produktionsraum der Weisheit und Ursache ihrer sozialen Gefährdung; die Rückkehr fungiert als notwendige Zirkulationskorrektur.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","CH_97E9_DKMD:A6","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3","text":"Liebe wird durch den Einschluss des Feindes nicht entpolitisiert, sondern als antagonistische Zirkulation organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4","text":"Neue Rede entsteht nicht aus sprachlicher Erfindung allein, sondern aus dem Druck, angesammelte Weisheit wieder in eine gemeinsame Welt zu überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD5","text":"Die Bewegung, durch die Zarathustra die Freunde zurückzugewinnen versucht, kann sie durch ihre Wildheit zugleich erschrecken und erneut vertreiben.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6","text":"Die Einbeziehung der Feinde hebt den Gegensatz nicht auf, sondern macht ihn zum Bestandteil der Seligkeit und der Rede.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD7","text":"Die Weisheit erfüllt sich nicht als abgeschlossene Lehre, sondern als erzeugtes Gebilde, das eine noch offene soziale Aufnahme sucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt die Unwahrheit einer transparenten Übertragung voraus, in der das sichtbare Bild die Herkunft und den Sinn der Lehre unverändert bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX2","text":"Es setzt die Unzulänglichkeit des privaten Besitzes von Weisheit voraus: Der einsiedlerische See kann nicht dauerhaft selbstgenügsam bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine stabile Trennung zwischen großzügiger Liebe und aggressiver Gewalt aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Freund-Feind-Unterscheidung als sichere soziale Ordnung, weil Freunde fliehen und Feinde zum Kreis der Seligkeit gehören können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Reife der Weisheit aus, da ihr jüngstes Hervorgebrachtes erst noch einen Boden finden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass eine Rückkehr allein durch friedliche Selbstoffenbarung gelingen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1","text":"Das System ist um die Abwesenheit unangefochtener Wiedererkennung organisiert: Die Lehre besitzt kein gesichertes, unverzerrtes Spiegelbild.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX2","text":"Eine reine Gemeinschaft der Freunde ist strukturell nicht verfügbar, weil jede Gemeinschaft durch Feindschaft und mögliche Flucht durchzogen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Schließung der Gabe und der Bedeutung ist unmöglich; jede Gabe verlangt neue Rede und erneute Aufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX4","text":"Die soziale Reparatur kann nicht aus der Innerlichkeit vollzogen werden, sondern verlangt den riskanten Wiedereintritt in eine bereits entstellte Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX5","text":"Der gesuchte sanfte Grund ist am Ende nicht erreicht, sondern bleibt die versperrte Möglichkeit, auf die sich die neue Weisheit zubewegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS1","text":"Aussaat → Rückzug → zeitliche Akkumulation → schmerzhafter Überschuss der Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS2","text":"Spiegelkonfrontation → Differenz zwischen Selbst und Bild → Lokalisierung der Gefahr in der öffentlichen Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS3","text":"Feindliche Entstellung → Scham der Empfänger → Verlust der Freunde → Imperativ der Suche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS4","text":"Glückliche Verwandlung → Rückkehr zu Freunden und Feinden → Wiederaufnahme von Rede, Gabe und Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS5","text":"Liebesüberschuss + Erschöpfung der alten Sprache → neue Rede → Abstieg vom Berg → Zirkulation zum Meer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS6","text":"Gemeinsame Anrede von Freunden und Feinden → Erhaltung des Gegensatzes → Speer, Sturm und Hagel als Entladungsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS7","text":"Entladung → erneute Zeugung der wilden Weisheit → Suche nach empfänglichem Grund in der Freundesliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AF1","text":"Verfälschtes Bild der Lehre → Scham der Geliebten und Verlust der Freunde → Spiegeldiagnose → Umkehr des Rückzugs → neue, überströmende Rede → antagonistische Einbeziehung der Feinde → Suche nach empfänglicher Freundschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2","text":"Einsamkeit erzeugt Weisheitsüberschuss → Überschuss erzeugt Schmerz und Ungeduld → Schmerz wird Glück und Sturm → Sturm erzeugt Rede und Entladung → Rede sucht soziale Aufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME1","text":"Die Gefahrenzone verschiebt sich vom inneren Zustand Zarathustras auf die öffentliche Bildgestalt und soziale Rezeption der Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME2","text":"Einsamkeit wird nicht mehr als Ziel, sondern als Reservoir und Druckkammer einer späteren Zirkulation kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME3","text":"Der Feind wird von einem bloßen äußeren Hindernis zu Adressat, Katalysator und Bestandteil der eigenen Seligkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME4","text":"Liebe wird von einem inneren Gefühl zu einer gerichteten Strom-, Sprach- und Entladungsbewegung reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME5","text":"Weisheit wird von einer fertigen Lehre zu einem jüngsten Hervorgebrachten transformiert, das auf soziale Empfänglichkeit angewiesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME6","text":"Die Rückkehr wird nicht als Versöhnung ohne Rest, sondern als gleichzeitige Wiederannäherung und Fortsetzung des Gegensatzes sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ein Kind mit Spiegel, ein verzerrtes Gesicht, die Rückkehr aus der Höhle und der erneute Antritt der Rede strukturieren die unmittelbare Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Lehre wird durch öffentliche Bilder, feindliche Aneignung, Scham der Empfänger und instabile Freundschaft vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Auf Verfälschung wird nicht mit weiterer Absonderung, sondern mit neuer Sprache, gesteigerter Zirkulation und einer gegen Feinde gerichteten Anrede reagiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Weisheit, Liebe und Rede erscheinen als wachsende, strömende und gebärende Prozesse ohne endgültige soziale Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Aussaat und Rückzug über Spiegeldiagnose und Freundverlust bis zur erneuten Rede zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben der konkrete Inhalt der Lehre sowie die Identität und historische Stellung von Feinden, Freunden und Geliebten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls offen bleibt, ob das teuflische Bild ausschließlich feindliche Entstellung oder zugleich eine reale Mutation der Lehre anzeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT4","text":"Die innere Kohärenz hängt davon ab, Spiegel, Strom, Sturm und Schwangerschaft als operative Transformationen und nicht als getrennte Weltmodelle zu lesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen öffentlicher Verfälschung, sozialem Verlust und der Notwendigkeit erneuter Zirkulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleibt die Spannung, dass Liebe durch Speer, Bosheit und Sturm wirkt und ihre Einbeziehung der Feinde den Gegensatz nicht beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT7","text":"Ungelöst bleibt ferner, dass dieselbe wilde Rede, die Freunde zurückrufen soll, sie erschrecken und erneut vertreiben kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT8","text":"Das Meer, die glückseligen Inseln und der sanfte Grund markieren einen angestrebten, aber nicht erreichten Endpunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Rückkehr als riskante soziale Neuverknüpfung und nicht als abgeschlossene Versöhnung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193517322270Z_060569bf","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Child with the Mirror","source_sha256":"d0b35f2ec6dbbdc1e6b26a4e0c219bdf602cd9a6250885239c4a3360de4ae8b9","sha256":"cb63c230656e063f36d9b7de8ef2271b7ea128cd77f90f2e9bdc427add634a64","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:35:17.324508+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS1","text":"After the sowing, withdrawal transforms the scattered gift into accumulated wisdom, whose fullness becomes painful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS2","text":"The mirror dream shows not Zarathustra's own face, but a distorted devilish image, whereby the crisis is determined as a danger to the public image of the teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS3","text":"The hostile distortion shames the beloved over their gifts received and produces the loss of friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS4","text":"The diagnosis transforms withdrawal into the task of seeking the lost and returning to friends as well as enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS5","text":"Overflowing love and exhausted language compel new speech, descent, and circulation from the hermit's lake to the sea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AS6","text":"The return remains antagonistic: enemies become both addressees and targets, while wild wisdom seeks receptive ground in the love of friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","text":"Withdrawal follows upon sowing and serves the maturation of what has been sown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","text":"Solitude lets wisdom grow, but transforms its fullness into pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","text":"The mirror image can diverge from one's own self and render a foreign distortion visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","text":"A teaching possesses a publicly circulating image that can be distorted by enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A5","text":"The distortion of the teaching shames its recipients and can bring about the loss of friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A6","text":"The recognized endangerment of the teaching produces the necessity of seeking out the lost friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","text":"Happiness transforms the return into a prophetic, singing, and gift-giving movement rather than into flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","text":"Love is an overflowing force that demands speech, gift, and descent into the valleys.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A9","text":"The old forms of language and paths no longer suffice for the renewed movement of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","text":"Friends and enemies can belong simultaneously to the shared circle of address and blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","text":"The weapon directed against enemies serves simultaneously as a means of ascent and discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","text":"Pent-up tension demands a violent discharge through which relief arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","text":"Wisdom remains wild and produces from its solitude a most recent, new product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:A14","text":"What is produced seeks a gentle, receptive ground in the love of friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1","text":"The public image of the teaching is not identical with its own content of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX2","text":"Distortion must not legitimize weeds as wheat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX3","text":"The teaching is not saved through mere preservation in solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX4","text":"The return does not spring from fear, but from a transformed movement of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX5","text":"Self-sufficient solitude does not constitute a final state of arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX6","text":"The old tongues and worn-out soles cannot bear the new movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX7","text":"Enmity does not exclude one from the circle of address and blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX8","text":"Love is not a conflict-free or pacified force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:NX9","text":"Wild wisdom is not wisdom already domesticated and secured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D1","text":"Solitude produces both the necessary maturation of wisdom and the excess that compels its return.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D2","text":"The mirror dream diagnoses not an inner self-transformation, but a disturbance of the public appearance of the teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D3","text":"The hostile distortion of the image becomes the social cause of the shame of the beloved and of the loss of friends.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D4","text":"The threat to the teaching is answered only through renewed social circulation, not through prolonged withdrawal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A5","CH_97E9_DKMD:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D5","text":"Happiness becomes effective as a renewed capacity to speak, to give, and to love.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D6","text":"The excess of love produces a new language because the old linguistic forms no longer convey the movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D7","text":"The enemy is determined simultaneously as an object of defense and as a condition of one's own discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D8","text":"The violent discharge leads not to the end of wisdom, but to its renewed generation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","CH_97E9_DKMD:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:D9","text":"The new wisdom remains dependent upon a reception by friends that is not yet secured.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1","text":"The identity of the teaching is determined not solely by its origin, but by the struggle over its public image and its social reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2","text":"Solitude is simultaneously the productive space of wisdom and the cause of its social endangerment; the return functions as a necessary correction of circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","CH_97E9_DKMD:A6","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3","text":"Love is not depoliticized by the inclusion of the enemy, but organized as antagonistic circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4","text":"New speech arises not from linguistic invention alone, but from the pressure to transfer accumulated wisdom once again into a shared world.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A2","CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD5","text":"The movement through which Zarathustra attempts to regain the friends can simultaneously frighten them and drive them away again through its wildness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:A9","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6","text":"The inclusion of enemies does not abolish the opposition, but makes it a component of blessedness and speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:A11","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SD7","text":"Wisdom is fulfilled not as a completed teaching, but as a generated formation seeking a social reception that remains open.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A13","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes the untruth of a transparent transmission in which the visible image preserves the origin and meaning of the teaching unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX2","text":"It presupposes the inadequacy of the private possession of wisdom: the hermit's lake cannot remain self-sufficient permanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX3","text":"It excludes a stable separation between generous love and aggressive violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies the friend-enemy distinction as a secure social order, because friends can flee and enemies can belong to the circle of blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX5","text":"It excludes a final maturity of wisdom, since its most recent product must still find a ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that a return could succeed through peaceful self-revelation alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1","text":"The system is organized around the absence of uncontested recognition: the teaching possesses no secured, undistorted mirror image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX2","text":"A pure community of friends is structurally unavailable, because every community remains traversed by enmity and possible flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX3","text":"A final closure of the gift and of meaning is impossible; every gift demands new speech and renewed reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX4","text":"Social repair cannot be accomplished from inwardness, but demands the risky re-entry into an already distorted world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX5","text":"The sought gentle ground is ultimately not attained, but remains the blocked possibility toward which the new wisdom moves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS1","text":"Sowing → withdrawal → temporal accumulation → painful excess of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS2","text":"Mirror confrontation → difference between self and image → localization of danger in the public teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS3","text":"Hostile distortion → shame of recipients → loss of friends → imperative of seeking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS4","text":"Happy transformation → return to friends and enemies → resumption of speech, gift, and love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS5","text":"Excess of love + exhaustion of old language → new speech → descent from the mountain → circulation toward the sea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS6","text":"Shared address of friends and enemies → preservation of opposition → spear, storm, and hail as forms of discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS7","text":"Discharge → renewed generation of wild wisdom → search for receptive ground in the love of friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AF1","text":"Falsified image of the teaching → shame of the beloved and loss of friends → mirror diagnosis → reversal of withdrawal → new, overflowing speech → antagonistic inclusion of enemies → search for receptive friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2","text":"Solitude produces excess of wisdom → excess produces pain and impatience → pain becomes happiness and storm → storm produces speech and discharge → speech seeks social reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME1","text":"The danger zone shifts from Zarathustra's inner state to the public image-form and social reception of the teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME2","text":"Solitude is no longer mapped as an end, but as a reservoir and pressure chamber of a later circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME3","text":"The enemy is reclassified from a mere external obstacle into addressee, catalyst, and component of one's own blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME4","text":"Love is reorganized from an inner feeling into a directed movement of current, language, and discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME5","text":"Wisdom is transformed from a finished teaching into a most recent product that depends on social receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ME6","text":"The return becomes visible not as reconciliation without remainder, but as simultaneous renewed approach and continuation of opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — A child with a mirror, a distorted face, the return from the cave, and the renewed commencement of speech structure the immediate action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The teaching is mediated through public images, hostile appropriation, the shame of recipients, and unstable friendship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Falsification is answered not with further isolation, but with new language, intensified circulation, and an address directed against enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Wisdom, love, and speech appear as growing, flowing, and birthing processes without a final social form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from sowing and withdrawal through mirror diagnosis and loss of friends to renewed speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete content of the teaching as well as the identity and historical position of enemies, friends, and beloved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT3","text":"Likewise left open is whether the devilish image indicates exclusively hostile distortion or also a real mutation of the teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT4","text":"The inner coherence depends on reading mirror, current, storm, and pregnancy as operative transformations and not as separate world-models.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection consists between public falsification, social loss, and the necessity of renewed circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT6","text":"Unresolved remains the tension that love operates through spear, malice, and storm, and that its inclusion of enemies does not eliminate the opposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT7","text":"Also unresolved remains that the same wild speech that is meant to call friends back can frighten them and drive them away again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT8","text":"The sea, the blissful islands, and the gentle ground mark an aspired-to but unattained endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the return is understood as a risky social re-linkage and not as completed reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DKMD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DKMD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DKMD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 36","title":"The Child with the Mirror","context":"Chapter 36","original_title":"Das Kind mit dem Spiegel","original_context":"Chapter 36"},"original_title":"Das Kind mit dem Spiegel","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC","layer":"CH","title":"Upon the Blessed Isles","order":37,"parents":["RAW_97E9_ADGC"],"revision":"CH_97E9_ADGC@R001","sha256":"7fa9940c7093361df27c6174753e08dfdd23c32ee98bb59ad777c78069901c8c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS1","text":"Überfluss und Reife eröffnen eine Perspektive, in der Lehren aufgenommen und in schöpferische Tätigkeit überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS2","text":"Die göttliche Erklärung wird als bloße Mutmaßung neu bestimmt und verliert ihren Anspruch auf transzendente Reichweite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS3","text":"An die Stelle des Gottes tritt der Übermensch als menschlich hervorzubringender Horizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS4","text":"Wahrheit verlangt, alles Wirkliche in menschlich Denkbares, Sichtbares und Fühlbares zu verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS5","text":"Die Welt wird nicht als fertige Gegebenheit vorausgesetzt, sondern durch Vernunft, Bild, Wille und Liebe erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS6","text":"Diese Selbst- und Welterzeugung stiftet die Hoffnung, ohne die das Leben untragbar und dem Unbegreiflichen ausgeliefert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS7","text":"Die Möglichkeit von Göttern wird durch den unerträglichen Status des Nicht-Gottseins des Sprechers reductiv ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A1","text":"Überfluss ermöglicht eine schöpferische Sicht auf das Ferne und Noch-nicht-Gegebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","text":"Gott ist eine Mutmaßung und keine gesicherte Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","text":"Mutmaßungen dürfen nicht über den Bereich des schöpferischen Willens hinausreichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A4","text":"Der Mensch kann keinen Gott schaffen und keinen Gott adäquat denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","text":"Der Mensch kann sich zu einem Vorfahren des Übermenschen umschaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","text":"Der Übermensch ist ein menschlich hervorzubringendes Ziel anstelle eines gegebenen Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","text":"Wille zur Wahrheit bedeutet, alles in menschlich Denkbares, Sichtbares und Fühlbares zu verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","text":"Die als Welt bezeichnete Wirklichkeit soll durch Vernunft, Bild, Wille und Liebe geschaffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A9","text":"Das Leben bedarf der Hoffnung, nicht in das Unbegreifliche oder Unvernünftige eingeboren zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A10","text":"Die Existenz von Göttern wäre für ein Subjekt unerträglich, das nicht selbst Gott sein könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX1","text":"Gott ist keine Erkenntnis, sondern eine Mutmaßung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX2","text":"Mutmaßung darf nicht über den schöpferischen Willen hinausreichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX3","text":"Die Schaffung eines Gottes ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX4","text":"Ein Gott entzieht sich der adäquaten menschlichen Denkbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX5","text":"Die Welt ist keine unabhängig fertige Gegebenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX6","text":"Das Leben darf nicht im Unbegreiflichen oder Unvernünftigen gründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX7","text":"Die Existenz von Göttern ist mit der Selbstposition des Sprechers unvereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D1","text":"Die göttliche Deutung wird durch eine schöpferisch begrenzte menschliche Deutung ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","CH_97E9_ADGC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D2","text":"Der Übermensch fungiert als erreichbare genealogische Aufgabe, nicht als übernatürliche Gegebenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D3","text":"Wahrheit wird zu einer Operation der Vermenschlichung des Wirklichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D4","text":"Erkenntnis wird in Welterzeugung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D5","text":"Die menschliche Schöpfung von Welt erhält ihre Rechtfertigung durch die Funktion der Hoffnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","CH_97E9_ADGC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D6","text":"Die Negation Gottes wird nicht aus einer unabhängigen Widerlegung, sondern aus der Unvereinbarkeit göttlicher Existenz mit der Sprecherposition erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D7","text":"Das menschliche Schaffen wird zum Maßstab zulässiger metaphysischer Annahmen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt transzendente Ontologie durch eine anthropozentrische Genealogie des Werdens.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD2","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Erkennen und Erschaffen wird aufgehoben, weil Wirklichkeit nur innerhalb menschlicher Formen der Hervorbringung legitim erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD3","text":"Der Übermensch übernimmt die strukturelle Funktion des Gottes, ohne dessen Transzendenz zu bewahren.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","CH_97E9_ADGC:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD4","text":"Die Negation der Götter stabilisiert eine geschlossene Welt, in der Sinn, Maß und Verständlichkeit aus menschlicher Schöpfung hervorgehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","CH_97E9_ADGC:A9","CH_97E9_ADGC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX1","text":"Eine vom Menschen unabhängige transzendente Instanz darf keine letzte Geltung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX2","text":"Eine Wirklichkeit, die nicht in menschliche Formen der Denkbarkeit, Sichtbarkeit und Fühlbarkeit überführt werden kann, darf nicht als Lebensgrund gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX3","text":"Erkenntnis als passive Aufnahme einer bereits fertigen Welt wird strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX4","text":"Ein nichtmenschliches Maß für Wahrheit und Wert wird nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass Hoffnung auf einer Anerkennung des Unbegreiflichen beruhen könnte, bleibt disqualifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass das Wirkliche dem Menschen ontologisch vorausliegt und sich seinem Schaffen entzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Verhältnis zum Sein, das nicht in Aneignung, Umformung oder Vermenschlichung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Koexistenz eines göttlichen Anderen mit einem Subjekt, das seine eigene Nicht-Göttlichkeit bejaht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX4","text":"Die unbegriffene Außenwelt bleibt als positive Möglichkeit unsichtbar, weil das System Verständlichkeit an menschliche Hervorbringung bindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS1","text":"Überfluss → perspektivische Öffnung → Aufnahme der Lehre als „Frucht“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS2","text":"Gott als Mutmaßung → Begrenzung der Mutmaßung durch den schöpferischen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS3","text":"Unmöglichkeit, Gott zu schaffen oder zu denken → Verschiebung des schöpferischen Ziels auf den Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS4","text":"Wille zur Wahrheit → Übersetzung alles Wirklichen in menschliche Denk-, Sicht- und Gefühlsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS5","text":"Menschliche Formen der Erkenntnis → Erzeugung der Welt durch Vernunft, Bild, Wille und Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS6","text":"Erzeugte Welt → Hoffnung auf Schutz vor Unbegreiflichkeit und Unvernünftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS7","text":"Unerträglichkeit eines göttlichen Anderen → reductio ad impossibilem: Es gibt keine Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS8","text":"Die Maschine schließt Transzendenz aus, indem sie Schöpfung, Verständlichkeit und Lebensfähigkeit an menschliche Selbstsetzung koppelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF1","text":"Reife und Überfluss → Lehre als aufzunehmende Frucht →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF2","text":"göttliche Mutmaßung → Begrenzung metaphysischer Reichweite →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF3","text":"Unschaffbarkeit des Gottes → Ersetzung durch den schaffbaren Übermenschen →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF4","text":"Wille zur Wahrheit → Vermenschlichung aller Erscheinungen →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF5","text":"Vermenschlichung → aktive Erzeugung der Welt →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF6","text":"Welterzeugung → Hoffnung gegen Unbegreiflichkeit und Unvernunft →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF7","text":"Unerträglichkeit des Nicht-Gottseins → Negation aller Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME1","text":"„Gott“ wird von einer transzendenten Ursache zu einer begrenzten menschlichen Mutmaßung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME2","text":"„Übermensch“ wird als funktionaler Ersatz für Gott und als genealogisches Produktionsziel klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME3","text":"Erkenntnis und Schöpfung werden auf derselben begrifflichen Ebene angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME4","text":"Die Welt wird vom unabhängigen Gegenstand zur Aufgabe menschlicher Hervorbringung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME5","text":"Wahrheit wird nicht primär als Übereinstimmung, sondern als vollständige Überführung in menschliche Formen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME6","text":"Hoffnung wird von religiöser Erwartung auf schöpferische Selbst- und Welterzeugung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text verbindet fallende Feigen, Überfluss, Lehre und die Ablösung Gottes durch den Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der argumentative Mechanismus begrenzt Mutmaßung durch schöpferischen Willen und organisiert Wirklichkeit durch menschliche Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Kampf gegen Gott wird als Umleitung von metaphysischer Erwartung in menschliche Selbsttransformation geführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität erscheint als werdende Schöpfung; der Übermensch liegt als zukünftiger Vorfahr vor, während Gott als gegenwärtige Mutmaßung verworfen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Gottesmutmaßung zur menschlichen Welterzeugung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT2","text":"Die Bildlogik von Reife, Fall und süßer Aufnahme ist für die metaphorische Oberfläche nicht erforderlich, für ihre affektive Verstärkung jedoch relevant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT3","text":"Die ontologische Unterscheidung zwischen Erschaffen, Denken und Deuten bleibt unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT4","text":"Die Negation Gottes folgt intern stärker aus der Sprecherposition als aus einem allgemeinen Beweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT5","text":"Das System ist in seiner anti-transzendenten Bewegung kohärent, vermischt jedoch erkenntnistheoretische und ontologische Ebenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die funktionale Ersetzung göttlicher Transzendenz durch menschliche Genealogie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT7","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass der Mensch die Welt schaffen soll, aber den Übermenschen zugleich nur als künftigen Vorfahren hervorbringen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT8","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen dem Willen zur Wahrheit und der Forderung, alles in menschliche Formen zu verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung: Transzendenz wird begrenzt, Schöpfung vermenschlicht und Hoffnung aus dieser Begrenzung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192754018232Z_fd634d1b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Blessed Isles","source_sha256":"7fa9940c7093361df27c6174753e08dfdd23c32ee98bb59ad777c78069901c8c","sha256":"1481c70fc71fc7218ce5f252ef697878a2963def0b38141e77c096eca30d947c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:27:54.022896+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS1","text":"Abundance and ripeness open a perspective in which teachings are received and transformed into creative activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS2","text":"The divine explanation is redefined as mere conjecture and loses its claim to transcendent scope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS3","text":"In place of God, the Übermensch enters as a horizon to be brought forth by human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS4","text":"Truth demands transforming everything real into what is humanly thinkable, visible, and feelable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS5","text":"The world is not presupposed as a finished given but produced through reason, image, will, and love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS6","text":"This self- and world-production grounds the hope without which life would be unbearable and delivered over to the incomprehensible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AS7","text":"The possibility of gods is reductively excluded through the unbearable status of the speaker's not-being-God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A1","text":"Abundance enables a creative view of what is distant and not-yet-given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","text":"God is a conjecture and not a secured reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","text":"Conjectures may not extend beyond the domain of the creative will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A4","text":"The human being can create no God and think no God adequately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","text":"The human being can remake itself into an ancestor of the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","text":"The Übermensch is a goal to be brought forth by human beings in place of a given God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","text":"Will to truth means transforming everything into what is humanly thinkable, visible, and feelable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","text":"The reality designated as world is to be created through reason, image, will, and love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A9","text":"Life requires the hope not to have been born into the incomprehensible or the irrational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:A10","text":"The existence of gods would be unbearable for a subject that could not itself be God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX1","text":"God is not knowledge but conjecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX2","text":"Conjecture may not extend beyond the creative will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX3","text":"The creation of a God is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX4","text":"A God eludes adequate human thinkability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX5","text":"The world is not an independently finished given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX6","text":"Life may not be grounded in the incomprehensible or the irrational.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:NX7","text":"The existence of gods is incompatible with the speaker's self-position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D1","text":"The divine interpretation is replaced by a human interpretation limited by creativity.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","CH_97E9_ADGC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D2","text":"The Übermensch functions as an attainable genealogical task, not as a supernatural given.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D3","text":"Truth becomes an operation of humanizing the real.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D4","text":"Knowledge is transformed into world-production.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D5","text":"The human creation of world receives its justification through the function of hope.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","CH_97E9_ADGC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D6","text":"The negation of God is produced not from an independent refutation but from the incompatibility of divine existence with the speaker's position.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:D7","text":"Human creation becomes the criterion of permissible metaphysical assumptions.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD1","text":"The system replaces transcendent ontology with an anthropocentric genealogy of becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A2","CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD2","text":"The boundary between knowing and creating is abolished because reality appears legitimate only within human forms of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A3","CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD3","text":"The Übermensch assumes the structural function of God without preserving God's transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A5","CH_97E9_ADGC:A6","CH_97E9_ADGC:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SD4","text":"The negation of the gods stabilizes a closed world in which meaning, measure, and intelligibility emerge from human creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A7","CH_97E9_ADGC:A8","CH_97E9_ADGC:A9","CH_97E9_ADGC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX1","text":"A transcendent instance independent of human beings may possess no ultimate validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX2","text":"A reality that cannot be transformed into human forms of thinkability, visibility, and feelability may not count as the ground of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX3","text":"Knowledge as passive reception of an already finished world is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX4","text":"A nonhuman criterion for truth and value is not admitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX5","text":"The possibility that hope could rest upon an acknowledgment of the incomprehensible remains disqualified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the real ontologically precedes the human being and eludes human creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a relation to being that does not consist in appropriation, transformation, or humanization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the coexistence of a divine Other with a subject that affirms its own non-divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX4","text":"The uncomprehended external world remains invisible as a positive possibility because the system binds intelligibility to human production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS1","text":"Abundance → perspectival opening → reception of the teaching as “fruit”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS2","text":"God as conjecture → limitation of conjecture by the creative will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS3","text":"Impossibility of creating or thinking God → displacement of the creative goal onto the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS4","text":"Will to truth → translation of everything real into human forms of thought, sight, and feeling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS5","text":"Human forms of knowledge → production of the world through reason, image, will, and love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS6","text":"Produced world → hope for protection against incomprehensibility and irrationality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS7","text":"Unbearability of a divine Other → reductio ad impossibilem: There are no gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:FGS8","text":"The machine excludes transcendence by coupling creation, intelligibility, and viability to human self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF1","text":"Ripeness and abundance → teaching as fruit to be received →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF2","text":"divine conjecture → limitation of metaphysical scope →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF3","text":"uncreatability of God → replacement by the creatable Übermensch →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF4","text":"Will to truth → humanization of all appearances →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF5","text":"humanization → active production of the world →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF6","text":"world-production → hope against incomprehensibility and irrationality →","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:AF7","text":"Unbearability of not-being-God → negation of all gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME1","text":"“God” is remapped from a transcendent cause to a limited human conjecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME2","text":"“Übermensch” is classified as a functional replacement for God and as a genealogical goal of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME3","text":"Knowledge and creation are arranged on the same conceptual level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME4","text":"The world is remapped from an independent object to a task of human production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME5","text":"Truth is determined not primarily as correspondence but as complete transformation into human forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ME6","text":"Hope is shifted from religious expectation to creative self- and world-production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text connects falling figs, abundance, teaching, and the replacement of God by the Übermensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT2","text":"Structural — The argumentative mechanism limits conjecture through creative will and organizes reality through human forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The struggle against God is conducted as a redirection of metaphysical expectation into human self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears as becoming creation; the Übermensch lies ahead as a future ancestor, while God is rejected as a present conjecture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from conjecture about God to human world-production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT2","text":"The image-logic of ripeness, falling, and sweet reception is not required for the metaphorical surface, but is relevant to its affective intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT3","text":"The ontological distinction between creating, thinking, and interpreting remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT4","text":"The negation of God follows internally more strongly from the speaker's position than from a general proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT5","text":"The system is coherent in its anti-transcendent movement, but conflates epistemological and ontological levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT6","text":"The strongest point is the functional replacement of divine transcendence by human genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT7","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that the human being is to create the world but can at the same time bring forth the Übermensch only as a future ancestor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT8","text":"A further tension arises between the will to truth and the demand to transform everything into human forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADGC:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement: transcendence is limited, creation humanized, and hope produced from this limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADGC:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_ADGC@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_ADGC:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 37","title":"Upon the Blessed Isles","context":"Chapter 37","original_title":"Auf den glückseligen Inseln","original_context":"Chapter 37"},"original_title":"Auf den glückseligen Inseln","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID","layer":"CH","title":"Well did I draw the conclusion; now, however, it draws me.—","order":38,"parents":["RAW_97E9_WZID"],"revision":"CH_97E9_WZID@R001","sha256":"5b49a4313fcbe1de4ea17f51f844f0329484300e56bc06ce3079b19a8d73a86b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS1","text":"Eine Gottesannahme wird als existentielle Zumutung und nicht als gesicherte Erkenntnis problematisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS2","text":"Der Gottesgedanke wird als Operation bestimmt, die Geradheit, Bewegung, Zeit und Vergänglichkeit verkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS3","text":"Die gedankliche Aufnahme dieser Operation erzeugt körperlichen Schwindel und Widerstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS4","text":"Aus dieser Wirkung wird eine Wertung gewonnen: Das Eine, Volle, Unbewegte, Satte und Unvergängliche erscheint als böse und menschenfeindlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS5","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von der Muthmaassung über ihre ontologische Wirkung und leibliche Wirkung zu ihrer ethischen Verwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A1","text":"Gott ist eine Muthmaassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A2","text":"Die Muthmaassung Gottes kann eine Qual erzeugen, die ohne Tod nicht auszuhalten ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A3","text":"Dem Schaffenden darf sein Glaube nicht ohne Weiteres genommen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A4","text":"Das Schweben des Adlers in Adler-Fernen bezeichnet eine zu bewahrende Ferne und Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A5","text":"Der Gottesgedanke macht alles Gerade krumm und alles Stehende drehend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A6","text":"Der Gottesgedanke hebt die Zeit auf und erklärt alles Vergängliche zur Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A7","text":"Die Annahme dieses Gedankens erzeugt Schwindel, Wirbel und Erbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A8","text":"Die Lehren vom Einen, Vollen, Unbewegten, Satten und Unvergänglichen sind böse und menschenfeindlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX1","text":"Gott ist keine gesicherte Gewissheit, sondern eine Muthmaassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX2","text":"Wirklichkeit ist nicht als ausschließlich gerade, ruhende und unveränderliche Ordnung zulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX3","text":"Vergänglichkeit ist nicht als bloße Lüge zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX4","text":"Das Eine und Volle ist nicht als unproblematische Ganzheit anzuerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX5","text":"Unbewegtheit und Sättigung sind keine neutralen Vollkommenheitsmerkmale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX6","text":"Unvergänglichkeit ist nicht ohne Weiteres als höherer Wert anzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX7","text":"Eine Lehre, die diese Bestimmungen absolut setzt, ist nicht menschenfreundlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D1","text":"Der Gottesgedanke verwandelt eine ontologische Behauptung in einen Angriff auf Zeitlichkeit und Werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D2","text":"Die Kritik am Gottesgedanken wird nicht nur begrifflich, sondern leiblich durch Schwindel und Erbrechen vollzogen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D3","text":"Das Schaffende und das adlerhafte Schweben werden gegen die metaphysische Fixierung auf Einheits- und Ruhezustände geschützt.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A4","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D4","text":"Die Verwerfung der Gotteslehre richtet sich gegen ihre Folgen für Bewegung, Zeit und Vergänglichkeit, nicht nur gegen ihren Namen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D5","text":"Körperlicher Widerstand fungiert als Wertindikator gegen die metaphysische Lehre vom Unbewegten und Unvergänglichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A7","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD1","text":"Metaphysische Einheit wird als Verneinung von Werden und damit als lebensfeindliche Stabilisierung rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD2","text":"Die Wahrheit einer metaphysischen Annahme wird an ihrer Wirkung auf Zeitlichkeit, Schaffen und Leiblichkeit gemessen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A2","CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD3","text":"Der Text ersetzt die Frage nach der Existenz Gottes durch die Frage, welche Form von Leben der Gottesgedanke ermöglicht oder zerstört.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A1","CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD4","text":"Die scheinbare Vollendung des Unbewegten wird als Verlust von Ferne, Bewegung, Zeit und Schöpfung totalisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A4","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass eine zeitlose Wirklichkeit nicht wahrer oder wertvoller ist als eine vergängliche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Ruhe, Einheit und Fülle als höchste ontologische Norm gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Vorstellung, dass das Werden durch seine Vergänglichkeit ontologisch minderwertig werde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX4","text":"Es verweigert einer metaphysischen Ordnung den Vorrang vor der leiblich erfahrenen Bewegungs- und Lebensordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX5","text":"Es setzt stillschweigend voraus, dass Schaffen nicht aus vollendeter Sättigung, sondern aus Ferne, Spannung und Bewegung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Zeit nur ein Mangel gegenüber dem Ewigen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Versöhnung von absoluter Unbewegtheit mit Schöpfung und Werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein metaphysischer Standpunkt, der die leibliche Reaktion als bloße Täuschung entwertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX4","text":"Die Kraft des Arguments beruht auf der Abwesenheit einer tragfähigen Vermittlung zwischen göttlicher Vollständigkeit und schöpferischer Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS1","text":"Muthmaassung Gottes → mögliche existentielle Qual → Frage nach dem Erhalt von Glaube, Schaffen und Ferne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS2","text":"Gottesgedanke → Umkehrung von Geradheit und Stand → Aufhebung von Zeit und Vergänglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung von Zeitlichkeit → körperlicher Schwindel und Erbrechen → leibliche Zurückweisung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS4","text":"Lehren des Einen, Vollen, Unbewegten, Satten und Unvergänglichen → Identifikation einer gemeinsamen metaphysischen Operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS5","text":"Gemeinsame Operation → Werturteil „böse“ und „menschenfeindlich“ → Vorrang von Werden, Bewegung und Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AF1","text":"Gottes-Muthmaassung → existentielle Zumutung → ontologische Verkehrung → Aufhebung der Zeit → leiblicher Widerstand → Verwerfung der metaphysischen Vollendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME1","text":"Gottesfrage wird von der Existenzebene auf die Wirkungs- und Lebensformebene verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME2","text":"Einheit, Fülle, Unbewegtheit, Sättigung und Unvergänglichkeit werden als Varianten einer einzigen gegenbewegenden Metaphysik kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME3","text":"Vergänglichkeit wird aus der Kategorie des Mangels in die Position einer zu verteidigenden Wirklichkeitsbedingung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME4","text":"Körperliche Übelkeit wird als epistemisch-wertende Reaktion und nicht als bloße Störung der Argumentation klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME5","text":"Schaffen und adlerhafte Ferne werden gegen die Totalisierung des Einen und Unbewegten als strukturelle Gegenpole sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Gottesgedanke wird als qualvolle und schwindelerregende Muthmaassung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Gottesgedanke operiert durch die Negation von Bewegung, Zeit und Vergänglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die metaphysische Lehre wird nicht durch Gegenbeweise, sondern durch ihre lebensfeindliche Wirkung und leibliche Unverträglichkeit zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität wird implizit als zeitlich, vergänglich, beweglich und nicht in einer unbewegten Einheit abgeschlossen vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Gottes-Muthmaassung zu metaphysischer Verwerfung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Muthmaassung als psychische, religiöse oder ontologische Kategorie primär gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, ob „Schaffender“ eine bestimmte Subjektform oder allgemein schöpferische Tätigkeit bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Zeitlichkeit, Werden und körperliche Reaktion als Gegeninstanzen zur metaphysischen Unbewegtheit gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von ontologischer Negation, leiblicher Wirkung und Werturteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Schutz des Glaubens des Schaffenden und der generellen Verwerfung der Gottesannahme bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, komprimiert jedoch die rhetorische Intensität von Schwindel, Erbrechen und Menschenfeindschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195545203544Z_d09d6e68","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Indeed, I drew the conclusion; but now it draws me.—","source_sha256":"5b49a4313fcbe1de4ea17f51f844f0329484300e56bc06ce3079b19a8d73a86b","sha256":"962f0236af5b804da180388ea841dadc5b0b0de5010bd90176c2a9ede6124117","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:55:45.206296+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS1","text":"An assumption of God is problematized as an existential imposition and not as secure knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS2","text":"The thought of God is determined as an operation that reverses straightness, movement, time, and transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS3","text":"The conceptual uptake of this operation produces bodily dizziness and resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS4","text":"From this effect, a valuation is derived: the One, Full, Unmoved, Sated, and Imperishable appear evil and inimical to humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AS5","text":"The argument moves from the supposition through its ontological effect and bodily effect to its ethical rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A1","text":"God is a supposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A2","text":"The supposition of God can produce a torment that cannot be endured without death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A3","text":"The creator must not simply be deprived of his faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A4","text":"The hovering of the eagle in eagle-distances designates a distance and mobility that are to be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A5","text":"The thought of God makes everything straight crooked and everything standing turn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A6","text":"The thought of God abolishes time and declares everything transient to be a lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A7","text":"The acceptance of this thought produces dizziness, vertigo, and vomiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:A8","text":"The doctrines of the One, Full, Unmoved, Sated, and Imperishable are evil and inimical to humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX1","text":"God is not a secure certainty, but a supposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX2","text":"Reality cannot be admitted as an exclusively straight, resting, and unchangeable order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX3","text":"Transience is not to be treated as a mere lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX4","text":"The One and the Full are not to be acknowledged as an unproblematic totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX5","text":"Immobility and satiety are not neutral marks of perfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX6","text":"Imperishability is not simply to be posited as a higher value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:NX7","text":"A doctrine that absolutizes these determinations is not friendly to humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D1","text":"The thought of God transforms an ontological assertion into an attack on temporality and becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D2","text":"The critique of the thought of God is carried out not only conceptually but bodily through dizziness and vomiting.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D3","text":"The creative and eagle-like hovering are protected against the metaphysical fixation on states of unity and rest.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A4","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D4","text":"The rejection of the doctrine of God is directed against its consequences for movement, time, and transience, not only against its name.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:D5","text":"Bodily resistance functions as an indicator of value against the metaphysical doctrine of the Unmoved and Imperishable.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A7","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD1","text":"Metaphysical unity is reconstructed as the negation of becoming and thus as a stabilization inimical to life.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD2","text":"The truth of a metaphysical assumption is measured by its effect on temporality, creation, and corporeality.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A2","CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD3","text":"The text replaces the question of God's existence with the question of what form of life the thought of God enables or destroys.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A1","CH_97E9_WZID:A5","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SD4","text":"The apparent completion of the Unmoved is totalized as the loss of distance, movement, time, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A3","CH_97E9_WZID:A4","CH_97E9_WZID:A6","CH_97E9_WZID:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that a timeless reality is not truer or more valuable than a transient one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that rest, unity, and fullness count as the highest ontological norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the notion that becoming becomes ontologically inferior through its transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX4","text":"It refuses to grant a metaphysical order precedence over the bodily experienced order of movement and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:DNX5","text":"It tacitly presupposes that creation proceeds not from completed satiety but from distance, tension, and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which time is merely a deficiency in relation to the eternal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the reconciliation of absolute immobility with creation and becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a metaphysical standpoint that devalues bodily reaction as mere deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:SNX4","text":"The force of the argument rests on the absence of a viable mediation between divine completeness and creative mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS1","text":"Supposition of God → possible existential torment → question of the preservation of faith, creation, and distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS2","text":"Thought of God → reversal of straightness and standing → abolition of time and transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS3","text":"Abolition of temporality → bodily dizziness and vomiting → bodily rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS4","text":"Doctrines of the One, Full, Unmoved, Sated, and Imperishable → identification of a common metaphysical operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:FGS5","text":"Common operation → value judgment “evil” and “inimical to humanity” → precedence of becoming, movement, and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:AF1","text":"Supposition of God → existential imposition → ontological reversal → abolition of time → bodily resistance → rejection of metaphysical completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME1","text":"The question of God is shifted from the level of existence to the level of effects and forms of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME2","text":"Unity, fullness, immobility, satiety, and imperishability are mapped as variants of a single counter-movement metaphysics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME3","text":"Transience is shifted from the category of deficiency into the position of a condition of reality to be defended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME4","text":"Bodily nausea is classified as an epistemic-evaluative reaction and not as a mere disturbance of argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ME5","text":"Creation and eagle-like distance become visible as structural counter-poles to the totalization of the One and the Unmoved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT1","text":"Surface — The thought of God is described as a tormenting and dizzying supposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT2","text":"Structural — The thought of God operates through the negation of movement, time, and transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The metaphysical doctrine is rejected not through counterproofs, but through its life-hostile effect and bodily incompatibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is implicitly presupposed as temporal, transient, mobile, and not concluded in an unmoved unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the supposition of God to metaphysical rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the supposition is primarily intended as a psychological, religious, or ontological category.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is whether “creator” designates a specific form of subjectivity or creative activity in general.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as temporality, becoming, and bodily reaction count as counterinstances to metaphysical immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of ontological negation, bodily effect, and value judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between protecting the creator's faith and the general rejection of the assumption of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_WZID:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, but compresses the rhetorical intensity of dizziness, vomiting, and enmity toward humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_WZID:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_WZID@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_WZID:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 38","title":"Well did I draw the conclusion; now, however, it draws me.—","context":"Chapter 38","original_title":"Wohl zog ich den Schluss; nun aber zieht er mich.—","original_context":"Chapter 38"},"original_title":"Wohl zog ich den Schluss; nun aber zieht er mich.—","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND","layer":"CH","title":"All that is imperishable—is but a symbol! And the poets lie too much.—","order":39,"parents":["RAW_97E9_AUND"],"revision":"CH_97E9_AUND@R001","sha256":"1a353be84da708e5bceeceae245205f9b2f8d6b7b35445e8745235a804aee9e3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, Vergänglichkeit nicht als Mangel, sondern als zu rechtfertigende Grundbedingung des Lebens zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS2","text":"Die Neubestimmung ersetzt das Unvergängliche durch Gleichnis, Zeit und Werden durch affirmative Deutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS3","text":"Schaffen wird als Erlösung vom Leiden und als Erzeugung von Leichtigkeit gesetzt, die nur durch Leiden, Sterben und Verwandlung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS4","text":"Der schöpferische Wille wird zugleich als gewolltes Schicksal, Befreiung des Fühlenden und Bedingung von Erkenntnis bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS5","text":"Die Abwendung von Göttern eröffnet den Menschen als Material und Ziel des Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der gewaltsamen Freilegung eines noch verborgenen Bildes des Übermenschen aus dem Stein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A1","text":"Alles Unvergängliche ist nur ein Gleichnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A2","text":"Zeit und Werden verlangen Gleichnisse, die Vergänglichkeit loben und rechtfertigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A3","text":"Schaffen erlöst vom Leiden und macht das Leben leicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A4","text":"Schaffen setzt Leiden und vielfache Verwandlung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A5","text":"Der Schaffende muss zugleich neu geborenes Kind, Gebärerin und Schmerz der Gebärerin sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A6","text":"Der schöpferische Wille bestimmt das Schicksal, indem er gerade dieses Schicksal will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A7","text":"Wollen befreit das fühlende, in Gefängnissen leidende Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A8","text":"Nicht-mehr-wollen, Nicht-mehr-schätzen und Nicht-mehr-schaffen bilden die große Müdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A9","text":"Erkenntnis erhält ihre Unschuld durch den Willen zur Zeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A10","text":"Der Wille zur Schöpfung setzt die Abwesenheit von Göttern voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A11","text":"Der schöpferische Wille treibt vom Göttlichen zum Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A12","text":"Im harten und hässlichen Stein ist ein Bild verborgen, das durch den Hammer freigelegt werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A13","text":"Die Schönheit des Übermenschen erscheint als Schatten des noch zu vollendenden Bildes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX1","text":"Das Unvergängliche wird als eigenständige Realität zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX2","text":"Dichterische Rede wird als unzuverlässig begrenzt, sofern sie das Unvergängliche behauptet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX3","text":"Nicht-mehr-wollen wird als Befreiung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX4","text":"Nicht-mehr-schätzen wird als Zustand der Müdigkeit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX5","text":"Nicht-mehr-schaffen wird als lebensfeindliche Erschöpfung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX6","text":"Götter werden als Hindernis der Schöpfung zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX7","text":"Der Stein darf nicht als fertige Gestalt gelten, sondern als Gefängnis eines noch verborgenen Bildes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX8","text":"Leiden darf nicht als endgültige Negation des Lebens gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D1","text":"Die Rechtfertigung der Vergänglichkeit erfolgt durch ihre Umwandlung in Bedingung und Material des Schaffens.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A1","CH_97E9_AUND:A2","CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D2","text":"Der Schaffende ist nur schöpferisch, wenn er frühere Gestalten seines Selbst sterben und sich in neue Gestalten verwandeln lässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D3","text":"Freiheit wird nicht als Abwesenheit von Schicksal, sondern als Bejahung des gewollten Schicksals bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D4","text":"Erkenntnis ist nicht willensfrei, sondern eine Form des Zeugungs- und Werdenswillens.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D5","text":"Die Überwindung des Göttlichen erzeugt keinen Nihilismus, sondern verschiebt die schöpferische Aufgabe auf den Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A10","CH_97E9_AUND:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D6","text":"Zerstörung des Bestehenden wird als notwendiger Vollzug der Freilegung einer zukünftigen Gestalt interpretiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A12","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D7","text":"Der Hammer fungiert als Instrument einer Schöpfung, die zunächst zerbrechen muss, was die Gestalt verbirgt.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A11","CH_97E9_AUND:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt Vergänglichkeit von einem zu überwindenden Defizit in die produktive Ontologie jeder Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A1","CH_97E9_AUND:A2","CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD2","text":"Subjektwerdung erscheint als rekursive Selbstzerstörung und Selbstgeburt, nicht als Bewahrung einer identischen Person.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A5","CH_97E9_AUND:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD3","text":"Freiheit wird zur aktiven Aneignung der Notwendigkeit, wodurch Schicksal und Wille in einer affirmativen Selbstsetzung verschränkt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A7","CH_97E9_AUND:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD4","text":"Erkenntnis wird in den schöpferischen Prozess eingegliedert und verliert den Status einer neutralen, vom Wollen unabhängigen Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A9","CH_97E9_AUND:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD5","text":"Die Verneinung transzendenter Götter totalisiert den Menschen als einzig verfügbaren Ort zukünftiger Gestaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A10","CH_97E9_AUND:A11","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD6","text":"Zukunft erscheint als verborgene Gestalt, die nicht entdeckt, sondern durch Gewalt, Verlust und Vollendung hervorgebracht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A12","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass es keine unveränderliche Wahrheit jenseits von Werden, Bild und Gleichnis gibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Bewahrung einer bestehenden Gestalt keine höhere Form des Lebens darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Freiheit aus, die vom Willen, vom Schicksal und von jeder Notwendigkeit unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Erkenntnis aus, die nicht aus einem zeugenden oder wertenden Willen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Schöpfung aus, die ohne Schmerz, Abschied, Sterben und Zerstörung möglich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine bereits vollendete menschliche oder übermenschliche Gestalt aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der das Sein unabhängig vom Schaffen, Wollen und Verwandeln bereits gerechtfertigt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erlösung durch Ruhe, Dauer oder Rückkehr zu einem Unvergänglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Schöpfer, der nur hervorbringt, ohne selbst erzeugt, gebrochen und verwandelt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zukunft, die als fertiges Ziel vor dem schöpferischen Vollzug verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine göttliche Ordnung, die dem menschlichen Schaffen Maß, Zweck oder Rechtfertigung vorausgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS1","text":"Unvergänglichkeit wird als Gleichnis disqualifiziert → Zeit und Werden werden als Primärbedingungen gesetzt → Vergänglichkeit wird rechtfertigungsfähig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS2","text":"Leiden und Sterben werden nicht negiert, sondern in Verwandlung überführt → Verwandlung konstituiert den Schaffenden → Schaffen erzeugt Leichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS3","text":"Gefangenschaft des Fühlenden wird auf Willensmangel zurückgeführt → Wollen fungiert als Befreiung → Freiheit wird als Bejahung des gewollten Schicksals erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS4","text":"Erkenntnis wird auf Zeugungswillen zurückbezogen → Erkenntnis verliert Neutralität → Wissen wird Teil des schöpferischen Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS5","text":"Götter werden als mögliche Schöpferinstanzen entfernt → der Mensch wird zum verfügbaren Material → der Stein wird zum Gefängnis einer zukünftigen Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS6","text":"Verborgene Gestalt wird durch den Hammer angezeigt → Zerstörung des Steins legt das Bild frei → die Schattenerscheinung des Übermenschen fungiert als Vollendungsrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AF1","text":"Behauptete Unvergänglichkeit → Gleichnischarakter des Unvergänglichen → Vorrang von Zeit und Werden → affirmative Rechtfertigung der Vergänglichkeit → Schaffen als Erlösung → Leiden, Sterben und Verwandlung als Produktionsbedingungen → Wille als Befreiung und gewolltes Schicksal → Ausschluss der Götter → Mensch als Schaffensziel und Material → Hammer gegen den steinernen Widerstand → Schatten des Übermenschen als Vollendungsvektor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME1","text":"Vergänglichkeit wird von einem Gegenbegriff zum Unvergänglichen zu einer positiven Bedingung der Schöpfung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME2","text":"Leiden wird von einem bloßen Negativzustand zu einem Geburts- und Transformationsmedium umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME3","text":"Freiheit wird aus dem Gegensatz zu Schicksal herausgelöst und als willentliche Aneignung des Schicksals neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME4","text":"Erkenntnis wird aus der Sphäre neutraler Betrachtung in die Sphäre des zeugenden Willens verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von Zerstörung und Schöpfung bricht zusammen: Zerstörung wird als operative Phase der Gestaltung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME6","text":"Der Mensch wird nicht als fertiges Subjekt, sondern als Material und Übergangsform einer zukünftigen Gestalt klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME7","text":"Der Gegensatz von Göttlichem und Menschlichem wird durch die funktionale Unterscheidung von Schöpfungshindernis und Schöpfungsmaterial ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gleichnisse über Zeit und Werden sollen Vergänglichkeit loben und rechtfertigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT2","text":"Structural — Schöpfung wird durch eine Kette aus Leiden, Sterben, Verwandlung, Wille und Freilegung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Aufgabe von der Suche nach Dauer zur aktiven Hervorbringung zukünftiger Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit wird als Werden, Selbstüberschreitung und noch nicht vollendete Bildwerdung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Vergänglichkeitsrechtfertigung zu schöpferischer Selbstüberwindung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Übermensch eine ontologische Gestalt, ein regulatives Bild oder ein dichterisches Gleichnis ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Freiheit als gewollte Notwendigkeit und Schöpfung als schmerzhafte Zerstörung verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Vergänglichkeit, Verwandlung und Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Verbindung liegt zwischen der Zurückweisung dichterischer Lüge und der fortgesetzten Verwendung von Gleichnis, Schatten und Bild.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT6","text":"Ein ungelöster Widerspruch besteht zwischen dem Willen als Befreier und dem Willen als Instanz, die das Schicksal notwendig setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die gewaltsame Freilegung nicht als bloßes Mittel, sondern als konstitutiver Bestandteil des Schaffens behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192838715250Z_4791a4fa","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"All that is imperishable—is but a parable! And the poets lie too much.—","source_sha256":"1a353be84da708e5bceeceae245205f9b2f8d6b7b35445e8745235a804aee9e3","sha256":"a7f503acee8eb952b0e3289c577a4d6b4e00cf8f921c461842f74fabb40644a9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:28:38.718062+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS1","text":"The problem consists in determining transience not as a deficiency, but as a fundamental condition of life requiring justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS2","text":"The redefinition replaces the imperishable with parable, and time and becoming with affirmative interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS3","text":"Creating is posited as redemption from suffering and as the production of lightness, which is possible only through suffering, dying, and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS4","text":"The creative will is determined simultaneously as willed fate, liberation of the feeling being, and condition of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS5","text":"The turning away from gods opens up the human being as material and goal of creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the violent laying bare from the stone of a still-hidden image of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A1","text":"Everything imperishable is only a parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A2","text":"Time and becoming demand parables that praise and justify transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A3","text":"Creating redeems from suffering and makes life light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A4","text":"Creating presupposes suffering and manifold transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A5","text":"The creator must simultaneously be a newborn child, a woman giving birth, and the pain of the woman giving birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A6","text":"The creative will determines fate by willing precisely this fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A7","text":"Willing liberates the feeling being that suffers in prisons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A8","text":"No-longer-willing, no-longer-valuing, and no-longer-creating constitute the great weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A9","text":"Knowledge receives its innocence through the will to procreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A10","text":"The will to creation presupposes the absence of gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A11","text":"The creative will drives from the divine toward the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A12","text":"In the hard and ugly stone an image is hidden that is to be laid bare by the hammer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:A13","text":"The beauty of the Overman appears as the shadow of the image still to be completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX1","text":"The imperishable is rejected as an independent reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX2","text":"Poetic speech is restricted as unreliable insofar as it asserts the imperishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX3","text":"No-longer-willing is excluded as liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX4","text":"No-longer-valuing is excluded as a state of weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX5","text":"No-longer-creating is excluded as life-hostile exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX6","text":"Gods are rejected as an obstacle to creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX7","text":"The stone must not count as a finished form, but as the prison of a still-hidden image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:NX8","text":"Suffering must not count as the final negation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D1","text":"The justification of transience occurs through its transformation into condition and material of creating.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A1","CH_97E9_AUND:A2","CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D2","text":"The creator is creative only if he allows earlier forms of his self to die and himself to be transformed into new forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D3","text":"Freedom is determined not as the absence of fate, but as affirmation of willed fate.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D4","text":"Knowledge is not free of will, but a form of the will to procreation and becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D5","text":"The overcoming of the divine produces no nihilism, but shifts the creative task onto the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A10","CH_97E9_AUND:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D6","text":"Destruction of what exists is interpreted as the necessary enactment of laying bare a future form.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A12","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:D7","text":"The hammer functions as the instrument of a creation that must first break what conceals the form.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A11","CH_97E9_AUND:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD1","text":"The system transforms transience from a deficit to be overcome into the productive ontology of every creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A1","CH_97E9_AUND:A2","CH_97E9_AUND:A3","CH_97E9_AUND:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD2","text":"Becoming a subject appears as recursive self-destruction and self-birth, not as preservation of an identical person.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A5","CH_97E9_AUND:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD3","text":"Freedom becomes the active appropriation of necessity, whereby fate and will are intertwined in an affirmative self-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A7","CH_97E9_AUND:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD4","text":"Knowledge is incorporated into the creative process and loses the status of a neutral instance independent of willing.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A6","CH_97E9_AUND:A9","CH_97E9_AUND:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD5","text":"The negation of transcendent gods totalizes the human being as the sole available site of future formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A10","CH_97E9_AUND:A11","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SD6","text":"The future appears as a hidden form that is not discovered, but brought forth through violence, loss, and completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4","CH_97E9_AUND:A12","CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that there is no immutable truth beyond becoming, image, and parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that preserving an existing form does not constitute a higher form of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX3","text":"It excludes a freedom that would be independent of will, fate, and every necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX4","text":"It excludes a knowledge that does not arise from a procreative or valuing will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX5","text":"It excludes a creation that would be possible without pain, farewell, dying, and destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:DNX6","text":"It excludes an already completed human or overhuman form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which being would already be justified independently of creating, willing, and transforming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX2","text":"Excluded is redemption through rest, duration, or return to an imperishable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a creator who merely brings forth without himself being generated, broken, and transformed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a future that would be available as a finished goal prior to the creative enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a divine order that predetermines measure, purpose, or justification for human creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS1","text":"Imperishability is disqualified as parable → time and becoming are posited as primary conditions → transience becomes capable of justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS2","text":"Suffering and dying are not negated, but transferred into transformation → transformation constitutes the creator → creating produces lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS3","text":"The imprisonment of the feeling being is traced back to lack of will → willing functions as liberation → freedom is produced as affirmation of willed fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS4","text":"Knowledge is referred back to the will to procreation → knowledge loses neutrality → knowing becomes part of creative becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS5","text":"Gods are removed as possible instances of creation → the human being becomes available material → the stone becomes the prison of a future form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:FGS6","text":"The hidden form is indicated by the hammer → destruction of the stone lays bare the image → the shadow-appearance of the Overman functions as a direction of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:AF1","text":"Asserted imperishability → parabolic character of the imperishable → primacy of time and becoming → affirmative justification of transience → creating as redemption → suffering, dying, and transformation as conditions of production → will as liberation and willed fate → exclusion of gods → the human being as goal and material of creating → hammer against stony resistance → shadow of the Overman as vector of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME1","text":"Transience is remapped from a counterconcept to the imperishable into a positive condition of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME2","text":"Suffering is reclassified from a merely negative state into a medium of birth and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME3","text":"Freedom is detached from its opposition to fate and remapped as volitional appropriation of fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME4","text":"Knowledge is shifted from the sphere of neutral contemplation into the sphere of the procreative will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME5","text":"The opposition between destruction and creation collapses: destruction becomes legible as an operative phase of formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME6","text":"The human being is classified not as a finished subject, but as material and transitional form of a future form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ME7","text":"The opposition between the divine and the human is replaced by the functional distinction between obstacle to creation and material of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT1","text":"Surface — Parables concerning time and becoming are to praise and justify transience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT2","text":"Structural — Creation is organized through a chain of suffering, dying, transformation, will, and laying bare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the task from the search for duration to the active bringing forth of future form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is presupposed as becoming, self-overcoming, and image-becoming not yet completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from justification of transience to creative self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the Overman is an ontological form, a regulative image, or a poetic parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as freedom is understood as willed necessity and creation as painful destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between transience, transformation, and creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT5","text":"The weakest connection lies between the rejection of poetic lying and the continued use of parable, shadow, and image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT6","text":"An unresolved contradiction exists between the will as liberator and the will as the instance that necessarily posits fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUND:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the violent laying bare is treated not as a mere means, but as a constitutive component of creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUND:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_AUND@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_AUND:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 39","title":"All that is imperishable—is but a symbol! And the poets lie too much.—","context":"Chapter 39","original_title":"Alles Unvergängliche—das ist nur ein Gleichniss! Und die Dichter lügen zuviel.—","original_context":"Chapter 39"},"original_title":"Alles Unvergängliche—das ist nur ein Gleichniss! Und die Dichter lügen zuviel.—","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Compassionate","order":40,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDM0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDM0@R001","sha256":"ba251cd5d75cd19e269c81f2f540195ca040ed33fa9ab8f65d6a302bc4eff546","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS1","text":"Die Rede nimmt die Spottrede vom Menschen als Tier auf und kehrt ihre Perspektive um: Für den Erkennenden erscheinen Menschen als Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS2","text":"Sie erklärt diese Tierhaftigkeit aus einer Geschichte der Scham, in der der Mensch durch wiederholte Beschämung geprägt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS3","text":"Aus der Scham folgt ein Gebot des Nichtbeschämens, das sich besonders gegen den Umgang mit Leidenden richtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS4","text":"Das Mitleid wird jedoch als schamlose, den Leidenden verletzende Form der Hilfe diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS5","text":"An die Stelle mitleidiger Nähe treten Distanz, Verhüllung, Selbsthilfe, Freude und eine harte Form des Beistands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in einer Hierarchie, in der große Liebe das Mitleid übersteigt, das Geliebte schaffen will und deshalb Härte verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A1","text":"Die Rede setzt den Menschen aus der Perspektive des Erkennenden als ein Tier mit roten, von Scham gezeichneten Backen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A2","text":"Die Geschichte des Menschen wird als Geschichte wiederholter Scham bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A3","text":"Der Edle darf den Leidenden nicht beschämen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A4","text":"Wer im Mitleiden selig ist, verfügt über zu wenig Scham.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A5","text":"Unvermeidliches Mitleid soll weder zur Identität werden noch in unmittelbarer Nähe ausgeübt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A6","text":"Die Menschheit hat sich zu wenig gefreut; diese Freudearmut wird als Erbsünde bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A7","text":"Das Erlernen größerer Freude vermindert besser als direkte Hilfe die Neigung, anderen weh zu tun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","text":"Das Wahrnehmen fremden Leidens erzeugt Scham, und die Hilfe kann den Stolz des Leidenden verletzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A9","text":"Große Verbindlichkeiten erzeugen Rachsucht; eine nicht vergessene kleine Wohltat verwandelt sich in einen nagenden Zwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A10","text":"Eine Gabe beschämt weniger, wenn Fremde und Arme sich ihre Frucht selbst nehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A11","text":"Die Rede behandelt die Figur des Bettlers als eine Form des Gebens, die sowohl beim Gebenden als auch beim Verweigern Ärger erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A12","text":"Gewissensbisse erziehen nicht zur Größe, sondern zum Beißen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A13","text":"Der kleine Gedanke verbreitet sich verborgen wie ein Pilz und macht den ganzen Leib morsch; die böse Tat spricht ihre Krankheit offen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A14","text":"Auch der vom Teufel Besessene kann zur Größe gelangen, wenn er seinen Teufel vergrößert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A15","text":"Das Zusammenleben mit Menschen ist wegen der Schwierigkeit des Schweigens schwer; Durchsichtigkeit bedeutet keinen wirklichen Durchgang durch den anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A16","text":"Dem leidenden Freund nützt ein hartes, feldbettartiges Lager besser als eine weiche mitleidige Aufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A17","text":"Große Liebe überwindet Vergebung und Mitleid, weil sie das Geliebte noch schaffen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A18","text":"Die Schaffenden sind hart; das Mitleid erzeugt eine schwere Wolke und wird als Todesursache Gottes dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX1","text":"Der Mensch ist aus der Perspektive des Erkennenden nicht als sichere Erhebung über das Tier festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX2","text":"Scham wird nicht als Rechtfertigung öffentlicher Beschämung des Leidenden zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX3","text":"Mitleid gilt nicht schon deshalb als gut, weil es Leid lindern will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX4","text":"Hilfe ist nicht notwendig wohltätig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX5","text":"Verpflichtung und Dankbarkeit werden nicht als harmlose Folgen einer Gabe anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX6","text":"Kleine Gedanken werden nicht als unschädliche Vorstufe oder Ersatz für große böse Taten akzeptiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX7","text":"Durchsichtigkeit wird nicht mit Verstehen oder Durchdringung gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX8","text":"Vergebung und Mitleid bilden nicht den höchsten Zustand der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX9","text":"Große Liebe wird nicht mit Weichheit, Nachsicht oder bloßer Leidensgemeinschaft identifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D1","text":"Der Mensch wird als schamgeprägtes Tier lesbar, dessen Anthropologie durch eine historische Schamstruktur organisiert ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A1","CH_97E9_VDM0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D2","text":"Der Schutz des Leidenden verlangt eine Zurückweisung der mitleidigen Selbstidentifikation und eine kontrollierte Distanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A3","CH_97E9_VDM0:A4","CH_97E9_VDM0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D3","text":"Freude wird zum bevorzugten Gegenmittel gegen das Zufügen von Leid.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A6","CH_97E9_VDM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D4","text":"Direkte Hilfe kann den Leidenden doppelt verletzen, indem sie sein Leiden sichtbar macht und ihn zugleich in eine Verpflichtung setzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","CH_97E9_VDM0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D5","text":"Eine ethisch schonendere Gabe verlagert die Handlung vom Gebenden auf die selbständige Aneignung durch den Empfänger.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","CH_97E9_VDM0:A9","CH_97E9_VDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D6","text":"Schuldgefühl und Gewissensbiss erzeugen keine Erneuerung, sondern reproduzieren eine aggressive Form moralischer Innerlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A12","CH_97E9_VDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D7","text":"Die Rede bevorzugt die offene, symptomatische Tat gegenüber der verdeckten Verkleinerung des Denkens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D8","text":"Destruktive Kräfte sollen nicht notwendig unterdrückt, sondern in eine Möglichkeit der Größe überführt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A13","CH_97E9_VDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D9","text":"Nützlicher Beistand wird als schweigsame, harte Aufnahmeform bestimmt, nicht als Auflösung des Leidens in weicher Anteilnahme.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A15","CH_97E9_VDM0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D10","text":"Liebe erhält ihren höchsten Rang erst dort, wo sie nicht mehr vergibt oder mitleidet, sondern hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A17","CH_97E9_VDM0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD1","text":"Das ethische Kriterium verschiebt sich von der Linderung fremden Schmerzes zur Vermeidung von Beschämung, Verpflichtung und Stolzverletzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD2","text":"Die Zurückweisung des Mitleids erzeugt keine reine Gleichgültigkeit, sondern eine alternative Technik des Beistands: Distanz, Selbstaneignung und Härte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD3","text":"Das System behandelt soziale Schädigung nicht nur als Folge sichtbarer Taten, sondern als Wirkung von Schuld, Dankbarkeit, kleinen Gedanken und verdeckten Abhängigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD4","text":"Die Rangordnung der Affekte lautet: Mitleid unter Vergebung, Vergebung unter schöpferischer Liebe, schöpferische Liebe über der Härte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD5","text":"Wird Mitleid verallgemeinert, verwandelt es sich von einer Tugend in eine metaphysische Last, die Menschen verdunkelt und Gott sterben lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD6","text":"Schweigen, Entfernung und nicht beschämende Selbstaneignung bilden eine relationale Gegenordnung zur mitleidigen Transparenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass gemeinsames Leiden selbst eine hinreichende Grundlage ethischer Gemeinschaft bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Gleichheitsmodell, in dem Gebender und Leidender durch offene Bedürftigkeit symmetrisch verbunden sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass eine gute Absicht die soziale Wirkung einer Hilfe garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine moralische Bildung, die über Reue, Gewissensbiss oder Selbstanklage zur Größe gelangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein neutraler Innenraum, in dem kleine Gedanken folgenlos bleiben könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Vorstellung, dass vollständige Kenntnis des anderen Nähe oder Durchdringung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine endgültige Erlösung durch Vergebung, Mitleid oder die bloße Beendigung des Leidens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX8","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein weiches Schöpfungsmodell, in dem Hervorbringung ohne Härte, Auswahl oder Überwindung möglich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine universale Ordnung der Wohltätigkeit, in der Geben und Empfangen ohne Beschämung, Schuld und Rachsucht funktionieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Gemeinschaft, deren primäres Bindemittel gegenseitiges Mitleid bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Form der Fürsorge, die zugleich unmittelbare Nähe, vollständige Anerkennung und unverletzten Stolz garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine theologische Rettung, deren Grund im Mitleid Gottes mit den Menschen liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX5","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Versöhnung, die durch Vergebung abgeschlossen werden kann, ohne in Schöpfung überzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX6","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Größe, die sich durch Schonung, Kleinheit oder die Unterdrückung widersprüchlicher Kräfte verwirklicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS1","text":"Tierperspektive des Erkennenden → Mensch als schamgeprägtes Tier → Anthropologie als Geschichte der Scham.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS2","text":"Geschichte der Scham → Gebot des Nichtbeschämens → Verdacht gegen das selbstzufriedene Mitleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS3","text":"Mitleidige Hilfe → Sichtbarkeit des Leidens + Verletzung des Stolzes + Verpflichtung → Rachsucht, Scham und Abhängigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS4","text":"Gefahr der Hilfe → Entfernung, Verhüllung und selbständige Aneignung → Beistand ohne offene Beschämung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS5","text":"Kleine Gedanken und Gewissensbisse → verborgene Vermehrung und moralische Aggression → Vorrang offener Symptome und gelenkter Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS6","text":"Mitleid unterhalb großer Liebe → Liebe als Schöpfung → Härte der Schaffenden und metaphysische Verwerfung des Mitleids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF1","text":"Spott über Zarathustras Tierhaftigkeit → Umkehrung der Perspektive → Menschen erscheinen dem Erkennenden als Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF2","text":"Mensch als schamgeprägtes Tier → Geschichte der Scham → Gebot des Nichtbeschämens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF3","text":"Gebot des Nichtbeschämens → Kritik des selbstgenügsamen Mitleids → Distanz und Verhüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF4","text":"Mitleidige Hilfe → Stolzverletzung, Schuld und Rachsucht → selbständige Aneignung, Freude und hartes Lager.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF5","text":"Kleine Gedanken und Gewissensbisse → verborgene Zersetzung → Vorrang offener Tat und vergrößerter Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF6","text":"Große Liebe übersteigt Vergebung und Mitleid → Liebe wird schöpferisch → Schaffende werden hart, Mitleid wird zur Wolke und zum Todesgrund Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME1","text":"Mitleid wird von einer Tugend zu einem möglichen Mechanismus der Beschämung, Abhängigkeit und Verletzung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME2","text":"Hilfe wird vom Akt des Gebenden auf die selbständige Aneignung durch den Empfänger verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME3","text":"Moralische Gefahr wird vom sichtbaren Fehltritt auf die unscheinbare, sich ausbreitende Innerlichkeit verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME4","text":"Freude wird als präventive Kraft gegen Schädigung klassifiziert, nicht als bloßer Gegensatz zum Leiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME5","text":"Liebe wird vertikal geordnet: Mitleid bildet die niedrigere, Schöpfung die höhere Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME6","text":"Distanz, Schweigen und Härte werden als ethische Medien neu klassifiziert, nicht als bloße Abwesenheit von Fürsorge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Rede verhandelt den Umgang mit Leidenden, Bettlern, Freunden, Schuld, Mitleid und Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Unterhalb dieser Gegenstände operiert ein Mechanismus aus Scham, Sichtbarkeit, Stolz, Verpflichtung, Rachsucht und Selbstaneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die moralische Strategie des Linderns durch eine Strategie der Distanz, der Freisetzung, der Freude und der schöpferischen Härte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Menschheitsgeschichte bewegt sich von der Scham über die Überwindung des Mitleids zur Möglichkeit des Schaffens; die theologische Zeit endet im Tod Gottes durch sein Mitleid mit den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Hauptbewegung von Scham über Mitleidskritik zu Distanz, Freude und schöpferischer Härte zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem positiven Kriterium hilfreiche Distanz von bloßer Gleichgültigkeit unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT3","text":"Eine interne Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Gebot, den Leidenden nicht zu beschämen, und der Behauptung, dass bereits das Sehen seines Leidens Scham erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT4","text":"Die Forderung nach Entfernung steht neben der Forderung nach einer Ruhestätte für den leidenden Freund, ohne die zulässige Nähe eindeutig zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT5","text":"Die Abschaffung der Bettler bleibt mit der Erlaubnis, dass Arme sich die Frucht selbst nehmen, institutionell unausgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT6","text":"Der Übergang von Freude und harter Hilfe zu Größe und Schöpfung wird behauptet, aber nicht als Verfahren spezifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT7","text":"Die Aussagen über Teufel, Gott und den Tod durch Mitleid schließen die Argumentation ab, werden jedoch metaphorisch und nicht kausal begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern seine Bildlogik als operative Begriffsmaschine und nicht als empirische Theorie gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194446175493Z_7d5e38aa","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Compassionate","source_sha256":"ba251cd5d75cd19e269c81f2f540195ca040ed33fa9ab8f65d6a302bc4eff546","sha256":"f846eb54b7e232755b9a9c61fd5ddb4612b86b7c58b8143efd45e104d66c8923","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:44:46.177692+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS1","text":"The discourse takes up the mocking speech about the human being as an animal and reverses its perspective: to the knower, human beings appear as animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS2","text":"It explains this animality through a history of shame, in which the human being is formed through repeated shaming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS3","text":"From shame follows a commandment not to shame, directed especially against dealings with sufferers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS4","text":"Compassion, however, is diagnosed as a shameless form of help that injures the sufferer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS5","text":"In place of compassionate proximity come distance, concealment, self-help, joy, and a hard form of assistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AS6","text":"The movement ends in a hierarchy in which great love surpasses compassion, seeks to create the beloved, and therefore demands hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A1","text":"The discourse posits the human being, from the perspective of the knower, as an animal with red cheeks marked by shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A2","text":"The history of the human being is determined as a history of repeated shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A3","text":"The noble person must not shame the sufferer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A4","text":"Whoever is blessed in fellow-suffering possesses too little shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A5","text":"Unavoidable compassion should neither become an identity nor be exercised in immediate proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A6","text":"Humanity has rejoiced too little; this poverty of joy is called original sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A7","text":"Learning greater joy diminishes the inclination to hurt others better than direct help does.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","text":"The perception of another's suffering produces shame, and help can injure the sufferer's pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A9","text":"Great obligations produce vindictiveness; a small benefaction that is not forgotten turns into a gnawing compulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A10","text":"A gift shames less when strangers and the poor take its fruit for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A11","text":"The discourse treats the figure of the beggar as a form of giving that generates annoyance both in the giver and in the refuser.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A12","text":"Pangs of conscience do not educate toward greatness, but toward biting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A13","text":"The small thought spreads concealed like a fungus and makes the whole body rotten; the evil deed openly speaks out its illness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A14","text":"Even one possessed by the devil can attain greatness if he enlarges his devil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A15","text":"Living together with human beings is difficult because of the difficulty of silence; transparency does not signify a real passage through the other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A16","text":"A hard, camp-bed-like resting place benefits the suffering friend more than a soft compassionate reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A17","text":"Great love overcomes forgiveness and compassion because it still seeks to create the beloved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:A18","text":"The creators are hard; compassion produces a heavy cloud and is represented as the cause of God's death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX1","text":"From the perspective of the knower, the human being is not fixed as a secure elevation above the animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX2","text":"Shame is not admitted as a justification for publicly shaming the sufferer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX3","text":"Compassion is not considered good merely because it seeks to alleviate suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX4","text":"Help is not necessarily beneficent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX5","text":"Obligation and gratitude are not acknowledged as harmless consequences of a gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX6","text":"Small thoughts are not accepted as a harmless preliminary stage or substitute for great evil deeds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX7","text":"Transparency is not equated with understanding or penetration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX8","text":"Forgiveness and compassion do not constitute the highest state of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:NX9","text":"Great love is not identified with softness, indulgence, or mere fellow-suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D1","text":"The human being becomes legible as an animal shaped by shame, whose anthropology is organized through a historical structure of shame.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A1","CH_97E9_VDM0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D2","text":"The protection of the sufferer demands a rejection of compassionate self-identification and a controlled distance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A3","CH_97E9_VDM0:A4","CH_97E9_VDM0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D3","text":"Joy becomes the preferred remedy against inflicting suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A6","CH_97E9_VDM0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D4","text":"Direct help can injure the sufferer doubly, by making his suffering visible and simultaneously placing him under an obligation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","CH_97E9_VDM0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D5","text":"An ethically gentler gift shifts the action from the giver to autonomous appropriation by the recipient.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A8","CH_97E9_VDM0:A9","CH_97E9_VDM0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D6","text":"Feelings of guilt and pangs of conscience produce no renewal, but reproduce an aggressive form of moral inwardness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A12","CH_97E9_VDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D7","text":"The discourse prefers the open, symptomatic deed to the concealed diminishment of thought.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D8","text":"Destructive forces should not necessarily be suppressed, but transformed into a possibility of greatness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A13","CH_97E9_VDM0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D9","text":"Useful assistance is determined as a silent, hard form of reception, not as the dissolution of suffering in soft sympathy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A15","CH_97E9_VDM0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:D10","text":"Love receives its highest rank only where it no longer forgives or feels compassion, but brings forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDM0:A17","CH_97E9_VDM0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD1","text":"The ethical criterion shifts from alleviating another's pain to avoiding shaming, obligation, and injury to pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD2","text":"The rejection of compassion does not produce pure indifference, but an alternative technique of assistance: distance, self-appropriation, and hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD3","text":"The system treats social injury not only as the consequence of visible deeds, but as the effect of guilt, gratitude, small thoughts, and concealed dependencies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD4","text":"The hierarchy of affects is as follows: compassion beneath forgiveness, forgiveness beneath creative love, creative love above hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD5","text":"When compassion is universalized, it transforms from a virtue into a metaphysical burden that darkens human beings and lets God die.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SD6","text":"Silence, distance, and non-shaming self-appropriation constitute a relational counter-order to compassionate transparency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that shared suffering itself forms a sufficient basis for ethical community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of equality in which giver and sufferer are symmetrically bound through open neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that a good intention guarantees the social effect of help.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a moral formation that attains greatness through remorse, pangs of conscience, or self-accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a neutral inner space in which small thoughts could remain without consequences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the notion that complete knowledge of the other produces proximity or penetration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX7","text":"Excluded is a final redemption through forgiveness, compassion, or the mere ending of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:DNX8","text":"Excluded is a soft model of creation in which bringing-forth would be possible without hardness, selection, or overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a universal order of beneficence in which giving and receiving function without shaming, guilt, and vindictiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a community whose primary binding agent is mutual compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a form of care that simultaneously guarantees immediate proximity, complete recognition, and uninjured pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a theological salvation whose ground lies in God's compassion for human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX5","text":"Unavailable is a reconciliation that can be concluded through forgiveness without passing over into creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:SNX6","text":"Unavailable is a greatness that realizes itself through sparing, smallness, or the suppression of contradictory forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS1","text":"Animal perspective of the knower → human being as an animal shaped by shame → anthropology as a history of shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS2","text":"History of shame → commandment not to shame → suspicion toward self-satisfied compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS3","text":"Compassionate help → visibility of suffering + injury to pride + obligation → vindictiveness, shame, and dependency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS4","text":"Danger of help → distance, concealment, and autonomous appropriation → assistance without open shaming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS5","text":"Small thoughts and pangs of conscience → concealed proliferation and moral aggression → priority of open symptoms and directed greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:FGS6","text":"Compassion beneath great love → love as creation → hardness of the creators and metaphysical rejection of compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF1","text":"Mockery of Zarathustra's animality → reversal of perspective → human beings appear as animals to the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF2","text":"Human being as an animal shaped by shame → history of shame → commandment not to shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF3","text":"Commandment not to shame → critique of self-sufficient compassion → distance and concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF4","text":"Compassionate help → injury to pride, guilt, and vindictiveness → autonomous appropriation, joy, and a hard resting place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF5","text":"Small thoughts and pangs of conscience → concealed decomposition → priority of open deed and enlarged force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:AF6","text":"Great love surpasses forgiveness and compassion → love becomes creative → creators become hard, compassion becomes a cloud and the ground of God's death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME1","text":"Compassion is remapped from a virtue into a possible mechanism of shaming, dependency, and injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME2","text":"Help is shifted from the act of the giver to autonomous appropriation by the recipient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME3","text":"Moral danger is relocated from visible misstep to inconspicuous, spreading inwardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME4","text":"Joy is classified as a preventive force against harm, not as a mere opposite of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME5","text":"Love is vertically ordered: compassion forms the lower, creation the higher form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ME6","text":"Distance, silence, and hardness are reclassified as ethical media, not as mere absences of care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The discourse addresses dealings with sufferers, beggars, friends, guilt, compassion, and love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Beneath these objects operates a mechanism of shame, visibility, pride, obligation, vindictiveness, and self-appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the moral strategy of alleviation with a strategy of distance, release, joy, and creative hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The history of humanity moves from shame through the overcoming of compassion toward the possibility of creation; theological time ends in God's death through his compassion for human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal movement from shame through the critique of compassion to distance, joy, and creative hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to what positive criterion helpful distance is distinguished from mere indifference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT3","text":"An internal tension remains between the commandment not to shame the sufferer and the assertion that the mere sight of his suffering produces shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT4","text":"The demand for distance stands alongside the demand for a resting place for the suffering friend, without unambiguously determining permissible proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT5","text":"The abolition of beggars remains institutionally unelaborated alongside the permission for the poor to take the fruit for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT6","text":"The transition from joy and hard help to greatness and creation is asserted, but not specified as a procedure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT7","text":"The statements concerning the devil, God, and death through compassion conclude the argument, but are grounded metaphorically rather than causally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDM0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement insofar as its image-logic is read as an operative conceptual machine rather than as an empirical theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDM0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDM0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDM0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 40","title":"On the Compassionate","context":"Chapter 40","original_title":"Von den Mitleidigen","original_context":"Chapter 40"},"original_title":"Von den Mitleidigen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Priests","order":41,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDP0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDP0@R001","sha256":"fae74fe267e48dd5d03083f0bc8546042c5643a1ce680223364a2c0845dd332d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS1","text":"Die Rede untersucht, warum die Priester zugleich Feinde, Leidensverursacher, Gefangene und Blutsverwandte sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS2","text":"Sie bestimmt die priesterliche Ordnung nicht als bloße Fremdherrschaft, sondern als Gefangenschaft durch falsche Werte, Wahn-Worte und deren institutionelle Verkörperung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS3","text":"Das Argument ist diagnostisch-genealogisch und strategisch: Es verfolgt die Entstehung des Erlösers aus Leiden, Lücken, Mitleid und Herdentrieb.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der taktischen Vermeidung des direkten Angriffs über die Diagnose religiöser Räume und Körper zur Demontage der Erlöserfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS5","text":"Blut, Feuer, Opfer und Überzeugungsintensität werden vom Wahrheitsbeweis zu Symptomen affektiver und geistiger Herkunft umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS6","text":"Freiheit erscheint als Befreiung von den Erlösern und von noch Größerem, bleibt jedoch ohne gegenwärtige Verkörperung durch einen Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","text":"Die Rede setzt die Priester zugleich als Zarathustras Feinde und Blutsverwandte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A2","text":"Übermäßiges Leiden verwandelt sich bei den Priestern in den Willen, andere leiden zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A3","text":"Ihre Demut ist rachsüchtig und verunreinigt denjenigen, der sie angreift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A4","text":"Der als Erlöser bezeichnete Ursprung schlägt die Priester in die Bande falscher Werte und Wahn-Worte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A5","text":"Falsche Werte und Wahn-Worte bilden schlafende Ungeheuer, die erwachen und die auf ihnen errichteten Hütten verschlingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A6","text":"Die kirchlichen Höhlen erzeugen verfälschtes Licht und versumpfte Luft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A7","text":"Der priesterliche Glaube ersetzt freie Aufwärtsbewegung durch kniende Buße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A8","text":"Die Priester nennen Gott, was ihnen widerspricht und wehtut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A9","text":"Ihre Anbetung schlägt den Menschen ans Kreuz und organisiert das Leben als Leichnam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A10","text":"Die Erlöser bestehen aus geistigen Lücken, die mit Wahn gefüllt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A11","text":"Im Mitleiden der Erlöser ertrinkt der Geist, während eine große Torheit an der Oberfläche bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A12","text":"Die priesterlichen Hirten treiben ihre Herde über einen einzigen Weg, als gäbe es zur Zukunft nur einen Steg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A13","text":"Diese Hirten gehören trotz ihrer Hirtenrolle selbst noch zur Herde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A14","text":"Blutzeichen und Feuerleiden beweisen die Wahrheit einer Lehre nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A15","text":"Der Weg zur Freiheit verlangt die Befreiung auch von dem, was größer als alle Erlöser ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A16","text":"Die Rede behauptet, dass es noch keinen Übermenschen gegeben hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A17","text":"Auch der größte Mensch bleibt allzumenschlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A18","text":"Die Geltung eines Erlösers soll sich an der erlösten Erscheinung und Schönheit seiner Jünger zeigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX1","text":"Die Priester sind nicht einfach äußerliche oder wesensfremde Feinde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX2","text":"Priesterliche Demut ist nicht harmlos, selbstlos oder friedfertig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX3","text":"Falsche Werte und Wahn-Worte sind keine neutralen Deutungen, sondern Gefangenschaftsmittel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX4","text":"Die Kirche ist keine offene Stätte des Lichts, sondern eine süßduftende Höhle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX5","text":"Religiöse Aufwärtsbewegung ist keine freie Erhebung, sondern kniende Buße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX6","text":"Der priesterliche Gott ist kein unabhängiger Maßstab jenseits des menschlichen Schmerzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX7","text":"Priesterliches Leben ist nicht lebensbejahende Verkörperung, sondern an Leichnam und Todtenkammer gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX8","text":"Blut ist kein verlässlicher Zeuge der Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX9","text":"Selbstverbrennung, Opfer und Leiden verleihen einer Lehre keinen Wahrheitsstatus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX10","text":"Der Erlöser ist weder aus Freiheit noch aus vollendeter Erkenntnis hervorgegangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX11","text":"Der Weg der Herde ist nicht notwendig der einzige Weg in die Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX12","text":"Ein Erlöser ist weder ein Übermensch noch eine bereits verwirklichte Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D1","text":"Der direkte Angriff auf die Priester wird strategisch unwirksam, weil ihre rachsüchtige Demut den Angreifer in ihre eigene Unreinheit hineinzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D2","text":"Die Priesterkritik bleibt durch Blutsverwandtschaft und geteiltes Leiden an ihr Objekt gebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D3","text":"Der Erlöser erzeugt keine Befreiung, sondern eine verzögerte Gefangenschaft, deren falsche Werte später ihre eigenen Träger verschlingen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A4","CH_97E9_VDP0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D4","text":"Die religiöse Institution verwandelt den Anspruch auf geistige Höhe in räumliche Enge, verfälschtes Licht und körperliche Unterwerfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A6","CH_97E9_VDP0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D5","text":"Wenn Gott als Name des Widerspruchs und Schmerzes fungiert, wird Anbetung zur religiösen Form von Ressentiment und Menschenfeindlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A8","CH_97E9_VDP0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D6","text":"Die Erlöserfigur erscheint als Kompensation geistiger Leere durch Wahn und als Ergebnis eines im Mitleid ertrinkenden Geistes.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A10","CH_97E9_VDP0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D7","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Hirten und Schafen zerfällt, weil die Führenden die Herdhaftigkeit selbst reproduzieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A12","CH_97E9_VDP0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D8","text":"Blutzeugnis und Feuermartyrium steigern Wahn und Hass, ohne die Wahrheit der Lehre zu begründen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D9","text":"Freiheit wird nicht als Besitz eines Erlösers, sondern als fortgesetzte Befreiung von Erlösern und übergeordneten Autoritäten bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D10","text":"Die behauptete Erlösung muss sich an der sichtbaren Gestalt ihrer Jünger bewähren und nicht an der Intensität ihres Opfers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A14","CH_97E9_VDP0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D11","text":"Die Abwesenheit des Übermenschen verhindert, dass die Freiheit auf ein gegenwärtig verfügbares menschliches Vorbild gestützt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A16","CH_97E9_VDP0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD1","text":"Die Priesterkritik kann das Objekt nicht äußerlich bekämpfen, weil Feindschaft, Verwandtschaft, Mitleid und strategische Zurückhaltung in derselben Beziehung verschränkt sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D1","CH_97E9_VDP0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD2","text":"Erlösung wird als ein zusammenhängender Mechanismus der Gefangenschaft reorganisiert: falsche Werte erzeugen Räume, Räume erzeugen Körperhaltungen, Körperhaltungen reproduzieren Tod und Herdentrieb.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D3","CH_97E9_VDP0:D4","CH_97E9_VDP0:D5","CH_97E9_VDP0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD3","text":"Die Rede kehrt den Wahrheitsapparat um, indem sie Blut, Feuer und Opfer als Symptome der Herkunft einer Lehre und die sichtbare Wirkung auf ihre Jünger als ihr entscheidendes Prüfmaß behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D8","CH_97E9_VDP0:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD4","text":"Freiheit erhält eine negative und offene Form: Sie besteht im Überwinden der Erlöser, ohne durch eine bereits vorhandene höhere Gestalt abgeschlossen zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D9","CH_97E9_VDP0:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD5","text":"Das System kann die Erlöser aus Mitleid kritisieren, ohne selbst außerhalb jeder affektiven Bindung zu stehen; dadurch bleibt die Grenze zwischen rettender Anteilnahme und lähmendem Mitleid instabil.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A2","CH_97E9_VDP0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX1","text":"Das Argument schließt stillschweigend aus, dass die Priester als vollständig äußerer Gegner behandelt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Leiden, Opferbereitschaft oder affektive Intensität eine Lehre epistemisch legitimieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass institutionelle Abgeschlossenheit einen gültigen Weg zur geistigen Höhe bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass ein Erlöser unabhängig von den Wirkungen auf seine Jünger als erlöst gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass ein gegenwärtiger Mensch die endgültige Gestalt der Freiheit verkörpert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass ein sauberer Gegenangriff die priesterliche Ordnung von außen auflösen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX1","text":"Eine bereits verfügbare, positiv abgeschlossene Freiheit steht dem Argument nicht zur Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX2","text":"Ein letzter Garant von Wahrheit fehlt, weil Gott, Erlöser, Blut, Feuer und Opfer nacheinander als unzureichende Garantien entfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX3","text":"Eine vollständig reine Außenposition fehlt, weil der Kritiker durch Verwandtschaft, Mitleid und gemeinsames Blut an das Kritisierte gebunden bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX4","text":"Eine positive Gestalt nach der Erlösung wird nicht ausgearbeitet; die Freiheit wird vornehmlich durch das bezeichnet, wovon sie sich lösen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS1","text":"Feindschaft + Blutsverwandtschaft → Nicht-Externalisierung des Gegners → taktisches Vorübergehen statt unmittelbarem Angriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS2","text":"Übermäßiges Leiden → rachsüchtige Demut → Weitergabe des Leidens an andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS3","text":"Erlöseranspruch → falsche Werte und Wahn-Worte → Gefangenschaft → schlafende Werte-Monster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS4","text":"Gefangenschaft → Kirche als Höhle → verfälschtes Licht und versumpfte Luft → kniende statt freie Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS5","text":"Geistige Lücke + Mitleid + heißes Herz/kalter Kopf → Erlöser als Brausewind → Herdentrieb und Einweg-Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS6","text":"Blutzeichen oder Feuerleiden → gesteigerter Wahn und Hass; nicht Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS7","text":"Sichtbare Gestalt der Jünger → Prüfung des Erlösungsanspruchs durch seine Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS8","text":"Befreiung von Erlösern und Übergeordnetem → kein vorhandener Übermensch → Freiheit als unvollendeter Horizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AF1","text":"Priesterbegegnung → Doppelstatus von Feind und Verwandtem → taktische Angriffssperre → Schmerz und Mitleid → Erlöser als Gefangenmacher → Kirche als Höhle und Todesraum → genealogische Analyse des Erlösers → Entwertung von Blut und Feuer als Wahrheitsbeweisen → Freiheit als Befreiung von Erlösern → offener Horizont ohne Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignme