gh","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME1","text":"Die Priester werden von einer fremden Feindgruppe zu einer innerlich verwandten und selbst gefangenen Formation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME2","text":"Die Kirche wird vom möglichen Heilraum zur Architektur von Scham, Enge, Unterwerfung und Tod umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME3","text":"Der Erlöser wird vom Problemlöser zum Symptom geistiger Lücke und zum Produzenten neuer Gefangenschaft umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME4","text":"Blut, Feuer und Opfer werden aus der Wahrheitsordnung in die Ordnung affektiver Herkunft und ideologischer Verstärkung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Hirte und Herde bricht zusammen, weil Führung als verfeinerte Herdhaftigkeit sichtbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME6","text":"Freiheit wird nicht mehr als Ankunft bei einem positiven Retter, sondern als offene Bewegung des Loswerdens kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Priester, Kirchen, Gott, Erlöser, Jünger und Übermensch bilden die explizite Figurenordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Leiden, falsche Werte, Wahn-Worte, institutionelle Räume, Herdentrieb und Wahrheitsbeweise bilden den reproduktiven Mechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Rede ersetzt unmittelbare Bekämpfung durch Diagnose, Wirkungskritik und eine Umordnung der Kriterien von Wahrheit und Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Falsche Werte schlafen, erwachen und verschlingen; der Übermensch bleibt zukünftig oder abwesend, während Freiheit als noch nicht abgeschlossene Bewegung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Priesterbegegnung über die Gefangenschaftsdiagnose bis zur offenen Freiheitsforderung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche positive Gestalt Freiheit, Schönheit und der reine Himmel nach dem Bruch der priesterlichen Ordnung annehmen sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT3","text":"Die negative Diagnose ist intern geschlossen: Erlöser, Institution, Opfer und Wahrheitsbeweis werden in einem gemeinsamen Gefangenschaftsmechanismus verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen politisch-strategischer Zurückhaltung, genealogischer Erlöserkritik und epistemischer Entwertung des Blutzeugnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an metaphorischen Strukturträgern wie Höhle, Leichnam, Ungeheuer und Brausewind, deren genaue begriffliche Übersetzung nicht vollständig formalisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung bleibt ungelöst: Mitleid wird als geistzerstörende Grundlage der Erlöser kritisiert, während die Priester dennoch aus Mitleid und Verwandtschaft heraus beurteilt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT7","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie entsteht daraus, dass Freiheit von einem höheren Maßstab abhängt, während kein gegenwärtiger Übermensch als Träger dieses Maßstabs existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern der Endpunkt nicht als positive Lösung, sondern als bewusst unverkörperte und negative Öffnung rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194603582398Z_30cfb56f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Priests","source_sha256":"fae74fe267e48dd5d03083f0bc8546042c5643a1ce680223364a2c0845dd332d","sha256":"ff1ee7b851f6846537f7878ede40b15300d7700c672c37f212afcdeb91701496","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:46:03.584131+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS1","text":"The discourse examines why the priests are at once enemies, inflicters of suffering, prisoners, and blood relatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS2","text":"It determines the priestly order not as mere foreign domination, but as captivity through false values, delusion-words, and their institutional embodiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS3","text":"The argument is diagnostic-genealogical and strategic: it traces the emergence of the redeemer from suffering, gaps, pity, and herd instinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from the tactical avoidance of direct attack through the diagnosis of religious spaces and bodies to the dismantling of the figure of the redeemer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS5","text":"Blood, fire, sacrifice, and intensity of conviction are recoded from proof of truth into symptoms of affective and spiritual origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AS6","text":"Freedom appears as liberation from the redeemers and from something still greater, yet remains without present embodiment through an overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","text":"The discourse posits the priests simultaneously as Zarathustra's enemies and blood relatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A2","text":"Excessive suffering is transformed among the priests into the will to make others suffer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A3","text":"Their humility is vindictive and contaminates the one who attacks it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A4","text":"The origin designated as redeemer casts the priests into the bonds of false values and delusion-words.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A5","text":"False values and delusion-words form sleeping monsters that awaken and devour the huts built upon them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A6","text":"The churchly caves produce falsified light and swampy air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A7","text":"Priestly faith replaces free upward movement with kneeling penance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A8","text":"The priests call God whatever contradicts and hurts them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A9","text":"Their worship nails the human being to the cross and organizes life as a corpse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A10","text":"The redeemers consist of spiritual gaps filled with delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A11","text":"In the fellow-suffering of the redeemers, the spirit drowns, while a great folly remains on the surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A12","text":"The priestly shepherds drive their flock along a single path, as though there were only one footbridge to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A13","text":"Despite their role as shepherds, these shepherds themselves still belong to the flock.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A14","text":"Signs of blood and suffering by fire do not prove the truth of a doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A15","text":"The path to freedom demands liberation also from that which is greater than all redeemers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A16","text":"The discourse asserts that there has not yet been an overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A17","text":"Even the greatest human being remains all-too-human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:A18","text":"The validity of a redeemer is to show itself in the redeemed appearance and beauty of his disciples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX1","text":"The priests are not simply external or essentially alien enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX2","text":"Priestly humility is not harmless, selfless, or peaceable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX3","text":"False values and delusion-words are not neutral interpretations, but means of captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX4","text":"The church is not an open place of light, but a sweet-smelling cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX5","text":"Religious upward movement is not free elevation, but kneeling penance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX6","text":"The priestly God is not an independent standard beyond human pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX7","text":"Priestly life is not life-affirming embodiment, but is bound to corpse and mortuary chamber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX8","text":"Blood is not a reliable witness of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX9","text":"Self-immolation, sacrifice, and suffering confer no status of truth upon a doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX10","text":"The redeemer has emerged neither from freedom nor from completed knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX11","text":"The path of the flock is not necessarily the only path into the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:NX12","text":"A redeemer is neither an overman nor an already realized freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D1","text":"Direct attack upon the priests becomes strategically ineffective because their vindictive humility draws the attacker into their own impurity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D2","text":"The critique of the priests remains bound to its object through blood kinship and shared suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D3","text":"The redeemer produces not liberation, but a delayed captivity whose false values later devour their own bearers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A4","CH_97E9_VDP0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D4","text":"The religious institution transforms the claim to spiritual height into spatial narrowness, falsified light, and bodily subjection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A6","CH_97E9_VDP0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D5","text":"When God functions as the name of contradiction and pain, worship becomes the religious form of ressentiment and hostility toward human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A8","CH_97E9_VDP0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D6","text":"The figure of the redeemer appears as compensation for spiritual emptiness through delusion and as the result of a spirit drowning in pity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A10","CH_97E9_VDP0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D7","text":"The distinction between shepherds and sheep collapses because the leaders themselves reproduce herdness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A12","CH_97E9_VDP0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D8","text":"Testimony in blood and martyrdom by fire intensify delusion and hatred without establishing the truth of the doctrine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D9","text":"Freedom is determined not as the possession of a redeemer, but as continuing liberation from redeemers and higher authorities.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D10","text":"The claimed redemption must prove itself in the visible form of its disciples and not in the intensity of their sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A14","CH_97E9_VDP0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:D11","text":"The absence of the overman prevents freedom from being supported by a presently available human exemplar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A16","CH_97E9_VDP0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD1","text":"The critique of the priests cannot combat the object externally, because enmity, kinship, pity, and strategic restraint are intertwined in the same relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D1","CH_97E9_VDP0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD2","text":"Redemption is reorganized as a connected mechanism of captivity: false values produce spaces, spaces produce bodily postures, bodily postures reproduce death and herd instinct.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D3","CH_97E9_VDP0:D4","CH_97E9_VDP0:D5","CH_97E9_VDP0:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD3","text":"The discourse reverses the apparatus of truth by treating blood, fire, and sacrifice as symptoms of the origin of a doctrine, and the visible effect upon its disciples as its decisive measure of testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D8","CH_97E9_VDP0:D10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD4","text":"Freedom assumes a negative and open form: it consists in overcoming the redeemers without being completed by an already existing higher figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:D9","CH_97E9_VDP0:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SD5","text":"The system can criticize the redeemers out of pity without itself standing outside every affective bond; thereby the boundary between saving participation and paralysing pity remains unstable.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDP0:A1","CH_97E9_VDP0:A2","CH_97E9_VDP0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX1","text":"The argument tacitly excludes the possibility that the priests can be treated as a wholly external opponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that suffering, willingness to sacrifice, or affective intensity epistemically legitimate a doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that institutional closure constitutes a valid path to spiritual height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that a redeemer can count as redeemed independently of the effects upon his disciples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that a present human being embodies the final form of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that a clean counterattack can dissolve the priestly order from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX1","text":"An already available, positively completed freedom is not available to the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX2","text":"A final guarantor of truth is absent, because God, redeemer, blood, fire, and sacrifice successively fall away as inadequate guarantors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX3","text":"A wholly pure external position is absent, because the critic remains bound to what is criticized through kinship, pity, and common blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:SNX4","text":"A positive figure after redemption is not elaborated; freedom is designated chiefly through that from which it must detach itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS1","text":"Enmity + blood kinship → non-externalization of the opponent → tactical passing-by instead of immediate attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS2","text":"Excessive suffering → vindictive humility → transmission of suffering to others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS3","text":"Claim to be redeemer → false values and delusion-words → captivity → sleeping value-monsters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS4","text":"Captivity → church as cave → falsified light and swampy air → kneeling rather than free movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS5","text":"Spiritual gap + pity + hot heart/cold head → redeemer as gust of wind → herd instinct and one-way future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS6","text":"Sign of blood or suffering by fire → intensified delusion and hatred; not truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS7","text":"Visible form of the disciples → testing of the claim to redemption through its effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:FGS8","text":"Liberation from redeemers and what is higher → no existing overman → freedom as unfinished horizon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AF1","text":"Encounter with priests → dual status as enemy and relative → tactical prohibition of attack → pain and pity → redeemer as maker of prisoners → church as cave and space of death → genealogical analysis of the redeemer → devaluation of blood and fire as proofs of truth → freedom as liberation from redeemers → open horizon without overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:AF2","text":"External opponent → inwardly shared captivity → institutionalized shame → herd-based redemption → epistemic reversal → negative determination of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME1","text":"The priests are remapped from an alien enemy group into an inwardly related and themselves captive formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME2","text":"The church is reclassified from a possible space of salvation into an architecture of shame, constriction, subjection, and death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME3","text":"The redeemer is recoded from problem-solver into a symptom of spiritual gap and a producer of new captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME4","text":"Blood, fire, and sacrifice are displaced from the order of truth into the order of affective origin and ideological intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME5","text":"The opposition between shepherd and flock collapses because leadership becomes visible as refined herdness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ME6","text":"Freedom is no longer mapped as arrival at a positive savior, but as the open movement of breaking free.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT1","text":"Surface: priests, churches, God, redeemers, disciples, and overman form the explicit order of figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT2","text":"Structural: suffering, false values, delusion-words, institutional spaces, herd instinct, and proofs of truth form the reproductive mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: the discourse replaces immediate combat with diagnosis, critique of effects, and a reordering of the criteria of truth and freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: false values sleep, awaken, and devour; the overman remains future or absent, while freedom appears as a movement not yet completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the encounter with the priests through the diagnosis of captivity to the open demand for freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what positive form freedom, beauty, and the pure sky are to assume after the break with the priestly order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT3","text":"The negative diagnosis is internally closed: redeemer, institution, sacrifice, and proof of truth are joined in a common mechanism of captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between political-strategic restraint, genealogical critique of the redeemer, and epistemic devaluation of testimony in blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on metaphorical structural bearers such as cave, corpse, monster, and gust of wind, whose exact conceptual translation is not fully formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT6","text":"The central tension remains unresolved: pity is criticized as the spirit-destroying basis of the redeemers, while the priests are nevertheless judged from pity and kinship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT7","text":"A second line of rupture arises from the fact that freedom depends on a higher standard, while no present overman exists as bearer of that standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDP0:MRT8","text":"The actual movement of the argument remains preserved insofar as the endpoint is reconstructed not as a positive solution, but as a deliberately unembodied and negative opening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDP0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDP0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDP0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 41","title":"On the Priests","context":"Chapter 41","original_title":"Von den Priestern","original_context":"Chapter 41"},"original_title":"Von den Priestern","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Virtuous","order":42,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDT0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDT0@R001","sha256":"733a76e7a3f805715fc465dab12be4d45ef10f14820ad588dc5aa13659f7b40e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist eine Tugendauffassung, die moralisches Handeln als Anspruch auf Lohn, Himmel, Vergeltung oder Strafe organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS2","text":"Diese Auffassung wird als fingierte Lohn- und Strafökonomie diagnostiziert, die in Welt und Seele projiziert worden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS3","text":"Die Diagnose verschiebt die Aufmerksamkeit vom moralischen Wort auf die verborgenen Kräfte, Bedürfnisse und Funktionen seines Ursprungs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS4","text":"Die verschiedenen Erscheinungen der Tugend werden genealogisch als heterogene und häufig verkleidete Triebe auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS5","text":"Tugend wird positiv als Selbst im Handeln bestimmt, nicht als fremde Bemäntelung, Selbstlosigkeit oder äußerlich kompensierbare Leistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS6","text":"Die Wirkung der Tugend überschreitet den abgeschlossenen Akt und bleibt als fortwanderndes Licht zeitlich wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS7","text":"Die argumentative Bewegung endet nicht in einer allgemeinen Definition, sondern in der Erschöpfung alter Moralwörter und ihrer Ersetzung durch die Formel des im Handeln gegenwärtigen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","text":"Tugendhafte verlangen für ihre Tugend Lohn, Zahlung, Himmel oder Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A2","text":"Lohn und Strafe sind in den Grund der Dinge und in den Grund der Seelen hineingelogen worden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","text":"Es gibt keinen Lohn- und Zahlmeister, der Tugend vergütet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A4","text":"Tugend ist nicht ihr eigener Lohn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","text":"Wahre Tugend ist das Selbst des Handelnden und keine fremde Hülle oder Bemäntelung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A6","text":"Wahre Tugend wird als eigenes Selbst geliebt und nicht wegen einer Zahlung vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A7","text":"Das Licht eines tugendhaften Werkes bleibt nach dessen Vollendung wirksam und wandert weiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","text":"Das Wort Tugend bezeichnet unterschiedliche und nicht notwendig zusammengehörige Triebe, Zustände und Verhaltensformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","text":"Ein als Tugend bezeichnetes Verhalten kann der Ausdruck eines fremden Zwangs, eines Lasters, einer Hemmung, einer Gewohnheit oder eines sozialen Mechanismus sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A10","text":"Gerechtigkeit kann als sprachliche Form von Rache und Erniedrigung fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","text":"Die gewöhnlichen Worte von Tugend, Gut und Böse stammen aus einer überlieferten Sprache der Lügner und Narren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A12","text":"Die verborgenen Gründe einer Seele müssen aufgerissen werden, damit Wahrheit und Lüge voneinander geschieden werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A13","text":"Die leise Stimme der Schönheit erreicht die aufgeweckten Seelen, während laute Zeichen auf schlafende Sinne zielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX1","text":"Tugend ist keine Tauschbeziehung zwischen Handlung und Belohnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX2","text":"Tugend wird nicht durch einen kosmischen oder psychischen Zahlmeister garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX3","text":"Tugend ist weder durch äußeren Lohn noch durch den Satz von der Tugend als eigenem Lohn begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX4","text":"Tugend ist keine Selbstlosigkeit, in der das Selbst aus der Handlung entfernt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX5","text":"Tugend ist keine fremde Maske, Bemäntelung oder Überlagerung des Handelnden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX6","text":"Tugend ist kein durch Peitsche, Zwang oder Krampf erzeugtes Verhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX7","text":"Tugend ist weder das Faulwerden von Lastern noch der religiös erleuchtete Abstieg in die eigene Niedrigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX8","text":"Tugend ist weder Hemmschuh, mechanisches Tiktak, bloße Gebärde, defensive Passivität noch die Befürwortung von Polizei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX9","text":"Tugend ist keine Handvoll persönlicher Gerechtigkeit, mit der die Welt verurteilt, gerächt oder andere erniedrigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX10","text":"Tugend ist weder der böse Blick auf das Niedrige noch ein beliebiges Verlangen nach Aufrichtung oder Umsturz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX11","text":"Tugend ist nicht durch die bloße Kenntnis oder Behauptung von Gut und Böse gesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX12","text":"Die Kritik besteht nicht darin, allen Tugendsprechern lediglich ihr Wissen abzusprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D1","text":"Die Forderung nach Lohn enthüllt Tugend als moralische Buchführung statt als autonome Wertquelle.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","CH_97E9_VDT0:A2","CH_97E9_VDT0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D2","text":"Wenn Tugend weder vergütet noch als eigener Lohn begründet wird, kann ihr Wert nicht aus einer Gegenleistung stammen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","CH_97E9_VDT0:A4","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D3","text":"Die Echtheit einer Handlung hängt daran, ob das Selbst in ihr gegenwärtig ist und nicht durch eine moralische Fremdform ersetzt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D4","text":"Der gemeinsame Name Tugend verdeckt eine Vielzahl gegensätzlicher psychischer und sozialer Funktionen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D5","text":"Der Anspruch auf Gerechtigkeit kann als nachträgliche Legitimierung von Rache und Erniedrigung erkannt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D6","text":"Ein tugendhaftes Werk ist nicht auf den Zeitpunkt seiner Ausführung beschränkt, weil seine Wirkung über den abgeschlossenen Akt hinausreicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D7","text":"Die Kritik muss die verborgenen Seelengründe freilegen, statt die überlieferten Moralwörter lediglich durch neue Behauptungen zu ersetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D8","text":"Die angemessene Erneuerung der Tugendsprache besteht in der Bestimmung des Selbst als im Handeln gegenwärtig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine transzendente Vergütungsordnung durch eine immanente Ordnung der Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD2","text":"Moralische Begriffe werden von normativen Etiketten in genealogische Indikatoren verborgener Kräfte und Funktionen umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A10","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD3","text":"Handlung wird als zeitlich ausgedehnter Prozess bestimmt, dessen Wirkung nicht mit dem Ende der Handlung abgeschlossen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD4","text":"Die Kritik operiert zugleich durch sanfte Erweckung und gewaltsame Freilegung: Schönheit öffnet, der Pflug trennt Wahrheit von Lüge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A12","CH_97E9_VDT0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD5","text":"Die moralische Behauptung von Gerechtigkeit kann selbst zur Produktion von Ungerechtigkeit, Rache und Erniedrigung beitragen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD6","text":"Die Einheit der Tugend wird nicht vorausgesetzt, sondern erst durch die Entfernung heterogener und verkleideter Motivstrukturen problematisch gemacht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine transzendente Moralökonomie aus, in der jede Tugendhandlung durch einen übergeordneten Verwalter ausgeglichen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, das Wort Tugend besitze unabhängig von seinen Trägern eine einheitliche und selbstverständliche Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Trennung von Tugend und Psychologie aus; jede Tugendform muss auf einen Antrieb, eine Bedürfnisstruktur oder eine Funktion zurückgeführt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass moralische Selbstbezeichnungen ihre Wahrheit durch bloße Benennung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX5","text":"Es schließt ein geschlossenes Modell der Handlung aus, in dem mit dem Abschluss des Werkes auch dessen Wirkung und Bedeutung enden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine moralische Autorität aus, die über Gut und Böse urteilen könnte, ohne selbst in überlieferten Interessen, Trieben oder sprachlichen Masken zu stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Welt als vollständig verrechenbare Ordnung von Leistung, Schuld, Lohn und Strafe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine gemeinsame Moralgrammatik, deren Wörter ohne genealogische Prüfung Wahrheit garantieren könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer vom Selbst ablösbaren, rein selbstlosen Tugendhandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die endgültige Stillstellung des Werkes in einer abgeschlossenen moralischen Bilanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS1","text":"Wahrnehmung wird nach Empfänglichkeit geteilt: schlafende Sinne verlangen Donner, aufgeweckte Seelen empfangen die leise Stimme der Schönheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS2","text":"Die Forderung nach Vergütung wird als Eingangssymptom einer fingierten moralischen Ökonomie identifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS3","text":"Die moralische Oberfläche wird aufgerissen, indem ihre verborgenen Seelengründe freigelegt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS4","text":"Nach der Freilegung werden scheinbare Tugenden in unterschiedliche Triebe, Zwänge, Gewohnheiten, Ressentiments und sozialen Funktionen zerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS5","text":"Die negative Reinigung erzeugt ein positives Kriterium: Tugend ist nur dort authentisch, wo das Selbst in der Handlung gegenwärtig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS6","text":"Die Handlung wird temporal erweitert, indem ihr Licht auch nach dem Abschluss, Vergessen oder Tod des Werkes weiterwandert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS7","text":"Die gewonnene Unterscheidung wird pädagogisch geschlossen, indem die alten Wörter erschöpft und durch die Formel des Selbst-im-Handeln ersetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AF1","text":"Lohnforderung → Entlarvung der Lohn- und Straflüge → Aufreißen der Seelengründe → Zerlegung falscher Tugendformen → Freilegung des Selbst als Handlungskriterium → Fortwirken des Werkes über seinen Abschluss hinaus → Erschöpfung der alten Moralwörter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AF2","text":"Überlieferte Tugendformeln → Verwechslung von Selbstlosigkeit und Tugend → Rückführung auf das im Handeln gegenwärtige Selbst → neue, nicht verrechenbare Bestimmung der Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME1","text":"Tugend wird von einer vergütbaren Leistung in eine Form der Selbstgegenwart im Handeln umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME2","text":"Der einheitliche Gegenstand Tugend zerfällt in eine Karte heterogener psychischer und sozialer Mechanismen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME3","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird mit ihrer möglichen Funktion als Rache- und Erniedrigungsinstrument kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME4","text":"Die Handlung wird nicht mehr punktuell, sondern als fortwirkende zeitliche Strahlung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Tugend und Laster wird durch die Untersuchung ihrer verdeckten Ursprünge destabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME6","text":"Moralische Sprache wird von einem Benennungssystem zu einem diagnostischen Feld der Kräfte, Masken und Funktionen umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Sichtbar ist der Streit um Lohn, Strafe, Vergeltung, Gerechtigkeit und die Bedeutung des Wortes Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Darunter liegt ein Mechanismus der Projektion, Verkleidung und sozialen Regulierung, durch den heterogene Triebe als Tugend erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die moralische Auseinandersetzung wird von der Widerlegung einzelner Sprecher auf die Erschöpfung und Ersetzung eines ganzen Vokabulars verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit wird als nicht verrechenbare Selbstwerdung im Handeln und als fortwirkende Bewegung des Werkes über seinen Abschluss hinaus bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Lohnforderung über die Entlarvung bis zur positiven Bestimmung des Selbst im Handeln zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch das wahre Selbst von einem bloß behaupteten oder aggressiv durchgesetzten Selbst unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das fortwandernde Licht eine kausale Wirkung, eine Erinnerung oder eine ontologische Eigenschaft des Werkes bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT4","text":"Die interne Logik ist dort kohärent, wo externe Vergütung durch immanente Selbstgegenwart ersetzt und die Handlung zeitlich erweitert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht zwischen der Zurückweisung jeder moralischen Verrechnung und der Behauptung einer verbindlichen Wahrheit aus dem Grund der Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der leisen, nicht erzwingbaren Stimme der Schönheit und der gewaltsamen Bildlichkeit des Aufreißens, Pflügens und Zerbrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT7","text":"Die Taxonomie der falschen Tugenden besitzt hohe diagnostische Kraft, wird aber stärker rhetorisch vorgeführt als formal aus einem unabhängigen Kriterium abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die positive Formel des Selbst im Handeln nicht von der negativen Demontage der Moralökonomie getrennt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194744986834Z_8a131ec2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Virtuous","source_sha256":"733a76e7a3f805715fc465dab12be4d45ef10f14820ad588dc5aa13659f7b40e","sha256":"5b55d6f1523b84f08bbedbafc7882e9d925e24e52894b0819f2a71860b227ac0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:47:44.989358+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS1","text":"The problem is a conception of virtue that organizes moral action as a claim to reward, heaven, retribution, or punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS2","text":"This conception is diagnosed as a fabricated economy of reward and punishment that has been projected into the world and the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS3","text":"The diagnosis shifts attention from the moral word to the hidden forces, needs, and functions of its origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS4","text":"The various manifestations of virtue are genealogically dismantled as heterogeneous and often disguised drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS5","text":"Virtue is positively determined as the self in action, not as an alien covering, selflessness, or an achievement externally compensable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS6","text":"The effect of virtue exceeds the completed act and remains temporally efficacious as a light that continues to travel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AS7","text":"The argumentative movement ends not in a general definition, but in the exhaustion of old moral words and their replacement by the formula of the self present in action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","text":"The virtuous demand reward, payment, heaven, or eternity for their virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A2","text":"Reward and punishment have been lied into the ground of things and into the ground of souls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","text":"There is no rewarder and paymaster who recompenses virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A4","text":"Virtue is not its own reward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","text":"True virtue is the self of the agent and no alien shell or cloak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A6","text":"True virtue is loved as one's own self and is not performed for the sake of a payment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A7","text":"The light of a virtuous work remains efficacious after its completion and travels onward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","text":"The word virtue designates different drives, states, and modes of conduct that do not necessarily belong together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","text":"Conduct designated as virtue can be the expression of an alien compulsion, a vice, an inhibition, a habit, or a social mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A10","text":"Justice can function as a linguistic form of revenge and humiliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","text":"The customary words virtue, good, and evil derive from a transmitted language of liars and fools.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A12","text":"The hidden grounds of a soul must be torn open so that truth and lie can be separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:A13","text":"The quiet voice of beauty reaches awakened souls, while loud signs aim at sleeping senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX1","text":"Virtue is not an exchange relation between action and reward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX2","text":"Virtue is not guaranteed by a cosmic or psychic paymaster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX3","text":"Virtue is founded neither by external reward nor by the proposition that virtue is its own reward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX4","text":"Virtue is not selflessness in which the self is removed from the action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX5","text":"Virtue is not an alien mask, cloak, or overlay of the agent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX6","text":"Virtue is not conduct produced by whip, compulsion, or cramp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX7","text":"Virtue is neither the growing lazy of vices nor the religiously enlightened descent into one's own lowliness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX8","text":"Virtue is neither an impediment, mechanical tick-tock, mere gesture, defensive passivity, nor the advocacy of police.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX9","text":"Virtue is not a handful of personal justice with which the world is condemned, avenged, or others humiliated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX10","text":"Virtue is neither the evil eye cast upon the lowly nor any arbitrary desire for elevation or overthrow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX11","text":"Virtue is not secured by mere knowledge or assertion of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:NX12","text":"The critique does not consist in merely denying all speakers of virtue their knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D1","text":"The demand for reward reveals virtue as moral bookkeeping rather than as an autonomous source of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","CH_97E9_VDT0:A2","CH_97E9_VDT0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D2","text":"If virtue is neither recompensed nor founded as its own reward, its value cannot derive from a return service.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","CH_97E9_VDT0:A4","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D3","text":"The authenticity of an action depends on whether the self is present in it and is not replaced by a moral alien form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D4","text":"The common name virtue conceals a multiplicity of opposed psychic and social functions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D5","text":"The claim to justice can be recognized as a retrospective legitimization of revenge and humiliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D6","text":"A virtuous work is not confined to the moment of its execution, because its effect extends beyond the completed act.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D7","text":"Critique must uncover the hidden grounds of the soul instead of merely replacing the transmitted moral words with new assertions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:D8","text":"The appropriate renewal of the language of virtue consists in determining the self as present in action.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD1","text":"The system replaces a transcendent order of recompense with an immanent order of self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A1","CH_97E9_VDT0:A3","CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD2","text":"Moral concepts are recoded from normative labels into genealogical indicators of hidden forces and functions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A10","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD3","text":"Action is determined as a temporally extended process whose effect is not concluded with the end of the action.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A5","CH_97E9_VDT0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD4","text":"Critique operates at once through gentle awakening and violent disclosure: beauty opens, the plough separates truth from lie.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A12","CH_97E9_VDT0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD5","text":"The moral assertion of justice can itself contribute to the production of injustice, revenge, and humiliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SD6","text":"The unity of virtue is not presupposed, but is first rendered problematic by the removal of heterogeneous and disguised motivational structures.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDT0:A8","CH_97E9_VDT0:A9","CH_97E9_VDT0:A11","CH_97E9_VDT0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a transcendent moral economy in which every virtuous action is balanced by a higher administrator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX2","text":"It excludes the assumption that the word virtue possesses a unified and self-evident meaning independently of its bearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX3","text":"It excludes a separation of virtue and psychology; every form of virtue must be capable of being traced back to a drive, a structure of needs, or a function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that moral self-designations receive their truth through mere naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX5","text":"It excludes a closed model of action in which, with the completion of the work, its effect and meaning also end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:DNX6","text":"It excludes a moral authority that could judge good and evil without itself standing within transmitted interests, drives, or linguistic masks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the world as a fully calculable order of achievement, guilt, reward, and punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a common moral grammar whose words could guarantee truth without genealogical examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a purely selfless virtuous action detachable from the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the final immobilization of the work in a completed moral balance sheet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS1","text":"Perception is divided according to receptivity: sleeping senses demand thunder, awakened souls receive the quiet voice of beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS2","text":"The demand for recompense is identified as the entry symptom of a fabricated moral economy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS3","text":"The moral surface is torn open by uncovering its hidden grounds of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS4","text":"After disclosure, apparent virtues are broken down into different drives, compulsions, habits, ressentiments, and social functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS5","text":"Negative purification yields a positive criterion: virtue is authentic only where the self is present in action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS6","text":"Action is temporally extended in that its light travels onward even after the completion, forgetting, or death of the work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:FGS7","text":"The distinction gained is pedagogically closed by exhausting the old words and replacing them with the formula of the self-in-action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AF1","text":"Demand for reward → unmasking of the lie of reward and punishment → tearing open the grounds of the soul → decomposition of false forms of virtue → disclosure of the self as criterion of action → continued efficacy of the work beyond its completion → exhaustion of the old moral words.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:AF2","text":"Transmitted formulas of virtue → confusion of selflessness and virtue → reduction to the self present in action → new, non-calculable determination of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME1","text":"Virtue is reclassified from a recompensable achievement into a form of self-presence in action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME2","text":"The unified object virtue disintegrates into a map of heterogeneous psychic and social mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME3","text":"Justice is mapped together with its possible function as an instrument of revenge and humiliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME4","text":"Action no longer becomes visible punctually, but as continuing temporal radiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME5","text":"The opposition between virtue and vice is destabilized through the investigation of their concealed origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ME6","text":"Moral language is redrawn from a system of designation into a diagnostic field of forces, masks, and functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Visible is the dispute over reward, punishment, retribution, justice, and the meaning of the word virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Beneath this lies a mechanism of projection, disguise, and social regulation through which heterogeneous drives appear as virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The moral confrontation is shifted from the refutation of individual speakers to the exhaustion and replacement of an entire vocabulary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is determined as non-calculable self-becoming in action and as the continuing movement of the work beyond its completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the demand for reward through unmasking to the positive determination of the self in action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is that by which the true self is distinguished from a merely asserted or aggressively enforced self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is whether the onward-travelling light denotes a causal effect, a memory, or an ontological property of the work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT4","text":"The internal logic is coherent where external recompense is replaced by immanent self-presence and action is temporally extended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT5","text":"A tension arises between the rejection of every moral reckoning and the assertion of a binding truth from the ground of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the quiet, unenforceable voice of beauty and the violent imagery of tearing open, ploughing, and breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT7","text":"The taxonomy of false virtues possesses great diagnostic force, but is presented more rhetorically than formally derived from an independent criterion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDT0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the positive formula of the self in action is not separated from the negative dismantling of the moral economy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDT0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDT0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDT0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 42","title":"On the Virtuous","context":"Chapter 42","original_title":"Von den Tugendhaften","original_context":"Chapter 42"},"original_title":"Von den Tugendhaften","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG","layer":"CH","title":"On the Rabble","order":43,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VOMG"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VOMG@R001","sha256":"b7b7067835d26eba5b12dcaa7f70514028ab16b0ff368fc6b68442ab343a1546","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS1","text":"Die Sprecherstimme setzt das Leben als Born der Lust und den gemeinsamen Zugang zu diesem Born als Kontaminationsrisiko.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS2","text":"Das Gesindel wird durch seine verunreinigende Wirkung auf Quellen, Lust, Sprache, Geist, Frucht und Herrschaft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS3","text":"Die scheinbare Abkehr vom Leben wird als Abwehr des Gesindels neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS4","text":"Der Prüfpunkt lautet, ob das Leben neben Feindschaft, Sterben und Marter auch das Gesindel benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS5","text":"Der Ekel blockiert Leben, Geist und Wahrnehmung, bis er durch Entfernung in Aufstieg umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS6","text":"In der Höhe wird ein nicht geteiltes Leben mit einem unverunreinigten Born gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS7","text":"Diese Höhe wird als exklusive Zukunftsgemeinschaft befestigt, die das Gesindel nicht beherbergt und ihm den Wind entgegenstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A1","text":"Das System setzt das Leben als Born der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","text":"Das Mittrinken des Gesindels vergiftet den Born.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A3","text":"Das Gesindel erklärt schmutzige Träume zur Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A4","text":"Die Benennung schmutziger Träume als Lust vergiftet die Worte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A5","text":"Der Kontakt des Gesindels entkräftet Feuer, Geist und Frucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A6","text":"Die Sprecherstimme setzt Feindschaft, Sterben und Marterkreuze als lebensnotwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A7","text":"Der operative Affekt gegen das Gesindel ist Ekel und nicht Hass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","text":"Die gegenwärtige Herrschaft erscheint als Schachern und Markten um Macht mit dem Gesindel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A9","text":"Die Entfernung vom Gesindel verlangt die Sperrung von Ohr, Auge, Mund und Nase.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A10","text":"Der Ekel kann sich in Flügel und quellenahnende Kräfte verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A11","text":"Der Born der Lust wird in der Höhe ohne mittrinkendes Gesindel wiedergefunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","text":"Reine Gefährten können den Born teilen, ohne ihn zu trüben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A13","text":"Die Höhe ist für die Unreinen und ihren Durst zu hoch und steil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A14","text":"Die künftige Gemeinschaft hält Nahrung und Heimstätten für Unsaubere nicht bereit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A15","text":"Der starke Wind der Höhe wirkt aktiv gegen Feinde und Spuckende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX1","text":"Lust ist nicht mit schmutzigen Träumen gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX2","text":"Die Worte sind keine neutrale Hülle für jede Benennung von Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX3","text":"Die Abkehr vom Leben ist nicht notwendig eine Verneinung des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX4","text":"Herrschaft ist nicht von der Verunreinigung durch Machtgeschacher getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX5","text":"Der Born der Lust ist kein gemeinsamer Zugang für das Gesindel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX6","text":"Die reine Gemeinschaft bietet den Unsauberen weder Nahrung noch Heimstatt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX7","text":"Die Abgrenzung bleibt nicht passiv, sondern wird als Wind gegen das Spucken vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D1","text":"Die Kontamination bleibt nicht auf die Quelle begrenzt, sondern breitet sich auf Lustbegriff, Sprache und vitale Medien aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","CH_97E9_VOMG:A3","CH_97E9_VOMG:A4","CH_97E9_VOMG:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D2","text":"Die scheinbare Lebensverneinung einzelner Gestalten lässt sich als Verweigerung des Kontakts mit dem Gesindel rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A1","CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","CH_97E9_VOMG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D3","text":"Die Notwendigkeit von Feindschaft begründet nicht die Notwendigkeit des Gesindels.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A6","CH_97E9_VOMG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D4","text":"Der Ekel verwandelt die kontaminierte Umgebung zunächst in eine Erfahrung des Erstickens und der Lebensmüdigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A5","CH_97E9_VOMG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D5","text":"Die sensorische Verschließung dient als Schutzmaßnahme gegen politische, sprachliche und historische Verunreinigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","CH_97E9_VOMG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D6","text":"Der Ekel wird zur produktiven Kraft, sobald er die Flucht aus der Niederung und den Aufstieg zur Quelle erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A7","CH_97E9_VOMG:A10","CH_97E9_VOMG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D7","text":"Die Wiedergewinnung der Lustquelle setzt selektive Nähe und räumliche Distanz zugleich voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A11","CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","CH_97E9_VOMG:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D8","text":"Die Zukunftsgemeinschaft übersetzt Reinheit in Regeln der Nahrung, der Behausung und der Nachbarschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","CH_97E9_VOMG:A13","CH_97E9_VOMG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D9","text":"Die frühere Machtkonkurrenz wird durch eine atmosphärische Gegenbewegung ersetzt, die das Gesindel auf Abstand hält.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","CH_97E9_VOMG:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD1","text":"Die Bejahung des Lebens wird nicht als universale Teilhabe, sondern als selektiver Zugang zu einer geschützten Quelle organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD2","text":"Das Gesindel fungiert als bereichsübergreifender Kontaminationsoperator, der Materialität, Lust, Sprache, Geist, Geschichte und Politik gleichförmig erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD3","text":"Der Ekel wird von einem lähmenden Affekt in ein Erkenntnis- und Bewegungsinstrument transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD4","text":"Die notwendige Feindschaft bleibt erhalten, während das Gesindel als ihr entbehrlicher Träger ausgeschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD5","text":"Die Höhe bezeichnet zugleich eine räumliche, soziale, geistige und zeitliche Neuordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD6","text":"Die Reinheit der neuen Ordnung muss durch die fortgesetzte Abwehr dessen stabilisiert werden, was sie ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX1","text":"Gemeinsamer Zugang zu einer Lebensquelle ist nicht neutral, sondern wird als ursprüngliche Kontaminationsform ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX2","text":"Eine Reinigung durch Integration, gegenseitige Umwandlung oder gemeinsames Lernen wird nicht als Möglichkeit zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX3","text":"Die Wiederherstellung des Lebens ist innerhalb der bestehenden sozialen und historischen Niederung nicht möglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX4","text":"Eine reine Herrschaft, die mit dem Gesindel verhandelt oder sich an ihm beteiligt, bleibt undenkbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX5","text":"Die Bedeutung von Lust kann nicht von den Bedingungen ihrer Benennung und sozialen Verwendung abgelöst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine gemeinsame Welt, in der derselbe Born allen offensteht und dennoch rein bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine universale Gemeinschaft, die das Gesindel in reine Gefährtenschaft überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine politische Macht, die ohne Tausch, Schachern und Verunreinigung mit dem Gesindel auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Lebensbejahung ohne hierarchische Distanz, Gegenwehr und aktive Grenzsicherung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS1","text":"Lebensquelle → Lustquelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS2","text":"Eintritt des Gesindels → Vergiftung der Quelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS3","text":"Vergiftung der Quelle → Verschmutzung von Lustbegriff, Worten, Feuer, Geist und Frucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS4","text":"Verschmutzung → Ekel → sensorische Schließung → scheinbare Lebensabkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS5","text":"Lebensnotwendige Feindschaft ≠ notwendiges Gesindel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS6","text":"Ekel → Flügel und quellenahnende Kräfte → Aufstieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS7","text":"Aufstieg → unverunreinigte Quelle → selektive Gefährtenschaft → vertikale Ausschließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS8","text":"Vertikale Ausschließung → Zukunftsgemeinschaft → Wind als aktive Abwehr der Niederungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AF1","text":"Vergiftete Lebensquelle → Kontamination von Lust, Sprache und Geist → Ekel und Rückzug → Unterscheidung zwischen notwendiger Feindschaft und entbehrlichem Gesindel → Aufstieg → nicht geteilter Born der Lust → exklusive Zukunftshöhe → aktiver Wind gegen die Niederungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AF2","text":"Gemeinsamer Born → Vergiftung; Vergiftung → Ekel; Ekel → Entfernung; Entfernung → Höhe; Höhe → Ausschluss; Ausschluss → erneuerte Feindschaft als Wind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME1","text":"„Gesindel“ wird von einer sozialen Bezeichnung zu einem bereichsübergreifenden Wirkungsbegriff der Kontamination umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz „Leben gegen Lebensverneinung“ wird durch die Unterscheidung „Leben gegen Gesindelkontakt“ ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME3","text":"Höhe wird nicht mehr bloß geografisch, sondern als Bedingung selektiven Zugangs und reiner Existenz lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME4","text":"Ekel wird von einem Symptom des Verfalls zu einer Kraft der Erkenntnis, Bewegung und Selbstbefreiung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME5","text":"Gemeinschaft wird nicht durch gemeinsame Teilhabe, sondern durch kontrollierte Nähe, Ausschluss von Nahrung und Ausschluss von Wohnraum bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME6","text":"Feindschaft wird aus dem Register des Machtgeschäfts in das Register einer aktiven atmosphärischen Grenzbewegung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Brunnen, Feuer, Früchte, Träume, Münder, Körper und der Wind bilden die unmittelbare Bild- und Handlungsebene der Verunreinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Kontakt mit dem Gesindel erzeugt eine Kette der Kontamination, die Lebensmedien, Sprache, Herrschaft und Geschichte verbindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text ersetzt Teilhabe, Verhandlung und gemeinsame Macht durch Entfernung, Aufstieg, Auswahl und aktive Abwehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Wirkliches Leben wird an Höhe, Sommer, Quelle und Zukunft gebunden, während Frühling, Gestern, Heute und Niederung als kontaminierte Zeitordnung erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierte Axiomatik reicht aus, um die Bewegung von der vergifteten Quelle zur exklusiven Höhe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob „Gesindel“ primär sozial, moralisch, politisch, sprachlich oder psychologisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT3","text":"Die operative Struktur ist intern kohärent: Kontamination erzeugt Ekel, Ekel erzeugt Entfernung, Entfernung ermöglicht Wiedergewinnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der bereichsübergreifenden Gleichschaltung von Lust, Sprache, Geist, Herrschaft und Geschichte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Übertragung der Brunnen-, Feuer-, Frucht- und Windbilder auf strukturelle Operationen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der behaupteten Notwendigkeit von Feindschaft und der behaupteten Entbehrlichkeit des Gesindels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT7","text":"Die gerichtete Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten; Bildrhythmus, Anrufung und rhetorische Intensität werden durch die Kompression nicht rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195314807948Z_f77ca484","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Rabble","source_sha256":"b7b7067835d26eba5b12dcaa7f70514028ab16b0ff368fc6b68442ab343a1546","sha256":"2bb91d81dd5769fdce3afcd0bd6bde30f6cd2a6587479ac826b4338fcf3f5b26","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:53:14.810120+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS1","text":"The speaking voice posits life as a wellspring of pleasure and shared access to this wellspring as a risk of contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS2","text":"The rabble is defined by its contaminating effect on sources, pleasure, language, spirit, fruit, and rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS3","text":"The apparent turning away from life is redefined as a defense against the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS4","text":"The point of examination is whether life, alongside enmity, dying, and torture-crosses, also requires the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS5","text":"Disgust blocks life, spirit, and perception until it turns into ascent through removal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS6","text":"At the height, an unshared life with an uncontaminated wellspring is attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AS7","text":"This height is secured as an exclusive future community that does not harbor the rabble and sets the wind against it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A1","text":"The system posits life as a wellspring of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","text":"The rabble's drinking along poisons the wellspring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A3","text":"The rabble declares dirty dreams to be pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A4","text":"Naming dirty dreams as pleasure poisons the words.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A5","text":"Contact with the rabble enfeebles fire, spirit, and fruit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A6","text":"The speaking voice posits enmity, dying, and torture-crosses as necessary to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A7","text":"The operative affect against the rabble is disgust and not hatred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","text":"Present rule appears as haggling and bargaining over power with the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A9","text":"Removal from the rabble requires the shutting off of ear, eye, mouth, and nose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A10","text":"Disgust can transform itself into wings and source-sensing powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A11","text":"The wellspring of pleasure is rediscovered at the height without the rabble drinking along.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","text":"Pure companions can share the wellspring without clouding it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A13","text":"The height is too high and steep for the impure and their thirst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A14","text":"The future community does not keep food and dwelling places ready for the unclean.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:A15","text":"The strong wind of the height acts actively against enemies and spitting ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX1","text":"Pleasure is not to be equated with dirty dreams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX2","text":"Words are not a neutral shell for every naming of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX3","text":"Turning away from life is not necessarily a negation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX4","text":"Rule is not separate from contamination through power-haggling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX5","text":"The wellspring of pleasure is not shared access for the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX6","text":"The pure community offers the unclean neither food nor dwelling place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:NX7","text":"The demarcation does not remain passive, but is enacted as wind against spitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D1","text":"Contamination does not remain confined to the source, but spreads to the concept of pleasure, language, and vital media.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","CH_97E9_VOMG:A3","CH_97E9_VOMG:A4","CH_97E9_VOMG:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D2","text":"The apparent negation of life by individual figures can be reconstructed as refusal of contact with the rabble.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A1","CH_97E9_VOMG:A2","CH_97E9_VOMG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D3","text":"The necessity of enmity does not ground the necessity of the rabble.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A6","CH_97E9_VOMG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D4","text":"Disgust initially transforms the contaminated environment into an experience of suffocation and weariness of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A5","CH_97E9_VOMG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D5","text":"Sensory closure serves as a protective measure against political, linguistic, and historical contamination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","CH_97E9_VOMG:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D6","text":"Disgust becomes a productive force as soon as it produces flight from the lowlands and ascent to the source.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A7","CH_97E9_VOMG:A10","CH_97E9_VOMG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D7","text":"The recovery of the source of pleasure presupposes selective proximity and spatial distance at once.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A11","CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","CH_97E9_VOMG:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D8","text":"The future community translates purity into rules of food, habitation, and neighborhood.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A12","CH_97E9_VOMG:A13","CH_97E9_VOMG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:D9","text":"The former competition for power is replaced by an atmospheric counter-movement that keeps the rabble at a distance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMG:A8","CH_97E9_VOMG:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD1","text":"The affirmation of life is organized not as universal participation, but as selective access to a protected source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD2","text":"The rabble functions as a cross-domain operator of contamination that uniformly encompasses materiality, pleasure, language, spirit, history, and politics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD3","text":"Disgust is transformed from a paralyzing affect into an instrument of knowledge and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD4","text":"Necessary enmity is retained, while the rabble is eliminated as its dispensable bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD5","text":"The height denotes at once a spatial, social, spiritual, and temporal reordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SD6","text":"The purity of the new order must be stabilized through the continued repulsion of that which it excludes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX1","text":"Shared access to a source of life is not neutral, but is excluded as an originary form of contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX2","text":"A purification through integration, reciprocal transformation, or shared learning is not admitted as a possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX3","text":"The restoration of life is not possible within the existing social and historical lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX4","text":"A pure rule that negotiates with the rabble or participates in it remains unthinkable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:DNX5","text":"The meaning of pleasure cannot be detached from the conditions of its naming and social use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a common world in which the same wellspring stands open to all and nevertheless remains pure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a universal community that transforms the rabble into pure companionship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a political power that manages without exchange, haggling, and contamination with the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:SNX4","text":"Excluded is an affirmation of life without hierarchical distance, resistance, and active securing of boundaries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS1","text":"Source of life → source of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS2","text":"Entry of the rabble → poisoning of the source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS3","text":"Poisoning of the source → defilement of the concept of pleasure, words, fire, spirit, and fruit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS4","text":"Defilement → disgust → sensory closure → apparent turning away from life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS5","text":"Enmity necessary to life ≠ necessary rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS6","text":"Disgust → wings and source-sensing powers → ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS7","text":"Ascent → uncontaminated source → selective companionship → vertical exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:FGS8","text":"Vertical exclusion → future community → wind as active defense against the lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AF1","text":"Poisoned source of life → contamination of pleasure, language, and spirit → disgust and withdrawal → distinction between necessary enmity and dispensable rabble → ascent → unshared wellspring of pleasure → exclusive future height → active wind against the lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:AF2","text":"Shared wellspring → poisoning; poisoning → disgust; disgust → removal; removal → height; height → exclusion; exclusion → renewed enmity as wind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME1","text":"“Rabble” is remapped from a social designation into a cross-domain operative concept of contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME2","text":"The opposition “life against negation of life” is replaced by the distinction “life against contact with the rabble.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME3","text":"Height becomes legible no longer merely geographically, but as a condition of selective access and pure existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME4","text":"Disgust is reclassified from a symptom of decay into a force of knowledge, movement, and self-liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME5","text":"Community is determined not by shared participation, but by controlled proximity, exclusion from food, and exclusion from living space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ME6","text":"Enmity is transferred from the register of power-business into the register of an active atmospheric movement of demarcation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Wells, fire, fruits, dreams, mouths, bodies, and the wind form the immediate level of images and actions of contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Contact with the rabble produces a chain of contamination that connects media of life, language, rule, and history.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text replaces participation, negotiation, and shared power with removal, ascent, selection, and active defense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Real life is bound to height, summer, source, and future, whereas spring, yesterday, today, and the lowlands appear as a contaminated temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT1","text":"The extracted axiomatics suffices to reconstruct the movement from the poisoned source to the exclusive height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether “rabble” is meant primarily socially, morally, politically, linguistically, or psychologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT3","text":"The operative structure is internally coherent: contamination produces disgust, disgust produces removal, removal enables recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the cross-domain equalization of pleasure, language, spirit, rule, and history.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on transferring the images of well, fire, fruit, and wind to structural operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT6","text":"Unresolved remains the tension between the asserted necessity of enmity and the asserted dispensability of the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VOMG:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VOMG:MRT7","text":"The directed argumentative movement is retained; image-rhythm, invocation, and rhetorical intensity are not reconstructed through the compression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VOMG@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VOMG:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 43","title":"On the Rabble","context":"Chapter 43","original_title":"Vom Gesindel","original_context":"Chapter 43"},"original_title":"Vom Gesindel","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Tarantulas","order":44,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VD_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VD_2@R001","sha256":"d0cb60cdb92eee99a4508397dc8fb949815243e255cd6c50cae43706a7f48289","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS1","text":"Der Text bearbeitet den Gegensatz zwischen der Gleichheitspredigt und einer Gerechtigkeit, die menschliche Ungleichheit bejaht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS2","text":"Die Gleichheitsprediger werden nicht über ihre Begriffe, sondern über den verborgenen Affekt der Rache diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS3","text":"Die Tarantel bezeichnet ein moralisches Subjekt, dessen Gerechtigkeitsrede als Tarnung von Neid, Kränkung und Straftrieb erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS4","text":"Das Argument ist diagnostisch und polemisch: Es reizt das verborgene Netz, um den verdrängten Affekt als offene Wut sichtbar zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS5","text":"Aus der Demaskierung der Gleichheitspredigt folgt die Zurückweisung jeder Vermischung von Lebenslehre und egalitärer Rachsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS6","text":"Das Gegenmodell bestimmt Leben als vertikalen Prozess von Stufen, Widerspruch, Machtkampf und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS7","text":"Die Schlussbewegung wendet die Diagnose auf den Sprecher selbst an, weil auch seine Feindschaft durch Rache in Drehung gebracht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","text":"Die Prediger der Gleichheit werden als von Rache bestimmt dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","text":"Ihre Rede von Gerechtigkeit fungiert als Verkleidung ihres Rachetriebs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A3","text":"Ihr Rachetrieb wird mit Neid, gekränktem Dünkel und vererbter Beschwerde verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A4","text":"Die Reizung ihres Netzes soll den verborgenen Affekt als offene Wut hervortreten lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A5","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird gegen die Gleichheitsprediger mit der Aussage gesetzt, dass die Menschen nicht gleich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","text":"Die Menschen sollen nach dieser Gegenposition auch nicht gleich werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","text":"Die Liebe zum Übermenschen setzt eine Zukunft voraus, in der Unterschiede, Stufen und Aufstieg erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","text":"Das Leben wird als Selbstüberwindung begriffen, die Höhe, Stufen und den Widerspruch der Stufen benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","text":"Wertnamen wie Gut und Böse, Reich und Arm oder Hoch und Gering fungieren als Waffen und klirrende Zeichen des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","text":"Kampf um Macht und Übermacht kann in der Schönheit erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A11","text":"Feindschaft soll als gegenseitiges, schönes und göttliches Streben geführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","text":"Der Biss der Rache kann auch die Seele desjenigen in Drehung bringen, der die Rache diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A13","text":"Der Sprecher muss sich binden, um nicht selbst zum Wirbel der Rachsucht zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX1","text":"Die Gleichheitspredigt ist keine interesselose Lehre der Gerechtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX2","text":"Die Rede von Gerechtigkeit ist nicht von Rache, Neid und Straftrieb getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX3","text":"Gleichheit ist kein unproblematisches Tugendideal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX4","text":"Leben ist nicht als Aufhebung von Rang, Stufen und Widerspruch bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX5","text":"Schönheit ist nicht mit konfliktloser Harmonie gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX6","text":"Feindschaft ist nicht notwendig Rachsucht, sofern sie als gegenseitiges Streben geführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX7","text":"Die Lehre vom Leben darf nicht mit einer Gleichheitspredigt vermischt werden, die dem Leben aus der Höhle heraus zu Willen redet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX8","text":"Der Sprecher ist kein von Rachewirkungen unangreifbarer Außenstehender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D1","text":"Die moralische Gleichheitsrede erscheint als psychische Technik, durch die Rache den Status von Gerechtigkeit erhält.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D2","text":"Neid und gekränkter Dünkel werden nicht als private Nebenmotive, sondern als Erzeugungsbedingungen der Gleichheitsforderung behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D3","text":"Die Provokation des Tarantelnetzes erzeugt eine Sichtbarkeit, die der bloßen Auslegung moralischer Begriffe nicht zugänglich wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D4","text":"Die Forderung nach Gleichheit wird als Angriff auf bestehende Macht und als Anspruch auf Bestrafung der Nichtgleichen rekonfiguriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D5","text":"Ungleichheit erhält den Status einer Bedingung des Aufstiegs und nicht bloß den eines sozialen Unterschieds.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D6","text":"Gegensätze von Wert und Rang werden als operative Mittel des Lebens und nicht als abschließende moralische Ordnungen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","CH_97E9_VD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D7","text":"Eine legitime Feindschaft muss sich von der strafenden Feindschaft der Taranteln durch Schönheit, Gegenseitigkeit und Aufwärtsstreben unterscheiden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","CH_97E9_VD_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D8","text":"Die Kritik der Rache verlangt Selbstbindung, weil die Enthüllung des Gegners den Kritiker in denselben Affekt hineinziehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","CH_97E9_VD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD1","text":"Moralische Begriffe werden als affektive Organisationsformen neu klassifiziert: Gerechtigkeit bezeichnet nicht nur ein Urteil, sondern kann Rache gesellschaftlich legitimieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Gleichheit und Ungleichheit wird in einen Gegensatz von nivellierender Rache und vertikalem Lebenstrieb überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A5","CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD3","text":"Konflikt wird aus dem Bereich des bloß Destruktiven herausgelöst und als Bedingung von Schönheit, Höhe und Selbstüberwindung eingesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","CH_97E9_VD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD4","text":"Das System benötigt zugleich die Aufrechterhaltung der Feindschaft und die Ausschließung der Rache, ohne das Kriterium dieser Trennung vollständig zu stabilisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","CH_97E9_VD_2:A11","CH_97E9_VD_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD5","text":"Die Kritik der Taranteln erzeugt keine unbeteiligte Außenposition, sondern eine reflexive Gefahrenzone, in der die eigene Rede vom Kampf selbst affiziert werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A4","CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","CH_97E9_VD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD6","text":"Zukunft wird als gestufte Bewegung des Über-sich-Hinausgehens und nicht als Zustand erreichter Gleichheit konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Gerechtigkeit ohne affektive Herkunft und ohne Strafverlangen funktionieren könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Gleichheit eine neutrale oder selbstbegründende Form der Tugend sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Machtunterschiede notwendig lebensfeindliche Störungen darstellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Identität von Feindschaft und Rache; das System benötigt eine Feindschaft, die nicht auf Bestrafung reduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Wertbegriffe bloß beschreibende und keine kämpferischen Funktionen besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kritik, die sich vollständig außerhalb des von ihr diagnostizierten Affekts positionieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer von Rache vollständig gereinigten Gerechtigkeitsgrundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX2","text":"Versperrt wird die Möglichkeit einer Gleichheit, die ohne Nivellierung, Straftrieb oder Feindschaft auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX3","text":"Versperrt wird eine konfliktfreie Ordnung, in der Leben, Schönheit und Wert nicht durch Differenz erzeugt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX4","text":"Versperrt wird eine reine Affirmation des Lebens, die weder von Ressentiment imitiert noch durch den eigenen Kampf korrumpiert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS1","text":"Verdeckter Affekt → moralische Benennung → gesellschaftliche Tarnung des Affekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS2","text":"Reizung des Netzes → Hervortreten der Wut → Bestätigung der Diagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS3","text":"Rache → Neid und gekränkter Dünkel → Gleichheitsforderung → Strafanspruch gegen die Nichtgleichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS4","text":"Demaskierung der Gleichheitsmoral → Zurückweisung der Nivellierung → Setzung von Ungleichheit, Stufen und Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS5","text":"Stufen und Widerspruch → Kampf um Macht und Übermacht → Schönheit als organisierte Spannung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS6","text":"Schöne Feindschaft → gegenseitiges Aufwärtsstreben → Unterscheidung von Kampf und Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS7","text":"Biss der Rache → mögliche Drehung des Kritikers → Selbstbindung als Schutz vor der Wiederholung des Gegners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AF1","text":"Verdeckte Rache in der Gleichheitspredigt → Reizung und Entlarvung des Tarantelnestes → Trennung von Gerechtigkeit und Rachsucht → Zurückweisung der Gleichheit als Lebensideal → Setzung von Ungleichheit, Stufen und Selbstüberwindung → Umdeutung der Feindschaft in schönes gegenseitiges Streben → Selbstgefährdung des Sprechers durch den Biss → Bindung gegen den Wirbel der Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME1","text":"Gleichheit wird von einer moralischen Norm zu einer möglichen Tarnform des Ressentiments umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME2","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird in eine strafende und eine aufwärtsgerichtete Funktion aufgespalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME3","text":"Ungleichheit wird von einem Defizit zu einer strukturellen Bedingung von Höhe, Zukunft und Selbstüberwindung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME4","text":"Wertgegensätze werden von stabilen Kategorien zu Waffen innerhalb eines fortgesetzten Lebenskampfes umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME5","text":"Feindschaft wird nicht mehr als Gegenbegriff zur Schönheit, sondern als deren mögliche Spannungsform kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME6","text":"Die Sprecherposition wird vom enthüllenden Richter zum selbst gefährdeten Teilnehmer der diagnostizierten Affektordnung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT1","text":"Oberflächenebene: Eine Tarantel wird als Bild für Gleichheitsprediger eingeführt, deren Netz gereizt und deren Biss am Sprecher sichtbar gemacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT2","text":"Strukturelle Ebene: Moralische Gleichheitsrede wird als institutionell und psychisch wirksame Form der Rache, Bestrafung und Machtumkehr organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategische Ebene: Der Text ersetzt argumentative Widerlegung durch Provokation, Demaskierung, begriffliche Trennung und anschließende Selbstbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontologische und zeitliche Ebene: Leben erscheint als gestufte, widersprüchliche und zukünftige Selbstüberwindung, deren Möglichkeit von Ungleichheit abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Diagnose der Gleichheitsprediger als rachsüchtige Taranteln zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT2","text":"Sie reichen aus, um die positive Gegenordnung von Ungleichheit, Höhe, Stufen und Selbstüberwindung zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen nicht bloß ästhetischen Kriterien schöne Feindschaft von Rache endgültig unterschieden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist in der affektiven Demaskierung und in der Umwertung von Gleichheit zu Rachemechanismus am stärksten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass der Text Kampf und Ungleichheit bejaht, Rache aber ausschließt, ohne die Grenze vollständig zu begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht dadurch, dass die Provokation des Gegners dessen Affekt freilegt und zugleich den Sprecher selbst in denselben Affekt verwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Demaskierung über Neurahmung zu Selbstbegrenzung, sofern die rhetorische Bildmaschine als operativer Mechanismus erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194929614142Z_8439e1c1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Tarantulas","source_sha256":"d0cb60cdb92eee99a4508397dc8fb949815243e255cd6c50cae43706a7f48289","sha256":"6fc80607012afbb06b9ebb7489fbca5d4d26997e5becf635da653ab2570d9db1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:49:29.621652+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS1","text":"The text addresses the opposition between the preaching of equality and a justice that affirms human inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS2","text":"The preachers of equality are diagnosed not through their concepts, but through the concealed affect of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS3","text":"The tarantula designates a moral subject whose discourse on justice appears as a camouflage for envy, resentment, and the drive to punish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS4","text":"The argument is diagnostic and polemical: it provokes the concealed web in order to make the repressed affect visible as open rage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS5","text":"From the unmasking of the preaching of equality follows the rejection of every conflation of the teaching of life with egalitarian vindictiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS6","text":"The countermodel defines life as a vertical process of levels, contradiction, struggle for power, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AS7","text":"The concluding movement applies the diagnosis to the speaker himself, since his enmity too can be set spinning by revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","text":"The preachers of equality are presented as determined by revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","text":"Their discourse on justice functions as a disguise for their drive for revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A3","text":"Their drive for revenge is associated with envy, wounded arrogance, and inherited grievance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A4","text":"The provocation of their web is meant to bring forth the concealed affect as open rage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A5","text":"Justice is set against the preachers of equality by the assertion that human beings are not equal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","text":"According to this counterposition, human beings should not become equal either.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","text":"Love of the Übermensch presupposes a future in which differences, levels, and ascent are preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","text":"Life is understood as self-overcoming, which requires height, levels, and the contradiction of levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","text":"Names of value such as Good and Evil, Rich and Poor, or High and Low function as weapons and clanging signs of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","text":"Struggle for power and supremacy can appear in beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A11","text":"Enmity is to be waged as a mutual, beautiful, and divine striving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","text":"The bite of revenge can also set spinning the soul of the one who diagnoses revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:A13","text":"The speaker must bind himself in order not to become a vortex of vindictiveness himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX1","text":"The preaching of equality is not a disinterested teaching of justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX2","text":"The discourse on justice is not separate from revenge, envy, and the drive to punish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX3","text":"Equality is not an unproblematic ideal of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX4","text":"Life is not defined as the abolition of rank, levels, and contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX5","text":"Beauty is not to be equated with conflictless harmony.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX6","text":"Enmity is not necessarily vindictiveness, insofar as it is waged as mutual striving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX7","text":"The teaching of life must not be conflated with a preaching of equality that speaks to life from out of the cave in order to ingratiate itself with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:NX8","text":"The speaker is not an outsider invulnerable to the effects of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D1","text":"Moral discourse on equality appears as a psychic technique through which revenge acquires the status of justice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D2","text":"Envy and wounded arrogance are treated not as private subsidiary motives, but as conditions of production of the demand for equality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D3","text":"The provocation of the tarantula web produces a visibility that would not be accessible to the mere interpretation of moral concepts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D4","text":"The demand for equality is reconfigured as an attack on existing power and as a claim to the punishment of those who are unequal.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D5","text":"Inequality receives the status of a condition of ascent and not merely that of a social difference.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D6","text":"Oppositions of value and rank are defined as operative means of life and not as final moral orders.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","CH_97E9_VD_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D7","text":"A legitimate enmity must distinguish itself from the punishing enmity of the tarantulas through beauty, reciprocity, and upward striving.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","CH_97E9_VD_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:D8","text":"The critique of revenge requires self-binding, because the exposure of the opponent can draw the critic into the same affect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","CH_97E9_VD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD1","text":"Moral concepts are reclassified as affective forms of organization: justice designates not merely a judgment, but can socially legitimize revenge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A1","CH_97E9_VD_2:A2","CH_97E9_VD_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD2","text":"The opposition between equality and inequality is transformed into an opposition between leveling revenge and a vertical life-drive.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A5","CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD3","text":"Conflict is detached from the domain of the merely destructive and installed as a condition of beauty, height, and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A8","CH_97E9_VD_2:A9","CH_97E9_VD_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD4","text":"The system requires both the maintenance of enmity and the exclusion of revenge, without fully stabilizing the criterion of this separation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A10","CH_97E9_VD_2:A11","CH_97E9_VD_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD5","text":"The critique of the tarantulas produces no uninvolved external position, but rather a reflexive danger zone in which one's own discourse on struggle can itself be affected.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A4","CH_97E9_VD_2:A12","CH_97E9_VD_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SD6","text":"The future is constructed as a graded movement of going-beyond-oneself and not as a state of attained equality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VD_2:A6","CH_97E9_VD_2:A7","CH_97E9_VD_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that justice could function without affective origin and without a desire for punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that equality is a neutral or self-grounding form of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that differences in power necessarily constitute life-hostile disturbances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the identity of enmity and revenge; the system requires an enmity that is not reduced to punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the assumption that value concepts possess merely descriptive and no combative functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a critique that could position itself entirely outside the affect it diagnoses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a basis of justice wholly purified of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of an equality that manages without leveling, the drive to punish, or enmity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is a conflict-free order in which life, beauty, and value are not produced through difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:SNX4","text":"Foreclosed is a pure affirmation of life that can neither be imitated by ressentiment nor corrupted by its own struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS1","text":"Concealed affect → moral designation → social camouflage of the affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS2","text":"Provocation of the web → emergence of rage → confirmation of the diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS3","text":"Revenge → envy and wounded arrogance → demand for equality → claim to punishment against those who are unequal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS4","text":"Unmasking of equality morality → rejection of leveling → positing of inequality, levels, and height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS5","text":"Levels and contradiction → struggle for power and supremacy → beauty as organized tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS6","text":"Beautiful enmity → mutual upward striving → distinction between struggle and revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:FGS7","text":"Bite of revenge → possible spinning of the critic → self-binding as protection against repetition of the opponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:AF1","text":"Concealed revenge in the preaching of equality → provocation and unmasking of the tarantula nest → separation of justice and vindictiveness → rejection of equality as an ideal of life → positing of inequality, levels, and self-overcoming → reinterpretation of enmity as beautiful mutual striving → endangerment of the speaker by the bite → binding against the vortex of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME1","text":"Equality is remapped from a moral norm into a possible camouflage form of ressentiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME2","text":"Justice is split into a punishing and an upward-directed function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME3","text":"Inequality is reclassified from a deficit into a structural condition of height, future, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME4","text":"Oppositions of value are redrawn from stable categories into weapons within an ongoing struggle of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME5","text":"Enmity is mapped no longer as the opposite concept of beauty, but as its possible form of tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ME6","text":"The position of the speaker is shifted from the revealing judge to the participant himself endangered by the diagnosed affective order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT1","text":"Surface level: A tarantula is introduced as an image for preachers of equality, whose web is provoked and whose bite is made visible on the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT2","text":"Structural level: Moral discourse on equality is organized as an institutionally and psychically effective form of revenge, punishment, and reversal of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic level: The text replaces argumentative refutation with provocation, unmasking, conceptual separation, and subsequent self-binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological and temporal level: Life appears as graded, contradictory, and future self-overcoming, whose possibility depends on inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the diagnosis of the preachers of equality as vindictive tarantulas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT2","text":"They suffice to generate the positive counterorder of inequality, height, levels, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined by which criteria, not merely aesthetic ones, beautiful enmity can be conclusively distinguished from revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT4","text":"The structure is strongest in affective unmasking and in the revaluation of equality into a mechanism of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT5","text":"The central fault line lies in the fact that the text affirms struggle and inequality but excludes revenge, without fully grounding the boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises because the provocation of the opponent exposes that opponent's affect while at the same time entangling the speaker himself in the same affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VD_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from unmasking through reframing to self-limitation, provided that the rhetorical image-machine is retained as an operative mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VD_2:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VD_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VD_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 44","title":"On the Tarantulas","context":"Chapter 44","original_title":"Von den Taranteln","original_context":"Chapter 44"},"original_title":"Von den Taranteln","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH","layer":"CH","title":"On the Famous Wise Men","order":45,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDBH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDBH@R001","sha256":"13ae7822187ac4b89d171a148f7ebb9f42b544d78e52cf57acd2973973c6231b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS1","text":"Öffentliche Ehrfurcht und gelehrter Unglaube werden als mögliche Formen des Dienstes am Volk problematisiert, nicht als Beweise für Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS2","text":"Die Anerkennung der berühmten Weisen wird auf ihre soziale Nützlichkeit und ihre Vermittlung an das Volk zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS3","text":"Der freie Geist wird als Gegenfigur bestimmt, weil er Verehrung, Fesselung und volkstümliche Wahrheitsansprüche verweigert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS4","text":"Wahrhaftigkeit wird neu bestimmt als Zerbrechen des verehrenden Willens und als Gang in eine götterlose, einsame Wüste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS5","text":"Geist wird nicht als Besitz von Erkenntnis, sondern als schmerzhafte, gefährliche und selbstverändernde Lebensbewegung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS6","text":"An diesem Maßstab scheitern die berühmten Weisen, weil sie als städtische, gut versorgte Diener und Zugtiere des Volkes erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Unvereinbarkeit zwischen volkstümlicher Weisheit und der wilden Weisheit des freien Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","text":"Die berühmten Weisen dienen primär dem Volk und nicht der Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A2","text":"Volkstümlicher Aberglaube erzeugt soziale Ehrfurcht vor den Weisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","text":"Unglaube wird toleriert, wenn er als Umweg oder Vermittlung zum Volk funktioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","text":"Der freie Geist verweigert Fesseln, Verehrung und die soziale Bindung an das Volk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A5","text":"Das Volk behandelt seine eigene Existenz und Verehrung als Beweis für Wahrheit und Recht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A6","text":"Die berühmten Weisen sprechen als Fürsprecher des Volkes und leiten daraus eine göttliche Stimme ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","text":"Dienst kann die Tugend des Herrn und des Dieners vergrößern, hebt aber die Dienststruktur nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","text":"Wahrhaftigkeit setzt das Zerbrechen des verehrenden Willens voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","text":"Der Wahrhaftige lebt ohne Götter, vereinzelt, hungernd und außerhalb der Oasen der Behaglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A10","text":"Oasen der Behaglichkeit enthalten zugleich neue Götzenbilder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","text":"Geist ist Leben, das in das eigene Leben einschneidet und sein Wissen durch eigene Qual vermehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A12","text":"Geistige Erkenntnis verlangt Opfer, Suche, Blindheit, Gewalt, Kälte, Schrecken und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A13","text":"Die berühmten Weisen kennen nur die Funken des Geistes, nicht dessen Amboss und Hammer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A14","text":"Die berühmten Weisen besitzen weder die Hitze noch den Wind, die Kälte und den Abgrund der geistigen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A15","text":"Die städtische, ehrbare und gut versorgte Existenz der Weisen steht der einsamen Wüstenexistenz des Wahrhaftigen entgegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX1","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht durch die Existenz des Volkes gewährleistet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX2","text":"Ehrfurcht vor den Weisen ist kein Beweis ihrer Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX3","text":"Tolerierter Unglaube ist nicht schon freier Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX4","text":"Dienst am Volk ist nicht Wahrheitssuche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX5","text":"Die Stimme des Volkes ist nicht Gottes Stimme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX6","text":"Behaglichkeit und Oase sind keine Bedingungen der Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX7","text":"Gelehrsamkeit, geistige Funken und vertrauter Umgang mit dem Geist sind nicht geistige Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX8","text":"Ehrbarkeit, aufrechter Rücken und soziale Anerkennung sind keine Zeichen geistiger Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX9","text":"Weisheit ist kein Armen- oder Krankenhaus für schlechte Dichter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX10","text":"Die städtische Stellung der berühmten Weisen ist keine geistige Souveränität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D1","text":"Die öffentliche Anerkennung der berühmten Weisen wird als Effekt politischer und sozialer Brauchbarkeit reklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","CH_97E9_VDBH:A2","CH_97E9_VDBH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D2","text":"Der Unglaube der berühmten Weisen erscheint als eingedämmte und vermittelnde Abweichung, nicht als autonome Wahrheitsbewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","CH_97E9_VDBH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D3","text":"Die Verfolgung des freien Geistes folgt aus seiner Verweigerung der volkstümlichen Wahrheitsordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A5","CH_97E9_VDBH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D4","text":"Wahrhaftigkeit wird als Akt der Trennung und nicht als Zustimmung zu einer Lehre erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D5","text":"Die Wüste fungiert als epistemische und existentielle Bedingung, weil sie Verehrung, Behaglichkeit und Götzenbildung entzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","CH_97E9_VDBH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D6","text":"Erkenntnis wird als Prozess der Selbstverletzung, Selbstprüfung und Selbstverwandlung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D7","text":"Die berühmten Weisen werden trotz ihrer Gelehrsamkeit als geistig unzureichend bestimmt, weil ihnen die produktiven Bedingungen der Erkenntnis fehlen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A13","CH_97E9_VDBH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D8","text":"Der Dienst der Weisen kann das Volk stärken, ohne die Weisen aus ihrer servilen Stellung zu lösen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD1","text":"Die Quelle epistemischer Autorität wird von sozialer Anerkennung auf existenzielle Trennung und Selbstüberwindung verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD2","text":"Abweichung gilt nur dann als Wahrheit, wenn sie ihre soziale Vermittlungsfunktion verlässt; selbst Unglaube kann andernfalls in den Dienst der Herrschaft treten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD3","text":"Erkenntnistheorie und Existenzlehre fallen zusammen, weil Wissen nur durch eine Veränderung der Lebensform entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD4","text":"Stadt und Wüste werden zu einer geistigen Topologie von verwalteter Behaglichkeit und gefährlicher Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","CH_97E9_VDBH:A10","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD5","text":"Der Text macht die Fähigkeit zur Trennung zum Kriterium dafür, ob ein Weiser überhaupt an der wilden Weisheit teilhaben kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD6","text":"Die berühmten Weisen werden nicht wegen mangelnder Intelligenz, sondern wegen ihrer fortbestehenden sozialen und geistigen Angeschirrtheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A6","CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Konsens, Volkstümlichkeit oder gesellschaftliche Dauer epistemische Geltung erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine stabile Versöhnung von Wahrheitsanspruch und Dienst am Volk aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine neutrale, folgenlose oder schmerzfreie Erkenntnis aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, Verehrung als unschädliche Begleitform der Wahrheit beizubehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX5","text":"Es schließt soziale Stellung, Ruhm und Gelehrsamkeit als Beweise geistiger Souveränität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX6","text":"Es schließt das Volk als selbstaufklärendes Erkenntnissubjekt aus und behandelt es primär als Träger von Aberglauben und Verfolgung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX7","text":"Es schließt eine geistige Existenz aus, die zugleich vollständig in städtischer Sicherheit, öffentlicher Anerkennung und sozialer Einbindung verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX1","text":"Eine legitime öffentliche Vermittlung der Wahrheit bleibt strukturell un verfügbar, sobald Vermittlung als Dienst und Verehrung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX2","text":"Eine nicht-asketische und nicht-schmerzhafte Route zu höherer Erkenntnis wird aus dem System entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX3","text":"Eine dauerhafte Synthese von Diener und freiem Geist wird nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX4","text":"Ein gemeinsamer geistiger Raum von Stadt und Wüste, in dem Behaglichkeit und Wahrhaftigkeit koexistieren könnten, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass die Auflösung aller Verehrung selbst zur neuen Verehrungsform erstarrt, bleibt unaufgelöst und wird nicht positiv abgesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS1","text":"Dienst am Volk + volkstümlicher Aberglaube → soziale Ehrfurcht vor den Weisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS2","text":"soziale Ehrfurcht + tolerierter Unglaube → funktionalisierte Abweichung statt Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS3","text":"Verweigerung von Verehrung und Volkstümlichkeit → Verfolgung des freien Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS4","text":"Zerbrechen des verehrenden Willens + Entzug aus der Oase → Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS5","text":"Wüste + Einsamkeit + Schmerz + Gefahr → Geist als selbstverändernde Erkenntnisbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS6","text":"Geistige Bewegung verlangt Hitze, Kälte, Hammer, Abgrund und Wind → Ausschluss bloßer geistiger Funken und behaglicher Gelehrsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS7","text":"Ausschlussbedingungen + soziale Angeschirrtheit → berühmte Weise als Diener und Zugtiere des Volkes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS8","text":"Dienerstatus + fehlende geistige Intensität → Unvereinbarkeit mit der wilden Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AF1","text":"Volk als Wahrheitsinstanz → Ehrfurcht durch sozialen Dienst → tolerierter Unglaube als Umweg → freie Verweigerung durch den Geist → Verfolgung → Zerbrechen des verehrenden Willens → Wüste als Wahrheitsbedingung → Geist als schmerzhafte Selbstüberwindung → Disqualifikation der berühmten Weisen → Unvereinbarkeit mit der wilden Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AF2","text":"Öffentliche Anerkennung → funktionalisierte Gelehrsamkeit → soziale Angeschirrtheit → Ausschluss aus der geistigen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME1","text":"Ruhm und Ehrfurcht werden von epistemischen Ausweisen zu Indikatoren sozialer Brauchbarkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME2","text":"Unglaube wird in vermittelte und autonome Formen geteilt; nur die autonome Form kann den Anspruch auf Freiheit tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME3","text":"Das Volk wird vom vermeintlichen Ursprung der Wahrheit zum Apparat ihrer sozialen Bestätigung und der Verfolgung ihrer Gegner umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME4","text":"Die Opposition von Stadt und Wüste wird als Opposition von verwalteter Existenz und existenzieller Wahrheitsproduktion lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME5","text":"Geist wird von einem Besitz oder einer Begabung zu einer riskanten Praxis der Selbstveränderung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME6","text":"Die Bewertung des Weisen verschiebt sich von Gelehrsamkeit und Einfluss auf die Fähigkeit, Verehrung, Sicherheit und soziale Zugehörigkeit zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Die Rede greift die berühmten Weisen an und kontrastiert sie mit dem freien, wahrhaftigen Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Gelehrsamkeit wird als institutionell und politisch eingebundener Dienst an Volk, Macht und sozialer Ordnung rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Maßstab für geistige Gefolgschaft wird neu gesetzt: Nicht öffentliche Wirkung, sondern die Fähigkeit zur Trennung entscheidet über Anschlussfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Geist erscheint als fortgesetzte, schmerzhafte Bewegung des Lebens in sich selbst; Wahrhaftigkeit bezeichnet eine Lebensform, nicht den Besitz eines endgültigen Satzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von volkstümlicher Anerkennung über funktionalisierten Unglauben zur Kritik der Weisen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT2","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Reklassifikation von Gelehrsamkeit als sozialer Dienstform und von Wahrhaftigkeit als existenzieller Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die genauen Schwellen, an denen Unglaube autonom, Geist intensiv und Dienst unzulässig wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT4","text":"Der Begriff des Volkes wechselt zwischen empirischer Menge, normativer Wahrheitsinstanz und blindem Kollektiv, ohne dass dieser Wechsel formal aufgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT5","text":"Die Behauptung, Dienst könne den Herrn und den Diener zugleich wachsen lassen, bleibt mit der endgültigen Verurteilung der Diener spannungsvoll verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT6","text":"Die öffentliche Anrede der berühmten Weisen steht in einer ungelösten Spannung zur Abwertung öffentlicher und städtischer Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT7","text":"Die Begriffe Wüste, Löwe, Adler, Hammer, Kälte und Wind tragen einen Teil der Ableitungskraft, der nicht unabhängig formalisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, komprimiert jedoch die performative Gewalt und die mögliche Re-Idolisierung des Wahrhaftigkeitsideals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193936559148Z_d2ad78fb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Famous Wise Men","source_sha256":"13ae7822187ac4b89d171a148f7ebb9f42b544d78e52cf57acd2973973c6231b","sha256":"4736624a27b4594c1df3dd5b8df4ab350a900c9163a0cc7b633201c7c05cc936","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:39:36.560013+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS1","text":"Public reverence and learned unbelief are problematized as possible forms of service to the people, not as proofs of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS2","text":"The recognition of the famous wise men is traced back to their social usefulness and their mediation to the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS3","text":"The free spirit is determined as a counterfigure because it refuses reverence, bondage, and popular claims to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS4","text":"Truthfulness is redefined as the breaking of the revering will and as a journey into a godless, solitary desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS5","text":"Spirit is determined not as possession of knowledge, but as a painful, dangerous, and self-transforming movement of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS6","text":"By this measure, the famous wise men fail, because they appear as urban, well-provided-for servants and draught animals of the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AS7","text":"The movement ends in the incompatibility between popular wisdom and the wild wisdom of the free spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","text":"The famous wise men serve primarily the people and not truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A2","text":"Popular superstition produces social reverence for the wise men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","text":"Unbelief is tolerated when it functions as a detour or mediation to the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","text":"The free spirit refuses fetters, reverence, and social attachment to the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A5","text":"The people treats its own existence and reverence as proof of truth and right.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A6","text":"The famous wise men speak as advocates of the people and derive a divine voice from this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","text":"Service can enlarge the virtue of master and servant, but does not abolish the structure of service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","text":"Truthfulness presupposes the breaking of the revering will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","text":"The truthful person lives without gods, isolated, hungry, and outside the oases of comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A10","text":"Oases of comfort simultaneously contain new idols.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","text":"Spirit is life that cuts into its own life and increases its knowledge through its own torment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A12","text":"Spiritual knowledge demands sacrifice, seeking, blindness, violence, cold, terror, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A13","text":"The famous wise men know only the sparks of spirit, not its anvil and hammer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A14","text":"The famous wise men possess neither the heat nor the wind, the cold and the abyss, of spiritual movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:A15","text":"The urban, respectable, and well-provided-for existence of the wise men stands opposed to the solitary desert existence of the truthful person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX1","text":"Truth is not guaranteed by the existence of the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX2","text":"Reverence for the wise men is no proof of their truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX3","text":"Tolerated unbelief is not yet free spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX4","text":"Service to the people is not a search for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX5","text":"The voice of the people is not God's voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX6","text":"Comfort and oasis are not conditions of truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX7","text":"Erudition, spiritual sparks, and familiar intercourse with spirit are not spiritual depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX8","text":"Respectability, an upright back, and social recognition are not signs of spiritual strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX9","text":"Wisdom is no poorhouse or hospital for bad poets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:NX10","text":"The urban position of the famous wise men is no spiritual sovereignty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D1","text":"The public recognition of the famous wise men is reclassified as an effect of political and social usefulness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","CH_97E9_VDBH:A2","CH_97E9_VDBH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D2","text":"The unbelief of the famous wise men appears as a contained and mediating deviation, not as an autonomous movement of truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","CH_97E9_VDBH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D3","text":"The persecution of the free spirit follows from its refusal of the popular order of truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A5","CH_97E9_VDBH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D4","text":"Truthfulness is produced as an act of separation and not as assent to a doctrine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D5","text":"The desert functions as an epistemic and existential condition because it withdraws reverence, comfort, and idol formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","CH_97E9_VDBH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D6","text":"Knowledge is determined as a process of self-injury, self-examination, and self-transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D7","text":"Despite their erudition, the famous wise men are determined as spiritually inadequate because they lack the productive conditions of knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A13","CH_97E9_VDBH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:D8","text":"The service of the wise men can strengthen the people without releasing the wise men from their servile position.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD1","text":"The source of epistemic authority is shifted from social recognition to existential separation and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A1","CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD2","text":"Deviation counts as truth only when it leaves its function of social mediation; otherwise, even unbelief can enter into the service of domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A3","CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD3","text":"Epistemology and doctrine of existence coincide because knowledge arises only through a transformation of the form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A11","CH_97E9_VDBH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD4","text":"City and desert become a spiritual topology of administered comfort and dangerous truthfulness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A9","CH_97E9_VDBH:A10","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD5","text":"The text makes the capacity for separation the criterion of whether a wise man can participate at all in wild wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A4","CH_97E9_VDBH:A8","CH_97E9_VDBH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SD6","text":"The famous wise men are excluded not because of insufficient intelligence, but because of their continuing social and spiritual harnessing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDBH:A6","CH_97E9_VDBH:A7","CH_97E9_VDBH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that consensus, popularity, or social duration produce epistemic validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX2","text":"It excludes a stable reconciliation of the claim to truth and service to the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX3","text":"It excludes neutral, consequence-free, or painless knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility of retaining reverence as a harmless accompanying form of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX5","text":"It excludes social position, fame, and erudition as proofs of spiritual sovereignty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX6","text":"It excludes the people as a self-enlightening subject of knowledge and treats it primarily as a bearer of superstition and persecution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:DNX7","text":"It excludes a spiritual existence that remains simultaneously and wholly within urban security, public recognition, and social integration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX1","text":"A legitimate public mediation of truth remains structurally unavailable once mediation appears as service and reverence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX2","text":"A non-ascetic and non-painful route to higher knowledge is removed from the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX3","text":"A lasting synthesis of servant and free spirit is not permitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX4","text":"A shared spiritual space of city and desert, in which comfort and truthfulness could coexist, is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:SNX5","text":"The possibility that the dissolution of all reverence itself hardens into a new form of reverence remains unresolved and is not positively secured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS1","text":"Service to the people + popular superstition → social reverence for the wise men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS2","text":"social reverence + tolerated unbelief → functionalized deviation instead of truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS3","text":"Refusal of reverence and popularity → persecution of the free spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS4","text":"Breaking of the revering will + withdrawal from the oasis → truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS5","text":"Desert + solitude + pain + danger → spirit as a self-transforming movement of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS6","text":"Spiritual movement requires heat, cold, hammer, abyss, and wind → exclusion of mere spiritual sparks and comfortable erudition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS7","text":"Conditions of exclusion + social harnessing → famous wise man as servant and draught animal of the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:FGS8","text":"Servant status + lacking spiritual intensity → incompatibility with wild wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AF1","text":"People as an instance of truth → reverence through social service → tolerated unbelief as detour → free refusal by spirit → persecution → breaking of the revering will → desert as condition of truth → spirit as painful self-overcoming → disqualification of the famous wise men → incompatibility with wild wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:AF2","text":"Public recognition → functionalized erudition → social harnessing → exclusion from spiritual movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME1","text":"Fame and reverence are remapped from epistemic credentials to indicators of social usefulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME2","text":"Unbelief is divided into mediated and autonomous forms; only the autonomous form can sustain the claim to freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME3","text":"The people is reclassified from the supposed origin of truth into the apparatus of its social confirmation and of the persecution of its opponents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME4","text":"The opposition of city and desert becomes legible as the opposition of administered existence and existential production of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME5","text":"Spirit is remapped from a possession or a gift to a risky practice of self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ME6","text":"The evaluation of the wise man shifts from erudition and influence to the capacity to break reverence, security, and social belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The discourse attacks the famous wise men and contrasts them with the free, truthful spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Erudition is reconstructed as a service to people, power, and social order that is institutionally and politically integrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The criterion for spiritual allegiance is reset: not public effect, but the capacity for separation decides aptitude for connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Spirit appears as the continued, painful movement of life within itself; truthfulness designates a form of life, not possession of a final proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from popular recognition through functionalized unbelief to the critique of the wise men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT2","text":"The system's strongest point lies in the reclassification of erudition as a form of social service and of truthfulness as existential separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT3","text":"The precise thresholds at which unbelief becomes autonomous, spirit intense, and service impermissible remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT4","text":"The concept of the people shifts between an empirical multitude, a normative instance of truth, and a blind collective, without this shift being formally resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT5","text":"The claim that service can allow master and servant to grow simultaneously remains tensely connected with the final condemnation of servants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT6","text":"The public address to the famous wise men stands in an unresolved tension with the devaluation of public and urban mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT7","text":"The concepts desert, lion, eagle, hammer, cold, and wind carry part of the force of derivation that is not independently formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDBH:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but compresses the performative violence and the possible re-idolization of the ideal of truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDBH:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDBH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDBH:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 45","title":"On the Famous Wise Men","context":"Chapter 45","original_title":"Von den berühmten Weisen","original_context":"Chapter 45"},"original_title":"Von den berühmten Weisen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN","layer":"CH","title":"The Night Song","order":46,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DASN"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASN@R001","sha256":"7d43e62f3dc40c9af95298ae4f8d115fef71651dd1d16ce9b8410e100465c56d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS1","text":"Der Ausgangskonflikt entsteht aus einer Lichtgestalt, deren unerschöpfliches Geben weder Empfang noch wirkliche Berührung hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS2","text":"Die Nacht wird als Bedingung bestimmt, unter der Quellen, Liebeslieder und inneres Verlangen sprachlich hervortreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS3","text":"Die Sprecherfigur ist Licht und erfährt gerade diese Lichtidentität als Einschließung, Einsamkeit und Unfähigkeit zur Aufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS4","text":"Die Kluft zwischen Geben und Nehmen verwandelt Überfluss in Armut, Neid, Härte und den Wunsch nach Entzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS5","text":"Das Geben erzeugt aus seiner eigenen Überfülle Rache, Bosheit und den Zusammenbruch der ursprünglichen Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS6","text":"Das diagnostisch-genealogische Argument führt von nächtlicher Artikulation über lichtbedingte Isolation zurück zu erneutem Nachtverlangen und wiederholter Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A1","text":"Die Nacht lässt die springenden Brunnen reden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A2","text":"Die Nacht erweckt die Lieder der Liebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A3","text":"Die Seele der Sprecherfigur ist ein springender Brunnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A4","text":"Die Seele der Sprecherfigur ist das Lied eines Liebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A5","text":"In der Sprecherfigur wirkt ein unstillbares Verlangen nach Liebe und sprachlicher Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A6","text":"Die Sprecherfigur ist Licht und verlangt danach, Nacht und Dunkelheit zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A7","text":"Die Einsamkeit der Sprecherfigur entsteht daraus, dass sie von ihrem eigenen Licht umgürtet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A8","text":"Das Licht der Sprecherfigur trinkt die aus ihm brechenden Flammen in sich zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A9","text":"Die Sprecherfigur verfügt nicht über das Glück des Nehmenden und lebt im fortgesetzten Geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A10","text":"Fortgesetztes Geben erzeugt Armut, Neid, Erschöpfung und den Verlust der Ruhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A11","text":"Zwischen Geben und Nehmen besteht eine Kluft, deren kleinste Ausdehnung zuletzt unüberbrückbar bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A12","text":"Die Überfülle der Schönheit erzeugt den Wunsch, die Beschenkten zu verletzen oder zu berauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A13","text":"Unbegrenztes Austeilen zerstört Scham und verwandelt Hand und Herz in Härte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A14","text":"Das Licht verhält sich gegenüber anderem Leuchtenden kalt, schweigsam und feindselig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A15","text":"Die Dunklen gewinnen Wärme und Labsal aus dem Leuchtenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A16","text":"In der Nacht bricht das Verlangen wie ein Quell hervor und verlangt nach Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX1","text":"Die Sprecherfigur ist nicht Nacht und kann ihre eigene Lichtgestalt nicht verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX2","text":"Das Nehmen stellt für die Sprecherfigur kein verfügbares Glück dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX3","text":"Geben garantiert keinen Zugang zur Seele der Nehmenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX4","text":"Die Übertragung von Gabe in Empfang hebt die Kluft nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX5","text":"Sättigung beendet den Hunger nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX6","text":"Tugend bleibt kein stabiler Zustand, sobald sie sich im Überfluss verausgabt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX7","text":"Das Licht ist kein Medium gegenseitiger Antwort unter den Leuchtenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX8","text":"Die Nacht ist nicht bloß Schweigen oder Abwesenheit von Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX9","text":"Die Beschenkten werden nicht notwendig zu Berührten oder Erwidernden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX10","text":"Die Sprecherfigur kann ihren Überfluss nicht durch weiteres Schenken auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D1","text":"Die Nacht externalisiert das innere Verlangen als Quelle, Rede und Liebeslied.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A2","CH_97E9_DASN:A3","CH_97E9_DASN:A4","CH_97E9_DASN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D2","text":"Die Lichtidentität macht die Sprecherfigur zur Quelle ihrer eigenen Flammen und sperrt sie zugleich vom Empfangen aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D3","text":"Das fortgesetzte Geben erzeugt trotz tatsächlicher Verteilung eine subjektive Armut.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D4","text":"Die Kluft zwischen Gabe und Empfang verwandelt relationale Nähe in Einsamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D5","text":"Die Überfülle des Gebens schlägt in den Wunsch nach Verletzung, Beraubung und Entzug um.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D6","text":"Die moralische Tugend des Austeilens erzeugt durch ihre Dauer die Bedingungen ihrer eigenen Verhärtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D7","text":"Das Verhältnis von Licht und Dunkelheit ist asymmetrisch: Das Licht gibt, während die Dunklen aus ihm Wärme gewinnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D8","text":"Das Nachtverlangen bezeichnet zugleich die gewünschte Gegenposition zur Lichtidentität und die Bedingung ihrer sprachlichen Entladung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD1","text":"Das Geben wird von einer Tugend in einen Mechanismus der Selbstverzehrung und sozialen Entfremdung umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD2","text":"Bosheit erscheint als reaktive Gegenbewegung eines Überflusses, der keine Aufnahme und keine Erwiderung findet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11","CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD3","text":"Licht und Dunkelheit bilden keine symmetrischen Gegensätze, sondern eine asymmetrische Ökonomie von Ausstrahlung, Aufnahme und Selbstverlust.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD4","text":"Das Lied reproduziert einen Kreislauf aus Überfülle, Isolation, Entzugswunsch, Nachtverlangen und erneuter sprachlicher Entladung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD5","text":"Die Suche nach Beziehung erzeugt gerade durch das Medium des Gebens die Bedingungen ihrer Verfehlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine reziproke Ordnung aus, in der Geben und Nehmen einander vollständig befriedigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass unbegrenztes Geben die Identität des Gebenden unversehrt erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein wohlwollendes Lichtverhältnis zwischen Leuchtenden aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Aufhebung der Einsamkeit durch die bloße Annahme von Geschenken aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine moralisch stabile Trennung zwischen Tugend und Aggression aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, den inneren Mangel durch äußere Verteilung zu sättigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX7","text":"Es schließt die dauerhafte Einnahme der Position des Empfangenden durch die Sprecherfigur aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine gemeinsame Nacht, in der die Lichtgestalt selbst dunkel werden und empfangen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig bleibt die Annahme, dass selbst die kleinste Distanz zwischen Geben und Nehmen überbrückbar sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine gegenseitige Rede der Leuchtenden; das Licht spricht zu den Dunklen, aber nicht zum eigenen Licht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich bleibt ein Zustand endgültiger Sättigung, in dem Überfluss, Begehren und Einsamkeit enden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX5","text":"Versperrt bleibt ein Abschluss jenseits der Wiederholung, da die letzte Nachtrede an die erste zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS1","text":"Nachtbedingung → Hervorbrechen von Brunnenrede und Liebeslied → Artikulation des inneren Verlangens.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A2","CH_97E9_DASN:A3","CH_97E9_DASN:A4","CH_97E9_DASN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS2","text":"Lichtidentität → Selbstumkreisung durch eigenes Licht → Unfähigkeit zum Empfangen → Einsamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS3","text":"Fortgesetztes Geben → Kluft zwischen Gabe und Empfang → subjektive Armut und Neid.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS4","text":"Überfülle ohne Erwiderung → Erschöpfung der Tugend → Härte, Entzug und Hunger nach Bosheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS5","text":"Feindseligkeit des Lichts gegen Leuchtendes → Suche nach den Dunklen als möglichen Empfängern → erneute Unmöglichkeit symmetrischer Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS6","text":"Nicht aufgelöste Lichtisolation → Durst nach Nacht → Verlangen bricht wie ein Quell hervor → Rede wiederholt den Anfang.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AF1","text":"Nacht → Quelle und Liebeslied → Lichtidentität → Selbstverzehr → unüberbrückbare Kluft zwischen Geben und Nehmen → Armut und Einsamkeit → Hunger nach Bosheit und Entzug → Verlangen nach Dunkelheit → erneute Nachtrede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AF2","text":"Die Schlussposition ist keine Auflösung, sondern die Rückführung der artikulierten Sehnsucht in denselben nächtlichen Ausgangskreislauf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME1","text":"Geben wird nicht mehr als reine Fülle, sondern als Erzeuger von Armut, Neid und Verhärtung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME2","text":"Licht wird aus der Gleichsetzung mit Güte gelöst und als zugleich spendende und feindselige Macht klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME3","text":"Dunkelheit wird von bloßer Negation zu einem Medium der Aufnahme, Wärmeerzeugung und möglichen Antwort umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME4","text":"Bosheit wird als funktionale Gegenbewegung eines blockierten Überschusses und nicht als isolierte moralische Eigenschaft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von Geben und Nehmen wird durch die strukturelle Kluft zwischen beiden als falsche Versöhnungsperspektive entlarvt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME6","text":"Nacht wird als produktive Sprachbedingung und nicht als Abwesenheit von Sichtbarkeit oder Sinn klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME7","text":"Die Wiederholung des Liedanfangs kartiert die Zeit als Zirkulation ungelöster Bedürftigkeit statt als Fortschritt zur Erfüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Sprecherfigur beschreibt Nacht, Licht, Brunnen, Lieder, Durst, Einsamkeit und den Wunsch nach Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Verhältnis von Überfluss, Verteilung, Empfang, Kluft und Verhärtung erzeugt die soziale Mechanik des Liedes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument verschiebt die Bewertung von Geben, Tugend und Bosheit und macht Entzug als Gegenstrategie des Überflusses sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Licht und Dunkelheit bilden relationale Seinspositionen, deren ungelöste Spannung sich in einem zyklischen Zeitmuster wiederholt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Nachtrede, Lichtisolation, Gebensüberfluss, Kluft, Verhärtung und Rückkehr der Rede zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Licht und Nacht psychische, metaphysische oder ausschließlich poetische Kategorien sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur als Kreislauf, in dem Überfluss seinen eigenen Mangel hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT4","text":"Ungelöst bleibt der Widerspruch zwischen dem Wunsch nach Berührung und dem Wunsch, die Beschenkten zu verletzen oder zu berauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle der Rekonstruktion liegt in der Ableitung von Einsamkeit und Aggression aus dem misslingenden Geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von metaphorischen Gleichsetzungen zwischen Licht, Quelle, Sprecherfigur, Dunkelheit und Empfang ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die Wiederholung am Ende als strukturelle Rückkehr und nicht als Lösung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193010501363Z_471a4960","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Night Song","source_sha256":"7d43e62f3dc40c9af95298ae4f8d115fef71651dd1d16ce9b8410e100465c56d","sha256":"2e3b763d158e690f37d9a7c1e64bd7da600d76d98e7353bc32d575564dbbebce","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:30:10.503288+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS1","text":"The initial conflict arises from a figure of light whose inexhaustible giving produces neither reception nor genuine contact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS2","text":"Night is determined as the condition under which fountains, love songs, and inner longing emerge linguistically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS3","text":"The speaking figure is light and experiences precisely this identity as light as enclosure, solitude, and incapacity for reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS4","text":"The gulf between giving and receiving transforms abundance into poverty, envy, hardness, and the desire for withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS5","text":"From its own overabundance, giving produces revenge, malice, and the collapse of original virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AS6","text":"The diagnostic-genealogical argument leads from nocturnal articulation, through light-conditioned isolation, back to renewed longing for night and repeated speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A1","text":"Night lets the leaping fountains speak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A2","text":"Night awakens the songs of lovers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A3","text":"The soul of the speaking figure is a leaping fountain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A4","text":"The soul of the speaking figure is the song of a lover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A5","text":"Within the speaking figure operates an insatiable longing for love and linguistic expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A6","text":"The speaking figure is light and longs to be night and darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A7","text":"The solitude of the speaking figure arises from being girded by its own light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A8","text":"The light of the speaking figure drinks back into itself the flames breaking forth from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A9","text":"The speaking figure does not possess the happiness of the receiver and lives in continual giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A10","text":"Continual giving produces poverty, envy, exhaustion, and the loss of repose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A11","text":"Between giving and receiving there is a gulf whose smallest extent ultimately remains unbridgeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A12","text":"The overabundance of beauty produces the desire to wound or rob those who are gifted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A13","text":"Unlimited distribution destroys shame and transforms hand and heart into hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A14","text":"Light behaves coldly, silently, and hostilely toward other luminous beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A15","text":"The dark ones derive warmth and refreshment from the luminous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:A16","text":"In the night, longing breaks forth like a spring and demands speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX1","text":"The speaking figure is not night and cannot leave its own figure of light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX2","text":"Receiving does not constitute an available happiness for the speaking figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX3","text":"Giving guarantees no access to the soul of those who receive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX4","text":"The transfer of gift into reception does not abolish the gulf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX5","text":"Satiation does not end hunger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX6","text":"Virtue does not remain a stable state once it expends itself in abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX7","text":"Light is not a medium of mutual response among luminous beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX8","text":"Night is not merely silence or absence of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX9","text":"Those who are gifted do not necessarily become touched or responsive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:NX10","text":"The speaking figure cannot dissolve its abundance through further giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D1","text":"Night externalizes inner longing as spring, speech, and love song.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A2","CH_97E9_DASN:A3","CH_97E9_DASN:A4","CH_97E9_DASN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D2","text":"Identity as light makes the speaking figure the source of its own flames and at the same time excludes it from receiving.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D3","text":"Continual giving produces subjective poverty despite actual distribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D4","text":"The gulf between gift and reception transforms relational proximity into solitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D5","text":"The overabundance of giving turns into the desire for wounding, robbery, and withdrawal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D6","text":"The moral virtue of distribution generates, through its duration, the conditions of its own hardening.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D7","text":"The relation between light and darkness is asymmetrical: light gives, while the dark ones derive warmth from it.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:D8","text":"Longing for night designates both the desired counterposition to identity as light and the condition of its linguistic discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD1","text":"Giving is recoded from a virtue into a mechanism of self-consumption and social alienation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD2","text":"Malice appears as the reactive counter-movement of an abundance that finds neither reception nor response.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11","CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD3","text":"Light and darkness do not form symmetrical opposites, but rather an asymmetrical economy of radiation, reception, and self-loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD4","text":"The song reproduces a cycle of overabundance, isolation, desire for withdrawal, longing for night, and renewed linguistic discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SD5","text":"The search for relation generates, precisely through the medium of giving, the conditions of its failure.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A9","CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a reciprocal order in which giving and receiving fully satisfy one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that unlimited giving preserves the identity of the giver intact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX3","text":"It excludes a benevolent relation of light among luminous beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX4","text":"It excludes the abolition of solitude through the mere acceptance of gifts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX5","text":"It excludes a morally stable separation between virtue and aggression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility of satiating inner lack through external distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:DNX7","text":"It excludes the speaking figure's enduring occupation of the position of the receiver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX1","text":"Unavailable remains a shared night in which the figure of light itself could become dark and receive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible remains the assumption that even the smallest distance between giving and receiving could be bridged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a mutual speech of luminous beings; light speaks to the dark ones, but not to its own light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX4","text":"Impossible remains a state of final satiation in which abundance, desire, and solitude end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:SNX5","text":"Foreclosed remains a conclusion beyond repetition, since the final nocturnal speech returns to the first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS1","text":"Night-condition → breaking forth of fountain-speech and love song → articulation of inner longing.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A1","CH_97E9_DASN:A2","CH_97E9_DASN:A3","CH_97E9_DASN:A4","CH_97E9_DASN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS2","text":"Identity as light → self-encirclement by one's own light → incapacity for receiving → solitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A7","CH_97E9_DASN:A8","CH_97E9_DASN:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS3","text":"Continual giving → gulf between gift and reception → subjective poverty and envy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A10","CH_97E9_DASN:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS4","text":"Overabundance without response → exhaustion of virtue → hardness, withdrawal, and hunger for malice.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A12","CH_97E9_DASN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS5","text":"Hostility of light toward the luminous → search for the dark ones as possible receivers → renewed impossibility of symmetrical relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A14","CH_97E9_DASN:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:FGS6","text":"Unresolved isolation of light → thirst for night → longing breaks forth like a spring → speech repeats the beginning.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASN:A5","CH_97E9_DASN:A6","CH_97E9_DASN:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AF1","text":"Night → spring and love song → identity as light → self-consumption → unbridgeable gulf between giving and receiving → poverty and solitude → hunger for malice and withdrawal → longing for darkness → renewed nocturnal speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:AF2","text":"The concluding position is not a resolution, but the return of articulated longing into the same nocturnal initial cycle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME1","text":"Giving becomes visible no longer as pure fullness, but as a producer of poverty, envy, and hardening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME2","text":"Light is detached from its equation with goodness and classified as a power that is both giving and hostile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME3","text":"Darkness is remapped from mere negation into a medium of reception, generation of warmth, and possible response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME4","text":"Malice becomes visible as the functional counter-movement of a blocked surplus and not as an isolated moral property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME5","text":"The opposition of giving and receiving is exposed as a false perspective of reconciliation through the structural gulf between the two.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME6","text":"Night is classified as a productive condition of language and not as the absence of visibility or meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ME7","text":"The repetition of the song's beginning maps time as the circulation of unresolved neediness rather than as progress toward fulfillment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaking figure describes night, light, fountains, songs, thirst, solitude, and the desire for speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relation of abundance, distribution, reception, gulf, and hardening generates the social mechanics of the song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument shifts the valuation of giving, virtue, and malice and makes withdrawal visible as a counterstrategy of abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Light and darkness form relational positions of being whose unresolved tension repeats itself in a cyclical temporal pattern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to generate nocturnal speech, isolation of light, excess of giving, gulf, hardening, and the return of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether light and night are psychological, metaphysical, or exclusively poetic categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent as a cycle in which abundance brings forth its own lack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT4","text":"The contradiction between the desire for contact and the desire to wound or rob those who are gifted remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the reconstruction lies in the derivation of solitude and aggression from failed giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on metaphorical equations among light, spring, speaking figure, darkness, and reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASN:MRT7","text":"The actual movement is preserved provided that the repetition at the end is read as a structural return and not as a solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASN:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASN@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DASN:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 46","title":"The Night Song","context":"Chapter 46","original_title":"Das Nachtlied","original_context":"Chapter 46"},"original_title":"Das Nachtlied","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST","layer":"CH","title":"The Dance Song","order":47,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DAST"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DAST@R001","sha256":"8350301edb7b1f0b252fa37a0982b53c12e3219e077ed7f1d6faf724d03c2a21","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS1","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem Tanz eröffnet das Problem, wie Leichtigkeit, Dunkelheit und Lebensbejahung gegen den Geist der Schwere bestehen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS2","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt die Schwere als teuflische Gegenmacht und ordnet das Göttliche der Beweglichkeit des Tanzes zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS3","text":"Die Züchtigung des kleinen Gottes wird in Weinen, Lachen und erneute Tanzfähigkeit überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS4","text":"Das Lied verschiebt die Szene in einen Dialog, der Tiefe, Unergründlichkeit und Tugend als relationale Zuschreibungen entlarvt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS5","text":"Leben und Weisheit werden als verwandte, veränderliche und verführende Kräfte bestimmt, deren Anerkennung aus Begehren und nicht aus neutraler Erkenntnis hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung ist allegorisch-dialogisch und performativ: Sie widerlegt die Schwere nicht theoretisch, sondern durch Tanz, Spott, Lachen und Gegenrede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS7","text":"Mit dem Ende des Tanzes kehren Abend, Trauer und ungelöste Existenzfragen zurück; die Überwindung der Schwere bleibt vorläufig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A1","text":"Der Tanz verkörpert Leichtigkeit, Beweglichkeit und Lebensbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A2","text":"Der Geist der Schwere ist Zarathustras höchster teuflischer Gegner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A3","text":"Die Dunkelheit ist nicht notwendig lebensfeindlich, weil unter ihr Rosen und verborgene Schönheit erscheinen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A4","text":"Der kleine Gott beziehungsweise Cupido ist eine schlafende, zu Tanz, Tränen und Lachen rückführbare Figur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A5","text":"Das Leben erscheint als Macht, die den Menschen anzieht, herauszieht und über seine Begriffe spottet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A6","text":"Das Unergründliche bezeichnet zunächst nur, was ein begrenztes Wesen nicht ergründen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A7","text":"Das Leben ist veränderlich, wild und nicht tugendhaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A8","text":"Männliche Tugenden werden auf das Leben projiziert und als Tiefe, Treue, Ewigkeit oder Geheimnis ausgegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A9","text":"Die Weisheit ähnelt dem Leben in Blick, Lachen und goldener Angel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A10","text":"Zarathustras Lob des Lebens ist durch Begehren und Liebe bedingt und umfasst sogar den Hass auf das Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A11","text":"Weisheit wirkt durch Durst, Schleier, Netze und Selbstverleugnung als Verführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A12","text":"Der Abend erzeugt Fragen nach Grund, Zweck, Ursache, Richtung, Ort und Methode des Weiterlebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX1","text":"Der Tanz wird nicht als moralisch zu unterbrechende Zerstreuung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX2","text":"Die Leichtigkeit wird nicht als Feindschaft gegen das Göttliche bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX3","text":"Die Dunkelheit wird nicht mit dem Fehlen von Schönheit oder Leben gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX4","text":"Das Unergründliche wird nicht als absolute Eigenschaft des Lebens anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX5","text":"Das Leben wird nicht als beständige, tugendhafte oder rein männlich begriffene Ordnung anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX6","text":"Die Weisheit wird nicht als transparente, widerspruchsfreie Wahrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX7","text":"Zarathustras Wahrheitsrede gegenüber der Weisheit wird nicht als neutrale Mitteilung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX8","text":"Das Ende des Tanzes wird nicht als endgültige Überwindung der Trauer oder der Schwere dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D1","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Tanz und Geist der Schwere verschiebt die Unterscheidung zwischen Göttlichem und Teuflischem von moralischer Autorität zu Beweglichkeit und Gewicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D2","text":"Dunkelheit und Leichtigkeit bilden keinen ausschließenden Gegensatz, sondern können innerhalb derselben Existenzordnung koexistieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D3","text":"Die Rückführung des kleinen Gottes in den Tanz erfolgt durch eine Umwandlung von Strafe in Lachen, Weinen und Bitte.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D4","text":"Die Behauptung von Tiefe wird als Projektion eines begrenzten Erkennenden auf eine veränderliche Welt zurückgeführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D5","text":"Die Entmoralisierung des Lebens hebt seine Bejahung nicht auf, sondern macht sie von Tugend und moralischer Reinheit unabhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D6","text":"Weisheit wird als begehrtes Verfahren der Verführung und nicht als stabiler Besitz von Erkenntnis erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D7","text":"Die Ähnlichkeit von Leben und Weisheit macht die Weisheit zu einer lebensförmigen Erscheinung und verhindert ihre Verselbständigung als äußere Norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D8","text":"Zarathustras Lebensbejahung ist affektiv ambivalent, weil sie Liebe und Hass nicht voneinander trennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D9","text":"Der Tanz suspendiert die Schwere nur situativ; mit dem Abend kehren Unruhe, Trauer und Grundfragen zurück.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt substanzielle Begriffe wie Tiefe, Ewigkeit und Wahrheit durch relationale, affektive und projektionale Vorgänge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A8","CH_97E9_DAST:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis erscheint als Bewegung des Angelns, Verfolgens und Verführens, nicht als endgültige Aneignung eines Gegenstands.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD3","text":"Lebensbejahung wird als nichtmoralische, konflikthafte und selbstwidersprüchliche Praxis konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD4","text":"Die Gegenmacht zur Schwere wird performativ durch Tanz, Spott, Lachen und Lied erzeugt, nicht durch einen abgeschlossenen Beweis.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD5","text":"Die zeitliche Struktur begrenzt die Anti-Schwere-Strategie: Jede lokale Befreiung bleibt von der Rückkehr des Abends und seiner Fragen überschattet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD6","text":"Die Kritik an der Projektion männlicher Tugenden erfolgt selbst durch die männliche Stimme einer weiblich personifizierten Lebens- und Weisheitsfigur.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A8","CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX1","text":"Die Welt wird nicht als von einer transzendenten moralischen Schwere endgültig beherrscht vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX2","text":"Das Leben ist nicht als stabiler Grund hinter seinen wechselnden Erscheinungen verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX3","text":"Der Erkennende steht nicht außerhalb der Verführung, Projektion und affektiven Verwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX4","text":"Eine reine, widerspruchsfreie Lebensbejahung ohne Hass, Trauer oder Zorn ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX5","text":"Die Weisheit besitzt keine von Leben, Begehren und sprachlicher Anrufung unabhängige Wahrheitsinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX6","text":"Der Abend ist keine neutrale Kulisse, sondern ein zeitlicher Operator, der die erzielte Leichtigkeit destabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX1","text":"Ein endgültiger, stabiler Grund hinter Leben und Weisheit bleibt unzugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX2","text":"Eine reine Erkenntnis ohne Angel, Schleier, Netz, Projektion oder Begehren ist innerhalb des Systems nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX3","text":"Eine dauerhafte Befreiung von der Schwere wird ausgeschlossen, weil jede Tanzordnung in die Abendfrage zurückfallen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX4","text":"Eine abschließende Versöhnung von Leben und Weisheit, Liebe und Hass, Tanz und Trauer wird nicht formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS1","text":"Eine Tanzszene setzt Leichtigkeit als operative Gegenkraft zur Schwere.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS2","text":"Die Gegenkraft wird theologisch umcodiert, indem Schwere dem Teufel und Leichtigkeit dem Göttlichen zugeordnet wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS3","text":"Die verbleibende dunkle Seite wird integriert, indem Dunkelheit als Bedingung möglicher Schönheit erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS4","text":"Eine kleine, schlafende Figur wird durch Züchtigung, Tränen und Lachen wieder in die Tanzbewegung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS5","text":"Das Lied verwandelt die äußere Szene in einen Dialog zwischen Zarathustra, Leben und Weisheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS6","text":"Der Dialog zerlegt Unergründlichkeit, Tiefe und Tugend in Perspektive, Projektion und wechselnde Zuschreibung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS7","text":"Die Ähnlichkeit von Leben und Weisheit koppelt Erkenntnis an Begehren, Verführung und affektive Ambivalenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS8","text":"Das Ende des Tanzes führt über die Abendstimmung in eine offene Folge existenzieller Fragen und verhindert die endgültige Schließung des Systems.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AF1","text":"Unterbrechbarer Tanz → Umcodierung der Schwere als teuflische Macht → Integration von Dunkelheit in Leichtigkeit → Rückführung des kleinen Gottes durch Lachen und Tränen → Dialogische Entwertung von Tiefe und Tugend → Verknüpfung von Leben und Weisheit als verführende Kräfte → Rückkehr des Abends → ungelöste Fragen nach dem Weiterleben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AF2","text":"Die Bewegung schließt nicht mit einer Lösung, sondern mit der zeitlichen Rückkehr derjenigen Schwere, die der Tanz zuvor performativ suspendiert hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME1","text":"Tanz wird von einem sozialen Spiel zu einer ontologisch-strategischen Operation gegen die Schwere umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME2","text":"Göttlichkeit und Teuflischkeit werden nach Beweglichkeit und Gewicht statt nach moralischer Norm verteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME3","text":"Dunkelheit wird als mit Schönheit und Leben kompatible Bedingung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME4","text":"Tiefe, Treue, Ewigkeit und Geheimnis werden als projizierte Tugendnamen neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME5","text":"Leben und Weisheit erscheinen nicht mehr als getrennte Gegenstände, sondern als verwandte Formen der Anziehung und Verführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME6","text":"Liebe und Hass verlieren ihren Gegensatzcharakter und werden als gemeinsam erzeugende Affekte der Lebensbejahung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME7","text":"Der Abend wird vom bloßen Schauplatz zum zeitlichen Mechanismus der Rückkehr von Zweifel und Schwere umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Begegnung mit tanzenden Mädchen, ein Spottlied auf den Geist der Schwere und eine anschließende Abendtrauer bilden die sichtbare Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Handlung organisiert ein Gegensatzsystem aus Leichtigkeit und Schwere sowie ein Projektionssystem aus Leben, Weisheit, Tugend und Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt argumentative Widerlegung durch eine Praxis aus Tanz, Lachen, Spott, affektiver Umkehrung und zeitweiliger Entlastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität erscheint als veränderlich, relational und verführerisch; Zeit führt die suspendierte Schwere im Abend wieder ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome A1 bis A12 reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Tanz und Schwere über Leben und Weisheit bis zur Abendfrage zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der kleine Gott lediglich Cupido, eine Spielgestalt der Schwere oder eine eigenständige Gegenfigur bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Lebensbejahung als ambivalente und nicht als widerspruchsfreie Position verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT4","text":"Ihre größte strukturelle Stärke liegt in der Rückführung von Tiefe, Tugend und Unergründlichkeit auf Projektion, Perspektive und Begehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT5","text":"Ihre zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Entwertung des Unergründlichen und seiner wiederholten poetischen Rückkehr als Abyss, Geheimnis und Abendfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass die Kritik männlicher Tugendprojektionen durch männliche Rede und weibliche Personifikation vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung nur dann, wenn sie die Rückkehr der Trauer als strukturell offen und nicht als abschließend überwunden behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193035419305Z_5e58bad5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Dance Song","source_sha256":"8350301edb7b1f0b252fa37a0982b53c12e3219e077ed7f1d6faf724d03c2a21","sha256":"01adda20dea2ca5ce2caf19d80f5eddacef8e0e6946fc3ede44b0a1f2a86cc08","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:30:35.420347+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS1","text":"The encounter with dance opens the problem of how lightness, darkness, and affirmation of life can withstand the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS2","text":"Zarathustra defines gravity as a diabolical counterforce and assigns the divine to the mobility of dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS3","text":"The chastisement of the little god is transformed into weeping, laughter, and renewed capacity for dancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS4","text":"The song shifts the scene into a dialogue that exposes depth, unfathomability, and virtue as relational attributions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS5","text":"Life and wisdom are defined as kindred, mutable, and seductive forces, whose recognition proceeds from desire and not from neutral cognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument is allegorical-dialogical and performative: it does not refute gravity theoretically, but through dance, mockery, laughter, and rejoinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AS7","text":"With the end of the dance, evening, sorrow, and unresolved existential questions return; the overcoming of gravity remains provisional.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A1","text":"Dance embodies lightness, mobility, and affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A2","text":"The spirit of gravity is Zarathustra's supreme diabolical adversary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A3","text":"Darkness is not necessarily hostile to life, because roses and hidden beauty can appear beneath it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A4","text":"The little god, or Cupid, is a sleeping figure who can be led back to dance, tears, and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A5","text":"Life appears as a power that attracts the human being, draws him out, and mocks his concepts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A6","text":"The unfathomable initially denotes only what a limited being cannot fathom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A7","text":"Life is mutable, wild, and not virtuous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A8","text":"Masculine virtues are projected onto life and presented as depth, fidelity, eternity, or mystery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A9","text":"Wisdom resembles life in gaze, laughter, and golden fishing rod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A10","text":"Zarathustra's praise of life is conditioned by desire and love and encompasses even hatred of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A11","text":"Wisdom operates as seduction through thirst, veils, nets, and self-denial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:A12","text":"Evening produces questions concerning the ground, purpose, cause, direction, place, and method of continuing to live.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX1","text":"Dance is not defined as a diversion to be interrupted on moral grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX2","text":"Lightness is not defined as hostility toward the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX3","text":"Darkness is not equated with the absence of beauty or life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX4","text":"The unfathomable is not acknowledged as an absolute property of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX5","text":"Life is not acknowledged as a constant, virtuous, or purely masculinely conceived order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX6","text":"Wisdom is not defined as transparent, contradiction-free truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX7","text":"Zarathustra's discourse of truth addressed to wisdom is not treated as neutral communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:NX8","text":"The end of the dance is not presented as the definitive overcoming of sorrow or gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D1","text":"The juxtaposition of dance and the spirit of gravity shifts the distinction between the divine and the diabolical from moral authority to mobility and weight.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D2","text":"Darkness and lightness do not form an exclusive opposition, but can coexist within the same existential order.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D3","text":"The return of the little god to dance takes place through a transformation of punishment into laughter, weeping, and entreaty.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D4","text":"The assertion of depth is traced back to the projection of a limited knower onto a mutable world.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D5","text":"The demoralization of life does not annul its affirmation, but makes it independent of virtue and moral purity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D6","text":"Wisdom is produced as a desired practice of seduction and not as a stable possession of knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D7","text":"The similarity of life and wisdom makes wisdom a life-formed appearance and prevents its autonomization as an external norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D8","text":"Zarathustra's affirmation of life is affectively ambivalent because it does not separate love and hatred from one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:D9","text":"Dance suspends gravity only situationally; with evening, unrest, sorrow, and fundamental questions return.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD1","text":"The system replaces substantial concepts such as depth, eternity, and truth with relational, affective, and projective processes.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A8","CH_97E9_DAST:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD2","text":"Cognition appears as a movement of fishing, pursuing, and seducing, not as the final appropriation of an object.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD3","text":"Affirmation of life is constituted as a nonmoral, conflictual, and self-contradictory practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A10","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD4","text":"The counterforce to gravity is generated performatively through dance, mockery, laughter, and song, not through a completed proof.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD5","text":"The temporal structure limits the anti-gravity strategy: every local liberation remains overshadowed by the return of evening and its questions.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2","CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SD6","text":"The critique of the projection of masculine virtues itself occurs through the masculine voice of a femininely personified figure of life and wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A8","CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX1","text":"The world is not presupposed to be definitively ruled by a transcendent moral gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX2","text":"Life is not available as a stable ground behind its changing appearances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX3","text":"The knower does not stand outside seduction, projection, and affective entanglement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX4","text":"A pure, contradiction-free affirmation of life without hatred, sorrow, or anger is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX5","text":"Wisdom possesses no instance of truth independent of life, desire, and linguistic address.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:DNX6","text":"Evening is not a neutral backdrop, but a temporal operator that destabilizes the lightness attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX1","text":"A final, stable ground behind life and wisdom remains inaccessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX2","text":"Pure cognition without fishing rod, veil, net, projection, or desire is not available within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX3","text":"A lasting liberation from gravity is excluded, because every order of dance can fall back into the question of evening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:SNX4","text":"A conclusive reconciliation of life and wisdom, love and hatred, dance and sorrow is not formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS1","text":"A dance scene posits lightness as an operative counterforce to gravity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS2","text":"The counterforce is theologically recoded by assigning gravity to the devil and lightness to the divine.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A1","CH_97E9_DAST:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS3","text":"The remaining dark side is integrated by darkness appearing as the condition of possible beauty.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS4","text":"A small, sleeping figure is returned to the movement of dance through chastisement, tears, and laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS5","text":"The song transforms the external scene into a dialogue among Zarathustra, life, and wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A5","CH_97E9_DAST:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS6","text":"The dialogue decomposes unfathomability, depth, and virtue into perspective, projection, and changing attribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A6","CH_97E9_DAST:A7","CH_97E9_DAST:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS7","text":"The similarity of life and wisdom couples cognition to desire, seduction, and affective ambivalence.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A9","CH_97E9_DAST:A10","CH_97E9_DAST:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:FGS8","text":"The end of the dance leads, through the mood of evening, into an open sequence of existential questions and prevents the definitive closure of the system.","refs":["CH_97E9_DAST:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AF1","text":"Interruptible dance → Recoding of gravity as a diabolical power → Integration of darkness into lightness → Return of the little god through laughter and tears → Dialogical devaluation of depth and virtue → Linkage of life and wisdom as seductive forces → Return of evening → Unresolved questions concerning continued life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:AF2","text":"The movement concludes not with a solution, but with the temporal return of the gravity that dance had previously suspended performatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME1","text":"Dance is reclassified from a social game into an ontological-strategic operation against gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME2","text":"Divinity and diabolicalness are distributed according to mobility and weight rather than moral norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME3","text":"Darkness becomes visible as a condition compatible with beauty and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME4","text":"Depth, fidelity, eternity, and mystery are reclassified as projected names of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME5","text":"Life and wisdom no longer appear as separate objects, but as kindred forms of attraction and seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME6","text":"Love and hatred lose their oppositional character and are mapped as jointly generative affects of affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ME7","text":"Evening is redrawn from a mere setting into a temporal mechanism of the return of doubt and gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT1","text":"Surface — An encounter with dancing girls, a mocking song against the spirit of gravity, and subsequent evening sorrow constitute the visible action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT2","text":"Structural — The action organizes a system of oppositions between lightness and gravity, as well as a system of projection involving life, wisdom, virtue, and depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces argumentative refutation with a practice of dance, laughter, mockery, affective reversal, and temporary relief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears mutable, relational, and seductive; time reintroduces the suspended gravity in the evening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT1","text":"Axioms A1 through A12 suffice to reconstruct the movement from dance and gravity through life and wisdom to the question of evening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the little god denotes merely Cupid, a playful figure of gravity, or an independent counterfigure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that affirmation of life is understood as an ambivalent and not as a contradiction-free position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT4","text":"Its greatest structural strength lies in tracing depth, virtue, and unfathomability back to projection, perspective, and desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT5","text":"Its central fault line lies between the devaluation of the unfathomable and its repeated poetic return as abyss, mystery, and the question of evening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that the critique of masculine virtue projections is mediated through masculine speech and feminine personification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DAST:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument only if it treats the return of sorrow as structurally open and not as conclusively overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DAST:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DAST@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DAST:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 47","title":"The Dance Song","context":"Chapter 47","original_title":"Das Tanzlied","original_context":"Chapter 47"},"original_title":"Das Tanzlied","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG","layer":"CH","title":"The Grave Song","order":48,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DASG"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASG@R001","sha256":"75578b4899b49b0d5499c58abee39169234892fd54ba5adf1b23b04d336d2df2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS1","text":"Der Gesang setzt bei der Frage an, wie die vernichteten Gesichte und Augenblicke der Jugend zugleich als Gräber und als Träger des Lebens bestimmt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS2","text":"Der Verlust wird nicht als gegenseitige Untreue, sondern als feindliche Zerstörung der verwundbarsten Werte des Sprechers bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS3","text":"Die feindliche Macht wirkt durch die Verkehrung bejahender Orientierungen in Ekel, Qual, Schuld und Verstummen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS4","text":"Die Zerstörung der Jugend vernichtet die höchste Hoffnung nicht nur inhaltlich, sondern auch in ihrer möglichen Ausdrucksform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS5","text":"Das Argument ist diagnostisch-genealogisch und rekonstruktiv: Es verfolgt die Entstehung der Wunde bis zu der Kraft, die aus ihr wieder hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung führt vom getöteten Vergangenen über Gedächtnis und Fluch zum unverwundbaren Willen und von den Gräbern zur Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A1","text":"Die Gesichte, Liebesblicke und Augenblicke der Jugend bilden das Herzlichste und Verwundbarste des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A2","text":"Diese Jugendgestalten sterben schnell und werden vom Sprecher als Tote erinnert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A3","text":"Ihr Verlust ist keine von beiden Seiten verschuldete Untreue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A4","text":"Feindliche Gewalt richtet sich gegen das Verwundbarste, um den Sprecher selbst zu treffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A5","text":"Feindliche Einwirkung kann eine bejahende Orientierung des Sprechers in ihr widerwärtiges Gegenbild verkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A6","text":"Diese Verkehrungen verwandeln Heiligkeit, Weisheit, Begierde, Überwindung, Mildtätigkeit und Opfer in Qual, Ekel, Beschuldigung oder Ersticken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A7","text":"Die höchsten Dinge besitzen für den Sprecher ihre angemessene Ausdrucksform nur im Tanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A8","text":"Die feindliche Zerstörung des Tanzes lässt das höchste Gleichnis und die höchste Hoffnung ungesprochen und unerlöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A9","text":"Im Sprecher besteht ein unverwundbarer und unbegrabbarer Wille fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A10","text":"Dieser Wille schreitet unverändert durch die Jahre und durchbricht die Gräber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A11","text":"Das Unerlöste der Jugend lebt im Willen als Leben und Hoffnung weiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A12","text":"Auferstehungen gibt es nur dort, wo Gräber sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX1","text":"Der Verlust ist nicht das natürliche Verblassen oder die selbstbestimmte Ablösung der Jugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX2","text":"Die Trennung ist nicht als schuldhafte gegenseitige Untreue zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX3","text":"Die Verwundung ist nicht auf gewöhnlichen Menschenmord oder körperliche Gewalt reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX4","text":"Die feindliche Macht verneint die Werte nicht einfach von außen, sondern verdirbt ihre innere Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX5","text":"Die Jugend kann nicht in ihrer ursprünglichen Form unversehrt zurückgewonnen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX6","text":"Das Grab ist kein endgültiger Abschluss des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX7","text":"Der Wille ist weder zerstört noch begraben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX8","text":"Das höchste Gleichnis ist nicht einfach vorhanden, sobald die höchste Erfahrung vorhanden ist; es kann durch fremde Einwirkung unausgesprochen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D1","text":"Der Verlust wird als gewaltsame Zerstörung einer wertbildenden Welt und nicht als bloße Abwesenheit lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D2","text":"Die Wirksamkeit der Feinde beruht auf Verkehrung und Kontamination, nicht auf einfacher Negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D3","text":"Der Angriff erfasst zugleich ethische, affektive, zeitliche, relationale und ästhetische Ebenen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6","CH_97E9_DASG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D4","text":"Das Verstummen des höchsten Gleichnisses bezeichnet den Erfolg der Zerstörung, nicht die Abwesenheit eines höchsten Wertes.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A7","CH_97E9_DASG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D5","text":"Wo die Jugend als Inhalt verloren ist, übernimmt der Wille die Funktion der zeitlichen Kontinuität.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D6","text":"Die Gräber werden von Endpunkten in Durchgangsbedingungen der Auferstehung umgebildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D7","text":"Das Gedächtnis bewahrt die Toten, trägt das Leben zu ihnen zurück und fixiert zugleich die Zuschreibung der Schuld.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD1","text":"Die Feinde greifen nicht nur einzelne Erlebnisse an, sondern die Fähigkeit des Sprechers, Heiligkeit, Begierde, Überwindung, Großzügigkeit und Ekstase als Werte hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6","CH_97E9_DASG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD2","text":"Die Kontinuität des Subjekts verschiebt sich vom Besitz intakter Jugendbilder auf die Fortdauer des Willens.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD3","text":"Auferstehung bezeichnet keine Wiederherstellung der verlorenen Jugend, sondern eine neue Lebensbewegung des Willens durch deren Gräber hindurch.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A8","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD4","text":"Der Verlust wird in eine Doppeloperation aus Trauer und Gegenmacht überführt: Der Kranz bewahrt die Toten, der Fluch hält den Feind fest.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD5","text":"Die affirmative Zukunft entsteht nicht außerhalb der Zerstörung, sondern aus einer Kraft, die deren Gräber durchquert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass der Tod der Jugend als notwendige Reifung oder natürliche Ablösung verstanden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Werte ihre Bedeutung unabhängig von affektiven, sozialen und symbolischen Vermittlungen bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Rückkehr zu einer unbeschädigten ursprünglichen Reinheit die Lösung des Verlusts bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Identität des Sprechers durch die unveränderte Erhaltung seiner vergangenen Bilder gesichert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass das Heilige gegen Verunreinigung, Aneignung oder Umdeutung immun ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Tod, Verlust und Begräbnis den ontologischen Endpunkt bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX7","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Erlösung ohne fortbestehende Wunde oder ohne das Unerlöste der Jugend möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX1","text":"Der Gesang schließt eine Welt aus, in der Jugend, Liebe, Heiligkeit und Weisheit ihre ursprüngliche Gestalt unangefochten bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX2","text":"Er schließt eine Versöhnung aus, in der der Feind, die Schuld und der Fluch aus dem Gedächtnis verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX3","text":"Er schließt eine abgeschlossene Erlösung aus; das Unerlöste bleibt Bestandteil des weiterlebenden Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX4","text":"Er schließt ein reines Leben jenseits der Negation aus; das neue Leben wird durch Zerstörung und Grab hindurch erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX5","text":"Er schließt die Trennung von Tod und Leben als stabile Gegensätze aus; das Grab wird zur Bedingung der Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS1","text":"Bejahende Jugendform P + höchste Verwundbarkeit V erzeugen ein bevorzugtes Angriffsziel.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS2","text":"Feindliche Einwirkung H(V) transformiert P in eine verkehrte Form P′ und erzeugt Wunde W.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS3","text":"Die verkehrte Form P′ zerstört den Ausdruck der höchsten Erfahrung und erzeugt ungesprochene Hoffnung U.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A7","CH_97E9_DASG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS4","text":"Der Verlust von P erzeugt Grab G; das Gedächtnis verbindet G mit Lebenskranz und Feindesfluch.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS5","text":"In G bleibt der Wille Vₙ als unverletzbare Kontinuität bestehen und trägt U als fortdauernde Jugendhoffnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS6","text":"Vₙ durchquert G; dadurch wird G von einem Endzustand in eine operative Schwelle verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS7","text":"G → Vₙ → Auferstehung: Das neue Leben entsteht aus der Fortbewegung des Willens durch das Begrabene, nicht aus dessen Wiederherstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AF1","text":"Gräberinsel und Rückkehr → Erinnerung der getöteten Jugend → Neubestimmung des Verlusts als feindliche Zerstörung → Aufdeckung der wertverkehrenden Feindesoperation → Verstummen von Tanz, Gleichnis und Hoffnung → Frage nach dem Überleben der Seele → Wille als unverwundbare und unbegrabare Kontinuität → Gräber als Bedingungen der Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME1","text":"Die Gräberinsel wird vom Ort des Verlusts zum Ort der möglichen Lebensfortsetzung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME2","text":"Feindseligkeit wird von äußerer Schädigung zu einer Operation der Wertverkehrung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME3","text":"Untreue wird von moralischer Schuld in eine unschuldige, erzwungene Trennungsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME4","text":"Die getöteten Jugendbilder werden von verlorenen Objekten zu latentem, im Willen fortbestehendem Material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME5","text":"Das Verstummen des Tanzes wird als strukturelle Beschädigung der Ausdrucksfähigkeit und nicht als bloßes Scheitern einer Handlung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME6","text":"Tod und Leben erscheinen nicht mehr als ausschließende Gegensätze, sondern als Sequenz von Begräbnis und Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME7","text":"Trauer und Fluch werden als komplementäre Formen derselben Gedächtnisoperation kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher beklagt die getöteten Gesichte und Augenblicke seiner Jugend und richtet einen Fluch gegen ihre Feinde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT2","text":"Structural — Feindliche Macht zerstört Werte, indem sie deren affektive, ethische und symbolische Formen in widerwärtige Gegenbilder verkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gesang verwandelt die Niederlage der Erinnerung in eine Doppelstrategie aus Bewahrung, Anklage und fortgesetzter Willensbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Wille bildet eine unbegrabare Zeitkontinuität, in der das Unerlöste der Vergangenheit als Bedingung zukünftigen Lebens erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Jugendverlust, feindlicher Verkehrung, Willenskontinuität und Auferstehung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wer die Feinde sind und ob ihre Gewalt individuell, sozial, geistig oder metaphorisch zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Sequenz von Verletzung über Begräbnis zu Willen und Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT4","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem unveränderten Willen und der durch ihn erzeugten Transformation; seine Identität und seine Produktivität werden nicht vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Tod der Jugendgesichte und ihrem Weiterleben als Unerlöstes im Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT6","text":"Eine dritte Spannung liegt zwischen der behaupteten Unschuld der gegenseitigen Untreue und der kategorischen Zuschreibung des Verlusts an die Feinde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT7","text":"Die stärkste strukturelle Verbindung besteht in der Umwandlung des Grabes vom Endpunkt in die Bedingung der Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an komprimierten metaphorischen Gleichsetzungen von Mord, Verwundung, Begräbnis und Auferstehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT9","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern Auferstehung als Fortsetzung des Willens durch den Verlust und nicht als Wiederherstellung der Jugend verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192946082215Z_5fd54fc0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Grave Song","source_sha256":"75578b4899b49b0d5499c58abee39169234892fd54ba5adf1b23b04d336d2df2","sha256":"cb085a08085fd845db2e36bbf8ebcfaa47d0351beb62a8976dac45060897db38","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:29:46.084060+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS1","text":"The song begins with the question of how the annihilated visions and moments of youth can simultaneously be determined as graves and as bearers of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS2","text":"The loss is determined not as mutual unfaithfulness, but as the hostile destruction of the speaker's most vulnerable values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS3","text":"The hostile power operates through the inversion of affirmative orientations into disgust, torment, guilt, and falling silent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS4","text":"The destruction of youth annihilates the highest hope not only in its content, but also in its possible form of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS5","text":"The argument is diagnostic-genealogical and reconstructive: it traces the emergence of the wound back to the force that re-emerges from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AS6","text":"The movement leads from the slain past through memory and curse to the invulnerable will, and from the graves to resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A1","text":"The visions, loving glances, and moments of youth constitute what is most heartfelt and most vulnerable for the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A2","text":"These youthful figures die quickly and are remembered by the speaker as dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A3","text":"Their loss is not an infidelity for which either side is at fault.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A4","text":"Hostile violence directs itself against what is most vulnerable in order to strike the speaker himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A5","text":"Hostile influence can invert an affirmative orientation of the speaker into its repugnant counter-image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A6","text":"These inversions transform holiness, wisdom, desire, overcoming, beneficence, and sacrifice into torment, disgust, accusation, or suffocation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A7","text":"For the speaker, the highest things possess their adequate form of expression only in dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A8","text":"The hostile destruction of dance leaves the highest likeness and the highest hope unspoken and unredeemed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A9","text":"Within the speaker, an invulnerable and unburyable will endures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A10","text":"This will proceeds unchanged through the years and breaks through the graves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A11","text":"The unredeemed element of youth lives on in the will as life and hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:A12","text":"Resurrections exist only where there are graves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX1","text":"The loss is not the natural fading or self-determined detachment of youth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX2","text":"The separation is not to be understood as culpable mutual infidelity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX3","text":"The wounding cannot be reduced to ordinary murder or physical violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX4","text":"Hostile power does not simply negate values from without, but corrupts their inner form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX5","text":"Youth cannot be regained intact in its original form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX6","text":"The grave is not a final ending of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX7","text":"The will is neither destroyed nor buried.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:NX8","text":"The highest likeness is not simply present as soon as the highest experience is present; it can remain unspoken through alien influence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D1","text":"The loss becomes legible as the violent destruction of a value-forming world and not as mere absence.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D2","text":"The efficacy of the enemies rests on inversion and contamination, not on simple negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D3","text":"The attack encompasses ethical, affective, temporal, relational, and aesthetic levels at once.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6","CH_97E9_DASG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D4","text":"The silencing of the highest likeness signifies the success of destruction, not the absence of a highest value.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A7","CH_97E9_DASG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D5","text":"Where youth is lost as content, the will assumes the function of temporal continuity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D6","text":"The graves are transformed from endpoints into transitional conditions of resurrection.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:D7","text":"Memory preserves the dead, carries life back to them, and at the same time fixes the attribution of guilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD1","text":"The enemies attack not merely individual experiences, but the speaker's capacity to bring forth holiness, desire, overcoming, generosity, and ecstasy as values.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6","CH_97E9_DASG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD2","text":"The continuity of the subject shifts from the possession of intact images of youth to the persistence of the will.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD3","text":"Resurrection denotes not a restoration of lost youth, but a new movement of life of the will through its graves.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A8","CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD4","text":"Loss is transferred into a double operation of mourning and counter-power: the wreath preserves the dead, the curse holds fast the enemy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SD5","text":"The affirmative future arises not outside destruction, but from a force that traverses its graves.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that the death of youth can be understood as necessary maturation or natural detachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that values preserve their meaning independently of affective, social, and symbolic mediations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that the return to an undamaged original purity constitutes the solution to loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the speaker's identity is secured through the unchanged preservation of his past images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that the sacred is immune to contamination, appropriation, or reinterpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that death, loss, and burial constitute the ontological endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:DNX7","text":"It excludes the possibility that redemption is possible without a persisting wound or without the unredeemed element of youth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX1","text":"The song excludes a world in which youth, love, holiness, and wisdom preserve their original form unchallenged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX2","text":"It excludes a reconciliation in which the enemy, guilt, and curse disappear from memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX3","text":"It excludes a completed redemption; the unredeemed remains a component of the continuing will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX4","text":"It excludes a pure life beyond negation; the new life is produced through destruction and grave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:SNX5","text":"It excludes the separation of death and life as stable opposites; the grave becomes the condition of resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS1","text":"Affirmative form of youth P + highest vulnerability V generate a preferred target of attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A1","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS2","text":"Hostile influence H(V) transforms P into an inverted form P′ and generates wound W.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A4","CH_97E9_DASG:A5","CH_97E9_DASG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS3","text":"The inverted form P′ destroys the expression of the highest experience and generates unspoken hope U.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A7","CH_97E9_DASG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS4","text":"The loss of P generates grave G; memory links G with wreath of life and curse upon the enemy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A2","CH_97E9_DASG:A3","CH_97E9_DASG:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS5","text":"In G, will Vₙ endures as inviolable continuity and bears U as enduring hope of youth.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS6","text":"Vₙ traverses G; thereby G is transformed from an end-state into an operative threshold.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:FGS7","text":"G → Vₙ → Resurrection: New life arises from the movement of the will through what has been buried, not from its restoration.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASG:A9","CH_97E9_DASG:A10","CH_97E9_DASG:A11","CH_97E9_DASG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:AF1","text":"Island of graves and return → remembrance of the slain youth → redefinition of loss as hostile destruction → disclosure of the enemy operation that inverts values → silencing of dance, likeness, and hope → question concerning the survival of the soul → will as invulnerable and unburyable continuity → graves as conditions of resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME1","text":"The island of graves is remapped from the place of loss into the place of possible continuation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME2","text":"Hostility is reclassified from external injury into an operation of value inversion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME3","text":"Infidelity is remapped from moral guilt into an innocent, compelled form of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME4","text":"The slain images of youth are transformed from lost objects into latent material persisting in the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME5","text":"The silencing of dance becomes visible as structural damage to the capacity for expression and not as the mere failure of an action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME6","text":"Death and life no longer appear as mutually exclusive opposites, but as a sequence of burial and resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ME7","text":"Mourning and curse are mapped as complementary forms of the same operation of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker laments the slain visions and moments of his youth and directs a curse against their enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT2","text":"Structural — Hostile power destroys values by inverting their affective, ethical, and symbolic forms into repugnant counter-images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The song transforms the defeat of memory into a double strategy of preservation, accusation, and continued movement of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The will forms an unburyable temporal continuity in which the unredeemed element of the past remains preserved as the condition of future life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement of youth-loss, hostile inversion, continuity of will, and resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined who the enemies are and whether their violence is to be understood individually, socially, spiritually, or metaphorically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT3","text":"The sequence from wounding through burial to will and resurrection is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT4","text":"A tension remains between the unchanged will and the transformation generated by it; its identity and its productivity are not mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT5","text":"A second tension remains between the death of the visions of youth and their continued life as unredeemed in the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT6","text":"A third tension lies between the asserted innocence of mutual infidelity and the categorical attribution of loss to the enemies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT7","text":"The strongest structural connection consists in the transformation of the grave from endpoint into the condition of resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction depends on compressed metaphorical equivalences of murder, wounding, burial, and resurrection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASG:MRT9","text":"The actual movement of argument remains preserved, provided resurrection is understood as the continuation of the will through loss and not as the restoration of youth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASG:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASG@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DASG:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 48","title":"The Grave Song","context":"Chapter 48","original_title":"Das Grablied","original_context":"Chapter 48"},"original_title":"Das Grablied","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB","layer":"CH","title":"On Self-Overcoming","order":49,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDSB"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDSB@R001","sha256":"5b7ed6794218fc5a2824f458f6052a08493ae57dc0d4483d8c3849b18084c27e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert den von den Weisesten bekundeten Willen zur Wahrheit als noch unerkannte Macht über die Denkbarkeit alles Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt diesen Willen zur Denkbarkeit als Willen zur Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS3","text":"Die auf das Werden gesetzten Werte erscheinen dadurch als Hervorbringungen eines herrschenden Willens und nicht als selbständige Maßstäbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS4","text":"Die Analyse des Lebendigen verallgemeinert diese Struktur zu einem Verhältnis von Gehorsam, Befehl, Herrschaft und Selbstgefährdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS5","text":"Der Wille zur Macht wird als Grundbewegung des Lebens gegen den Willen zum Dasein gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS6","text":"Leben wird als fortgesetzte Selbstüberwindung bestimmt, in der auch Opfer, Dienst, Schöpfung und Untergang Machtbewegungen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS7","text":"Daraus folgt eine schöpferische Umwertung, die bestehende Werte zerbrechen muss und die höchste Güte mit dem höchsten Bösen verschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","text":"Der Wille zur Wahrheit der Weisesten ist ein Wille zur Denkbarkeit alles Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A2","text":"Alles Seiende soll dem Geist gefügig, glatt und als Spiegel oder Widerbild verfügbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","text":"Der Wille zur Denkbarkeit ist ein Wille zur Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","text":"Werte werden auf den Fluss des Werdens gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A5","text":"Die geltenden Wertungen von Gut und Böse entspringen einem herrschenden Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","text":"Alles Lebendige ist ein Gehorchendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","text":"Demjenigen wird befohlen, der sich nicht selbst gehorchen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","text":"Befehlen ist schwerer als Gehorchen und trägt die Last der Gehorchenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","text":"Jeder Befehl ist ein Versuch und eine Selbstgefährdung des Lebendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","text":"Auch der Selbstbefehl macht das Lebendige zum Richter, Rächer und Opfer seines eigenen Gesetzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A11","text":"Im Willen des Dienenden wirkt der Wille, über noch Schwächeres Herr zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","text":"Das Leben ist dasjenige, was sich immer selbst überwinden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A13","text":"Einen Willen zum Dasein gibt es nicht; wo Leben ist, gibt es Willen zur Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","text":"Kein Gutes und Böses besitzt unvergängliche Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A15","text":"Eine neue Wertschöpfung setzt die Vernichtung und Zerbrechung bestehender Werte voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A16","text":"Verschwiegenen Wahrheiten wird durch Schweigen eine giftige Wirksamkeit belassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX1","text":"Der Wille zur Wahrheit ist nicht als unabhängige Suche nach Wahrheit zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX2","text":"Seiendes ist nicht als bereits vollständig denkbar und geistig ungebunden vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX3","text":"Werte sind keine dem Werden äußerlichen oder übergeordneten Instanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX4","text":"Volkstümliche Wertungen von Gut und Böse sind keine autonomen Ursprünge der Moral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX5","text":"Der Fluss des Werdens ist nicht die eigentliche Gefahr für Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX6","text":"Gehorsam ist keine machtfreie Gegenposition zur Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX7","text":"Einen eigenständigen Willen zum Dasein gibt es nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX8","text":"Gutes und Böses sind keine unveränderlichen moralischen Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX9","text":"Schöpfung ist nicht von Vernichtung und Wertzerbrechung ablösbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX10","text":"Schweigen ist keine neutrale Bewahrung problematischer Wahrheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D1","text":"Der Wille zur Wahrheit wird von einer epistemischen Zielsetzung in eine Machtoperation überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A2","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D2","text":"Wertungen erscheinen als bewegliche Setzungen innerhalb des Werdens und nicht als dessen transzendente Maßstäbe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","CH_97E9_VDSB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D3","text":"Gehorsam und Befehl bilden zwei Richtungen desselben Machtverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D4","text":"Dienst, Opferung und Liebesblick können als indirekte Aneignungen von Macht funktionieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D5","text":"Selbstbeherrschung ist keine Befreiung vom Machtwillen, sondern dessen reflexive Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D6","text":"Leben wird nicht durch Selbsterhaltung, sondern durch Selbstüberwindung und Machtsteigerung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D7","text":"Jede moralische Ordnung bleibt der Möglichkeit ihrer eigenen Überwindung ausgesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D8","text":"Erkenntnis wird als Pfad und Fußstapfe des Willens zur Macht klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD1","text":"Erkenntnis, Moral und Lebensvorgang werden unter einer einheitlichen Logik des Willens zur Macht zusammengezogen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","CH_97E9_VDSB:A5","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD2","text":"Herrschaft, Dienst, Gehorsam und Opfer sind keine getrennten sozialen Grundformen, sondern interne Modulationen eines einzigen Machtprozesses.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD3","text":"Das Leben erzeugt seine höchsten Formen durch die Bereitschaft, sich selbst zu gefährden, zu opfern und zu übersteigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD4","text":"Wertordnungen sind zeitweilige Formen des Werdens, deren Zerbrechen aus derselben schöpferischen Macht hervorgeht, die sie errichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD5","text":"Der höchste schöpferische Akt kann nicht in einer stabilen moralischen Endordnung bestehen, weil er seine eigenen Voraussetzungen wieder angreift.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine machtfreie, neutrale Erkenntnisposition aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX2","text":"Es schließt einen ursprünglichen Selbsterhaltungstrieb als letzte Erklärung des Lebens aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine moralische Ordnung aus, die unabhängig vom Werden und von Wertsetzungen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine einfache Hierarchie aus, in der Herrschende unbelastete Macht besitzen und Dienende machtlos bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Trennung von Schöpfung und Zerstörung als zwei selbständige Vorgänge aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Versöhnung von Leben, Wert und Zweck aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX7","text":"Es schließt einen Standpunkt außerhalb des Willens zur Macht aus, von dem aus dessen Wirkung abschließend beurteilt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, vor der dauerhaft gekniet werden kann, ohne dass auch diese Welt wieder überwunden werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein nicht gewollter Grund von Wahrheit, Wert und Sinn, der dem Machtprozess äußerlich bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Leben, dessen höchste Form in bloßer Fortdauer oder Sicherung bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine letzte Form des Guten, die nicht zugleich die Zerstörung bestehender Güter einschlösse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die vollständige Stillstellung des Widerspruchs; ungelöste Wahrheit kehrt als Gift zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS1","text":"Epistemischer Anspruch → Forderung nach Denkbarkeit alles Seienden → Unterwerfung des Seienden unter den Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS2","text":"Unterwerfung unter den Geist → Entlarvung des Erkenntniswillens als Wille zur Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS3","text":"Setzung von Werten auf das Werden → Rückführung moralischer Geltung auf einen herrschenden Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS4","text":"Analyse des Lebendigen → Generalisierung von Gehorsam, Befehl und Selbstbefehl als Machtformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS5","text":"Machtform des Befehls → Last, Versuch, Wagnis und Selbstgefährdung des Lebendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS6","text":"Einheit von Dienst, Opfer und Herrschaft → Bestimmung des Lebens als fortgesetzte Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS7","text":"Ausschluss des Willens zum Dasein → Vorrang des Willens zur Macht als Lebensgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS8","text":"Selbstüberwindung des Lebens → Vergänglichkeit der Werte → schöpferische Zerstörung bestehender Wertordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS9","text":"Giftigkeit des Verschwiegenen → Vorrang des Aussprechens vor der Stabilisierung durch Schweigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AF1","text":"Wille zur Wahrheit → Wille zur Denkbarkeit → Wille zur Macht → Werte als Setzungen im Werden → Gehorsam und Befehl als Lebensstruktur → Selbstüberwindung → Ausschluss des Willens zum Dasein → Zerstörung bestehender Werte → schöpferische Güte unter Einschluss des höchsten Bösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME1","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Wahrheit und Macht wird aufgehoben, indem Erkenntnis als Machtvollzug kartiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME2","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Herrschenden und Dienenden wird in ein zirkulierendes Machtverhältnis umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME3","text":"Moralische Werte werden von zeitlosen Normen zu beweglichen Formen auf dem Fluss des Werdens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME4","text":"Schöpfung und Vernichtung erscheinen als zusammengehörige Phasen derselben Wertproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME5","text":"Leben wird nicht mehr als schützenswerter Endzweck, sondern als riskanter Träger von Machtsteigerung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME6","text":"Das höchste Gute wird nicht jenseits des Bösen, sondern als schöpferische Durcharbeitung und Zerstörung des Bestehenden bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text behandelt den Willen zur Wahrheit, die Wertungen von Gut und Böse sowie die beobachtbaren Formen von Gehorsam, Befehl und Opfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Er rekonstruiert diese Formen als institutionell und relational verschränkte Machtbewegungen innerhalb des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Erkenntnis und Wertschöpfung werden als Vorgänge neu gerahmt, die Aneignung, Selbstgefährdung und die Zerstörung bestehender Formen einschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Leben wird als werdender, sich selbst überwindender Wille zur Macht bestimmt, während Werte keine unvergängliche Existenz besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Kritik des Willens zur Wahrheit zur schöpferischen Wertzerstörung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Wille zur Macht als empirische Beschreibung des Lebens oder als universales Interpretationsprinzip fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT3","text":"Die Begründung gegen den Willen zum Dasein widerlegt dessen mögliche Varianten nicht vollständig, sondern ersetzt sie durch eine andere Grundbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT4","text":"Die Spannung zwischen dem universalen Gehorsam des Lebendigen und der Macht des Befehlenden wird umgedeutet, aber nicht vollständig aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT5","text":"Die Behauptung unvergänglicher Selbstüberwindung steht in Spannung zur Zurückweisung jeder endgültigen, überzeitlichen Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT6","text":"Die Verbindung von höchstem Bösen und höchster Güte wird strukturell behauptet, aber nicht deduktiv aus einer unabhängigen Norm abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Anthropomorphisierung des Lebens, rhetorische Evidenz und philosophische Deduktion nicht miteinander verwechselt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194654505733Z_60f983b3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Self-Overcoming","source_sha256":"5b7ed6794218fc5a2824f458f6052a08493ae57dc0d4483d8c3849b18084c27e","sha256":"d9f0114b257f26c5e60c7722a0ed55a5014f77be1adb4117ea2e40d244456686","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:46:54.506569+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the will to truth avowed by the wisest as a still unrecognized power over the intelligibility of all that is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS2","text":"It determines this will to intelligibility as will to power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS3","text":"The values posited upon becoming thereby appear as productions of a ruling will and not as independent standards.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS4","text":"The analysis of the living generalizes this structure into a relation of obedience, command, domination, and self-endangerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS5","text":"The will to power is posited as the fundamental movement of life against the will to existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS6","text":"Life is determined as continuous self-overcoming, in which sacrifice, service, creation, and decline also remain movements of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AS7","text":"From this follows a creative revaluation that must shatter existing values and interweaves the highest goodness with the highest evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","text":"The will to truth of the wisest is a will to the intelligibility of all that is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A2","text":"All that is is to become compliant, smooth, and available to the spirit as mirror or reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","text":"The will to intelligibility is a will to power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","text":"Values are posited upon the flow of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A5","text":"The prevailing valuations of good and evil arise from a ruling will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","text":"Everything living is something obedient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","text":"Command is given to whoever cannot obey himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","text":"Commanding is harder than obeying and bears the burden of those who obey.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","text":"Every command is an experiment and a self-endangerment of the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","text":"Even self-command makes the living the judge, avenger, and sacrifice of its own law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A11","text":"In the will of the servant, the will to be master over what is still weaker is at work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","text":"Life is that which must always overcome itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A13","text":"There is no will to existence; where there is life, there is will to power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","text":"No good and evil possesses imperishable validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A15","text":"A new creation of values presupposes the destruction and shattering of existing values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:A16","text":"Through silence, unspoken truths are left a poisonous efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX1","text":"The will to truth is not to be understood as an independent search for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX2","text":"What is is not presupposed as already fully intelligible and unbound by the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX3","text":"Values are not instances external or superior to becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX4","text":"Popular valuations of good and evil are not autonomous origins of morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX5","text":"The flow of becoming is not the actual danger to good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX6","text":"Obedience is not a power-free counterposition to domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX7","text":"There is no independent will to existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX8","text":"Good and evil are not unchangeable moral quantities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX9","text":"Creation cannot be detached from destruction and the shattering of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:NX10","text":"Silence is not a neutral preservation of problematic truths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D1","text":"The will to truth is shifted from an epistemic aim into an operation of power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A2","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D2","text":"Valuations appear as mobile positings within becoming and not as its transcendent standards.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","CH_97E9_VDSB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D3","text":"Obedience and command constitute two directions of the same relation of power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D4","text":"Service, sacrifice, and the gaze of love can function as indirect appropriations of power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D5","text":"Self-mastery is not liberation from the will to power, but its reflexive form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D6","text":"Life is determined not by self-preservation, but by self-overcoming and the enhancement of power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D7","text":"Every moral order remains exposed to the possibility of its own overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:D8","text":"Knowledge is classified as the path and footprint of the will to power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD1","text":"Knowledge, morality, and the process of life are drawn together under a unified logic of the will to power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A1","CH_97E9_VDSB:A3","CH_97E9_VDSB:A5","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD2","text":"Domination, service, obedience, and sacrifice are not separate fundamental social forms, but internal modulations of a single process of power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A6","CH_97E9_VDSB:A7","CH_97E9_VDSB:A8","CH_97E9_VDSB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD3","text":"Life produces its highest forms through the readiness to endanger, sacrifice, and surpass itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A9","CH_97E9_VDSB:A10","CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD4","text":"Value orders are temporary forms of becoming, whose shattering proceeds from the same creative power that erects them.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A4","CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SD5","text":"The highest creative act cannot consist in a stable final moral order, because it again attacks its own presuppositions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSB:A12","CH_97E9_VDSB:A14","CH_97E9_VDSB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a power-free, neutral position of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX2","text":"It excludes an original drive for self-preservation as the ultimate explanation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX3","text":"It excludes a moral order that exists independently of becoming and of value-positings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX4","text":"It excludes a simple hierarchy in which rulers possess unburdened power and servants remain powerless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX5","text":"It excludes a separation of creation and destruction as two independent processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX6","text":"It excludes a final reconciliation of life, value, and purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:DNX7","text":"It excludes a standpoint outside the will to power from which its effect could be conclusively judged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world before which one can permanently kneel without this world, too, having to be overcome again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an un-willed ground of truth, value, and meaning that would remain external to the process of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a life whose highest form would consist in mere continuance or preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final form of the good that would not at the same time include the destruction of existing goods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:SNX5","text":"Excluded is the complete immobilization of contradiction; unresolved truth returns as poison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS1","text":"Epistemic claim → demand for the intelligibility of all that is → subjection of what is to the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS2","text":"Subjection to the spirit → unmasking of the will to knowledge as will to power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS3","text":"Positing of values upon becoming → reduction of moral validity to a ruling will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS4","text":"Analysis of the living → generalization of obedience, command, and self-command as forms of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS5","text":"Power-form of command → burden, experiment, risk, and self-endangerment of the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS6","text":"Unity of service, sacrifice, and domination → determination of life as continuous self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS7","text":"Exclusion of the will to existence → primacy of the will to power as the ground of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS8","text":"Self-overcoming of life → transience of values → creative destruction of existing value orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:FGS9","text":"Poisonousness of what is unspoken → primacy of speaking out over stabilization through silence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:AF1","text":"Will to truth → will to intelligibility → will to power → values as positings in becoming → obedience and command as the structure of life → self-overcoming → exclusion of the will to existence → destruction of existing values → creative goodness including the highest evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME1","text":"The opposition of truth and power is suspended by mapping knowledge as the exercise of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME2","text":"The opposition of rulers and servants is redrawn into a circulating relation of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME3","text":"Moral values are reclassified from timeless norms into mobile forms upon the flow of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME4","text":"Creation and destruction appear as interrelated phases of the same production of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME5","text":"Life is no longer visible as an end in itself worthy of protection, but as a risky bearer of the enhancement of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ME6","text":"The highest good is determined not beyond evil, but as a creative working-through and destruction of what exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text treats the will to truth, valuations of good and evil, and the observable forms of obedience, command, and sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT2","text":"Structural — It reconstructs these forms as institutionally and relationally interwoven movements of power within becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Knowledge and the creation of values are reframed as processes that include appropriation, self-endangerment, and the destruction of existing forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Life is determined as a becoming, self-overcoming will to power, while values possess no imperishable existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the critique of the will to truth to the creative destruction of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the will to power functions as an empirical description of life or as a universal principle of interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT3","text":"The argument against the will to existence does not fully refute its possible variants, but replaces them with another fundamental determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT4","text":"The tension between the universal obedience of the living and the power of the commander is reinterpreted, but not fully resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT5","text":"The assertion of imperishable self-overcoming stands in tension with the rejection of every final, supratemporal validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT6","text":"The connection between the highest evil and the highest goodness is structurally asserted, but not deductively derived from an independent norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSB:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSB:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument insofar as anthropomorphization of life, rhetorical evidence, and philosophical deduction are not confused with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDSB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDSB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 49","title":"On Self-Overcoming","context":"Chapter 49","original_title":"Von der Selbst-Überwindung","original_context":"Chapter 49"},"original_title":"Von der Selbst-Überwindung","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Sublime Ones","order":50,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDE0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDE0@R001","sha256":"732806318a62807003fbc72894220d3c59698429aab74ba0c1e74503db103e44","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert den Erhabenen als geistig erfolgreichen, aber finsteren, gespannten und innerlich nicht vollendeten Kämpfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS2","text":"Er unterstellt die Beurteilung jeder Gestalt einem Streit um Geschmack, Gewicht und Wertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS3","text":"Die diagnostische Bewegung zeigt, dass Erkenntnis, Kampf und äußere Bezwingung die innere Überwindung nicht garantieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS4","text":"Die zentrale Neubestimmung lautet, dass Erhabenheit erst durch Selbstabwendung, Erdbejahung und gelösten Willen in Schönheit übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS5","text":"Der Erhabene muss seine That, seine Unthiere, seine Räthsel und zuletzt seinen Helden-Willen überwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS6","text":"Macht wird als schön bestimmt, wenn sie gnädig ins Sichtbare herabkommt und sich in Güte selbst überwältigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung endet postheroisch: Erst wenn der Held die Seele verlässt, kann sich der Über-Held nähern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A1","text":"Alles Leben ist Streit um Geschmack und Schmecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A2","text":"Geschmack ist zugleich Gewicht, Wagschale und Wägender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A3","text":"Der Erhabene erscheint als ernster, erkenntnisjagender, asketischer und erdverachtender Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","text":"Das Bezwingen von Unthieren und das Lösen von Räthseln beseitigen die inneren Unthiere und Räthsel nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A5","text":"Die eigene That bleibt als Schatten auf dem Handelnden, solange er sie nicht überwunden hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A6","text":"Schönheit beginnt erst, wenn der Erhabene seiner Erhabenheit müde wird und sich von sich selber abwendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","text":"Der Übergang zur Schönheit verlangt die Bejahung des Irdischen gegen die Verachtung der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","text":"Der Erhabene muss seinen Helden-Willen verlernen und sich von einer höheren, gelösten Kraft heben lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A9","text":"Unthiere und Räthsel sollen nicht bloß bezwungen, sondern in himmlische Kinder verwandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A10","text":"Erkenntnis muss lächeln und ohne Eifersucht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A11","text":"Verlangen soll nicht in Sattheit, sondern in Schönheit schweigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A12","text":"Das Schöne entzieht sich dem heftigen Willen und verlangt gelöste Muskeln und abgeschirrten Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","text":"Schönheit ist das gnädige Herabkommen von Macht in das Sichtbare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A14","text":"Die Güte der Gewaltigen ist ihre letzte Selbst-Überwältigung; ihre mögliche Bosheit begründet die Forderung nach dem Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A15","text":"Der Held muss die Seele verlassen, damit sich ihr im Traum der Über-Held nähern kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX1","text":"Erhabenheit ist nicht bereits Schönheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX2","text":"Erkenntnisjagd und geistige Buße sind keine vollendete Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX3","text":"Äußere Siege über Unthiere und Räthsel sind keine innere Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX4","text":"Verachtung der Erde ist kein Zeichen höherer Geistigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX5","text":"Der Helden-Wille ist nicht die letzte Form des Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX6","text":"Sattheit ist nicht das angemessene Ende des Verlangens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX7","text":"Güte wird nicht durch Schwäche, Lahmheit oder Unfähigkeit begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX8","text":"Ruhe im Schatten ist noch keine Ruhe in der Sonne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX9","text":"Schönheit ist keine bloße Abschwächung oder Entmachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D1","text":"Der Erhabene steht nicht außerhalb der Wertung, sondern wird durch einen konkurrierenden Geschmack beurteilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A1","CH_97E9_VDE0:A2","CH_97E9_VDE0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D2","text":"Die äußere Bezwingung macht gerade den Fortbestand des inneren Unüberwundenen sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D3","text":"Die That bindet den Handelnden, wenn sie als fremder Schatten auf ihm liegen bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D4","text":"Die Abwendung vom eigenen Erhabenheitsanspruch ermöglicht den Sprung über den eigenen Schatten in die Sonne.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D5","text":"Erdbejahung und gelöster Wille bilden keine Niederlage, sondern die Bedingungen des Übergangs zur Schönheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D6","text":"Überwindung wird von der Vernichtung des Gegners auf die Verwandlung des Überwundenen verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D7","text":"Erkenntnis und Leidenschaft werden erst dann vollendet, wenn sie ihre kämpferische Spannung in Lächeln und Schönheit umbilden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A10","CH_97E9_VDE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D8","text":"Macht erhält ihre schönste Gestalt nicht durch Steigerung, sondern durch gnädige Sichtbarkeit und Selbst-Überwältigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","CH_97E9_VDE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D9","text":"Die höchste Transformation setzt das Verschwinden des bisherigen Helden als Träger der Seele voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD1","text":"Der Erhabene ist eine Übergangsform: Er verfügt bereits über Erkenntnis und Macht, bleibt aber an deren nicht verwandelte Schatten gebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A3","CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD2","text":"Schönheit bezeichnet nicht den Gegensatz zur Macht, sondern die Macht nach ihrer Selbst-Überwältigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A12","CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","CH_97E9_VDE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD3","text":"Das System erzeugt eine gestufte Überwindung: Unthiere und Räthsel werden bezwungen, die That wird überwunden, der Helden-Wille wird verlernt und der Held selbst wird verlassen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A5","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A9","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD4","text":"Geistige Erhöhung wird nur dann gültig, wenn sie in die Bejahung des Irdischen zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD5","text":"Der Endpunkt der Entwicklung ist keine stärkere Selbstbehauptung, sondern eine postheroische Öffnung für eine noch höhere Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX1","text":"Die Wahrheitssuche wird als hinreichender Endzweck des Geistes ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX2","text":"Die Gleichsetzung von Ernst, Askese und Größe wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX3","text":"Die Annahme, äußere Bezwingung erzeuge innere Freiheit, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX4","text":"Eine Rangordnung, in der die Erde dem Geist als minderwertig gilt, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX5","text":"Macht wird nicht als notwendig gespannte, aggressive oder herrische Selbstbehauptung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX6","text":"Güte wird nicht aus Mangel an Kraft, sondern aus der Überwindung eigener Kraftreserven erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX7","text":"Selbstüberwindung bewahrt den ursprünglichen Helden nicht als letzten souveränen Träger seiner Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit eines Erhabenen, der zugleich schon schön, heiter, irdisch und innerlich gelöst wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine Macht, die ihre Stärke nur durch dauernde Spannung und Selbstbehauptung bewahren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein neutraler Geschmack außerhalb von Gewichtung, Streit und Wertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX4","text":"Unbestimmt bleibt eine endgültige Gestalt des Über-Helden jenseits des verlassenen Helden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS1","text":"Leben → Streit um Geschmack → Gewichtung jeder Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS2","text":"Erhabener → Erkenntnisjagd und Kampf → äußere Siege bei innerem Rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS3","text":"Innerer Rest → Schatten, Verachtung, gespannte Seele → unvollendete Erhabenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS4","text":"Müdigkeit an der Erhabenheit + Abwendung vom Selbst → Sprung über den Schatten → Sonne und Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS5","text":"Bezwingen → Erlösen und Verwandeln; Erkenntnis → Lächeln; Leidenschaft → Schönheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS6","text":"Gelöster Wille + sichtbare Gnade + Selbst-Überwältigung → Schönheit der Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS7","text":"Verlassen des Helden → Entleerung der bisherigen Trägerform → Annäherung des Über-Helden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AF1","text":"Stilles, lachendes Meer → Auftreten des finsteren Erhabenen → geschmackliche Zurückweisung → Diagnose des unüberwundenen Tiers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AF2","text":"Erkenntnissieg → verbleibender Schatten und Erdverachtung → Selbstabwendung → Erdpreis, gelöster Wille und Schönheit → gnädige Macht → Über-Held.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME1","text":"Das Erhabene wird von einer Endgestalt der Größe zu einer defizitären Übergangsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME2","text":"Schönheit wird von einer weichen Gegenmacht zu einer sichtbaren Form selbstüberwundener Macht umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME3","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht mehr primär nach ihrem Besitz, sondern nach ihrer Fähigkeit zu Lächeln, Eifersuchtslosigkeit und Verwandlung bewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME4","text":"Erdverbundenheit und geistige Erhöhung werden als zusammengehörige statt gegensätzliche Bewegungen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME5","text":"Güte wird aus dem Bereich der Schwäche herausgelöst und dem Bereich der letzten Selbst-Überwältigung zugeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME6","text":"Der Held wird vom souveränen Endpunkt zum vorläufigen Träger einer Entwicklung umklassifiziert, die über ihn hinausführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Erhabene wird als finsterer, ernster und gespannter Erkenntniskämpfer dem Lachen und Geschmack des Meeres ausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Erkenntnis, Kampf, That, Wille, Erde und Schönheit werden als aufeinanderfolgende Stufen innerer Überwindung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt Bewunderung des Erhabenen durch ein prüfendes Geschmacksurteil und fordert nicht mehr Sieg, sondern Selbstverwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Gestalt des Menschen erscheint als Übergang: vom Erhabenen über den verlassenen Helden zum kommenden Über-Helden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Kritik des Erhabenen zur Forderung nach Schönheit und Selbst-Überwältigung zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben der genaue Status des Über-Helden und die Bedeutung der göttlichen Begierden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Erhabener, Held und Über-Held als Entwicklungsstufen und nicht als stabile Typen gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Ableitung des inneren Mangels aus dem Gegensatz von äußerem Sieg und verbleibendem Schatten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der strukturellen Funktion der Bilder von Schatten, Sonne, Stier, Säule und Äther ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der geforderten aktiven Verwandlung und dem Ideal des abgeschirrten oder willenlosen Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT7","text":"Ungelöst bleibt ferner die Spannung zwischen Leben als Streit um Geschmack und Schönheit als gelöster, nicht-heftiger Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT8","text":"Die Ablösung des Helden durch den Über-Helden lässt die Kontinuität des sich verwandelnden Subjekts offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT9","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: Spott über die unvollendete Erhabenheit → Diagnose des Schattens → Selbstabwendung → Erdbejahung → Schönheit der Macht → postheroische Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194052639415Z_8e95bf3e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Sublime Ones","source_sha256":"732806318a62807003fbc72894220d3c59698429aab74ba0c1e74503db103e44","sha256":"842d1a77fb2c722716571cdd1186ff8f6f3243300746787109f6a6228289f8f5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:40:52.641702+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the sublime one as an intellectually successful, yet gloomy, tense, and inwardly unfulfilled fighter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS2","text":"It subjects the assessment of every figure to a struggle over taste, weight, and valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS3","text":"The diagnostic movement shows that knowledge, struggle, and outward conquest do not guarantee inner overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS4","text":"The central redefinition states that sublimity passes into beauty only through turning away from oneself, affirmation of the earth, and a released will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS5","text":"The sublime one must overcome his deed, his monsters, his riddles, and finally his hero-will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS6","text":"Power is determined as beautiful when it graciously descends into the visible and overpowers itself in goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AS7","text":"The movement ends post-heroically: only when the hero leaves the soul can the over-hero draw near.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A1","text":"All life is a struggle over taste and tasting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A2","text":"Taste is at once weight, scale, and weigher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A3","text":"The sublime one appears as a serious spirit, hunting knowledge, ascetic, and contemptuous of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","text":"Conquering monsters and solving riddles do not eliminate the inner monsters and riddles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A5","text":"One's own deed remains as a shadow upon the agent so long as he has not overcome it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A6","text":"Beauty begins only when the sublime one grows weary of his sublimity and turns away from himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","text":"The transition to beauty demands affirmation of the earthly against contempt for the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","text":"The sublime one must unlearn his hero-will and allow himself to be lifted by a higher, released force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A9","text":"Monsters and riddles are not merely to be conquered, but transformed into heavenly children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A10","text":"Knowledge must become smiling and without jealousy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A11","text":"Desire should fall silent not in satiety, but in beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A12","text":"The beautiful withdraws from vehement will and demands released muscles and an unharnessed will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","text":"Beauty is the gracious descent of power into the visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A14","text":"The goodness of the powerful is their final self-overpowering; their possible wickedness grounds the demand for the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:A15","text":"The hero must leave the soul so that the over-hero may draw near to it in the dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX1","text":"Sublimity is not already beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX2","text":"The hunt for knowledge and spiritual penance are no completed redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX3","text":"Outward victories over monsters and riddles are no inner overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX4","text":"Contempt for the earth is no sign of higher spirituality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX5","text":"The hero-will is not the final form of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX6","text":"Satiety is not the appropriate end of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX7","text":"Goodness is not grounded in weakness, lameness, or incapacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX8","text":"Rest in the shadow is not yet rest in the sun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:NX9","text":"Beauty is no mere attenuation or disempowerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D1","text":"The sublime one stands not outside valuation, but is judged through a competing taste.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A1","CH_97E9_VDE0:A2","CH_97E9_VDE0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D2","text":"Outward conquest makes precisely the persistence of the inwardly unconquered visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D3","text":"The deed binds the agent when it remains lying upon him as an alien shadow.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D4","text":"Turning away from one's own claim to sublimity makes possible the leap over one's own shadow into the sun.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D5","text":"Affirmation of the earth and released will constitute not a defeat, but the conditions of transition to beauty.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D6","text":"Overcoming is shifted from the annihilation of the opponent to the transformation of the overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D7","text":"Knowledge and passion are completed only when they transform their combative tension into smile and beauty.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A10","CH_97E9_VDE0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D8","text":"Power attains its most beautiful form not through intensification, but through gracious visibility and self-overpowering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","CH_97E9_VDE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:D9","text":"The highest transformation presupposes the disappearance of the previous hero as bearer of the soul.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD1","text":"The sublime one is a transitional form: he already possesses knowledge and power, but remains bound to their untransformed shadows.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A3","CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD2","text":"Beauty denotes not the opposite of power, but power after its self-overpowering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A12","CH_97E9_VDE0:A13","CH_97E9_VDE0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD3","text":"The system produces a graduated overcoming: monsters and riddles are conquered, the deed is overcome, the hero-will is unlearned, and the hero himself is left behind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A4","CH_97E9_VDE0:A5","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A9","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD4","text":"Spiritual elevation becomes valid only when it returns to the affirmation of the earthly.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A7","CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SD5","text":"The endpoint of development is not a stronger self-assertion, but a post-heroic opening toward a still higher figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDE0:A8","CH_97E9_VDE0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX1","text":"The search for truth is excluded as a sufficient final purpose of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX2","text":"The equation of seriousness, asceticism, and greatness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX3","text":"The assumption that outward conquest produces inner freedom is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX4","text":"A hierarchy in which the earth counts as inferior to the spirit is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX5","text":"Power is not presupposed as necessarily tense, aggressive, or lordly self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX6","text":"Goodness is explained not from a lack of strength, but from the overcoming of one's own reserves of strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:DNX7","text":"Self-overcoming does not preserve the original hero as the final sovereign bearer of his development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains the possibility of a sublime one who would at once already be beautiful, cheerful, earthly, and inwardly released.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed remains a power that can preserve its strength only through permanent tension and self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a neutral taste outside weighting, struggle, and valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:SNX4","text":"Undetermined remains a final figure of the over-hero beyond the abandoned hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS1","text":"Life → struggle over taste → valuation of every figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS2","text":"Sublime one → hunt for knowledge and struggle → outward victories with an inner remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS3","text":"Inner remainder → shadow, contempt, tense soul → uncompleted sublimity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS4","text":"Weariness with sublimity + turning away from the self → leap over the shadow → sun and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS5","text":"Conquering → redeeming and transforming; knowledge → smile; passion → beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS6","text":"Released will + visible grace + self-overpowering → beauty of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:FGS7","text":"Leaving the hero → emptying of the previous bearer-form → approach of the over-hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AF1","text":"Silent, laughing sea → appearance of the gloomy sublime one → rejection by taste → diagnosis of the unconquered beast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:AF2","text":"Victory of knowledge → remaining shadow and contempt for the earth → turning away from the self → praise of the earth, released will, and beauty → gracious power → over-hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME1","text":"The sublime is remapped from a final form of greatness to a deficient transitional form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME2","text":"Beauty is reclassified from a soft counter-power to a visible form of self-overcome power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME3","text":"Knowledge is no longer assessed primarily according to its possession, but according to its capacity for smiling, freedom from jealousy, and transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME4","text":"Earthliness and spiritual elevation are mapped as movements belonging together rather than opposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME5","text":"Goodness is detached from the domain of weakness and assigned to the domain of final self-overpowering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ME6","text":"The hero is reclassified from a sovereign endpoint to the provisional bearer of a development that leads beyond him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The sublime one is exposed, as a gloomy, serious, and tense fighter for knowledge, to the laughter and taste of the sea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Knowledge, struggle, deed, will, earth, and beauty are organized as successive stages of inner overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces admiration of the sublime with a testing judgment of taste and demands no longer victory, but self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The figure of the human appears as a transition: from the sublime one through the abandoned hero to the coming over-hero.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to generate the movement from the critique of the sublime to the demand for beauty and self-overpowering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT2","text":"The exact status of the over-hero and the meaning of divine desires remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the sublime one, the hero, and the over-hero are read as developmental stages and not as stable types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the derivation of the inner lack from the opposition between outward victory and remaining shadow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the structural function of the images of shadow, sun, bull, pillar, and ether.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT6","text":"Unresolved remains the tension between the demanded active transformation and the ideal of the unharnessed or will-less will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT7","text":"Likewise unresolved remains the tension between life as a struggle over taste and beauty as a released, non-vehement form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT8","text":"The replacement of the hero by the over-hero leaves open the continuity of the transforming subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDE0:MRT9","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved: mockery of uncompleted sublimity → diagnosis of the shadow → turning away from the self → affirmation of the earth → beauty of power → post-heroic transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDE0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDE0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDE0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 50","title":"On the Sublime Ones","context":"Chapter 50","original_title":"Von den Erhabenen","original_context":"Chapter 50"},"original_title":"Von den Erhabenen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB","layer":"CH","title":"On the Land of Culture","order":51,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VLDB"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VLDB@R001","sha256":"e38bad6f43b539c98ae7764fe09771d997a62f16c51a9ba974a37f7b1d929b99","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist, wie eine Gegenwart zu bestimmen ist, die sämtliche historischen Zeiten sichtbar trägt, aber keine eigene erkennbare Gestalt besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS2","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als Überlagerung historischer Zeichen und Spiegelungen neu bestimmt, deren Farbigkeit Verdeckung statt Fülle erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS3","text":"Die Entblößung dieser Verdeckung legt keinen tragfähigen Kern frei, sondern Gerippe, Magerkeit und Unfruchtbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS4","text":"Der Anspruch, vollständig wirklich und ohne Glauben zu sein, schlägt in Selbstwiderlegung um, weil die Gegenwärtigen aus den Resten aller Glaubensformen zusammengesetzt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS5","text":"Das Argument ist diagnostisch und apophatisch: Es bestimmt die Gegenwart durch ihre Maskierungen, ihren Mangel und ihre ausgeschlossene schöpferische Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung führt vom Zukunftsgrauen über die Diagnose der gegenwärtigen Unfruchtbarkeit und das Lachen als Distanzierung zur Ausrichtung auf ein noch unentdecktes Land der Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A1","text":"Das Vorstoßen in die Zukunft erzeugt Grauen und führt zur rückläufigen Bewegung in die Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","text":"Die Gegenwart erscheint als ein Land der Bildung, das aus historischen Überlagerungen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","text":"Zeiten, Völker, Sitten und Glaubensformen treten in den Gebärden und Zeichen der Gegenwärtigen zugleich hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","text":"Farbigkeit, Spiegelungen und überlagerte Zeichen verbergen die Gegenwärtigen, statt ihre eigene Gestalt sichtbar zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A5","text":"Unter der Entfernung aller Zeichen bleibt kein tragfähiger Kern, sondern ein Gerippe, eine erschreckende Magerkeit und eine wundersame Armut zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A6","text":"Die Gegenwärtigen sind weder in ihrer bekleideten Erscheinung noch in ihrer entblößten Gestalt erträglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","text":"Der Anspruch, vollständig wirklich und frei von Glauben und Aberglauben zu sein, wird durch die Zusammensetzung aus den Bildern alles ehemals Geglaubten unterlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A8","text":"Die gleichzeitige Anwesenheit verschiedener Zeiten erzeugt widersprüchliches Reden und macht die Gegenwärtigen zu wandelnden Widerlegungen des Glaubens und des Denkens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A9","text":"Die Unfruchtbarkeit der Gegenwärtigen erklärt ihren Mangel an Glauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A10","text":"Schöpferische Hervorbringung setzt Wahrträume, Sternzeichen und einen Glauben an Glauben voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A11","text":"Die Wirklichkeit der Gegenwärtigen ist als halb geöffnetes Tor organisiert, an dem der Untergang wartet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A12","text":"Die Gegenwärtigen behandeln alles als wert, zugrunde zu gehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","text":"In Vergangenheit und Gegenwart findet sich keine Heimat; Heimat wird ausschließlich im unentdeckten Land der Kinder gesucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A14","text":"Die zukünftigen Kinder sollen die Gegenwart als Schuldverhältnis zur väterlichen Vergangenheit ausgleichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A15","text":"Lachen verwandelt die Begegnung mit der gegenwärtigen Unhaltbarkeit in eine tragbare Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX1","text":"Die Gegenwart ist keine einheitliche, aus sich selbst verständliche Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX2","text":"Historische Vielheit ist keine lesbare Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX3","text":"Unter der kulturellen Bekleidung liegt keine positive, tragfähige Nacktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX4","text":"Die Entfernung von Zeichen führt nicht zu Wahrheit, sondern zu Gerippe und Magerkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX5","text":"Glaubenslosigkeit ist keine unabhängige Wirklichkeit außerhalb des Glaubens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX6","text":"Die Gegenwärtigen sind keine schöpferisch fruchtbare Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX7","text":"Die Gegenwart ist kein bewohnbares Vater- oder Mutterland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX8","text":"Die Gegenwärtigen sind kein Ursprung einer tragfähigen Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D1","text":"Die vollständige historische Überlagerung erzeugt Unlesbarkeit, weil sie jede unterscheidbare Eigenform verdeckt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D2","text":"Die kulturelle Farbigkeit erweist sich als Maskierung eines Mangels und nicht als Ausdruck substantieller Fülle.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","CH_97E9_VLDB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D3","text":"Die Entblößung widerlegt die Hoffnung, hinter der Oberfläche eine erhaltenswerte Wahrheit freizulegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A5","CH_97E9_VLDB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D4","text":"Der Anspruch auf glaubensfreie Wirklichkeit wird zur Selbstwiderlegung, weil die Gegenwärtigen aus den Formen des Glaubens hervorgegangen sind, die sie zurückweisen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D5","text":"Der Mangel an Glauben erscheint als Symptom fehlender Hervorbringung und nicht als Zeichen aufgeklärter Autonomie.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A9","CH_97E9_VLDB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Wirklichkeit wird als Übergangszustand zum Untergang bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A11","CH_97E9_VLDB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D7","text":"Das Lachen unterbricht die unmittelbare Übernahme der gegenwärtigen Schwere und hält die eigene Sehnsucht funktionsfähig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A6","CH_97E9_VLDB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D8","text":"Der Verlust jeder gegebenen Heimat macht das Land der Kinder zum einzigen verbleibenden Zukunftsvektor.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD1","text":"Die Gegenwart ist eine misslungene Totalisierung: Sie enthält alle Zeiten, erzeugt daraus aber weder Einheit noch eigenes Leben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD2","text":"Die maximale kulturelle Sichtbarkeit produziert epistemische Unsichtbarkeit, weil die Menge der Zeichen die Möglichkeit einer eindeutigen Deutung zerstört.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","CH_97E9_VLDB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD3","text":"Die behauptete Wirklichkeit der Gegenwärtigen bezeichnet keinen positiven Seinsüberschuss, sondern den Endzustand einer erschöpften und selbstwiderlegenden Synthese.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8","CH_97E9_VLDB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD4","text":"Die Kritik der Gegenwart führt nicht zur Wiedergewinnung der Vergangenheit, sondern zur Konstruktion einer zukünftigen Heimat aus der noch nicht vorhandenen Generation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A12","CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD5","text":"Die Zeitstruktur spaltet die Zukunft in eine zerstörerische Zukunft des Grauens und eine schöpferische Zukunft der Kinder.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A1","CH_97E9_VLDB:A10","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD6","text":"Das Lachen fungiert als strategische Technik, durch die eine unbewohnbare Gegenwart durchquert werden kann, ohne zur eigenen Zukunftsorientierung zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX1","text":"Aus der Aufnahme aller historischen Formen entsteht keine höhere Synthese.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX2","text":"Die Entfernung von Glauben garantiert keine objektive oder unvermittelte Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX3","text":"Historische Vielheit genügt nicht zur Hervorbringung eines gegenwärtigen Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX4","text":"Die Gegenwart kann ihre überlieferten Zeichen nicht in eine eigene schöpferische Ordnung überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX5","text":"Die Rückkehr zu den Vätern und Müttern stellt keine bewohnbare Kontinuität her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX6","text":"Die Gegenwart besitzt keine innere Ressource, aus der ihre Zukunft unmittelbar hervorgehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX1","text":"Dem System fehlt ein generatives Zentrum, das die angesammelten Zeiten in eine eigene Form überführen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX2","text":"Es fehlt eine tragfähige Kontinuität zwischen historischer Überlieferung, gegenwärtigem Leben und zukünftiger Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX3","text":"Die blockierte Möglichkeit besteht darin, aus übernommenen Zeichen einen eigenen Glauben und eine eigene Schöpfung zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX4","text":"Heimat ist nicht als gegebener Ort verfügbar, sondern nur als Projektion auf noch nicht vorhandene Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX5","text":"Die Gegenwart kann weder ihre Masken bewohnen noch ihren Mangel in eine positive Gestalt verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS1","text":"Zukunftsüberschreitung → Grauen → Rückwärtsbewegung zur Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS2","text":"Begegnung mit der Gegenwart → visuelle Überfülle → Erfassung als Ansammlung historischer Zeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS3","text":"Historische Totalüberlagerung + Spiegelung → Verdeckung der Eigenform → Unmöglichkeit des Erkennens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS4","text":"Entfernung der Zeichen → Gerippe und Unfruchtbarkeit; Beibehaltung der Zeichen → Maskierung und Unlesbarkeit; beide Zustände → Unhaltbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS5","text":"Anspruch auf glaubensfreie Wirklichkeit → Rückführung auf sedimentierte Glaubensformen → Selbstwiderlegung und Unglaubwürdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS6","text":"Unfruchtbarkeit → Glaubensmangel → fehlende Hervorbringung → Schwelle des Untergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS7","text":"Lachen → affektive Distanz → Erhaltung der Sehnsucht → Abweisung gegebener Heimaten → Ausrichtung auf das Land der Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS8","text":"Schuld gegenüber der väterlichen Vergangenheit + zukünftige Kinder → reparative Umkehrung der Zeitrichtung → Gegenwart wird auf ihre Überwindung hin bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AF1","text":"Zukunftsgrauen → Rückkehr zur Gegenwart → historische Überlagerung → Maskierung und Unlesbarkeit → Entblößung als Gerippe → Unhaltbarkeit von Bekleidung und Nacktheit → Selbstwiderlegung des Wirklichkeitsanspruchs → Diagnose der Unfruchtbarkeit → Untergangsschwelle → Lachen als Distanzierung → Heimatlosigkeit → Land der Kinder als zukünftige Reparatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AF2","text":"Vergangenheit als überlagerte Last → Gegenwart als erschöpfte Synthese → Zukunft als doppelte Möglichkeit von Grauen und Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME1","text":"Bildung wird von einer Form der Kultivierung zu einer Ansammlung undurchdringlicher historischer Zeichen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME2","text":"Farbige Vielheit wird von einem Zeichen kultureller Fülle zu einem Symptom der Verdeckung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Glauben und Unglauben bricht zusammen, weil der Unglaube als Produkt sedimentierter Glaubensformen erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Bekleidung und Nacktheit verliert seine Erlösungsfunktion, weil beide Zustände denselben Mangel freilegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME5","text":"Die Gegenwart wird nicht mehr als Zentrum der Zeit, sondern als Übergangs- und Untergangsschwelle kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME6","text":"Heimat wird von einem erinnerten Ursprung zu einem erst durch die Kinder zu erzeugenden Zukunftsraum umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME7","text":"Lachen wird von einer Reaktion auf Komik zu einem Verfahren der strategischen Durchquerung untragbarer Verhältnisse umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Gegenwärtigen erscheinen als bemalte, spiegelnde und mit historischen Zeichen überlagerte Körper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die kulturelle Überlagerung erzeugt Maskierung, Unlesbarkeit, fehlende Eigenform und Unfruchtbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Diagnose wird durch Lachen in Distanz übersetzt und von der Rückkehr zur Vergangenheit auf die Erzeugung einer zukünftigen Heimat umgelenkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit erscheint als widersprüchliche Schichtung von Zeiten; die Zukunft teilt sich in zerstörerisches Grauen und schöpferische Nachkommenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Zukunftsgrauen über Gegenwartsdiagnose zu zukünftiger Orientierung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Negativarchitektur bleibt erhalten: Überfülle verdeckt Leere, Entblößung beseitigt sie nicht, und Glaubenslosigkeit ist keine Autonomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Unfruchtbarkeit biologisch, geistig, politisch oder kulturgeschichtlich vorrangig gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT4","text":"Die Verbindung von Unfruchtbarkeit und Glaubensmangel wird behauptet und operativ verwendet, aber nicht eigenständig begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT5","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Maschine auf der Ebene der Diagnose; ihre stärkste Operation ist die Umkehrung sichtbarer Fülle in strukturellen Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Zukunft als Quelle des Grauens und der Zukunft als einzig möglicher Heimat der Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Allgegenwart vergangener Zeiten in der Gegenwart und der Behauptung, dass eine schöpferische Zukunft außerhalb dieser Gegenwart gesucht werden müsse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Lachen als Übergangstechnik und das Kinderland als generative Schließung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195137219371Z_fe32321c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of the Land of Culture","source_sha256":"e38bad6f43b539c98ae7764fe09771d997a62f16c51a9ba974a37f7b1d929b99","sha256":"98ba50c0a0064bc2e9d8decbf1907c1d777484e32801118df3365a71a2031879","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:51:37.221332+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS1","text":"The central problem is how to determine a present that visibly bears all historical ages, yet possesses no recognizable form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS2","text":"The present is redetermined as a superimposition of historical signs and reflections, whose colorfulness produces concealment rather than fullness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS3","text":"The stripping away of this concealment reveals no sustainable core, but rather a skeleton, emaciation, and barrenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS4","text":"The claim to be wholly real and without belief turns into self-refutation, because those of the present are composed of the remnants of all forms of belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS5","text":"The argument is diagnostic and apophatic: it determines the present through its masks, its deficiency, and its excluded creative possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AS6","text":"The movement leads from the horror of the future through the diagnosis of present barrenness and laughter as distancing to an orientation toward a still undiscovered land of children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A1","text":"Advancing into the future produces horror and leads to a backward movement into the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","text":"The present appears as a land of culture, consisting of historical superimpositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","text":"Ages, peoples, customs, and forms of belief emerge simultaneously in the gestures and signs of those of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","text":"Colorfulness, reflections, and superimposed signs conceal those of the present instead of making their own form visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A5","text":"Beneath the removal of all signs, there remains no sustainable core, but a skeleton, a terrifying emaciation, and a wondrous poverty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A6","text":"Those of the present are tolerable neither in their clothed appearance nor in their stripped form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","text":"The claim to be wholly real and free of belief and superstition is undermined by their composition out of the images of all that was once believed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A8","text":"The simultaneous presence of different ages produces contradictory speech and makes those of the present into walking refutations of belief and thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A9","text":"The barrenness of those of the present explains their lack of belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A10","text":"Creative production presupposes true dreams, signs of the stars, and a belief in belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A11","text":"The reality of those of the present is organized as a half-open gate at which downfall waits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A12","text":"Those of the present treat everything as worthy of perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","text":"Neither in the past nor in the present is a homeland to be found; homeland is sought exclusively in the undiscovered land of children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A14","text":"The future children are to settle the present as a relation of debt to the paternal past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:A15","text":"Laughter transforms the encounter with present untenability into a bearable distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX1","text":"The present is not a unified form intelligible from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX2","text":"Historical plurality is not a legible identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX3","text":"Beneath cultural clothing lies no positive, sustainable nakedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX4","text":"The removal of signs leads not to truth, but to skeleton and emaciation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX5","text":"Belieflessness is not an independent reality outside belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX6","text":"Those of the present are not a creatively fertile present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX7","text":"The present is not an inhabitable fatherland or motherland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:NX8","text":"Those of the present are not the origin of a sustainable future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D1","text":"Complete historical superimposition produces illegibility because it conceals every distinguishable form of its own.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D2","text":"Cultural colorfulness proves to be a masking of a deficiency and not an expression of substantial fullness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","CH_97E9_VLDB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D3","text":"Stripping away refutes the hope of disclosing a truth worthy of preservation behind the surface.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A5","CH_97E9_VLDB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D4","text":"The claim to a reality free of belief becomes self-refutation, because those of the present emerged from the forms of belief that they reject.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D5","text":"The lack of belief appears as a symptom of absent production and not as a sign of enlightened autonomy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A9","CH_97E9_VLDB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D6","text":"Present reality is determined as a transitional state toward downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A11","CH_97E9_VLDB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D7","text":"Laughter interrupts the immediate assumption of present gravity and keeps one's own longing functional.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A6","CH_97E9_VLDB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:D8","text":"The loss of every given homeland makes the land of children the sole remaining vector toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD1","text":"The present is a failed totalization: it contains all ages, but produces from them neither unity nor life of its own.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A2","CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD2","text":"Maximum cultural visibility produces epistemic invisibility because the quantity of signs destroys the possibility of unambiguous interpretation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A3","CH_97E9_VLDB:A4","CH_97E9_VLDB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD3","text":"The asserted reality of those of the present denotes no positive surplus of being, but the final state of an exhausted and self-refuting synthesis.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A7","CH_97E9_VLDB:A8","CH_97E9_VLDB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD4","text":"The critique of the present leads not to the recovery of the past, but to the construction of a future homeland out of the generation not yet present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A12","CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD5","text":"The temporal structure divides the future into a destructive future of horror and a creative future of children.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A1","CH_97E9_VLDB:A10","CH_97E9_VLDB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SD6","text":"Laughter functions as a strategic technique through which an uninhabitable present can be traversed without becoming one's own orientation toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLDB:A13","CH_97E9_VLDB:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX1","text":"No higher synthesis arises from the incorporation of all historical forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX2","text":"The removal of belief guarantees no objective or unmediated reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX3","text":"Historical plurality does not suffice for the production of a present subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX4","text":"The present cannot transform its inherited signs into an order of its own creative making.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX5","text":"The return to the fathers and mothers establishes no inhabitable continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:DNX6","text":"The present possesses no inner resource from which its future could emerge directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX1","text":"The system lacks a generative center that could transform the accumulated ages into a form of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX2","text":"There is no sustainable continuity between historical tradition, present life, and future production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility consists in producing, out of inherited signs, a belief and a creation of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX4","text":"Homeland is not available as a given place, but only as a projection onto children not yet present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:SNX5","text":"The present can neither inhabit its masks nor transform its deficiency into a positive form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS1","text":"Transgression into the future → horror → backward movement toward the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS2","text":"Encounter with the present → visual excess → apprehension as an accumulation of historical signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS3","text":"Historical total superimposition + reflection → concealment of own form → impossibility of recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS4","text":"Removal of the signs → skeleton and barrenness; retention of the signs → masking and illegibility; both states → untenability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS5","text":"Claim to a reality free of belief → reduction to sedimented forms of belief → self-refutation and lack of credibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS6","text":"Barrenness → lack of belief → absent production → threshold of downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS7","text":"Laughter → affective distance → preservation of longing → rejection of given homelands → orientation toward the land of children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:FGS8","text":"Debt toward the paternal past + future children → reparative reversal of the direction of time → the present is determined with a view to its overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AF1","text":"Horror of the future → return to the present → historical superimposition → masking and illegibility → stripping away as skeleton → untenability of clothing and nakedness → self-refutation of the claim to reality → diagnosis of barrenness → threshold of downfall → laughter as distancing → homelessness → land of children as future repair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:AF2","text":"Past as superimposed burden → present as exhausted synthesis → future as the double possibility of horror and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME1","text":"Culture is remapped from a form of cultivation into an accumulation of impenetrable historical signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME2","text":"Colorful plurality is remapped from a sign of cultural fullness into a symptom of concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME3","text":"The opposition between belief and unbelief collapses because unbelief appears as a product of sedimented forms of belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME4","text":"The opposition between clothing and nakedness loses its redemptive function because both states disclose the same deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME5","text":"The present is no longer mapped as the center of time, but as a threshold of transition and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME6","text":"Homeland is reclassified from a remembered origin into a future space to be produced only through children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ME7","text":"Laughter is redefined from a reaction to comedy into a procedure for the strategic traversal of unbearable conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT1","text":"Surface — Those of the present appear as bodies painted, reflecting, and overlaid with historical signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT2","text":"Structural — Cultural superimposition produces masking, illegibility, absence of a form of its own, and barrenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Through laughter, the diagnosis is translated into distance and redirected from return to the past toward the production of a future homeland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears as a contradictory stratification of ages; the future divides into destructive horror and creative progeny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from horror of the future through diagnosis of the present to future orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT2","text":"The central negative architecture remains preserved: excess conceals emptiness, stripping away does not eliminate it, and belieflessness is not autonomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether barrenness is meant primarily in a biological, spiritual, political, or cultural-historical sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT4","text":"The connection between barrenness and lack of belief is asserted and used operationally, but not independently justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT5","text":"The machine is internally coherent at the level of diagnosis; its strongest operation is the reversal of visible fullness into structural deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the future as a source of horror and the future as the only possible homeland of children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT7","text":"A further fault line lies between the omnipresence of past ages in the present and the assertion that a creative future must be sought outside this present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VLDB:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as laughter is treated as a technique of transition and the land of children as generative closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VLDB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VLDB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VLDB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 51","title":"On the Land of Culture","context":"Chapter 51","original_title":"Vom Lande der Bildung","original_context":"Chapter 51"},"original_title":"Vom Lande der Bildung","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE","layer":"CH","title":"On Immaculate Perception","order":52,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDUE"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDUE@R001","sha256":"84425af72341baf7df67d07cee8a0c8f3d9e7c01973f03900b126fe38aa8792b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS1","text":"Die scheinbare Schwangerschaft des Mondes wird als Bild einer nichtzeugenden, verschämten Beziehung zur Erde bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS2","text":"Die „Rein-Erkennenden“ werden als Subjekte entlarvt, deren Geist das eigene Begehren verleugnet, obwohl ihre „Eingeweide“ es bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS3","text":"Die Ideale der Begierdelosigkeit, Beschaulichkeit und spiegelnden Erkenntnis werden als verschleierte Formen von Feigheit, Begierde und Selbsttäuschung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS4","text":"Unschuld, Schönheit und Erkenntnis werden an Zeugung, schöpferischen Willen, Liebe, Untergang und Selbstüberschreitung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS5","text":"Die Morgenröte ersetzt den Mond als Modell einer offenen, schöpferischen und zur Erde bejahend gerichteten Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von enthüllter Scheinfruchtbarkeit über die Diagnose gespaltenen Begehrens zur Umwertung der Erkenntnis als Erhebung der Tiefe in die Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A1","text":"Der Mond steht für eine scheinbar fruchtbare, tatsächlich aber nichtzeugende Beziehung zur Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","text":"Die „Rein-Erkennenden“ begehren die Erde und das Irdische trotz ihres geistigen Verachtungsideals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","text":"Die Trennung von Geist und „Eingeweiden“ erzeugt Scham, schlechtes Gewissen und indirektes Verhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A4","text":"Ein Begehren, das sich nicht eingesteht, erscheint als Heimlichkeit, Lüge und schleichende Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A5","text":"Begierdelose Betrachtung ist kein Ausdruck von Unschuld, sondern eine Selbstverführung des gespaltenen Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A6","text":"Die Reduktion der Erkenntnis auf passives Schauen macht die Dinge zu bloßen Bildern und den Erkennenden zum unbeteiligten Spiegel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","text":"Unschuld der Begierde besteht in der bejahten Einheit von Begehren, Zeugung und schöpferischem Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A8","text":"Schönheit entsteht dort, wo mit dem ganzen Willen geliebt und der Untergang des bloßen Bildes gewollt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A9","text":"Liebe schließt die Bereitschaft zum Untergang und damit zur Preisgabe der bloßen Selbsterhaltung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A10","text":"Wer über sich hinaus schaffen will, besitzt den reinsten Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A11","text":"Edle Begriffe können körperliche Begierde, Feigheit und Instinktverdrängung verdecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A12","text":"Die Selbsttäuschung wird durch religiöse und moralische Masken stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A13","text":"Die Annäherung und das Tageslicht machen die verborgenen Motive des scheinbar reinen Spiels sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A14","text":"Die Sonnenliebe zur Erde verkörpert Unschuld, schöpferische Begierde und offene Steigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A15","text":"Erkenntnis bedeutet, dass alles Tiefe in die Höhe des Erkennenden gelangen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX1","text":"Die scheinbare Schwangerschaft des Mondes ist keine wirkliche Zeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX2","text":"Die „Rein-Erkennenden“ sind nicht begierdelos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX3","text":"Die Verachtung des Irdischen beseitigt das irdische Begehren nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX4","text":"Geistige Scham ist keine Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX5","text":"Heimliches Begehren ist keine Unschuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX6","text":"Beschaulichkeit ist nicht notwendig Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX7","text":"Ein Spiegelverhältnis zu den Dingen ist keine schöpferische Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX8","text":"Das bloße Auge erzeugt keine Schönheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX9","text":"Die Liebe der „Rein-Erkennenden“ ist nicht zeugend und nicht werdensfreudig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX10","text":"Edle Namen garantieren weder edle Motive noch edle Handlungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX11","text":"Eine Gottesmaske ist keine göttliche Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX12","text":"Die Ferne des Beobachters bewahrt die Reinheit des Beobachteten nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX13","text":"Die Verleumdung des Begehrens entsteht nicht aus seiner Abwesenheit, sondern aus seiner verleugneten Anwesenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D1","text":"Der Mond wird zum Modell einer Erkenntnishaltung, die die Erde begehrt, ohne sich als begehrend zu bekennen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A1","CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D2","text":"Die „reine“ Erkenntnis ist eine maskierte Spaltung zwischen geistiger Selbstbeschreibung und körperlicher Triebstruktur.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D3","text":"Das Ideal des Lebens ohne Begierde ist eine Selbstrede des verleugneten Begehrens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D4","text":"Das Spiegelbild der Dinge bezeichnet eine Erkenntnis, die Berührung, Zugriff und Erzeugung durch bloße Betrachtung ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A5","CH_97E9_VDUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D5","text":"Die „unbefleckte Erkenntnis“ wird als Unfähigkeit zur Zeugung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A6","CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D6","text":"Die Verleugnung des Begehrens verwandelt körperliche Abhängigkeit in moralische Scham.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D7","text":"Unschuld ist nicht Abwesenheit von Begierde, sondern deren schöpferische Bejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D8","text":"Schönheit ist nicht distanzierte Wahrnehmung, sondern die Bereitschaft, das Bild durch Liebe und Untergang zu überschreiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D9","text":"Die Entlarvung falscher Reinheit erfordert die Umwertung der herabgesetzten, körpernahen und „krummen“ Wörter.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D10","text":"Die Morgenröte beendet die Mondordnung, indem sie verborgene Begierde in offene schöpferische Bewegung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A13","CH_97E9_VDUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D11","text":"Das Meer wird vom passiv betrachteten Gegenstand zur begierigen Mitbewegung der Sonnenliebe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D12","text":"Erkenntnis wird als Aufwärtsbewegung verstanden, in der Tiefe nicht verleugnet, sondern in Höhe verwandelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD1","text":"Die Kritik der „reinen“ Erkenntnis ist zugleich eine Kritik der Trennung von Epistemologie, Körperlichkeit, Erotik und Zeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD2","text":"Das Reinheitsideal erzeugt die von ihm verleugnete Unreinheit als Scham, Heimlichkeit, Lüge und Instinktmaskierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD3","text":"Der Text ersetzt die Achse rein/unrein durch die Achse verleugnetes/bejahtes Begehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD4","text":"Erkenntnis wird von einer passiven Darstellungsfunktion in eine schöpferische Transformationsbewegung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von Mond und Sonne ordnet zwei Formen des Weltbezugs: heimliche Aneignung durch Distanz und offene Steigerung durch Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD6","text":"Die Entlarvung vollzieht sich zeitlich: Nacht ermöglicht die Maske, Nähe und Morgen machen ihre Triebstruktur sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD7","text":"Die affirmative Alternative bleibt nicht bei Lebensbejahung stehen, sondern bindet Bejahung an Zeugung, Selbstüberschreitung und Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD8","text":"Die Formel „alles Tiefe soll hinauf“ totalisiert Erkenntnis als Aneignung und Umformung der Tiefe durch eine erhöhte Perspektive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keinen neutralen Erkenntnisstandpunkt außerhalb von Begierde, Körper und Wille.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX2","text":"Es gibt keine stabile Identität eines Geistes, der vom Körper unabhängig urteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX3","text":"Es gibt keine Erkenntnis, die durch Nichtwollen rein oder unschuldig wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX4","text":"Es gibt keine Liebe zur Erde, die ohne Zeugung, Werden oder schöpferische Überschreitung unschuldig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX5","text":"Es gibt keine Schönheit, die im bloßen Gegenstandsbild aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX6","text":"Es gibt keine edle Sprache, deren Wert unabhängig von den verborgenen Trieben ihrer Sprecher besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX7","text":"Es gibt keine religiöse oder moralische Maske, die den Instinkt in einen höheren Ursprung verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX8","text":"Es gibt keine Ferne, die das Verborgene dauerhaft vor der Enthüllung schützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist ein reines Subjekt, dessen Erkenntnis weder vom Begehren noch vom Körper getragen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine unschuldige Passivität, die ohne Verleugnung, Feigheit oder Sterilität auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Erkenntnis und Begehren als voneinander unabhängige Sphären zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Transzendenz des Geistes, die das Irdische verachtet, ohne von ihm abhängig zu bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX5","text":"Abwesend ist ein äußerer Maßstab, von dem aus die Triebe des Erkennenden endgültig gereinigt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erkenntnis, die Tiefe lediglich bewahrt, statt sie in eine gesteigerte Form zu überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS1","text":"Scheinbare Fruchtbarkeit → Entzug wirklicher Zeugung → Symbolisierung des Mondes als falscher Erzeuger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS2","text":"Begehren der Erde + geistige Verachtung des Irdischen → Spaltung von Geist und Eingeweiden → Scham, Schuld und heimliches Verhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS3","text":"Spaltung → Selbstverführung durch Begierdelosigkeit → Umbenennung des passiven Schielens in Beschaulichkeit und des feigen Tastens in Schönheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS4","text":"Passive Spiegel-Erkenntnis → Ausschluss von Zugriff, Zeugung und Werden → Diagnose der „unbefleckten Erkenntnis“ als Sterilität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS5","text":"Diagnose der Sterilität → Gegenbestimmung der Unschuld als schöpferische Begierde → Verbindung von Liebe, Zeugung, Überschreitung und Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS6","text":"Enthüllung durch Nähe und Morgenlicht → Ende der Mondordnung → Auftreten der Sonne als Modell offener Erdliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS7","text":"Sonnenliebe + aufsteigende Bewegung des Meeres → Tiefe wird in Höhe überführt → Erkenntnis = Erhebung alles Tiefen zur eigenen Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AF1","text":"Scheinbare Schwangerschaft des Mondes → Entlarvung nichtzeugender Reinheit → Spaltung von Geist und Eingeweiden → Begierdelosigkeit als Selbsttäuschung → Erkenntnis als passive Spiegelung → Sterilitätsdiagnose → Unschuld als schöpferische Begierde → Liebe und Untergang → Sonnenliebe zur Erde → Erhebung der Tiefe in die Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AF2","text":"Verdecktes Begehren → moralische Maske → sprachliche Umwertung → körperliche und schöpferische Gegenbestimmung → zeitliche Enthüllung im Morgenlicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME1","text":"„Reine Erkenntnis“ wird von einer epistemischen Tugend zu einer physiologisch-moralischen Verdrängungsform umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME2","text":"Begierde wird vom Gegenbegriff der Erkenntnis zum Prüfstein ihrer Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME3","text":"Unschuld wird von Nichtbegehren auf integriertes, zeugendes und schöpferisches Begehren umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME4","text":"Schönheit wird aus der Sphäre distanzierter Betrachtung in die Sphäre von Wille, Liebe und Untergang verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz von Geist und Körper bricht als Erklärung zusammen; sichtbar wird eine durch den Körper strukturierte Geistigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME6","text":"Niedrige, krumme und körpernahe Wörter werden als mögliche Wahrheitsinstrumente gegen edle Begriffe aufgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME7","text":"Der Mond wird als Kartierung verborgener, schuldbeladener und steriler Beziehung zur Erde klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME8","text":"Die Sonne wird als Kartierung offener, schöpferischer und steigernder Weltbeziehung eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME9","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht mehr als Bewahrung des Gegenstands, sondern als vertikale Transformation der Tiefe sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Mond, Erde, Sonne, Meer und Fenster bilden die Bildfolge, an der heimliches und offenes Begehren unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Eine geistig-körperliche Spaltung erzeugt die institutionelle Grammatik von Reinheit, Scham, Heimlichkeit, Beschaulichkeit und Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text entzieht den Gegnern ihre Selbstbeschreibung, indem er ihre Begriffe als Masken ihrer verdrängten Triebe umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Wirklichkeit erscheint als Werden, Zeugung, Untergang und Steigerung; Nacht verdeckt, Nähe und Morgen enthüllen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Mondmetapher über die Diagnose der Reinheitsillusion zur Sonnenordnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob „Eingeweide“, Zeugung und schöpferischer Wille metaphorisch, psychologisch oder ontologisch zu lesen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist als polemische Umwertung intern kohärent: Verleugnetes Begehren erzeugt falsche Reinheit, bejahtes Begehren erzeugt Unschuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Rekonstruktion der Reinheit als aktiv erzeugter Verdrängungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT5","text":"Die positive Gegenordnung bleibt von der Gleichsetzung von Zeugung, Liebe, Untergang und Erkenntnis abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Kritik passiver Beschaulichkeit und der Totalisierung der Erkenntnis als Erhebung aller Tiefe zur eigenen Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass der Text die Perspektive des Sprechers als Enthüllungsinstanz privilegiert, obwohl er jede vom Begehren unabhängige Reinheit verwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Sonnenordnung nicht als bloßes Gegenbild, sondern als epistemische Neudefinition gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194815203690Z_6bd4ae9d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of Immaculate Knowledge","source_sha256":"84425af72341baf7df67d07cee8a0c8f3d9e7c01973f03900b126fe38aa8792b","sha256":"d2a16f7d2d00faa3e80c10139af5b2d8e0af4d0fc8bd626475bf7e61ffef2db6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:48:15.205934+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS1","text":"The moon’s apparent pregnancy is determined as the image of a non-procreative, ashamed relation to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS2","text":"The “Pure Knowers” are exposed as subjects whose spirit denies its own desire, although their “entrails” preserve it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS3","text":"The ideals of desirelessness, contemplation, and mirroring knowledge are redefined as veiled forms of cowardice, desire, and self-deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS4","text":"Innocence, beauty, and knowledge are bound to procreation, creative will, love, downfall, and self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS5","text":"The dawn replaces the moon as a model of an open, creative love affirmatively directed toward the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AS6","text":"The argument moves from revealed apparent fertility through the diagnosis of divided desire to the revaluation of knowledge as the elevation of depth into height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A1","text":"The moon stands for a relation to the earth that is apparently fertile but in fact non-procreative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","text":"The “Pure Knowers” desire the earth and the earthly despite their spiritual ideal of contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","text":"The separation of spirit and “entrails” produces shame, bad conscience, and indirect behavior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A4","text":"A desire that does not admit itself appears as furtiveness, lie, and stealthy movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A5","text":"Desireless contemplation is not an expression of innocence, but a self-seduction of the divided subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A6","text":"The reduction of knowledge to passive seeing makes things into mere images and the knower into an uninvolved mirror.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","text":"The innocence of desire consists in the affirmed unity of desire, procreation, and creative will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A8","text":"Beauty arises where one loves with the whole will and wills the downfall of the mere image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A9","text":"Love includes readiness for downfall and thus for the surrender of mere self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A10","text":"Whoever wants to create beyond themselves possesses the purest will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A11","text":"Noble concepts can conceal bodily desire, cowardice, and repression of instinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A12","text":"Self-deception is stabilized through religious and moral masks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A13","text":"Approach and daylight render visible the hidden motives of the seemingly pure play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A14","text":"The sun’s love for the earth embodies innocence, creative desire, and open intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:A15","text":"Knowledge means that everything deep is to reach the height of the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX1","text":"The moon’s apparent pregnancy is no real procreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX2","text":"The “Pure Knowers” are not desireless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX3","text":"Contempt for the earthly does not eliminate earthly desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX4","text":"Spiritual shame is not purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX5","text":"Secret desire is not innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX6","text":"Contemplation is not necessarily knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX7","text":"A mirror-relation to things is no creative knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX8","text":"The mere eye produces no beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX9","text":"The love of the “Pure Knowers” is neither procreative nor joyful in becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX10","text":"Noble names guarantee neither noble motives nor noble actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX11","text":"A God-mask is no divine soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX12","text":"The observer’s distance does not preserve the purity of what is observed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:NX13","text":"The slander of desire arises not from its absence, but from its denied presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D1","text":"The moon becomes the model of an epistemic attitude that desires the earth without confessing itself as desiring.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A1","CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D2","text":"“Pure” knowledge is a masked division between spiritual self-description and bodily drive-structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D3","text":"The ideal of life without desire is a self-discourse of denied desire.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D4","text":"The mirror-image of things designates a knowledge that replaces touch, grasp, and production with mere contemplation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A5","CH_97E9_VDUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D5","text":"“Immaculate knowledge” is determined as incapacity for procreation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A6","CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D6","text":"The denial of desire transforms bodily dependency into moral shame.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A2","CH_97E9_VDUE:A3","CH_97E9_VDUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D7","text":"Innocence is not the absence of desire, but its creative affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D8","text":"Beauty is not distanced perception, but readiness to surpass the image through love and downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDUE:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D9","text":"The exposure of false purity requires the revaluation of the degraded, body-near, and “crooked” words.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D10","text":"The dawn ends the lunar order by transferring hidden desire into open creative movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A13","CH_97E9_VDUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D11","text":"The sea shifts from a passively contemplated object to the desirous co-movement of the sun’s love.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:D12","text":"Knowledge is understood as an upward movement in which depth is not denied but transformed into height.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD1","text":"The critique of “pure” knowledge is at once a critique of the separation of epistemology, corporeality, eroticism, and procreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD2","text":"The ideal of purity produces the impurity it denies as shame, furtiveness, lie, and masking of instinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD3","text":"The text replaces the axis pure/impure with the axis denied/affirmed desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD4","text":"Knowledge is transferred from a passive representational function into a creative movement of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD5","text":"The opposition of moon and sun orders two forms of relation to the world: secret appropriation through distance and open intensification through love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD6","text":"The exposure unfolds temporally: night enables the mask; proximity and morning make its drive-structure visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD7","text":"The affirmative alternative does not stop at affirmation of life, but binds affirmation to procreation, self-overcoming, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SD8","text":"The formula “alles Tiefe soll hinauf” totalizes knowledge as the appropriation and transformation of depth by an elevated perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX1","text":"There is no neutral standpoint of knowledge outside desire, body, and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX2","text":"There is no stable identity of a spirit that judges independently of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX3","text":"There is no knowledge that becomes pure or innocent through non-willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX4","text":"There is no love for the earth that remains innocent without procreation, becoming, or creative surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX5","text":"There is no beauty exhausted in the mere image of the object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX6","text":"There is no noble language whose value exists independently of the hidden drives of its speakers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX7","text":"There is no religious or moral mask that transforms instinct into a higher origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:DNX8","text":"There is no distance that permanently protects the hidden from revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a pure subject whose knowledge is sustained neither by desire nor by the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an innocent passivity that manages without denial, cowardice, or sterility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX3","text":"Barred is the possibility of treating knowledge and desire as spheres independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible is a transcendence of spirit that despises the earthly without ceasing to depend on it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX5","text":"Absent is an external standard from which the drives of the knower could be definitively purified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:SNX6","text":"Excluded is a knowledge that merely preserves depth instead of transferring it into an intensified form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS1","text":"Apparent fertility → withdrawal of real procreation → symbolization of the moon as false progenitor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS2","text":"Desire for the earth + spiritual contempt for the earthly → division of spirit and entrails → shame, guilt, and secret behavior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS3","text":"Division → self-seduction through desirelessness → renaming passive squinting as contemplation and cowardly groping as beauty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS4","text":"Passive mirror-knowledge → exclusion of grasp, procreation, and becoming → diagnosis of “immaculate knowledge” as sterility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS5","text":"Diagnosis of sterility → counter-determination of innocence as creative desire → connection of love, procreation, surpassing, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS6","text":"Revelation through proximity and morning light → end of the lunar order → appearance of the sun as model of open love for the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:FGS7","text":"Sun-love + ascending movement of the sea → depth is transferred into height → knowledge = elevation of everything deep to one’s own height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AF1","text":"Apparent pregnancy of the moon → exposure of non-procreative purity → division of spirit and entrails → desirelessness as self-deception → knowledge as passive mirroring → diagnosis of sterility → innocence as creative desire → love and downfall → sun-love for the earth → elevation of depth into height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:AF2","text":"Concealed desire → moral mask → linguistic revaluation → bodily and creative counter-determination → temporal revelation in the morning light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME1","text":"“Pure knowledge” is reclassified from an epistemic virtue into a physiologico-moral form of repression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME2","text":"Desire is remapped from the counter-concept of knowledge to the touchstone of its truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME3","text":"Innocence is remapped from non-desiring to integrated, procreative, and creative desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME4","text":"Beauty is shifted from the sphere of distanced contemplation into the sphere of will, love, and downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME5","text":"The opposition of spirit and body collapses as an explanation; a spirituality structured by the body becomes visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME6","text":"Low, crooked, and body-near words are elevated as possible instruments of truth against noble concepts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME7","text":"The moon is classified as a mapping of a hidden, guilt-laden, and sterile relation to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME8","text":"The sun is deployed as a mapping of an open, creative, and intensifying relation to the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ME9","text":"Knowledge becomes visible no longer as preservation of the object, but as the vertical transformation of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Moon, earth, sun, sea, and window form the sequence of images through which secret and open desire are distinguished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** A spiritual-bodily division produces the institutional grammar of purity, shame, furtiveness, contemplation, and lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text deprives its opponents of their self-description by recoding their concepts as masks of their repressed drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality appears as becoming, procreation, downfall, and intensification; night conceals, proximity and morning reveal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the moon metaphor through the diagnosis of the illusion of purity to the solar order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether “entrails,” procreation, and creative will are to be read metaphorically, psychologically, or ontologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent as a polemical revaluation: denied desire produces false purity; affirmed desire produces innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the reconstruction of purity as an actively produced form of repression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT5","text":"The positive counter-order remains dependent on the equation of procreation, love, downfall, and knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the critique of passive contemplation and the totalization of knowledge as the elevation of all depth to one’s own height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the text privileges the speaker’s perspective as an instance of revelation, although it rejects every purity independent of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDUE:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the solar order is read not as a mere counter-image, but as an epistemic redefinition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDUE:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDUE@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDUE:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 52","title":"On Immaculate Perception","context":"Chapter 52","original_title":"Von der unbefleckten Erkenntniss","original_context":"Chapter 52"},"original_title":"Von der unbefleckten Erkenntniss","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Scholars","order":53,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDG0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDG0@R001","sha256":"466916cd212f1724e8208fe7b943b5f9a320196fa5e9d630196475b947a307b1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt bei der Aberkennung des Gelehrtenstatus an und macht daraus ein Problem der Zugehörigkeit, des Erkennens und der Rangordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS2","text":"Der Sprecher bestimmt den Verlust des Gelehrtenhauses als gewollten Auszug und als Befreiung von einer abgerichteten Erkenntnisform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS3","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von freier, erhitzter Gedankenbewegung und kühler Zuschauerhaltung bildet die diagnostische Achse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS4","text":"Die Gelehrten werden als technische Apparate beschrieben, die fremde Gedanken beobachten, Formen verknüpfen, Material zermahlen und normierte Ergebnisse erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS5","text":"Die institutionelle Gegnerschaft erscheint als räumliche und akustische Sperre gegen eine Bewegung über den Gelehrten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS6","text":"Die Diagnose endet in einer nicht-egalitären Gerechtigkeitsbehauptung, nach der verschiedene Menschen nicht dasselbe wollen dürfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A1","text":"Der Gelehrtenstatus ist abhängig vom Gegenüber: Für Kinder, Disteln und Mohnblumen bleibt der Sprecher ein Gelehrter, für die Schafe nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","text":"Der Sprecher hat das Haus der Gelehrten verlassen und die Tür hinter sich zugeschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","text":"Die Erkenntnisordnung der Gelehrten richtet die Seele wie eine Fertigkeit auf mechanische Wiederholung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","text":"Freiheit, offene Luft und frische Erde besitzen für den Sprecher höheren Wert als Würden und Achtbarkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","text":"Eigene Gedanken erzeugen Hitze und Atemnot, während die Gelehrten im kühlen Schatten eine Zuschauerposition einnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","text":"Die Gelehrten betrachten überwiegend Gedanken, die von anderen hervorgebracht wurden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","text":"Die Gelehrten beherrschen formale Verfahren des Fädelns, Knüpfens und Verwebens geistiger Elemente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","text":"Die Gelehrten funktionieren wie Uhrwerke, die eingestellte Ergebnisse zuverlässig und mit geringem Geräusch anzeigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A9","text":"Die Gelehrten zermahlen zugeführtes Material zu einem standardisierten, weißen Rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","text":"Die Gelehrten sichern ihre Stellung durch gegenseitiges Misstrauen, kleine Schlauheiten, Gift und falsche Würfel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A11","text":"Die Tugenden der Gelehrten stoßen den Sprecher stärker ab als deren offen erkennbare Falschheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","text":"Die Gelehrten reagieren auf eine Bewegung über ihnen mit materieller Abschirmung und akustischer Dämpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A13","text":"Die Gelehrtesten hören den Sprecher am schlechtesten, weil zwischen ihnen und ihm menschlicher Fehl und menschliche Schwäche geschichtet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","text":"Gerechtigkeit beruht nicht auf Gleichheit, weil Menschen nicht gleich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A15","text":"Was der Sprecher will, sollen die Gelehrten nicht ebenfalls wollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX1","text":"Der Sprecher ist für die Schafe kein Gelehrter mehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX2","text":"Das Gelehrtenhaus ist kein Ort fortbestehender Zugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX3","text":"Erkennen ist keine freie, ungerichtete Tätigkeit, sondern eine Abrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX4","text":"Gelehrsamkeit ist keine Teilnahme an der Hitze des Gedankens, sondern Zuschauerhaltung im Schatten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX5","text":"Gelehrtes Denken ist nicht primär ursprüngliches Denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX6","text":"Gelehrte Weisheit ist weder unschuldig noch fruchtbar; sie erscheint als kleiner Spruch, Sumpfgeruch und Froschlaut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX7","text":"Formale Geschicklichkeit ist keine Einfalt und keine schöpferische Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX8","text":"Gelehrte Tugend ist kein Gegenpol zur Falschheit, sondern kann stärker entfremden als diese.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX9","text":"Die Gelehrten bilden keine vertrauensvolle oder faire Erkenntnisgemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX10","text":"Zwischen Sprecher und Gelehrten besteht keine ungehinderte akustische oder räumliche Verständigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX11","text":"Gerechtigkeit ist nicht mit der Forderung identisch, dass alle dasselbe wollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D1","text":"Der Austritt aus dem Gelehrtenhaus ist zugleich ein Austritt aus einer bestimmten Produktionsweise des Erkennens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D2","text":"Die Zuschauerhaltung macht fremde Gedanken zu beobachtbaren Gegenständen, ohne ihre Hervorbringung zu wiederholen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D3","text":"Die formale Vielseitigkeit der Gelehrten erzeugt Verknüpfung, ohne dadurch ursprüngliche Gedanken hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D4","text":"Die Gelehrten verwandeln Erkenntnismaterial in messbare, standardisierte und entleerte Resultate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D5","text":"Ihre technische Präzision kann mit Misstrauen, Täuschung und strategischer Konkurrenz verbunden sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D6","text":"Die Ablehnung des Sprechers richtet sich nicht nur gegen Irrtum, sondern gegen eine Erkenntnisform, deren Tugend selbst entfremdet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D7","text":"Die Gelehrten übersetzen geistige Rangordnung in materielle Abschirmung und verringerte Hörbarkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D8","text":"Die Behauptung menschlicher Ungleichheit legitimiert eine asymmetrische Verteilung von Wünschen und Ansprüchen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD1","text":"Gelehrsamkeit erscheint als Apparat der Verarbeitung: Sie beobachtet, verknüpft, misst und reduziert, statt primär hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Sprecher und Gelehrten ist ein Gegensatz zwischen exponierter Gedankenproduktion und geschützter Sekundärverarbeitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD3","text":"Erkenntniskonflikt wird als räumliche, materielle und akustische Ordnung von Oben, Unten, Dämpfung und Hörbarkeit organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD4","text":"Der Gelehrtenstatus besitzt keine absolute Bedeutung, sondern entsteht aus einer relationalen Verteilung von Perspektiven, Adressaten und Rangpositionen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A1","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD5","text":"Die Kritik an den Gelehrten kann nicht in eine bloße Reform ihrer Tugenden überführt werden, weil auch ihre Tugenden als entfremdende Kräfte erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD6","text":"Die Rückweisung der Gleichheit erzeugt eine politische und ontologische Trennung, in der unterschiedliche Erkenntnisweisen unterschiedliche Ansprüche auf Wollen und Geltung erhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX1","text":"Erkenntnis ist nicht als neutrale Ansammlung von Wissen verfügbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX2","text":"Der Intellekt existiert nicht unabhängig von Körper, Raum, Material und institutioneller Organisation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX3","text":"Technische Kompetenz begründet keine epistemische oder moralische Legitimität.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX4","text":"Zwischen verschiedenen Erkenntnisformen besteht kein vorausgesetztes gemeinsames Maß.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX5","text":"Kommunikation ist keine vorausliegende Gleichheit, sondern kann durch Hierarchie und materielle Vermittlung verhindert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX1","text":"Eine Rückkehr in das Gelehrtenhaus oder eine Versöhnung mit seiner Erkenntnisordnung ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX2","text":"Eine gemeinsame Sprache zwischen Sprecher und Gelehrten ist nicht als neutrale Grundlage gegeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX3","text":"Eine nicht-hierarchische Außenposition ist ausgeschlossen, weil der Auszug selbst in eine Bewegung über den Gelehrten umschlägt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX4","text":"Eine positive institutionelle Alternative zur Gelehrtenordnung bleibt unformuliert; verfügbar sind nur Auszug, Freiluft, Hitze und Distanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass Gelehrsamkeit durch ihre eigenen Tugenden gerettet werden könnte, wird strukturell abgeschnitten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS1","text":"Fremde Aberkennung des Status → relationale Neubestimmung des Gelehrtenbegriffs → selbstgesetzter Austritt aus der Institution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS2","text":"Institutionelle Abrichtung des Erkennens → Gegensatz von mechanischer Wiederholung und freier Gedankenbewegung → Vorrang von Offenheit, Körper und Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS3","text":"Zuschauerhaltung → Betrachtung fremder Gedanken → formale Verknüpfung → standardisierte und entleerte Resultate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS4","text":"Technische Geschicklichkeit plus Misstrauen → Erkenntnis als Konkurrenzapparat → Ausschluss von Unschuld, Vertrauen und schöpferischer Einfachheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS5","text":"Bewegung über den Gelehrten → institutionelle Abschirmung → gedämpfter Schritt und verschlechterte Hörbarkeit → fortbestehende Überordnung des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS6","text":"Behauptete Ungleichheit der Menschen → asymmetrische Verteilung legitimer Wünsche → Schließung gegen gemeinsame Maßstäbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AF1","text":"Fremde Aberkennung des Gelehrtenstatus → Umdeutung des Verlusts als Befreiung → Austritt aus der abgerichteten Erkenntnisordnung → Diagnose der Gelehrten als technische Zuschauer- und Reduktionsapparate → Übersetzung des Konflikts in vertikale und akustische Sperren → normative Schließung durch Ungleichheit und getrennte Wünsche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME1","text":"Der Begriff „Gelehrter“ wird von einer festen Identität in eine relationale Zuschreibung zwischen Sprecher, Adressat und Rangposition umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME2","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht länger primär als Besitz von Wahrheiten, sondern als Verarbeitung, Verknüpfung, Messung und Reduktion sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME3","text":"Die falsche Alternative zwischen Weisheit und Falschheit bricht zusammen, weil auch Tugend als technische oder strategische Entfremdung erscheinen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von geistiger Überlegenheit und institutioneller Unterlegenheit wird als räumliche und akustische Infrastruktur lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME5","text":"Gleichheit wird aus dem Begriff der Gerechtigkeit herausgelöst; Gerechtigkeit bezeichnet stattdessen die Anerkennung ungleicher Wünsche und Positionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME6","text":"Der Außenraum wird als Gegenbild zur Gelehrteninstitution sichtbar, bleibt jedoch eher als negative Fluchtzone denn als ausgearbeitete Ordnung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Sprecher weist die Zuschreibung „Gelehrter“ zurück, verlässt das Gelehrtenhaus und grenzt sich von dessen Bewohnern ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Gelehrsamkeit funktioniert als institutioneller Apparat aus Abrichtung, Zuschauerhaltung, formaler Verknüpfung, Reduktion, Misstrauen und Abschirmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Konflikt wird nicht als Debatte über einzelne Wahrheiten, sondern als Kampf um Standort, Hörbarkeit, Maßstab und zulässige Wünsche gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Menschen sind nicht gleich; lebendige Hitze, offene Erde und eigene Gedanken stehen einer mechanischen Zeitordnung aus Uhrwerk, Wiederholung und standardisiertem Ertrag gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom Austritt zur Diagnose der Gelehrten und zur Ungleichheitsbehauptung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche positive Erkenntnisform an die Stelle der Gelehrtenordnung treten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Bilder von Uhrwerk, Mühle, Gift und falschen Würfeln als Funktionsmodelle gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Erkenntniskritik, institutioneller Materialität und vertikaler Rangordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass der Sprecher die Gelehrtenordnung verlässt, seine Position aber weiterhin durch Überordnung und Rang bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass der Sprecher Gelehrsamkeit relativiert, zugleich aber selbst neue Klassifikationen von Gelehrten, Kindern, Schafen und Menschen setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT7","text":"Die Schlusskraft hängt von metaphorischer Verdichtung ab, insbesondere von der Gleichsetzung gelehrter Tätigkeit mit Abrichtung, Mechanik, Zermahlung und Abschirmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Aberkennung über Auszug und Diagnose bis zur hierarchischen Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194234616630Z_a9a80253","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Scholars","source_sha256":"466916cd212f1724e8208fe7b943b5f9a320196fa5e9d630196475b947a307b1","sha256":"cdc1de624a4efebbebc5633d5380480c51f6c2559b979ab7e98b7212c6c871ed","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:42:34.617561+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS1","text":"The text begins with the revocation of scholarly status and turns it into a problem of belonging, knowing, and rank order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS2","text":"The speaker defines the loss of the house of scholars as a willed departure and as liberation from a drilled form of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS3","text":"The opposition between free, heated movement of thought and cool spectator stance forms the diagnostic axis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS4","text":"The scholars are described as technical apparatuses that observe others' thoughts, link forms, grind material, and produce standardized results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS5","text":"Institutional antagonism appears as a spatial and acoustic barrier against a movement above the scholars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AS6","text":"The diagnosis ends in a non-egalitarian assertion of justice, according to which different people must not be permitted to want the same thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A1","text":"Scholarly status depends on the counterpart: for children, thistles, and poppies, the speaker remains a scholar, but not for the sheep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","text":"The speaker has left the house of scholars and slammed the door behind him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","text":"The scholars' order of knowledge drills the soul, like a skill, toward mechanical repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","text":"For the speaker, freedom, open air, and fresh earth possess greater value than dignities and respectabilities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","text":"One's own thoughts produce heat and shortness of breath, whereas the scholars assume a spectator position in cool shade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","text":"The scholars predominantly contemplate thoughts that have been produced by others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","text":"The scholars command formal procedures of threading, knotting, and weaving intellectual elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","text":"The scholars function like clockworks that reliably and quietly indicate preset results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A9","text":"The scholars grind supplied material into a standardized, white residue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","text":"The scholars secure their position through mutual mistrust, petty cunning, poison, and loaded dice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A11","text":"The virtues of the scholars repel the speaker more strongly than their openly recognizable falsehoods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","text":"The scholars react to a movement above them with material shielding and acoustic dampening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A13","text":"The most scholarly hear the speaker worst, because human error and human weakness are layered between them and him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","text":"Justice is not based on equality, because people are not equal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:A15","text":"What the speaker wants, the scholars should not likewise want.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX1","text":"For the sheep, the speaker is no longer a scholar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX2","text":"The house of scholars is not a place of continuing belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX3","text":"Knowing is not a free, undirected activity, but a drilling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX4","text":"Scholarship is not participation in the heat of thought, but a spectator stance in the shade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX5","text":"Scholarly thinking is not primarily original thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX6","text":"Scholarly wisdom is neither innocent nor fruitful; it appears as a petty saying, marsh smell, and frog sound.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX7","text":"Formal skill is neither simplicity nor creative simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX8","text":"Scholarly virtue is not an opposite to falsehood, but can estrange more strongly than the latter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX9","text":"The scholars do not constitute a trusting or fair community of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX10","text":"There is no unobstructed acoustic or spatial understanding between speaker and scholars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:NX11","text":"Justice is not identical with the demand that everyone want the same thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D1","text":"Departure from the house of scholars is at once departure from a particular mode of producing knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D2","text":"The spectator stance makes others' thoughts into observable objects without repeating their production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D3","text":"The formal versatility of the scholars produces linkage without thereby producing original thoughts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D4","text":"The scholars transform material of knowledge into measurable, standardized, and emptied results.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D5","text":"Their technical precision can be associated with mistrust, deception, and strategic competition.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D6","text":"The speaker's rejection is directed not only against error, but against a form of knowledge whose virtue itself alienates.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D7","text":"The scholars translate intellectual rank order into material shielding and diminished audibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:D8","text":"The assertion of human inequality legitimates an asymmetrical distribution of wishes and claims.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD1","text":"Scholarship appears as an apparatus of processing: it observes, links, measures, and reduces, rather than primarily producing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD2","text":"The opposition between speaker and scholars is an opposition between exposed production of thought and protected secondary processing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD3","text":"Conflict over knowledge is organized as a spatial, material, and acoustic order of above, below, dampening, and audibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD4","text":"Scholarly status has no absolute significance, but emerges from a relational distribution of perspectives, addressees, and positions of rank.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A1","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD5","text":"The critique of the scholars cannot be converted into a mere reform of their virtues, because their virtues too appear as alienating forces.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SD6","text":"The rejection of equality produces a political and ontological separation in which different modes of knowledge receive different claims to willing and validity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A14","CH_97E9_VDG0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX1","text":"Knowledge is not available as a neutral accumulation of information.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A3","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX2","text":"The intellect does not exist independently of body, space, material, and institutional organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A9","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX3","text":"Technical competence does not establish epistemic or moral legitimacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A7","CH_97E9_VDG0:A8","CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX4","text":"There is no presupposed common measure between different forms of knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:DNX5","text":"Communication is not a prior equality, but can be prevented by hierarchy and material mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX1","text":"A return to the house of scholars or a reconciliation with its order of knowledge is not available.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX2","text":"A common language between speaker and scholars is not given as a neutral foundation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A6","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX3","text":"A non-hierarchical external position is excluded, because departure itself turns into a movement above the scholars.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A12","CH_97E9_VDG0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX4","text":"A positive institutional alternative to the order of scholars remains unformulated; only departure, open air, heat, and distance are available.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A2","CH_97E9_VDG0:A4","CH_97E9_VDG0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:SNX5","text":"The possibility that scholarship might be saved through its own virtues is structurally cut off.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDG0:A10","CH_97E9_VDG0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS1","text":"External revocation of status → relational redefinition of the concept of the scholar → self-imposed departure from the institution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS2","text":"Institutional drilling of knowing → opposition between mechanical repetition and free movement of thought → priority of openness, body, and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS3","text":"Spectator stance → contemplation of others' thoughts → formal linkage → standardized and emptied results.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS4","text":"Technical skill plus mistrust → knowledge as an apparatus of competition → exclusion of innocence, trust, and creative simplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS5","text":"Movement above the scholars → institutional shielding → muffled step and worsened audibility → continuing superiority of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:FGS6","text":"Asserted inequality of human beings → asymmetrical distribution of legitimate wishes → closure against common standards.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:AF1","text":"External revocation of scholarly status → reinterpretation of the loss as liberation → departure from the drilled order of knowledge → diagnosis of the scholars as technical spectator and reduction apparatuses → translation of the conflict into vertical and acoustic barriers → normative closure through inequality and separate wishes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME1","text":"The concept “scholar” is remapped from a fixed identity into a relational attribution between speaker, addressee, and position of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME2","text":"Knowledge becomes visible no longer primarily as possession of truths, but as processing, linkage, measurement, and reduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME3","text":"The false alternative between wisdom and falsehood collapses, because virtue too can appear as technical or strategic alienation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME4","text":"The opposition between intellectual superiority and institutional inferiority becomes legible as spatial and acoustic infrastructure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME5","text":"Equality is detached from the concept of justice; justice instead denotes recognition of unequal wishes and positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ME6","text":"The external space becomes visible as a counter-image to the institution of scholars, yet remains defined more as a negative zone of flight than as an elaborated order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The speaker rejects the attribution “scholar,” leaves the house of scholars, and distinguishes himself from its inhabitants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Scholarship functions as an institutional apparatus of drilling, spectator stance, formal linkage, reduction, mistrust, and shielding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The conflict is framed not as a debate over individual truths, but as a struggle over position, audibility, standard, and permissible wishes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Human beings are not equal; living heat, open earth, and one's own thoughts stand opposed to a mechanical temporal order of clockwork, repetition, and standardized yield.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from departure to the diagnosis of the scholars and to the assertion of inequality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined which positive form of knowledge is to take the place of the order of scholars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the images of clockwork, mill, poison, and loaded dice are read as functional models.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of critique of knowledge, institutional materiality, and vertical rank order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the speaker leaves the order of scholars, but continues to determine his position through superiority and rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT6","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that the speaker relativizes scholarship while at the same time himself establishing new classifications of scholars, children, sheep, and human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT7","text":"The force of the conclusion depends on metaphorical condensation, especially on the equation of scholarly activity with drilling, mechanics, grinding, and shielding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDG0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from revocation through departure and diagnosis to hierarchical closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDG0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDG0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDG0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 53","title":"On the Scholars","context":"Chapter 53","original_title":"Von den Gelehrten","original_context":"Chapter 53"},"original_title":"Von den Gelehrten","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0","layer":"CH","title":"On Poets","order":54,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDD0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDD0@R001","sha256":"c9313f7a53d726ed519f7bac8ea5cfbd55aeae978cd1208ae8bc5200d2ef1bd6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS1","text":"Der Text untersucht, wie die Geltung dichterischer Aussagen unter der Bedingung begrenzten Wissens und instabiler Gründe bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS2","text":"Die Warum-Frage wird durch den Entzug erinnerbarer Gründe und die Nichtverfügbarkeit eigener Meinungen zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS3","text":"Die Körperkenntnis bestimmt Geist und „Unvergängliches“ als abgeleitete Gleichnisse statt als selbständige Wirklichkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS4","text":"Das Zuviel-Lügen der Dichter wird aus ihrem schlechten Wissen, ihrem schlechten Lernen und ihrer Neigung zur Vermischung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS5","text":"Die dichterischen Zugänge zu Natur, Volk, Gefühl, Göttern und Übermenschen werden als Projektionen, Ersatzwissen und Eitelkeitsformen rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS6","text":"Die Kritik schließt Zarathustra als Dichter ein und führt von der Diagnose dichterischer Oberflächlichkeit zu einer erst kommenden Selbstwendung des Dichters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A1","text":"Der Leib ist die Erkenntnisinstanz, von der aus der Geist nur noch als „gleichsam Geist“ erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A2","text":"Das „Unvergängliche“ ist nur ein Gleichniss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A3","text":"Zarathustra verweigert die Verfügbarkeit seiner Gründe als Antwort auf ein Warum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A4","text":"Erlebte Gründe liegen zeitlich zurück und müssen im gegenwärtigen Gedächtniss nicht verfügbar sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A5","text":"Meinungen werden nicht vollständig besessen; sie können entfliegen oder als fremde Elemente auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","text":"Zarathustra ist selbst ein Dichter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A7","text":"Der Glaube an Zarathustra begründet weder Wahrheit noch Seligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A8","text":"Die Dichter lügen zu viel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","text":"Geringes Wissen und schlechtes Lernen erzeugen das Lügen der Dichter als Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A10","text":"Dichter verfälschen ihre Stoffe und erzeugen giftige Mischungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","text":"Dichter ersetzen Wissen durch die Aufwertung geistig Armer, volkstümlicher „Weisheit“ und des „Ewig-Weiblichen“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A12","text":"Dichter deuten einsames Lauschen und zärtliche Regungen als privilegierten Zugang der Natur zu ihrem Inneren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A13","text":"Götter und Übermenschen sind Dichter-Gleichnisse und Dichter-Erschleichnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","text":"Dichterisches Denken bleibt oberflächlich und verwechselt Lust, Langeweile und Harfen-Klingklang mit Tiefe und Inbrunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A15","text":"Dichter trüben ihr Gewässer, damit es tief scheine, und bleiben als Mittler, Mischer und Halb-und-Halbe unreine Gestalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A16","text":"Der Geist des Dichters verlangt Zuschauer und organisiert seine Erscheinungen als Eitelkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A17","text":"Aus den Dichtern können gegen sich selbst gewendete Büsser des Geistes hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A18","text":"Die Selbstwendung der Dichter gehört einer kommenden Zeit an und ist noch nicht vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX1","text":"Das System gründet nicht auf einer vollständig verfügbaren Antwort auf das Warum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX2","text":"Glaube an eine Person ist kein Wahrheitskriterium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX3","text":"Zarathustra steht nicht außerhalb der kritisierten dichterischen Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX4","text":"Es gibt keinen besonderen Erkenntniszugang durch Volk, Natur, Gefühl oder das „Ewig-Weibliche“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX5","text":"Götter und Übermenschen besitzen keine von dichterischen Gleichnissen unabhängige Transzendenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX6","text":"Erregung, Wollust, Langeweile und Klang erzeugen keine Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX7","text":"Versöhnung durch Vermittlung und Mischung ist keine Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX8","text":"Ein unzulängliches Geschehen wird nicht dadurch zum Ereigniss, dass es dichterisch erhöht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX9","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen alten und neuen Dichtern hebt ihre gemeinsame Oberflächlichkeit nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D1","text":"Die Zurückweisung des Warum entzieht dem Text eine vollständig rekonstruierbare Ursprungskette seiner Meinungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A3","CH_97E9_VDD0:A4","CH_97E9_VDD0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D2","text":"Die Kritik an den Dichtern kann keine externe Anklage bleiben, weil der Sprecher selbst als Dichter bestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D3","text":"Aus geringem Wissen und schlechtem Lernen folgt das Zuviel-Lügen als kompensatorische Produktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A8","CH_97E9_VDD0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D4","text":"Die dichterische Lüge besteht nicht nur in Falschheit, sondern in der Verfälschung und Vermischung ihrer Materialien.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D5","text":"Geistige Armut, Volk, Natur und Gefühl werden zu Ersatzquellen eines Wissens gemacht, das nicht erworben wurde.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","CH_97E9_VDD0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D6","text":"Die Behauptung eines Zugangs zu den Dingen zwischen Himmel und Erde erzeugt eine poetische Personifikation der Natur.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D7","text":"Götter und Übermenschen erscheinen als auf Wolken gesetzte, hinreichend leichte Konstruktionen der dichterischen Imagination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D8","text":"Die behauptete Tiefe des dichterischen Geistes wird als Effekt der Trübung und nicht als Durchdringung der Gründe erklärt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","CH_97E9_VDD0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D9","text":"Die dichterische Versöhnung reproduziert gerade die Unreinheit, die sie zu vermitteln vorgibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D10","text":"Die Forderung nach Zuschauern verwandelt poetische Erkenntnis in eine Form von Selbstinszenierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D11","text":"Die Ermüdung am dichterischen Geist eröffnet die Möglichkeit einer gegen sich selbst gerichteten dichterischen Kritik.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A16","CH_97E9_VDD0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD1","text":"Die dichterische Transzendenz entsteht systemisch aus Wissensmangel, affektiver Projektion, Vermischung und Eitelkeit statt aus einem Zugang zu einer höheren Wirklichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","CH_97E9_VDD0:A12","CH_97E9_VDD0:A13","CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD2","text":"Die Kritik der dichterischen Lüge wird zu einer selbstreflexiven Operation, weil sie den Kritiker in dieselbe poetische Produktionsform einschließt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A7","CH_97E9_VDD0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD3","text":"Die Auflösung metaphysischer Bilder führt nicht zu einem fertigen Wahrheitsstandpunkt, sondern zu einer immanenten Prüfung derjenigen Instanz, die diese Bilder erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A1","CH_97E9_VDD0:A2","CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD4","text":"Die poetische Oberflächlichkeit wird zugleich als Erkenntnismangel, als soziale Bedürftigkeit nach Zuschauern und als ontologische Inflation sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD5","text":"Selbstüberwindung erscheint nur als kommende Möglichkeit, weil die Kritik die alte dichterische Form auflöst, ohne die neue Form bereits bereitzustellen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A17","CH_97E9_VDD0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein vollständig selbsttransparentes Subjekt, das seine Gründe, Meinungen und Ursprünge jederzeit besitzen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein neutraler Wahrheitsgrund außerhalb von Glaube, Erinnerung, Körper und dichterischer Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine nicht-projizierte Welt hinter den poetischen Bildern von Natur, Göttern und Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist reine Vermittlung ohne Mischung, Verfälschung oder Halbheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Tiefe, die sich durch Intensität, ornamentalen Klang oder affektive Ergriffenheit selbst beglaubigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein bereits vorhandenes Subjekt der Selbstüberwindung; vorhanden ist nur dessen Ankunft als Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX1","text":"Der Text setzt die Abwesenheit eines nicht-poetischen und nicht-metaphorischen Erkenntnisbodens voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX2","text":"Nach der Auflösung von Göttern und Übermenschen bleibt keine positive transzendente Ordnung verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Trennung zwischen wahrer Diagnose und dichterischer Konstruktion bleibt versperrt, weil die Diagnose selbst in poetischer Rede erfolgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer reinen, unvermittelten Beziehung zwischen Sprache, Welt und Wahrheit wird nicht erreicht, sondern strukturell blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX5","text":"Die angekündigte Selbstüberwindung besitzt keine ausgearbeitete Gegenwartsgestalt und bleibt auf die Zukunftsform des „Morgen“, „Übermorgen“ und „Einstmals“ verwiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS1","text":"Körperkenntnis → Herabstufung des Geistes → Gleichnishaftigkeit des „Unvergänglichen“ → Entliteraliserung metaphysischer Ansprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS2","text":"Warum-Frage → Nichtverfügbarkeit vergangener Gründe → Instabilität der Meinungen → Verweigerung einer geschlossenen Selbstbegründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_9