 von Erkenntnisquellen in Mechanismen der Ersatzbildung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME4","text":"Tiefe wird nicht länger als Eigenschaft des Inhalts, sondern als möglicher Effekt sprachlicher Trübung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME5","text":"Kritik wird von einer äußeren Zurückweisung der Dichter in eine innere Bewegung der Selbstermüdung und Selbstumwendung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME6","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Lüge und Wahrheit wird durch den Gegensatz zwischen unreflektierter Projektion und selbstkritischer Transformation ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die unmittelbare Behauptung lautet, dass Dichter zu viel lügen und Zarathustra ihrer Oberflächlichkeit müde ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Lügen wird durch Wissensmangel, schlechtes Lernen, Vermischung, Projektion und das Bedürfnis nach Zuschauern erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Kritik entzieht sich sowohl dem Glauben an den Sprecher als auch einer äußeren Richterposition und organisiert dadurch eine selbstreflexive Neurahmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Leib relativiert Geist und „Unvergängliches“ zu Gleichnissen; die Auflösung der alten dichterischen Form wird auf eine zukünftige Selbstwendung hin geöffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Körperkenntnis und Erkenntnisentzug über die Kritik der Dichter bis zur Möglichkeit ihrer Selbstüberwindung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem positiven Kriterium Zarathustras eigene dichterische Rede von der kritisierten Lüge unterschieden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT3","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht zwischen der Verweigerung begründender Warum-Antworten und den bestimmten kausalen Erklärungen des dichterischen Lügenmechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT4","text":"Die Körperkenntnis eröffnet die Kritik, liefert aber keine ausgearbeitete positive Ontologie des Leibes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT5","text":"Die pauschale Verurteilung der Dichter bleibt mit der Anerkennung von Perlen in ihnen und mit ihrer möglichen inneren Verwandlung unvollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT6","text":"Die Kritik der Gleichnisse und dichterischen Erschleichnisse vollzieht sich selbst durch Gleichnisse von Meer, Pfau, Büffel, Gewässer und Schalthier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT7","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Selbstinklusion des Dichters als Übergang von Fremdkritik zu Selbstprüfung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, bleibt aber auf die rhetorische Kraft der Bildkomplexe und auf eine nicht vollständig explizierte Zukunft des Büssers des Geistes angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194004243450Z_b870e3fd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Of Poets","source_sha256":"c9313f7a53d726ed519f7bac8ea5cfbd55aeae978cd1208ae8bc5200d2ef1bd6","sha256":"36f9ee5012786d8aa6c03f3c45c31de930049cf74e9bb5f2e9757f103bb0658f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:40:04.244749+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS1","text":"The text examines how the validity of poetic statements can be determined under the condition of limited knowledge and unstable grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS2","text":"The why-question is rejected through the withdrawal of memorable grounds and the unavailability of one's own opinions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS3","text":"Knowledge of the body determines spirit and the “imperishable” as derivative parables rather than as independent realities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS4","text":"The poets' excessive lying is generated by their poor knowledge, their poor learning, and their inclination toward mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS5","text":"The poetic approaches to nature, people, feeling, gods, and overmen are reconstructed as projections, substitute knowledge, and forms of vanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AS6","text":"The critique includes Zarathustra as a poet and leads from the diagnosis of poetic superficiality to a still forthcoming self-turning of the poet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A1","text":"The body is the instance of knowledge, from which spirit appears only as “as it were spirit.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A2","text":"The “imperishable” is only a parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A3","text":"Zarathustra refuses the availability of his grounds as an answer to a why.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A4","text":"Experienced grounds lie temporally in the past and need not be available in present memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A5","text":"Opinions are not possessed completely; they can fly away or appear as foreign elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","text":"Zarathustra is himself a poet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A7","text":"Belief in Zarathustra grounds neither truth nor blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A8","text":"Poets lie too much.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","text":"Scant knowledge and poor learning generate the lying of poets as a necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A10","text":"Poets falsify their materials and produce poisonous mixtures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","text":"Poets replace knowledge through the elevation of the spiritually poor, popular “wisdom,” and the “Eternal-Feminine.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A12","text":"Poets interpret solitary listening and tender stirrings as nature's privileged access to its interior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A13","text":"Gods and overmen are poets' parables and poets' surreptitious acquisitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","text":"Poetic thinking remains superficial and mistakes pleasure, boredom, and harp-jingling for depth and ardor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A15","text":"Poets muddy their waters so that they may seem deep, and remain impure figures as mediators, mixers, and half-and-halves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A16","text":"The poet's spirit demands spectators and organizes its appearances as vanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A17","text":"From poets may arise penitents of the spirit turned against themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:A18","text":"The self-turning of poets belongs to a coming time and has not yet been accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX1","text":"The system is not founded on a fully available answer to the why.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX2","text":"Belief in a person is no criterion of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX3","text":"Zarathustra does not stand outside the criticized poetic lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX4","text":"There is no special cognitive access through people, nature, feeling, or the “Eternal-Feminine.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX5","text":"Gods and overmen possess no transcendence independent of poetic parables.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX6","text":"Excitement, lust, boredom, and sound produce no depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX7","text":"Reconciliation through mediation and mixture is not purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX8","text":"An inadequate occurrence does not become an event merely because it is poetically elevated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:NX9","text":"The distinction between old and new poets does not abolish their shared superficiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D1","text":"The rejection of the why deprives the text of a fully reconstructible chain of origins of its opinions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A3","CH_97E9_VDD0:A4","CH_97E9_VDD0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D2","text":"The critique of poets cannot remain an external accusation, because the speaker is himself determined as a poet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D3","text":"From scant knowledge and poor learning follows excessive lying as compensatory production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A8","CH_97E9_VDD0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D4","text":"The poetic lie consists not only in falsity, but in the falsification and mixture of its materials.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D5","text":"Spiritual poverty, people, nature, and feeling are made into substitute sources of knowledge that was not acquired.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","CH_97E9_VDD0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D6","text":"The assertion of access to the things between heaven and earth produces a poetic personification of nature.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D7","text":"Gods and overmen appear as constructions of poetic imagination, set upon clouds and sufficiently light.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D8","text":"The asserted depth of the poetic spirit is explained as an effect of muddiness and not as penetration of grounds.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","CH_97E9_VDD0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D9","text":"Poetic reconciliation reproduces precisely the impurity it purports to mediate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D10","text":"The demand for spectators transforms poetic knowledge into a form of self-staging.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:D11","text":"Weariness with the poetic spirit opens the possibility of a poetic critique directed against itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A16","CH_97E9_VDD0:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD1","text":"Poetic transcendence arises systemically from lack of knowledge, affective projection, mixture, and vanity rather than from access to a higher reality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A11","CH_97E9_VDD0:A12","CH_97E9_VDD0:A13","CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD2","text":"The critique of the poetic lie becomes a self-reflexive operation because it includes the critic within the same poetic form of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A7","CH_97E9_VDD0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD3","text":"The dissolution of metaphysical images does not lead to a finished standpoint of truth, but to an immanent examination of the instance that produces these images.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A1","CH_97E9_VDD0:A2","CH_97E9_VDD0:A6","CH_97E9_VDD0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD4","text":"Poetic superficiality becomes visible at once as a lack of knowledge, as a social need for spectators, and as ontological inflation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A9","CH_97E9_VDD0:A14","CH_97E9_VDD0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SD5","text":"Self-overcoming appears only as a future possibility, because the critique dissolves the old poetic form without already providing the new form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDD0:A17","CH_97E9_VDD0:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a fully self-transparent subject that could possess its grounds, opinions, and origins at all times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a neutral ground of truth outside belief, memory, body, and poetic speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a non-projected world behind the poetic images of nature, gods, and overmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is pure mediation without mixture, falsification, or halfness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a depth that authenticates itself through intensity, ornamental sound, or affective rapture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an already existing subject of self-overcoming; present is only its arrival as possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX1","text":"The text presupposes the absence of a non-poetic and non-metaphorical ground of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX2","text":"After the dissolution of gods and overmen, no positive transcendent order remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX3","text":"A final separation between true diagnosis and poetic construction remains barred, because the diagnosis itself occurs in poetic speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a pure, unmediated relation between language, world, and truth is not attained but structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:SNX5","text":"The announced self-overcoming possesses no elaborated present form and remains referred to the future form of “tomorrow,” “the day after tomorrow,” and “someday.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS1","text":"Knowledge of the body → downgrading of spirit → parabolic character of the “imperishable” → deliteralization of metaphysical claims.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS2","text":"Why-question → unavailability of past grounds → instability of opinions → refusal of a closed self-grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS3","text":"Zarathustra as poet → rejection of belief in Zarathustra → inclusion of the speaker in the critique → self-reflexivity of the accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS4","text":"Scant knowledge and poor learning → necessary lying → falsification and poisonous mixture → production of substitute knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS5","text":"Substitute knowledge through people, nature, and feeling → projection of a secret access → gods and overmen as parables → emergence of a light transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS6","text":"Claim to depth → muddiness of the water → mediation and halfness → exposure of poetic vanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:FGS7","text":"Weariness with the poetic spirit → gaze turned against itself → penitent of the spirit → still unfinished future transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AF1","text":"Why-question → withdrawal of memorable grounds → body as counter-instance → self-inclusion of Zarathustra → necessary lying from lack of knowledge → poetic projection → metaphysical parables → superficiality and mixture → self-weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:AF2","text":"Assertion of the poetic lie → inclusion of the speaker himself → dissolution of the external judicial standpoint → transformation of critique into self-examination → possible emergence of the penitent of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME1","text":"Truth is detached from personal authority and belief and bound to the examination of the generating conditions of a statement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME2","text":"The opposition between human speech and divine or overhuman speech collapses; all three are mapped as poetic constructions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME3","text":"Ignorance, feeling, popular character, and experience of nature are reclassified from sources of knowledge into mechanisms of substitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME4","text":"Depth becomes visible no longer as a property of content, but as a possible effect of linguistic muddiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME5","text":"Critique is transferred from an external rejection of poets into an internal movement of self-weariness and self-turning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ME6","text":"The opposition between lie and truth is replaced by the opposition between unreflective projection and self-critical transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate assertion is that poets lie too much and that Zarathustra is weary of their superficiality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Lying is generated by lack of knowledge, poor learning, mixture, projection, and the need for spectators.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The critique withdraws from both belief in the speaker and an external judicial position, and thereby organizes a self-reflexive reframing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The body relativizes spirit and the “imperishable” into parables; the dissolution of the old poetic form is opened toward a future self-turning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from knowledge of the body and withdrawal of knowledge through the critique of poets to the possibility of their self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what positive criterion Zarathustra's own poetic speech can be distinguished from the criticized lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT3","text":"A tension arises between the refusal of grounding answers to why-questions and the determinate causal explanations of the mechanism of poetic lying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT4","text":"Knowledge of the body opens the critique, but provides no elaborated positive ontology of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT5","text":"The blanket condemnation of poets remains incompletely mediated with the recognition of pearls in them and with their possible inner transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT6","text":"The critique of parables and poetic surreptitious acquisitions itself takes place through parables of sea, peacock, buffalo, water, and composite animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT7","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the self-inclusion of the poet is understood as a transition from critique of others to self-examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDD0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, but remains dependent on the rhetorical force of the complexes of images and on a not fully explicated future of the penitent of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDD0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDD0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDD0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 54","title":"On Poets","context":"Chapter 54","original_title":"Von den Dichtern","original_context":"Chapter 54"},"original_title":"Von den Dichtern","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0","layer":"CH","title":"On Great Events","order":55,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VGE0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VGE0@R001","sha256":"e97f69088979b10c6187d0fecb2236193b94035dfadfe7ee3a846290dbb85bff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt ein spektakuläres Gerücht über Zarathustras Verschwinden gegen die Frage, ob Sichtbarkeit, Lärm und Angst historische Bedeutung anzeigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS2","text":"Die Figur des Feuerhundes wird als Modell einer vermeintlichen Tiefe entlarvt, deren Nahrung, Sprache und Wirkung von der Oberfläche stammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS3","text":"Das Argument trennt laute Umsturzereignisse von wirklichen geschichtlichen Ereignissen und bestimmt letztere als stille Verschiebungen der Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS4","text":"Es überträgt die Diagnose des Feuerhundes auf Umstürzer, Staat und Kirche, deren Macht durch Lärm, Darstellung und geglaubene Vorrangstellung funktioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS5","text":"Es bestimmt Zerstörung nicht als Aufhebung des Alten, sondern als mögliche Reaktivierung dessen, was zerstört werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS6","text":"Der Text kontrastiert den Feuerhund mit einer gold- und lachenserzeugenden Tiefe, bevor er in die unaufgelöste Frage nach dem Schatten und der „höchste[n] Zeit“ zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A1","text":"Die Erde besitzt eine verletzbare Oberfläche, auf der Mensch und Feuerhund als Krankheiten erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","text":"Der Feuerhund behauptet Tiefe, bezieht seine Nahrung jedoch von der Oberfläche und spricht daher „gesalzen, lügnerisch und flach“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","text":"Lärm, Rauch und Gebrüll sind kein Maßstab für die Größe eines Ereignisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A4","text":"Die Welt wird durch die Erfindung neuer Werte und nicht durch die Erfindung neuen Lärms bewegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","text":"Der Sturz eines verehrten Gegenstandes kann dessen Erneuerung und gesteigerte Wirksamkeit hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A6","text":"Kirche und Staat sind homologe Täuschungsformen, die durch Rauch, Gebrüll und den Anspruch auf Vorrang Glauben erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A7","text":"Eine wirkliche Tiefe erzeugt Gold und Lachen statt Asche, Rauch und heißen Schleim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX1","text":"Tiefe ist nicht durch vulkanische Gewalt, unterweltliche Herkunftsbehauptung oder laute Selbstanzeige ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX2","text":"Ein großes Ereignis ist nicht notwendig ein sichtbares, hörbares oder kollektiv erschreckendes Ereignis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX3","text":"Der Ruf nach „Freiheit“ ist nicht identisch mit Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX4","text":"Bildersturz ist nicht identisch mit Befreiung von dem Gestürzten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX5","text":"Kirche ist nicht eine vom Staat unabhängige geistliche Ordnung, und der Staat ist nicht von sich aus das wichtigste Wesen auf Erden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D1","text":"Laute politische oder soziale Erschütterung begründet innerhalb des Systems keinen Anspruch auf geschichtliche Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D2","text":"Geschichtliche Wirksamkeit wird an der Neubildung von Werten statt an der Intensität öffentlicher Erregung gemessen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D3","text":"Umsturz besitzt keine autonome schöpferische Kraft, sondern kann dem Umgestürzten neue Gestalt, Schönheit und Dauer verleihen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D4","text":"Die politische Vorrangstellung des Staates beruht auf performativer Selbstbehauptung und kollektivem Glauben, nicht auf einer ausgewiesenen Wesenspriorität.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D5","text":"Feuerhund, Umstürzer und Staat gehören derselben Oberflächenlogik an, sofern sie Wirkung durch Lärm, Verachtung und spektakuläre Geste erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D6","text":"Der positive Gegenbegriff zur oberflächlichen Umsturzgewalt ist keine friedliche Passivität, sondern eine andersartige, wertschaffende Produktivität der Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A4","CH_97E9_VGE0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD1","text":"Der Text verschiebt die primäre geschichtliche Kausalität von Ereignissen und Institutionen auf Prozesse der Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD2","text":"Staatliche Herrschaft und revolutionärer Umsturz erscheinen nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als potenziell homologe Formen öffentlicher Selbstinszenierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD3","text":"Die Zerstörung einer Ordnung kann deren Erneuerung bewirken; Opposition wird damit als möglicher Reproduktionsmechanismus der bekämpften Ordnung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD4","text":"Das wahrhaft Geschichtliche entzieht sich im Moment seines Geschehens den üblichen Kriterien öffentlicher Erkennbarkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Sichtbarkeit, Lautstärke und kollektive Aufregung keine verlässlichen Indikatoren für historische Größe sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass politische Befreiung nicht aus ihrer eigenen Benennung, ihrem Pathos oder ihrem Umsturzgestus folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass eine behauptete Herkunft aus der Tiefe ohne Prüfung ihrer materiellen und rhetorischen Herkunft als wahr gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Negation als solche eine Ordnung beendet; Negation kann deren Lebensfähigkeit steigern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass institutionelle Herrschaft und ihre lautstarke Gegnerschaft notwendig auf verschiedenen strukturellen Ebenen operieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX1","text":"Es gibt kein abschließendes öffentliches Zeichen, das ein Ereignis eindeutig als groß, tief oder geschichtlich ausweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX2","text":"Es gibt keinen endgültigen Bruch, sofern der Angriff auf eine Ordnung deren Wiederbelebung ermöglichen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX3","text":"Die verkündete „höchste Zeit“ erhält keine bestimmte Bedeutung; der Text organisiert sich um eine zeitliche Dringlichkeit, die er nicht auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS1","text":"Mythos der Unterwelt und spektakuläres Gerücht erzeugen den Anschein, dass Lärm und außerordentliche Erscheinung Tiefe bezeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS2","text":"Die Herkunftsprüfung des Feuerhundes führt von seiner behaupteten Tiefe zu seiner Abhängigkeit von der Oberfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS3","text":"Oberflächenabhängigkeit erzeugt die Diagnose: Lärm, Rauch und Freiheitsruf sind Formen einer lügnerischen Selbstinszenierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS4","text":"Die Diagnose erzeugt die Unterscheidung: laute Umsturzereignisse stehen gegen stille Wertschöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS5","text":"Die Unterscheidung wird auf Bildersturz, Kirche und Staat übertragen und macht deren Gegnerschaft als mögliche Reproduktion sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS6","text":"Der goldene Feuerhund setzt eine positive Figur wahrer Tiefe ein, ohne deren Verfahren der Wertschöpfung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS7","text":"Die Rückkehr zum Schatten schließt die Argumentation nicht ab, sondern lässt die zeitliche Forderung nach dem entscheidenden Ereignis offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF1","text":"Unterweltgerücht und fliegende Erscheinung → Zuschreibung außerordentlicher Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF2","text":"Feuerhund → Prüfung des behaupteten Ursprungs seiner Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF3","text":"Oberflächenabhängigkeit → Entlarvung von Rauch, Gebrüll und Freiheitsrhetorik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF4","text":"Entlarvung des Lärms → Trennung von großen Ereignissen und neuen Werten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite",