rozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME5","text":"Wertschöpfung wird als primärer Ort geschichtlicher Veränderung sichtbar, während Ereignisproduktion sekundär wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text verhandelt Feuerberg, Feuerhund, Schiffsgeschichte, Gerücht, Schatten und die Rückkehr Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text analysiert die Produktion von Glaubwürdigkeit durch Lärm, Sichtbarkeit, Angst, institutionellen Anspruch und kollektiven Glauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text entzieht Umsturz, Empörung und Freiheitsruf ihren automatischen Vorrang und verlegt transformative Praxis in die Schaffung neuer Werte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Erde erscheint als verletzbare Oberfläche mit verborgener Produktivität; wahre Ereignishaftigkeit wird still gedacht, während die „höchste Zeit“ unbestimmt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Bewegung von der Kritik des Lärms zur Vorrangstellung neuer Werte zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch neue Werte als gültig, schöpferisch oder von bloßer Neuerung unterschieden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT3","text":"Die positive Figur des goldenen Feuerhundes fungiert als Gegenbild, aber ihre produktive Mechanik wird nicht aus den vorherigen Prämissen abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste interne Verbindung liegt in der gemeinsamen Diagnose von Feuerhund, Umstürzer, Staat und Kirche als Formen oberflächlicher Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass der Text Umsturz als Reproduktionsmechanismus kritisiert, ihn den alters- und tugendschwachen Institutionen aber zugleich als Wiederbelebung empfiehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht dadurch, dass die Kritik öffentlicher Lärminszenierung selbst in einer stark performativen, polemischen Redeform vollzogen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Hauptbewegung, erklärt jedoch nicht abschließend, welche Bedeutung der Schatten und seine Verkündung der „höchste[n] Zeit“ für die Werttheorie besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195018053961Z_7e6253b8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Great Events","source_sha256":"e97f69088979b10c6187d0fecb2236193b94035dfadfe7ee3a846290dbb85bff","sha256":"13dbe11e0bf53fb0783121f01bb0cb75c0e7a38cb1b2888862c63281554e815a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:50:18.056524+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS1","text":"The text sets a spectacular rumor about Zarathustra's disappearance against the question of whether visibility, noise, and fear indicate historical significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS2","text":"The figure of the fire-dog is exposed as a model of an alleged depth whose nourishment, language, and effect originate from the surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS3","text":"The argument separates loud events of upheaval from genuine historical events and determines the latter as silent shifts in the order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS4","text":"It transfers the diagnosis of the fire-dog to revolutionaries, the state, and the church, whose power functions through noise, display, and believed precedence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS5","text":"It determines destruction not as the abolition of the old, but as a possible reactivation of what is to be destroyed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AS6","text":"The text contrasts the fire-dog with a gold- and laughter-producing depth before returning to the unresolved question of the shadow and the “höchste[n] Zeit”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A1","text":"The earth possesses a vulnerable surface upon which human beings and the fire-dog appear as diseases.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","text":"The fire-dog claims depth, but derives its nourishment from the surface and therefore speaks “gesalzen, lügnerisch und flach”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","text":"Noise, smoke, and roaring are not a measure of the greatness of an event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A4","text":"The world is moved by the invention of new values and not by the invention of new noise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","text":"The fall of a revered object can bring about its renewal and increased efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A6","text":"Church and state are homologous forms of deception that generate belief through smoke, roaring, and the claim to precedence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:A7","text":"A genuine depth produces gold and laughter rather than ashes, smoke, and hot slime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX1","text":"Depth is not attested by volcanic violence, a claimed underworld origin, or loud self-display.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX2","text":"A great event is not necessarily a visible, audible, or collectively terrifying event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX3","text":"The call for “Freiheit” is not identical with freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX4","text":"Iconoclasm is not identical with liberation from that which has been overthrown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:NX5","text":"Church is not a spiritual order independent of the state, and the state is not of itself the most important being on earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D1","text":"Loud political or social upheaval does not, within the system, establish a claim to historical depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D2","text":"Historical efficacy is measured by the formation of new values rather than by the intensity of public agitation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D3","text":"Upheaval possesses no autonomous creative force, but can confer new form, beauty, and duration upon what has been overthrown.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D4","text":"The political precedence of the state rests on performative self-assertion and collective belief, not on a demonstrated priority of essence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D5","text":"Fire-dog, revolutionary, and state belong to the same logic of the surface insofar as they generate effect through noise, contempt, and spectacular gesture.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:D6","text":"The positive counter-concept to superficial violence of upheaval is not peaceful passivity, but a different, value-creating productivity of depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A4","CH_97E9_VGE0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD1","text":"The text shifts primary historical causality from events and institutions to processes of value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD2","text":"State rule and revolutionary upheaval appear not as opposites, but as potentially homologous forms of public self-staging.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A2","CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD3","text":"The destruction of an order can effect its renewal; opposition thus becomes legible as a possible mechanism of reproduction of the order being fought.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A5","CH_97E9_VGE0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SD4","text":"The truly historical eludes the customary criteria of public recognizability at the moment of its occurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VGE0:A3","CH_97E9_VGE0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that visibility, loudness, and collective excitement are not reliable indicators of historical greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes that political liberation does not follow from its own naming, its pathos, or its gesture of upheaval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that a claimed origin in depth can count as true without examination of its material and rhetorical origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility that negation as such terminates an order; negation can increase its viability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that institutional rule and its vociferous opposition necessarily operate on different structural levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX1","text":"There is no conclusive public sign that unequivocally attests an event as great, deep, or historical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX2","text":"There is no final rupture insofar as the attack on an order can make its revival possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:SNX3","text":"The proclaimed “höchste Zeit” receives no determinate meaning; the text organizes itself around a temporal urgency that it does not resolve.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS1","text":"Myth of the underworld and spectacular rumor produce the appearance that noise and extraordinary manifestation attest depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS2","text":"The examination of the fire-dog's origin leads from its claimed depth to its dependence on the surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS3","text":"Dependence on the surface produces the diagnosis: noise, smoke, and the call for freedom are forms of mendacious self-staging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS4","text":"The diagnosis produces the distinction: loud events of upheaval stand against silent value-creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS5","text":"The distinction is transferred to iconoclasm, church, and state and renders their antagonism visible as possible reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS6","text":"The golden fire-dog introduces a positive figure of true depth without determining its procedures of value-creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:FGS7","text":"The return to the shadow does not conclude the argument, but leaves open the temporal demand for the decisive event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF1","text":"Underworld rumor and flying apparition → attribution of extraordinary significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF2","text":"Fire-dog → examination of the claimed origin of its power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF3","text":"Dependence on the surface → exposure of smoke, roaring, and rhetoric of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF4","text":"Exposure of noise → separation of great events and new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF5","text":"Separation of event and value → reclassification of upheaval as possible regeneration of the old.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF6","text":"Reclassification of upheaval → homology of fire-dog, state, and church.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:AF7","text":"Counter-image of golden depth → open return to the indeterminate “höchste[n] Zeit”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME1","text":"The conceptual pair deep/superficial is shifted from spatial location to origin, mode of speech, and form of effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME2","text":"The opposition great/small is replaced by the opposition loud/silent and subsequently revalued in favor of the silent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME3","text":"Revolutionary destruction becomes visible no longer as the counterpole of the existing order, but as a possible mechanism of its renewal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME4","text":"State and church are mapped as variants of the same rhetorical-performative form of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ME5","text":"Value-creation becomes visible as the primary locus of historical change, while event-production becomes secondary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text deals with volcano, fire-dog, ship story, rumor, shadow, and Zarathustra's return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text analyzes the production of credibility through noise, visibility, fear, institutional claim, and collective belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text deprives upheaval, indignation, and the call for freedom of their automatic precedence and relocates transformative practice to the creation of new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The earth appears as a vulnerable surface with hidden productivity; true eventfulness is conceived silently, while the “höchste Zeit” remains indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central movement from the critique of noise to the precedence of new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how new values are distinguished as valid, creative, or from mere novelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT3","text":"The positive figure of the golden fire-dog functions as a counter-image, but its productive mechanics are not derived from the preceding premises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT4","text":"The strongest internal connection lies in the shared diagnosis of fire-dog, revolutionary, state, and church as forms of superficial efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that the text criticizes upheaval as a mechanism of reproduction, yet at the same time recommends it to institutions weak in age and virtue as revival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that the critique of public staging through noise is itself carried out in a strongly performative, polemical mode of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VGE0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VGE0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the principal argumentative movement, but does not conclusively explain what significance the shadow and its proclamation of the “höchste[n] Zeit” possess for the theory of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VGE0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VGE0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 55","title":"On Great Events","context":"Chapter 55","original_title":"Von grossen Ereignissen","original_context":"Chapter 55"},"original_title":"Von grossen Ereignissen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW","layer":"CH","title":"The Soothsayer","order":56,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DERW"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERW@R001","sha256":"6651453bf0d97c3b3b7dd580fa9291e6b6bf38b3eb4f8225044a404f7e1c29b7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS1","text":"Die Weissagung behauptet eine kollektive Erschöpfung, in der Arbeit, Fruchtbarkeit, Zukunft und selbst der Tod ihre tragende Bedeutung verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS2","text":"Die prophetische Formel wirkt nicht bloß beschreibend, sondern affektiv ansteckend und verwandelt Zarathustra in einen der von ihr Erfassten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS3","text":"Der Traum verdichtet diese Erfassung zur Todesburg, in der Leben nur als besiegtes, konserviertes und verschlossenes Objekt erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS4","text":"Der Einbruch des Windes und des vielfachen Gelächters zerstört die Geschlossenheit der Todesordnung nicht argumentativ, sondern als unkontrollierbare Wiederkehr lebendiger Vielheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS5","text":"Der Jünger deutet die Traumgewalt als Zarathustras persönliche Sendung gegen Todesmüdigkeit und als Garantie einer künftigen Lebensmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS6","text":"Zarathustra beantwortet die Weissagung durch Mahlzeit, Aufnahme des Wahrsagers und das Versprechen eines Meeres, ohne die Deutung des Jüngers ausdrücklich zu bestätigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A1","text":"Die Weissagung setzt Leere, Gleichheit und Vergangenheitsform als Totalurteil über menschliche Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A2","text":"Das Totalurteil entwertet Arbeit und Ertrag, indem es deren Produkte als verdorben und ihre Voraussetzungen als vergiftet erscheinen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A3","text":"Die Todesmüdigkeit ist keine Ruhe, sondern ein Fortleben ohne lebbaren Horizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A4","text":"Die Weissagung gewinnt Macht, indem sie sich wiederholt, räumlich verbreitet und als kollektive Stimme erklingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A5","text":"Zarathustra ist gegen die affektive Macht des Nihilismus nicht immun und muss dessen Form zunächst selbst durchlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A6","text":"Die Todesordnung bewahrt Leben als besiegtes Zeichen und hält es dadurch in einem geschlossenen Archiv fest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A7","text":"Die Unterbrechung der Todesordnung erscheint als Wind, Öffnung, Zerbrechen und Gelächter, nicht als Widerlegung einer These.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A8","text":"Die Deutung des Jüngers verwandelt das Traumgeschehen in eine Identitätserzählung, in der Zarathustra selbst die Gegenmacht zur Todesmüdigkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A9","text":"Die Schlussgeste ersetzt die absolute Gegenprophezeiung durch eine konkrete, geteilte und noch nicht abschließend erklärte Praxis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A10","text":"Zarathustras Kopfschütteln entzieht der heroischen Traumdeutung des Jüngers die eindeutige Autorisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX1","text":"Die Weissagung definiert sich gegen jede Annahme, dass Arbeit, Ernte und vergangene Leistung aus sich selbst Sinn sichern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX2","text":"Todesmüdigkeit ist nicht Tod, weil sie gerade den Eintritt in einen endgültigen Untergang verfehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX3","text":"Die ersehnte Tiefe ist nicht verfügbar, solange selbst das Meer zurückweicht und kein Ort des Untergangs offensteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX4","text":"Das Traumzeichen ist nicht unmittelbar transparent, weil sein Sinn verborgen, eingefangen und deutungsbedürftig bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX5","text":"Die Gegenmacht zum Grab ist nicht stille Erhabenheit, sondern Lärm, Vielheit, Lächerlichkeit und kindliche Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX6","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht einfach der souveräne Retter, den die Jüngerdeutung aus ihm macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D1","text":"Das Totalurteil wird zur sozialen Realität, weil seine Wiederholung Erschöpfung als gemeinsame Weltlage organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D2","text":"Zarathustras Krise widerlegt die Vorstellung, dass die Gegenfigur des Nihilismus außerhalb seiner Ansteckung steht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A4","CH_97E9_DERW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D3","text":"Die Todesburg übersetzt die prophetische Formel in eine Bildordnung, in der Leben nur noch als abgeschlossenes Vergangenes vorkommt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D4","text":"Das Gelächter wirkt als Gegenereignis, weil es die Bewachung und Archivierung des Lebens durch eine nicht einschließbare Lebensvielfalt unterbricht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A6","CH_97E9_DERW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D5","text":"Die Jüngerdeutung stabilisiert die Krise durch Personalisierung, indem sie die diffuse Lebensmacht in Zarathustras garantierende Identität überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D6","text":"Die Schlussgeste entkräftet die Jüngerdeutung nicht durch Gegenlehre, sondern durch eine Handlung, die die prophetische Bildwelt praktisch umkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A2","CH_97E9_DERW:A9","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D7","text":"Das versprochene Meer beantwortet die Klage über die fehlende Tiefe, ohne die Möglichkeit des Untergangs als Endziel zu bestätigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD1","text":"Nihilismus erscheint als selbstverstärkende Maschine: Totalurteil erzeugt Erschöpfung, Erschöpfung bestätigt das Totalurteil, und die Bestätigung erweitert dessen soziale Reichweite.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A2","CH_97E9_DERW:A4","CH_97E9_DERW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD2","text":"Die Todesordnung kann nur herrschen, indem sie Leben bewahrt; ihre Archive enthalten daher zugleich das Material ihrer eigenen Störung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A6","CH_97E9_DERW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD3","text":"Die Gegenbewegung zum Nihilismus ist nicht reine Negation des Negativen, sondern die Wiederherstellung von Teilbarkeit, Nahrung, Nähe und Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD4","text":"Der Text trennt Lebensmacht von der verfügbaren Selbstbeschreibung eines einzelnen Lebensführers.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A8","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD5","text":"Die Zukunft bleibt nur offen, wenn sie weder durch die Weissagung der Erschöpfung noch durch die Garantie des Jüngers endgültig festgelegt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A8","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass Erschöpfung eine ontologische Wahrheit über das Sein des Lebens enthüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass Tod als endgültige Ruhe oder als erreichbarer Abschluss verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass ein symbolisches Ereignis seine eigene verbindliche Deutung mitliefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass eine einzelne Figur die Gegenmacht zum Nihilismus vollständig verkörpern und garantieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass der Wahrsager nur äußerer Gegner bleibt; die Schlussgeste bindet ihn in die Gegenhandlung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX1","text":"Verworfen wird die Möglichkeit eines reinen Außenstandpunkts, von dem aus die Todesmüdigkeit folgenlos beobachtet oder bloß widerlegt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX2","text":"Verworfen wird die Schließung des Lebens in Vergangenheit, Grab, Archiv oder endgültige Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX3","text":"Verworfen wird eine Zukunft, die durch prophetische Verheißung oder charismatische Bürgschaft bereits gesichert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS1","text":"Totalurteil über Leere und Vergangenheitsförmigkeit → Entwertung von Werk, Ertrag und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS2","text":"Wiederholung des Totalurteils → kollektive Affektansteckung → Zarathustras Einbezug in die Todesmüdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS3","text":"Affektive Krise → Schlaf und Traum → räumliche Verdichtung des Nihilismus als bewachtes Archiv besiegten Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS4","text":"Öffnung des Archivs → Wind, Sargbruch und Gelächter → Sichtbarwerden einer nicht archivierten Lebensvielfalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS5","text":"Jüngerdeutung → Personalisierung der Lebensmacht → Anspruch auf Zukunftsgarantie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS6","text":"Zarathustras Vorbehalt → Mahlzeit, Aufnahme des Wahrsagers und Meerbild → praktische Gegenfiguration ohne endgültige Auslegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF1","text":"Kollektive Erschöpfungsprophezeiung → affektive Ansteckung Zarathustras → Verlust von Sprache, Nahrung und Ruhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF2","text":"Traum der Todesbewachung → gewaltsame Öffnung des Grabarchivs → Gelächter als Wiederkehr des eingesperrten Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF3","text":"Heroische Auslegung durch den Jünger → Zarathustras stiller Vorbehalt → Mahlzeit und Meer als nichtdoktrinäre Gegenbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME1","text":"Nihilismus wird von einer individuellen Überzeugung zu einer kollektiven Infrastruktur aus Wiederholung, Affekt und entwerteter Zeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME2","text":"Der Tod wird von einem Endpunkt zu einer erschöpften Fortsetzung ohne Tiefe und ohne Abschluss umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME3","text":"Das Grab wird nicht als bloßer Ort des Verfalls, sondern als Institution der Konservierung und Besiegung von Leben sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME4","text":"Lachen wird von einer Reaktion zu einer zerstörenden und befreienden Kraft gegen die Geschlossenheit der Todesordnung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME5","text":"Der Gegner wird von einer auszuschließenden Person zu einem in die Gegenhandlung einzubeziehenden Träger der Krise umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME6","text":"Der Jünger erscheint zugleich als Helfer der Deutung und als Produzent einer unzulässigen charismatischen Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Wahrsager verkündet allgemeine Erschöpfung; Zarathustra erkrankt an ihr, träumt, erwacht und ordnet eine Mahlzeit an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Weissagung fungiert als Reproduktionsmechanismus, der durch Wiederholung Wahrnehmung, Affekt und soziale Zeit in eine Todesordnung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verlagert die Gegenwehr von der Widerlegung einer Doktrin zu einer Unterbrechung ihrer affektiven und symbolischen Infrastruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Leben erscheint nicht als gesicherte Substanz, sondern als unverfügbare Wiederkehr, deren Zukunft weder im Vergangenen noch in einer Retterfigur aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von prophetischer Totalisierung über Ansteckung und Traum bis zur praktischen Gegenfigur zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was das versprochene Meer positiv bezeichnet; der Text liefert eine Gegenfigur zur flachen, versiegten Welt, keine ausgearbeitete Lehre der Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Verbindung von Wiederholung, Erschöpfung, Grabarchiv und störendem Gelächter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Umkehrung der Todesordnung aus ihrem eigenen Material: Das konservierte Leben wird zur Quelle des Bruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur bleibt auf komprimierte Bildlogik angewiesen, weil weder die Ursache der prophetischen Macht noch der Status des Gelächters begrifflich ausgeführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der vom Jünger behaupteten Garantie durch Zarathustra und Zarathustras nicht erläutertem Vorbehalt gegen diese Personalisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193256551884Z_5f246c52","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Soothsayer","source_sha256":"6651453bf0d97c3b3b7dd580fa9291e6b6bf38b3eb4f8225044a404f7e1c29b7","sha256":"df3b1cdd27ad12ac844a4bef6e1bb1457f4b0ae88906f8cdb82dc50decae836d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:32:56.554186+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS1","text":"The prophecy asserts a collective exhaustion in which work, fertility, the future, and even death lose their sustaining significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS2","text":"The prophetic formula operates not merely descriptively but affectively contagiously, transforming Zarathustra into one of those seized by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS3","text":"The dream condenses this seizure into the castle of death, in which life appears only as a defeated, preserved, and enclosed object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS4","text":"The irruption of the wind and the manifold laughter destroys the closure of the order of death not argumentatively, but as an uncontrollable return of living multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS5","text":"The disciple interprets the dream's violence as Zarathustra's personal mission against weariness of death and as the guarantee of a future power of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AS6","text":"Zarathustra answers the prophecy through a meal, the reception of the soothsayer, and the promise of a sea, without explicitly affirming the disciple's interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A1","text":"The prophecy posits emptiness, equality, and pastness as a total judgment upon human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A2","text":"The total judgment devalues work and yield by making their products appear corrupted and their preconditions poisoned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A3","text":"Weariness of death is not rest, but a continued living without a livable horizon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A4","text":"The prophecy gains power by repeating itself, spreading spatially, and sounding as a collective voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A5","text":"Zarathustra is not immune to the affective power of nihilism and must first undergo its form himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A6","text":"The order of death preserves life as a defeated sign and thereby holds it fast in a closed archive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A7","text":"The interruption of the order of death appears as wind, opening, breaking, and laughter, not as the refutation of a thesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A8","text":"The disciple's interpretation transforms the dream event into a narrative of identity in which Zarathustra himself is the counterforce to weariness of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A9","text":"The concluding gesture replaces absolute counter-prophecy with a concrete, shared, and not yet conclusively explained practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:A10","text":"Zarathustra's shaking of his head withdraws unequivocal authorization from the disciple's heroic dream interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX1","text":"The prophecy defines itself against every assumption that work, harvest, and past achievement secure meaning of themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX2","text":"Weariness of death is not death, because it precisely fails to enter into a final downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX3","text":"The longed-for depth is not available so long as even the sea recedes and no place of downfall stands open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX4","text":"The dream sign is not immediately transparent, because its meaning remains hidden, captured, and in need of interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX5","text":"The counterforce to the grave is not silent sublimity, but noise, multiplicity, ridiculousness, and childlike appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:NX6","text":"Zarathustra is not simply the sovereign savior that the disciple's interpretation makes him out to be.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D1","text":"The total judgment becomes social reality because its repetition organizes exhaustion as a shared condition of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D2","text":"Zarathustra's crisis refutes the notion that the counterfigure to nihilism stands outside its contagion.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A4","CH_97E9_DERW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D3","text":"The castle of death translates the prophetic formula into an order of images in which life occurs only as a completed past.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D4","text":"Laughter operates as a counter-event because it interrupts the guarding and archiving of life through a diversity of life that cannot be enclosed.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A6","CH_97E9_DERW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D5","text":"The disciple's interpretation stabilizes the crisis through personalization, by transferring diffuse life-power into Zarathustra's guaranteeing identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D6","text":"The concluding gesture does not invalidate the disciple's interpretation through counter-doctrine, but through an action that practically reverses the prophetic world of images.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A2","CH_97E9_DERW:A9","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:D7","text":"The promised sea answers the complaint about the lack of depth without affirming the possibility of downfall as the final goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD1","text":"Nihilism appears as a self-reinforcing machine: total judgment produces exhaustion, exhaustion confirms total judgment, and confirmation extends its social reach.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A2","CH_97E9_DERW:A4","CH_97E9_DERW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD2","text":"The order of death can rule only by preserving life; its archives therefore simultaneously contain the material of their own disruption.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A6","CH_97E9_DERW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD3","text":"The counter-movement to nihilism is not the pure negation of the negative, but the restoration of shareability, nourishment, proximity, and depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A3","CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD4","text":"The text separates life-power from the available self-description of an individual guide of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A7","CH_97E9_DERW:A8","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SD5","text":"The future remains open only if it is not definitively determined either by the prophecy of exhaustion or by the disciple's guarantee.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERW:A1","CH_97E9_DERW:A8","CH_97E9_DERW:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that exhaustion reveals an ontological truth about the being of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that death is available as final rest or as an attainable completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility that a symbolic event supplies its own binding interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility that a single figure can fully embody and guarantee the counterforce to nihilism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the soothsayer remains merely an external opponent; the concluding gesture incorporates him into the counter-action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX1","text":"Rejected is the possibility of a pure external standpoint from which weariness of death could be observed without consequence or merely refuted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX2","text":"Rejected is the closure of life within the past, the grave, the archive, or final explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:SNX3","text":"Rejected is a future that would already be secured by prophetic promise or charismatic surety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS1","text":"Total judgment concerning emptiness and pastness → devaluation of work, yield, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS2","text":"Repetition of the total judgment → collective affective contagion → Zarathustra's inclusion in weariness of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS3","text":"Affective crisis → sleep and dream → spatial condensation of nihilism as a guarded archive of defeated life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS4","text":"Opening of the archive → wind, coffin-breaking, and laughter → becoming visible of a diversity of life not archived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS5","text":"Disciple's interpretation → personalization of life-power → claim to a guarantee of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:FGS6","text":"Zarathustra's reservation → meal, reception of the soothsayer, and image of the sea → practical counterfiguration without final interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF1","text":"Prophecy of collective exhaustion → Zarathustra's affective contagion → loss of language, nourishment, and rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF2","text":"Dream of the guarding of death → violent opening of the grave archive → laughter as the return of imprisoned life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:AF3","text":"Heroic interpretation by the disciple → Zarathustra's silent reservation → meal and sea as a non-doctrinal counter-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME1","text":"Nihilism is remapped from an individual conviction into a collective infrastructure of repetition, affect, and devalued time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME2","text":"Death is reclassified from an endpoint into an exhausted continuation without depth and without completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME3","text":"The grave becomes visible not as a mere site of decay, but as an institution of the preservation and defeat of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME4","text":"Laughter is remapped from a reaction into a destructive and liberating force against the closure of the order of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME5","text":"The opponent is reclassified from a person to be excluded into a bearer of the crisis to be included in the counter-action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ME6","text":"The disciple appears at once as an aid to interpretation and as the producer of an impermissible charismatic closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT1","text":"Surface — A soothsayer proclaims universal exhaustion; Zarathustra falls ill from it, dreams, awakens, and orders a meal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT2","text":"Structural — The prophecy functions as a mechanism of reproduction that, through repetition, transfers perception, affect, and social time into an order of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts resistance from the refutation of a doctrine to an interruption of its affective and symbolic infrastructure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Life appears not as a secured substance, but as an unavailable return whose future is exhausted neither in the past nor in a savior figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from prophetic totalization through contagion and dream to the practical counterfigure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT2","text":"What the promised sea positively signifies remains underdetermined; the text provides a counterfigure to the flat, dried-up world, not an elaborated doctrine of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT3","text":"The connection of repetition, exhaustion, grave archive, and disruptive laughter is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the reversal of the order of death out of its own material: preserved life becomes the source of rupture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT5","text":"The structure remains dependent on compressed image-logic because neither the cause of prophetic power nor the status of laughter is conceptually elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERW:MRT6","text":"The central fault line lies between the guarantee through Zarathustra claimed by the disciple and Zarathustra's unexplained reservation against this personalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERW:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DERW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 56","title":"The Soothsayer","context":"Chapter 56","original_title":"Der Wahrsager","original_context":"Chapter 56"},"original_title":"Der Wahrsager","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES","layer":"CH","title":"On Redemption","order":57,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDES"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDES@R001","sha256":"f087b70df0ef94abcce509b8c78cff6a376ccf038e3a1788f7365dbfab841823","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS1","text":"Die sichtbare körperliche Versehrtheit wird als unzureichendes Modell menschlicher Versehrtheit zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS2","text":"Der Mensch erscheint als zeitlich zerstreute, unvollständige und zufallsförmige Existenz, nicht als gegenwärtig ganze Person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS3","text":"Erlösung wird als schöpferische Zusammenfügung des Zerstreuten und Umwertung des Vergangenen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS4","text":"Der Wille ist notwendig als Befreier, aber durch die Unwiderruflichkeit des Vergangenen selbst gefangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS5","text":"Die Ohnmacht des Willens gegenüber dem „Es war“ erzeugt Rache, Strafe, Schuld und eine feindliche Deutung der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS6","text":"Die Erlösung verlangt eine noch nicht vollzogene Umformung des Willens zum schöpferischen Bejahen und Zurückwollen der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A1","text":"Menschliche Versehrtheit besteht nicht primär im Verlust einzelner Fähigkeiten, sondern in einer deformierenden Verteilung von Mangel und Übermaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A2","text":"Ein isoliert hypertrophiertes Vermögen erzeugt keinen höheren Menschen, sondern einen umgekehrten Krüppel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A3","text":"Der gegenwärtige Mensch ist keine geschlossene Einheit, sondern ein zerstreutes Fragment einer noch ausstehenden Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A4","text":"Die Zukunft ist nur als Gegenstand sehender, wollender und schaffender Tätigkeit zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A5","text":"Erlösung besteht darin, Bruchstück, Rätsel und Zufall in eine geschaffene Einheit zu überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A6","text":"Der Wille befreit, sofern er Zukunft schaffen und wollen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A7","text":"Der Wille ist gegenüber dem vollzogenen Vergangenen ohnmächtig, weil er die Zeit nicht rückgängig machen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A8","text":"Die Ohnmacht gegenüber dem Vergangenen verwandelt den befreienden Willen in einen rächenden und leidvermehrenden Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A9","text":"Strafe und Schuld sind ideologische Formen, in denen die Rache des Willens sich als Gerechtigkeit legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A10","text":"Der schaffende Wille muss das Vergangene nicht vernichten, sondern es als gewollt und weiter zu wollend aneignen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A11","text":"Der Wille zur Macht verlangt mehr als Versöhnung mit der Zeit: eine bejahende Beziehung zum Unwiderruflichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX1","text":"Erlösung ist nicht die medizinische oder soziale Korrektur sichtbarer Behinderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX2","text":"Menschliche Ganzheit ist nicht durch die Steigerung eines einzelnen Vermögens erreichbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX3","text":"Genie ist nicht identisch mit Größe, sofern Größe durch einseitige Hypertrophie erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX4","text":"Erlösung ist nicht die Auslöschung vergangener Taten durch Strafe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX5","text":"Gerechtigkeit ist nicht das zeitliche Gesetz einer notwendigen Wiederkehr von Tat, Schuld und Strafe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX6","text":"Befreiung ist nicht Nicht-Wollen, Selbstaufhebung des Willens oder Flucht aus der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX7","text":"Versöhnung mit der Zeit genügt nicht, sofern sie das Vergangene lediglich hinnimmt statt es schöpferisch zu bejahen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D1","text":"Körperliche Unversehrtheit kann die Grundversehrtheit des Menschen nicht beheben, weil diese in zeitlicher Zerstreuung und einseitiger Deformation liegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A1","CH_97E9_VDES:A2","CH_97E9_VDES:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D2","text":"Die Zukunft fungiert als Maßstab, von dem aus die Gegenwart als unvollständig und der Mensch als noch nicht zusammengesetzt erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A3","CH_97E9_VDES:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D3","text":"Schöpferisches Wollen muss eine retrospektive Operation leisten, weil es Erlösung nur durch eine neue Stellung zum Gewesenen vollziehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A5","CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D4","text":"Die Strafmoral kompensiert nicht vergangenes Leiden, sondern reproduziert die Ohnmacht des Willens in einer moralischen Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A8","CH_97E9_VDES:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D5","text":"Der Wille kann nur dann Erlöser sein, wenn seine Befreiungsfunktion gegen seine eigene zeitliche Gefangenschaft durchgesetzt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A6","CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D6","text":"Die Lehre endet nicht mit einer vollendeten Erlösung, sondern mit der offenen Frage nach ihrer Ermöglichung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD1","text":"Die zentrale Versehrtheit des Menschen wird von der organischen auf die zeitlich-ontologische Ebene verschoben: Der Mensch leidet an seiner Nichtidentität mit seinem Gewesensein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A1","CH_97E9_VDES:A3","CH_97E9_VDES:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD2","text":"Moralische Vergeltungsordnungen erscheinen als sekundäre Rationalisierungen eines primären Affekts gegen die Irreversibilität der Zeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A8","CH_97E9_VDES:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD3","text":"Der schaffende Wille wird zur Instanz, die Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft nicht zeitlich aufhebt, sondern in einer bejahenden Willensform zusammenschließt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A4","CH_97E9_VDES:A5","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD4","text":"Der Wille zur Macht ist kein bloßes Zukunftswollen, weil seine höchste Probe in der rückwirkenden Bejahung des Unabänderlichen liegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD5","text":"Die Erlösungslehre wird als Aufgabe exponiert, deren normative Gestalt formuliert ist, deren Vollzugsmechanismus jedoch ausgesetzt bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX1","text":"Eine unveränderliche Vergangenheit darf nicht als hinreichender Grund für Schuld, Strafe oder nihilistische Weltverneinung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX2","text":"Menschliche Einheit darf nicht als ursprüngliche, vorgefundene oder natürlich wiederherstellbare Ganzheit vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX3","text":"Die Befreiung des Willens darf nicht als souveräne Ausgangslage angenommen werden, weil der Wille selbst durch Zeitlichkeit bestimmt und beschädigt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX4","text":"Das Vergangene darf weder durch Vergessen noch durch eine moralische Abrechnung neutralisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX5","text":"Die Überwindung der Rache darf nicht in asketischer Willensverneinung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX1","text":"Eine Erlösung außerhalb der Zeit wird als unzulässig ausgeschlossen; Erlösung kann nur die Stellung zum Zeitlichen transformieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX2","text":"Eine endgültige Trennung von Schöpfung und Vergangenheit wird ausgeschlossen; jedes zukünftige Schaffen bleibt an das „Es war“ gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX3","text":"Eine vollständig gegebene Lehre der Erlösung bleibt abwesend, weil die Instanz des Zurückwollens angerufen, aber nicht gelehrt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX4","text":"Eine undifferenzierte öffentliche Sprache der Lehre wird ausgeschlossen, weil die abschließende Szene Redeweisen nach Adressaten, Schülern und Selbstbezug trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS1","text":"Sichtbare Versehrtheit → Kritik der Heilungslogik → Verschiebung von körperlichem Mangel zu deformierender Einseitigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS2","text":"Einseitigkeit und Zerstreuung → Diagnose des Menschen als Fragment → Zukunft als Maß der gegenwärtigen Unvollständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS3","text":"Fragmentierte Zeitlichkeit → Forderung nach schöpferischer Sammlung → Erlösung als Umwertung des „Es war“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS4","text":"Unwiderruflichkeit des Vergangenen → Ohnmacht des Willens → Rache → Strafe, Schuld und zeitfeindliche Metaphysik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS5","text":"Verwerfung von Rache und Nicht-Wollen → schaffender Wille → Bejahung des Vergangenen als gewollt und weiter zu wollend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS6","text":"Wille zur Macht → Forderung des Zurückwollens → offene Unterbrechung, weil die Erzeugung dieser Willensform ungeklärt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS7","text":"Unterbrechung der Lehre → Wechsel der Redeebene → Sichtbarwerden der Differenz zwischen exoterischer, didaktischer und selbstbezüglicher Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF1","text":"Körperlicher Krüppel **→** umgekehrter Krüppel **→** Mensch als zeitliches Fragment **→** Erlösung als schöpferische Sammlung **→** Wille als Befreier und Gefangener **→** Rache als Strafmoral **→** Zurückwollen als offene Endforderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF2","text":"Sichtbare Heilung **→** Verwerfung bloßer Korrektur **→** Diagnose der Zeitkrankheit **→** Umwertung des Vergangenen **→** Unterbrechung vor dem Vollzug der Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF3","text":"Öffentliche Antwort an Krüppel **→** esoterische Rede an Jünger **→** Selbstbefragung Zarathustras **→** problematisierte Einheit der Lehre und ihrer Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME1","text":"Behinderung wird von einer lokalen Defizienz zu einer allgemeinen Figur deformierter Menschlichkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME2","text":"Größe, Genie und Spezialisierung werden von Zeichen der Erhöhung zu möglichen Symptomen struktureller Verstümmelung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME3","text":"Schuld und Strafe werden von moralischen Grundkategorien zu Affekttechniken eines gegen die Zeit ressentimentgeladenen Willens umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME4","text":"Erlösung wird von Wiedergutmachung oder Vergebung zu einer schöpferischen Aneignung des Unwiderruflichen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME5","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als bloß späterer Zeitpunkt, sondern als Perspektive sichtbar, aus der Gegenwart und Vergangenheit neu organisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME6","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Befreiung und Gefangenschaft wird internalisiert: Der Wille ist zugleich Quelle der Erlösung und Quelle der Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME7","text":"Lehre erscheint nicht als einheitlich übertragbarer Inhalt, sondern als nach Adressat und Reflexionsstufe gespaltene Redeordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Rede behandelt Krüppel, Bettler, körperliche Heilung, menschliche Fragmente und die Frage nach Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text rekonstruiert eine Kette von zeitlicher Ohnmacht über Rache zu Strafmoral, Schuld und nihilistischer Weltdeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt Korrektur, Vergeltung und Versöhnung durch eine Praxis schöpferischer Umwertung des Vergangenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zeit ist als irreversibles Geschehen bestimmt, an dem der Wille scheitert, das er aber bejahend umformen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT5","text":"Discursive — Die abschließende Rahmenszene zeigt, dass die Lehre selbst zwischen öffentlicher Rede, Schülerrede und Selbstrede nicht identisch bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Versehrtheitsdiagnose über Zeitkritik zur Forderung eines schöpferischen Zurückwollens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der positive Mechanismus, durch den der gefangene Wille seine eigene zeitliche Ohnmacht tatsächlich überwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Erlösung als Veränderung der Stellung zum Vergangenen und nicht als Veränderung vergangener Tatsachen verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung des Systems liegt in der Ableitung von Schuld und Strafe aus der Rache gegen die Irreversibilität der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT5","text":"Die Hauptbruchlinie liegt zwischen der schöpferischen Allmacht, die der Wille beanspruchen soll, und seiner ausdrücklich behaupteten Ohnmacht gegenüber dem „Es war“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT6","text":"Die Forderung, Vergangenes als gewollt zu bejahen, kann die Vergangenheit semantisch umwerten, ohne ihre faktische Unabänderlichkeit aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT7","text":"Die Einführung des Willens zur Macht steigert die Forderung über Versöhnung hinaus, begründet aber nicht, wie diese Steigerung hervorgebracht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT8","text":"Die Schlussdialogik konserviert eine weitere Spannung: Die Lehre verlangt höchste Selbstüberwindung, wird jedoch in unterschiedlich codierte Redeweisen für verschiedene Adressaten aufgeteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194118378979Z_b10accdf","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Redemption","source_sha256":"f087b70df0ef94abcce509b8c78cff6a376ccf038e3a1788f7365dbfab841823","sha256":"cae4e14b61a0c612516a05eff6c47e4dab2c9f1601b000758101a48473df110f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:41:18.380016+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS1","text":"Visible bodily impairment is rejected as an inadequate model of human impairment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS2","text":"The human being appears as a temporally dispersed, incomplete, and contingent existence, not as a presently whole person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS3","text":"Redemption is determined as the creative assemblage of what is dispersed and the revaluation of what is past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS4","text":"The will is necessary as liberator, but is itself captive through the irrevocability of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS5","text":"The will's powerlessness before the “It was” produces revenge, punishment, guilt, and a hostile interpretation of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AS6","text":"Redemption demands a not-yet-accomplished transformation of the will into creative affirmation and the willing-back of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A1","text":"Human impairment consists not primarily in the loss of individual capacities, but in a deforming distribution of deficiency and excess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A2","text":"An isolated hypertrophied capacity produces not a higher human being, but an inverted cripple.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A3","text":"The present human being is not a closed unity, but a dispersed fragment of a future still outstanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A4","text":"The future is accessible only as the object of seeing, willing, and creating activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A5","text":"Redemption consists in transferring fragment, riddle, and chance into a created unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A6","text":"The will liberates insofar as it can create and will the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A7","text":"The will is powerless before the accomplished past because it cannot reverse time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A8","text":"Powerlessness before the past transforms the liberating will into an avenging and suffering-augmenting will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A9","text":"Punishment and guilt are ideological forms in which the will's revenge legitimates itself as justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A10","text":"The creating will must not destroy the past, but appropriate it as willed and as still to be willed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:A11","text":"The will to power demands more than reconciliation with time: an affirmative relation to the irrevocable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX1","text":"Redemption is not the medical or social correction of visible disability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX2","text":"Human wholeness cannot be attained through the augmentation of a single capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX3","text":"Genius is not identical with greatness insofar as greatness is produced through one-sided hypertrophy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX4","text":"Redemption is not the erasure of past deeds through punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX5","text":"Justice is not the temporal law of a necessary recurrence of deed, guilt, and punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX6","text":"Liberation is not non-willing, the self-annulment of the will, or flight from time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:NX7","text":"Reconciliation with time does not suffice insofar as it merely accepts the past instead of affirming it creatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D1","text":"Bodily intactness cannot remedy the human being's fundamental impairment, because this lies in temporal dispersion and one-sided deformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A1","CH_97E9_VDES:A2","CH_97E9_VDES:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D2","text":"The future functions as the standard from which the present appears incomplete and the human being as not yet assembled.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A3","CH_97E9_VDES:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D3","text":"Creative willing must perform a retrospective operation because it can accomplish redemption only through a new relation to what has been.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A5","CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D4","text":"Punitive morality does not compensate for past suffering, but reproduces the will's powerlessness in a moral form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A8","CH_97E9_VDES:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D5","text":"The will can be redeemer only if its liberating function is asserted against its own temporal captivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A6","CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:D6","text":"The doctrine ends not with an accomplished redemption, but with the open question of its possibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD1","text":"The human being's central impairment is shifted from the organic to the temporal-ontological level: the human being suffers from non-identity with its having-been.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A1","CH_97E9_VDES:A3","CH_97E9_VDES:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD2","text":"Moral orders of retribution appear as secondary rationalizations of a primary affect against the irreversibility of time.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A8","CH_97E9_VDES:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD3","text":"The creating will becomes the instance that does not temporally annul past, present, and future, but joins them together in an affirmative form of willing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A4","CH_97E9_VDES:A5","CH_97E9_VDES:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD4","text":"The will to power is not mere future-willing, because its highest test lies in the retroactive affirmation of the unalterable.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A7","CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SD5","text":"The doctrine of redemption is presented as a task whose normative form is formulated, but whose mechanism of enactment remains suspended.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDES:A10","CH_97E9_VDES:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX1","text":"An unchangeable past must not count as a sufficient reason for guilt, punishment, or nihilistic world-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX2","text":"Human unity must not be presupposed as an original, given, or naturally restorable wholeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX3","text":"The liberation of the will must not be assumed as a sovereign starting point, because the will itself is determined and damaged by temporality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX4","text":"The past must be neutralized neither through forgetting nor through a moral reckoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:DNX5","text":"The overcoming of revenge must not consist in ascetic negation of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX1","text":"A redemption outside time is excluded as inadmissible; redemption can only transform the relation to what is temporal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX2","text":"A final separation of creation and the past is excluded; every future creating remains bound to the “It was”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX3","text":"A fully given doctrine of redemption remains absent, because the instance of willing-back is invoked but not taught.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:SNX4","text":"An undifferentiated public language of doctrine is excluded, because the concluding scene separates modes of speech according to addressees, disciples, and self-reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS1","text":"Visible impairment → critique of the logic of healing → shift from bodily deficiency to deforming one-sidedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS2","text":"One-sidedness and dispersion → diagnosis of the human being as fragment → future as the measure of present incompleteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS3","text":"Fragmented temporality → demand for creative gathering → redemption as revaluation of the “It was”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS4","text":"Irrevocability of the past → powerlessness of the will → revenge → punishment, guilt, and time-hostile metaphysics.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS5","text":"Rejection of revenge and non-willing → creating will → affirmation of the past as willed and still to be willed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS6","text":"Will to power → demand of willing-back → open interruption, because the production of this form of will remains unexplained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:FGS7","text":"Interruption of the doctrine → shift of discursive level → emergence of the difference between exoteric, didactic, and self-referential speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF1","text":"Bodily cripple **→** inverted cripple **→** human being as temporal fragment **→** redemption as creative gathering **→** will as liberator and captive **→** revenge as punitive morality **→** willing-back as open final demand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF2","text":"Visible healing **→** rejection of mere correction **→** diagnosis of the sickness of time **→** revaluation of the past **→** interruption before the enactment of redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:AF3","text":"Public response to cripples **→** esoteric speech to disciples **→** Zarathustra's self-questioning **→** problematized unity of the doctrine and its transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME1","text":"Disability is remapped from a local deficiency into a general figure of deformed humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME2","text":"Greatness, genius, and specialization are reclassified from signs of elevation into possible symptoms of structural mutilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME3","text":"Guilt and punishment are reordered from moral basic categories into affective techniques of a will charged with ressentiment against time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME4","text":"Redemption is shifted from restitution or forgiveness to a creative appropriation of the irrevocable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME5","text":"The future becomes visible not as a merely later point in time, but as the perspective from which present and past are newly organized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME6","text":"The opposition between liberation and captivity is internalized: the will is at once the source of redemption and the source of revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ME7","text":"Doctrine appears not as uniformly transferable content, but as an order of speech divided according to addressee and level of reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT1","text":"Surface — The discourse concerns cripples, beggars, bodily healing, human fragments, and the question of redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text reconstructs a chain from temporal powerlessness through revenge to punitive morality, guilt, and nihilistic interpretation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces correction, retribution, and reconciliation with a practice of creative revaluation of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Time is determined as irreversible occurrence, at which the will fails, but which it is to transform affirmatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:ALT5","text":"Discursive — The concluding framing scene shows that the doctrine itself does not remain identical between public speech, speech to disciples, and self-speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the diagnosis of impairment through critique of time to the demand for a creative willing-back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive mechanism by which the captive will actually overcomes its own temporal powerlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as redemption is understood as a change in the relation to the past and not as a change in past facts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest connection lies in the derivation of guilt and punishment from revenge against the irreversibility of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT5","text":"The principal fault line lies between the creative omnipotence that the will is supposed to claim and its explicitly asserted powerlessness before the “It was”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT6","text":"The demand to affirm what is past as willed can semantically revalue the past without annulling its factual unalterability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT7","text":"The introduction of the will to power intensifies the demand beyond reconciliation, but does not ground how this intensification is produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDES:MRT8","text":"The concluding dialogic preserves a further tension: the doctrine demands the highest self-overcoming, yet is divided into differently coded modes of speech for different addressees.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDES:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDES@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDES:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 57","title":"On Redemption","context":"Chapter 57","original_title":"Von der Erlösung","original_context":"Chapter 57"},"original_title":"Von der Erlösung","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK","layer":"CH","title":"On Human Prudence","order":58,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDMK"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDMK@R001","sha256":"0c2086753f3d3b152158c9e56cdf0216b6198738108acb0e21f2221f70c51979","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt nicht die Höhe, sondern den Abhang als Gefahr: Der Blick stürzt aufwärts, während die Hand an der Tiefe Halt sucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS2","text":"Der doppelte Wille bindet den Sprecher an die Menschen, weil diese Bindung zugleich Halt gibt und den Aufstieg zum Obermenschen vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS3","text":"Diese Bindung verlangt den Verzicht auf Vorsicht, vollständige Menschenkenntnis und Reinheit; Täuschbarkeit und Verunreinigung werden zu Erhaltungsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS4","text":"Die Eitlen werden als Schauspieler geschont, weil ihre Selbstinszenierung das menschliche Leben als Anschauung stabilisiert und die Schwermut heilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS5","text":"Die Furcht vor dem Bösen und vor dem Übermenschen wird als Beschränktheit der gegenwärtigen Guten, Gerechten, Weisen und Höchsten diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in Verkleidung und Selbstverkennung, damit die Bindung an die Menschen bestehen bleibt, ohne den Aufstieg auf eine feste Identität zu schließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","text":"Der Abhang ist gefährlich, weil der Wille gleichzeitig zur Höhe strebt und an der Tiefe Halt sucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","text":"Die Bindung an Menschen hält den Sprecher fest und vermittelt zugleich den Auftrieb zum Obermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","text":"Vorsicht vor den Menschen würde deren Funktion als Anker aufheben und den Sprecher zu leicht hinauf und hinwegreißen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","text":"Das Leben unter Menschen verlangt Aufnahmefähigkeit, Anpassung und die Bereitschaft, auch mit Unreinem umzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A5","text":"Sich betrügen zu lassen ist eine strategische Aufhebung der Wachsamkeit gegenüber Betrügern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","text":"Die Eitelkeit speist ihren Glauben an sich selbst aus den Blicken, dem Lob und den Lügen anderer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","text":"Die Eitlen führen sich auf und erfinden sich; dadurch werden sie zu Schauspielern, an denen sich das Leben betrachten lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A8","text":"Verletzte Eitelkeit erzeugt Trauerspiele, während verletzter Stolz über den Stolz hinaus etwas Höheres hervorbringen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","text":"Die Furchtsamkeit der Menschen verdeckt die Wunderbarkeit und Produktivität des Bösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","text":"Das gegenwärtig Böse ist zeitlich und maßstäblich begrenzt; größere Formen des Bösen gehören einer noch offenen Zukunft an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","text":"Der Obermensch benötigt einen ihm angemessenen Gegner, dessen Gestalt als Über-Drache erst aus gesteigerter Bosheit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","text":"Die gegenwärtig höchsten Menschen würden den Obermenschen wegen seiner Güte, Weisheit und Größe als Teufel benennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A13","text":"Die Entfernung von den gegenwärtig Höchsten verlangt Verkleidung und die Verkennung des eigenen und fremden Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX1","text":"Nicht die Höhe selbst, sondern die ungesicherte Doppelbewegung zwischen Höhe und Tiefe definiert die Gefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX2","text":"Der Aufstieg gründet nicht auf vollständiger Menschenkenntnis oder dauernder Wachsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX3","text":"Reinheit unter Menschen ist kein aufrechterhaltbarer Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX4","text":"Die Eitelkeit ist nicht bloß ein zu verachtender Mangel, sondern eine funktionale Form des Spiels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX5","text":"Das Böse wird nicht durch die Furcht der Guten abschließend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX6","text":"Die gegenwärtigen moralischen Namen für Bosheit besitzen keine endgültige Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX7","text":"Die gegenwärtig höchsten Menschen bilden nicht den Gipfel der Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX8","text":"Eine unverkleidete, transparente Beziehung zwischen Sprecher, Mitmenschen und eigenem Selbst wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D1","text":"Die Menschen erscheinen nicht primär als Erkenntnisgegenstand, sondern als materieller und affektiver Anker des Aufstiegs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D2","text":"Das Aussetzen der Vorsicht wird von einem Defizit in eine Form der Klugheit umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D3","text":"Blindheit gegenüber den Menschen erhält eine doppelte Funktion: Sie schützt vor Enttäuschung und bewahrt ihre stabilisierende Wirkung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D4","text":"Die Eitlen werden als therapeutische Schauspieler klassifiziert, deren Bedürftigkeit das Leben als aufführbares Schauspiel erhält.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D5","text":"Die Schonung der Eitlen beruht nicht auf moralischer Nachsicht, sondern auf ihrer Funktion für die affektive Stabilität des Sprechers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","CH_97E9_VDMK:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D6","text":"Die moralische Furcht vor dem Bösen wird als Wahrnehmungshemmung behandelt, die dessen zukünftige Formen unsichtbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","CH_97E9_VDMK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D7","text":"Der Obermensch wird durch die notwendige Steigerung seines Gegenbildes zeitlich und relational erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","CH_97E9_VDMK:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D8","text":"Die Opposition der Guten und Weisen gegen den Obermenschen bestätigt deren eigene Maßstabsgebundenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D9","text":"Verkleidung und Selbstverkennung werden zu operativen Mitteln, um menschliche Nähe und zukünftige Überschreitung gleichzeitig aufrechtzuerhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","CH_97E9_VDMK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD1","text":"Der Motor des Systems ist ein kontrollierter Doppelwille: Die Bindung an die Menschen ermöglicht den Aufstieg, den der Aufstieg zugleich überschreiten will.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD2","text":"Erkenntnisverzicht, Täuschbarkeit und Verunreinigung werden nicht als bloße Schwächen, sondern als operative Medien der Transzendenz eingesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD3","text":"Das System verwandelt negative Bestimmungen in Ressourcen: Eitelkeit wird zur Bühne, Unreinheit zur Anpassungsfähigkeit und Bosheit zum Entwicklungsmaterial.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","CH_97E9_VDMK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD4","text":"Der Obermensch erscheint nicht als isoliertes Ideal, sondern als relationaler Zukunftspunkt, der einen gesteigerten Gegner und die Unzulänglichkeit der Gegenwart voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD5","text":"Die Identität des aufsteigenden Subjekts bleibt absichtlich instabil, weil offene Zukunft nur durch kontrollierte Verkennung erhalten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","CH_97E9_VDMK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein autonomer Aufstieg, der ohne menschlichen Halt auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Wachsamkeit und Menschenkenntnis seien unter allen Umständen höhere Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Transzendenz, die sich durch Absonderung von Schmutz, Täuschung und Bedürftigkeit vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine geschlossene moralische Ontologie, in der das Böse bereits vollständig erkannt und benannt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Gegenwart der „Höchsten und Besten“ als normativer Endpunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein stabiles Subjekt, das sich selbst und die anderen unverkleidet erkennen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird ein Aufstieg, der den Menschen einfach hinter sich lässt; die Überschreitung bleibt auf menschliche Verankerung angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Güte des Obermenschen, die innerhalb der bestehenden moralischen Kategorien anerkannt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist eine endgültige Identität des Sprechers; die Zukunft bleibt nur durch Verkleidung, Distanz und Selbstverkennung offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist eine nicht-theatralische, nicht-vermittelte Form menschlicher Nähe, in der Leben ohne Darstellung tragfähig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS1","text":"Doppelwillen zwischen Höhe und Tiefe → menschliche Bindung als Anker und Aufstiegsmedium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS2","text":"Ankerabhängigkeit → Aufhebung der Vorsicht → zugelassene Täuschung und partielle Blindheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS3","text":"Leben unter Menschen → notwendige Durchlässigkeit → Verzicht auf Reinheit und Aufnahme des Unreinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS4","text":"Eitelkeit → Selbstinszenierung → Schauspiel → affektive Stabilisierung und Heilung der Schwermut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS5","text":"Furcht vor dem Bösen → moralische Verengung → zeitliche Öffnung des Bösen → Erzeugung des Über-Drachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS6","text":"Unzulänglichkeit der gegenwärtig Höchsten → Benennung des Obermenschen als Teufel → Verschiebung in fernere Zukünfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS7","text":"Zukunftsverschiebung → Verkleidung und Selbstverkennung → erneute menschliche Verankerung bei offengehaltener Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AF1","text":"Abhang als Doppelwillen → Menschen als notwendiger Anker → Nicht-Vorsicht und zugelassene Täuschung → Anpassung durch Verunreinigung → Eitelkeit als Schauspiel → Stabilisierung des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AF2","text":"Furcht vor dem Bösen → Relativierung gegenwärtiger moralischer Maßstäbe → Zukunft des gesteigerten Bösen → notwendiger Über-Drache → Versagen der gegenwärtig Höchsten → Obermensch als missbenannte Zukunft → Verkleidung und Selbstverkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME1","text":"Die begriffliche Achse verschiebt sich von „Höhe“ zu „Abhang“: Nicht das Ziel, sondern die widersprüchliche Vermittlung des Aufstiegs wird sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME2","text":"Die Menschen werden vom Gegenstand möglicher Erkenntnis zum stabilisierenden Medium einer übermenschlichen Bewegung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME3","text":"Klugheit wird von der Abwehr der Täuschung auf die kontrollierte Zulassung von Täuschbarkeit umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME4","text":"Eitelkeit wird vom moralischen Defekt zur performativen und therapeutischen Infrastruktur des Lebens umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME5","text":"Das Böse wird vom abschließenden Gegenstand moralischer Verurteilung zum unentwickelten Material einer zukünftigen Steigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME6","text":"Die „Guten und Gerechten“, Weisen und Höchsten werden vom Gipfel zum negativen Maßstab des Obermenschen herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME7","text":"Identität wird nicht durch Selbstkenntnis, sondern durch funktionale Verkennung und Verkleidung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher beschreibt seine drei Menschen-Klugheiten und seine abschließende Strategie der Verkleidung im Umgang mit Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT2","text":"Structural — Menschliche Bindung, Eitelkeit, Täuschung und moralische Furcht werden als Mechanismen der Stabilisierung und Begrenzung des Aufstiegs angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt Abwehr, Reinheit und direkte Erkenntnis durch taktische Blindheit, selektive Schonung, Darstellung und kontrollierte Selbstverkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Obermensch gehört einer noch nicht realisierten Zukunft an, deren Entstehung die Steigerung des Bösen und die Auflösung gegenwärtiger Identitäts- und Wertmaßstäbe voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die zentrale Maschine aus Doppelwillen, menschlichem Anker, strategischer Blindheit und Zukunftsverschiebung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben der ontologische Status des Obermenschen, die genaue Bedeutung seiner Güte und die Grenze zwischen realer Bosheit und perspektivischer Umbenennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aufstieg nicht als Loslösung, sondern als spannungsabhängige Bindung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umkehrung negativer Eigenschaften zu funktionalen Bedingungen: Nichtwissen, Eitelkeit, Schmutz und Bosheit tragen die Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie besteht darin, dass menschliche Nähe zugleich notwendiger Anker und zu überschreitende Beschränkung bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der behaupteten Zukunft des Bösen und der nur bildhaft angegebenen Erzeugung des Über-Drachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom Abgrund über menschliche Verankerung und moralische Umwertung zur verschleierten Öffnung auf den Obermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194508715093Z_08b1b412","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Human Prudence","source_sha256":"0c2086753f3d3b152158c9e56cdf0216b6198738108acb0e21f2221f70c51979","sha256":"ee2ae057928ca52edca927d1e2414f389034efcc10bcb95d48b7a5efcb3a74c2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:45:08.723120+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS1","text":"The text identifies not the height but the slope as the danger: the gaze plunges upward, while the hand seeks support in the depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS2","text":"The double will binds the speaker to human beings, because this bond simultaneously provides support and mediates the ascent to the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS3","text":"This bond demands the renunciation of caution, complete knowledge of human beings, and purity; susceptibility to deception and contamination become conditions of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS4","text":"The vain are spared as actors because their self-staging stabilizes human life as spectacle and heals melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS5","text":"Fear of evil and of the overman is diagnosed as the limitation of the presently good, just, wise, and highest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AS6","text":"The movement ends in disguise and self-misrecognition, so that the bond with human beings endures without closing off the ascent upon a fixed identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","text":"The slope is dangerous because the will simultaneously strives toward height and seeks support in the depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","text":"The bond with human beings holds the speaker fast and simultaneously mediates the upward impetus toward the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","text":"Caution toward human beings would abolish their function as anchor and carry the speaker too easily upward and away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","text":"Life among human beings requires receptivity, adaptation, and the willingness also to deal with what is impure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A5","text":"Allowing oneself to be deceived is a strategic suspension of vigilance toward deceivers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","text":"Vanity nourishes its belief in itself from the looks, praise, and lies of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","text":"The vain perform and invent themselves; thereby they become actors through whom life can be contemplated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A8","text":"Wounded vanity produces tragedies, whereas wounded pride can bring forth something higher beyond pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","text":"The fearfulness of human beings conceals the wondrousness and productivity of evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","text":"Present evil is temporally and quantitatively limited; greater forms of evil belong to a future still open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","text":"The overman requires an opponent commensurate with him, whose form as an over-dragon emerges only from intensified evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","text":"The presently highest human beings would name the overman devil on account of his goodness, wisdom, and greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:A13","text":"Distance from the presently highest demands disguise and the misrecognition of one's own and others' selves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX1","text":"Not height itself, but the unsecured double movement between height and depth defines the danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX2","text":"The ascent is not grounded in complete knowledge of human beings or continual vigilance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX3","text":"Purity among human beings is not a sustainable condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX4","text":"Vanity is not merely a defect to be despised, but a functional form of play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX5","text":"Evil is not conclusively determined by the fear of the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX6","text":"The present moral names for evil possess no final validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX7","text":"The presently highest human beings do not form the summit of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:NX8","text":"An undisguised, transparent relation between speaker, fellow human beings, and one's own self is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D1","text":"Human beings appear not primarily as an object of knowledge, but as the material and affective anchor of ascent.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D2","text":"The suspension of caution is recoded from a deficit into a form of prudence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D3","text":"Blindness toward human beings acquires a double function: it protects against disappointment and preserves their stabilizing effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D4","text":"The vain are classified as therapeutic actors whose neediness preserves life as performable spectacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D5","text":"Sparing the vain rests not on moral indulgence, but on their function for the speaker's affective stability.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A6","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","CH_97E9_VDMK:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D6","text":"Moral fear of evil is treated as an inhibition of perception that renders its future forms invisible.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","CH_97E9_VDMK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D7","text":"The overman is produced temporally and relationally through the necessary intensification of his counter-image.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","CH_97E9_VDMK:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D8","text":"The opposition of the good and wise to the overman confirms their own bondage to standards.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:D9","text":"Disguise and self-misrecognition become operative means for simultaneously maintaining human proximity and future transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","CH_97E9_VDMK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD1","text":"The motor of the system is a controlled double will: the bond with human beings enables the ascent that ascent simultaneously seeks to surpass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A1","CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD2","text":"Renunciation of knowledge, susceptibility to deception, and contamination are deployed not as mere weaknesses, but as operative media of transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A3","CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","CH_97E9_VDMK:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD3","text":"The system transforms negative determinations into resources: vanity becomes a stage, impurity adaptability, and evil material for development.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A4","CH_97E9_VDMK:A7","CH_97E9_VDMK:A9","CH_97E9_VDMK:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD4","text":"The overman appears not as an isolated ideal, but as a relational point in the future that presupposes an intensified opponent and the inadequacy of the present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A10","CH_97E9_VDMK:A11","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SD5","text":"The identity of the ascending subject remains deliberately unstable because an open future can be preserved only through controlled misrecognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDMK:A2","CH_97E9_VDMK:A12","CH_97E9_VDMK:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an autonomous ascent that can do without human support.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that vigilance and knowledge of human beings are in all circumstances higher virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a transcendence accomplished through separation from dirt, deception, and neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a closed moral ontology in which evil would already be fully known and named.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the present of the “Highest and Best” as a normative endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a stable subject that could recognize itself and others undisguised.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX1","text":"Impossible is an ascent that simply leaves human beings behind; transcendence remains dependent on human anchoring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a goodness of the overman that could be recognized within existing moral categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is a final identity of the speaker; the future remains open only through disguise, distance, and self-misrecognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:SNX4","text":"Barred is a non-theatrical, unmediated form of human proximity in which life would be sustainable without representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS1","text":"Double will between height and depth → human bond as anchor and medium of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS2","text":"Dependence on the anchor → suspension of caution → permitted deception and partial blindness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS3","text":"Life among human beings → necessary permeability → renunciation of purity and acceptance of the impure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS4","text":"Vanity → self-staging → spectacle → affective stabilization and healing of melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS5","text":"Fear of evil → moral narrowing → temporal opening of evil → production of the over-dragon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS6","text":"Inadequacy of the presently highest → naming the overman devil → displacement into more distant futures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:FGS7","text":"Displacement into the future → disguise and self-misrecognition → renewed human anchoring with transcendence kept open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AF1","text":"Slope as double will → human beings as necessary anchor → non-caution and permitted deception → adaptation through contamination → vanity as spectacle → stabilization of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:AF2","text":"Fear of evil → relativization of present moral standards → future of intensified evil → necessary over-dragon → failure of the presently highest → overman as misnamed future → disguise and self-misrecognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME1","text":"The conceptual axis shifts from “height” to “slope”: not the goal, but the contradictory mediation of ascent becomes visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME2","text":"Human beings are reclassified from the object of possible knowledge into the stabilizing medium of a superhuman movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME3","text":"Prudence is shifted from warding off deception to the controlled admission of susceptibility to deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME4","text":"Vanity is remapped from moral defect to the performative and therapeutic infrastructure of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME5","text":"Evil is shifted from the conclusive object of moral condemnation to the undeveloped material of a future intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME6","text":"The “Good and Just,” wise, and highest are demoted from the summit to the negative standard of the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ME7","text":"Identity is organized not through self-knowledge, but through functional misrecognition and disguise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker describes his three human prudences and his concluding strategy of disguise in dealing with human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT2","text":"Structural — Human bonding, vanity, deception, and moral fear are arranged as mechanisms of stabilization and limitation of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces defense, purity, and direct knowledge with tactical blindness, selective sparing, representation, and controlled self-misrecognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The overman belongs to a future not yet realized, whose emergence presupposes the intensification of evil and the dissolution of present standards of identity and value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the central machine of double will, human anchor, strategic blindness, and displacement into the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the ontological status of the overman, the exact meaning of his goodness, and the boundary between real evil and perspectival renaming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that ascent is understood not as detachment, but as tension-dependent binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the reversal of negative properties into functional conditions: nonknowledge, vanity, dirt, and evil sustain the movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT5","text":"The strongest fault line consists in the fact that human proximity remains simultaneously a necessary anchor and a limitation to be surpassed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT6","text":"A second fault line lies between the asserted future of evil and the only figuratively indicated production of the over-dragon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDMK:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the abyss through human anchoring and moral revaluation to the veiled opening toward the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDMK:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDMK@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDMK:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 58","title":"On Human Prudence","context":"Chapter 58","original_title":"Von der Menschen-Klugheit","original_context":"Chapter 58"},"original_title":"Von der Menschen-Klugheit","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0","layer":"CH","title":"The Stillest Hour","order":59,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DSS0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DSS0@R001","sha256":"ab94a16bb93fb1408b5a56a00e0d04319eacd5d087578e7c0259e987b0d2a917","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS1","text":"Die sichtbare Verstörung des Sprechers erzeugt die Frage nach dem Grund seines bevorstehenden Fortgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS2","text":"Der Fortgang wird nicht als freie Entscheidung, sondern als erzwungene Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS3","text":"Die Ursache der Nötigung wird in einer zornigen Herrin personifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS4","text":"Diese Herrin erhält den Namen „meine stillste Stunde“ und verschiebt die Ursache vom sozialen Raum in eine innere, zeitliche Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS5","text":"Die Mitteilung an die Zurückbleibenden legitimiert das Scheiden und soll ihre Verhärtung gegen den plötzlich Scheidenden verhindern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von sichtbarer Verstörung über verborgene Nötigung und Benennung zu nachträglicher kommunikativer Rechtfertigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","text":"Der Sprecher erscheint verstört, fortgetrieben und unwillig-folgsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","text":"Der Sprecher steht vor einem erneuten Eintritt in die Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","text":"Der gegenwärtige Eintritt in die Einsamkeit erfolgt widerwillig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","text":"Der Fortgang wird durch eine übergeordnete Instanz geboten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","text":"Diese Instanz wird als „zornige Herrin“ angeredet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","text":"Die „zornige Herrin“ trägt den Namen „meine stillste Stunde“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","text":"Der Befehl der stillsten Stunde verursacht das tatsächliche Scheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","text":"Der Sprecher muss den Grund seines Scheidens mitteilen, damit die Herzen der Zurückbleibenden nicht gegen ihn verhärten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A9","text":"Die vollständige Mitteilung wird als Verpflichtung des Sprechers dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX1","text":"Das Scheiden ist keine freiwillige, souveräne Entscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX2","text":"Die Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit ist kein lustvoller oder bejahter Rückzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX3","text":"Der Fortgang ist kein grundloses Verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX4","text":"Die Ursache des Fortgangs liegt nicht in einem offen ausgesprochenen sozialen Konflikt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX5","text":"Die Beziehung zu den Zurückbleibenden wird nicht durch körperliche Anwesenheit gesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX6","text":"Das Schweigen über die Ursache wird als unzulässig ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D1","text":"Der Fortgang erscheint als Gehorsam gegenüber einer inneren Nötigung und nicht als autonome Selbstsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D2","text":"Die Einsamkeit wird als wiederkehrender Bestimmungsort des Sprechers etabliert, dessen gegenwärtige Wiederaufnahme jedoch durch Widerwillen markiert ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D3","text":"Die Benennung der stillsten Stunde übersetzt eine unbestimmte innere Nötigung in eine befehlende Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D4","text":"Die Mitteilung des Grundes wird zur Bedingung dafür, dass das Scheiden nicht als feindseliger Abbruch gelesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D5","text":"Der Sprecher vollzieht den Fortgang und hält zugleich durch Erklärung eine Beziehung zu den Zurückbleibenden aufrecht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD1","text":"Das Subjekt des Scheidens ist geteilt: Es gehorcht einer nicht selbst gesetzten Instanz und übernimmt dennoch die Pflicht, deren Wirkung sprachlich zu vermitteln.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD2","text":"Einsamkeit erscheint nicht als bloße Abwesenheit, sondern als durch eine innere Zeitinstanz erzwungene Existenzform.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD3","text":"Die soziale Bindung wird nicht durch Verbleiben, sondern durch die Offenlegung der Nötigung vermittelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD4","text":"Der Text verwandelt einen scheinbar persönlichen Abschied in eine Konstellation aus Befehl, Gehorsam, Benennung und nachträglicher Legitimierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein autonomes Subjekt, dessen Wille den Fortgang vollständig begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine psychologisch transparente Ursache, die ohne Personifikation der Herrin unmittelbar verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine eindeutige Trennung zwischen innerem Zustand und äußerem Gebot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine soziale Beziehung, die den Bruch ohne erklärende Vermittlung übersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Einsamkeit, die als bloße Wahl oder bloße räumliche Bewegung verstanden werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass der Sprecher aus eigener letzter Verfügung bleibt, wird durch die Autorität der stillsten Stunde blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX2","text":"Die eigentliche Ursache des Befehls bleibt hinter ihrer Benennung als „stillste Stunde“ entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX3","text":"Eine Versöhnung zwischen Gehorsam und persönlichem Wollen wird nicht hergestellt, sondern als Spannung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit des Sprechers wird nur kommunikativ bearbeitbar, nicht aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS1","text":"Sichtbare Verstörung → Frage nach der Ursache → Feststellung des bevorstehenden Fortgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS2","text":"Wiederkehrende Einsamkeit + gegenwärtiger Widerwille → Unterscheidung zwischen Bestimmungsort und Zustimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS3","text":"Unbestimmte Nötigung → Personifikation als zornige Herrin → Benennung als „stillste Stunde“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS4","text":"Benannter Befehl → tatsächliches Scheiden → Verpflichtung zur Erklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS5","text":"Erklärung des Zwangs → Verhinderung der Verhärtung der Zurückbleibenden → kommunikative Schließung ohne Aufhebung der Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AF1","text":"Verstörung → erzwungene Rückkehr → zornige Herrin → „stillste Stunde“ → Gehorsam → Erklärung des Scheidens → Verhinderung sozialer Verhärtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME1","text":"Freiwilliger Abschied und erzwungener Fortgang werden als verschiedene Handlungsmodelle getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME2","text":"Die Ursache des Geschehens wird aus der interpersonalen Situation in eine personifizierte innere Zeitinstanz verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME3","text":"Einsamkeit wird von einem bloßen Ort zu einer befohlenen Existenzform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME4","text":"Erklärung wird als vermittelnde Praxis zwischen unvermeidbarer Abwesenheit und fortbestehender Bindung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME5","text":"Widerwillen und Gehorsam erscheinen nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als gleichzeitige Zustände desselben Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein verstörter Sprecher kündigt seinen Fortgang und seine Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine befehlende Instanz organisiert den Übergang von innerer Nötigung zu äußerer Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Sprecher rahmt sein Verschwinden durch Offenlegung des Zwangs, um die soziale Deutung des Abschieds zu steuern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Eine personifizierte Stunde besitzt gegenüber dem Sprecher handlungsbestimmende Autorität und ordnet seine Zeitlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um Verstörung, Befehl, Fortgang, Benennung und Erklärung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was die stillste Stunde außerhalb ihrer Benennung als Herrin genau ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Gehorsam und Widerwillen als simultane Bestimmungen zugelassen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kette von Nötigung, Scheiden und kommunikativer Rechtfertigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der metaphorischen Gleichsetzung von Stunde, Herrin und Befehl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT6","text":"Die Spannung zwischen innerer Autorität und persönlicher Verantwortung wird nicht aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT7","text":"Die formale Bewegung des Textes bleibt durch die Reduktion auf Ursache, Gehorsam und Erklärung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193615325567Z_495ae387","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Stillest Hour","source_sha256":"ab94a16bb93fb1408b5a56a00e0d04319eacd5d087578e7c0259e987b0d2a917","sha256":"309577dd4a0dd5b637a5718114c08b7a441f3dd86d1662cd1390b2df853e5355","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:36:15.328111+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS1","text":"The speaker’s visible disturbance gives rise to the question of the reason for his impending departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS2","text":"The departure is determined not as a free decision, but as a compelled return into solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS3","text":"The cause of the compulsion is personified in an angry mistress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS4","text":"This mistress is given the name “my stillest hour” and shifts the cause from the social sphere into an inner, temporal instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS5","text":"The communication to those remaining behind legitimates the departure and is intended to prevent their hardening against the one who departs suddenly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AS6","text":"The argument moves from visible disturbance through hidden compulsion and naming to subsequent communicative justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","text":"The speaker appears disturbed, driven away, and unwillingly obedient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","text":"The speaker stands before a renewed entry into solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","text":"The present entry into solitude occurs unwillingly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","text":"The departure is commanded by a higher instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","text":"This instance is addressed as an “angry mistress.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","text":"The “angry mistress” bears the name “my stillest hour.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","text":"The command of the stillest hour causes the actual departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","text":"The speaker must communicate the reason for his departure so that the hearts of those remaining behind do not harden against him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:A9","text":"The full communication is presented as an obligation of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX1","text":"The departure is not a voluntary, sovereign decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX2","text":"The return into solitude is not a pleasurable or affirmed withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX3","text":"The departure is not a groundless disappearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX4","text":"The cause of the departure does not lie in an openly expressed social conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX5","text":"The relationship to those remaining behind is not secured through physical presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:NX6","text":"Silence regarding the cause is excluded as impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D1","text":"The departure appears as obedience to an inner compulsion and not as autonomous self-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D2","text":"Solitude is established as the speaker’s recurring destination, whose present resumption is nevertheless marked by unwillingness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D3","text":"The naming of the stillest hour translates an indeterminate inner compulsion into a commanding instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D4","text":"The communication of the reason becomes the condition under which the departure is not read as a hostile break.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:D5","text":"The speaker enacts the departure while at the same time maintaining a relationship to those remaining behind through explanation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD1","text":"The subject of departure is divided: it obeys an instance not posited by itself and nevertheless assumes the duty to communicate its effect linguistically.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD2","text":"Solitude appears not as mere absence, but as a form of existence compelled by an inner temporal instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD3","text":"The social bond is mediated not through remaining, but through the disclosure of the compulsion.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SD4","text":"The text transforms an apparently personal farewell into a constellation of command, obedience, naming, and subsequent legitimation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSS0:A1","CH_97E9_DSS0:A2","CH_97E9_DSS0:A3","CH_97E9_DSS0:A4","CH_97E9_DSS0:A5","CH_97E9_DSS0:A6","CH_97E9_DSS0:A7","CH_97E9_DSS0:A8","CH_97E9_DSS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX1","text":"Excluded is an autonomous subject whose will fully grounds the departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a psychologically transparent cause that would be directly available without the personification of the mistress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX3","text":"Excluded is an unambiguous separation between inner state and outer command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a social relationship that survives the rupture without explanatory mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a solitude that could be understood as mere choice or mere spatial movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX1","text":"The possibility that the speaker remains by his own ultimate discretion is blocked by the authority of the stillest hour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX2","text":"The actual cause of the command remains withdrawn behind its naming as “stillest hour.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX3","text":"A reconciliation between obedience and personal willing is not established, but maintained as tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:SNX4","text":"The speaker’s absence becomes communicatively manageable only; it is not abolished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS1","text":"Visible disturbance → question of the cause → determination of the impending departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS2","text":"Recurring solitude + present unwillingness → distinction between destination and assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS3","text":"Indeterminate compulsion → personification as angry mistress → naming as “stillest hour.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS4","text":"Named command → actual departure → obligation to explain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:FGS5","text":"Explanation of the coercion → prevention of the hardening of those remaining behind → communicative closure without the abolition of solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:AF1","text":"Disturbance → compelled return → angry mistress → “stillest hour” → obedience → explanation of the departure → prevention of social hardening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME1","text":"Voluntary farewell and compelled departure are separated as different models of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME2","text":"The cause of the event is displaced from the interpersonal situation into a personified inner temporal instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME3","text":"Solitude is remapped from a mere place into a commanded form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME4","text":"Explanation is classified as a mediating practice between unavoidable absence and continuing bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ME5","text":"Unwillingness and obedience no longer appear as opposites, but as simultaneous states of the same subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — A disturbed speaker announces his departure and his return into solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — A commanding instance organizes the transition from inner compulsion to outer action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The speaker frames his disappearance through disclosure of the coercion in order to direct the social interpretation of the farewell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — A personified hour possesses action-determining authority over the speaker and orders his temporality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct disturbance, command, departure, naming, and explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the stillest hour precisely is apart from its naming as mistress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as obedience and unwillingness are admitted as simultaneous determinations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the chain of compulsion, departure, and communicative justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the metaphorical identification of hour, mistress, and command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT6","text":"The tension between inner authority and personal responsibility is not resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSS0:MRT7","text":"The formal movement of the text is preserved through reduction to cause, obedience, and explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DSS0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DSS0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 59","title":"The Stillest Hour","context":"Chapter 59","original_title":"Die stillste Stunde","original_context":"Chapter 59"},"original_title":"Die stillste Stunde","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS","layer":"CH","title":"Do you know the terror of the sleeper?—","order":60,"parents":["RAW_97E9_KIDS"],"revision":"CH_97E9_KIDS@R001","sha256":"9480d0d7397d9d0651ee4f709f0e6801ff857ea294413d4cbf2f1a9931512b39","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS1","text":"Der Beginn des Traums wird als Erschütterung einer bislang tragenden Wirklichkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS2","text":"Der Schrecken des Einschlafenden entsteht aus dem gleichzeitigen Verlust des Bodens und dem Einsetzen des Traums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS3","text":"Ein persönliches Ereignis wird nachträglich als Gleichnis für diese Schwellenstruktur eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS4","text":"Die Schwelle wird durch minimale zeitliche Bewegung, umfassende Stille und körperliches Erschrecken markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS5","text":"Der Übergang betrifft nicht nur den Traum, sondern die wahrgenommene Uhr des Lebens und damit die Ordnung der eigenen Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A1","text":"Einschlafen ist ein Übergangszustand zwischen Bodenhaftung und Traum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","text":"Der Beginn des Traums wird als Weichen des Bodens erfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A3","text":"Der Verlust des Bodens erzeugt Schrecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A4","text":"Ein persönliches Erlebnis kann die Struktur des Einschlafens als Gleichnis wiederholen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","text":"Die Schwelle wird durch eine minimale Bewegung der Zeit angezeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A6","text":"Die wahrgenommene Stille kann die eigene Lebenszeit als hörbare oder atmende Ordnung hervortreten lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A7","text":"Das Hervortreten dieser Lebenszeit erzeugt körperliches Erschrecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A8","text":"Traum, Zeit und Schrecken werden in einer gemeinsamen Schwellenbewegung verschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX1","text":"Der Traum beginnt nicht aus stabiler Bodenhaftung heraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX2","text":"Der Übergang wird nicht als kontinuierliches, unmerkliches Hinübergleiten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX3","text":"Die Stille ist nicht bloß die Abwesenheit von Geräuschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX4","text":"Die Lebenszeit erscheint nicht als gleichförmig verfügbare Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX5","text":"Das persönliche Ereignis wird nicht als isolierte Einzelbegebenheit belassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D1","text":"Der Traum wird als Ereignis einer ontologischen Instabilisierung erfahrbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A1","CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","CH_97E9_KIDS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D2","text":"Der Schrecken bezeichnet nicht nur Angst vor dem Traum, sondern die Wahrnehmung eines Wirklichkeitswechsels.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","CH_97E9_KIDS:A3","CH_97E9_KIDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D3","text":"Das Gleichnis überträgt die Struktur des Einschlafens auf einen wachen oder erinnerbaren Lebensmoment.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A4","CH_97E9_KIDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D4","text":"Die Bewegung des Zeigers macht den Übergang sichtbar, obwohl die Umgebung als vollkommen still erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","CH_97E9_KIDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D5","text":"Die eigene Lebenszeit wird als empfindliche, beinahe organische Instanz wahrgenommen.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","CH_97E9_KIDS:A6","CH_97E9_KIDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD1","text":"Der Text erzeugt eine Schwellenontologie, in der Wirklichkeit durch ihren möglichen Entzug und nicht durch ihre Stabilität erfahren wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD2","text":"Zeit wird vom neutralen Maß zur erschreckenden Selbsttätigkeit der eigenen Existenz umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD3","text":"Traum und Erwachen verlieren ihre klare Trennung, weil derselbe Strukturtyp beide als Übergänge des Bodens und der Zeit organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Wirklichkeit kein unverlierbarer Grund ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Zeit ausschließlich äußerlich gemessen und unabhängig vom Erleben bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, Übergänge würden erst durch nachträgliche begriffliche Ordnung zu Ereignissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der Schlaf, Traum und Lebenszeit voneinander getrennte, stabile Bereiche bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SNX2","text":"Die grundlegende Abwesenheit eines sicheren Bodens organisiert die gesamte Erfahrung, ohne selbst als Gegenstand verfügbar zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS1","text":"Tragender Boden → sein Weichen → Beginn des Traums → körperlicher Schrecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS2","text":"Persönliches Schwellenereignis → Gleichnisbildung → Übertragung der Einschlafstruktur auf die Lebenszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS3","text":"Minimale Zeitbewegung + maximale Stille → Hervortreten der Lebensuhr → Erschrecken des Herzens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS4","text":"Verlust stabiler Trennungen → Verschränkung von Traum, Zeit und Existenz → Schwellenontologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AF1","text":"Schrecken des Einschlafenden → Weichen des Bodens → Beginn des Traums → Gleichnis des eigenen Erlebnisses → lautlose Bewegung der Lebensuhr → Erschrecken des Herzens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME1","text":"Einschlafen wird von einem physiologischen Vorgang zu einer Erfahrung des Wirklichkeitsverlusts umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME2","text":"Der Traum wird nicht als Gegenwelt, sondern als beginnende Verschiebung des tragenden Grundes sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME3","text":"Stille und Bewegung werden nicht länger als Gegensätze behandelt; die Stille macht die minimale Zeitbewegung erst erfahrbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME4","text":"Die Uhr des Lebens wird von einem Messinstrument zu einer inneren, erschreckend atmenden Zeitinstanz transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Ein Einschlafender erschrickt, als der Boden weicht und der Traum beginnt; ein persönlicher Moment wiederholt diese Erfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Eine minimale zeitliche Bewegung tritt innerhalb umfassender Stille als Instabilisierung des Lebensgrundes hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Das Gleichnis verschiebt die Lesart vom einzelnen Erlebnis auf ein allgemeines Modell des Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Wirklichkeit erscheint als prekärer Boden, während Zeit als eigenständig atmende und erschreckende Bewegung erfahren wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom Einschlafschrecken zur persönlichen Gleichniserfahrung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT2","text":"Die Verbindung von Bodenverlust, Traumbeginn und Erschrecken ist intern geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT3","text":"Die Funktion der Lebensuhr bleibt gegenüber der Gleichnisstruktur semantisch unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT4","text":"Ungeklärt bleibt, ob das persönliche Ereignis tatsächlich traumartig, nur metaphorisch oder ontologisch erschütternd ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion ist dort am stärksten, wo Stille, Zeitbewegung und körperliche Reaktion als ein einziger Schwellenmechanismus erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung, muss jedoch die Mehrdeutigkeit zwischen Schlaf, Traum und Lebensereignis offenhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193629825116Z_2902db81","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Do you know the terror of the one falling asleep?—","source_sha256":"9480d0d7397d9d0651ee4f709f0e6801ff857ea294413d4cbf2f1a9931512b39","sha256":"c860924b140bafdaa477fd18a7b44a33ccf0c230631e0fa878bdce4042274a98","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:36:29.826767+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS1","text":"The beginning of the dream is determined as a shattering of a reality that had hitherto been sustaining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS2","text":"The terror of the one falling asleep arises from the simultaneous loss of ground and onset of the dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS3","text":"A personal event is subsequently employed as a parable for this threshold structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS4","text":"The threshold is marked by minimal temporal movement, comprehensive silence, and bodily fright.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AS5","text":"The transition concerns not only the dream, but the perceived clock of life and thus the order of one's own existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A1","text":"Falling asleep is a transitional state between groundedness and dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","text":"The beginning of the dream is experienced as the ground giving way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A3","text":"The loss of ground produces terror.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A4","text":"A personal experience can repeat the structure of falling asleep as a parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","text":"The threshold is indicated by a minimal movement of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A6","text":"Perceived silence can allow one's own lifetime to emerge as an audible or breathing order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A7","text":"The emergence of this lifetime produces bodily fright.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:A8","text":"Dream, time, and terror are intertwined in a shared threshold movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX1","text":"The dream does not begin from stable groundedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX2","text":"The transition is not determined as a continuous, imperceptible gliding-over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX3","text":"Silence is not merely the absence of sounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX4","text":"Lifetime does not appear as uniformly available duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:NX5","text":"The personal event is not left as an isolated individual occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D1","text":"The dream becomes experienceable as an event of ontological destabilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A1","CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","CH_97E9_KIDS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D2","text":"The terror denotes not merely fear of the dream, but the perception of a change of reality.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A2","CH_97E9_KIDS:A3","CH_97E9_KIDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D3","text":"The parable transfers the structure of falling asleep onto an awake or recollectable moment of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A4","CH_97E9_KIDS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D4","text":"The movement of the hand makes the transition visible, although the surroundings appear perfectly silent.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","CH_97E9_KIDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:D5","text":"One's own lifetime is perceived as a sensitive, almost organic instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_KIDS:A5","CH_97E9_KIDS:A6","CH_97E9_KIDS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD1","text":"The text generates a threshold ontology in which reality is experienced through its possible withdrawal and not through its stability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD2","text":"Time is remapped from a neutral measure into the terrifying self-activity of one's own existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SD3","text":"Dream and waking lose their clear separation because the same structural type organizes both as transitions of ground and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that reality is not an inalienable ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that time remains measured exclusively externally and independently of experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that transitions become events only through subsequent conceptual ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which sleep, dream, and lifetime constitute separate, stable domains.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:SNX2","text":"The fundamental absence of secure ground organizes the entire experience without itself becoming available as an object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS1","text":"Sustaining ground → its giving way → beginning of the dream → bodily terror.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS2","text":"Personal threshold event → formation of a parable → transfer of the structure of falling asleep onto lifetime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS3","text":"Minimal movement of time + maximal silence → emergence of the clock of life → fright of the heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:FGS4","text":"Loss of stable separations → intertwining of dream, time, and existence → threshold ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:AF1","text":"Terror of the one falling asleep → giving way of the ground → beginning of the dream → parable of one's own experience → soundless movement of the clock of life → fright of the heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME1","text":"Falling asleep is reclassified from a physiological process into an experience of the loss of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME2","text":"The dream becomes visible not as a counterworld, but as an incipient displacement of the sustaining ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME3","text":"Silence and movement are no longer treated as opposites; silence first makes minimal temporal movement experienceable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ME4","text":"The clock of life is transformed from a measuring instrument into an inner, terrifyingly breathing temporal instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — A person falling asleep is startled as the ground gives way and the dream begins; a personal moment repeats this experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — A minimal temporal movement emerges within comprehensive silence as a destabilization of the ground of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The parable shifts the reading from the individual experience to a general model of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Reality appears as precarious ground, while time is experienced as an independently breathing and terrifying movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the terror of falling asleep to the personal parabolic experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT2","text":"The connection of loss of ground, beginning of dream, and fright is internally closed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT3","text":"The function of the clock of life remains semantically underdetermined in relation to the parable structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT4","text":"It remains unresolved whether the personal event is in fact dreamlike, merely metaphorical, or ontologically shattering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT5","text":"The construction is strongest where silence, temporal movement, and bodily reaction appear as a single threshold mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_KIDS:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but must keep open the ambiguity between sleep, dream, and life event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_KIDS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_KIDS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_KIDS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 60","title":"Do you know the terror of the sleeper?—","context":"Chapter 60","original_title":"Kennt ihr den Schrecken des Einschlafenden?—","original_context":"Chapter 60"},"original_title":"Kennt ihr den Schrecken des Einschlafenden?—","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO","layer":"CH","title":"Then it spoke to me without a voice: “You know it, Zarathustra?”—","order":61,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DSEO"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DSEO@R001","sha256":"9453b89f781520040618b71304a157a6f2a90f6e1446955aec9915037e56fd51","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS1","text":"Eine namenlose Stimme konfrontiert Zarathustra mit einem Wissen, das er besitzt, aber nicht ausspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS2","text":"Die anfängliche Verweigerung wird als Trotz, danach als Angst, Unfähigkeit und fehlende Demut umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS3","text":"Zarathustra entzieht sich der Rede, indem er seine Würdigkeit, seine Höhe und die Wirksamkeit seines Wortes bezweifelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS4","text":"Die Stimme ersetzt unmittelbare Wirksamkeit durch eine verborgene, zeitlich verzögerte Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS5","text":"Aus dem Verlust des Gehorsams wird eine Verpflichtung zum Befehlen abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS6","text":"Die Endposition identifiziert nicht fehlende Macht, sondern den Verzicht auf Herrschaft als Zarathustras schwerstes Versäumnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","text":"Die Stimme setzt voraus, dass Zarathustra das maßgebliche Wissen besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A2","text":"Das Wissen ist von seiner sprachlichen Äußerung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","text":"Zarathustras Schweigen erscheint zunächst als gewollte Verweigerung, erweist sich jedoch als durch Angst und Überforderung begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","text":"Das Aussprechen des maßgeblichen Wortes verlangt die Bereitschaft, daran zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","text":"Zarathustra bindet seine Rede an die Voraussetzung eigener Würdigkeit und an das Warten auf einen Würdigeren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A6","text":"Demut kann als Schutzschicht gegen die Zumutung des eigenen Auftrags fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","text":"Wer Berge versetzen soll, muss zugleich Täler und Niederungen versetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","text":"Das bisherige Wort hat die Menschen noch nicht erreicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A9","text":"Spott und das Zittern beim eigenen Weg entkräften die geforderte Aufgabe nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","text":"Wer das Gehorchen verlernt hat, soll an dessen Stelle befehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A11","text":"Großes zu befehlen ist schwerer, als Großes auszuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A12","text":"Zarathustra verfügt über Macht, verweigert jedoch die Herrschaft; diese Verweigerung wird als sein Unverzeihlichstes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX1","text":"Das Wissen wird nicht als Unwissenheit definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX2","text":"Das Schweigen wird nicht als bloßes Nichtwissen akzeptiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX3","text":"Die Redeverweigerung wird nicht als souveräner Trotz anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX4","text":"Demut wird nicht als hinreichende Entschuldigung zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX5","text":"Die fehlende Wirkung des Wortes wird nicht mit fehlender Macht gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX6","text":"Der Spott der Menschen wird nicht als Widerlegung des eigenen Weges behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX7","text":"Das Ausbleiben unmittelbarer Verständigung wird nicht als endgültiges Scheitern bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX8","text":"Gehorsamsverweigerung wird nicht als Endpunkt der Handlungsmacht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX9","text":"Macht wird nicht als neutraler Besitz ohne Herrschaftspflicht behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D1","text":"Zarathustras Schweigen ist ein Konflikt zwischen erkanntem Wissen und verweigerter Verkörperung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","CH_97E9_DSEO:A2","CH_97E9_DSEO:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D2","text":"Der behauptete Trotz verdeckt eine Unfähigkeit, die Zumutung des Wortes zu tragen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","CH_97E9_DSEO:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D3","text":"Die Berufung auf einen Würdigeren verschiebt die Verantwortung für die Rede in eine unbestimmte Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","CH_97E9_DSEO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D4","text":"Demut fungiert als Widerstand gegen die Anerkennung der eigenen Höhe.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","CH_97E9_DSEO:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D5","text":"Die behauptete Wirkung des Wortes umfasst nicht nur Übertragung, sondern Umgestaltung von Höhen und Niederungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Wirkungslosigkeit des Wortes widerlegt seine mögliche spätere Wirkung nicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D7","text":"Der eigene Weg beginnt vor seiner sozialen Anerkennung und kann durch Spott nicht aufgehoben werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D8","text":"Der Verlust des Gehorsams erzeugt eine neue, noch nicht angenommene Befehlsposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D9","text":"Die höchste Schwierigkeit liegt nicht in der Hervorbringung großer Taten, sondern in der Setzung ihrer verbindlichen Richtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D10","text":"Zarathustras Problem wird von fehlender Macht auf verweigerte Herrschaft verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD1","text":"Das Gespräch verwandelt eine psychologische Blockade in eine politische und hierarchische Verpflichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD2","text":"Die innere Demut wird als Mechanismus lesbar, durch den vorhandene Macht vor ihrer öffentlichen Wirksamkeit zurückgehalten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","CH_97E9_DSEO:A6","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD3","text":"Wirkung wird aus der Logik unmittelbarer Anerkennung gelöst und als verborgener, zeitlich verzögerter Prozess gefasst.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD4","text":"Das Recht zu befehlen wird nicht durch Anerkennung, Erfolg oder Gehorsam begründet, sondern durch die Fähigkeit zum Großen und den Verlust des eigenen Gehorsams.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A9","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD5","text":"Die Rede erzeugt eine Totalisierung, in der Wissen, Selbstüberwindung, soziale Wirkung und Herrschaft als Stufen desselben Auftrags erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX1","text":"Ein vorhandenes Wissen genügt nicht; ausgeschlossen wird ein Wissen, das ohne Verkörperung und öffentliche Zumutung bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX2","text":"Eine selbstgewählte Zurückhaltung genügt nicht; ausgeschlossen wird ein Subjekt, das seine Macht durch Nicht-Handeln neutral halten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX3","text":"Demut gilt nicht als reine Tugend; ausgeschlossen wird ihre Unterscheidung von Selbstverbergung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX4","text":"Soziale Nichtaufnahme gilt nicht als objektive Grenze; ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass Wirkung nur dort existiert, wo sie sofort verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX5","text":"Die Trennung zwischen geistiger Erkenntnis und politischer Herrschaft wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX6","text":"Die Vorstellung wird ausgeschlossen, dass Macht ohne Entscheidung über andere unschuldig oder neutral bleiben könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein Zustand, in dem Zarathustra wissen, sprechen und Macht besitzen kann, ohne sich der Gefahr des Zerbrechens auszusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Wirkung ohne Unterordnung, Führung oder Herrschaftsentscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX3","text":"Die unbenannte Wahrheit hinter dem Gespräch darf nicht als privates Eigentum des Wissenden verfügbar bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX4","text":"Eine gleichrangige Beziehung zwischen dem Sprecher, den Menschen und dem noch nicht benannten Inhalt wird strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit, dass Nicht-Herrschen selbst eine gültige Endposition sein könnte, wird als unzulässig behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS1","text":"Unausgesprochenes Wissen + anhaltende Konfrontation → Trennung von Wissen und Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS2","text":"Trennung von Wissen und Rede + Selbstrechtfertigung → Rückführung des Schweigens von Trotz auf Angst, Unfähigkeit und Demut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS3","text":"Demut + Zweifel an der eigenen Würdigkeit → Verschiebung der Verantwortung auf einen noch Würdigeren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS4","text":"fehlende unmittelbare Wirkung + Gleichnis von Tau, Bergen und Tälern → Umstellung von sichtbarer Anerkennung auf verborgene und verzögerte Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS5","text":"verlernter Gehorsam + vorhandene Macht → Verpflichtung zum Befehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS6","text":"Verpflichtung zum Befehlen + größere Schwierigkeit des Befehls → Enddiagnose: Nicht Machtlosigkeit, sondern verweigerte Herrschaft ist das entscheidende Versagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AF1","text":"Besessenes, aber verschwiegenes Wissen → Entlarvung des Trotzes als Angst und Unfähigkeit → Demut als Verbergung → Zweifel an der Wirkung des Wortes → Anerkennung verzögerter Wirkung → Umkehr von Ungehorsam in Befehlsauftrag → Anklage der verweigerten Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AF2","text":"Schweigen → innere Blockade → soziale Nichtaufnahme → verborgene Wirksamkeit → politische Verpflichtung → Herrschaft als nicht angenommene Form der Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME1","text":"Schweigen wird von einer sprachlichen Abwesenheit in eine blockierte Machtposition umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME2","text":"Demut wird von einer Tugendbezeichnung zu einem möglichen Vermeidungsmechanismus neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME3","text":"Wirkung wird von unmittelbarer Verständlichkeit auf zeitlich verzögerte, indirekte Veränderung erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME4","text":"Spott und Nichtverstehen werden von Gegenbeweisen zu Durchgangsbedingungen eines eigenen Weges umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME5","text":"Ungehorsam wird nicht als Freiheit, sondern als unvollendete Voraussetzung des Befehls kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME6","text":"Macht wird als Aufgabe zur Herrschaft und nicht als bloße Fähigkeit neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra weigert sich, ein gewusstes Wort auszusprechen, und behauptet, es nicht zu können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Stimme ordnet Angst, Demut, soziale Zurückweisung und verzögerte Wirkung zu einer Mechanik der verhinderten Verkörperung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Scheitern des Sprechens wird in einen Auftrag zur Führung und zum Befehlen umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit erscheint als unbenannter Inhalt, dessen Wirkung nicht gegenwärtige Anerkennung, sondern spätere und verborgene Entfaltung voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von verschwiegenem Wissen zu verweigerter Herrschaft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben der Inhalt des Wissens, die Identität der Stimme und das konkrete Objekt des Befehls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Behauptungen der Stimme als maßgebliche Setzungen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umwandlung persönlicher Verweigerung in eine strukturelle Machtdiagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung zwischen Demut und Herrschaft wird zugespitzt, aber nicht begrifflich aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, verliert jedoch die affektive Intensität von Schrecken, Weinen und Zittern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193557709866Z_c1385c02","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Then it spoke to me without a voice: “You know it, Zarathustra?”—","source_sha256":"9453b89f781520040618b71304a157a6f2a90f6e1446955aec9915037e56fd51","sha256":"c730183f6bde0b340d85afc6da5d6b58e33f19a2a8ef493b8864d50a7398d3f1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:35:57.712559+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS1","text":"A nameless voice confronts Zarathustra with a knowledge that he possesses but does not utter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS2","text":"The initial refusal is redefined as defiance, then as fear, incapacity, and lack of humility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS3","text":"Zarathustra evades speech by doubting his worthiness, his height, and the efficacy of his word.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS4","text":"The voice replaces immediate efficacy with a hidden, temporally delayed effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS5","text":"From the loss of obedience, an obligation to command is derived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AS6","text":"The final position identifies not a lack of power, but the renunciation of rule as Zarathustra's gravest failing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","text":"The voice presupposes that Zarathustra possesses the authoritative knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A2","text":"Knowledge is separated from its linguistic expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","text":"Zarathustra's silence initially appears as deliberate refusal, yet proves to be limited by fear and being overwhelmed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","text":"Uttering the authoritative word requires the readiness to break under it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","text":"Zarathustra binds his speech to the precondition of his own worthiness and to waiting for one more worthy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A6","text":"Humility can function as a protective layer against the demand of one's own task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","text":"Whoever is to move mountains must at the same time move valleys and lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","text":"The word hitherto has not yet reached human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A9","text":"Mockery and trembling on one's own path do not invalidate the demanded task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","text":"Whoever has unlearned obedience shall command in its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A11","text":"Commanding great things is more difficult than carrying out great things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:A12","text":"Zarathustra possesses power, yet refuses rule; this refusal is determined as his most unforgivable failing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX1","text":"Knowledge is not defined as ignorance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX2","text":"Silence is not accepted as mere non-knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX3","text":"The refusal of speech is not recognized as sovereign defiance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX4","text":"Humility is not admitted as a sufficient excuse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX5","text":"The word's lacking effect is not equated with a lack of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX6","text":"The mockery of human beings is not treated as a refutation of one's own path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX7","text":"The absence of immediate understanding is not determined as final failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX8","text":"Refusal of obedience is not admitted as the endpoint of the power to act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:NX9","text":"Power is not treated as neutral possession without an obligation to rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D1","text":"Zarathustra's silence is a conflict between recognized knowledge and refused embodiment.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","CH_97E9_DSEO:A2","CH_97E9_DSEO:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D2","text":"The asserted defiance conceals an incapacity to bear the demand of the word.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","CH_97E9_DSEO:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D3","text":"The appeal to one more worthy displaces responsibility for speech into an indeterminate future.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","CH_97E9_DSEO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D4","text":"Humility functions as resistance to the acknowledgment of one's own height.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","CH_97E9_DSEO:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D5","text":"The asserted effect of the word encompasses not only transmission, but also the transformation of heights and lowlands.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D6","text":"The present ineffectiveness of the word does not refute its possible later effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D7","text":"One's own path begins before its social recognition and cannot be annulled by mockery.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D8","text":"The loss of obedience produces a new position of command that has not yet been assumed.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D9","text":"The highest difficulty lies not in the production of great deeds, but in establishing their binding direction.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:D10","text":"Zarathustra's problem is shifted from lacking power to refused rule.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD1","text":"The conversation transforms a psychological blockage into a political and hierarchical obligation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A3","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD2","text":"Inner humility becomes legible as a mechanism by which existing power is held back from its public efficacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A5","CH_97E9_DSEO:A6","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD3","text":"Effect is detached from the logic of immediate recognition and conceived as a hidden, temporally delayed process.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A8","CH_97E9_DSEO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD4","text":"The right to command is founded not on recognition, success, or obedience, but on the capacity for greatness and the loss of one's own obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A9","CH_97E9_DSEO:A10","CH_97E9_DSEO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SD5","text":"The speech produces a totalization in which knowledge, self-overcoming, social effect, and rule appear as stages of the same task.","refs":["CH_97E9_DSEO:A1","CH_97E9_DSEO:A4","CH_97E9_DSEO:A7","CH_97E9_DSEO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX1","text":"Existing knowledge is not sufficient; excluded is a knowledge that can exist without embodiment and public demand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX2","text":"Self-chosen restraint is not sufficient; excluded is a subject that can keep its power neutral through non-action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX3","text":"Humility does not count as pure virtue; excluded is its distinction from self-concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX4","text":"Social non-reception does not count as an objective limit; excluded is the assumption that effect exists only where it is immediately understood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX5","text":"The separation between intellectual knowledge and political rule is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the notion that power without decision over others could remain innocent or neutral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains a state in which Zarathustra can know, speak, and possess power without exposing himself to the danger of breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX2","text":"Excluded remains an effect without subordination, leadership, or a decision of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX3","text":"The unnamed truth behind the conversation must not remain available as the private property of the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX4","text":"An equal-ranking relationship between the speaker, human beings, and the as-yet unnamed content is structurally barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:SNX5","text":"The possibility that not ruling could itself be a valid final position is treated as inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS1","text":"Unspoken knowledge + persistent confrontation → separation of knowledge and speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS2","text":"Separation of knowledge and speech + self-justification → reduction of silence from defiance to fear, incapacity, and humility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS3","text":"Humility + doubt about one's own worthiness → displacement of responsibility onto one yet more worthy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS4","text":"lack of immediate effect + parable of dew, mountains, and valleys → shift from visible recognition to hidden and delayed efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS5","text":"unlearned obedience + existing power → obligation to command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:FGS6","text":"Obligation to command + greater difficulty of command → final diagnosis: not powerlessness, but refused rule is the decisive failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AF1","text":"Possessed but concealed knowledge → exposure of defiance as fear and incapacity → humility as concealment → doubt about the effect of the word → acknowledgment of delayed effect → reversal of disobedience into a mandate to command → accusation of refused rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:AF2","text":"Silence → inner blockage → social non-reception → hidden efficacy → political obligation → rule as an unassumed form of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME1","text":"Silence is remapped from a linguistic absence into a blocked position of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME2","text":"Humility is reclassified from a designation of virtue into a possible mechanism of avoidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME3","text":"Effect is expanded from immediate intelligibility to temporally delayed, indirect change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME4","text":"Mockery and non-understanding are reinterpreted from counter-evidence into conditions of passage for one's own path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME5","text":"Disobedience is mapped not as freedom, but as the unfinished precondition of command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ME6","text":"Power is redefined as a task toward rule and not as mere capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra refuses to utter a word he knows and claims not to be able to do so.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT2","text":"Structural — The voice arranges fear, humility, social rejection, and delayed effect into a mechanics of prevented embodiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The failure of speaking is reframed as a task of leadership and command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth appears as an unnamed content whose effect presupposes not present recognition, but later and hidden unfolding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from concealed knowledge to refused rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT2","text":"The content of the knowledge, the identity of the voice, and the concrete object of command remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that the claims of the voice are treated as authoritative positings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the transformation of personal refusal into a structural diagnosis of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT5","text":"The central tension between humility and rule is intensified, but not conceptually resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DSEO:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DSEO:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, but loses the affective intensity of terror, weeping, and trembling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DSEO@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DSEO:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 61","title":"Then it spoke to me without a voice: “You know it, Zarathustra?”—","context":"Chapter 61","original_title":"Dann sprach es ohne Stimme zu mir: „Du weisst es, Zarathustra?“—","original_context":"Chapter 61"},"original_title":"Dann sprach es ohne Stimme zu mir: „Du weisst es, Zarathustra?“—","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM","layer":"CH","title":"And I answered: “I lack the lion’s voice for all commanding.”","order":62,"parents":["RAW_97E9_UIAM"],"revision":"CH_97E9_UIAM@R001","sha256":"83a06187b29a0af74d06b15243ecb6ad2c2a1e5802cf9486f7fbb31ba9cf1414","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS1","text":"Das Problem des Befehls erscheint zunächst als Mangel an der Stimme des Löwen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS2","text":"Die Antwort bestimmt Wirksamkeit gegenläufig als Wirkung des Leisen, kaum Wahrnehmbaren und Zukünftigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS3","text":"Gedanken mit „Taubenfüssen“ werden als weltlenkende Kräfte eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS4","text":"Befehlen wird an die Verkörperung dessen gebunden, „was kommen muss“, nicht an stimmliche Gewalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von vermeintlichem Ausdrucksmangel über eine Umkehrung der Machtlogik zur Anweisung einer schattenhaften, vorangehenden Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","text":"Die Fähigkeit zu befehlen wird zunächst mit der Stimme des Löwen identifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","text":"Die stillsten Worte können einen Sturm bringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","text":"Gedanken können ohne hörbare Gewalt wirksam werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A4","text":"Gedanken, die unauffällig auftreten, können die Welt lenken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","text":"Das Kommende besitzt eine Notwendigkeitsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","text":"Eine Person kann als Schatten des Kommenden auftreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","text":"Das Auftreten als Schatten des Kommenden ermöglicht Befehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A8","text":"Befehlen umfasst ein Vorangehen in der eigenen Befehlsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX1","text":"Befehlswirksamkeit ist nicht auf eine laute oder löwenartige Stimme beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX2","text":"Weltlenkung ist nicht an offene Sichtbarkeit gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX3","text":"Macht ist nicht mit unmittelbarer Lautstärke gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX4","text":"Das Kommende wird nicht als bloß verfügbares oder beliebig herstellbares Ereignis behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX5","text":"Vorangehen im Befehlen ist nicht von der Repräsentation einer bereits vollendeten Gegenwart abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D1","text":"Eine fehlende Löwenstimme schließt Befehlsfähigkeit nicht aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D2","text":"Das Leise kann eine größere Wirkungsweite besitzen als das unmittelbar Laute.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D3","text":"Unauffälligkeit wird von einem Defizit zu einer Bedingung weltlicher Wirksamkeit umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D4","text":"Befehlen wird als Vorwegnahme einer notwendigen Zukunft bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D5","text":"Die Befehlsinstanz muss ihre Autorität nicht aus sich selbst, sondern aus ihrer Stellung zum Kommenden gewinnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D6","text":"Vorangehen und Befehlen fallen in derselben gerichteten Bewegung zusammen.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","CH_97E9_UIAM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt expressive Gewalt durch eine zeitlich vermittelte Wirksamkeit, in der das Kommende durch leise Gedanken gegenwärtig handlungsfähig wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4","CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD2","text":"Herrschaft erscheint als Fähigkeit, eine notwendige Zukunft zu verkörpern, bevor sie vollständig sichtbar oder gegenwärtig ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","CH_97E9_UIAM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD3","text":"Der scheinbare Mangel an Stimme wird zur strategischen Form einer Macht, deren Wirksamkeit gerade aus ihrer geringen physischen Präsenz entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD4","text":"Die Autorität des Befehls beruht auf einer Verbindung von Unhörbarkeit, Zukunftsnotwendigkeit und repräsentierendem Auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass Lautstärke kein notwendiges Maß politischer oder weltlicher Wirksamkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass sichtbare Präsenz nicht die privilegierte Form geschichtlicher Kausalität ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein autonomes, vom Kommenden unabhängiges Subjekt des Befehls aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, Zukunft werde erst nach ihrem Eintritt wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX5","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Schattenhaftigkeit keine bloße Schwäche, sondern eine operative Form der Vermittlung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Machtordnung, in der Herrschaft durch offene Stimmgewalt, unmittelbare Sichtbarkeit und gegenwärtige Präsenz garantiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass Befehlen ausschließlich aus souveräner Selbstsetzung hervorgeht; es muss aus einer vorgegebenen Zukunft abgeleitet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX3","text":"Die Abwesenheit der Löwenstimme strukturiert den gesamten Übergang von persönlicher Ausdrucksmacht zu anonymer, kommender Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Gegenwart, die keinen Schatten eines notwendigen Kommenden trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS1","text":"Wahrgenommener Mangel an stimmlicher Befehlsgewalt → Zweifel an der Fähigkeit zu befehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS2","text":"Negation der Lautstärke als notwendiger Machtbedingung → Aufwertung des Stillen und Unhörbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS3","text":"Leise Gedanken → unsichtbare Weltlenkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS4","text":"Weltlenkung durch das Unauffällige → Macht wird als indirekte und zeitlich vorgreifende Wirkung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS5","text":"Notwendiges Kommendes → normativer Horizont des Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS6","text":"Verkörperung des Kommenden als Schatten → vermitteltes Subjekt der Autorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS7","text":"Schattenhafte Verkörperung → Befehlen und befehlendes Vorangehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AF1","text":"Fehlende Löwenstimme → Infragestellung der Befehlsfähigkeit → Umkehrung des Machtmaßstabs → Wirksamkeit des Stillen → Verkörperung des notwendigen Kommenden → befehlendes Vorangehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AF2","text":"Stimmlicher Mangel → unsichtbare Gedankenmacht → zeitliche Vorwegnahme → schattenhafte Autorität → Befehl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME1","text":"Das Begriffsfeld der Macht wird von Lautstärke und Sichtbarkeit auf Leise, Unauffälligkeit und indirekte Wirkung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Schwäche und Herrschaft wird aufgelöst, indem Schattenhaftigkeit als Träger von Autorität klassifiziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME3","text":"Gegenwart wird als Wirkung einer vorausliegenden Zukunft kartiert, nicht als selbstgenügsamer Ausgangspunkt des Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME4","text":"Befehlen wird von einem stimmlichen Akt in eine zeitliche und repräsentative Stellung zum Kommenden umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME5","text":"Das Unhörbare wird als politisch oder weltgeschichtlich wirksamer Bereich sichtbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Stimme fehlt, während leise Worte und Gedanken als wirksam behauptet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wirksamkeit wird durch indirekte, unauffällige und nicht-physische Vermittlung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Autorität soll nicht durch Lautstärke erzeugt, sondern durch die Verkörperung einer notwendigen Zukunft gewonnen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Kommende besitzt eine vorgängige Notwendigkeit und wirkt durch seinen Schatten bereits in der Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang vom Stimmdefizit zur schattenhaften Befehlsautorität zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch das Kommende seine Notwendigkeit erhält und worin die angekündigte Weltlenkung konkret besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern leise Wirksamkeit und zukünftige Notwendigkeit als gemeinsame Gegenordnung zur Lautstärke gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umkehrung von Ausdrucksmangel und Macht: Das Fehlende wird zur Bedingung einer anderen Autoritätsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von der nicht vollständig begründeten Gleichsetzung von Schattenhaftigkeit, Zukunftsrepräsentation und Befehlsfähigkeit ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange der Löwenstimme kein bloßes Versagen, sondern der Ausgangspunkt einer negativen Neudefinition von Macht zugeschrieben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193725563503Z_8afbd258","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"And I replied: “I lack the lion’s voice for all commanding.”","source_sha256":"83a06187b29a0af74d06b15243ecb6ad2c2a1e5802cf9486f7fbb31ba9cf1414","sha256":"7b7ddf5d8d01f3ef5ac770aef879d979aae72ba2e61c7e3159c8b4d05d419c61","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:37:25.565604+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS1","text":"The problem of commanding initially appears as a lack of the lion’s voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS2","text":"The reply contrapuntally defines efficacy as the effect of the quiet, the scarcely perceptible, and the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS3","text":"Thoughts with “dove’s feet” are deployed as world-directing forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS4","text":"Commanding is bound to the embodiment of that “which must come,” not to vocal force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from an alleged deficiency of expression, through a reversal of the logic of power, to the instruction of a shadowy, preceding rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","text":"The capacity to command is initially identified with the voice of the lion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","text":"The quietest words can bring a storm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","text":"Thoughts can become effective without audible force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A4","text":"Thoughts that appear inconspicuously can steer the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","text":"That which is coming possesses a structure of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","text":"A person can appear as the shadow of that which is coming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","text":"Appearing as the shadow of that which is coming enables commanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:A8","text":"Commanding encompasses an advancing ahead in one’s own movement of command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX1","text":"The efficacy of commanding is not limited to a loud or lion-like voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX2","text":"Steering the world is not bound to open visibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX3","text":"Power is not to be equated with immediate loudness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX4","text":"That which is coming is not treated as a merely available or arbitrarily producible event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:NX5","text":"Advancing ahead in commanding does not depend on the representation of an already completed present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D1","text":"The absence of a lion’s voice does not preclude the capacity to command.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D2","text":"The quiet can possess a greater range of efficacy than the immediately loud.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D3","text":"Inconspicuousness is recoded from a deficit into a condition of worldly efficacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D4","text":"Commanding is determined as the anticipation of a necessary future.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D5","text":"The instance of command need not derive its authority from itself, but rather from its position in relation to that which is coming.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:D6","text":"Advancing ahead and commanding coincide in the same directed movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","CH_97E9_UIAM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD1","text":"The system replaces expressive force with a temporally mediated efficacy in which that which is coming becomes presently capable of action through quiet thoughts.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A4","CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD2","text":"Rule appears as the capacity to embody a necessary future before it is fully visible or present.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7","CH_97E9_UIAM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD3","text":"The apparent lack of voice becomes the strategic form of a power whose efficacy arises precisely from its slight physical presence.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A1","CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A3","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SD4","text":"The authority of command rests on a connection of inaudibility, future necessity, and representative appearance.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAM:A2","CH_97E9_UIAM:A5","CH_97E9_UIAM:A6","CH_97E9_UIAM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX1","text":"The system depends on loudness not being a necessary measure of political or worldly efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that visible presence is not the privileged form of historical causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX3","text":"It excludes an autonomous subject of command independent of that which is coming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that the future becomes effective only after its arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:DNX5","text":"It presupposes that shadowiness is not mere weakness, but an operative form of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an order of power in which rule is guaranteed through open vocal force, immediate visibility, and present presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX2","text":"The possibility that commanding arises exclusively from sovereign self-positing remains barred; it must be derived from a pre-given future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX3","text":"The absence of the lion’s voice structures the entire transition from personal expressive power to anonymous, coming efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:SNX4","text":"A present that bears no shadow of a necessary coming is rendered inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS1","text":"Perceived lack of vocal commanding power → doubt concerning the capacity to command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS2","text":"Negation of loudness as a necessary condition of power → elevation of the quiet and the inaudible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS3","text":"Quiet thoughts → invisible direction of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS4","text":"Direction of the world through the inconspicuous → power is determined as an indirect and temporally anticipatory effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS5","text":"Necessary coming → normative horizon of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS6","text":"Embodiment of what is coming as shadow → mediated subject of authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:FGS7","text":"Shadowy embodiment → commanding and commanding advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AF1","text":"Lack of the lion’s voice → questioning of the capacity to command → reversal of the measure of power → efficacy of the quiet → embodiment of the necessary coming → commanding advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:AF2","text":"Vocal deficiency → invisible power of thought → temporal anticipation → shadowy authority → command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME1","text":"The conceptual field of power is shifted from loudness and visibility to quietness, inconspicuousness, and indirect effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME2","text":"The opposition between weakness and rule is dissolved by classifying shadowiness as a bearer of authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME3","text":"The present is mapped as the effect of a future lying ahead, not as a self-sufficient point of departure for action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME4","text":"Commanding is reclassified from a vocal act into a temporal and representative position in relation to that which is coming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ME5","text":"The inaudible is made visible as a sphere effective politically or in world history.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT1","text":"Surface — A voice is absent, while quiet words and thoughts are asserted to be effective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Efficacy is organized through indirect, inconspicuous, and non-physical mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Authority is to be gained not through loudness, but through the embodiment of a necessary future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — That which is coming possesses an antecedent necessity and already acts in the present through its shadow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from vocal deficit to shadowy commanding authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how what is coming receives its necessity and what, concretely, the announced direction of the world consists in.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that quiet efficacy and future necessity count as a shared counter-order to loudness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the reversal of deficiency of expression and power: what is lacking becomes the condition of another form of authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on the not fully justified equation of shadowiness, representation of the future, and capacity to command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAM:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the lion’s voice is attributed not a mere failure, but the point of departure for a negative redefinition of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_UIAM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_UIAM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 62","title":"And I answered: “I lack the lion’s voice for all commanding.”","context":"Chapter 62","original_title":"Und ich antwortete: „Mir fehlt des Löwen Stimme zu allem Befehlen.“","original_context":"Chapter 62"},"original_title":"Und ich antwortete: „Mir fehlt des Löwen Stimme zu allem Befehlen.“","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI","layer":"CH","title":"And I answered: “I am ashamed.”","order":63,"parents":["RAW_97E9_UIAI"],"revision":"CH_97E9_UIAI@R001","sha256":"8201bb1088e0c7f47268d5d12f3ef9ecde726e79edc1bdb83b598ea3971a0bf1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS1","text":"Eine innere Instanz deutet Scham als verbleibendes Zeichen jugendlichen Stolzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS2","text":"Die geforderte Verwandlung zum Kind setzt die Überwindung der eigenen Jugend voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS3","text":"Zarathustra verweigert die geforderte Verwandlung zunächst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS4","text":"Das Lachen der Instanz verwandelt die Verweigerung in körperlich erfahrenen Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS5","text":"Die Reife seiner Früchte fällt mit seiner Unreife für deren Hervorbringung zusammen und erzwingt erneute Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS6","text":"Der Versuch, den Freunden alles mitzuteilen, endet in verschwiegenem Rest, Schmerz und Abschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","text":"Scham bezeichnet eine noch wirksame Bindung an jugendlichen Stolz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A2","text":"Kindwerden ist keine Rückkehr zur Jugend, sondern setzt deren Überwindung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","text":"Die geforderte Verwandlung wird von Zarathustra nicht freiwillig angenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A4","text":"Die innere Instanz verfügt über eine nicht-stimmliche, aber sprachmächtige Autorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A5","text":"Lachen kann eine Zurückweisung körperlich und zerstörerisch vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","text":"Hervorgebrachte Früchte können reif sein, bevor ihr Hervorbringer für sie reif ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A7","text":"Unreife für die eigenen Früchte macht erneute Einsamkeit erforderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","text":"Zarathustra beansprucht, seinen Freunden nichts Wesentliches verschwiegen zu haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A9","text":"Trotz dieser Mitteilung bleibt ein nicht gegebenes Etwas bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A10","text":"Die Nähe des Abschieds verwandelt die Beziehung zu den Freunden in überwältigenden Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A11","text":"Die endgültige Reifung vollzieht sich nicht in der Gemeinschaft, sondern durch deren Verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX1","text":"Kindwerden ist nicht mit Jugend gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX2","text":"Scham ist nicht als abgeschlossene moralische Einsicht bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX3","text":"Die Reife der Früchte beweist nicht die Reife Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX4","text":"Die Mitteilung an die Freunde hebt das Verschweigen nicht vollständig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX5","text":"Die Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit ist kein freiwilliger Rückzug aus bloßer Vorliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX6","text":"Das Lachen ist nicht befreiende Heiterkeit, sondern eine entlarvende und verletzende Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX7","text":"Die Freunde können den Schmerz nicht durch Trost aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D1","text":"Scham fungiert als Diagnose eines noch nicht überwundenen Selbstverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D2","text":"Die geforderte Kindheit ist eine nachjugendliche Form der Unschuld, nicht eine Regression.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D3","text":"Die Verweigerung hält Zarathustra in genau dem Zustand fest, den die Stimme als überwindungsbedürftig markiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D4","text":"Das Lachen fungiert als Vollzug der Widerlegung, weil es die sprachliche Verweigerung in leiblichen Schmerz überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D5","text":"Zarathustras Hervorbringung besitzt eine zeitliche Vorläufigkeit: Das Erzeugte ist weiter als der Erzeuger.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D6","text":"Einsamkeit wird zur Bedingung nachträglicher Reifung und nicht zum Ergebnis bereits vollendeter Reife.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D7","text":"Vollständige Offenheit gegenüber den Freunden bleibt strukturell unmöglich, obwohl Zarathustra seine Mitteilung als vollständig behauptet.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","CH_97E9_UIAI:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D8","text":"Die Gemeinschaft bildet den Ort der Mitteilung, aber nicht den Ort der abschließenden Transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A10","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD1","text":"Das Werk organisiert Reifung als asymmetrischen Prozess, in dem Hervorbringung, Selbstverständnis und Fähigkeit zur Mitteilung zeitlich auseinanderfallen.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD2","text":"Die innere Autorität erzeugt Transformation nicht durch Zustimmung, sondern durch Verweigerung, Entlarvung und erzwungene Absonderung.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A4","CH_97E9_UIAI:A5","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD3","text":"Gemeinschaftliche Wahrheitserklärung führt nicht zur Aufhebung des Geheimnisses, sondern macht dessen verbleibende Unverfügbarkeit sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","CH_97E9_UIAI:A9","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD4","text":"Die verlangte Kindwerdung totalisiert den Übergang: Selbst Jugend, Stolz, Reife, Hervorbringung und Gemeinschaft werden als noch zu überwindende Zustände neu geordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2","CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass vorhandene Hervorbringungen die innere Reife ihres Urhebers garantieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Selbstkenntnis durch die Benennung der eigenen Erfahrung abgeschlossen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Gemeinschaft die letzte Instanz über die Entwicklung des Einzelnen bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Schmerz durch begriffliche Einsicht oder soziale Nähe aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Kindlichkeit als ursprüngliche Unmittelbarkeit ohne vorausgehende Selbstüberwindung erreichbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine endgültige Übereinstimmung zwischen dem, was Zarathustra hervorbringt, und dem, wer er im Hervorbringen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Mitteilung, die den Sprecher vollständig entäußert und das Geheimnis beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Reifung, die innerhalb der Freundschaft vollendet und durch Trost bestätigt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein stabiler Endzustand der Verwandlung; jede erreichte Frucht eröffnet eine neue Unreife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS1","text":"Scham → Diagnose jugendlichen Stolzes → Forderung des Kindwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS2","text":"Kindwerden → notwendige Überwindung der Jugend → Verweigerung durch Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS3","text":"Verweigerung → nicht-stimmliches Lachen → körperliche Zerreißung des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS4","text":"Reife der Früchte + Unreife des Hervorbringers → Erfordernis des Mürbwerdens → Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS5","text":"Anspruch vollständiger Mitteilung → verbleibendes nicht gegebenes Etwas → Fortbestehen des Verschwiegenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS6","text":"verbleibendes Verschwiegenes + Nähe des Abschieds → Schmerz → nächtliches Verlassen der Freunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AF1","text":"Scham → Ausweisung des jugendlichen Stolzes → Forderung nach nachjugendlicher Kindlichkeit → Verweigerung → lachende Entlarvung → körperlicher Zusammenbruch → Diskrepanz von Fruchtreife und Selbstreife → Einsamkeit als Nachreifung → unvollständige Mitteilung → Abschied und Verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME1","text":"Kindheit wird von einer Lebensphase zu einer nachjugendlichen Transformationsposition umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME2","text":"Reife wird von der Qualität des Hervorgebrachten auf die Fähigkeit des Hervorbringers zur Aufnahme und Verantwortung seiner Früchte verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME3","text":"Einsamkeit wird von sozialer Abwesenheit zu einem produktiven Reifungsmedium umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME4","text":"Mitteilung und Verschwiegenheit werden nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als koexistierende Bedingungen desselben Sprechens kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME5","text":"Lachen wird von einem Ausdruck der Überlegenheit zu einem Instrument der ontologischen Entblößung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME6","text":"Freundschaft wird als notwendiger Ort der Mitteilung, aber als unzureichender Ort der Vollendung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra antwortet mit Scham, verweigert das Kindwerden, erleidet das Lachen und verlässt seine Freunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine autoritative Instanz koppelt Selbstüberwindung, Reifung, Hervorbringung und Einsamkeit in eine Zwangsfolge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Scheitern der Verweigerung und der Mitteilung wird selbst zum Verfahren, durch das die nächste Entwicklungsstufe erzwungen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Erzeuger und Erzeugtes fallen zeitlich auseinander; Reifung ist unabschließbar und erzeugt aus jeder Frucht eine neue Differenz zwischen Können und Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Scham, Verweigerung, Lachen, Fruchtreife, Einsamkeit und Abschied als zusammenhängende Erzeugungsfolge zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die sprechende Instanz als psychische, metaphysische oder poetische Autorität zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Kindwerden als Überwindung der Jugend und nicht als Rückkehr verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Fruchtreife und Unreife des Hervorbringers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT5","text":"Ihre zentrale Spannung liegt zwischen behaupteter vollständiger Mitteilung und dem ausdrücklich verbleibenden nicht gegebenen Etwas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Reife der Früchte und der fortbestehenden Notwendigkeit des Mürbwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn sie Gemeinschaft als Mitteilungsraum und Einsamkeit als Transformationsbedingung trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193712851113Z_037df35a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"And I answered: “I am ashamed.”","source_sha256":"8201bb1088e0c7f47268d5d12f3ef9ecde726e79edc1bdb83b598ea3971a0bf1","sha256":"03663ca5984ae95325af3de86c29bf74fb3f5067087e9e36aeb00595c117f7ef","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:37:12.853741+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS1","text":"An inner instance interprets shame as a remaining sign of youthful pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS2","text":"The demanded transformation into a child presupposes the overcoming of one’s own youth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS3","text":"Zarathustra initially refuses the demanded transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS4","text":"The laughter of the instance transforms the refusal into bodily experienced pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS5","text":"The maturity of his fruits coincides with his immaturity for their production and compels renewed solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AS6","text":"The attempt to communicate everything to his friends ends in an unspoken remainder, pain, and farewell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","text":"Shame designates a still effective attachment to youthful pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A2","text":"Becoming a child is not a return to youth, but presupposes its overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","text":"The demanded transformation is not voluntarily accepted by Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A4","text":"The inner instance possesses a non-vocal, yet linguistically powerful authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A5","text":"Laughter can enact a rejection bodily and destructively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","text":"Produced fruits can be ripe before their producer is ripe for them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A7","text":"Immaturity for one’s own fruits makes renewed solitude necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","text":"Zarathustra claims not to have withheld anything essential from his friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A9","text":"Despite this communication, a something not given remains.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A10","text":"The proximity of farewell transforms the relationship to the friends into overwhelming pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:A11","text":"Final maturation takes place not in community, but through leaving it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX1","text":"Becoming a child is not to be equated with youth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX2","text":"Shame is not determined as a completed moral insight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX3","text":"The maturity of the fruits does not prove Zarathustra’s maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX4","text":"Communication to the friends does not completely abolish concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX5","text":"The return to solitude is not a voluntary withdrawal out of mere preference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX6","text":"The laughter is not liberating cheerfulness, but an unmasking and injuring power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:NX7","text":"The friends cannot abolish the pain through consolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D1","text":"Shame functions as a diagnosis of a self-relation not yet overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D2","text":"The demanded childhood is a post-youthful form of innocence, not a regression.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D3","text":"The refusal holds Zarathustra fast in precisely the state that the voice marks as requiring overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D4","text":"The laughter functions as the enactment of refutation because it transfers linguistic refusal into bodily pain.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D5","text":"Zarathustra’s production possesses a temporal provisionality: what is produced is further advanced than the producer.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D6","text":"Solitude becomes the condition of subsequent maturation and not the result of already completed maturity.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D7","text":"Complete openness toward the friends remains structurally impossible, although Zarathustra claims his communication to be complete.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","CH_97E9_UIAI:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:D8","text":"Community forms the site of communication, but not the site of final transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A10","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD1","text":"The work organizes maturation as an asymmetrical process in which production, self-understanding, and the capacity for communication fall temporally apart.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD2","text":"The inner authority generates transformation not through consent, but through refusal, unmasking, and enforced separation.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A3","CH_97E9_UIAI:A4","CH_97E9_UIAI:A5","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD3","text":"Communal declaration of truth does not lead to the abolition of the secret, but makes its remaining unavailability visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A8","CH_97E9_UIAI:A9","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SD4","text":"The demanded becoming-child totalizes the transition: even youth, pride, maturity, production, and community are reordered as states still to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_UIAI:A1","CH_97E9_UIAI:A2","CH_97E9_UIAI:A6","CH_97E9_UIAI:A7","CH_97E9_UIAI:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that existing productions guarantee the inner maturity of their author.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that self-knowledge can be completed through the naming of one’s own experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that community forms the final instance concerning the development of the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that pain is abolished through conceptual insight or social proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that childlikeness is attainable as original immediacy without preceding self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a final correspondence between what Zarathustra produces and who he is in producing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX2","text":"Unavailable remains a communication that completely externalizes the speaker and eliminates the secret.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX3","text":"Barred is a maturation that could be completed within friendship and confirmed through consolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a stable final state of transformation; every attained fruit opens a new immaturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS1","text":"Shame → diagnosis of youthful pride → demand for becoming a child.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS2","text":"Becoming a child → necessary overcoming of youth → refusal by Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS3","text":"Refusal → non-vocal laughter → bodily tearing apart of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS4","text":"Maturity of the fruits + immaturity of the producer → necessity of becoming mellow → return to solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS5","text":"Claim of complete communication → remaining something not given → persistence of what is withheld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:FGS6","text":"remaining withheld matter + proximity of farewell → pain → nocturnal leaving of the friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:AF1","text":"Shame → identification of youthful pride → demand for post-youthful childlikeness → refusal → laughing unmasking → bodily collapse → discrepancy between fruit-maturity and self-maturity → solitude as subsequent maturation → incomplete communication → farewell and departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME1","text":"Childhood is remapped from a phase of life to a post-youthful position of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME2","text":"Maturity is shifted from the quality of what is produced to the producer’s capacity to receive and assume responsibility for his fruits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME3","text":"Solitude is reclassified from social absence into a productive medium of maturation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME4","text":"Communication and concealment are mapped not as opposites, but as coexisting conditions of the same speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME5","text":"Laughter is reordered from an expression of superiority into an instrument of ontological stripping-bare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ME6","text":"Friendship is determined as a necessary site of communication, but as an insufficient site of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra answers with shame, refuses becoming a child, suffers the laughter, and leaves his friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT2","text":"Structural — An authoritative instance couples self-overcoming, maturation, production, and solitude in a sequence of compulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The failure of refusal and communication itself becomes the procedure through which the next stage of development is compelled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Producer and produced fall temporally apart; maturation is unclosable and generates from every fruit a new difference between capability and being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct shame, refusal, laughter, fruit-maturity, solitude, and farewell as a coherent generative sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the speaking instance is to be understood as psychic, metaphysical, or poetic authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as becoming a child is understood as overcoming youth and not as return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of fruit-maturity and the immaturity of the producer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT5","text":"Its central tension lies between the claimed complete communication and the explicitly remaining something not given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the maturity of the fruits and the persisting necessity of becoming mellow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_UIAI:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if it separates community as the space of communication and solitude as the condition of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_UIAI:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_UIAI@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_UIAI:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 63","title":"And I answered: “I am ashamed.”","context":"Chapter 63","original_title":"Und ich antwortete: „Ich schäme mich.“","original_context":"Chapter 63"},"original_title":"Und ich antwortete: „Ich schäme mich.“","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT","layer":"CH","title":"Part Three","order":64,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DRIT"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DRIT@R001","sha256":"205f0f7df9cbf9367a99fc78fc23f71f5e514794ef8b6f09f2bbbd9d0b145526","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS1","text":"Das Verlangen nach Erhebung erzeugt den Blick nach oben, während erreichte Erhebung den Blick nach unten richtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS2","text":"Erhebung wird dadurch als Unterschied zwischen angestrebter und vollzogener Position bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS3","text":"Die Möglichkeit, zugleich erhoben zu sein und zu lachen, fungiert als Prüfung der erreichten Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS4","text":"Der Aufstieg auf die höchsten Berge erzeugt eine Distanz zu Trauer-Spielen und Trauer-Ernst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS5","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von der Blickrichtung über die Positionsdifferenz zur affektiven Konsequenz des Lachens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","text":"Das Verlangen nach Erhebung richtet den Blick nach oben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","text":"Wer erhoben ist, blickt hinab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A3","text":"Angestrebte Erhebung und vollzogene Erhebung sind verschiedene Positionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","text":"Gleichzeitiges Erhobensein und Lachen ist keine selbstverständliche, sondern eine prüfende Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","text":"Die höchsten Berge bilden den Ort der vollzogenen Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","text":"Vom höchsten Berg aus erscheinen Trauer-Spiele und Trauer-Ernst als Gegenstände des Lachens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A7","text":"Erhebung verändert nicht nur die Höhe der Position, sondern auch das Verhältnis zu Trauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX1","text":"Erhebung ist nicht mit dem bloßen Verlangen nach Erhebung identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX2","text":"Der Blick nach oben bezeichnet nicht die Perspektive des bereits Erhobenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX3","text":"Der Blick hinab ist nicht als Zeichen des Mangels an Erhebung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX4","text":"Erhobensein wird nicht durch Trauer-Ernst als angemessene Grundhaltung definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX5","text":"Der Aufstieg auf den höchsten Berg führt nicht zu einer Fortsetzung der Perspektive des Aufsteigenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX6","text":"Lachen und Erhebung werden nicht als getrennte oder notwendig widersprüchliche Zustände behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D1","text":"Das Verlangen nach Erhebung zeigt eine noch nicht vollzogene Erhebung an.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D2","text":"Die Blickrichtung dient als Unterscheidungsmerkmal zwischen Aufstieg und erreichte[r] Höhe.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D3","text":"Wer zugleich erhoben ist und lacht, erfüllt das affektive Kriterium der höchsten Position.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","CH_97E9_DRIT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D4","text":"Die Bergeshöhe erzeugt eine Perspektive, aus der Trauer nicht mehr als verbindliche Ernstform erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D5","text":"Das Lachen markiert die Distanz zwischen der Bergperspektive und den Formen des Trauerns.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD1","text":"Erhebung ist ein perspektivischer Positionswechsel, der die Richtung des Blicks und die Bewertung von Trauer zugleich reorganisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD2","text":"Das Lachen fungiert als Zeichen dafür, dass Erhebung nicht nur räumlich, sondern affektiv und interpretativ vollzogen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD3","text":"Der Text ersetzt die vertikale Bewegung des Aufstiegs durch eine Umkehr der Perspektive: Der Aufsteigende sieht nach oben, der Erhobene sieht hinab.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD4","text":"Trauer wird von einer überwältigenden Grundstimmung zu einer betrachtbaren und verlachbaren Erscheinung herabgestuft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf der Annahme beruhen, dass die Richtung des Begehrens bereits die erreichte Position verkörpert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX2","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen werden, dass Höhe lediglich eine quantitative Steigerung desselben Blickpunkts bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX3","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen werden, dass Ernsthaftigkeit gegenüber Trauer die höchste Form geistiger oder existenzieller Stellung darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX4","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen werden, dass Erhebung ohne affektive Umwertung von Trauer vollständig erreicht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX5","text":"Das System kann nicht von einer gleichrangigen Perspektive zwischen Bergeshöhe und Trauer ausgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der Aufstieg nur den Standort verändert, ohne die Ordnung des Sichtbaren und Fühlbaren umzuschichten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Verfügbarkeit einer neutralen Erhebung, die weder Distanz noch Lachen gegenüber Trauer hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Trauer zugleich als höchste verbindliche Wahrheit und als Gegenstand der Überwindung beizubehalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX4","text":"Die unausgesprochene Abwesenheit des Systems ist eine Perspektive, in der Erhebung und Trauer ohne Hierarchie koexistieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS1","text":"Verlangen nach Erhebung → Aufwärtsblick → Anzeige einer noch nicht vollzogenen Position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS2","text":"Vollzogene Erhebung → Abwärtsblick → Umkehr der ursprünglichen Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS3","text":"Höchster Berg → maximale Distanz → veränderte Sichtbarkeit von Trauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS4","text":"Veränderte Sichtbarkeit von Trauer → Lachen über Trauer-Spiele und Trauer-Ernst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS5","text":"Lachen unter Bedingungen der Höhe → Nachweis einer affektiv vollzogenen Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS6","text":"Aufwärtsorientierung und Abwärtsdistanz → Unterscheidung zwischen Streben und erreichte[r] Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AF1","text":"Erhebungsverlangen → Aufwärtsblick → Differenz zwischen Streben und Besitz → Abwärtsblick des Erhobenen → Bergeshöhe → Lachen über Trauer → affektive Bestätigung der Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME1","text":"Die Blickrichtung wird von einer räumlichen Angabe zu einer diagnostischen Markierung des Erhebungszustands umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME2","text":"Erhebung wird von einer vertikalen Bewegung zu einer Veränderung der gesamten Wahrnehmungs- und Bewertungsordnung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME3","text":"Lachen wird als Indikator einer erreichten Position sichtbar, nicht als bloßer Gegensatz zu Ernst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME4","text":"Trauer-Spiele und Trauer-Ernst werden von bindenden Lebensformen zu distanziert betrachtbaren Erscheinungen klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Höhe und Tiefe wird durch eine relationale Perspektivumkehr ersetzt: Höhe konstituiert sich als Hinabblicken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text unterscheidet Aufwärtsblick, Abwärtsblick, Lachen und Trauer im Verhältnis zur Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT2","text":"Structural — Erhebung organisiert eine Positionsdifferenz zwischen verlangendem Aufstieg und bereits erreichter Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text setzt Lachen als Prüfmittel gegen eine bloß behauptete oder aspirative Erhebung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Erhebung erzeugt eine neue Seins- und Zeitposition, aus der frühere Formen des Trauerns nachträglich als Spiele und Ernstformen erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom Erhebungsverlangen zur Perspektive des Erhobenen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen aspirativer und vollzogener Erhebung ist für die Rekonstruktion notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT3","text":"Die Rolle des Lachens als Prüfzeichen ist aus dem Text ableitbar, bleibt jedoch in ihrer normativen Verbindlichkeit unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Hinabblicken und Lachen als Folgen erreichter Höhe gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Möglichkeit des gleichzeitigen Erhobenseins und Lachens und der offenen Frage, ob diese Verbindung selten, ideal oder konstitutiv ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT6","text":"Unentschieden bleibt, ob das Lachen Trauer überwindet, entwertet oder lediglich perspektivisch relativiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Berg nicht als bloßer Ort, sondern als Erzeuger einer neuen Perspektive behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193535361521Z_08b71f79","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Third Part","source_sha256":"205f0f7df9cbf9367a99fc78fc23f71f5e514794ef8b6f09f2bbbd9d0b145526","sha256":"0738c43baf841e5dac83dd4c5cfb1cb8ccffe6c67fe2e21e0f1436422bce3ac6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:35:35.364062+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS1","text":"The desire for elevation produces the upward gaze, whereas attained elevation directs the gaze downward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS2","text":"Elevation is thereby determined as the difference between an aspired-to and an accomplished position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS3","text":"The possibility of being elevated and laughing at the same time functions as a test of attained elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS4","text":"The ascent of the highest mountains produces a distance from mourning plays and mourning seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AS5","text":"The argument moves from the direction of the gaze, through positional difference, to the affective consequence of laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","text":"The desire for elevation directs the gaze upward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","text":"Whoever is elevated looks downward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A3","text":"Sought elevation and accomplished elevation are different positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","text":"Being elevated and laughing simultaneously is not a self-evident but a testing possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","text":"The highest mountains constitute the site of accomplished elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","text":"From the highest mountain, mourning-plays and mourning-seriousness appear as objects of laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:A7","text":"Elevation changes not only the height of the position, but also the relation to mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX1","text":"Elevation is not identical with the mere desire for elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX2","text":"The upward gaze does not designate the perspective of one already elevated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX3","text":"The downward gaze is not determined as a sign of a lack of elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX4","text":"Being elevated is not defined by mourning-seriousness as an appropriate fundamental attitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX5","text":"The ascent to the highest mountain does not lead to a continuation of the perspective of the one ascending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:NX6","text":"Laughter and elevation are not treated as separate or necessarily contradictory states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D1","text":"The desire for elevation indicates an elevation not yet accomplished.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D2","text":"The direction of gaze serves as a distinguishing feature between ascent and attained[r] height.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D3","text":"Whoever is simultaneously elevated and laughing fulfills the affective criterion of the highest position.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","CH_97E9_DRIT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D4","text":"The height of the mountain produces a perspective from which mourning no longer appears as a binding form of seriousness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:D5","text":"Laughter marks the distance between the mountain perspective and the forms of mourning.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD1","text":"Elevation is a perspectival change of position that simultaneously reorganizes the direction of the gaze and the evaluation of mourning.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD2","text":"Laughter functions as a sign that elevation has been accomplished not only spatially, but affectively and interpretively.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A4","CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD3","text":"The text replaces the vertical movement of ascent with a reversal of perspective: the one ascending looks upward, the one elevated looks downward.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A1","CH_97E9_DRIT:A2","CH_97E9_DRIT:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SD4","text":"Mourning is downgraded from an overwhelming fundamental mood to a phenomenon that can be contemplated and laughed at.","refs":["CH_97E9_DRIT:A5","CH_97E9_DRIT:A6","CH_97E9_DRIT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on the assumption that the direction of desire already embodies the attained position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX2","text":"It must be excluded that height remains merely a quantitative increase of the same point of view.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX3","text":"It must be excluded that seriousness toward mourning constitutes the highest form of spiritual or existential position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX4","text":"It must be excluded that elevation can be fully attained without an affective revaluation of mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:DNX5","text":"The system cannot proceed from an equal-ranking perspective between mountain height and mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which ascent merely changes one's location without rearranging the order of the visible and the feelable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the availability of a neutral elevation that produces neither distance nor laughter toward mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of retaining mourning simultaneously as the highest binding truth and as an object of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:SNX4","text":"The unspoken absence of the system is a perspective in which elevation and mourning coexist without hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS1","text":"Desire for elevation → upward gaze → indication of a position not yet accomplished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS2","text":"Accomplished elevation → downward gaze → reversal of the original orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS3","text":"Highest mountain → maximum distance → altered visibility of mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS4","text":"Altered visibility of mourning → laughter at mourning plays and mourning seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS5","text":"Laughter under conditions of height → proof of an affectively accomplished elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:FGS6","text":"Upward orientation and downward distance → distinction between striving and attained height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:AF1","text":"Desire for elevation → upward gaze → difference between striving and possession → downward gaze of the elevated one → mountain height → laughter at mourning → affective confirmation of elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME1","text":"The direction of gaze is reclassified from a spatial indication into a diagnostic marker of the state of elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME2","text":"Elevation is remapped from a vertical movement into a transformation of the entire order of perception and evaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME3","text":"Laughter becomes visible as an indicator of an attained position, not as a mere opposite of seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME4","text":"Mourning-plays and mourning-seriousness are classified from binding forms of life into phenomena that can be regarded at a distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ME5","text":"The opposition between height and depth is replaced by a relational reversal of perspective: height constitutes itself as looking downward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text distinguishes upward gaze, downward gaze, laughter, and mourning in relation to elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT2","text":"Structural — Elevation organizes a positional difference between desiring ascent and already attained height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text deploys laughter as a means of testing against a merely asserted or aspirational elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Elevation produces a new position of being and time from which earlier forms of mourning subsequently appear as plays and forms of seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the desire for elevation to the perspective of the elevated one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT2","text":"The distinction between aspirational and accomplished elevation is necessary for the reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT3","text":"The role of laughter as a testing sign is derivable from the text, but remains underdetermined in its normative bindingness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as looking downward and laughter are read as consequences of attained height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the asserted possibility of being elevated and laughing simultaneously and the open question whether this connection is rare, ideal, or constitutive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT6","text":"It remains undecided whether laughter overcomes mourning, devalues it, or merely relativizes it perspectivally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DRIT:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text, provided that the mountain is treated not as a mere place but as the producer of a new perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DRIT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DRIT@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DRIT:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 64","title":"Part Three","context":"Chapter 64","original_title":"Dritter Theil","original_context":"Chapter 64"},"original_title":"Dritter Theil","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2","layer":"CH","title":"The Wanderer","order":65,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DE_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DE_2@R001","sha256":"539580b3fa1a50a21e1dd81c6c65b714ef5fb819f37494082bd31fea96b0de87","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS1","text":"Zarathustras Existenz wird als unabschließbares Wandern und Bergsteigen bestimmt, nicht als Aufenthalt in der Ebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS2","text":"Weil die Zeit äußerer Zufälle abgelaufen ist, kehrt alles Kommende als Rückkehr des eigenen, zuvor zerstreuten Selbst heim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS3","text":"Der Weg der Größe führt auf einen letzten Gipfel, in dem Gipfel und Abgrund zusammenfallen und der Rückweg verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS4","text":"Der Aufstieg verlangt die Überschreitung des eigenen Kopfes und Herzens, die Verwandlung des Mildesten in Härte und die Ablösung von sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS5","text":"Der höchste Gipfel wird nur durch den tiefsten Abstieg in Schmerz und Dunkelheit erreichbar, weil das Höchste aus dem Tiefsten hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS6","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem Meer reaktiviert die ausgeschlossene Gegenbewegung: universale Liebe, Trost und Erinnerung an Verlassene verwandeln die Einsamkeit in Selbstzorn, Sehnsucht und Weinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A1","text":"Wandern und Bergsteigen bilden Zarathustras grundlegende Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A2","text":"Äußere Zufälle sind erschöpft; Kommendes erscheint als Rückkehr des eigenen, zuvor zerstreuten Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","text":"Der Weg der Größe endet an einem letzten Gipfel, an dem Gipfel und Abgrund eins werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A4","text":"Der Weg der Größe löscht seinen eigenen Rückweg aus und lässt keine Nachfolge zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","text":"Der Aufstieg muss ohne äußere Leitern über den eigenen Kopf und das eigene Herz erfolgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A6","text":"Erkenntnis verlangt Distanz vom eigenen Standpunkt und den Blick über die vorderen Gründe hinaus auf Grund und Hintergrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A7","text":"Das Höchste entsteht aus dem Tiefsten; der letzte Gipfel setzt daher den Abstieg in den tiefsten Schmerz voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A8","text":"Die Liebe zu allem Lebendigen gefährdet die radikale Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A9","text":"Die Erinnerung an die verlassenen Freunde erscheint Zarathustra als mögliches Vergehen an ihnen und erzeugt Selbstzorn und Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX1","text":"Der Weg schließt Ebenheit, Stillstand und dauerhaftes Sitzen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX2","text":"Das Kommende ist kein unabhängiger Zufall, der von außen in das Leben eintritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX3","text":"Der Weg der Größe ist kein begehbarer Rückweg und keine von anderen nachvollziehbare Route.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX4","text":"Äußere Leitern, Hilfen und Aufstiegsmittel stehen nicht zur Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX5","text":"Schonung, Weichheit und eine Welt des mühelosen Wohlbefindens werden als unzureichend ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX6","text":"Erkenntnis darf nicht bei den vorderen Gründen der Dinge stehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX7","text":"Ein Aufstieg ohne vorherigen Abstieg in den Schmerz ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX8","text":"Die tröstende Zähmung des Furchtbaren und die unterschiedslose Liebe zu allem Lebendigen sind keine sichere Form der Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D1","text":"Wandern wird von einer Folge äußerer Begegnungen zu einer Bewegung der Rückkehr des eigenen Selbst.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A1","CH_97E9_DE_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D2","text":"Die Größe besteht nicht in erreichbarer Höhe allein, sondern in der unauflösbaren Kopplung von Gipfel, Abgrund und ausgelöschtem Rückweg.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","CH_97E9_DE_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D3","text":"Selbstüberwindung ist zugleich Bedingung des Aufstiegs und Bedingung erweiterten Erkennens.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","CH_97E9_DE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D4","text":"Der Abstieg in den Schmerz fungiert nicht als Unterbrechung des Aufstiegs, sondern als dessen produktive Voraussetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","CH_97E9_DE_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D5","text":"Die Überwindung des eigenen Standpunkts verlangt, das eigene Selbst sowohl als Ausgangspunkt als auch als zu überschreitendes Gelände zu behandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","CH_97E9_DE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D6","text":"Die Fähigkeit zum Trost bildet innerhalb der Einsamkeit eine innere Gegenkraft, weil sie jedes Furchtbare wieder in Nähe und Liebe überführen will.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D7","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem Meer verwandelt die expansive Liebe nicht in Versöhnung, sondern in Selbstanklage und emotionale Entladung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A8","CH_97E9_DE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD1","text":"Der Weg der Größe erzeugt seine eigene Unumkehrbarkeit, indem er äußere Führung, Rückkehr und Nachfolge zugleich abschafft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD2","text":"Das System hebt die Gegensätze von Aufstieg und Abstieg, Höhe und Tiefe, Gipfel und Abgrund in einer vertikalen Einheit auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD3","text":"Das Selbst ist zugleich Ursprung, Gegenstand, Hindernis und Medium der Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD4","text":"Die ontologische Erhöhung des Subjekts wird durch eine notwendige Durchquerung von Schmerz und Dunkelheit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD5","text":"Universale Liebe erscheint als strukturelle Konkurrenz zur Einsamkeit, nicht als deren harmonische Ergänzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD6","text":"Die endgültige Bewegung führt nicht zu einer stabilen Synthese, sondern zur Koexistenz von Bereitschaft, Selbsthärte, Liebe, Zorn und Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine autonome äußere Alterität aus, die dem Selbst dauerhaft als fremde Quelle von Ereignissen gegenüberstünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein stabiles Selbst aus, das sich entweder unverändert besitzt oder vollständig hinter sich lassen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen neutralen Fortschritt aus, bei dem Höhe ohne Krise, Schmerz und Selbstüberschreitung erreicht werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX4","text":"Es schließt gemeinschaftliche Vermittlung als tragende Bedingung der Größe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Erkenntnis aus, die vom Umbau des Erkennenden unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine widerspruchsfreie Verbindung von radikaler Einsamkeit und unterschiedsloser Liebe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Welt, in der Dinge als wirklich unabhängige Fremdheiten bestehen bleiben, ohne in die Rückkehr des eigenen Selbst eingegliedert zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein geteilter Weg der Größe, auf dem Begleitung, Nachfolge oder überlieferte Leitern den Aufstieg ermöglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine schmerzlose Höhe, die ihre eigene Tiefe nicht durchqueren müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine endgültige Versöhnung zwischen der Härte der Einsamkeit und der Liebe zu allem Lebendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines tragfähigen Gegenübers strukturiert die Schlussbewegung stärker als die behauptete Bereitschaft zur Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS1","text":"Wandern als Grundform → äußere Bewegung wird zur Selbstbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS2","text":"Erschöpfung des Zufalls → jedes Kommende wird als Heimkehr des eigenen Selbst klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS3","text":"Annäherung an den letzten Gipfel → Gipfel und Abgrund werden in einer einzigen Grenzfigur verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS4","text":"Auslöschung des Rückwegs und Entzug äußerer Leitern → der Aufstieg wird zur Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS5","text":"Selbstüberschreitung → Härte, Distanz und erweiterte Sicht auf Grund und Hintergrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS6","text":"Erweiterte Sicht → Abstieg in die tiefste Schmerzschicht als Produktionsbedingung des Höchsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS7","text":"Begegnung mit dem schlafenden Meer → Aktivierung von Trostimpuls, Liebe und Erinnerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS8","text":"Kollision von Einsamkeit und universaler Liebe → Selbstverspottung, Selbstzorn, Sehnsucht und Weinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AF1","text":"Unruhige Wanderexistenz → Ende äußerer Zufälle → Heimkehr des zerstreuten Selbst → letzter Gipfel als Gipfel-Abgrund-Einheit → Auslöschung von Rückweg und Leitern → Selbstüberschreitung und Härte → Abstieg in den tiefsten Schmerz → Meer als Gegenfigur der Einsamkeit → Konflikt von Trostliebe und Verlassenheit → Zorn und Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME1","text":"Zufall wird von einer externen Ereigniskategorie zu einer Form der Selbstzugehörigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME2","text":"Gipfel und Abgrund werden nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als komplementäre Bedingungen derselben Größe sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME3","text":"Aufstieg und Abstieg werden als zwei Richtungen eines einzigen generativen Vorgangs klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME4","text":"Das Selbst wird zugleich als Beobachter, Terrain, Hindernis und zu überschreitende Grenze kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME5","text":"Das Meer wird von einer Landschaft zu einer Tiefenfigur für Schmerz, Erinnerung, Erwartung und nicht beherrschte Alterität umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME6","text":"Liebe wird von einer stabilisierenden Tugend zu einer Gefährdung der Einsamkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME7","text":"Einsamkeit erscheint nicht als abgeschlossener Zustand, sondern als prekäre Formation, die durch ihr eigenes Liebesvermögen unterlaufen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine nächtliche Wanderung über den Bergrücken führt Zarathustra vom Ausgangspunkt zum anderen Meer und schließlich unter die Klippen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: Berg, Meer, Gipfel, Abgrund und Rückweg organisieren ein Modell, in dem Selbstüberwindung durch vertikale Gegenbewegungen erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Größe wird als strategische Unumkehrbarkeit neu bestimmt, die äußere Hilfe, Nachahmung und Rückzug ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Zeitliche Ereignisse verlieren ihre Fremdheit und kehren als eigenes Selbst zurück, während das Höchste aus einer vorgängigen Tiefe hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Wanderexistenz über Selbstüberschreitung und Tiefenabstieg bis zur emotionalen Entladung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Selbst, Schicksal, Meer und Schmerz ontologisch oder überwiegend bildlich zu verstehen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Kopplung von Höhe und Tiefe; instabil bleibt die gleichzeitige Behauptung der Rückkehr zum eigenen Selbst und seiner notwendigen Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Struktur bildet die Regel, dass der höchste Gipfel nur durch den tiefsten Abstieg erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen radikaler Einsamkeit und universaler Liebe wird offengelegt, aber nicht aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT6","text":"Die Schlussbewegung von der Selbstverspottung zum Weinen ist strukturell vorbereitet, jedoch nicht deduktiv determiniert und bleibt an die affektive Bildsprache gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegungsrichtung, reduziert jedoch die Mehrdeutigkeit der Sprecherrollen und der metaphorischen Ebenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193318682357Z_4b4bbe88","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Wanderer","source_sha256":"539580b3fa1a50a21e1dd81c6c65b714ef5fb819f37494082bd31fea96b0de87","sha256":"c87cc85e4587107c3bbcedec92332072b262e863b51a78247e4b43e593759fbf","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:33:18.683288+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's existence is determined as unfinishable wandering and mountain-climbing, not as dwelling on the plain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS2","text":"Because the time of external contingencies has elapsed, everything to come returns home as the return of his own, previously scattered self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS3","text":"The path of greatness leads to a final summit in which summit and abyss coincide and the way back disappears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS4","text":"The ascent demands the surpassing of one's own head and heart, the transformation of what is mildest into hardness, and detachment from oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS5","text":"The highest summit becomes attainable only through the deepest descent into pain and darkness, because the highest emerges from the deepest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AS6","text":"The encounter with the sea reactivates the excluded counter-movement: universal love, consolation, and remembrance of those abandoned transform solitude into self-anger, longing, and weeping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A1","text":"Wandering and mountain-climbing constitute Zarathustra's fundamental mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A2","text":"External contingencies are exhausted; what is to come appears as the return of one's own, previously scattered self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","text":"The path of greatness ends at a final summit at which summit and abyss become one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A4","text":"The path of greatness erases its own way back and permits no following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","text":"The ascent must take place without external ladders, over one's own head and one's own heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A6","text":"Knowledge requires distance from one's own standpoint and a view beyond the foreground grounds to ground and background.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A7","text":"The highest arises from the deepest; the final summit therefore presupposes descent into the deepest pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A8","text":"Love for all living things endangers radical solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:A9","text":"The remembrance of the abandoned friends appears to Zarathustra as a possible transgression against them and generates self-anger and longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX1","text":"The path excludes flatness, standstill, and permanent sitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX2","text":"What is to come is not an independent contingency that enters life from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX3","text":"The path of greatness is not a traversable way back and not a route that can be retraced by others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX4","text":"External ladders, aids, and means of ascent are unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX5","text":"Indulgence, softness, and a world of effortless well-being are excluded as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX6","text":"Knowledge must not remain at the foreground grounds of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX7","text":"An ascent without a prior descent into pain is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:NX8","text":"The consoling taming of the terrible and indiscriminate love for all living things are not a secure form of solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D1","text":"Wandering shifts from a sequence of external encounters to a movement of the return of one's own self.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A1","CH_97E9_DE_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D2","text":"Greatness consists not in attainable height alone, but in the irresolvable coupling of summit, abyss, and erased way back.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","CH_97E9_DE_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D3","text":"Self-overcoming is at once a condition of ascent and a condition of expanded knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","CH_97E9_DE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D4","text":"Descent into pain functions not as an interruption of ascent, but as its productive precondition.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A3","CH_97E9_DE_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D5","text":"Overcoming one's own standpoint requires treating one's own self both as a point of departure and as terrain to be traversed beyond.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A5","CH_97E9_DE_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D6","text":"The capacity for consolation constitutes an inner counterforce within solitude, because it seeks to convert everything terrible back into proximity and love.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:D7","text":"The encounter with the sea transforms expansive love not into reconciliation, but into self-accusation and emotional discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DE_2:A8","CH_97E9_DE_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD1","text":"The path of greatness produces its own irreversibility by simultaneously abolishing external guidance, return, and following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD2","text":"The system sublates the oppositions of ascent and descent, height and depth, summit and abyss into a vertical unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD3","text":"The self is at once origin, object, obstacle, and medium of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD4","text":"The ontological elevation of the subject is produced through a necessary traversal of pain and darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD5","text":"Universal love appears as a structural competitor to solitude, not as its harmonious complement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SD6","text":"The final movement leads not to a stable synthesis, but to the coexistence of readiness, self-hardness, love, anger, and longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an autonomous external alterity that would permanently confront the self as an alien source of events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes a stable self that could either possess itself unchanged or leave itself completely behind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX3","text":"It excludes neutral progress in which height could be attained without crisis, pain, and self-surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX4","text":"It excludes communal mediation as a supporting condition of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes knowledge that would be independent of the transformation of the knower.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:DNX6","text":"It excludes a contradiction-free connection between radical solitude and indiscriminate love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a world in which things remain as genuinely independent aliennesses, without being incorporated into the return of one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a shared path of greatness on which accompaniment, following, or inherited ladders make ascent possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a painless height that would not have to traverse its own depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a final reconciliation between the hardness of solitude and love for all living things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:SNX5","text":"The absence of a viable counterpart structures the final movement more strongly than the asserted readiness for solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS1","text":"Wandering as basic form → external movement becomes self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS2","text":"Exhaustion of contingency → everything to come is classified as the homecoming of one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS3","text":"Approach to the final summit → summit and abyss are joined in a single boundary figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS4","text":"Erasure of the way back and withdrawal of external ladders → ascent becomes self-surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS5","text":"Self-surpassing → hardness, distance, and an expanded view of ground and background.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS6","text":"Expanded view → descent into the deepest layer of pain as the condition of production of the highest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS7","text":"Encounter with the sleeping sea → activation of impulse toward consolation, love, and remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:FGS8","text":"Collision of solitude and universal love → self-mockery, self-anger, longing, and weeping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:AF1","text":"Restless wandering existence → end of external contingencies → homecoming of the scattered self → final summit as summit-abyss unity → erasure of way back and ladders → self-surpassing and hardness → descent into the deepest pain → sea as counterfigure to solitude → conflict of consoling love and abandonment → anger and longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME1","text":"Contingency is remapped from an external event category to a form of self-belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME2","text":"Summit and abyss are no longer visible as opposites, but as complementary conditions of the same greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME3","text":"Ascent and descent are classified as two directions of a single generative process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME4","text":"The self is mapped simultaneously as observer, terrain, obstacle, and boundary to be traversed beyond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME5","text":"The sea is reassigned from a landscape to a figure of depth for pain, remembrance, expectation, and unmastered alterity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME6","text":"Love is reclassified from a stabilizing virtue to an endangerment of solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ME7","text":"Solitude appears not as a closed state, but as a precarious formation undermined by its own capacity for love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: A nocturnal wandering across the mountain ridge leads Zarathustra from the point of departure to the other sea and finally beneath the cliffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: Mountain, sea, summit, abyss, and way back organize a model in which self-overcoming is produced through vertical counter-movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Greatness is newly determined as strategic irreversibility that excludes external aid, imitation, and retreat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Temporal events lose their alienness and return as one's own self, while the highest emerges from an antecedent depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from wandering existence through self-surpassing and descent into depth to emotional discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether self, fate, sea, and pain are to be understood ontologically or predominantly figuratively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT3","text":"The coupling of height and depth is internally coherent; the simultaneous assertion of return to one's own self and its necessary surpassing remains unstable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest structure is formed by the rule that the highest summit is produced only through the deepest descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT5","text":"The tension between radical solitude and universal love is disclosed, but not resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT6","text":"The final movement from self-mockery to weeping is structurally prepared, yet not deductively determined and remains bound to affective imagery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DE_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DE_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual direction of movement, yet reduces the ambiguity of the speaker roles and the metaphorical levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DE_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DE_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 65","title":"The Wanderer","context":"Chapter 65","original_title":"Der Wanderer","original_context":"Chapter 65"},"original_title":"Der Wanderer","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3","layer":"CH","title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 1","order":66,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_3@R001","sha256":"e047f16ba6459a6961c2430cefe823d0bd560c8cb0a0e2e6ce0951ca59cee935","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS1","text":"Gefährliches Zuhören löst Zarathustras Rede aus, nachdem Trauer und Schweigen die unmittelbare Mitteilung blockiert haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS2","text":"Das Rätsel wird an Sucher adressiert, die keine lineare Herleitung, sondern die Konfrontation mit dem Unerschlossenen verlangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS3","text":"Die Vision stellt Einsamkeit als Aufstieg gegen eine innere Schwerkraft dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS4","text":"Die Schwerkraft verwandelt den Aufstieg in eine selbstbezügliche Drohung des Rückfalls und der Selbststeinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS5","text":"Der Mut unterbricht diese Drohung durch Angriff und macht Abgrund, Mitleiden und Tod zu bekämpfbaren Widerständen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet nicht in Beweis oder Erlösung, sondern in der wiederholbaren Lebensformel: „War das das Leben? Wohlan! Noch Ein Mal!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A1","text":"Zarathustras Rede wird durch das Zuhören gefährlicher Reiseerfahrungen ausgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A2","text":"Das Rätsel gehört den Suchern, die dem erratbaren Faden nicht folgen und erschließende Ableitung zurückweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","text":"Das Gesicht des Einsamsten erscheint als Aufstieg auf einem kargen, feindseligen Bergpfad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","text":"Der Aufstieg wird durch einen „Geist der Schwere“ behindert, der als Zwerg und Maulwurf verkörpert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","text":"Die Schwerkraft behauptet, dass jeder geworfene Stein fallen muss und dass Zarathustras eigener Wurf auf ihn zurückfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A6","text":"Die Gegenwart des inneren Gegners macht die Verbindung zweier Wesen einsamer als die Einsamkeit eines Einzelnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","text":"Mut ist eine angreifende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A8","text":"Der Mensch überwindet Schmerz durch den Mut und dessen „klingendes Spiel“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","text":"Menschliches Sehen ist notwendig mit dem Sehen von Abgründen verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A10","text":"Mitleiden ist der tiefste Abgrund, weil die Tiefe des Lebenssehens die Tiefe des Leidenssehens steigert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A11","text":"Der Mut spricht auf den Tod und das Leben mit der Formel „War das das Leben? Wohlan! Noch Ein Mal!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX1","text":"Das Rätsel ist nicht als lineare Beweisführung oder schrittweise Fadenverfolgung zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX2","text":"Der Aufstieg ist kein natürlicher, bewachsener oder versöhnlicher Fortschritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX3","text":"Der Widerstand gegen den Aufstieg ist nicht bloß äußerliche Topographie, sondern eine innere Gegeninstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX4","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht mit dem bloßen Fehlen anderer Personen identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX5","text":"Mut ist nicht passive Duldung, sondern Angriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX6","text":"Mitleiden liefert keinen Ausweg aus der Tiefe des Leidens, sondern bildet selbst deren tiefsten Abgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX7","text":"Die Schlussformel ist keine deduktive Auflösung des Rätsels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX8","text":"Der Tod wird nicht als letztgültige Grenze der Handlungsmacht akzeptiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D1","text":"Das Zuhören fremder Gefahren ermöglicht die Wiedergewinnung der eigenen Sprache.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D2","text":"Die Form des Arguments muss indirekt, rätselhaft und nicht-deduktiv sein, weil seine Adressaten gerade die erschließende Erklärung zurückweisen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D3","text":"Der Aufstieg wird als Selbstüberwindung erzeugt, weil jeder Schritt gegen eine im Subjekt wirksame Schwerkraft erfolgt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","CH_97E9_1C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D4","text":"Die Schwerkraft verwandelt das eigene Überschreiten in die Möglichkeit des Rückfalls auf das eigene Selbst.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D5","text":"Der innere Gegner erzeugt keine Gemeinschaft, sondern eine gesteigerte Form der Einsamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D6","text":"Mut unterbricht den lähmenden Druck, indem er die passive Bedrängnis in einen Angriff umformt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D7","text":"Der Abgrund wird durch Mut nicht beseitigt, sondern als angreifbarer Widerstand bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D8","text":"Die menschliche Fähigkeit, Schmerz zu ertragen und zu überwinden, wird auf die operative Form des Mutes zurückgeführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D9","text":"Eine größere Tiefe des Lebenssehens erzeugt keine Entlastung, sondern eine größere Nähe zum Leiden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D10","text":"Die Formel „Noch Ein Mal!“ verwandelt den Tod von einem Endpunkt in eine erneut zu beantwortende Herausforderung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD1","text":"Selbstüberwindung erzeugt ihren eigenen Gegenstoß: Derjenige, der sich hochwirft, wird zum Gegenstand des Rückfalls.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD2","text":"Die Schwerkraft ist die Struktur, durch die der Versuch des Aufstiegs in Selbstbezug, Einsamkeit und Selbstgefährdung überführt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD3","text":"Mut beseitigt Leiden nicht, sondern verändert dessen Status vom überwältigenden Zustand zum Gegenstand des Angriffs.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A8","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD4","text":"Das System ersetzt endgültige Überwindung durch wiederholte Gegenwehr gegen Schwere, Abgrund und Tod.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD5","text":"Erkenntnis und Leiden bilden keine getrennten Sphären: Die Tiefe des Sehens wird durch die Tiefe dessen bestimmt, was es als Leiden freilegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keine gesicherte Selbsttranszendenz, die dem Gesetz des Rückfalls entzogen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX2","text":"Es gibt keinen erkenntnismäßigen Standpunkt außerhalb des Abgrunds und des Leidens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX3","text":"Es gibt keine passive Form des Mitleidens, die die durch Einsicht erzeugte Tiefe auflösen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX4","text":"Es gibt keine äußere Instanz, von der aus der innere Gegner endgültig neutralisiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX5","text":"Es gibt keine abschließende begriffliche Herleitung, welche die Rätselstruktur durch Erklärung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX6","text":"Es gibt keinen Tod, der als unbedingte Aufhebung jeder weiteren Antwort fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX1","text":"Eine endgültige Flucht aus der Schwerkraft ist ausgeschlossen; verfügbar bleibt nur der erneute Angriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX2","text":"Eine endgültige Versöhnung von Aufstieg und Fall wird nicht hergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX3","text":"Eine leidensfreie Erkenntnisposition bleibt unzugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX4","text":"Eine abschließende Lösung des Rätsels wird durch keine begriffliche Schlussformel bereitgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX5","text":"Eine Lebensbejahung jenseits von Wiederholung, Gefahr und Tod wird nicht eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS1","text":"Gefährliches Zuhören → Aufhebung des Schweigens → Freisetzung der Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS2","text":"Rätseladressierung → Ausschluss linearer Erklärung → indirekte Form der Mitteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS3","text":"Aufstieg → Aktivierung der Schwerkraft → Rückführung des geworfenen Selbst auf sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS4","text":"Rückfalldrohung → Steigerung der Einsamkeit → Unterbrechung durch den angreifenden Mut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS5","text":"Abgrundsehen → Leidenstiefe → Umwandlung von Schwindel, Mitleiden und Tod in Angriffsobjekte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS6","text":"Angriffsmut → „klingendes Spiel“ → erneute Bejahbarkeit des Lebens in der Formel „Noch Ein Mal!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF1","text":"Erwartung der Schiffsleute → zweitägiges Schweigen → gefährliches Zuhören → gelöste Zunge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF2","text":"Rätseladressierung → Gesicht des Einsamsten → Aufstieg gegen den Geist der Schwere → Drohung des Rückfalls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF3","text":"Innere Bedrückung → Entscheidung „Du! Oder ich!“ → Mut als Angriff → Abgrund, Mitleiden und Tod als Widerstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF4","text":"Menschlicher Schmerz → klingendes Spiel → „War das das Leben?“ → „Wohlan! Noch Ein Mal!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME1","text":"Zuhören wird von einer passiven Aufnahme zu einer Bedingung der sprachlichen Hervorbringung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME2","text":"Der Bergpfad wird von einem äußeren Ort zu einer Karte des inneren Widerstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME3","text":"Der Gegner wird vom äußeren Feind zur im Selbst wirksamen Schwerkraft umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME4","text":"Einsamkeit wird von sozialer Abwesenheit auf die Struktur gespaltener Selbstbezüglichkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME5","text":"Der Abgrund wird zugleich als Erkenntnisform, Leidensraum und Angriffsfeld klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME6","text":"Mut wird nicht als Charaktereigenschaft, sondern als operative Umwandlung von Passivität in Angriff sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME7","text":"Die Zeit des Lebens wird nicht als einmaliger Verlauf, sondern als Möglichkeit des erneuten Vollzugs kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein einsamer Aufstieg wird durch einen Zwerg, die Schwerkraft und die Formel des Mutes dramatisch artikuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Der Text organisiert Aufstieg, Rückfall, Einsamkeit, Abgrund und Angriff als Funktionen eines inneren Widerstandsmodells.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Das Argument weist Erklärung und lineare Ableitung zurück und privilegiert Rätsel, Zuhören, Konfrontation und erneuten Angriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Leben, Tod und Leiden werden unter einer Zeitform der Wiederholung und erneuten Bejahung angeordnet, ohne eine vollständige Lehre dieser Wiederholung auszuformulieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von gefährlichem Zuhören über innere Schwere und Mut bis zur Formel der Wiederholung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Zwerg als psychische Instanz, metaphysischer Gegner oder rhetorische Verkörperung der Schwerkraft zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, ob „Noch Ein Mal!“ eine kosmologische Wiederkehr behauptet oder nur eine existentielle Wiederholungsbereitschaft bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Schwerkraft, Abgrund und Tod als Druckformen und Mut als Gegenoperation gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT5","text":"Eine zentrale Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung, jeder geworfene Stein müsse fallen, und der Behauptung, Mut könne den Tod töten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht daraus, dass Mitleiden als tiefster Abgrund verworfen wird, obwohl gerade die tiefste Einsicht in das Leben die tiefste Einsicht in das Leiden erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT7","text":"Die Maschine ist am stärksten in der Verkettung von Schwere, Selbstbezug, Einsamkeit und Angriff; ihre Schließung hängt an metaphorischer Verdichtung und an der nicht vollständig aufgelösten Schlussformel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185306781343Z_3b8c77ec","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"e047f16ba6459a6961c2430cefe823d0bd560c8cb0a0e2e6ce0951ca59cee935","sha256":"a3d421029d8b1209bff552247c9052a92abcf069704e3cb6ee91815c1ee618db","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:53:06.782455+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS1","text":"Dangerous listening triggers Zarathustra's speech after grief and silence have blocked direct communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS2","text":"The riddle is addressed to seekers who demand not a linear derivation but confrontation with the undisclosed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS3","text":"The vision presents solitude as ascent against an inner gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS4","text":"Gravity transforms ascent into a self-referential threat of relapse and self-stoning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS5","text":"Courage interrupts this threat through attack and makes abyss, compassion, and death into resistances that can be fought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AS6","text":"The movement ends not in proof or redemption, but in the repeatable formula of life: “Was that life? Very well! Once more!”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A1","text":"Zarathustra's speech is triggered by listening to dangerous experiences of travel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A2","text":"The riddle belongs to the seekers who do not follow the thread that can be guessed and reject elucidating derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","text":"The vision of the loneliest one appears as an ascent on a barren, hostile mountain path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","text":"The ascent is impeded by a “spirit of gravity,” embodied as dwarf and mole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","text":"Gravity asserts that every thrown stone must fall and that Zarathustra's own throw falls back upon him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A6","text":"The presence of the inner adversary makes the conjunction of two beings lonelier than the solitude of an individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","text":"Courage is an attacking force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A8","text":"The human being overcomes pain through courage and its “ringing play.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","text":"Human seeing is necessarily bound up with seeing abysses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A10","text":"Compassion is the deepest abyss because the depth of seeing life increases the depth of seeing suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:A11","text":"Courage responds to death and life with the formula “Was that life? Very well! Once more!”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX1","text":"The riddle is not accessible as linear demonstration or stepwise following of a thread.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX2","text":"Ascent is not a natural, overgrown, or reconciling progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX3","text":"The resistance to ascent is not merely external topography, but an inner counter-instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX4","text":"Solitude is not identical with the mere absence of other persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX5","text":"Courage is not passive endurance, but attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX6","text":"Compassion provides no way out of the depth of suffering, but itself constitutes its deepest abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX7","text":"The concluding formula is not a deductive resolution of the riddle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:NX8","text":"Death is not accepted as the final boundary of the power to act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D1","text":"Listening to alien dangers enables the recovery of one's own language.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D2","text":"The form of the argument must be indirect, riddling, and non-deductive, because its addressees precisely reject elucidating explanation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D3","text":"Ascent is produced as self-overcoming because every step takes place against a gravity operative within the subject.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","CH_97E9_1C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D4","text":"Gravity transforms one's own crossing-over into the possibility of relapse upon one's own self.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D5","text":"The inner adversary produces not community, but an intensified form of solitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D6","text":"Courage interrupts the paralyzing pressure by transforming passive oppression into an attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D7","text":"The abyss is not abolished by courage, but determined as an attackable resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenan